  ('656803324376663632', 'J Balvin Bruuttal', 2017, 'Music', null, null, 'J Balvin, Nicky Jam, Yandel, Farruko, Reykon, Zion, Lennox, Shako', null, 'J Balvin returns to his hometown of Medellin, Colombia to perform a special anniversary concert entitled "Bruuttal". A musical journey that begins with his first songs and ends with his most recent multi-platinum album " Energia".', 'J Balvin returns to his hometown of Medellin, Colombia to perform a special anniversary concert entitled "Bruuttal". A musical journey that begins with his first songs and ends with his most recent multi-platinum album " Energia".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vlxuIjEckdp6adjvjNyhxhhtoIY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:537927'),
  ('617055310171870124', 'j-hope IN THE BOX', 2023, 'Documentary, Music', 'Park Jun-soo', null, 'j-hope, Jimin, Jung Kook, RM, Jin, SUGA, V, J. Cole', 'R', 'For 200 days, the daily life of artist j-hope is captured. From his production of solo album "Jack in the Box" and listening party, this documentary follows him all the way to his debut on the stage of "Lollapalooza."', 'For 200 days, the daily life of artist j-hope is captured. From his production of solo album "Jack in the Box" and listening party, this documentary follows him all the way to his debut on the stage of "Lollapalooza."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6EzOqBScbCqoTKCM77LEPxgSNTi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1076443'),
  ('987518776779642906', 'J-Men Forever', 1979, 'Comedy', 'Richard Patterson, Bruce Logan', 'Phil Proctor, Peter Bergman', 'Peter Bergman, Phil Proctor, M.G. Kelly, Jack Angel, Margolyn Curtis, Joan Gerber, Rod Gist, Michael C. Gwynne', 'PG', 'The Lightning Bug has a multi-prong scheme to enslave the earth. First, rock and roll, which the JMen counter with Muzac, then marijuana. Finally, the JMen build a bomb to blow up the moon with, but the Bug beats them to it by self destructing the moon by playing his rock and roll too loud.', 'The Lightning Bug has a multi-prong scheme to enslave the earth. First, rock and roll, which the JMen counter with Muzac, then marijuana. Finally, the JMen build a bomb to blow up the moon with, but the Bug beats them to it by self destructing the moon by playing his rock and roll too loud.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nfPZIM6w3f0BFop1lDYn4rvAW7t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42174'),
  ('190102604052097987', 'J. Edgar', 2011, 'Drama, Crime, History', 'Clint Eastwood, Tom Stern, David M. Bernstein', 'Dustin Lance Black', 'Leonardo DiCaprio, Armie Hammer, Naomi Watts, Josh Lucas, Josh Hamilton, Judi Dench, Geoff Pierson, Gunner Wright', 'R', 'As the face of law enforcement in the United States for almost 50 years, J. Edgar Hoover was feared and admired, reviled and revered. But behind closed doors, he held secrets that would have destroyed his image, his career, and his life.', 'As the face of law enforcement in the United States for almost 50 years, J. Edgar Hoover was feared and admired, reviled and revered. But behind closed doors, he held secrets that would have destroyed his image, his career, and his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hWHFPhGvCvfHbZCxJSR3n6GsXIf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88794'),
  ('606556683113940652', 'J. R. R. Tolkien''s The Hobbit', 1966, 'Animation, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Gene Deitch', 'Gene Deitch', 'Herbert Lass', null, 'The very first movie adaptation of J.R.R Tolkien''s The Hobbit. Made in just 30 days so that the producer could keep the rights to Tolkien''s books.', 'The very first movie adaptation of J.R.R Tolkien''s The Hobbit. Made in just 30 days so that the producer could keep the rights to Tolkien''s books.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sm8h3bhCtVe7cGS7yzFuFoiO46G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99457'),
  ('215630000163075567', 'J.C. Chavez', 2007, null, 'Diego Luna', null, null, null, 'A documentary about the life and career Mexican boxer Julio César Chávez.', 'A documentary about the life and career Mexican boxer Julio César Chávez.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eOKTQLVeMZUbZUPVwFNt5f6WoQ1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:206577'),
  ('578855568701661711', 'J.D.''s Revenge', 1976, 'Horror, Thriller, Action', 'Arthur Marks, Harry J. May', 'Jaison Starkes', 'Glynn Turman, Louis Gossett Jr., Joan Pringle, Carl W. Crudup, Julian Christopher, Fred Pinkard, Jo Anne Meredith, Alice Jubert', 'R', 'Although notorious New Orleans gangster J.D. Walker is shot and killed in the 1940s, his spirit remains restless for three decades, until a hypnotist''s supernatural nightclub act allows him to take over the body of a mild-mannered law student and seek revenge on those who got him killed.', 'Although notorious New Orleans gangster J.D. Walker is shot and killed in the 1940s, his spirit remains restless for three decades, until a hypnotist''s supernatural nightclub act allows him to take over the body of a mild-mannered law student and seek revenge on those who got him killed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s9uQYcIJj3W4bsIhY1ohqpVYqga.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44690'),
  ('1035876005893822837', 'J.K. Rowling: A Year in the Life', 2007, 'Documentary, TV Movie', 'James Runcie, Neville Kidd', null, 'J.K. Rowling', null, 'A look into the life of J.K. Rowling in the year leading to her finishing her final Harry Potter book.', 'A look into the life of J.K. Rowling in the year leading to her finishing her final Harry Potter book.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/noeheyUWBemWXoAbVSXLI34Vcz2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36619'),
  ('1127570481655907947', 'J.R.R. Tolkien: Designer of Worlds', 2014, 'Documentary, Fantasy', 'Frédéric Mainson, Simon Backès', null, 'Michael Lonsdale, Jérôme Kircher', null, 'This is a story of a seemingly quiet and unobtrusive man, author of a colossal and partly unfinished literary work. We will try to trace back to the origins of his inspiration so as to understand why his work met and still meets with so much success. How did JRR Tolkien manage, through the power of words alone, to so widely instill wisps of magic in the midst of a particularly disenchanted 20th century?', 'This is a story of a seemingly quiet and unobtrusive man, author of a colossal and partly unfinished literary work. We will try to trace back to the origins of his inspiration so as to understand why his work met and still meets with so much success. How did JRR Tolkien manage, through the power of words alone, to so widely instill wisps of magic in the midst of a particularly disenchanted 20th century?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dCanINBF7Fps5d8x0l8VrlFLZAo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:380876'),
  ('898354750635192044', 'J.S. Bach: Fantasia in G minor', 1965, 'Animation', 'Jan Švankmajer, Svatopluk Malý', 'Jan Švankmajer', null, null, 'A man plays the Bach piece of the title on the organ, accompanied by images of stone walls with cracks and holes that grow and shrink, intercut with images of doors and wire-meshed windows.', 'A man plays the Bach piece of the title on the organ, accompanied by images of stone walls with cracks and holes that grow and shrink, intercut with images of doors and wire-meshed windows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mLGFCmw2teDaBQQ9WmOdGiwCtfj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18952'),
  ('508824465491941482', 'J.T. LeRoy', 2019, 'Drama, History', 'Justin Kelly, Bobby Bukowski', 'Justin Kelly, Savannah Knoop', 'Kristen Stewart, Laura Dern, Diane Kruger, Jim Sturgess, Courtney Love, Kelvin Harrison Jr., James Jagger, Eric Plamondon', 'R', 'A young woman named Savannah Knoop spends six years pretending to be a transgender writer named JT Leroy, the made-up literary persona of her sister-in-law.', 'A young woman named Savannah Knoop spends six years pretending to be a transgender writer named JT Leroy, the made-up literary persona of her sister-in-law.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/43ffZhMCWQhzMneGP4kDWoPV48X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:460070'),
  ('665133665457103537', 'J''ai faim !!!', 2001, 'Comedy', 'Florence Quentin', 'Florence Quentin', 'Catherine Jacob, Michèle Laroque, Garance Clavel, Isabelle Candelier, Alessandra Martines, Yvan Le Bolloc''h, Samuel Labarthe, Stéphane Audran', null, 'A chubby forty-ish florist is dumped for a gorgeous young woman. She decides to lose weight and to ruin her rival''s life in order to win her handsome lover back.', 'A chubby forty-ish florist is dumped for a gorgeous young woman. She decides to lose weight and to ruin her rival''s life in order to win her handsome lover back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wx49sOAdb0fluHkTy2e81ZAjc1K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74191'),
  ('221342360960146544', 'J''ai perdu Albert', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Didier van Cauwelaert, Frédéric Sauvagnac, Michel Amathieu', 'Didier van Cauwelaert', 'Stéphane Plaza, Julie Ferrier, Josiane Balasko, Bernard Le Coq, Étienne Draber, Philippe du Janerand, Kader Boukhanef, Virginie Visconti', null, 'Chloe has been living a successful life thanks to one trick: Albert Einstein is in her mind. But one day, he decides to move and chooses another body: Zac, a depressive beekeeper.', 'Chloe has been living a successful life thanks to one trick: Albert Einstein is in her mind. But one day, he decides to move and chooses another body: Zac, a depressive beekeeper.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5I4MiZxaNI6Patml3rgofspB6wV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:506421'),
  ('863275279365082151', 'J''invente rien', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Michel Leclerc, Pascal Lagriffoul', null, 'Kad Merad, Elsa Zylberstein, Claude Brasseur, Patrick Chesnais, Sara Martins, Guillaume Toucas, Liliane Rovère, Lise Lamétrie', null, 'Paul has no specific life goal, and Mathilde, who provides for their household, despairs that he can find one. If he continues like this, she may well drop him. So Paul thinks he''s got to invent something.', 'Paul has no specific life goal, and Mathilde, who provides for their household, despairs that he can find one. If he continues like this, she may well drop him. So Paul thinks he''s got to invent something.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ibW8RznVKi3eVFBtBlw940dTwVx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21773'),
  ('1078590772931180982', 'J''irai au paradis car l''enfer est ici', 1997, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Xavier Durringer, Mathieu Vadepied', 'Jean Miez, Xavier Durringer', 'Arnaud Giovaninetti, Daniel Duval, Gérald Laroche, Claire Keim, Jean Miez, Brigitte Catillon, Édouard Montoute, Marc Chapiteau', null, 'In this French gangster drama, a young hoodlum, new to his famed father''s dubious profession, successfully completes his first hit but then finds himself trapped in between a brutal vendetta between rival gangs. To save himself, Francois joins forces with a motley gang of crooks, led by the emotionally unstable Rufin, and tries to wait the situation out while amusing himself with the affections of a nightclub chanteuse. Meanwhile, his colleagues are being killed off, one by one, leaving him to wonder whether or not his father will use his clout to save him.', 'In this French gangster drama, a young hoodlum, new to his famed father''s dubious profession, successfully completes his first hit but then finds himself trapped in between a brutal vendetta between rival gangs. To save himself, Francois joins forces with a motley gang of crooks, led by the emotionally unstable Rufin, and tries to wait the situation out while amusing himself with the affections of a nightclub chanteuse. Meanwhile, his colleagues are being killed off, one by one, leaving him to wonder whether or not his father will use his clout to save him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eGJIfc8i6sJ1HTcxGyeC00R02gt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64908'),
  ('1152868492561731549', 'J''irai mourir dans les Carpates', 2020, 'Comedy, Thriller', 'Antoine de Maximy', 'Thomas Pujol, Antoine de Maximy', 'Antoine de Maximy, Alice Pol, Max Boublil, Stéphan Wojtowicz, Léon Plazol, Alexandre Ionescu, Lola Cès, Adrian Matioc', null, 'Antoine de Maximy disappeared in the Carpathian Mountains during the filming of J''irai dormir chez vous (2005) after a car accident . His editor, Agnès, tries to find him thanks to the pictures of his trip.', 'Antoine de Maximy disappeared in the Carpathian Mountains during the filming of J''irai dormir chez vous (2005) after a car accident . His editor, Agnès, tries to find him thanks to the pictures of his trip.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/63zLQ0djzdbmwzK2eymu6bWLbNX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:719747'),
  ('612165700590840269', 'J''me sens pas belle', 2004, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Bernard Jeanjean, Pierre Aïm', 'Bernard Jeanjean', 'Marina Foïs, Julien Boisselier, Isabelle Nanty, Didier Bénureau, Julie Durand, Matthias Van Khache', null, 'Fanny, a single woman in her mid-thirties, has had enough of relationships that don''t work, so she decides to seduce Paul, a colleague from the office, into a brief one-night sexual encounter. Everything is prepared when Paul arrives, but then, thanks to Fanny''s clumsiness, things don''t exactly work out as planned...', 'Fanny, a single woman in her mid-thirties, has had enough of relationships that don''t work, so she decides to seduce Paul, a colleague from the office, into a brief one-night sexual encounter. Everything is prepared when Paul arrives, but then, thanks to Fanny''s clumsiness, things don''t exactly work out as planned...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5TTchPYMWkMSj3678ACzgSyf43v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56008'),
  ('531552434231010008', 'Jaadugar', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Sameer Saxena, Soumik Mukherjee', 'Biswapati Sarkar', 'Jitendra Kumar, Arushi Sharma, Javed Jaffrey, Manoj Joshi, Rukshar Dhillon, Sameer Saxena, Ajay Mehra, Raj Qushal', null, 'A small-time magician with zero interest in football must lead his local team to the finals of a tournament if he wishes to marry the love of his life.', 'A small-time magician with zero interest in football must lead his local team to the finals of a tournament if he wishes to marry the love of his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wEfhAPR6VNzrt1tkTuzCamRMB3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:821119'),
  ('761395392424612569', 'Jaan-E-Mann', 2006, 'Drama, Romance', 'Shirish Kunder, Vikas Sharma, Sudeep Chatterjee', 'Shirish Kunder', 'Salman Khan, Akshay Kumar, Preity Zinta, Anupam Kher, Nawab Shah, Aman Verma, Soni Razdan, Javed Sheikh', null, 'Agastya a NASA scientist comes in search of his crush Piya. In order to make her fall for him, he gets Suhaan to help this out. However, everything goes well till a shocking past stands in front of them, turning their lives upside down.', 'Agastya a NASA scientist comes in search of his crush Piya. In order to make her fall for him, he gets Suhaan to help this out. However, everything goes well till a shocking past stands in front of them, turning their lives upside down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qBCQOQOZyeJKljODcGZbzr80REn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59267'),
  ('630652453687446451', 'Jaanam Samjha Karo', 1999, 'Drama, Romance', 'Andaleeb Sultanpuri, W. B. Rao', 'Rajkumar Santoshi', 'Salman Khan, Urmila Matondkar, Jaspal Bhatti, Shammi Kapoor, Shakti Kapoor, Sadashiv Amrapurkar, Bindu Desai, Monica Bedi', null, 'Chandni, a nightclub singer and dancer, is requested to pretend to be a wealthy womaniser''s wife in front of his grandfather. However, things get interesting when the two, gradually, fall in love.', 'Chandni, a nightclub singer and dancer, is requested to pretend to be a wealthy womaniser''s wife in front of his grandfather. However, things get interesting when the two, gradually, fall in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uAE2tf9EVtBeBSl6M941Lu0QKL5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161227'),
  ('1151050253401777593', 'Jaane Bhi Do Yaaro', 1983, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Kundan Shah, Sudhir Mishra, Binod Pradhan', 'Kundan Shah, Sudhir Mishra', 'Naseeruddin Shah, Ravi Baswani, Bhakti Barve, Satish Shah, Om Puri, Satish Kaushik, Pankaj Kapur, Deepak Qazir', null, 'Two zanies open a photography studio. They score a partnership with a gossip magazine that suddenly thrusts them into a world of corruption, murder, and hijinks.', 'Two zanies open a photography studio. They score a partnership with a gossip magazine that suddenly thrusts them into a world of corruption, murder, and hijinks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gidaBJsPuq0nTG7PI93mERZoVAh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25499'),
  ('46914541192209695', 'Jaane Jaan', 2023, 'Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Sujoy Ghosh, Avik Mukhopadhyay, Mukesh Chhabra', 'Sujoy Ghosh', 'Kareena Kapoor Khan, Jaideep Ahlawat, Vijay Varma, Naisha Khanna, Saurabh Sachdeva, Ujjwal Chopra, Uttam Pradhan, Karma Takapa', 'R', 'When a single mother her teenage daughter becomes ensnared in a deadly crime, find an unexpected ally in their neighbor, a simple, doting but genius teacher math teacher comes to aid, while a tenacious cop digs into the case.', 'When a single mother her teenage daughter becomes ensnared in a deadly crime, find an unexpected ally in their neighbor, a simple, doting but genius teacher math teacher comes to aid, while a tenacious cop digs into the case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oaUOV9VCNM5MjrmonqgH4o3XNwQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:950071'),
  ('476175721324703211', 'Jaane Kahan Se Aayi Hai', 2010, 'Comedy, Drama, Fantasy, Romance', 'Milap Zaveri', 'Milap Zaveri', 'Riteish Deshmukh, Jacqueline Fernandez, Vishal Malhotra, Ruslaan Mumtaz, Satish Shah, Supriya Pilgaonkar, Amrita Rao, Boman Irani', null, 'A man tries to help an alien from Venus find true love on Earth.', 'A man tries to help an alien from Venus find true love on Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8opCHaRGQQMHW1Sx3FR9xIObF4f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71315'),
  ('190524449886476722', 'Jaane Tu... Ya Jaane Na', 2008, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Manoj Lobo, Abbas Tyrewala', 'Abbas Tyrewala', 'Imran Khan, Genelia D''Souza, Manjari Fadnnis, Prateik Smita Patil, Sugandha Garg, Nirav Mehta, Alishka Varde, Ayaz Khan', null, 'Two best friends being convinced that they are not in love search for each other''s love.', 'Two best friends being convinced that they are not in love search for each other''s love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iV1W0IEtQYuBnnxNmZxSmPHK3Pu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14467'),
  ('469280779588389538', 'Jaani Dushman: Ek Anokhi Kahani', 2002, 'Action, Fantasy, Thriller, Horror', 'Rajkumar Kohli', null, 'Arman Kohli, Manisha Koirala, Sunny Deol, Akshay Kumar, Suniel Shetty, Sonu Nigam, Arshad Warsi, Aditya Pancholi', null, 'A shape-shifting snake exacts revenge on the men he believes are responsible for the death of Divya, his lover in her previous life.', 'A shape-shifting snake exacts revenge on the men he believes are responsible for the death of Divya, his lover in her previous life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e9Aps5rxiu3lzPgtccEERfReJ6R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:159436'),
  ('1075031016611776524', 'Jaanwar', 1999, 'Action', 'Suneel Darshan', 'Robin Bhatt', 'Akshay Kumar, Shilpa Shetty Kundra, Karisma Kapoor, Aditya Kapadia, Ashish Vidhyarthi, Mohnish Behl, Ashutosh Rana, Johny Lever', null, 'Sultan (Shakti Kapoor) adopted an orphan and named him Badshah (Akshay Kumar). Badshah grows up to be a criminal and his life was made difficult by Inspector Pradhan (Ashish Vidyarthi). Badshah''s sidekick is Abdul (Ashutosh Rana). The only hope in Badshah''s life is Sapna (Karisma Kapoor), whom he incidentally met. But circumstances lead Badshah to commit murder in public. During this experience, a child clangs to him and he took the child to Sapna. Before he could explain anything, Pradhan gets there and Badshah had to escape. He changed his name to Babu Lohar and becomes a blacksmith and loving father, to give the child a good future. However, after 7 years, he sees Abdul and Sultan again. Pradhan is still after him. When the child''s parents find out about him, they ask Babu to return their child. Will he let the child go? Will the child go with his parents?', 'Sultan (Shakti Kapoor) adopted an orphan and named him Badshah (Akshay Kumar). Badshah grows up to be a criminal and his life was made difficult by Inspector Pradhan (Ashish Vidyarthi). Badshah''s sidekick is Abdul (Ashutosh Rana). The only hope in Badshah''s life is Sapna (Karisma Kapoor), whom he incidentally met. But circumstances lead Badshah to commit murder in public. During this experience, a child clangs to him and he took the child to Sapna. Before he could explain anything, Pradhan gets there and Badshah had to escape. He changed his name to Babu Lohar and becomes a blacksmith and loving father, to give the child a good future. However, after 7 years, he sees Abdul and Sultan again. Pradhan is still after him. When the child''s parents find out about him, they ask Babu to return their child. Will he let the child go? Will the child go with his parents?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hAdnoPTsd1uWXKtKNzHzhijg6j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:353429'),
  ('546787664519451087', 'Jaat', 2025, 'Crime, Action, Thriller', 'Gopichand Malineni, Rishi Punjabi, Gulabi Srinu', 'Gopichand Malineni, M. Vivek Anand, Nimmagadda Srikanth', 'Sunny Deol, Randeep Hooda, Saiyami Kher, Regina Cassandra, Vineet Kumar Singh, Ramya Krishnan, Jagapati Babu, Vinay Varma', 'R', 'A mysterious stranger journeys to a remote town controlled by a callous crime lord, with one violent mission — restoring justice to its people.', 'A mysterious stranger journeys to a remote town controlled by a callous crime lord, with one violent mission — restoring justice to its people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/guTflsCTgLNqTbpHTi9gJANk1Rf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1306845'),
  ('179986839185768344', 'Jab Harry Met Sejal', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Imtiaz Ali, Beáta Neszmélyi, Krisztina Barkóczy', 'Imtiaz Ali', 'Shah Rukh Khan, Anushka Sharma, Aru Krishansh Verma, Chandan Roy Sanyal, Evelyn Sharma, Kavi Shastri, Sayani Gupta, Björn Freiberg', null, 'A middle-aged tour guide develops profound affection for a bubbly traveller while helping her search for a lost engagement ring across various picturesque European destinations.', 'A middle-aged tour guide develops profound affection for a bubbly traveller while helping her search for a lost engagement ring across various picturesque European destinations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yraJilUVLSd6BmQ4f1YtJGmcNkf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:441906'),
  ('71133774257365443', 'Jab Pyaar Kisise Hota Hai', 1998, 'Drama, Family, Comedy', 'Deepak Sareen, Manmohan Singh', 'Honey Irani', 'Salman Khan, Twinkle Khanna, Johny Lever, Saeed Jaffrey, Namrata Shirodkar, Anupam Kher, Aditya Narayan, Farida Jalal', null, 'Sooraj Dhanrajgir, a playboy, falls in love with Komal, who rejects him because of his vices and gives him time to change. Things go awry when a little boy shows up claiming to be his son.', 'Sooraj Dhanrajgir, a playboy, falls in love with Komal, who rejects him because of his vices and gives him time to change. Things go awry when a little boy shows up claiming to be his son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Rje4CxHvs7yDXuRrlWttDXUmmy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161236'),
  ('194062091817388973', 'Jab Tak Hai Jaan', 2012, 'Drama, Romance', 'Yash Chopra, Bharat Rawail, Abhiraj Minawala', 'Aditya Chopra, Devika Bhagat', 'Shah Rukh Khan, Katrina Kaif, Anushka Sharma, Sarika, Andrew Bicknell, Sharib Hashmi, Jasmine Jardot, Gireesh Sahedev', 'NR', 'Samar Anand (Shah Rukh Khan), a London-based struggling musician falls in love with Meera Thappar (Katrina Kaif). After a severe accident, a panicked Meera promises God to leave Samar if he lives. Heartbroken, Samar leaves for India to become a fearless bomb disposal expert in the army.', 'Samar Anand (Shah Rukh Khan), a London-based struggling musician falls in love with Meera Thappar (Katrina Kaif). After a severe accident, a panicked Meera promises God to leave Samar if he lives. Heartbroken, Samar leaves for India to become a fearless bomb disposal expert in the army.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1TlzJZrzUlaC95Noqt3oMoxQxCu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132316'),
  ('754589615411708092', 'Jab We Met', 2007, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Imtiaz Ali, Natarajan Subramaniam', 'Imtiaz Ali', 'Shahid Kapoor, Kareena Kapoor Khan, Tarun Arora, Dara Singh, Pavan Malhotra, Kamal Tiwari, Kiran Juneja, Divya Shah', 'PG-13', 'A depressed wealthy businessman and a spunky carefree young woman embark on an unexpected journey that changes their lives.', 'A depressed wealthy businessman and a spunky carefree young woman embark on an unexpected journey that changes their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iqiH6vnoEgjAypKsuIScN7JlE2j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11807'),
  ('56568943595724496', 'Jabariya Jodi', 2019, 'Drama, Romance', 'Prashant Singh, Manu Anand, Vishal Sinha', 'Sanjeev k Jha', 'Parineeti Chopra, Sidharth Malhotra, Aparshakti Khurana, Sanjay Mishra, Javed Jaffrey, Ruslaan Mumtaz, Chandan Roy Sanyal, Neeraj Sood', null, 'Abhay Singh runs a syndicate of kidnapping greedy grooms, who demand dowry in Bihar’s Madhopur. He then, forcefully marries them off to the girl, calling it a ‘surprise party’. But when his childhood sweetheart Babli re-enters his life, he must choose between love and his long-term ambitions.', 'Abhay Singh runs a syndicate of kidnapping greedy grooms, who demand dowry in Bihar’s Madhopur. He then, forcefully marries them off to the girl, calling it a ‘surprise party’. But when his childhood sweetheart Babli re-enters his life, he must choose between love and his long-term ambitions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qibn9VfTUiDExrkxb2X3MZRABe0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:543693'),
  ('640809468808409198', 'Jabberwocky', 1971, 'Animation', 'Jan Švankmajer, Boris Baromykin', 'Jan Švankmajer', null, null, 'In stop-motion animation, a wardrobe moves through the countryside. It arrives in a house, a child''s voice recites Lewis Carroll''s "Jabberwocky," and various objects, such as toys and dolls, move about, disintegrate, and play out archetypal scenes. Like Carroll''s verse, the images are at once familiar and unfamiliar. A child''s play suit, hanging in the wardrobe, becomes the adventure''s protagonist.', 'In stop-motion animation, a wardrobe moves through the countryside. It arrives in a house, a child''s voice recites Lewis Carroll''s "Jabberwocky," and various objects, such as toys and dolls, move about, disintegrate, and play out archetypal scenes. Like Carroll''s verse, the images are at once familiar and unfamiliar. A child''s play suit, hanging in the wardrobe, becomes the adventure''s protagonist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ccsqfFZmO75eLbXNs259JVLpDpf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19021'),
  ('861381820882181831', 'Jabberwocky', 1977, 'Fantasy, Comedy', 'Terry Gilliam, Terry Bedford, Roger Cain', 'Terry Gilliam, Charles Alverson', 'Michael Palin, Harry H. Corbett, John Le Mesurier, Warren Mitchell, Max Wall, Rodney Bewes, John Bird, Bernard Bresslaw', 'PG', 'After the death of his father, young Dennis Cooper goes to town where he has to pass several adventures. The town and the whole kingdom is threatened by a terrible monster called ''Jabberwocky''. Will Dennis make his fortune? Is anyone brave enough to defeat the monster?', 'After the death of his father, young Dennis Cooper goes to town where he has to pass several adventures. The town and the whole kingdom is threatened by a terrible monster called ''Jabberwocky''. Will Dennis make his fortune? Is anyone brave enough to defeat the monster?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kprcqmFxWPU45L1ZnMXO5yPPMVA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11834'),
  ('124340540006304328', 'Jacinta', 2017, 'Drama', 'Jorge Paixão da Costa', 'Manuel Arouca, Raquel Palermo', 'Dalila Carmo, Matilde Serrão, Renata Belo, Graciano Dias, António Pedro Cerdeira, Pedro Lamares, Paula Lobo Antunes, João Didelet', null, 'The story of Jacinta, one of the three children involved in the Marian apparition reported in 1917 at Cova da Iria, in Fátima, Portugal.', 'The story of Jacinta, one of the three children involved in the Marian apparition reported in 1917 at Cova da Iria, in Fátima, Portugal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wvbfi9372DePH3Gp0a3hPyflFlG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:449393'),
  ('587613044988937297', 'Jack', 1996, 'Comedy, Family, Drama', 'Francis Ford Coppola, Roman Coppola, John Toll', 'James DeMonaco, Gary Nadeau', 'Robin Williams, Diane Lane, Brian Kerwin, Jennifer Lopez, Bill Cosby, Fran Drescher, Adam Zolotin, Irwin Corey', 'PG-13', 'Born with a rare condition that makes him age four times faster than normal, ten-year-old Jack Powell looks like a forty-year-old man. After years of homeschooling, he enters public school for the first time, eager to make friends and live like any other kid—only to discover that growing up too fast means learning some of life’s hardest lessons early.', 'Born with a rare condition that makes him age four times faster than normal, ten-year-old Jack Powell looks like a forty-year-old man. After years of homeschooling, he enters public school for the first time, eager to make friends and live like any other kid—only to discover that growing up too fast means learning some of life’s hardest lessons early.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9W6UI8UQ4YdLCAaPFd0lcKJ1tX4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7095'),
  ('88111638501748118', 'Jack', 2014, 'Drama', 'Edward Berger, Jens Harant', 'Nele Mueller-Stöfen, Edward Berger', 'Ivo Pietzcker, Luise Heyer, Nele Mueller-Stöfen, Jacob Matschenz, Georg Arms, Odine Johne, Johann Fohl, Johannes Hendrik Langer', null, 'Ten-year-old Jack has to take care of his little brother, six-year-old Manuel, every day from the time he gets up to the time he goes to bed. When Manuel suffers an accident, their lives change forever.', 'Ten-year-old Jack has to take care of his little brother, six-year-old Manuel, every day from the time he gets up to the time he goes to bed. When Manuel suffers an accident, their lives change forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4cLb755niFIB55tXlQKjaBwnEPQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:254323'),
  ('496472098364970869', 'Jack & Diane', 2012, 'Drama, Horror, Romance', 'Bradley Rust Gray, Anne Misawa', 'Bradley Rust Gray', 'Juno Temple, Riley Keough, Kylie Minogue, Cara Seymour, Lou Taylor Pucci, Dane DeHaan, Michael Chernus, Neal Huff', 'R', 'The romance between two teenage girls quickly manifests as terrifying, violent and inexplicable.', 'The romance between two teenage girls quickly manifests as terrifying, violent and inexplicable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yz7Fck16GLYTL0CK6EfDYIqrhEl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105531'),
  ('755928490956735594', 'Jack & Sarah', 1995, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Jean-Yves Escoffier, Tim Sullivan, Cliff Lanning', 'Tim Sullivan', 'Richard E. Grant, Samantha Mathis, Judi Dench, Eileen Atkins, Cherie Lunghi, Imogen Stubbs, David Swift, Kate Hardie', null, 'Jack always lands on his feet. He lands on his feet when he marries the beautiful Sarah. He lands on his feet when he buys a luxurious new home. However, when Sarah goes into labour, he takes a tumble down the stairs and lands on his head. When he comes around he discovers he is the proud father of a baby girl, but deficient in the spouse department to the tune of 1.', 'Jack always lands on his feet. He lands on his feet when he marries the beautiful Sarah. He lands on his feet when he buys a luxurious new home. However, when Sarah goes into labour, he takes a tumble down the stairs and lands on his head. When he comes around he discovers he is the proud father of a baby girl, but deficient in the spouse department to the tune of 1.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yWMj1KMfnixB35qa2IZKniHF4sn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2021'),
  ('1084003427328183043', 'Jack and Jill', 2011, 'Comedy, Family', 'Conte Mark Matal, Daniel Silverberg, Dennis Dugan', 'Adam Sandler, Steve Koren', 'Adam Sandler, Al Pacino, Katie Holmes, Elodie Tougne, Rohan Chand, Eugenio Derbez, David Spade, Nick Swardson', 'PG', 'Jack Sadelstein, a successful advertising executive in Los Angeles with a beautiful wife and kids, dreads one event each year: the Thanksgiving visit of his twin sister Jill. Jill''s neediness and passive-aggressiveness is maddening to Jack, turning his normally tranquil life upside down.', 'Jack Sadelstein, a successful advertising executive in Los Angeles with a beautiful wife and kids, dreads one event each year: the Thanksgiving visit of his twin sister Jill. Jill''s neediness and passive-aggressiveness is maddening to Jack, turning his normally tranquil life upside down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kFeAxmZvu0TE4iuLRHQD6Cej8Wf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71880'),
  ('719815366813474986', 'Jack and Jill', 2021, 'Horror, Drama', 'Jack Peter Mundy, Fred Searle', 'Tom Jolliffe, Jack Peter Mundy', 'Jo Barker, Lee Hancock, Antonia Whillans, Sarah T. Cohen, Sofia Lacey, Clint Gordon, Beatrice Fletcher, Daisy Hamilton', null, 'A horror retelling of the nursery rhyme Jack and Jill. A group of friends grieving a recent loss meet up with one another only to discover they are being hunted by Jack and Jill.', 'A horror retelling of the nursery rhyme Jack and Jill. A group of friends grieving a recent loss meet up with one another only to discover they are being hunted by Jack and Jill.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o2oxHNIALzFdOqnaBgM1PlFzG0u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:879917'),
  ('693811973919926705', 'Jack and Jill vs. The World', 2008, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Vanessa Parise, Manfred Guthe', 'Peter Stebbings, Vanessa Parise', 'Freddie Prinze Jr., Taryn Manning, Peter Stebbings, Ingrid Doucet, Vanessa Parise, Lisa Ciara, Darrin Brown, Claudia Besso', 'PG-13', 'Jack and Jill''s Manifesto of Rules to Live By Rule 1 Be honest Rule 2 Believe in fairy tales Rule 3 Accept time as our friend Rule 4 Make sure the nooky is good Rule 5 Promote beauty. Wage a sustained campaign against ugliness Rule 6 Abandon the pursuit of happiness and its false promise Rule 7 Show compassion, except to pirates Rule 8 Less TV Rule 9 Always be willing to admit when you''re wrong', 'Jack and Jill''s Manifesto of Rules to Live By Rule 1 Be honest Rule 2 Believe in fairy tales Rule 3 Accept time as our friend Rule 4 Make sure the nooky is good Rule 5 Promote beauty. Wage a sustained campaign against ugliness Rule 6 Abandon the pursuit of happiness and its false promise Rule 7 Show compassion, except to pirates Rule 8 Less TV Rule 9 Always be willing to admit when you''re wrong', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g5LSsxj3pPEFOo33eIjKFMRP6CS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16216'),
  ('989613033288254078', 'Jack and Old Mac', 1956, 'Animation, Music, Fantasy, Family', 'Bill Justice', null, null, 'NR', 'Two stylized nursery rhymes are shown. First is "The House That Jack Built" as told with a variety of characters composed of letters that spell out their names (Example: the cow is made up of an intertwined C, O, and W). Next is "Old MacDonald Had a Band" (no, not farm) in which Old MacDonald and his band give way with a hot jazz number (even his animals play instruments). The piece comes to an end when Old MacDonald''s wife is tired of doing all the housework and gives him a swift whack on his head with her rolling pin.', 'Two stylized nursery rhymes are shown. First is "The House That Jack Built" as told with a variety of characters composed of letters that spell out their names (Example: the cow is made up of an intertwined C, O, and W). Next is "Old MacDonald Had a Band" (no, not farm) in which Old MacDonald and his band give way with a hot jazz number (even his animals play instruments). The piece comes to an end when Old MacDonald''s wife is tired of doing all the housework and gives him a swift whack on his head with her rolling pin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2R0mOIskd6xHmZ8cUOJ9s1WQMph.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89773'),
  ('179582567746707957', 'Jack and the Beanstalk', 1931, 'Animation', 'Dave Fleischer', null, 'Ann Little, Billy Murray, William Pennell', null, 'A Max &amp; Dave Fleischer cartoon from 1931. Bimbo climbs a beanstalk to find Betty Boop enslaved by the giant.', 'A Max &amp; Dave Fleischer cartoon from 1931. Bimbo climbs a beanstalk to find Betty Boop enslaved by the giant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/amNK4kTzPDrSkgOkju92HgaJgWT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162591'),
  ('1011352548057810626', 'Jack and the Beanstalk', 1952, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Music', 'Jean Yarbrough, George Robinson', 'Nathaniel Curtis', 'Bud Abbott, Lou Costello, Buddy Baer, Dorothy Ford, Barbara Brown, David Stollery, William Farnum, Shaye Cogan', 'NR', 'Two down-on-their-luck loafers take a job babysitting, with a bedtime story of the titular tale turning into a wacky Abbott and Costello-faced musical retelling involving stolen cows, terrible giants, and the heroic boy with an opportunistic butcher in a castle above the clouds.', 'Two down-on-their-luck loafers take a job babysitting, with a bedtime story of the titular tale turning into a wacky Abbott and Costello-faced musical retelling involving stolen cows, terrible giants, and the heroic boy with an opportunistic butcher in a castle above the clouds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/psogkzcA2yOT0Tz669i0Lm1eZXM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18698'),
  ('559753624035611410', 'Jack and the Beanstalk', 1967, 'Fantasy, Animation, Adventure, Family, TV Movie', 'Gene Kelly, Hal Mohr, George R. Batcheller Jr.', 'Michael Morris, Larry Markes', 'Bobby Riha, Dick Beals, Gene Kelly, Ted Cassidy, Janet Waldo, Marni Nixon, Marian McKnight, Chris Allen', null, 'A delightful retelling of the classic fairytale by Hanna-Barbera, using live action and animation.', 'A delightful retelling of the classic fairytale by Hanna-Barbera, using live action and animation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1O1hgNW43iYY8N0pOcqKeMc9fJz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72762'),
  ('128867903173048535', 'Jack and the Beanstalk', 1974, 'Adventure, Animation, Fantasy', 'Gisaburō Sugii, Shigeru Yamamoto', 'Peter J. Solmo', 'Masachika Ichimura, Linda Yamamoto, Kō Nishimura, Hiroshi Mizushima, Kirin Kiki, Kazuo Kamimura, Nobue Ichitani, Miyoko Aso', null, 'An adventurous young boy named Jack climbs a giant beanstalk to a magical kingdom governed by a greedy, tyrannical giant.', 'An adventurous young boy named Jack climbs a giant beanstalk to a magical kingdom governed by a greedy, tyrannical giant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jJbWGUeVHxWdiQyzOSosCs9kdVQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34052'),
  ('15155491666297942', 'Jack and the Beanstalk', 2009, 'Adventure, Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Gary J. Tunnicliffe, Brian Baugh', 'Flip Kobler, Cindy Marcus', 'Chevy Chase, Madison Davenport, Emily Rose Everhard, Colin Ford, Gilbert Gottfried, Sammi Hanratty, James Karen, Hal B. Klein', 'G', 'A fairy tale character who is about to flunk out of fairy tale school, Jack must perform a heroic deed by Monday or fail miserably, just like his father before him. Anxious to make good, Jack sells his C.O.W. (Computer of Wonder) for a handful of magic beans and a mysterious book that records his adventures as he''s having them. Accompanied by his sidekick Grayson -- a goose who ate a bean and underwent an amazing transformation -- Jack climbs the magic beanstalk to recover the fabled Harp of Destiny from the evil Giant who lives in the sky. Helping Jack on his perilous quest is the spunky Jillian, a fearless young girl whom Jack meets on his journey -- and who just may have a hidden agenda...', 'A fairy tale character who is about to flunk out of fairy tale school, Jack must perform a heroic deed by Monday or fail miserably, just like his father before him. Anxious to make good, Jack sells his C.O.W. (Computer of Wonder) for a handful of magic beans and a mysterious book that records his adventures as he''s having them. Accompanied by his sidekick Grayson -- a goose who ate a bean and underwent an amazing transformation -- Jack climbs the magic beanstalk to recover the fabled Harp of Destiny from the evil Giant who lives in the sky. Helping Jack on his perilous quest is the spunky Jillian, a fearless young girl whom Jack meets on his journey -- and who just may have a hidden agenda...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kQKwVj1xvWh2jN1GeBsubpVgdFn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36550'),
  ('786288908774566438', 'Jack and the Cuckoo-Clock Heart', 2014, 'Animation, Romance, Adventure, Drama, Fantasy', 'Stéphane Berla, Mathias Malzieu', 'Mathias Malzieu', 'Mathias Malzieu, Olivia Ruiz, Grand Corps Malade, Jean Rochefort, Emily Loizeau, Rossy de Palma, Babet, Marie Vincent', 'PG', 'Jack is born with his heart frozen solid on the coldest day in history. A wise midwife saves him by replacing it with a cuckoo clock. Now Jack must abide by three rules to keep his mechanical heart safe: never touch the clock''s hands, master his anger, and never fall in love. He tries his best, but when he meets a girl named Acacia he falls in love, threatening the delicate balance of his artificial heart.', 'Jack is born with his heart frozen solid on the coldest day in history. A wise midwife saves him by replacing it with a cuckoo clock. Now Jack must abide by three rules to keep his mechanical heart safe: never touch the clock''s hands, master his anger, and never fall in love. He tries his best, but when he meets a girl named Acacia he falls in love, threatening the delicate balance of his artificial heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ZSrU2mvlzM5Jr30XtKCU1fziIj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:204436'),
  ('165665438745661600', 'Jack Be Nimble', 1993, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Garth Maxwell, Donald Duncan', 'Garth Maxwell', 'Alexis Arquette, Sarah Smuts-Kennedy, Bruno Lawrence, Tony Barry, Elizabeth Hawthorne, Brenda Simmons, Gilbert Goldie, Patricia Phillips', null, 'Jack and Dora, abandoned by their parents as babies, are desperate to find each other after years of adoption. Jack''s young life has been spent with a sadistic family. Dora, whose life has been somewhat better, has developed extra-sensory powers which tell her that Jack''s in danger and drives her to search for him.', 'Jack and Dora, abandoned by their parents as babies, are desperate to find each other after years of adoption. Jack''s young life has been spent with a sadistic family. Dora, whose life has been somewhat better, has developed extra-sensory powers which tell her that Jack''s in danger and drives her to search for him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uQStdnElxgOOer91Hyw1chLdGBQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99092'),
  ('89573696255033843', 'Jack Brooks: Monster Slayer', 2007, 'Horror, Action, Comedy', 'Jon Knautz', 'Jon Knautz, John Ainslie', 'Trevor Matthews, Robert Englund, Daniel Kash, David Fox, Dean Hawes, Rachel Skarsten, James A. Woods, Ashley Bryant', 'R', 'As a child Jack Brooks witnessed the brutal murder of his family. Now a young man he struggles with a pestering girlfriend, therapy sessions that resolve nothing, and night classes that barely hold his interest. After unleashing an ancient curse, Jack''s Professor undergoes a transformation into something not-quite- human, and Jack is forced to confront some old demons... along with a few new ones.', 'As a child Jack Brooks witnessed the brutal murder of his family. Now a young man he struggles with a pestering girlfriend, therapy sessions that resolve nothing, and night classes that barely hold his interest. After unleashing an ancient curse, Jack''s Professor undergoes a transformation into something not-quite- human, and Jack is forced to confront some old demons... along with a few new ones.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xAieCaFdEiIwhHS7FKcltPDUnRc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16205'),
  ('1021769402436703797', 'Jack Frost', 1934, 'Animation', 'Ub Iwerks, Shamus Culhane, Al Eugster', null, null, null, 'A young grizzly bear, undaunted by his mother''s warnings of the coming winter, runs away from home only to be confronted by Old Man Winter himself.', 'A young grizzly bear, undaunted by his mother''s warnings of the coming winter, runs away from home only to be confronted by Old Man Winter himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tFjDdTxdW2ygknyj7GFgUoeaX97.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70539'),
  ('300618782590178135', 'Jack Frost', 1979, 'Family, Animation, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Jules Bass, Arthur Rankin, Jr.', 'Romeo Muller', 'Buddy Hackett, Robert Morse, Paul Frees, Larry Storch, Dave Garroway, Debra Clinger, Don Messick, Dee Stratton', 'G', 'Pardon-me Pete, the official groundhog of Groundhog Day, tells the story of Jack Frost, who falls in love with a beautiful young woman and begs Father Winter to make him human so that she can see him. His request is granted, but only on the condition that by the Spring he has a house, a bag of gold, a horse and a wife. But Jack finds that life as a human is more complicated than he thought.', 'Pardon-me Pete, the official groundhog of Groundhog Day, tells the story of Jack Frost, who falls in love with a beautiful young woman and begs Father Winter to make him human so that she can see him. His request is granted, but only on the condition that by the Spring he has a house, a bag of gold, a horse and a wife. But Jack finds that life as a human is more complicated than he thought.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rky3WOB9AZ4fELooSKWwmO9qRQq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26538'),
  ('370248081987656078', 'Jack Frost', 1997, 'Fantasy, Horror, Comedy', 'Michael Cooney, Chad Rosen, Sam Hill', 'Michael Cooney', 'Christopher Allport, Shannon Elizabeth, Stephen Mendel, F. William Parker, Brian Leckner, Scott MacDonald, Kelly Jean Peters, Rob LaBelle', 'R', 'On his way to be executed, the vehicle containing notorious serial killer Jack Frost collides with a hazardous chemical truck, turning him into a snow covered mutant and unleashing him on the unsuspecting town of Snomonton.', 'On his way to be executed, the vehicle containing notorious serial killer Jack Frost collides with a hazardous chemical truck, turning him into a snow covered mutant and unleashing him on the unsuspecting town of Snomonton.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sXOATwGluNbb9ezfG6DvXCiXvJp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27318'),
  ('568709828597970948', 'Jack Frost', 1998, 'Comedy, Family, Drama, Fantasy', 'Troy Miller, László Kovács, Todd Y. Murata', 'Mark Steven Johnson, Jeff Cesario, Steve Bloom', 'Michael Keaton, Kelly Preston, Mark Addy, Joseph Cross, Henry Rollins, Mika Boorem, Andrew Lawrence, Eli Marienthal', 'PG', 'A father, who can''t keep his promises, dies in a car accident. One year later, he returns as a snowman, who has the final chance to put things right with his son before he is gone forever.', 'A father, who can''t keep his promises, dies in a car accident. One year later, he returns as a snowman, who has the final chance to put things right with his son before he is gone forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tdSyQJe7vEDcH9kEVqzVcr0O9lS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9745'),
  ('113640131804272320', 'Jack Frost 2: The Revenge of the Mutant Killer Snowman', 2000, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Horror', 'Michael Cooney, Dean Lent', 'Michael Cooney', 'Christopher Allport, Scott MacDonald, David Allen Brooks, Sean Patrick Murphy, Melanie Good, Tai Bennett, Jennifer Lyons, Shonda Farr', 'R', 'The sheriff and his deputies from the first movie decide to take a vacation in the Caribbean. Their holiday will be short-lived, however, as the thawed murderer gets inadvertently re-frozen and brought back to life. As if that weren''t bad enough, he now has the ability to remain frozen even in tropical temperatures, and he''s headed south to settle some old scores.', 'The sheriff and his deputies from the first movie decide to take a vacation in the Caribbean. Their holiday will be short-lived, however, as the thawed murderer gets inadvertently re-frozen and brought back to life. As if that weren''t bad enough, he now has the ability to remain frozen even in tropical temperatures, and he''s headed south to settle some old scores.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3wFa1ue5NDa3q04y2PGmq64gevZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27320'),
  ('311575106076488203', 'Jack Frusciante è uscito dal gruppo', 1996, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Enza Negroni, Alessio Gelsini Torresi', 'Enza Negroni, Enrico Brizzi', 'Stefano Accorsi, Violante Placido, Alessandro Zamattio, Barbara Livi, Andrea Manai, Riccardo Pedrazzoli, Stefano Rivi, Simone Sabattini', null, 'Alex, a high-school boy fond of rock and punk music, falls in love with Adelaide, who shares his feelings but doesn''t want to get too involved because she will soon leave for studying in America. Alex gets relief in music and his friend Martino who leads what looks to him as a more complete life.', 'Alex, a high-school boy fond of rock and punk music, falls in love with Adelaide, who shares his feelings but doesn''t want to get too involved because she will soon leave for studying in America. Alex gets relief in music and his friend Martino who leads what looks to him as a more complete life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h3grYuiU0dqoJ8pjqx64APXoUS3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56332'),
  ('851528660783341915', 'Jack Goes Boating', 2010, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Philip Seymour Hoffman, W. Mott Hupfel III, Curtis Smith', 'Robert Glaudini', 'Philip Seymour Hoffman, Amy Ryan, John Ortiz, Daphne Rubin-Vega, Richard Petrocelli, Tom McCarthy, Lola Glaudini, Rafael Osorio', 'R', 'A limo driver''s blind date sparks a tale of love, betrayal, friendship and grace—centered on two working-class New York City couples.', 'A limo driver''s blind date sparks a tale of love, betrayal, friendship and grace—centered on two working-class New York City couples.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Qd8IJYdzzZh4Ylc8raKA9alRyW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43943'),
  ('541457491896474841', 'Jack Goes Home', 2016, 'Drama, Thriller, Horror', 'Austin Schmidt, Thomas Dekker', 'Thomas Dekker', 'Rory Culkin, Lin Shaye, Daveigh Chase, Natasha Lyonne, Louis Hunter, Nikki Reed, Britt Robertson, Michael Sirow', null, 'After his father is killed in a car crash, Jack travels home to Colorado to help nurse his mother (who was injured in the crash) back to health. There, he uncovers long buried secrets and lies within his family, his friends, and his very identity.', 'After his father is killed in a car crash, Jack travels home to Colorado to help nurse his mother (who was injured in the crash) back to health. There, he uncovers long buried secrets and lies within his family, his friends, and his very identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1K1Rptb0NFAi5BqtJXI6zefpTOQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:381935'),
  ('568044443653276162', 'Jack Hunter and the Quest for Akhenaten''s Tomb', 2008, 'Adventure, Action', 'Terry Cunningham', 'Michael Palmieri, Kevin Moore, Steven Jones', 'Ivan Sergei, Joanne Kelly, Thure Riefenstein, Alaina Huffman, Susan Ward, Mario Naim Bassil, Tuncel Kurtiz, Sinan Tuzcu', null, 'Adventurer Jack Hunter sets off in pursuit of a legendary tomb, meeting dangerous old adversaries, and even more dangerous old flames, along the way.', 'Adventurer Jack Hunter sets off in pursuit of a legendary tomb, meeting dangerous old adversaries, and even more dangerous old flames, along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AkjACojVQ8EPGgVvXQQ9zzYXpJH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32895'),
