  ('591099175094996875', 'Jack Strong', 2014, 'Drama, History, Thriller', 'Władysław Pasikowski, Magdalena Górka, Maciej Słowiński', 'Władysław Pasikowski', 'Marcin Dorociński, Maja Ostaszewska, Patrick Wilson, Oleg Maslennikov, Dimitri Bilov, Dagmara Dominczyk, Ireneusz Czop, Mirosław Baka', null, 'Poland, 1970. Firmly determined to fight against Soviet tyranny and prevent the destruction of the world, the high-ranking officer of the Polish army Ryszard Kukliński makes a serious decision that will put his life, his family and the fate of an entire nation at risk.', 'Poland, 1970. Firmly determined to fight against Soviet tyranny and prevent the destruction of the world, the high-ranking officer of the Polish army Ryszard Kukliński makes a serious decision that will put his life, his family and the fate of an entire nation at risk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g68bLH7cljIj0XbsfQUmrkDNF2M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:204968'),
