  ('439905804973493398', 'Jack the Giant Killer', 1962, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Family', 'Nathan Juran, David S. Horsley', 'Orville H. Hampton, Nathan Juran', 'Kerwin Mathews, Judi Meredith, Torin Thatcher, Walter Burke, Don Beddoe, Barry Kelley, Dayton Lummis, Anna Lee', 'G', 'The terrible and trecherous Pendragon plans to gain the throne of Cornwall by getting the king to abdicate and to marry his lovely daughter. To help him he has his dreadful witches in his castle and his almost unstoppable sorcery. A giant under his control abducts the princess, but on the way home with her the giant meets farming lad Jack who slays him. This is only the beginning.', 'The terrible and trecherous Pendragon plans to gain the throne of Cornwall by getting the king to abdicate and to marry his lovely daughter. To help him he has his dreadful witches in his castle and his almost unstoppable sorcery. A giant under his control abducts the princess, but on the way home with her the giant meets farming lad Jack who slays him. This is only the beginning.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nQYitRN2Wyy2sf8VQ6AvWBaVB2z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25360'),
  ('791588047837823262', 'Jack the Giant Killer', 2013, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Mark Atkins, Mark Atkins', 'Mark Atkins', 'Ben Cross, Jane March, Jamie Atkins, Vicki Glover, Tanya Winsor, Julian Boote, Harry Dyer, Jon Campling', 'PG', 'A giant beanstalk brings Jack to a land in the clouds filled with snarling, evil beasts. When the creatures make their way to the ground, Jack must figure out how to get back down before they destroy earth and everyone in it.', 'A giant beanstalk brings Jack to a land in the clouds filled with snarling, evil beasts. When the creatures make their way to the ground, Jack must figure out how to get back down before they destroy earth and everyone in it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eV1qcF3ifxJqEESus7wJeDrR3z2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:177566'),
  ('706847336565622663', 'Jack the Giant Slayer', 2013, 'Fantasy, Action, Adventure, Drama', 'Bryan Singer, Newton Thomas Sigel, Jamie Christopher', 'Darren Lemke, Christopher McQuarrie, Dan Studney', 'Nicholas Hoult, Eleanor Tomlinson, Ewan McGregor, Stanley Tucci, Ian McShane, Bill Nighy, Eddie Marsan, Ewen Bremner', 'PG-13', 'The story of an ancient war that is reignited when a young farmhand unwittingly opens a gateway between our world and a fearsome race of giants. Unleashed on the Earth for the first time in centuries, the giants strive to reclaim the land they once lost, forcing the young man, Jack into the battle of his life to stop them. Fighting for a kingdom, its people, and the love of a brave princess, he comes face to face with the unstoppable warriors he thought only existed in legend–and gets the chance to become a legend himself.', 'The story of an ancient war that is reignited when a young farmhand unwittingly opens a gateway between our world and a fearsome race of giants. Unleashed on the Earth for the first time in centuries, the giants strive to reclaim the land they once lost, forcing the young man, Jack into the battle of his life to stop them. Fighting for a kingdom, its people, and the love of a brave princess, he comes face to face with the unstoppable warriors he thought only existed in legend–and gets the chance to become a legend himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9jSI7saUX9Qz0JLh19jX2ulEwL7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81005'),
