  ('651199101503571556', 'Jack''s Dream', 1938, 'Animation, Drama, Fantasy', 'Joseph Cornell', null, null, null, 'A lucid dream turned nightmarish reality. A ship sinking into a world of fear. A short film that’s mostly puppetry by one of America''s most prolific twentieth century artists.', 'A lucid dream turned nightmarish reality. A ship sinking into a world of fear. A short film that’s mostly puppetry by one of America''s most prolific twentieth century artists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tNwjNpa8BureJIjwoTPDjpHSIGM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:236121'),
  ('539550573807923866', 'Jackal of Nahueltoro', 1970, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Miguel Littín, Héctor Ríos', 'Miguel Littín', 'Nelson Villagra, Shenda Román, Marcelo Romo, Héctor Noguera, Luis Alarcón, Pedro Villagra, Rafael Benavente, Rubén Sotoconil', null, 'Based on an actual murder case that ignited a furious debate over the death penalty in Chile in 1960, this experimental social drama portrays the life and death of an illiterate peasant who, while drunk, murdered the woman with whom he had a relationship and her five children.', 'Based on an actual murder case that ignited a furious debate over the death penalty in Chile in 1960, this experimental social drama portrays the life and death of an illiterate peasant who, while drunk, murdered the woman with whom he had a relationship and her five children.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tjcWfo5AJgU7TIyG5TFTpVhgS0t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72855'),
  ('347590025857187764', 'Jackals', 2017, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Kevin Greutert, Heidi Hinzman, TK Shom', 'Jared Rivet', 'Stephen Dorff, Johnathon Schaech, Deborah Kara Unger, Nick Roux, Alyssa Julia Smith, Chelsea Ricketts, Ben Sullivan, Jason Scott Jenkins', 'NR', 'Set in the 1980s, an estranged family hires a cult deprogrammer to take back their teenage son from a murderous cult, but find themselves under siege when the cultists surround their cabin, demanding the boy back.', 'Set in the 1980s, an estranged family hires a cult deprogrammer to take back their teenage son from a murderous cult, but find themselves under siege when the cultists surround their cabin, demanding the boy back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/roWDNPm5UAKo3LLi3BUXwmfDsHc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:459947'),
  ('1083567776770938990', 'Jackass 2.5', 2007, 'Comedy, Documentary', 'Jeff Tremaine', 'Ryan Dunn, Loomis Fall, Al Walker', 'Johnny Knoxville, Steve-O, Bam Margera, Chris Pontius, Spike Jonze, Jeff Tremaine, Rake Yohn, Preston Lacy', 'NR', 'The crew have now set off to finish what as left over from Jackass 2.0, and in this version they have Wee Man use a ''pee'' gun on themselves, having a mini motor bike fracas in the grocery mall, a sperm test, a portly crew member disguised as King Kong, as well as include three episodes of their hilarious adventures in India.', 'The crew have now set off to finish what as left over from Jackass 2.0, and in this version they have Wee Man use a ''pee'' gun on themselves, having a mini motor bike fracas in the grocery mall, a sperm test, a portly crew member disguised as King Kong, as well as include three episodes of their hilarious adventures in India.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qriTT0KQvvuCs73z0LyEduw6XX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14158'),
  ('282063792915091661', 'Jackass 3.5', 2011, 'Comedy, Documentary, Action', 'Jeff Tremaine', 'Barry Owen Smoter, Jarppi Leppälä, Jarno Laasala', 'Johnny Knoxville, Ryan Dunn, Dave England, Preston Lacy, Bam Margera, Ehren McGhehey, Steve-O, Chris Pontius', 'NR', 'Johnny Knoxville of ''Jackass'' releases unused material of stunts, tricks, antics and shenanigans shot during the production of ''Jackass 3D'' that didn''t make it into the film, as well as the hilarious outtakes.', 'Johnny Knoxville of ''Jackass'' releases unused material of stunts, tricks, antics and shenanigans shot during the production of ''Jackass 3D'' that didn''t make it into the film, as well as the hilarious outtakes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o0cILOYbqfppTLAhkI2tzA2BWtX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65851'),
  ('1051150610030103877', 'Jackass 3D', 2010, 'Comedy, Documentary, Action', 'Jeff Tremaine', 'Spike Jonze, Johnny Knoxville, Madison Clapp', 'Johnny Knoxville, Bam Margera, Ryan Dunn, Steve-O, Chris Pontius, Jason ''Wee Man'' Acuña, Preston Lacy, Ehren McGhehey', 'R', 'Johnny Knoxville, Bam Margera, Steve-O, Wee Man and the rest of their fearless and foolhardy friends take part in another round of outrageous pranks and stunts. In addition to standing in the path of a charging bull, launching themselves into the air and crashing through various objects, the guys perform in segments such as "Sweatsuit Cocktail," "Beehive Tetherball" and "Lamborghini Tooth Pull."', 'Johnny Knoxville, Bam Margera, Steve-O, Wee Man and the rest of their fearless and foolhardy friends take part in another round of outrageous pranks and stunts. In addition to standing in the path of a charging bull, launching themselves into the air and crashing through various objects, the guys perform in segments such as "Sweatsuit Cocktail," "Beehive Tetherball" and "Lamborghini Tooth Pull."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uPirN07su7LFixyZyLrNMMQ9u1E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16290'),
  ('124723648775535846', 'Jackass 4.5', 2022, 'Comedy, Action, Documentary', 'Dimitry Elyashkevich, Jeff Tremaine', 'Spike Jonze, Johnny Knoxville, Jeff Tremaine', 'Johnny Knoxville, Steve-O, Chris Pontius, Dave England, Ehren McGhehey, Jason ''Wee Man'' Acuña, Preston Lacy, Zach Holmes', null, 'Through outrageous, never-before-seen footage, witness the making of the Jackass crew''s last go at wild stunts.', 'Through outrageous, never-before-seen footage, witness the making of the Jackass crew''s last go at wild stunts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bl686OSeMQOvs90IQAgt8QipCsB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:828853'),
  ('741562163330749717', 'Jackass Forever', 2022, 'Action, Comedy, Documentary', 'Jeff Tremaine, Dimitry Elyashkevich, Lance Bangs', 'Dave England, Chris Pontius, Nick Kreiss', 'Johnny Knoxville, Steve-O, Chris Pontius, Dave England, Jason ''Wee Man'' Acuña, Ehren McGhehey, Preston Lacy, Zach Holmes', 'R', 'The Jackass crew, along with some newcomers, returns for one final round of hilarious, absurd, and dangerous stunts.', 'The Jackass crew, along with some newcomers, returns for one final round of hilarious, absurd, and dangerous stunts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ruHDFumJfW7F2vEqTZEQQ9xT7CA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:656663'),
  ('254334395726849096', 'Jackass Number Two', 2006, 'Action, Comedy, Documentary', 'Jeff Tremaine, Dimitry Elyashkevich', 'Jeff Tremaine, Steve-O, Brandon DiCamillo', 'Johnny Knoxville, Bam Margera, Steve-O, Chris Pontius, Ryan Dunn, Jason ''Wee Man'' Acuña, Preston Lacy, Dave England', 'R', 'Jackass Number Two is a compilation of various stunts, pranks and skits, and essentially has no plot. Chris Pontius, Johnny Knoxville, Steve-O, Bam Margera, and the whole crew return to the screen to raise the stakes higher than ever before.', 'Jackass Number Two is a compilation of various stunts, pranks and skits, and essentially has no plot. Chris Pontius, Johnny Knoxville, Steve-O, Bam Margera, and the whole crew return to the screen to raise the stakes higher than ever before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u73V8dMqUwjtPL6gWesCE7ji9GU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12094'),
  ('95833206466215613', 'Jackass Presents: Bad Grandpa', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Lance Bangs, Jeff Tremaine, Dimitry Elyashkevich', 'Spike Jonze, Jeff Tremaine, Johnny Knoxville', 'Johnny Knoxville, Jackson Nicoll, Georgina Cates, Catherine Keener, Spike Jonze, Kamber Hejlik, Grasie Mercedes, Jack Polick', 'R', '86-year-old Irving Zisman is on a journey across America with the most unlikely companion: his 8 year-old grandson, Billy.', '86-year-old Irving Zisman is on a journey across America with the most unlikely companion: his 8 year-old grandson, Billy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dDSMzBEaM0LYSy9Muo0zsCo77Vh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:208134'),
  ('1096586205031173392', 'Jackass Presents: Bad Grandpa .5', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Jeff Tremaine', 'Johnny Knoxville, Jeff Tremaine, Spike Jonze', 'Johnny Knoxville, Spike Jonze, Jackson Nicoll, Catherine Keener, Georgina Cates, Zia Harris, Jeff Tremaine, Trip Taylor', 'PG-13', 'Bad Grandpa .5 gives you a whole new perspective on the world of Irving Zisman with bonus scenes and pranks also featuring Spike Jonze as "Gloria" and Catherine Keener as Irving''s wife "Ellie", plus a look at the evolution of Johnny Knoxville''s naughty alter-ego, the makeup effects, and a behind-the-scenes peek at the idiocy it takes to make a hidden camera movie in public.', 'Bad Grandpa .5 gives you a whole new perspective on the world of Irving Zisman with bonus scenes and pranks also featuring Spike Jonze as "Gloria" and Catherine Keener as Irving''s wife "Ellie", plus a look at the evolution of Johnny Knoxville''s naughty alter-ego, the makeup effects, and a behind-the-scenes peek at the idiocy it takes to make a hidden camera movie in public.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4FBfykfsiFHp3EPlG1rH7S5XwF3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:273641'),
  ('1010464306679602125', 'Jackass Shark Week', 2021, 'Comedy, Action, Documentary, TV Movie', 'Michael Reid', null, 'Johnny Knoxville, Steve-O, Chris Pontius, Sean McInerney, Davon ''Jasper'' Wilson, Craig O''Connell', null, 'Johnny Knoxville sends Steve-O, Chris Pontius, and new Jackass cast members on a Shark Week mission for the ages. They''ll dial up a series of shark stunts that test their bravery and threshold of pain as they put common shark myths to the test.', 'Johnny Knoxville sends Steve-O, Chris Pontius, and new Jackass cast members on a Shark Week mission for the ages. They''ll dial up a series of shark stunts that test their bravery and threshold of pain as they put common shark myths to the test.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fFzp9YEvyUksviwCNWYpa8cJQuj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:849777'),
  ('325778096637471384', 'Jackass: The Movie', 2002, 'Action, Comedy, Documentary', 'Jeff Tremaine, Dimitry Elyashkevich, Lance Acord', 'Bam Margera, Steve-O, Preston Lacy', 'Johnny Knoxville, Bam Margera, Steve-O, Chris Pontius, Ryan Dunn, Jason ''Wee Man'' Acuña, Preston Lacy, Dave England', 'R', 'Johnny Knoxville and his band of maniacs perform a variety of stunts and gross-out gags on the big screen for the first time. They wander around Japan in panda outfits, wreak havoc on a once civilized golf course, they even do stunts involving LIVE alligators, and so on.', 'Johnny Knoxville and his band of maniacs perform a variety of stunts and gross-out gags on the big screen for the first time. They wander around Japan in panda outfits, wreak havoc on a once civilized golf course, they even do stunts involving LIVE alligators, and so on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Rb659hvGfmef1xm0mMvDHEBqmf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9012'),
  ('66540075696938735', 'Jackdaw', 2024, 'Action, Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Will Baldy, Alicia Brockenbrow, La'' Toyah McDonald', 'Jamie Childs', 'Oliver Jackson-Cohen, Jenna Coleman, Thomas Turgoose, Joe Blakemore, Rory McCann, Allan Mustafa, Vivienne Acheampong, Leon Harrop', 'NR', 'A former motocross champion and army veteran, now caring for his younger brother. Broke, he agrees to do an open water pick up of a mysterious illegal package in the North Sea. A resulting double cross and his brother’s disappearance set him and his old bike on a violent nocturnal odyssey through England’s northern rust belt.', 'A former motocross champion and army veteran, now caring for his younger brother. Broke, he agrees to do an open water pick up of a mysterious illegal package in the North Sea. A resulting double cross and his brother’s disappearance set him and his old bike on a violent nocturnal odyssey through England’s northern rust belt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m3OwT2vQ468E6b05pNCcCKY0Q7u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1081680'),
  ('70680408204578056', 'Jackie', 2016, 'Drama', 'Pablo Larraín, Hubert Engammare, Thierry Poulet', 'Noah Oppenheim', 'Natalie Portman, Peter Sarsgaard, Greta Gerwig, Billy Crudup, John Hurt, Richard E. Grant, Caspar Phillipson, Beth Grant', 'R', 'An account of the days of First Lady, Jacqueline Kennedy, in the immediate aftermath of John F. Kennedy''s assassination in 1963.', 'An account of the days of First Lady, Jacqueline Kennedy, in the immediate aftermath of John F. Kennedy''s assassination in 1963.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nF9N33PfhizMEzbfxHoxXBo2vx9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:376866'),
  ('710682748073588601', 'Jackie & Ryan', 2014, 'Drama', 'Ami Canaan Mann, Duane ''DC'' Manwiller, Glen Trotiner', 'Ami Canaan Mann', 'Katherine Heigl, Ben Barnes, Clea DuVall, Sheryl Lee, Emily Alyn Lind, Nathan Stevens, Allan Groves, Ryan Bingham', 'PG-13', 'A modern day train hopper fighting to be a successful musician and a single mom battling to maintain custody of her daughter defy their circumstances by coming together in a relationship that may change each other''s lives forever.', 'A modern day train hopper fighting to be a successful musician and a single mom battling to maintain custody of her daughter defy their circumstances by coming together in a relationship that may change each other''s lives forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wKaYcvfZIMsCCZoHtgMr87MpU4Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:289891'),
  ('445578007591159870', 'Jackie Brown', 1997, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Guillermo Navarro, William Paul Clark, Rick Lange', 'Quentin Tarantino', 'Pam Grier, Samuel L. Jackson, Robert De Niro, Bridget Fonda, Michael Keaton, Robert Forster, Michael Bowen, Chris Tucker', 'R', 'Jackie Brown is a flight attendant who gets caught in the middle of smuggling cash into the country for her gunrunner boss. When the cops try to use Jackie to get to her boss, she hatches a plan — with help from a bail bondsman — to keep the money for herself.', 'Jackie Brown is a flight attendant who gets caught in the middle of smuggling cash into the country for her gunrunner boss. When the cops try to use Jackie to get to her boss, she hatches a plan — with help from a bail bondsman — to keep the money for herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rOUx7qg4KmEh1juEDwqzbDSL1Nr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:184'),
  ('825911027595406224', 'Jackie Chan: Building an Icon', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Antoine Coursat', null, 'Jackie Chan, Marie Borgini, Verena Rendtorff, Sebastian Griegel, Thomas Wenke, Brett Ratner, Bruce Lee, Jaden Smith', null, 'Jackie Chan is a true icon of Asian and Chinese culture. Over a 45-year-long career, he has carved a niche for himself as an actor, stuntman, director, and screenwriter, but also singer and formidable businessman. After starring in almost 200 films, Jackie Chan has reconciled fans of genre film and Hollywood blockbusters, whilst bridging the gap between Asian and Western cinema. Through film excerpts, archive footage and images, and an offbeat approach inspired by the visual codes of the golden age of kung fu films, this documentary will take a look back at the creation of a popular hero who has come to be an icon for China, and for the entire Asian continent.', 'Jackie Chan is a true icon of Asian and Chinese culture. Over a 45-year-long career, he has carved a niche for himself as an actor, stuntman, director, and screenwriter, but also singer and formidable businessman. After starring in almost 200 films, Jackie Chan has reconciled fans of genre film and Hollywood blockbusters, whilst bridging the gap between Asian and Western cinema. Through film excerpts, archive footage and images, and an offbeat approach inspired by the visual codes of the golden age of kung fu films, this documentary will take a look back at the creation of a popular hero who has come to be an icon for China, and for the entire Asian continent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bSSGZLWKWt4RAf68mMgjUMfZIRw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:860578'),
  ('67664220919665131', 'Jackie Chan: My Story', 1998, 'Documentary', 'Jackie Chan', 'Bey Logan, Richard J. Havis', 'Jackie Chan, Charles Chan, Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Willie Chan Chi-Keung, David Akers-Jones, Stanley Tong Gwai-Lai, Michelle Yeoh, Michael Warrington', 'PG-13', 'Jackie Chan is one of the world''s biggest action stars, famed for his wacky sense of humor, remarkable martial arts techniques, and willingness to perform incredible stunts without the use of doubles -- or a net. This video takes a personal look at Chan as he works on screen projects in Hollywood and Beijing and candidly discusses his life and work.', 'Jackie Chan is one of the world''s biggest action stars, famed for his wacky sense of humor, remarkable martial arts techniques, and willingness to perform incredible stunts without the use of doubles -- or a net. This video takes a personal look at Chan as he works on screen projects in Hollywood and Beijing and candidly discusses his life and work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kJnVff7qqEWeRZbILeZLW6fsn62.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46122'),
  ('579739361412767158', 'Jackie Chan: My Stunts', 1999, 'Documentary', 'Jackie Chan, Xavier Lee Pak-Tat, Wong Chi-Keung', 'Bey Logan', 'Jackie Chan, Michael Brown, Tsui Man, Mars, Rocky Lai Keung-Ken, Bradley James Allan, Johnny Cheung Wa, Go Shut-Fung', null, 'Jackie Chan: My Stunts shows some of the tricks of the trade that Jackie and his stunt team utilize to perform their stunts. This is not an endless gag reel of stunts gone wrong, but an in depth look at how timing and camera placement can make or break a shot. Jackie will show you what is done to enhance fights and protect the stuntmen from getting injured. Of course, if the character you are portraying is wearing shorts and a tank top, you just have to get hurt!', 'Jackie Chan: My Stunts shows some of the tricks of the trade that Jackie and his stunt team utilize to perform their stunts. This is not an endless gag reel of stunts gone wrong, but an in depth look at how timing and camera placement can make or break a shot. Jackie will show you what is done to enhance fights and protect the stuntmen from getting injured. Of course, if the character you are portraying is wearing shorts and a tank top, you just have to get hurt!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eLT6kuZ4bQpUaFJ6OKH2YMvaUet.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40863'),
  ('497851475941943805', 'Jackie Fabulous: You Can Leave', 2026, 'Comedy', 'Charlie Fonville, Peter Gordon', 'Jackie Fabulous', 'Jackie Fabulous', 'R', 'Jackie Fabulous brings big, unapologetic energy-spilling hilarious truths about ex-husbands, diet pills, menopause, and what people do that drive you nuts. Charisma, killer timing, and heart make this hour bold, joyous, and very, very fabulous.', 'Jackie Fabulous brings big, unapologetic energy-spilling hilarious truths about ex-husbands, diet pills, menopause, and what people do that drive you nuts. Charisma, killer timing, and heart make this hour bold, joyous, and very, very fabulous.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fpn2IQxVNbTmEjEp12Ia3ErycRv6.jpg', 'plex:movie:jackie-fabulous-you-can-leave'),
  ('598152885859674630', 'Jacknife', 1989, 'Drama, War', 'David Hugh Jones, Brian West', 'Stephen Metcalfe', 'Robert De Niro, Kathy Baker, Ed Harris, Ivar Brogger, Jordan Lund, Charles S. Dutton, Bruce Ramsay, Jessalyn Gilsig', 'R', 'A conflict develops between a troubled Vietnam veteran and the sister he lives with when she becomes involved romantically with the army buddy who reminds him of the tragic battle they both survived.', 'A conflict develops between a troubled Vietnam veteran and the sister he lives with when she becomes involved romantically with the army buddy who reminds him of the tragic battle they both survived.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i3tnWvBTV6d0YOldO3guhpLS8WT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39787'),
  ('1001307239276110052', 'Jackpot', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Sari Lempiäinen, Anu Hukka, Jarkko T. Laine', 'Timo Kahilainen, Heikki Vihinen', 'Heikki Silvennoinen, Timo Kahilainen, Heikki Vihinen, Heikki Hela, Riitta Havukainen, André Wickström, Mari Turunen, Miia Selin', null, 'Kummelin Jackpot, was released in February 2006. It was about a divorced man portrayed by Silvennoinen, who realises a way to trick himself a jackpot in football betting.', 'Kummelin Jackpot, was released in February 2006. It was about a divorced man portrayed by Silvennoinen, who realises a way to trick himself a jackpot in football betting.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mnVn6T3K88tX2WFICHHly6oc34A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78479'),
  ('755308008354940287', 'Jackpot 2', 1982, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Aki Kaurismäki, Pauli Pentti, Mika Kaurismäki', 'Mika Kaurismäki, Aki Kaurismäki', 'Matti Pellonpää, Aki Kaurismäki, Lauri Törhönen, Martti Syrjä, Tiina Bergström, Jukka Mikkola, Anna-Maija Kaurismäki, Anssi Tikanmäki', null, 'Three young people, two boys and a girl, meet on a Friday evening in an urban post-disaster setting which has brought Helsinki to ruins. The boys'' sole purpose of life is to play a Flip-Flop pinball machine.', 'Three young people, two boys and a girl, meet on a Friday evening in an urban post-disaster setting which has brought Helsinki to ruins. The boys'' sole purpose of life is to play a Flip-Flop pinball machine.', null, 'tmdb:movie:223613'),
  ('888088296940860666', 'Jackpot Island - Kumanthong Returns', 2022, 'Thriller, Action, Drama, Horror', 'Lê Bình Giang', null, 'Trần Nghĩa, Trần Tiểu Vy, Trần Phong, Minh Dự, Phương Lan, Tân Trề, Lê Huỳnh, Hoàng Yến Chibi', null, 'The "Jackpot Island - Kumanthong Returns" continues to spread obsession and doubts about one of Southeast Asia''s most terrifying divinities. Who is really hiding behind the evil, monstrous face and holding terrifying secrets? What does a deadly island and the terrifyingly mysterious appearance of monstrous mermaids have to do with this brutal and terrifying spell?', 'The "Jackpot Island - Kumanthong Returns" continues to spread obsession and doubts about one of Southeast Asia''s most terrifying divinities. Who is really hiding behind the evil, monstrous face and holding terrifying secrets? What does a deadly island and the terrifyingly mysterious appearance of monstrous mermaids have to do with this brutal and terrifying spell?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qUplOg6PMzEOOvT77YcFHOituxZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1013665'),
  ('396070255468079988', 'Jackpot!', 2024, 'Comedy, Action', 'Paul Feig, John Schwartzman, James Young', 'Rob Yescombe', 'Awkwafina, John Cena, Simu Liu, Ayden Mayeri, Donald Watkins, Sam Asghari, mgk, Seann William Scott', 'R', 'In the near future, a ''Grand Lottery'' has been established - the catch: kill the winner before sundown to legally claim their multi-billion dollar jackpot. When Katie Kim mistakenly finds herself with the winning ticket, she reluctantly joins forces with amateur lottery protection agent Noel Cassidy who must get her to sundown in exchange for a piece of her prize.', 'In the near future, a ''Grand Lottery'' has been established - the catch: kill the winner before sundown to legally claim their multi-billion dollar jackpot. When Katie Kim mistakenly finds herself with the winning ticket, she reluctantly joins forces with amateur lottery protection agent Noel Cassidy who must get her to sundown in exchange for a piece of her prize.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7vv0NTaQGOO7M5ZMerp1vMFJsby.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1094138'),
  ('428716933706152384', 'Jackson County Jail', 1976, 'Crime, Drama', 'Michael Miller, Bruce Logan, Gary Dorf', 'Donald E. Stewart', 'Yvette Mimieux, Tommy Lee Jones, Robert Carradine, Howard Hesseman, Betty Thomas, Hal Needham, Mary Woronov, Severn Darden', 'R', 'A young woman stumbles into a nightmare land of hijacking and humiliation while driving cross-country from California to New York.', 'A young woman stumbles into a nightmare land of hijacking and humiliation while driving cross-country from California to New York.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6oFezms8XgNvVdAWEB3abBpu6TP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21950'),
  ('185161444060740180', 'Jacky in the Kingdom of Women', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Riad Sattouf', 'Riad Sattouf', 'Vincent Lacoste, Charlotte Gainsbourg, Didier Bourdon, Anémone, Valérie Bonneton, Michel Hazanavicius, Noémie Lvovsky, Laure Marsac', null, 'In a country where women are in charge, a man goes to unusual lengths to make his dream of marrying the daughter of a military leader come true.', 'In a country where women are in charge, a man goes to unusual lengths to make his dream of marrying the daughter of a military leader come true.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nEXMIWgRIFDZVFl7fFHooQBBBdu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:223954'),
  ('451819245495020020', 'Jacob', 1994, 'Adventure, Drama, TV Movie', 'Peter Hall, Ennio Guarnieri', 'Lionel Chetwynd', 'Matthew Modine, Lara Flynn Boyle, Sean Bean, Joss Ackland, Juliet Aubrey, Irene Papas, Giancarlo Giannini, Christoph Waltz', 'PG', 'Isaac''s son Jacob deprives his brother Esau of his birthright and has to flee for his life. He finds shelter with his uncle Laban, but is himself deceived. Finally, Jacob has to face both his uncle and brother.', 'Isaac''s son Jacob deprives his brother Esau of his birthright and has to flee for his life. He finds shelter with his uncle Laban, but is himself deceived. Finally, Jacob has to face both his uncle and brother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bmwFf3fMgBKqtiST5sQ7wapeLFB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2712'),
  ('189276075868038129', 'Jacob the Liar', 1974, 'History, Drama, Comedy', 'Frank Beyer, Günter Marczinkowsky', 'Frank Beyer, Jurek Becker', 'Vlastimil Brodský, Erwin Geschonneck, Henry Hübchen, Blanche Kommerell, Manuela Simon, Zsuzsa Gordon, Armin Mueller-Stahl, Friedrich Richter', null, 'A Jewish ghetto in the east of Europe, 1944. By coincidence, Jakob Heym eavesdrops on a German radio broadcast announcing the Soviet Army is making slow by steady progress towards central Europe. In order to keep his companion in misfortune, Mischa, from risking his life for a few potatoes, he tells him what he heard and announces that he is in possession of a radio - in the ghetto a crime punishable by death. It doesn''t take long for word of Jakob''s secret to spread - suddenly, there is new hope and something to live for - and so Jakob finds himself in the uncomforting position of having to come up with more and more stories.', 'A Jewish ghetto in the east of Europe, 1944. By coincidence, Jakob Heym eavesdrops on a German radio broadcast announcing the Soviet Army is making slow by steady progress towards central Europe. In order to keep his companion in misfortune, Mischa, from risking his life for a few potatoes, he tells him what he heard and announces that he is in possession of a radio - in the ghetto a crime punishable by death. It doesn''t take long for word of Jakob''s secret to spread - suddenly, there is new hope and something to live for - and so Jakob finds himself in the uncomforting position of having to come up with more and more stories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mT4DFHyanpXb3Ykd8M1Z9auyegL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2200'),
  ('608247363740963149', 'Jacob''s Ladder', 1990, 'Drama, Mystery, Horror', 'Adrian Lyne, Jeffrey L. Kimball, Joseph P. Reidy', 'Bruce Joel Rubin', 'Tim Robbins, Elizabeth Peña, Danny Aiello, Matt Craven, Pruitt Taylor Vince, Jason Alexander, Patricia Kalember, Eriq La Salle', 'R', 'After returning home from the Vietnam War, veteran Jacob Singer struggles to maintain his sanity. Plagued by hallucinations and flashbacks, Singer rapidly falls apart as the world and people around him morph and twist into disturbing images. His girlfriend, Jezzie, and ex-wife, Sarah, try to help, but to little avail. Even Singer''s chiropractor friend, Louis, fails to reach him as he descends into madness.', 'After returning home from the Vietnam War, veteran Jacob Singer struggles to maintain his sanity. Plagued by hallucinations and flashbacks, Singer rapidly falls apart as the world and people around him morph and twist into disturbing images. His girlfriend, Jezzie, and ex-wife, Sarah, try to help, but to little avail. Even Singer''s chiropractor friend, Louis, fails to reach him as he descends into madness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ufLcHIi1aXjjH8MediAMvnwDsVI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2291'),
  ('575977582489916881', 'Jacob''s Ladder', 2019, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'David M. Rosenthal, Pedro Luque, Deanna Brigidi', 'Jeff Buhler, Sarah Thorpe', 'Michael Ealy, Jesse Williams, Nicole Beharie, Guy Burnet, Karla Souza, Kevin L. Johnson, Ninja N. Devoe, Brian Kayode-Patrick Johnson', 'R', 'After losing his brother in combat, Jacob Singer returns home from Afghanistan -- only to be pulled into a mind-twisting state of paranoia. Singer soon realizes that his sibling is alive but life is not what it seems.', 'After losing his brother in combat, Jacob Singer returns home from Afghanistan -- only to be pulled into a mind-twisting state of paranoia. Singer soon realizes that his sibling is alive but life is not what it seems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wIlmYRxrIVBo90ITVBCCbTqUZE3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:456529'),
  ('585893431321037094', 'Jacqueline Sauvage: It Was Him or Me', 2018, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Kika Ungaro, Yves Rénier', 'Marie Deshaires, Catherine Touzet', 'Muriel Robin, Olivier Marchal, Alix Poisson, Armelle Deutsch, Samantha Rénier, Erika Sainte, Laura Sépul, Anissa Allali', null, 'On Monday, September 10, 2012, Jacqueline Sauvage shot her husband the back three times. She then learned that their son had just committed suicide. And so the most publicized trial in recent years commenced.', 'On Monday, September 10, 2012, Jacqueline Sauvage shot her husband the back three times. She then learned that their son had just committed suicide. And so the most publicized trial in recent years commenced.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x3b8l1D3ctjzIeIAa1XrpbiHsmU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:547691'),
