  ('341310201266160135', 'Jacquou the Rebel', 2007, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Laurent Boutonnat, Oliver Cocaul', null, 'Gaspard Ulliel, Marie-Josée Croze, Albert Dupontel, Jocelyn Quivrin, Olivier Gourmet, Judith Davis, Affif Ben Badra, Tchéky Karyo', null, 'In 1815, young Jacquou lives an idyllic peasant life with his parents in the Périgord region of France. But one day, his childhood happiness is cruelly ended when his father is arrested, after a dispute with the arrogant Count de Nansac. With both his parents dead, Jacquou is adopted by Bonal, a kind priest, under whose influence he grows into an assured, morally upright young man. Now an adult, Jacquou has one desire. To repay the Count de Nansac for the evil he once inflicted on his parents...', 'In 1815, young Jacquou lives an idyllic peasant life with his parents in the Périgord region of France. But one day, his childhood happiness is cruelly ended when his father is arrested, after a dispute with the arrogant Count de Nansac. With both his parents dead, Jacquou is adopted by Bonal, a kind priest, under whose influence he grows into an assured, morally upright young man. Now an adult, Jacquou has one desire. To repay the Count de Nansac for the evil he once inflicted on his parents...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jVLkOarUiKvFSLGSTQYGkdpwN2j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17227'),
  ('603705241649969850', 'Jade', 1995, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Andrzej Bartkowiak, William Friedkin, James J. Murakami', 'Joe Eszterhas', 'David Caruso, Linda Fiorentino, Chazz Palminteri, Richard Crenna, Michael Biehn, Donna Murphy, Ken King, Holt McCallany', 'R', 'When a prominent art dealer is found murdered, the man''s death leads to an intriguing investigation steeped in sex, corruption and crime. District Attorney David Corelli gets assigned to the case and discovers that a key suspect is his ex-lover Katrina Gavin, a beautiful psychologist who has settled down with his old friend and peer. As Corelli gets deeper into the case, he uncovers dark secrets with far-reaching implications.', 'When a prominent art dealer is found murdered, the man''s death leads to an intriguing investigation steeped in sex, corruption and crime. District Attorney David Corelli gets assigned to the case and discovers that a key suspect is his ex-lover Katrina Gavin, a beautiful psychologist who has settled down with his old friend and peer. As Corelli gets deeper into the case, he uncovers dark secrets with far-reaching implications.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8KWiZKDYpAgh8n27lanvTuDquyX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11863'),
  ('499876076883028788', 'Jade', 2024, 'Action, Thriller', 'James Bamford, Brett Juskalian', 'Lynn Colliar, Glenn Ennis, James Bamford', 'Shaina West, Mickey Rourke, Katherine McNamara, Mark Dacascos, Marcus Aurelio, Marcus Vincios Maciel, Chris Bruno, Sean McNabb', null, 'Jade presents the story of a woman who comes between a powerful businessman and a gang leader in their search for a hard drive that could damage the operations of Interpol. Despite grieving for the brother she accidentally killed, the woman is required to use her unique set of skills to retrieve the drive and protect her brother''s unborn child being carried by another woman.', 'Jade presents the story of a woman who comes between a powerful businessman and a gang leader in their search for a hard drive that could damage the operations of Interpol. Despite grieving for the brother she accidentally killed, the woman is required to use her unique set of skills to retrieve the drive and protect her brother''s unborn child being carried by another woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vNEdHgeTFDdK0plI9LTEOMeVveA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:849509'),
  ('119872883963117180', 'Jade Dynasty', 2019, 'Drama, Romance, Fantasy', 'Tony Ching Siu-Tung, William Chan Wai-Lin, Xiong Xinxin', 'Song Chaoyun, Shen Jie', 'Xiao Zhan, Li Qin, Meng Meiqi, Tang Yixin, Li Xi, Xie Chen, He Zhengting, Zhang Zhikun', null, 'After the massacre of his village, Zhang Xiaofan is taken in by the Qing Yun Sect where he begins his journey of cultivation. When he finds out the truth behind the deaths of his parents, he succumbs to his rage and demonic tendencies and becomes the enemy of Qing Yun Sect.', 'After the massacre of his village, Zhang Xiaofan is taken in by the Qing Yun Sect where he begins his journey of cultivation. When he finds out the truth behind the deaths of his parents, he succumbs to his rage and demonic tendencies and becomes the enemy of Qing Yun Sect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vrlopXfgDRQofFxAedvJba2XcQK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:578906'),
