  ('361929367300717633', 'Jailbird', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Andrea Magnani, Yaroslav Pilunskyi, Denis Halyapin', 'Andrea Magnani, Chiara Barbo, Nicos Panayotopoulos', 'Adriano Tardiolo, Giovanni Calcagno, Nina Naboka, Aylin Prandi, Gianluca Gobbi, Maksim Kostyunin, Orest Syrvatka, Stefano Cassetti', null, 'As the son of two inmates Hyacinth was always more at home in prison than in the outside world, until he took part in a foot race that promised to change his life.', 'As the son of two inmates Hyacinth was always more at home in prison than in the outside world, until he took part in a foot race that promised to change his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bs4t919wSEakghynTgxZwYBgpjw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1053024'),
  ('1007638283859979283', 'Jailbirds', 2016, 'Drama', 'Audrey Estrougo, Guillaume Schiffman', 'Audrey Estrougo, Agnès Caffin', 'Sophie Marceau, Suzanne Clément, Anne Le Ny, Alice Belaïdi, Eye Haïdara, Pauline Burlet, Nailia Harzoune, Aurore Broutin', null, 'In order to save the man she loves from jail, Mathilde takes his place by helping his break-out. While she exclusively relies on him to survive in this prison setting, Mathilde has not heard from him since her imprisonment. Isolated, with her son as her only support, she is now identified by the inmate number 383205-B. Will Mathilde become a convict like any other one?', 'In order to save the man she loves from jail, Mathilde takes his place by helping his break-out. While she exclusively relies on him to survive in this prison setting, Mathilde has not heard from him since her imprisonment. Isolated, with her son as her only support, she is now identified by the inmate number 383205-B. Will Mathilde become a convict like any other one?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1S1elJLqHvrLcvkrXtp8IJ3vF4H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:402910'),
