  ('241919169847069858', 'Jailbreak Affair', 2024, null, 'Ham Seo-yong', null, 'Lee Chae-dam, Jin Seo-yool, Son Ye-ha, Lee Ye-jin, Min Do-yoon', null, 'How do inmates in a correctional facility satisfy their sexual desires? A full-fledged confined-space erotic story depicting the precarious prison life of prison guards and inmates involved in sex penpals begins!', 'How do inmates in a correctional facility satisfy their sexual desires? A full-fledged confined-space erotic story depicting the precarious prison life of prison guards and inmates involved in sex penpals begins!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tXQTZ5JUrPS82zEzcxti6zf2y7b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1315905'),
  ('1067045121886502291', 'Jailbreak: Love on the Run', 2024, 'Crime, Documentary', 'Thorsten Thielow, Dan Abrams', null, 'Vicky White, Casey White, Robin Roberts, Duane ''Dog'' Chapman, Joy Behar', 'R', 'An Alabama corrections officer falls in love with a man awaiting trial for murder and risks it all to help him escape.', 'An Alabama corrections officer falls in love with a man awaiting trial for murder and risks it all to help him escape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uj9fjmDSBH56cz2VL49caIso0iq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1341685'),
  ('1150812162417635215', 'Jailer', 2023, 'Action, Crime, Thriller, Comedy, Adventure', 'Nelson Dilipkumar, Vijay Kartik Kannan', 'Nelson Dilipkumar', 'Rajinikanth, Vinayakan, Vasanth Ravi, Yogi Babu, Ramya Krishnan, Mirnaa, Rithvik, G. Marimuthu', 'NR', 'Muthuvel Pandian, a retired, stern yet compassionate jailer lives a peaceful life with his family, but trouble knocks his door when his cop son’s tryst with an antique mafia gang goes awry and forces Muthu to step back into a dark world he had voluntarily took a break from.', 'Muthuvel Pandian, a retired, stern yet compassionate jailer lives a peaceful life with his family, but trouble knocks his door when his cop son’s tryst with an antique mafia gang goes awry and forces Muthu to step back into a dark world he had voluntarily took a break from.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pTmMxAHqX4vsIDE6HPPxOR0Q6TN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:937020'),
  ('270872362225495668', 'Jailhouse Rock', 1957, 'Music, Drama', 'Richard Thorpe, Hank Moonjean, Robert J. Bronner', 'Guy Trosper', 'Elvis Presley, Judy Tyler, Mickey Shaughnessy, Vaughn Taylor, Jennifer Holden, Dean Jones, Anne Neyland, Percy Helton', 'NR', 'After serving time for manslaughter, young Vince Everett becomes a teenage rock star.', 'After serving time for manslaughter, young Vince Everett becomes a teenage rock star.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iSlddodPAnPuRPr7Cc8AYvaNHSR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15697'),
  ('1083571443473494445', 'Jailhouse Wardress', 1981, 'Drama', 'Alain Deruelle, Jesús Franco, Alain Payet', 'Alain Deruelle', 'Didier Aubriot, Eugénie Laborde, Michael Bates, Monica Swinn, Bob Asklöf, Maria Cavour, Michel Charrel, Ronald Curram', null, 'After the fall of the Third Reich, all Nazi SS officers ran away in Latin American countries. There they created special laboratories to crate beautiful women for satisfaction of their guards'' sexual desires. The main warden in this prison is a cruel woman. Their main plan is to revenge for defeat of Nazi''s Germany.', 'After the fall of the Third Reich, all Nazi SS officers ran away in Latin American countries. There they created special laboratories to crate beautiful women for satisfaction of their guards'' sexual desires. The main warden in this prison is a cruel woman. Their main plan is to revenge for defeat of Nazi''s Germany.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nfK70T7B57Vgkl7reWLrtv53HLM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29532'),
  ('407454971416787585', 'Jaime', 1974, 'Documentary', 'Acácio de Almeida, António Reis, Margarida Cordeiro', null, 'Jaime Fernandes, Evangelina Gil Delgado', null, 'Jaime, a poem of suffering and loneliness, describes the existence and pictorial work of a man isolated in a psychiatric hospital.', 'Jaime, a poem of suffering and loneliness, describes the existence and pictorial work of a man isolated in a psychiatric hospital.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dq8UYNPwEbBBL5drXuqFWL6K9Qn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:243259'),
  ('435390332030880460', 'Jaime', 1999, 'Drama', 'António-Pedro Vasconcelos, Edgar Moura, Carlos Assis', 'Carlos Saboga, António-Pedro Vasconcelos', 'Saúl Fonseca, Fernanda Serrano, Joaquim Leitão, Sandro Silva, Vítor Norte, Guilherme Leme, Nicolau Breyner, Rogério Samora', null, 'A woman takes her young son, leaves her husband and moves in with her lover. The boy, desperate to get his parents back together, becomes convinced that if only he can get his father''s stolen motorcycle back everything will be fine again, so he sets out to get enough money to buy his father a new one.', 'A woman takes her young son, leaves her husband and moves in with her lover. The boy, desperate to get his parents back together, becomes convinced that if only he can get his father''s stolen motorcycle back everything will be fine again, so he sets out to get enough money to buy his father a new one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jDpnyAD1p3r6reGRgtSBnzlyKKB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109192'),
  ('763804208738983989', 'Jaime', 2022, 'Drama', 'Francisco Javier Rodriguez, Francisco Javier Rodriguez', 'Francisco Javier Rodriguez', 'Guy Dessent, Lot Lemm, David Delaloy, Jaime Saldaña, Lorena Urra', null, 'Jaime is the portrait of a young man affected by a mental disorder in which his mind perceives reality in a distorted way. In this fascinating and provoking medium length film, director Francisco Javier Rodriguez questions our idea of reality, creating a subtle game in which fact and fiction merge. Touching yet unsettling, this film interrogates what we consider to be “the norm”.', 'Jaime is the portrait of a young man affected by a mental disorder in which his mind perceives reality in a distorted way. In this fascinating and provoking medium length film, director Francisco Javier Rodriguez questions our idea of reality, creating a subtle game in which fact and fiction merge. Touching yet unsettling, this film interrogates what we consider to be “the norm”.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gz3Zc22S1faQ80gsEUI5QgNFTI0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:951298'),
  ('131630107046458517', 'Jajantaram Mamantaram', 2003, 'Family, Fantasy', 'Soumitra Ranade', 'Soumitra Ranade', 'Javed Jaffrey, Gulshan Grover, Joy Fernandes, Nishith Dadhich, Manav Kaul, Dipannita Sharma, Madhura Velankar', null, 'A young man lands in the land of little people, who ask him to save them from their enemies.', 'A young man lands in the land of little people, who ask him to save them from their enemies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sN7WWCY8fKLEIl2oKUiX30gJfwL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:348152'),
  ('736617137585794326', 'Jake Speed', 1986, 'Action, Comedy, Thriller', 'Andrew Lane, Bryan Loftus, Stephen Chigorimbo', 'Andrew Lane, Wayne Crawford', 'Wayne Crawford, Karen Kopins, Dennis Christopher, John Hurt, Leon Ames, Roy London, Donna Pescow, Barry Primus', 'PG', 'Jake Speed (Wayne Crawford) is the lead character in some of the biggest page-turners of the 1940s. A chiseled, heroic action figure, Speed saves lives on paper, but when a young girl is kidnapped and her sister (Karen Kopins) begs the real-life Speed for help, he must find a way to be as gallant as the book hero whose creation he''s inspired. Accompanied by the victim''s sibling, Speed flies to Africa to see if he''s up to the task.', 'Jake Speed (Wayne Crawford) is the lead character in some of the biggest page-turners of the 1940s. A chiseled, heroic action figure, Speed saves lives on paper, but when a young girl is kidnapped and her sister (Karen Kopins) begs the real-life Speed for help, he must find a way to be as gallant as the book hero whose creation he''s inspired. Accompanied by the victim''s sibling, Speed flies to Africa to see if he''s up to the task.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9zlGxL1aBYH0bqQQ1CmoBiiZNBg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71141'),
  ('76173353737079811', 'Jakob the Liar', 1999, 'Comedy, Drama, History', 'Elemér Ragályi, Peter Kassovitz', 'Didier Decoin, Peter Kassovitz', 'Robin Williams, Liev Schreiber, Hannah Taylor-Gordon, Alan Arkin, Michael Jeter, Bob Balaban, Armin Mueller-Stahl, Éva Igó', 'PG-13', 'In 1944 Poland, a Jewish shop keeper named Jakob is summoned to ghetto headquarters after being caught out after curfew. While waiting for the German Kommondant, Jakob overhears a German radio broadcast about Russian troop movements. Returned to the ghetto, the shopkeeper shares his information with a friend and then rumors fly that there is a secret radio within the ghetto.', 'In 1944 Poland, a Jewish shop keeper named Jakob is summoned to ghetto headquarters after being caught out after curfew. While waiting for the German Kommondant, Jakob overhears a German radio broadcast about Russian troop movements. Returned to the ghetto, the shopkeeper shares his information with a friend and then rumors fly that there is a secret radio within the ghetto.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vvwsvPyQFuQbKKfzNgoRhAcL5ml.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2290'),
  ('716821271876317965', 'Jakob''s Wife', 2021, 'Horror, Thriller, Fantasy', 'David Matthews, Travis Stevens', 'Travis Stevens, Kathy Charles, Mark Steenland', 'Barbara Crampton, Larry Fessenden, Bonnie Aarons, Nyisha Bell, Sarah Lind, Mark Kelly, Robert Rusler, Jay DeVon Johnson', 'NR', 'After a chance encounter with "The Master", Anne discovers bite marks on her neck, a new sense of power, and an appetite to live bigger and bolder than ever.', 'After a chance encounter with "The Master", Anne discovers bite marks on her neck, a new sense of power, and an appetite to live bigger and bolder than ever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hsOSdY9ALwBLP41c6tAF5UXkpc0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:786110'),
  ('109186036917694241', 'Jalan Pulang', 2025, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Jeropoint, Mandela Majid, Ihsan Achdiat', 'Kelanara Studio', 'Luna Maya, Shareefa Daanish, Taskya Namya, Saskia Chadwick, Teuku Rifnu Wikana, Widika Sidmore, Sujiwo Tejo, Kiki Narendra', null, 'After her husband''s mysterious death, Lastini believes a dark entity is possessing her daughter, Arum. With only five days before Arum''s leap-year birthday, Lastini and her two other children journey across Java to seek help from spiritual healers. As the demon''s grip tightens, they race against time to save Arum and find their way back home.', 'After her husband''s mysterious death, Lastini believes a dark entity is possessing her daughter, Arum. With only five days before Arum''s leap-year birthday, Lastini and her two other children journey across Java to seek help from spiritual healers. As the demon''s grip tightens, they race against time to save Arum and find their way back home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8cCA4pKow6wxuwbpSAgIC2K7AGg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1422294'),
  ('92073960543882204', 'Jalebi', 2018, 'Drama, Romance', 'Swastik Karnatki, Pradipta De, Pushpdeep Bhardwaj', null, 'Rhea Chakraborty, Varun Mitra, Digangana Suryavanshi, Praveena Deshpande, Aanya Dureja, Arya Poorti, Arjun Kanungo, Sumanth', null, 'An estranged couple happen to meet on a train journey where they independently reflect on what went wrong in their relationship and whether they will truly be able to move forward and start a new chapter, together or alone.', 'An estranged couple happen to meet on a train journey where they independently reflect on what went wrong in their relationship and whether they will truly be able to move forward and start a new chapter, together or alone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pIJYLvMMWTsEpNFVxU6YwTzdOzL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:547865'),
  ('1112702963505984521', 'Jallikattu', 2019, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Lijo Jose Pellissery, Tinu Pappachan, Girish Gangadharan', 'R. Jayakumar, S. Hareesh', 'Antony Varghese, Chemban Vinod Jose, Sabumon Abdusamad, Santhy Balachandran, Jaffer Idukki, Vinod Kozhikode, Tinu Pappachan, Jayashankar', null, 'An escaped buffalo triggers a frenzy of ecstatic violence in a remote village.', 'An escaped buffalo triggers a frenzy of ecstatic violence in a remote village.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8pEsTp9bS6yjr9P9K43vPP8mw1v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:564704'),
  ('156935442967962697', 'Jalsa', 2022, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Suresh Triveni, Saurabh Goswami, Shrushti Kashyap', 'Suresh Triveni, Prajwal Chandrashekhar', 'Vidya Balan, Shefali Shah, Rohini Hattangadi, Vidhatri Bandi, Manav Kaul, Vijay Nikam, Mohammed Iqbal Khan, Surya Kasibhatla', null, 'A hit and run of an 18-year-old girl becomes the hub of a wheel that sets into motion many a spoke - a journalist, a raging mother, a cop and a system all caught in an ethical dilemma. Questions are raised only to realize that the truth is rarely pure and never simple.', 'A hit and run of an 18-year-old girl becomes the hub of a wheel that sets into motion many a spoke - a journalist, a raging mother, a cop and a system all caught in an ethical dilemma. Questions are raised only to realize that the truth is rarely pure and never simple.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h7lazOfbemCtX7ZZYnqmZx4IHxD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:944410'),
  ('708184756913067324', 'Jam Films', 2002, 'Comedy, Drama, Fantasy', 'Daizaburo Hanada, George Iida, Ryuhei Kitamura', 'George Iida, Shunji Iwai, Rokurō Mochizuki', 'Natsuko Akiyama, Hirofumi Arai, Haruka Ayase, Hirosue Ryoko, Satomi Ishihara, Kazuki Kitamura, Hitomi Kurihara, Akaji Maro', null, 'Jam Films is a 2002 suite of 7 shorts produced by Sega/Amuse.', 'Jam Films is a 2002 suite of 7 shorts produced by Sega/Amuse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aDdA0Ib7Steo1KahEQsa5Hv3mXp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115580'),
  ('391511725328415805', 'Jam Films S', 2004, 'Comedy', 'Masakazu Abe, Ryuichi Takatsu, Ryo Tejima', null, 'Koyuki, Satomi Ishihara, Ren Osugi, Haruka Ayase, Zeebra, Kenichi Endo, Mari Hamada, Naohito Fujiki', null, 'Jam Films S is a Japanese omnibus movie. It was released by Phantom FIlm in Japan on January 15, 2005. The movie follows 2002’s Jam Films and its 2004 sequel Jam Films 2. This time around, the overall theme is “S” which stands for succession, success, and special. There are seven shorts, all produced by Ryuhei Kitamura. Included are the shorts Tuesday by Kenji Sonoda, Heaven Sent by Ryuichi Takatsu, Blouse by Hitoshi Ishikawa, New Horizon by Ryo Teshima, Suberidai by Yuichi Abe, Alpha by Daisaburo Harada, and Suit by Masaki Hamamoto.', 'Jam Films S is a Japanese omnibus movie. It was released by Phantom FIlm in Japan on January 15, 2005. The movie follows 2002’s Jam Films and its 2004 sequel Jam Films 2. This time around, the overall theme is “S” which stands for succession, success, and special. There are seven shorts, all produced by Ryuhei Kitamura. Included are the shorts Tuesday by Kenji Sonoda, Heaven Sent by Ryuichi Takatsu, Blouse by Hitoshi Ishikawa, New Horizon by Ryo Teshima, Suberidai by Yuichi Abe, Alpha by Daisaburo Harada, and Suit by Masaki Hamamoto.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e4ghrPEec5P0GK8RZv4CZquQVhT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:377238'),
