  ('662539596978803007', 'Jamaica Inn', 1939, 'Crime, Adventure, Thriller', 'Alfred Hitchcock, Harry Stradling Sr., Bernard Knowles', 'Sidney Gilliat, Joan Harrison', 'Charles Laughton, Maureen O''Hara, Robert Newton, Leslie Banks, Marie Ney, Horace Hodges, Emlyn Williams, Wylie Watson', 'NR', 'In early 19th-century Cornwall, young Mary Yellan travels to live with her aunt and uncle at the remote Jamaica Inn, where she discovers the inn is a front for a violent gang of wreckers who lure ships to their doom along the coast. As she becomes entangled in their crimes, Mary must fight to survive and uncover the truth behind the terror that haunts the moors.', 'In early 19th-century Cornwall, young Mary Yellan travels to live with her aunt and uncle at the remote Jamaica Inn, where she discovers the inn is a front for a violent gang of wreckers who lure ships to their doom along the coast. As she becomes entangled in their crimes, Mary must fight to survive and uncover the truth behind the terror that haunts the moors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qgeBF25h9MYoxJmKvlUj60IGDNz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31995'),
  ('899529964325877850', 'Jamais sans toi, Louna', 2019, 'Drama, Crime, TV Movie', 'Yann Samuell', 'Yann Samuell', 'Alice Taglioni, Rod Paradot, Chloé Jouannet, Sophie Guillemin, Serge Hazanavicius, Inna Modja, François Feroleto, Elsa Houben', null, 'Adapted from Never Again Without You, Louna by the spouses Sabrina and Yoan Bombarde. Sabrina and Yann are deprived of custody of their baby for abuse. The couple did not stop talking about an inherited orphan disease, the social authorities seem deaf. In preparation for their trial, a judge mandates a child psychiatrist to trace the thread of the case .', 'Adapted from Never Again Without You, Louna by the spouses Sabrina and Yoan Bombarde. Sabrina and Yann are deprived of custody of their baby for abuse. The couple did not stop talking about an inherited orphan disease, the social authorities seem deaf. In preparation for their trial, a judge mandates a child psychiatrist to trace the thread of the case .', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2A4tc8jVKqUyvMnBasqpFMd47gU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:627429'),
  ('944488737341243850', 'Jambalakidi Pamba', 1993, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'V Srinivasa Reddy, E.V.V. Satyanarayana', 'E.V.V. Satyanarayana', 'Naresh, Aamani, Brahmanandam, Kota Srinivasa Rao, Babu Mohan, Jayalalita, Jayaprakash Reddy, Mallikarjuna Rao', null, 'Fed up of a male-dominated society, a woman approaches a yogini who has prepared a herb that will make men behave like women. After a series of bizarre incidents, a police officer investigates.', 'Fed up of a male-dominated society, a woman approaches a yogini who has prepared a herb that will make men behave like women. After a series of bizarre incidents, a police officer investigates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tqmyfoSEOtxXHK9Hu2oxYr1sf0z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:403399'),
  ('1121587948303882873', 'Jambon d''Ardenne', 1977, 'Comedy', 'Benoît Lamy', 'Benoît Lamy, Rudolph Pauli', 'Annie Girardot, Christian Barbier, Ann Petersen, Dominique Drouot, Nathalie van de Walle, André Vercammen, Bonbon, William van den Daele', null, 'During the height of the tourist season, the rivalry between the manager of a slightly fancy restaurant and the proprietor of a nearby fast-food stand becomes quite heated, and shots are fired. In this comedy, the restaurant is run with an iron hand by its "patronne," and the help eventually have had enough. If that weren''t sufficient trouble, the children of the owners of both establishments are romantically entangled, further infuriating the passions of the feuding food fanatics.', 'During the height of the tourist season, the rivalry between the manager of a slightly fancy restaurant and the proprietor of a nearby fast-food stand becomes quite heated, and shots are fired. In this comedy, the restaurant is run with an iron hand by its "patronne," and the help eventually have had enough. If that weren''t sufficient trouble, the children of the owners of both establishments are romantically entangled, further infuriating the passions of the feuding food fanatics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hcFro03JV7hG0i5ROOn1Jnzo259.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:264426'),
  ('576003220398988501', 'Jamel et ses amis au Marrakech du rire 2012', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Jamel Debbouze, Karim Debbouze, Richard Valverde', 'Habib Kadi, Jamel Debbouze, Ahmed Hamidi', 'Jamel Debbouze, Redouanne Harjane, Stromae, Fatsah Bouyahmed, Jérôme Commandeur, Tony Saint-Laurent, Gad Elmaleh, François-Xavier Demaison', null, 'Marrakech du Rire is an annual international festival of humor that has been held since 2011 in Marrakech, Morocco. Created by comedian Jamel Debbouze, it has been broadcast every year since its creation on the French TV channel M6.', 'Marrakech du Rire is an annual international festival of humor that has been held since 2011 in Marrakech, Morocco. Created by comedian Jamel Debbouze, it has been broadcast every year since its creation on the French TV channel M6.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mfCnFi5c24m3usIx2wQIvz716TW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:122169'),
  ('783401101298936390', 'Jamel et ses amis au Marrakech du rire 2015', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Richard Valverde, Jamel Debbouze', null, 'Jamel Debbouze, Élie Semoun, Franck Dubosc, Anthony Kavanagh, Fatsah Bouyahmed, Michaël Grégorio, Gad Elmaleh, Nawell Madani', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s6svPhNIitzbbvUGQ6eAe3tpGhJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:347355'),
