  ('800024341580377003', 'Jamel et ses amis au Marrakech du rire 2022 : 10 ans', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Richard Valverde, Jean-Philippe Bourdon', 'Jamel Debbouze, Khaled Amara, Mohamed Hamidi', 'Jamel Debbouze, Michaël Youn, Jarry, Jeff Panacloc, Kad Merad, Camille Lellouche, Caroline Vigneaux, Booder', null, 'The Marrakech du Rire is back in 2022 for its tenth edition, an opportunity to celebrate 10 years of laughter, madness, and outrageous sketches at the Badii Palace. To celebrate this anniversary, Jamel is offering an exceptional gala with even more surprises and extravagance, a transformed stage, and the participation of numerous guests and talents.', 'The Marrakech du Rire is back in 2022 for its tenth edition, an opportunity to celebrate 10 years of laughter, madness, and outrageous sketches at the Badii Palace. To celebrate this anniversary, Jamel is offering an exceptional gala with even more surprises and extravagance, a transformed stage, and the participation of numerous guests and talents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eF7iURfShtgEkR8c5LOf4c6ddGg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1001951'),
  ('690754504115784737', 'James Acaster: Cold Lasagne Hate Myself 1999', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Anton McCrae, Daniel Lucchesi', 'James Acaster', 'James Acaster', null, 'On December 17th 2019, I, James Acaster, filmed my 2019 tour show Cold Lasagne Hate Myself 1999 at EartH in Hackney. It was a show about the best year of my life (1999) and the worst year of my life (2017), I wore a very nifty jacket for it and I looked extremely cool.', 'On December 17th 2019, I, James Acaster, filmed my 2019 tour show Cold Lasagne Hate Myself 1999 at EartH in Hackney. It was a show about the best year of my life (1999) and the worst year of my life (2017), I wore a very nifty jacket for it and I looked extremely cool.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dzRahuPe6GlM9gKtRUQ33oCsjgH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:763274'),
  ('115661981662036480', 'James Acaster: Hecklers Welcome', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Stuart Laws, Anton McCrae', 'James Acaster', 'James Acaster, Stuart Laws', 'R', 'James Acaster explores his love/hate relationship with standup by relinquishing control of his set and accepting a healthy dose of audience interference – AKA heckling. With his wiry observational eye and incomparable wit, Acaster shares hilarious on-the-fly meta-analysis of his own material, along with stories from his childhood that spurred him to pursue a career in comedy.', 'James Acaster explores his love/hate relationship with standup by relinquishing control of his set and accepting a healthy dose of audience interference – AKA heckling. With his wiry observational eye and incomparable wit, Acaster shares hilarious on-the-fly meta-analysis of his own material, along with stories from his childhood that spurred him to pursue a career in comedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cBVE7JVzEvegJs2JDd1BdoqdBSS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1386881'),
  ('471556334702981866', 'James and the Giant Peach', 1996, 'Family, Animation, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Pete Kozachik, Henry Selick, Hiro Narita', 'Steve Bloom, Karey Kirkpatrick, Jonathan Roberts', 'Paul Terry, Miriam Margolyes, Joanna Lumley, Pete Postlethwaite, Simon Callow, Richard Dreyfuss, Jane Leeves, Susan Sarandon', 'PG', 'When the young orphan boy James spills a magic bag of crocodile tongues, he finds himself in possession of a giant peach that flies him away to strange lands.', 'When the young orphan boy James spills a magic bag of crocodile tongues, he finds himself in possession of a giant peach that flies him away to strange lands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vNEGobe23vW43mSPYVaVaBLP6qV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10539'),
  ('227074121577615955', 'James Dean', 2001, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Robbie Greenberg, Mark Rydell, Mic Rodgers', 'Israel Horovitz', 'James Franco, Michael Moriarty, Valentina Cervi, Enrico Colantoni, Edward Herrmann, Joanne Linville, John Pleshette, Barry Primus', 'PG', 'The man behind the legend and a knowing look at 1950s Hollywood are revealed in this dynamic biopic of the meteoric star whose troubled life echoed his gut-grabbing performances in East of Eden, Rebel Without a Cause and Giant.', 'The man behind the legend and a knowing look at 1950s Hollywood are revealed in this dynamic biopic of the meteoric star whose troubled life echoed his gut-grabbing performances in East of Eden, Rebel Without a Cause and Giant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6dZt1YCJoEUjFRZUUhjEZclkDSZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2141'),
  ('680246246244390524', 'James White', 2015, 'Drama', 'Mátyás Erdély, Josh Mond', 'Josh Mond', 'Christopher Abbott, Cynthia Nixon, Kid Cudi, Makenzie Leigh, Ron Livingston, David Call, Scott Cohen, Jeanette Dilone', 'R', 'James White is a troubled twentysomething trying to stay afloat in a frenzied New York City. As he retreats further into a hedonistic lifestyle, his mother''s battle with a serious illness faces a series of setbacks that force him to assume more responsibility. With the pressure on him mounting, James must find new reserves of strength or risk imploding completely.', 'James White is a troubled twentysomething trying to stay afloat in a frenzied New York City. As he retreats further into a hedonistic lifestyle, his mother''s battle with a serious illness faces a series of setbacks that force him to assume more responsibility. With the pressure on him mounting, James must find new reserves of strength or risk imploding completely.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a7LzEt0y7CS9q5DGdUcIQ3JuBE5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:312804'),
  ('61480281080745362', 'Jamestown Baloos', 1957, 'Animation', 'Robert Breer', null, null, null, 'Cut-outs of war machines and the figure of Napoleon – contributors to an anti-war theme – encounter abstract shapes, line drawings, old-master landscapes, short bursts of ‘real-time’ landscapes and shakily photographed gestural watercolors. … ‘a synthesis of all previous techniques.’', 'Cut-outs of war machines and the figure of Napoleon – contributors to an anti-war theme – encounter abstract shapes, line drawings, old-master landscapes, short bursts of ‘real-time’ landscapes and shakily photographed gestural watercolors. … ‘a synthesis of all previous techniques.’', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/stT2D2Z1TII39DRQyJt9n2Q2UPz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147611'),
  ('505682649791148574', 'Jamesy Boy', 2014, 'Crime, Drama, Romance', 'Robert Lam, Trevor White', 'Lane Shadgett, Trevor White', 'Spencer Rocco Lofranco, Mary-Louise Parker, Ving Rhames, James Woods, Taissa Farmiga, Rosa Salazar, Michael Trotter, Ben Rosenfield', 'NR', 'Based on the true story of teenager James Burns who goes from a suburban street gang to a maximum-security prison cell surrounded by hardened criminals. He turns his life around in prison thanks to the unexpected friendship he forms with a convicted murderer who becomes his mentor.', 'Based on the true story of teenager James Burns who goes from a suburban street gang to a maximum-security prison cell surrounded by hardened criminals. He turns his life around in prison thanks to the unexpected friendship he forms with a convicted murderer who becomes his mentor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fJCMNxUnYfOmej5FhXSOeMX2jSD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:233470'),
  ('186551375329559512', 'Jamie Foxx: What Had Happened Was...', 2024, 'Comedy, Documentary', 'Hamish Hamilton', 'Jamie Foxx', 'Jamie Foxx, Corinne Foxx, Anelise Foxx', 'R', 'Oscar- and Golden Globe-winning actor. Grammy-winning singer. Beloved comedian. Jamie Foxx returns to the stage to set the record straight.', 'Oscar- and Golden Globe-winning actor. Grammy-winning singer. Beloved comedian. Jamie Foxx returns to the stage to set the record straight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4KzwXRpiUA765QTDynsfdbQsqGN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1353311'),
  ('776571353613116235', 'Jamie Marks Is Dead', 2014, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Carter Smith, Darren Lew, Alex Schwerin', 'Carter Smith', 'Noah Silver, Cameron Monaghan, Morgan Saylor, Brett DelBuono, Fred Tolliver Jr., Ronen Rubinstein, Ryan Munzert, Connor Antico', 'NR', 'No one seemed to care about Jamie Marks until after his death. Hoping to find the love and friendship he never had in life, Jamie’s ghost visits former classmate Adam McCormick, drawing him into the bleak world between the living and the dead.', 'No one seemed to care about Jamie Marks until after his death. Hoping to find the love and friendship he never had in life, Jamie’s ghost visits former classmate Adam McCormick, drawing him into the bleak world between the living and the dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q2hTW172Q7CSC0A5Lp6HAJ41XQr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:244562'),
  ('686498557859475504', 'Jammin'' the Blues', 1944, 'Documentary, Music', 'Gjon Mili, Robert Burks', null, 'Lester Young, George ''Red'' Callender, Harry Edison, Marlowe Morris, Sidney Catlett, Barney Kessel, Jo Jones, John Simmons', null, 'In this short film, prominent jazz musicians of the 1940s gather for a rare filming of a jam session. This highly stylized chronicle features tenor sax legend Lester Young.', 'In this short film, prominent jazz musicians of the 1940s gather for a rare filming of a jam session. This highly stylized chronicle features tenor sax legend Lester Young.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dRFAdxORaQokAy62KqIHUbcaA6e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147282'),
  ('767794587992448624', 'Jamon Jamon', 1992, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Bigas Luna, José Luis Alcaine, Ricardo Albarrán', 'Bigas Luna, Cuca Canals', 'Stefania Sandrelli, Anna Galiena, Juan Diego, Penélope Cruz, Javier Bardem, Jordi Mollà, Tomás Martín, Armando del Río', null, 'José Luis has a cushy corporate job at the lingerie factory his mom owns. After he falls in love and proposes to Silvia, a beautiful laborer on the underwear assembly line, his mom enlists Raul, a potential underwear model and would-be bullfighter, to seduce Silvia.', 'José Luis has a cushy corporate job at the lingerie factory his mom owns. After he falls in love and proposes to Silvia, a beautiful laborer on the underwear assembly line, his mom enlists Raul, a potential underwear model and would-be bullfighter, to seduce Silvia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bxYSRl1vXGwaAD98aXSwZQ5hmAe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4507'),
  ('675843378500227642', 'Jan Dara', 2001, 'Romance, Drama', 'Nonzee Nimibutr, Nattawut Kittikhun', 'Sirapak Paoboonkerd, Nonzee Nimibutr', 'Suwinit Panjamawat, Santisuk Promsiri, Christy Chung Lai-Tai, Egkarat Sarasook, Wipawee Charoenpura, Patharawarin Timkul, Thana Komentiti, Sasithorn Panichnok', null, 'Jan is a boy growing up in 1930s Siam in a wealthy, dysfunctional family where sex has a huge impact on everyone''s lives. Jan is viewed by his father as cursed, since his mother died giving birth to him.', 'Jan is a boy growing up in 1930s Siam in a wealthy, dysfunctional family where sex has a huge impact on everyone''s lives. Jan is viewed by his father as cursed, since his mother died giving birth to him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vE9h8C2FiOLXwli7NsTcn2MyWm6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68507'),
  ('588194734170367850', 'Jan Dara: The Beginning', 2012, 'Drama, Romance', 'Chatchai Pongprapaphan, Pundhevanop Dhewakul, Phanom Phromachat', 'Pundhevanop Dhewakul', 'Mario Maurer, Chaiyapol Poupart, Sakrat Ruekthamrong, Bongkoj Khongmalai, Savika Chaiyadej, Rudklao Amratisha, Shou Nishino, Rhatha Phongam', 'R', 'Jan, a young boy, grows up without a mother and is often insulted by his father. He struggles with his life as he longs to be with several women, even Madame Boonleung, his father''s lover.', 'Jan, a young boy, grows up without a mother and is often insulted by his father. He struggles with his life as he longs to be with several women, even Madame Boonleung, his father''s lover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6JXtCgm8ygSJRKGSl3GvOzRjGBM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151512'),
  ('41213427944509852', 'Jan Dara: The Finale', 2013, 'Drama, Romance', 'Pundhevanop Dhewakul, Phanom Phromachat', 'Pundhevanop Dhewakul', 'Mario Maurer, Chaiyapol Poupart, Sakrat Ruekthamrong, Bongkoj Khongmalai, Rhatha Phongam, Shou Nishino, Savika Chaiyadej, Nut Devahastin Na Ayutthaya', null, 'As a grown up, Jan recounts the abuse he experienced as a young boy at the hands of his sadistic father, Luang Wissanandacha. He decides to seek revenge and depose him.', 'As a grown up, Jan recounts the abuse he experienced as a young boy at the hands of his sadistic father, Luang Wissanandacha. He decides to seek revenge and depose him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mcGdlxKKBNK8GMbZq91O5RndsEq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:189715'),
  ('642720804848216583', 'Jana Gana Mana', 2022, 'Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Sudeep Elamon, Kiran Raphel, Dijo Jose Antony', 'Sharis Mohammed', 'Prithviraj Sukumaran, Suraj Venjaramoodu, Mamta Mohandas, Vincy Aloshious, Shari, Sri Divya, Shammi Thilakan, Kitty', null, 'After the mysterious death of a college professor triggers nationwide protests, a police officer’s pursuit of justice unravels layers of political manipulation and moral conflict, exposing how truth and power collide in the pursuit of justice.', 'After the mysterious death of a college professor triggers nationwide protests, a police officer’s pursuit of justice unravels layers of political manipulation and moral conflict, exposing how truth and power collide in the pursuit of justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1bSPVn6HlkGYTQ4tJYJ0UGWnQM9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:792358'),
  ('1112270577740219030', 'Jana Nayagan', 2026, 'Action, Drama, Science Fiction', 'H. Vinoth, Sathyan Sooryan, Harshavarthan Nagarajan', 'H. Vinoth', 'Vijay, Mamitha Baiju, Bobby Deol, Pooja Hegde, Priyamani, Prakash Raj, Gautham Vasudev Menon, Narain', null, 'A clash of ideologies. One stands for the people, the other feeds on control. Their paths collided once before. Years later, a child’s silent fear ignites the past, drawing a former police officer into a battle far bigger than personal revenge.', 'A clash of ideologies. One stands for the people, the other feeds on control. Their paths collided once before. Years later, a child’s silent fear ignites the past, drawing a former police officer into a battle far bigger than personal revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jt8pfSIdi47YpFMMWVRr8w5u2S0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1235877'),
  ('414576019993562086', 'Janara', 2015, 'Horror, Thriller, Drama, Mystery', 'Roberto Bontà Polito, Giovanni Dentici, Sabina Pariante', 'Brando Currarini, Alessandro Riccardi', 'Gianni Capaldi, Alessandro D''Ambrosi, Rosaria De Cicco, Noemi Giangrande, Lorenza Sorino, Fabrizio Vona, Francesco Perciballi, Laura Sinceri', null, 'The mysterious disappearances of several children in San Lupo, in the province of Benevento, are throwing the population into chaos and terror. Some believe it could be a pedophile, while others believe it''s a legendary witch, Janara, who was burned at the stake while pregnant centuries ago, thus casting a curse on the town and its inhabitants. It''s against this backdrop that Alessandro and Marta, a young pregnant couple, arrive in town to deal with inheritance matters related to the death of Marta''s grandfather. They will find themselves dealing with the disappearances much more intimately than they ever imagined.', 'The mysterious disappearances of several children in San Lupo, in the province of Benevento, are throwing the population into chaos and terror. Some believe it could be a pedophile, while others believe it''s a legendary witch, Janara, who was burned at the stake while pregnant centuries ago, thus casting a curse on the town and its inhabitants. It''s against this backdrop that Alessandro and Marta, a young pregnant couple, arrive in town to deal with inheritance matters related to the death of Marta''s grandfather. They will find themselves dealing with the disappearances much more intimately than they ever imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sFAQbCUL8cUO27ygtLDpPjxcwmZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:349795'),
  ('1046121207875789406', 'Janbaaz', 1986, 'Action, Romance, Crime', 'Kamal Bose, Feroz Khan', 'K.K. Shukla', 'Feroz Khan, Anil Kapoor, Amrish Puri, Dimple Kapadia, Sridevi, Shakti Kapoor, Raza Murad, Rekha', null, 'Rana Vikram Singh has two sons, police officer Rajesh and fun-loving playboy Amar. Rajesh has gone through a traumatic experience of losing the girl he loved when she succumbed to drug addiction. He vows to fight this menace.', 'Rana Vikram Singh has two sons, police officer Rajesh and fun-loving playboy Amar. Rajesh has gone through a traumatic experience of losing the girl he loved when she succumbed to drug addiction. He vows to fight this menace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ljsGHTRtVqLsyitbApe7mt8mQf6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27640'),
  ('202481875382930085', 'Jane', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Ellen Kuras, Brett Morgen, Stefan Nadelman', 'Brett Morgen', 'Jane Goodall, Hugo van Lawick, Hugo Eric Louis van Lawick', null, 'Drawing from never-before-seen footage that has been tucked away in the National Geographic archives, director Brett Morgen tells the story of Jane Goodall, a woman whose chimpanzee research revolutionized our understanding of the natural world.', 'Drawing from never-before-seen footage that has been tucked away in the National Geographic archives, director Brett Morgen tells the story of Jane Goodall, a woman whose chimpanzee research revolutionized our understanding of the natural world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lasO6v47evkx4JfRqf4Rhqp8FZd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:470819'),
  ('550673003351673736', 'Jane', 2022, 'Mystery, Thriller, Drama', 'Sabrina Jaglom, Diana Matos, Lee Rose', 'Sabrina Jaglom, Rishi Rajani', 'Madelaine Petsch, Chloe Bailey, Chloe Yu, Nina Bloomgarden, Ian Owens, Kerri Medders, Melissa Leo, Gage Gomez', 'R', 'When Olivia gets deferred from her dream college, she begins to spiral. In an attempt to regain control, she embarks on a social media-fueled rampage against those that stand in the way of her success. But as things escalate, she is forced to confront her darkest impulses in order to get ahead.', 'When Olivia gets deferred from her dream college, she begins to spiral. In an attempt to regain control, she embarks on a social media-fueled rampage against those that stand in the way of her success. But as things escalate, she is forced to confront her darkest impulses in order to get ahead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4IRtmYsaEP9W7QlpCh3ASUomsrj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:853867'),
  ('713133479605488669', 'Jane and the Lost City', 1987, 'Adventure, Comedy, Action', 'Terry Marcel, Paul Beeson, Graham Hickson', 'Mervyn Haisman', 'Kirsten Hughes, Sam J. Jones, Maud Adams, Jasper Carrott, Robin Bailey, Graham Stark, Elsa O''Toole, Ian Roberts', 'PG', 'Jane and the Colonel must journey to Africa to the lost city to retrieve the diamonds before the Nazis do. Comedy based on the popular wartime comic strip.', 'Jane and the Colonel must journey to Africa to the lost city to retrieve the diamonds before the Nazis do. Comedy based on the popular wartime comic strip.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5NgbvdDDfO1Y4VJFk9CPe8hTfiA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:171571'),
  ('190212551492888503', 'Jane Austen in Manhattan', 1980, 'Drama, Romance', 'Ernest Vincze, Larry Pizer, James Ivory', 'Ruth Prawer Jhabvala', 'Anne Baxter, Robert Powell, Michael Wager, Tim Choate, John Guerrasio, Katrina Hodiak, Sean Young, Kurt Johnson', null, 'Two teachers vie for the right to stage a play written by Jane Austen when she was twelve years old.', 'Two teachers vie for the right to stage a play written by Jane Austen when she was twelve years old.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9gCGDHA70CNCUrXjvzF1IeyjmTK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:185156'),
  ('727515558664756001', 'Jane Austen Wrecked My Life', 2025, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Pierre Mazoyer, Laura Piani, Sylvain Yonnet', 'Laura Piani', 'Camille Rutherford, Pablo Pauly, Charlie Anson, Annabelle Lengronne, Liz Crowther, Alan Fairbairn, Lola Peploe, Alice Butaud', 'R', 'An aspiring author looking to get more out of life takes up a writing residency and finds herself in the sort of romantic entanglements that could come from the pages of a Jane Austen novel.', 'An aspiring author looking to get more out of life takes up a writing residency and finds herself in the sort of romantic entanglements that could come from the pages of a Jane Austen novel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2xxmiejiP664Pyyjdftx8BWzHDS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1082424'),
  ('101717199656749976', 'Jane Austen''s Mafia!', 1998, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Jim Abrahams, Pierre Letarte', 'Jim Abrahams, Greg Norberg, Michael McManus', 'Jay Mohr, Billy Burke, Christina Applegate, Pamela Gidley, Olympia Dukakis, Lloyd Bridges, Jason Fuchs, Joe Viterelli', 'PG-13', 'After growing up poor in Salmonella, Vincenzo Cortino installs himself as the preeminent, if bumbling, Mafia don of the New World. But now he must pass on power to one of his two sons: either level-headed veteran Anthony or vituperative loose cannon Joey.', 'After growing up poor in Salmonella, Vincenzo Cortino installs himself as the preeminent, if bumbling, Mafia don of the New World. But now he must pass on power to one of his two sons: either level-headed veteran Anthony or vituperative loose cannon Joey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gGgirOcInrfjWgemKMjvZc3fGtU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9835'),
  ('929257687866350953', 'Jane B. by Agnès V.', 1988, null, 'Agnès Varda, Pierre-Laurent Chénieux, Nurith Aviv', 'Agnès Varda', 'Jane Birkin, Jean-Pierre Léaud, Philippe Léotard, Farid Chopel, Alain Souchon, Serge Gainsbourg, Laura Betti, Monique Godard', null, 'The interests, obsessions, and fantasies of two singular artists converge in this inspired collaboration between Agnès Varda and her longtime friend the actor Jane Birkin. Made over the course of a year and motivated by Birkin’s fortieth birthday—a milestone she admits to some anxiety over—Jane B. by Agnès V. contrasts the private, reflective Birkin with Birkin the icon.', 'The interests, obsessions, and fantasies of two singular artists converge in this inspired collaboration between Agnès Varda and her longtime friend the actor Jane Birkin. Made over the course of a year and motivated by Birkin’s fortieth birthday—a milestone she admits to some anxiety over—Jane B. by Agnès V. contrasts the private, reflective Birkin with Birkin the icon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1izUNQlIMkc7dhcbatWej6NvpW8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53028'),
  ('237430515822648223', 'Jane by Charlotte', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Charlotte Gainsbourg, Adrien Bertolle, Gena Desanti', 'Charlotte Gainsbourg', 'Jane Birkin, Charlotte Gainsbourg, Jo Attal, Iggy Pop, Serge Gainsbourg, Kate Barry', null, 'Charlotte Gainsbourg looks at her mother Jane Birkin in a way she never did, overcoming a sense of reserve. Using a camera lens, they expose themselves to each other, begin to step back, leaving space for a mother-daughter relationship.', 'Charlotte Gainsbourg looks at her mother Jane Birkin in a way she never did, overcoming a sense of reserve. Using a camera lens, they expose themselves to each other, begin to step back, leaving space for a mother-daughter relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fMhd76lPhjkdHvyO3kE0Z5ySyGk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:836485'),
  ('776822381305407739', 'Jane Eyre', 1934, 'Drama, Romance', 'Christy Cabanne', 'Adele Comandini', 'Virginia Bruce, Colin Clive, Beryl Mercer, David Torrence, Aileen Pringle, Edith Fellows, John Rogers, Jean Darling', 'NR', 'After a bleak childhood, Jane Eyre goes out into the world to become a governess. As she lives happily in her new position at Thornfield Hall, she meets the dark, cold, and abrupt master of the house, Edward Rochester. Jane and her employer grow close in friendship and she soon finds herself falling in love with him. Happiness seems to have found Jane at last, but could Rochester''s terrible secret be about to destroy it forever?', 'After a bleak childhood, Jane Eyre goes out into the world to become a governess. As she lives happily in her new position at Thornfield Hall, she meets the dark, cold, and abrupt master of the house, Edward Rochester. Jane and her employer grow close in friendship and she soon finds herself falling in love with him. Happiness seems to have found Jane at last, but could Rochester''s terrible secret be about to destroy it forever?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tYMbNpZcVaafIeaMltGEsuJcU3d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:169625'),
