  ('1138475731400800518', 'Jane Fonda in Five Acts', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Susan Lacy, Sam Painter', null, 'Jane Fonda, Tom Hayden, Robert Redford, Lily Tomlin, Ted Turner, Paula Weinstein, Troy Garity, Sam Waterston', null, 'Girl next door, activist, so-called traitor, fitness tycoon, Oscar winner: Jane Fonda has lived a life of controversy, tragedy and transformation – and she’s done it all in the public eye. An intimate look at one woman’s singular journey.', 'Girl next door, activist, so-called traitor, fitness tycoon, Oscar winner: Jane Fonda has lived a life of controversy, tragedy and transformation – and she’s done it all in the public eye. An intimate look at one woman’s singular journey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lgOfQqfOeMt2dGsD8u0XcBOvfpo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:490082'),
  ('460879474890012176', 'Jane Got a Gun', 2015, 'Western, Action, Drama', 'Gavin O''Connor, Mandy Walker, Billy Hopkins', 'Anthony Tambakis', 'Natalie Portman, Joel Edgerton, Ewan McGregor, Noah Emmerich, Boyd Holbrook, Rodrigo Santoro, Alex Manette, Todd Stashwick', 'R', 'After her outlaw husband returns home shot with eight bullets and barely alive, Jane reluctantly reaches out to an ex-lover who she hasn''t seen in over ten years to help her defend her farm when the time comes that her husband''s gang eventually tracks him down to finish the job.', 'After her outlaw husband returns home shot with eight bullets and barely alive, Jane reluctantly reaches out to an ex-lover who she hasn''t seen in over ten years to help her defend her farm when the time comes that her husband''s gang eventually tracks him down to finish the job.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hmfZZ7QeD2RTqkCQX09OC2ehawz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:174751'),
  ('1046303429486406674', 'Jane Zhang - Listen to Jane Z Live 2012', 2012, 'Music', null, null, 'Jane Zhang', null, 'Listen to Jane Z Live (simplified Chinese: 倾听 张靓颖; traditional Chinese: 傾聽 張靚穎) is Jane Zhang''s first live album that was released on 4 June 2012. It is her third album with Universal Music Group under Show City Times and sixth album to date. All songs were sung and recorded live at Beijing Huasheng Tianqiao Theater in April 2012.', 'Listen to Jane Z Live (simplified Chinese: 倾听 张靓颖; traditional Chinese: 傾聽 張靚穎) is Jane Zhang''s first live album that was released on 4 June 2012. It is her third album with Universal Music Group under Show City Times and sixth album to date. All songs were sung and recorded live at Beijing Huasheng Tianqiao Theater in April 2012.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lGAMfzPgneiqsyFmoEsJ2coM3eW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:206965'),
  ('525162935835415765', 'Janela da Alma', 2001, 'Documentary', 'João Jardim, Walter Carvalho, Walter Carvalho', 'Walter Carvalho, João Jardim', 'Hermeto Pascoal, José Saramago, Paulo Cezar Lopes, Antonio Cícero, Wim Wenders, Evgen Bavčar, Spela Lenarcic, Marieta Severo', null, 'Nineteen people with differing degrees of visual impairment – from mild nearsightedness to total blindness – discuss how they see themselves, how they see others and how they perceive the world. Unusual images, of burning trees or empty deserts, link the interviews, which vary from deep to funny to poetic.', 'Nineteen people with differing degrees of visual impairment – from mild nearsightedness to total blindness – discuss how they see themselves, how they see others and how they perceive the world. Unusual images, of burning trees or empty deserts, link the interviews, which vary from deep to funny to poetic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fLJ56kNgzJnvv82oLumG395NKk5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63407'),
  ('134369553140048551', 'Janet Jackson: The Velvet Rope Tour', 1998, 'Music', 'David Mallet', null, 'Janet Jackson, Q-Tip, Ray Singh, Colin Powell, Michael Andrews, Keith Diorio, Gil Duldulao, Teresa Espinosa', 'NR', 'Janet Jackson performs live at New York City’s Madison Square Garden for the final stop of her “The Velvet Rope” tour.', 'Janet Jackson performs live at New York City’s Madison Square Garden for the final stop of her “The Velvet Rope” tour.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lMM1liiuO9AX0tsqFe8gFjACSPb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:131246'),
  ('324113702464398434', 'Janet Planet', 2024, 'Drama', 'Kat Hess, Laura Klein, Annie Baker', 'Annie Baker', 'Julianne Nicholson, Zoe Ziegler, Will Patton, Sophie Okonedo, Elias Koteas, Luke Bosco, June Walker Grossman, Abby Harri', 'PG-13', 'In rural Western Massachusetts, 11-year-old Lacy spends the summer of 1991 at home, enthralled by her own imagination and the attention of her mother, Janet. As the months pass, three visitors enter their orbit, all captivated by Janet.', 'In rural Western Massachusetts, 11-year-old Lacy spends the summer of 1991 at home, enthralled by her own imagination and the attention of her mother, Janet. As the months pass, three visitors enter their orbit, all captivated by Janet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i4qK3vQS4MD8OKhIkqSe3UK6OuH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1037035'),
  ('97564798163102720', 'Janhit Mein Jaari', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Chirantan Das, Jai Basantu Singh, Parag Mehta', 'Sonali Singh, Jai Basantu Singh, Rajan Agarwal', 'Nushrratt Bharuccha, Anud Singh Dhaka, Paritosh Tripathi, Vijay Raaz, Tinnu Anand, Brijendra Kala, Sapna Sand, Ishtiyak Khan', null, 'A small-town girl from MP, Manokamna, gets a decent-paying job. But the work requires her to sell condoms. Will she be able to voice her beliefs while balancing her responsibilities and society?', 'A small-town girl from MP, Manokamna, gets a decent-paying job. But the work requires her to sell condoms. Will she be able to voice her beliefs while balancing her responsibilities and society?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A2bUJ6CBqimqcofBr4X0j0Ph89U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:768466'),
  ('651017566937862104', 'Janie', 1970, 'Horror', 'Jack Bravman, Roberta Findlay, Roberta Findlay', 'James Foley', 'Linda Vair, Peer St. Jean, Tina Kraskow, Michael Findlay, William Savage, Berla L. Moke, Ella Greenberg, Walter Dunnet', null, 'A sadistic teenager searching for "Daddy" murders and dismembers anybody who picks her up hitch-hiking.', 'A sadistic teenager searching for "Daddy" murders and dismembers anybody who picks her up hitch-hiking.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tg4U00CC3CTF9LAKwEJi5hiVvwA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:213212'),
  ('846735469738819248', 'Janis', 1974, 'Documentary, Music', 'Howard Alk', 'Howard Alk, Seaton Findlay', 'Janis Joplin, Richard Bell, Sam Andrew, John Simon, Dick Cavett', 'R', 'Released just a few years after her death, this forms a picture of who Janis was through interviews and performance clips.', 'Released just a few years after her death, this forms a picture of who Janis was through interviews and performance clips.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oDlPlPjt8AgzydPdVKjWWeXleMW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:200655'),
  ('963710619989641717', 'Janis and John', 2003, 'Comedy', 'Samuel Benchetrit, Pierre Aïm, Ophélie Gelber', 'Samuel Benchetrit, Gábor Rassov', 'Sergi López, Marie Trintignant, François Cluzet, Christopher Lambert, Jean-Louis Trintignant, Amparo Soler Leal, Sacha Aubart, Basile Leroux', null, 'Insurance salesman tries to get money from his hippie cousin by fulfilling his dream: arraigning for John Lennon and Janis Joplin''s "second coming".', 'Insurance salesman tries to get money from his hippie cousin by fulfilling his dream: arraigning for John Lennon and Janis Joplin''s "second coming".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rDqz4rAEAfOxdLmANkzJMgWn24A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49399'),
  ('276643494240825637', 'Janis: Little Girl Blue', 2015, 'Documentary, Music', 'Amy J. Berg, Francesco Carrozzini, Paula Huidobro', 'Amy J. Berg', 'Janis Joplin, Cat Power, D. A. Pennebaker, Dick Cavett, Peter Albin, Karleen Bennett, Laura Joplin, Michael Joplin', null, 'Janis Joplin is one of the most respected and iconic rock & roll singers of all time, a tragic and misunderstood figure who captivated millions of listeners and blazed new creative trails before her death in 1970 at age 27. Director Amy Berg explored Joplin''s story in depth. A portrait of a complicated, driven and often beleaguered artist. Joplin''s own words recount a series of letters she wrote to her family over the years. Janis was a vessel of energy when she sang. Her rapid rise and untimely death changed music forever.', 'Janis Joplin is one of the most respected and iconic rock & roll singers of all time, a tragic and misunderstood figure who captivated millions of listeners and blazed new creative trails before her death in 1970 at age 27. Director Amy Berg explored Joplin''s story in depth. A portrait of a complicated, driven and often beleaguered artist. Joplin''s own words recount a series of letters she wrote to her family over the years. Janis was a vessel of energy when she sang. Her rapid rise and untimely death changed music forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qosDLnAcHRAUjgmZIU0c1ktEhx2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:321974'),
  ('302189401508799737', 'Janky Promoters', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Marcus Raboy, Staci Lamkin, Greg Hale', 'Ice Cube', 'Ice Cube, Mike Epps, Young Jeezy, Darris Love, Julio Oscar Mechoso, Lil J.J., Glenn Plummer, Juanita Jennings', 'R', 'Two shady concert promoters get into hot water when their chance to book a superstar rapper goes awry.', 'Two shady concert promoters get into hot water when their chance to book a superstar rapper goes awry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sQTn0iUDsfwSLOznzOzfDhC3J8I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25186'),
  ('801105738748200491', 'Jannat', 2008, 'Crime, Drama, Romance', 'Kunal Deshmukh, Manoj Soni', 'Vishesh Bhatt', 'Emraan Hashmi, Sonal Chauhan, Javed Sheikh, Sameer Kochhar, Vishal Malhotra, Vipin Sharma, Abhimanyu Singh, Vineet Kumar Singh', 'PG-13', 'A gambler turns into a cricket bookie banking on his sixth sense for the game. But his urge to make quick money pushes him into match-fixing and he loses control of his life and love.', 'A gambler turns into a cricket bookie banking on his sixth sense for the game. But his urge to make quick money pushes him into match-fixing and he loses control of his life and love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4QRFa5FjA27hC3ZnHfzAjeTUt0Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25510'),
  ('601020984133184734', 'Jannat 2', 2012, 'Action, Romance', 'Kunal Deshmukh, Bobby Singh', null, 'Emraan Hashmi, Randeep Hooda, Esha Gupta, Mohammed Zeeshan Ayyub, Manish Chaudhary, Imran Zahid, Sumeet Nijhawan, Brijendra Kala', null, 'Sonu Dilli KKC, an illegal arms dealer is chased around by ACP Pratap Raghuvanshi. On the other hand, Sonu falls for Dr Jhanvi Singh Tomar. However, Sonu''s life is turned upside-down, when he realises that Dr Jhanvi is the daughter of Mangal Singh Tomar, an illegal arms kingpin. Will Sonu survive the difficult times ahead?', 'Sonu Dilli KKC, an illegal arms dealer is chased around by ACP Pratap Raghuvanshi. On the other hand, Sonu falls for Dr Jhanvi Singh Tomar. However, Sonu''s life is turned upside-down, when he realises that Dr Jhanvi is the daughter of Mangal Singh Tomar, an illegal arms kingpin. Will Sonu survive the difficult times ahead?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2nQgcZb9hGzU2Dz8cYC5JoxkYBi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85053'),
  ('522235795085189338', 'Janosik', 1974, 'TV Movie, Adventure', 'Jerzy Passendorfer, Stefan Pindelski', 'Tadeusz Kwiatkowski', 'Ewa Lemańska, Marek Perepeczko, Bogusz Bilewski, Witold Pyrkosz, Marian Kociniak, Janusz Kłosiński, August Kowalczyk, Jerzy Turek', null, 'In the early 19th century, the legendary Tatra brigand Janosik defies the oppressive local nobility and Austrian troops by robbing the rich to give to the poor, becoming a folk hero among the peasants.', 'In the early 19th century, the legendary Tatra brigand Janosik defies the oppressive local nobility and Austrian troops by robbing the rich to give to the poor, becoming a folk hero among the peasants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hwrv8F84y24dsGmpPAEop8rOxaz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:157646'),
  ('592496323925123443', 'Japan Sinks', 2006, 'Drama, Thriller, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Shinji Higuchi, Taro Kawazu, Yoshikazu Ishii', 'Masato Katō', 'Tsuyoshi Kusanagi, Ko Shibasaki, Etsushi Toyokawa, Mao Daichi, Mitsuhiro Oikawa, Mayuko Fukuda, Hideko Yoshida, Akira Emoto', null, 'In the aftermath of a major earthquake, scientists predict that Japan will sink into the sea. As further disasters follow, politicians plead with other countries to take refugees, while scientists struggle to save Japan itself.', 'In the aftermath of a major earthquake, scientists predict that Japan will sink into the sea. As further disasters follow, politicians plead with other countries to take refugees, while scientists struggle to save Japan itself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bRFIzzyChY726O3ICE453YjOOoQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16766'),
  ('1075565974082445174', 'Japan''s Longest Day', 1967, 'Drama, History, War', 'Kihachi Okamoto, Hiroshi Murai, Michio Yamamoto', 'Shinobu Hashimoto', 'Seiji Miyaguchi, Rokkō Toura, Chishū Ryū, So Yamamura, Toshirō Mifune, Yoshio Kosugi, Takashi Shimura, Etsushi Takahashi', null, 'Following the detonation of the atomic bombs on Hiroshima and Nagasaki, the Japanese military and the government clash over the demand from the Allies for unconditional surrender. Minister of the Army Anami leads the military officers who propose to fight on, even to the death of every Japanese citizen. Emperor Hirohito, however, joins with his ministers in asking the unthinkable, the peaceful surrender of Japan. When the military plots a coup to overthrow the Emperor''s civilian government, Anami must face the choice between his desires and loyalty to his Emperor.', 'Following the detonation of the atomic bombs on Hiroshima and Nagasaki, the Japanese military and the government clash over the demand from the Allies for unconditional surrender. Minister of the Army Anami leads the military officers who propose to fight on, even to the death of every Japanese citizen. Emperor Hirohito, however, joins with his ministers in asking the unthinkable, the peaceful surrender of Japan. When the military plots a coup to overthrow the Emperor''s civilian government, Anami must face the choice between his desires and loyalty to his Emperor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1IfCvCMoE14B2DbLtcWz4bgkl7P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47370'),
  ('133070782812626721', 'Japanese Girls at the Harbor', 1933, 'Drama, Romance', 'Hiroshi Shimizu, Isao Numanami, Tai Ogiwara', 'Mitsu Suyama', 'Michiko Oikawa, Yukiko Inoue, Ureo Egawa, Ranko Sawa, Yumeko Aizome, Tatsuo Saitō, Yasuo Nanjo', null, 'Set in the port city of Yokohama, two girls, Sunako and Dora who attend a Christian school, pledge to be friends. But when a youth named Henry appears on his motorcycle and offers to take Sunako for a ride, we know that this friendship won''t last and that the lives of both girls will change in ways they are barely able to comprehend, and can do little to change.', 'Set in the port city of Yokohama, two girls, Sunako and Dora who attend a Christian school, pledge to be friends. But when a youth named Henry appears on his motorcycle and offers to take Sunako for a ride, we know that this friendship won''t last and that the lives of both girls will change in ways they are barely able to comprehend, and can do little to change.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vKIthkPUnvcq4J7k3wOGGNvSGhp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64728'),
  ('778686874616430532', 'Japanese Girls Never Die', 2016, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Daigo Matsui, Yusuke Hatai, Ryo Hirano', 'Misaki Setoyama', 'Yu Aoi, Mitsuki Takahata, Taiga Nakano, Shono Hayama, Huwie Ishizaki, Akiko Kikuchi, Maho Yamada, Motoki Ochiai', null, 'While a gang of high school girls randomly beats lone men at night, the photo of a young woman who has been declared missing is used to design a template which is painted on each wall of a small suburban town.', 'While a gang of high school girls randomly beats lone men at night, the photo of a young woman who has been declared missing is used to design a template which is painted on each wall of a small suburban town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i8CZ4JQ38z8gDC28q64LuMxEuk1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:410114'),
  ('820682361523863268', 'Japanese Spiderman: Episode 0', 1978, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Koichi Takemoto', 'Susumu Takaku, Shozo Uehara', 'Shinji Tôdô, Noboru Nakaya, Mitsuo Andō, Yukie Kagawa, Rika Miura, Izumi Oyama, Yoshiharu Yabuki, Fuyuki Murakami', null, 'The Iron Cross Army are sabotaging oil-tankers with the help of their monster, the Sea-Devil, a semi-mechanical anthropomorphic swordfish with an ability to shoot torpedoes from its mouth. Spiderman employs the help of the interpol agent Juzo Mamiya to help him stop the Iron Cross Army.', 'The Iron Cross Army are sabotaging oil-tankers with the help of their monster, the Sea-Devil, a semi-mechanical anthropomorphic swordfish with an ability to shoot torpedoes from its mouth. Spiderman employs the help of the interpol agent Juzo Mamiya to help him stop the Iron Cross Army.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mVeOiXqSIYRLkuC8HtLKpHRzuek.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:438561'),
  ('932871584327250281', 'Japanese Story', 2003, 'Drama, Romance', 'Sue Brooks, Rachel Evans, Ian Baker', 'Alison Tilson', 'Toni Collette, Gotaro Tsunashima, Matthew Dyktynski, Lynette Curran, Yumiko Tanaka, Kate Atkinson, Bill Young, Reg Evans', null, 'Sandy, a geologist, finds herself stuck on a field trip to the Pilbara desert with a Japanese man she finds inscrutable, annoying and decidedly arrogant. Hiromitsu''s view of her is not much better. Things go from bad to worse when they become stranded in one of the most remote regions on Earth.', 'Sandy, a geologist, finds herself stuck on a field trip to the Pilbara desert with a Japanese man she finds inscrutable, annoying and decidedly arrogant. Hiromitsu''s view of her is not much better. Things go from bad to worse when they become stranded in one of the most remote regions on Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bgazOSULGJSF2DNnyfWkOWn74ei.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13433'),
  ('217495027710318294', 'Japanese Summer: Double Suicide', 1967, 'Crime, Drama', 'Nagisa Ōshima, Yasuhiro Yoshioka', 'Mamoru Sasaki, Tsutomu Tamura, Nagisa Ōshima', 'Keiko Sakurai, Kei Satō, Tetsuo Ashida, Bunya Ozawa, Yoshiyuki Fukuda, Hideo Kanze, Hōsei Komatsu, Shunsuke Mizoguchi', null, 'A sex-obsessed woman, a suicidal man she meets on the street, and a gun-crazy wannabe gangster become trapped in an underground hideaway.', 'A sex-obsessed woman, a suicidal man she meets on the street, and a gun-crazy wannabe gangster become trapped in an underground hideaway.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6xWMv9P2cKbGjtIkA4OG991IJQr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48515'),
  ('592133223277314657', 'Japanese Woman is Cheap in the Next Room', 2020, 'Drama, Romance', 'Shin Hyo-sung', null, 'Sarina Momonaga, Min Do-yoon, Lee Sul-ah', null, 'Jae-kyung is embarrassed and runs away after seeing someone talking to herself at a bar. Did she live in her next room? Yuya and Jae-kyung, who are free from misunderstanding, are rapidly approaching. Soon, they will develop into a relationship with each other. However, the new relationship at the boarding house causes all relationships to break. To make matters worse, Jae-kyung misunderstood Yuya''s appearance to share her concerns with Ken. Can their relationship be restored?', 'Jae-kyung is embarrassed and runs away after seeing someone talking to herself at a bar. Did she live in her next room? Yuya and Jae-kyung, who are free from misunderstanding, are rapidly approaching. Soon, they will develop into a relationship with each other. However, the new relationship at the boarding house causes all relationships to break. To make matters worse, Jae-kyung misunderstood Yuya''s appearance to share her concerns with Ken. Can their relationship be restored?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ltsm79ByVGCfzlKYD91lcQNjK8o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:725405'),
  ('781337216590580796', 'Japón', 2003, 'Drama', 'Carlos Reygadas, Diego Martínez Vignatti, Thierry Tronchet', 'Carlos Reygadas', 'Alejandro Ferretis, Magdalena Flores, Yolanda Villa, Martín Serrano, Rolando Hernández, Bernabe Pérez, Fernando Benítez, Carlo Reygadas Barquín', null, 'A painter from the big city goes to a remote canyon to commit suicide. To reach some calmness he stays at the farmstead of Ascen, an old religious woman. Although only a few words are spoken, love grows.', 'A painter from the big city goes to a remote canyon to commit suicide. To reach some calmness he stays at the farmstead of Ascen, an old religious woman. Although only a few words are spoken, love grows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dvLPpPzRhwHx32wNbtglIUWQFhq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36211'),
  ('297858268289112182', 'Japon İşi', 1987, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Kartal Tibet, Ali Akdeniz', 'Erdoğan Tünaş', 'Kemal Sunal, Fatma Girik, Sümer Tilmaç, Reha Yurdakul, Asuman Arsan, Mitsiu Hamaya, Tuncer Sevi, Necdet Yakın', null, 'Veysel loves a singer named Basak. But she doesn’t love him back. One day Veysel saves the life of a Japanese tourist. Later, the tourist sends a gift to Veysel from Japan. The gift is a robot that looks exactly like the singer he loves, Basak.', 'Veysel loves a singer named Basak. But she doesn’t love him back. One day Veysel saves the life of a Japanese tourist. Later, the tourist sends a gift to Veysel from Japan. The gift is a robot that looks exactly like the singer he loves, Basak.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7GhL8QC62T54jrz6S92y8psAsph.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:236053'),
  ('267815961568959462', 'Japoteurs', 1942, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, Family, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Seymour Kneitel', null, 'Bud Collyer, Joan Alexander, Jack Mercer, Jackson Beck', null, 'Superman vs. Japanese spies hijacking a new super-bomber.', 'Superman vs. Japanese spies hijacking a new super-bomber.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8j8upgNmWzlvfkAlLXgqmbhbj2u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71128'),
  ('202222950962280550', 'Jappeloup', 2013, 'Drama', 'Christian Duguay, Ronald Plante, Stéphane Gluck', 'Guillaume Canet', 'Guillaume Canet, Marina Hands, Daniel Auteuil, Lou de Laâge, Tchéky Karyo, Jacques Higelin, Marie Bunel, Joël Dupuch', null, 'A true sports story that utterly defies the odds, Duguay’s film captures the wild ups and downs of the Olympics-bound career of legendary equine star Jappeloup and his troubled rider, locked in a tense relationship with his horseman father and forever uncertain of his own skills as an equestrian', 'A true sports story that utterly defies the odds, Duguay’s film captures the wild ups and downs of the Olympics-bound career of legendary equine star Jappeloup and his troubled rider, locked in a tense relationship with his horseman father and forever uncertain of his own skills as an equestrian', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gUDW33zn3faZapPVDZIph8tvq0w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:172106'),
  ('830669092617260139', 'Jar City', 2006, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Baltasar Kormákur, Bergsteinn Björgúlfsson', 'Baltasar Kormákur', 'Ingvar E. Sigurðsson, Ágústa Eva Erlendsdóttir, Björn Hlynur Haraldsson, Ólafía Hrönn Jónsdóttir, Atli Rafn Sigurðsson, Kristbjörg Kjeld, Þorsteinn Gunnarsson, Theodór Júlíusson', null, 'A murder opens up a bleak trail of long buried secrets and small town corruption for a worn out police detective and his squad.', 'A murder opens up a bleak trail of long buried secrets and small town corruption for a worn out police detective and his squad.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eY5Iq6oxvPKPX4a1Na2oBzQbqTL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16170'),
  ('813356698745812570', 'Jára Cimrman Lying, Sleeping', 1983, 'Comedy', 'Ladislav Smoljak, Richard Valenta, Jan Hraběta', 'Zdeněk Svěrák, Ladislav Smoljak', 'Zdeněk Svěrák, Valerie Kaplanová, Josef Abrhám, Petr Čepek, Milena Dvorská, Libuše Šafránková, Jiří Kostka, Míla Myslíková', null, 'Czechoslovak comedy film directed by Ladislav Smoljak, about the fictional national hero Jára Cimrman (universal genius, inventor, sportsman, criminalist, poet, writer and philosopher).', 'Czechoslovak comedy film directed by Ladislav Smoljak, about the fictional national hero Jára Cimrman (universal genius, inventor, sportsman, criminalist, poet, writer and philosopher).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5sj8TyF5fRL7IMwpQnuCcmxEBmH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:167752'),
  ('1115407665475757519', 'Jargo', 2004, 'Crime, Drama', 'Maria Solrun, Birgit Guðjónsdóttir', 'Maria Solrun', 'Constantin von Jascheroff, Udo Kier, Ulrich Noethen, Josefine Preuß, Oktay Özdemir, Nora Waldstätten, Marc Hosemann, Eladio Pamaran', null, 'Jargo is a German teen brought up in Saudi Arabia. Moving to Berlin, Jargo maintains his Arabian clothing until he encounters a similar aged German Turk Kamil and here begins his introduction into the world of juvenile cool (read delinquency). He then has to decide which girls he likes while being pressured by his father to get laid.', 'Jargo is a German teen brought up in Saudi Arabia. Moving to Berlin, Jargo maintains his Arabian clothing until he encounters a similar aged German Turk Kamil and here begins his introduction into the world of juvenile cool (read delinquency). He then has to decide which girls he likes while being pressured by his father to get laid.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mtNg0wfBmlk334K4Zcc4oeB1ctM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41874'),
  ('329716841262865636', 'Jarhead', 2005, 'Drama, War', 'Sam Mendes, Roger Deakins, Stefan Dechant', 'William Broyles Jr.', 'Jake Gyllenhaal, Jamie Foxx, Peter Sarsgaard, Scott MacDonald, Chris Cooper, Laz Alonso, Lucas Black, Brian Geraghty', 'R', 'Jarhead is a film about a US Marine Anthony Swofford’s experience in the Gulf War. After putting up with an arduous boot camp, Swofford and his unit are sent to the Persian Gulf where they are eager to fight, but are forced to stay back from the action. Swofford struggles with the possibility of his girlfriend cheating on him, and as his mental state deteriorates, his desire to kill increases.', 'Jarhead is a film about a US Marine Anthony Swofford’s experience in the Gulf War. After putting up with an arduous boot camp, Swofford and his unit are sent to the Persian Gulf where they are eager to fight, but are forced to stay back from the action. Swofford struggles with the possibility of his girlfriend cheating on him, and as his mental state deteriorates, his desire to kill increases.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6vdj47RAWOUZBkeQmqToeZ7eaio.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25'),
  ('746151196360571332', 'Jarhead 2: Field of Fire', 2014, 'War, Action', 'Don Michael Paul, Alexander Krumov', 'Ellis Black, Berkeley Anderson', 'Josh Kelly, Danielle Savre, Cole Hauser, Ralitsa Paskaleva, Bokeem Woodbine, Jesse García, Esai Morales, Stephen Lang', 'R', 'Battle-scarred and disillusioned by the war, Corporal Chris Merrimette is put in charge of a unit whose next mission is to resupply a remote outpost on the edge of Taliban-controlled territory. While driving through the hostile Helmand province, a Navy SEAL flags down their convoy and enlists the unit on an operation of international importance: they must help an Afghan woman famous for her defiance of the Taliban escape the country. Without tanks or air support, Merrimette and his team will need all the courage and firepower they can muster to fight their way across the war-torn country and shepherd the woman to safety.', 'Battle-scarred and disillusioned by the war, Corporal Chris Merrimette is put in charge of a unit whose next mission is to resupply a remote outpost on the edge of Taliban-controlled territory. While driving through the hostile Helmand province, a Navy SEAL flags down their convoy and enlists the unit on an operation of international importance: they must help an Afghan woman famous for her defiance of the Taliban escape the country. Without tanks or air support, Merrimette and his team will need all the courage and firepower they can muster to fight their way across the war-torn country and shepherd the woman to safety.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s3LkjkwmmhECqQyCuJLG1t009Qq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:285423'),
  ('866796453531736435', 'Jarhead 3: The Siege', 2016, 'War, Action, Drama', 'Mark Rutledge, William Kaufman, Stanimir Stamatov', 'Michael D. Weiss, Chad Law', 'Scott Adkins, Sasha Jackson, Tom Ainsley, Dennis Haysbert, Charlie Weber, Dante Basco, Romeo, Erik Valdez', 'R', 'Corporal Evan Albright joined the elite Marine Corps Security Guards to save the world and see some action-not necessarily in that order. But his first assignment, protecting a U. S. Embassy in a seemingly safe Middle Eastern capitol, relegates his unit to wrangling "gate groupies" protesting outside the compound and honing their marksmanship by playing video games. So Albright and his team are caught off guard when well-armed and well-trained militants launch a surprise attack aimed at killing an informant in the embassy. Heavily out-gunned, they will have to muster all the courage and fire power they can as their once routine assignment spirals into all-out war.', 'Corporal Evan Albright joined the elite Marine Corps Security Guards to save the world and see some action-not necessarily in that order. But his first assignment, protecting a U. S. Embassy in a seemingly safe Middle Eastern capitol, relegates his unit to wrangling "gate groupies" protesting outside the compound and honing their marksmanship by playing video games. So Albright and his team are caught off guard when well-armed and well-trained militants launch a surprise attack aimed at killing an informant in the embassy. Heavily out-gunned, they will have to muster all the courage and fire power they can as their once routine assignment spirals into all-out war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/namZEDSMbFOSI3sMjzeSJ4E176o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:378385'),
  ('674681280567138894', 'Jarhead: Law of Return', 2019, 'War', 'Stanimir Stamatov, Alexander Krumov, Don Michael Paul', 'Don Michael Paul', 'Devon Sawa, Yael Eitan, Nicholas Aaron, Ben Cross, Amaury Nolasco, Robert Patrick, Tsahi Halevi, Shanti Ashanti', 'R', 'Major Ronan Jackson, an accomplished fighter pilot for the Israel Defense Forces and son of a U.S. Senator, is shot down while flying through Syrian airspace. After miraculously surviving the crash, Jackson is taken captive by a group of Hezbollah militiamen. A squad of elite soldiers, led by Gunnery Sergeant Dave Torres, risk their own lives in the hopes of saving an ally they''ve never met.', 'Major Ronan Jackson, an accomplished fighter pilot for the Israel Defense Forces and son of a U.S. Senator, is shot down while flying through Syrian airspace. After miraculously surviving the crash, Jackson is taken captive by a group of Hezbollah militiamen. A squad of elite soldiers, led by Gunnery Sergeant Dave Torres, risk their own lives in the hopes of saving an ally they''ve never met.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6LlqyjAik3Kh68QQ9AchSJEF0Z5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:635744'),
  ('142713118545482389', 'Jaripeo', 2026, 'Documentary', 'Efraín Mojica, Rebecca Zweig, Gerardo Guerra V., Josue Eber Morales, Natanael Guzman', 'Efraín Mojica, Rebecca Zweig', 'Efraín Mojica', null, 'Set against the vibrant spectacle of the jaripeo, a symbol of Mexican cowboy tradition and machismo, this story unveils a hidden world of queer desire and quiet rebellion. As glances and gestures disrupt the rigid norms of masculinity, the rodeo becomes a stage for our protagonists to navigate identity, community, and the search for belonging in an oppressively traditional space.', 'Set against the vibrant spectacle of the jaripeo, a symbol of Mexican cowboy tradition and machismo, this story unveils a hidden world of queer desire and quiet rebellion. As glances and gestures disrupt the rigid norms of masculinity, the rodeo becomes a stage for our protagonists to navigate identity, community, and the search for belonging in an oppressively traditional space.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F1tOhwyRmwjsZzNm9b8DEtFh8c47.jpg', 'plex:movie:jaripeo-2026'),
  ('346382350460635090', 'Jarrapellejos', 1988, 'Drama', 'Antonio Giménez-Rico, Kuki López Rodero', 'Antonio Giménez-Rico, Manuel Gutiérrez Aragón', 'Antonio Ferrandis, Juan Diego, Lydia Bosch, Amparo Larrañaga, Jose Coronado, Joaquín Hinojosa, Miguel Rellán, Aitana Sánchez-Gijón', null, 'Pedro Jarrapellejos is a ladies man who cannot turn the heads of Isabel or her beautiful daughter. When both peasant women are found raped and murdered in a brutal scene, a schoolteacher is falsely accused. Pedro knows his own nephew and his friend participated in the killings, but he uses his considerable influence over the police and courts to intimidate the witnesses into silence.', 'Pedro Jarrapellejos is a ladies man who cannot turn the heads of Isabel or her beautiful daughter. When both peasant women are found raped and murdered in a brutal scene, a schoolteacher is falsely accused. Pedro knows his own nephew and his friend participated in the killings, but he uses his considerable influence over the police and courts to intimidate the witnesses into silence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sVHZO4uie3S70OUcIKmM6TFofl9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:263371'),
  ('1063371883141282843', 'Jarri Puter', 2003, 'Comedy', 'Roberto Rivera, Víctor Manuel Castro', null, 'Alfonso Zayas, Julio Alegría, Alexa Castillo, Jessica Farrell, Alfredo Galindo Reyes, Mario Zebadúa, Víctor Manuel Castro', null, 'Jarri Puter is a gay man who goes to a magic school and learns how to become a great wizard while dealing with his homosexuality.', 'Jarri Puter is a gay man who goes to a magic school and learns how to become a great wizard while dealing with his homosexuality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ArEg7NMZRDYts88OMfNWHvosA5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:388209'),
  ('354220625597198771', 'Jasmine Women', 2004, 'Drama, Family, Romance', 'Hou Yong, Yao Xiaofeng', 'Hou Yong', 'Zhang Ziyi, Joan Chen, Jiang Wen, Liu Ye, Lu Yi, Lin Dongfu, Huang Daliang, Ge Lili', null, 'Zhang Ziyi plays the youngest of three generations of women who leads lives in Shanghai. Joan Chen plays the great-grandmother, grandmother, and mother. The film recounts this family, the mistakes they make, and a cycle that the granddaughter breaks out of.', 'Zhang Ziyi plays the youngest of three generations of women who leads lives in Shanghai. Joan Chen plays the great-grandmother, grandmother, and mother. The film recounts this family, the mistakes they make, and a cycle that the granddaughter breaks out of.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gQ3Rir69yoiLWKXgBWbrFGxN9vr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44217'),
  ('178224615025434945', 'Jasminum', 2006, 'Comedy, Family', 'Jan Jakub Kolski, Krzysztof Ptak', 'Jan Jakub Kolski', 'Janusz Gajos, Grażyna Błęcka-Kolska, Wiktoria Gąsiewska, Adam Ferency, Krzysztof Pieczyński, Monika Dryl, Patrycja Soliman, Bogusław Linda', null, 'The peaceful world of a monastery, in a small town Jasmine, is destroyed by the arrival of monument restorers, Natasha, along with her daughter Eugenia. The legend associated with the monastery bode revelation in him a saint in the near future. Despite initial reluctance, Natasha starts the maintenance of the image stored there. The secrets of the monastery are unraveled: the unhappy lovers bodies placed in the catacombs, the secret elixir of love, created with the smell of the monks.', 'The peaceful world of a monastery, in a small town Jasmine, is destroyed by the arrival of monument restorers, Natasha, along with her daughter Eugenia. The legend associated with the monastery bode revelation in him a saint in the near future. Despite initial reluctance, Natasha starts the maintenance of the image stored there. The secrets of the monastery are unraveled: the unhappy lovers bodies placed in the catacombs, the secret elixir of love, created with the smell of the monks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/efwj4GntvKV0lqoehKu9NrCJuh0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113321'),
  ('188486521411534706', 'Jason and the Argonauts', 1963, 'Adventure, Family, Fantasy', 'Don Chaffey, Wilkie Cooper, Dennis Bertera', 'Jan Read, Beverley Cross', 'Todd Armstrong, Nancy Kovack, Gary Raymond, Laurence Naismith, Niall MacGinnis, Michael Gwynn, Douglas Wilmer, Jack Gwillim', 'G', 'Jason, a fearless sailor and explorer, returns to his home land of Thessaly after a long voyage to claim his rightful throne. He learns, however, that he must first find the magical Golden Fleece. To do so, he must embark on an epic quest fraught with fantastic monsters and terrible perils.', 'Jason, a fearless sailor and explorer, returns to his home land of Thessaly after a long voyage to claim his rightful throne. He learns, however, that he must first find the magical Golden Fleece. To do so, he must embark on an epic quest fraught with fantastic monsters and terrible perils.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xHVxIgqD5CxlOI5GHxvVSt5Zh5Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11533'),
  ('491223577011769840', 'Jason Bourne', 2016, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Paul Greengrass, Barry Ackroyd, Paul Inglis', 'Paul Greengrass, Christopher Rouse', 'Matt Damon, Tommy Lee Jones, Alicia Vikander, Vincent Cassel, Julia Stiles, Riz Ahmed, Ato Essandoh, Scott Shepherd', 'PG-13', 'The most dangerous former operative of the CIA is drawn out of hiding to uncover hidden truths about his past.', 'The most dangerous former operative of the CIA is drawn out of hiding to uncover hidden truths about his past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xA7N41glw17MBQtcWSm2eBlBRuG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:324668'),
  ('439044074644905067', 'Jason Goes to Hell: The Final Friday', 1993, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Adam Marcus, Bill Dill, Kelly Kiernan', 'Jay Huguely, Dean Lorey', 'Kane Hodder, John D. LeMay, Kari Keegan, Steven Williams, Steven Culp, Erin Gray, Rusty Schwimmer, Richard Gant', 'R', 'Jason Voorhees is tracked down and blown to bits by a special FBI task force, reborn with the bone-chilling ability to assume the identity of anyone he touches.', 'Jason Voorhees is tracked down and blown to bits by a special FBI task force, reborn with the bone-chilling ability to assume the identity of anyone he touches.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Aacq05foqiWdXqetFv02HBvMoJy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10285'),
  ('503011548218789575', 'Jason Lives - Friday the 13th Part VI', 1986, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Tom McLoughlin, Jon Kranhouse, Martin Walters', 'Tom McLoughlin', 'Thom Mathews, Jennifer Cooke, David Kagen, Renée Jones, Kerry Noonan, Darcy DeMoss, Tom Fridley, Alan Blumenfeld', 'R', 'Tommy Jarvis, tormented by the fear that maybe Jason isn''t really dead, unwittingly resurrects the mass murderer for another bloody rampage.', 'Tommy Jarvis, tormented by the fear that maybe Jason isn''t really dead, unwittingly resurrects the mass murderer for another bloody rampage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6vdUpHvkspQonXBdWcLWW5ciEPJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10225'),
  ('441266289998276474', 'Jason X', 2001, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Derick V. Underschultz, James Isaac, Penny Charter', 'Todd Farmer', 'Kane Hodder, Jeff Geddis, Lexa Doig, David Cronenberg, Markus Parilo, Jonathan Potts, Lisa Ryder, Dov Tiefenbach', 'R', 'In the year 2455, Old Earth is now a contaminated planet abandoned for centuries -- a brown world of violent storms, toxic landmasses and poisonous seas. Yet humans have returned to the deadly place that they once fled, not to live, but to research the ancient, rusting artifacts of the long-gone civilizations. But it''s not the harmful environment that could prove fatal to the intrepid, young explorers who have just landed on Old Earth. For them, it''s Friday the 13th, and Jason lives!', 'In the year 2455, Old Earth is now a contaminated planet abandoned for centuries -- a brown world of violent storms, toxic landmasses and poisonous seas. Yet humans have returned to the deadly place that they once fled, not to live, but to research the ancient, rusting artifacts of the long-gone civilizations. But it''s not the harmful environment that could prove fatal to the intrepid, young explorers who have just landed on Old Earth. For them, it''s Friday the 13th, and Jason lives!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ggOND0hfoE0f3K857joSzEeIchb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11470'),
  ('234692995096576840', 'Jason''s Lyric', 1994, 'Crime, Drama, Romance', 'Doug McHenry, Francis Kenny', 'Bobby Smith Jr.', 'Allen Payne, Jada Pinkett Smith, Bokeem Woodbine, Eddie Griffin, Suzzanne Douglas, Lisa Nicole Carson, Lahmard J. Tate, Forest Whitaker', 'R', 'The story of a young man who must confront his own fears about love as well as his relationships with family and friends.', 'The story of a young man who must confront his own fears about love as well as his relationships with family and friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2dXA5dNh3kqDQwRt08TxxgldTOW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22067'),
  ('1142200218039210818', 'Jasper Jones', 2017, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Rachel Perkins, Mark Wareham', 'Shaun Grant, Craig Silvey', 'Levi Miller, Aaron L. McGrath, Angourie Rice, Toni Collette, Dan Wyllie, Hugo Weaving, Kevin Long, Matt Nable', 'PG-13', 'Fourteen-year-old Charlie''s life changes when Jasper takes his help to dispose of the body of his girlfriend, Laura. He decides to look for the murderer and falls in love with Laura''s younger sister.', 'Fourteen-year-old Charlie''s life changes when Jasper takes his help to dispose of the body of his girlfriend, Laura. He decides to look for the murderer and falls in love with Laura''s younger sister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kB0fpfm0aArdBOdokVXUxS3rxtP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:414027'),
  ('457755016390246764', 'Jassy', 1947, 'Adventure, Drama, Romance', 'Bernard Knowles, Geoffrey Unsworth', 'Dorothy Christie, Campbell Christie, Geoffrey Kerr', 'Margaret Lockwood, Patricia Roc, Dennis Price, Basil Sydney, Dermot Walsh, Esma Cannon, Cathleen Nesbitt, Linden Travers', null, 'In 19th century England, Jassy is a young Gypsy girl blessed with the gift of second sight. Pursued by superstitious villagers, she is rescued by the son of the owner of Mordelaine, a vast stately home. Unfortunately, his father''s drinking and gambling threaten the very ownership of the house. Despite her humble origins as a servant girl, Jassy must try to use her talents to climb the social ladder and save Mordelaine for the man whom she loves.', 'In 19th century England, Jassy is a young Gypsy girl blessed with the gift of second sight. Pursued by superstitious villagers, she is rescued by the son of the owner of Mordelaine, a vast stately home. Unfortunately, his father''s drinking and gambling threaten the very ownership of the house. Despite her humble origins as a servant girl, Jassy must try to use her talents to climb the social ladder and save Mordelaine for the man whom she loves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2cFQpXG6F0S2Rrv9tOp3IrYTIrb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:254141'),
  ('827218386829809502', 'Jathi Ratnalu', 2021, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Radhan, Anudeep, Siddam Manohar', 'Anudeep', 'Naveen Polishetty, Priyadarshi Pullikonda, Rahul Ramakrishna, Faria Abdullah, Murali Sharma, Brahmaji, Brahmanandam, Tanikella Bharani', null, 'Three young men leave their village to find decent jobs in the city. However, they find themselves in a pickle when a minister blackmails them for a lost mobile phone.', 'Three young men leave their village to find decent jobs in the city. However, they find themselves in a pickle when a minister blackmails them for a lost mobile phone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7MzvmgHRmhbJH1UZJhRCkAtxvEy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:796368'),
