  ('476866978595999995', 'Jaya Jaya Jaya Jaya Hey', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Bablu Aju, Vipin Das, Savin Sa', 'Nashid Mohammad Famy, Vipin Das', 'Darshana Rajendran, Basil Joseph, Aju Varghese, Azees Nedumangad, Sudheer Paravoor, Manju Pillai, Anand Manmadhan, Hareesh Pengan', null, 'Jayabharathi who was denied every simple joy in life while growing up just because she is a girl/woman is married to Rajesh, a male chauvinist, short-tempered and selfish person. On suffering domestic violence, she doesn''t get any support. She then decides to fight back!', 'Jayabharathi who was denied every simple joy in life while growing up just because she is a girl/woman is married to Rajesh, a male chauvinist, short-tempered and selfish person. On suffering domestic violence, she doesn''t get any support. She then decides to fight back!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lAc6mHHJxmiAbkxrF0TipvRRZW7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:931132'),
  ('1083022847320146718', 'Jayantabhai Ki Luv Story', 2013, 'Action, Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Vinnil Markan, Santosh Thundiyil', 'Kiran Kotrial', 'Vivek Oberoi, Neha Sharma, Zakir Hussain, Nassar, Raj Singh Arora, Rahul Singh, Falguni Rajani, Vishwanath Chatterjee', null, 'A street thug with a soft heart and a young, hot-headed former company executive end up as neighbours.', 'A street thug with a soft heart and a young, hot-headed former company executive end up as neighbours.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ywbYwfKoY8WZYHLJLHn2btlJoD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:189542'),
  ('394955175117749505', 'Jayeshbhai Jordaar', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Shanoo Sharma, Siddharth Diwan, Divyang Thakkar', 'Divyang Thakkar', 'Ranveer Singh, Shalini Pandey, Boman Irani, Ratna Pathak Shah, Jia Vaidya, Puneet Issar, Swati Das, Soumita Samanta', null, 'A non-confrontational Jayesh decides to defy his patriarchal family and flee with his pregnant wife Mudra to save their unborn daughter from foeticide. A screwball, hilarious chase begins as Jayesh''s father assembles all his might to nab them. Will this unlikely hero manage to create a safe and equal haven for his daughter?', 'A non-confrontational Jayesh decides to defy his patriarchal family and flee with his pregnant wife Mudra to save their unborn daughter from foeticide. A screwball, hilarious chase begins as Jayesh''s father assembles all his might to nab them. Will this unlikely hero manage to create a safe and equal haven for his daughter?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dv93VspYwwNPbvdB0AcddhiDrGU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:678999'),
  ('190131454196146755', 'Jayne Mansfield''s Car', 2013, 'Drama, Romance', 'Billy Bob Thornton, Barry Markowitz, Nicole LeBlanc', 'Tom Epperson, Billy Bob Thornton', 'Kevin Bacon, Tippi Hedren, Shawnee Smith, Ray Stevenson, John Hurt, Robert Duvall, Billy Bob Thornton, Frances O''Connor', 'R', 'Alabama; 1969: The death of a clan''s estranged wife and mother brings together two very different families. The scars of the past hide differences that will either tear them apart or expose truths that could lead to unexpected collisions.', 'Alabama; 1969: The death of a clan''s estranged wife and mother brings together two very different families. The scars of the past hide differences that will either tear them apart or expose truths that could lead to unexpected collisions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/52B13wFJFd4DhM9txFbmsiuVomE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94671'),
