  ('748399744543523821', 'JCVD', 2008, 'Drama, Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Mabrouk El Mechri, Pierre-Yves Bastard', 'Christophe Turpin, Mabrouk El Mechri', 'Jean-Claude Van Damme, François Damiens, Zinedine Soualem, Karim Belkhadra, Jean-François Wolff, Anne Paulicevich, John Flanders, Janine Horsburgh', 'R', 'Between his tax problems and his legal battle with his wife for the custody of his daughter, these are hard times for the action movie star who finds that even Steven Seagal has pinched a role from him! This fictionalized version of Jean-Claude Van Damme returns to the country of his birth to seek the peace and tranquility he can no longer enjoy in the United States, but inadvertently gets involved in a bank robbery with hostages.', 'Between his tax problems and his legal battle with his wife for the custody of his daughter, these are hard times for the action movie star who finds that even Steven Seagal has pinched a role from him! This fictionalized version of Jean-Claude Van Damme returns to the country of his birth to seek the peace and tranquility he can no longer enjoy in the United States, but inadvertently gets involved in a bank robbery with hostages.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8fdLq1X9n770THGtGDx2e74ETvE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13672'),
  ('808248898835127389', 'Je ne suis pas un héros', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Bruno Laurec, Rudy Milstein, Noélène Delluc', 'Rudy Milstein, Théo Courtial, Gaëlle Macé', 'Vincent Dedienne, Clémence Poésy, Géraldine Nakache, Isabelle Nanty, Sam Karmann, Rabah Nait Oufella, Johann Dionnet, Anna Cervinka', null, 'Louis is a super nice guy. But in his lawyer''s office, this is not a compliment. When his doctor wrongly diagnoses a serious disease, his colleagues behaviour changes : they care about him, they ask him questions and they listen his answers. Finally, Louis exists ! So, obviously, he hesitates over telling the truth.', 'Louis is a super nice guy. But in his lawyer''s office, this is not a compliment. When his doctor wrongly diagnoses a serious disease, his colleagues behaviour changes : they care about him, they ask him questions and they listen his answers. Finally, Louis exists ! So, obviously, he hesitates over telling the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qH8p6c3P7wruLcckGpxdoA0BrKG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1004255'),
  ('722312862509032220', 'Je règle mon pas sur le pas de mon père', 1999, 'Comedy', 'Rémi Waterhouse, Patrick Blossier', 'Eric Vicaut, Rémi Waterhouse', 'Jean Yanne, Guillaume Canet, Laurence Côte, Yves Rénier, Philippe Laudenbach, Jean-Claude Durand, Jean-Claude Cotillard, François Rollin', null, 'Sauveur (Savior) needs someone to save him, and so he begins to look for his father, a fast- talking ladies'' man. The son becomes attached to his misanthropic father, and soon a crippled woman photographer and a gigolo with a killer smile also enter the scene, and the situation becomes more and more impossible.', 'Sauveur (Savior) needs someone to save him, and so he begins to look for his father, a fast- talking ladies'' man. The son becomes attached to his misanthropic father, and soon a crippled woman photographer and a gigolo with a killer smile also enter the scene, and the situation becomes more and more impossible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bxlUU6JDHOMyj9twdpvi0RnCPPk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67653'),
  ('616220774020962596', 'Je suis Charlie', 2015, 'Documentary, History, Crime, Drama', 'Emmanuel Leconte, Daniel LeConte, Damien Girault', 'Daniel LeConte, Emmanuel Leconte', 'Élisabeth Badinter, Gérard Biard, Charb, Cabu, Marika Bret, Riss, Eric Portheault', null, 'This new documentary by the father-and-son directing team of Daniel and Emmanuel Leconte pays tribute to the 11 journalists of the French satirical magazine Charlie Hebdo who were killed in the January 2015 attack by radical Islamic extremists.', 'This new documentary by the father-and-son directing team of Daniel and Emmanuel Leconte pays tribute to the 11 journalists of the French satirical magazine Charlie Hebdo who were killed in the January 2015 attack by radical Islamic extremists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ymwptzwT1QjnrfihrKaSV01fUr9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:358761'),
  ('409064473986201454', 'Je suis Karl', 2021, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Frank Lamm, Christian Schwochow', 'Thomas Wendrich', 'Luna Wedler, Jannis Niewöhner, Milan Peschel, Edin Hasanović, Anna Fialová, Fleur Geffrier, Johann-Christof Laubisch, Aziz Dyab', 'R', 'An explosion sends fear and terror through Berlin. Young Maxi''s home is reduced to rubble and ashes, burying her mother and little brothers. Only she and her father survive the terrorist bomb attack. When she happens to meet the charismatic Karl, who tells her about a conference for young people in Prague, she seizes the opportunity to flee Berlin and her grieving father. The political movement behind the meeting claims to be working for a better Europe. Maxi has no idea how close the murderers really are to her family.', 'An explosion sends fear and terror through Berlin. Young Maxi''s home is reduced to rubble and ashes, burying her mother and little brothers. Only she and her father survive the terrorist bomb attack. When she happens to meet the charismatic Karl, who tells her about a conference for young people in Prague, she seizes the opportunity to flee Berlin and her grieving father. The political movement behind the meeting claims to be working for a better Europe. Maxi has no idea how close the murderers really are to her family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gQJcTlIfLJayp5TdlvFzwh9gtMp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:683641'),
