  ('436215469607048553', 'Je t''aime', 2010, 'Animation, Science Fiction', 'Mamoru Oshii', null, null, null, 'Set in Tokyo in the near future, when all humanity has been wiped out, a lonely basset hound wanders around a deserted city. Its only wish is to feel the warmth of a human being once more.', 'Set in Tokyo in the near future, when all humanity has been wiped out, a lonely basset hound wanders around a deserted city. Its only wish is to feel the warmth of a human being once more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rP7xdPrHRzeurLwemEIlRu7ogSa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:265829'),
  ('478267802406044909', 'Je t''aime John Wayne', 2000, 'Comedy', 'Toby MacDonald', 'Luke Ponte', 'Kris Marshall, Camilla Rutherford, Laura Lumley, Mark Rex', null, 'Belmonde lives in 1990s London as an iconic , cool Frenchman modelled on the new wave cinema of the 1960s. Really he is English and middle class – a fact that his family won''t let him forget!', 'Belmonde lives in 1990s London as an iconic , cool Frenchman modelled on the new wave cinema of the 1960s. Really he is English and middle class – a fact that his family won''t let him forget!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t1pTaZ0PIYg0UUu3nAbeY5fs870.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49301'),
  ('1073023557842304666', 'Je T''Aime, Je T''Aime', 1968, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'Alain Resnais, Jean Boffety, Jean Lefèvre', 'Jacques Sternberg', 'Claude Rich, Olga Georges-Picot, Anouk Ferjac, Van Doude, Claire Duhamel, Bernard Fresson, Irène Tunc, Carla Marlier', null, 'Recovering from an attempted suicide, a man is selected to participate in a time travel experiment that has only been tested on mice. A malfunction in the experiment causes the man to experience moments from his past in a random order.', 'Recovering from an attempted suicide, a man is selected to participate in a time travel experiment that has only been tested on mice. A malfunction in the experiment causes the man to experience moments from his past in a random order.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A5jRNmJHFkY8mQAFO4SOocm8ZrS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4798'),
  ('413969613479785250', 'Je te veux moi non plus', 2021, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Rodolphe Lauga', null, 'Inès Reg, Kévin Debonne, Laurie Peret, Pauline Clément, Anthony Sonigo, Constance Labbé, Michèle Garcia, Fadila Belkebla', null, 'Nina and Dylan, best friends since childhood, have no secrets from each other. Nina now lives in Paris, while Dylan lives in Biarritz. Dylan always thought they''d end up together, but has never seriously taken a chance on Nina, since she laughs at him every time he mentions a future together. When Nina leaves her boyfriend and decides to go to Biarritz for an impromptu vacation with her two best friends, something finally clicks. Dylan has just started a relationship with her latest date, and Nina realizes that he''s the one for her! Full of twists and turns, their love story is going to be much more complicated than expected.', 'Nina and Dylan, best friends since childhood, have no secrets from each other. Nina now lives in Paris, while Dylan lives in Biarritz. Dylan always thought they''d end up together, but has never seriously taken a chance on Nina, since she laughs at him every time he mentions a future together. When Nina leaves her boyfriend and decides to go to Biarritz for an impromptu vacation with her two best friends, something finally clicks. Dylan has just started a relationship with her latest date, and Nina realizes that he''s the one for her! Full of twists and turns, their love story is going to be much more complicated than expected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8eevR507AolRD8w45TnJKaRmyDm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:799844'),
