  ('136409567161799229', 'Je vais mieux', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Jean-Pierre Améris, Matthieu Poirot-Delpech', 'Jean-Pierre Améris', 'Éric Elmosnino, Ary Abittan, Judith El Zein, Alice Pol, François Berléand, Henri Guybet, Lise Lamétrie, Maud Baecker', null, 'A fifty-year-old man suffers from a sore back. All the world''s doctors, radiologists, and oesteopaths can do nothing for him : the roots of his illness are pyschological. But what should he change about his work, his wife and his family in order to get better ?', 'A fifty-year-old man suffers from a sore back. All the world''s doctors, radiologists, and oesteopaths can do nothing for him : the roots of his illness are pyschological. But what should he change about his work, his wife and his family in order to get better ?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6VUtghV1BJzDhBCuVQxwPoWOxrU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:474313'),
