  ('645073995254578778', 'Jean-Claude Van Damme: Karate King', 2023, 'Documentary, TV Movie', 'Thomas Labourasse, Denis Dufays, Marie Pannetrat', 'Olivier Monssens', 'Claude Goetz, Philippe Graton, Michel Qissi, Monette Loza, Marc Duvinage, Vincent Fannoy, Sheldon Lettich, Cédric Delelée', null, 'An American low-budget action film celebrated an unexpected worldwide success in 1988: "Bloodsport". With its, the world of film fans and martial arts cinema discovered a new idol: Jean-Claude Van Damme. In the 1970s there was Bruce Lee, but at the end of the 1980s a Belgian won the day. Van Damme was a karate master and had unparalleled strength and flexibility. For ten years he was one of Hollywood''s hottest action stars. But excessive overconfidence and drugs bring him down again. At home in Europe he becomes a laughing stock on talk shows. Only with "JCVD" does he manage to get back on his feet, playing his character with perspective and self-irony, but without ever giving up the reputation that his action films brought him and which has been a cult for several generations. The highs and lows of his eventful life are told through archive footage and contributions from people close to the popular Belgian actor.', 'An American low-budget action film celebrated an unexpected worldwide success in 1988: "Bloodsport". With its, the world of film fans and martial arts cinema discovered a new idol: Jean-Claude Van Damme. In the 1970s there was Bruce Lee, but at the end of the 1980s a Belgian won the day. Van Damme was a karate master and had unparalleled strength and flexibility. For ten years he was one of Hollywood''s hottest action stars. But excessive overconfidence and drugs bring him down again. At home in Europe he becomes a laughing stock on talk shows. Only with "JCVD" does he manage to get back on his feet, playing his character with perspective and self-irony, but without ever giving up the reputation that his action films brought him and which has been a cult for several generations. The highs and lows of his eventful life are told through archive footage and contributions from people close to the popular Belgian actor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1UrweOtMOmXGuYWIpz56sOtjDGA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1103705'),
  ('115103229257264484', 'Jean-Philippe', 2006, 'Comedy, Music', 'Laurent Tuel, Catherine Pujol, Olivier Coutard', 'Laurent Tuel, Christophe Turpin', 'Fabrice Luchini, Johnny Hallyday, Guilaine Londez, Antoine Duléry, Élodie Bollée, Olivier Gueritée, Jackie Berroyer, Caroline Cellier', null, 'A bourgeois office drone whose raison d''être is the music of French rocker Johnny Hallyday awakens one day in an alternate universe where the famed musician never recorded a single song. When he’s not at the office dutifully plugging-away, Fabrice lives a deadly dull life.', 'A bourgeois office drone whose raison d''être is the music of French rocker Johnny Hallyday awakens one day in an alternate universe where the famed musician never recorded a single song. When he’s not at the office dutifully plugging-away, Fabrice lives a deadly dull life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ItX0Pueg1a4tWAJx0jigYkYkHa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13713'),
  ('411703621888708221', 'Jeanne and the Perfect Guy', 1998, 'Drama, Romance', 'Olivier Ducastel, Jacques Martineau, Matthieu Poirot-Delpech', 'Jacques Martineau, Olivier Ducastel', 'Mathieu Demy, Virginie Ledoyen, Jacques Bonnaffé, Valérie Bonneton, Frédéric Gorny, Nelly Borgeaud, Denis Podalydès, Olivier Nicklaus', 'NR', 'Jeanne, a receptionist at a travel agency, is looking for the love of her life. She thinks she has finally found it with Olivier. However, Olivier reveals he has AIDS and disappears from her life after her profession of love and confession of infidelity.', 'Jeanne, a receptionist at a travel agency, is looking for the love of her life. She thinks she has finally found it with Olivier. However, Olivier reveals he has AIDS and disappears from her life after her profession of love and confession of infidelity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eXVPHK4FFqZsjhAoEYLn8g1ZzSG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25512'),
  ('673840922882732791', 'Jeanne Dielman, 23, quai du Commerce, 1080 Bruxelles', 1976, 'Drama', 'Chantal Akerman, Babette Mangolte, Jean-Pol Ferbus', 'Chantal Akerman', 'Delphine Seyrig, Jan Decorte, Henri Storck, Jacques Doniol-Valcroze, Yves Bical, Chantal Akerman', 'NR', 'A lonely young widow lives with her son following an immutable order: while the boy is in school, she cares for their apartment, does chores, and receives clients in the afternoon.', 'A lonely young widow lives with her son following an immutable order: while the boy is in school, she cares for their apartment, does chores, and receives clients in the afternoon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fqfSu8Y1YSVFkoCJyiTXI6woYma.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44012'),
  ('722543967382284009', 'Jeanne du Barry', 2023, 'Drama, History, Romance', 'Elise Vogel, Maïwenn, Frédéric Gérard', 'Teddy Lussi-Modeste, Nicolas Livecchi, Maïwenn', 'Maïwenn, Johnny Depp, Benjamin Lavernhe, Melvil Poupaud, Robin Renucci, Pierre Richard, Marianne Basler, Caroline Chaniolleau', null, 'The life of Jeanne Bécu, who was born as the illegitimate daughter of an impoverished seamstress in 1743 and went on to rise through the Court of Louis XV to become his last official mistress.', 'The life of Jeanne Bécu, who was born as the illegitimate daughter of an impoverished seamstress in 1743 and went on to rise through the Court of Louis XV to become his last official mistress.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rSTtGXebezwZ6GVTeZVaeJ9ZQF1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:921452'),
  ('574560834421786568', 'Jeanne Eagels', 1957, 'Drama', 'George Sidney, Robert H. Planck, Charles S. Gould', 'Daniel Fuchs, Sonya Levien, John Fante', 'Kim Novak, Jeff Chandler, Agnes Moorehead, Charles Drake, Larry Gates, Virginia Grey, Gene Lockhart, Joe De Santis', 'NR', 'Biographical film based loosely on the life of 1920s stage star Jeanne Eagels.', 'Biographical film based loosely on the life of 1920s stage star Jeanne Eagels.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6mjpfMkQ0plY99qhcf0KkL3GnMS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142254'),
  ('905563157754656328', 'Jeannette: The Childhood of Joan of Arc', 2017, 'Drama', 'Bruno Dumont, Guillaume Deffontaines', 'Bruno Dumont', 'Lise Leplat Prudhomme, Jeanne Voisin, Lucile Gauthier, Victoria Lefebvre, Aline Charles, Élise Charles, Nicolas Leclaire, Gery De Poorter', null, 'France, 1425. During the Hundred Years’ War, Jeannette, age of 8, looks after her sheep in the small village of Domremy. One day she tells her friend Hauviette how she cannot bear the suffering caused by the English. Madame Gervaise, a nun, tries to reason with the young girl, but she is ready to take up arms for the salvation of souls and the liberation of the Kingdom of France. Carried by her faith, she will become Joan of Arc.', 'France, 1425. During the Hundred Years’ War, Jeannette, age of 8, looks after her sheep in the small village of Domremy. One day she tells her friend Hauviette how she cannot bear the suffering caused by the English. Madame Gervaise, a nun, tries to reason with the young girl, but she is ready to take up arms for the salvation of souls and the liberation of the Kingdom of France. Carried by her faith, she will become Joan of Arc.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n8Pw8fO2AV6JQVC6qagBIofJMaI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:399049'),
  ('1071429833104386885', 'Jeanny - The Fifth Girl', 2022, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'Josef Mittendorfer, Judith Limberger, Andreas Kopriva', 'Thorsten Wettcke, Andreas Karlström', 'Theresa Riess, Manuel Rubey, Patricia Aulitzky, Steffen Schroeder, Laura Bilgeri, Eva Herzig, Zeynep Buyrac, Johann Nikolussi', null, 'In Mödling, a small town near Vienna, girls between the ages of 18 and 20 have been disappearing without a trace at ever shorter intervals for the past 13 years. Residents are worried and accuse the police of incompetence. In this environment of fear and mistrust, the 19-year-old schoolgirl Jeanny meets the mysterious but charming tax consultant Johannes, which initially has something threatening about it. But Johannes sees more in Jeanny than just an innocent girl. And he gives Jeanny, who lost her father at a young age, support and recognition. He helps her to pass the Matura, he awakens her self-confidence and gives her the appreciation that she misses. An unusual love grows between the two, which is initially kept secret from everyone. As she is drawn deeper and deeper into the whirl of her feelings, the aggressive climate in the town continues to escalate. A militia is formed. Jeanny is becoming increasingly insecure. Can she really trust Johannes?', 'In Mödling, a small town near Vienna, girls between the ages of 18 and 20 have been disappearing without a trace at ever shorter intervals for the past 13 years. Residents are worried and accuse the police of incompetence. In this environment of fear and mistrust, the 19-year-old schoolgirl Jeanny meets the mysterious but charming tax consultant Johannes, which initially has something threatening about it. But Johannes sees more in Jeanny than just an innocent girl. And he gives Jeanny, who lost her father at a young age, support and recognition. He helps her to pass the Matura, he awakens her self-confidence and gives her the appreciation that she misses. An unusual love grows between the two, which is initially kept secret from everyone. As she is drawn deeper and deeper into the whirl of her feelings, the aggressive climate in the town continues to escalate. A militia is formed. Jeanny is becoming increasingly insecure. Can she really trust Johannes?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/goWq9aywlh3C8dLxaroBBaA5eAx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:932691'),
  ('786619750429751414', 'Jeans', 1998, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance, Music', 'Shankar, Ashok Kumar Agarwal, S. P. Hosimin', 'Shankar', 'Prashanth, Aishwarya Rai Bachchan, Nassar, Lakshmi, Raju Sundaram, Radikaa Sarathkumar, Senthil, S.Ve. Sekar', null, 'The father of twin brothers wants to get them married to only twin sisters. But one of the brothers falls in love with a woman does not have a twin sister.', 'The father of twin brothers wants to get them married to only twin sisters. But one of the brothers falls in love with a woman does not have a twin sister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uICyDD1FuQIjAm0M0gL6wq5RgPZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30086'),
  ('347057794803358019', 'Jeans and T-Shirt', 1983, 'Music, Comedy, Romance', 'Mariano Laurenti', 'Franco Calabrese', 'Nino D''Angelo, Roberta Olivieri, Bombolo, Enzo Cannavale, Gabriele Villa, Benito Artesi, Dino Somma, Fiorella Masselli', null, 'Nino is a young and poor boy who meets Annamaria, a rich spoiled girl who''s on holiday with his father in Capri.', 'Nino is a young and poor boy who meets Annamaria, a rich spoiled girl who''s on holiday with his father in Capri.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8bmORtu7vlVdCK6B5NF0ICnx8Qd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:194257'),
  ('46503844897542273', 'Jeca Tatu', 1959, 'Comedy', 'Milton Amaral, Rudolf Icsey', 'Milton Amaral', 'Amacio Mazzaropi, Geny Prado, Roberto Duval, Nicolau Guzzardi, Nena Viana, Marlene França, Francisco Di Franco, Miriam Rony', null, 'Jeca Tatu is a lazy, simple-minded guy who has his property threatened by the greed of a landowner.', 'Jeca Tatu is a lazy, simple-minded guy who has his property threatened by the greed of a landowner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zFd1IzwexpicNpfndRYBALcC6Qn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120753'),
  ('833423892113344159', 'Jeepers Creepers', 1939, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Horror', 'Robert Clampett', null, 'Mel Blanc, Pinto Colvig', null, 'Police officer Porky is called to investigate strange noises at a house that might be haunted. Before he arrives, we tour the house and hear some evil-sounding cackles, which, it turns out, are coming from a radio – one that a ghost was listening to. The ghost then sings the title song while getting ready for a night of haunting, just as Porky arrives. The ghost invites him in with a woman''s voice, then disappears. Porky comes in and gets spooked by some flapping curtains. When he comes back in, the ghost puts a couple of frogs into a pair of shoes and sets them loose; they collect a hatrack and a curtain, forming a sort of black ghost that ultimately scares Porky upstairs, right into the arms of the ghost.', 'Police officer Porky is called to investigate strange noises at a house that might be haunted. Before he arrives, we tour the house and hear some evil-sounding cackles, which, it turns out, are coming from a radio – one that a ghost was listening to. The ghost then sings the title song while getting ready for a night of haunting, just as Porky arrives. The ghost invites him in with a woman''s voice, then disappears. Porky comes in and gets spooked by some flapping curtains. When he comes back in, the ghost puts a couple of frogs into a pair of shoes and sets them loose; they collect a hatrack and a curtain, forming a sort of black ghost that ultimately scares Porky upstairs, right into the arms of the ghost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i7kWlYHTbsRb7wM2BnhVrxIoMgc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:205254'),
  ('108559787895426370', 'Jeepers Creepers', 2001, 'Horror', 'Don E. FauntLeRoy, Victor Salva, George Bamber', 'Victor Salva', 'Gina Philips, Justin Long, Jonathan Breck, Patricia Belcher, Eileen Brennan, Brandon Smith, Peggy Sheffield, Jeffrey William Evans', 'R', 'On a desolate country highway, two homeward-bound teens are nearly run off the road by a maniac in a beat-up truck, and later spot him shoving what appears to be a body down a sewer pipe.', 'On a desolate country highway, two homeward-bound teens are nearly run off the road by a maniac in a beat-up truck, and later spot him shoving what appears to be a body down a sewer pipe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g410Y1U1ELbmJG14Zru3UAimm1G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8922'),
  ('601493327297495193', 'Jeepers Creepers 2', 2003, 'Horror', 'Don E. FauntLeRoy, Victor Salva, Mark Anthony Little', 'Victor Salva', 'Travis Schiffner, Ray Wise, Jonathan Breck, Al Santos, Nicki Aycox, Eric Nenninger, Marieh Delfino, Tom Tarantini', 'R', 'When their bus is crippled on the side of a deserted road, a team of high school athletes discover an opponent they cannot defeat – and may not survive.', 'When their bus is crippled on the side of a deserted road, a team of high school athletes discover an opponent they cannot defeat – and may not survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u2ghDfjcs3y5c8ata3COc4pWiAN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11351'),
  ('142795167503649846', 'Jeepers Creepers 3', 2017, 'Horror', 'Victor Salva, Don E. FauntLeRoy, Ari Golan', 'Victor Salva', 'Stan Shaw, Gabrielle Haugh, Jonathan Breck, Brandon Smith, Meg Foster, Jordan Salloum, Joyce Giraud, Chester Rushing', 'R', 'Taking place on the last day of the Creeper’s twenty-three-day feeding frenzy, as the skeptical Sergeant Tubbs teams up with a task force hellbent on destroying the Creeper for good. The Creeper fights back in gory glory as its enemies grow closer than ever before to learning the secret of its dark origins.', 'Taking place on the last day of the Creeper’s twenty-three-day feeding frenzy, as the skeptical Sergeant Tubbs teams up with a task force hellbent on destroying the Creeper for good. The Creeper fights back in gory glory as its enemies grow closer than ever before to learning the secret of its dark origins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pK7ge28ubs45av9aGEbVWW7ZbA8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55341'),
  ('304080994519088056', 'Jeepers Creepers: Reborn', 2022, 'Horror', 'Simon Rowling, Timo Vuorensola', 'Sean-Michael Argo', 'Sydney Craven, Imran Adams, Jarreau Benjamin, Peter Brooke, Ocean Navarro, Matt Barkley, Dee Wallace, Gary Graham', 'R', 'Forced to travel to a horror festival with her boyfriend, a young woman begins experiencing premonitions associated with the urban myth of The Creeper. She believes that something supernatural has been summoned — and that she is at the center of it all.', 'Forced to travel to a horror festival with her boyfriend, a young woman begins experiencing premonitions associated with the urban myth of The Creeper. She believes that something supernatural has been summoned — and that she is at the center of it all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aGBuiirBIQ7o64FmJxO53eYDuro.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:717728'),
  ('557561854536085552', 'Jeet', 1996, 'Action, Romance', 'Raj Kanwar, Harmeet Singh', 'Raj Kanwar', 'Sunny Deol, Salman Khan, Karisma Kapoor, Tabu, Amrish Puri, Alok Nath, Dalip Tahil, Mohan Joshi', null, 'The story of a hitman who kills for the mob, but on one job he falls madly in love with a girl, who happens to be the beautiful daughter of an associate.', 'The story of a hitman who kills for the mob, but on one job he falls madly in love with a girl, who happens to be the beautiful daughter of an associate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rc16sRaw8S4EnXZFcwywdks97LG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:141613'),
  ('1011487157795478362', 'Jefe', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Sergio Barrejón', 'Natxo López, Marta Sofia Martins', 'Luis Callejo, Juana Acosta, Carlo D''Ursi, Josean Bengoetxea, Bárbara Santa-Cruz, Maica Barroso, Dailia Carmo, Adam Jezierski', null, 'Cesar is ''the boss'', the one everyone hates, the one some flatter and the one nobody tells the truth; the great successful businessman is on the edge of the precipice. One night his actions crumble down, his partners betray him and his wife kicks him out of the house. Entrenched in his office, he tries relentlessly to recover his company and his life. But he will not do it alone, César will find a very special ally, Ariana, the cleaner of the night shift.', 'Cesar is ''the boss'', the one everyone hates, the one some flatter and the one nobody tells the truth; the great successful businessman is on the edge of the precipice. One night his actions crumble down, his partners betray him and his wife kicks him out of the house. Entrenched in his office, he tries relentlessly to recover his company and his life. But he will not do it alone, César will find a very special ally, Ariana, the cleaner of the night shift.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xR9kYBmJ5JZBdDtS9CIziHdKTSD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:517298'),
  ('667795512335989896', 'Jeff Dunham: Arguing with Myself', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Manny Rodriguez', 'Jeff Dunham', 'Jeff Dunham', null, 'A recorded live performance of ventriloquist Jeff Dunham portrays a comedian whose revival of an old-fashioned art has made ventriloquism more relevant to modern societal concerns. Starring his six main characters, from Bubba Jay, a Nascar-obsessed hick, to Peanut, a flamboyant gay monkey, Dunham’s puppets have dirty but inoffensive senses of humor that mock the American Dream.', 'A recorded live performance of ventriloquist Jeff Dunham portrays a comedian whose revival of an old-fashioned art has made ventriloquism more relevant to modern societal concerns. Starring his six main characters, from Bubba Jay, a Nascar-obsessed hick, to Peanut, a flamboyant gay monkey, Dunham’s puppets have dirty but inoffensive senses of humor that mock the American Dream.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wh5KAy9lGcf7z9yv1Ax8hHVdUU2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14542'),
  ('902004902448116181', 'Jeff Dunham: Spark of Insanity', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Michael Simon', 'Jeff Dunham', 'Jeff Dunham, Paige Dunham', 'PG-13', 'Combining his amazing talent and his unorthodox sense of humor, Jeff Dunham returns, yet again, with a hilarious stand-up comedy and ventriloquist performance. Starting off with the infamously known Walter, scrutinizing every bit of today''s American society. Followed by two new characters, Achmed the Dead Terrorist, who continuously threatens the crowd with Silence and Death, and Melvin the Superhero.', 'Combining his amazing talent and his unorthodox sense of humor, Jeff Dunham returns, yet again, with a hilarious stand-up comedy and ventriloquist performance. Starting off with the infamously known Walter, scrutinizing every bit of today''s American society. Followed by two new characters, Achmed the Dead Terrorist, who continuously threatens the crowd with Silence and Death, and Melvin the Superhero.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8HB4miftuPSJr7kCaS9MenC3PJt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14540'),
