  ('752455754418870979', 'Jeff Ross: Take a Banana for the Ride', 2026, 'Comedy', 'Stephen Kessler', 'Jeff Ross', 'Jeff Ross', 'TV-MA', 'Legendary comic Jeff Ross makes his Broadway debut with a one-man show that''s both heartfelt and hilarious.', 'Legendary comic Jeff Ross makes his Broadway debut with a one-man show that''s both heartfelt and hilarious.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FLWFJ6K3FF9G04z1Ntq9SigLMjt.jpg', 'plex:movie:jeff-ross-take-a-banana-for-the-ride'),
  ('988229078400099862', 'Jeff, Who Lives at Home', 2012, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Mark Duplass, Jay Duplass, Jas Shelton', 'Jay Duplass, Mark Duplass', 'Jason Segel, Ed Helms, Susan Sarandon, Judy Greer, Rae Dawn Chong, Steve Zissis, Evan Ross, Matt Malloy', 'R', 'Dispatched from his basement room on an errand for his mother, slacker Jeff might discover his destiny (finally) when he spends the day with his brother as he tracks his possibly adulterous wife.', 'Dispatched from his basement room on an errand for his mother, slacker Jeff might discover his destiny (finally) when he spends the day with his brother as he tracks his possibly adulterous wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9zn7I5dmZ7IGng87gWVk9K37eq7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82532'),
  ('974836306578477741', 'Jefferson Circus Songs', 1974, 'Animation', 'Suzan Pitt, Alan Kraning', null, 'Alanna Fargo, Steve Clement, Pauline Raich, Lynn Oharin, Laurie Nichols, David Baker, Mike Wassener, Dawn Hartzell', null, 'In a fantasy world, life-size cardboard animations interact with children clad in clown wigs, monkey masks, and princess costumes. Together, they host a carnival of surreal goings-on.', 'In a fantasy world, life-size cardboard animations interact with children clad in clown wigs, monkey masks, and princess costumes. Together, they host a carnival of surreal goings-on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7LhODXUP85258dq3Oo5QA8xmmnT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:227821'),
  ('86211055178483785', 'Jefferson in Paris', 1995, 'Drama, Romance, History', 'James Ivory, Pierre Lhomme', 'Ruth Prawer Jhabvala', 'Nick Nolte, Greta Scacchi, Thandiwe Newton, Gwyneth Paltrow, Jean-Pierre Aumont, Simon Callow, Seth Gilliam, James Earl Jones', 'PG-13', 'His wife having recently died, Thomas Jefferson accepts the post of United States ambassador to pre-revolutionary France, though he finds it difficult to adjust to life in a country where the aristocracy subjugates an increasingly restless peasantry. In Paris, he becomes smitten with cultured artist Maria Cosway, but, when his daughter visits from Virginia accompanied by her attractive slave, Sally Hemings, Jefferson''s attentions are diverted.', 'His wife having recently died, Thomas Jefferson accepts the post of United States ambassador to pre-revolutionary France, though he finds it difficult to adjust to life in a country where the aristocracy subjugates an increasingly restless peasantry. In Paris, he becomes smitten with cultured artist Maria Cosway, but, when his daughter visits from Virginia accompanied by her attractive slave, Sally Hemings, Jefferson''s attentions are diverted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vcZCvsm920LoNDb7pMibJkxIE4n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87729'),
  ('190251534026455547', 'Jeffrey', 1995, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Christopher Ashley, Jeffery J. Tufano', 'Paul Rudnick', 'Steven Weber, Patrick Stewart, Michael T. Weiss, Bryan Batt, Nathan Lane, Sigourney Weaver, Olympia Dukakis, Robert Klein', 'R', 'Jeffrey, a gay man living in New York City with an overwhelming fear of contracting AIDS, concludes that being celibate is the only option to protect himself. As fate would have it, shortly after his declaration of a sex-free existence, he meets the handsome Steve Howard, his dream man -- except for his HIV-positive status. Facing this dilemma, Jeffrey turns to his best friend and an outrageous priest for guidance.', 'Jeffrey, a gay man living in New York City with an overwhelming fear of contracting AIDS, concludes that being celibate is the only option to protect himself. As fate would have it, shortly after his declaration of a sex-free existence, he meets the handsome Steve Howard, his dream man -- except for his HIV-positive status. Facing this dilemma, Jeffrey turns to his best friend and an outrageous priest for guidance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cacIqtIkUaD5xYqUUN1J7qJjciQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17447'),
  ('1041250335877881652', 'Jekyll & Hyde', 1990, 'Horror, Thriller, TV Movie, Science Fiction', 'David Wickes, Norman G. Langley, Geoff Glover', 'David Wickes', 'Michael Caine, Cheryl Ladd, Joss Ackland, Ronald Pickup, Diane Keen, Kim Thomson, Kevin McNally, David Schofield', null, 'Henry Jekyll is a troubled man. His wife died of pneumonia. He wants his sister-in-law, but her father forbids any contact. And his experiments into the dual nature of man have yielded a personality-splitting drug that he has tested on himself, changing him into an uninhibited brute who seeks violent and undignified pleasures. Jekyll quickly becomes addicted to the sordid freedom induced by the drug. He can commit the most enjoyably revolting deeds, then return to his laboratory and use an antidote to change back to his original form, so that his lofty persona remains untarnished.', 'Henry Jekyll is a troubled man. His wife died of pneumonia. He wants his sister-in-law, but her father forbids any contact. And his experiments into the dual nature of man have yielded a personality-splitting drug that he has tested on himself, changing him into an uninhibited brute who seeks violent and undignified pleasures. Jekyll quickly becomes addicted to the sordid freedom induced by the drug. He can commit the most enjoyably revolting deeds, then return to his laboratory and use an antidote to change back to his original form, so that his lofty persona remains untarnished.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hj12czMNEw0OVzXmbBXvdidR7lr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48747'),
  ('567115656436816429', 'Jekyll and Hyde... Together Again', 1982, 'Comedy, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Jerry Belson, Philip H. Lathrop, Jerry Sobul', 'Monica Johnson, Jerry Belson, Harvey Miller', 'Mark Blankfield, Bess Armstrong, Krista Errickson, Tim Thomerson, Michael McGuire, Neil Hunt, Cassandra Peterson, Peter Brocco', 'R', 'While conducting a research experiment intended to bring about an alternative to modern surgery, exhausted Los Angeles surgeon Dr. Daniel Jekyll falls asleep and accidentally inhales the white powders, transforming him into a wildly uninhibited nymphomaniac.', 'While conducting a research experiment intended to bring about an alternative to modern surgery, exhausted Los Angeles surgeon Dr. Daniel Jekyll falls asleep and accidentally inhales the white powders, transforming him into a wildly uninhibited nymphomaniac.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sFlJhatebF8oXnFaMsx7mWJYQoe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3028'),
  ('429298582282518605', 'Jellyfish', 2007, 'Drama, Romance', 'Shira Geffen, Antoine Héberlé, Etgar Keret', 'Shira Geffen', 'Sarah Adler, Shosha Goren, Tsipor Aizen, Bruria Albeck, Ilanit Ben-Yaakov, Assi Dayan, Miri Fabian, Jonathan Gurfinkel', null, 'Meduzot (the Hebrew word for Jellyfish) tells the story of three very different Israeli women living in Tel Aviv whose intersecting stories weave an unlikely portrait of modern Israeli life. Batya, a catering waitress, takes in a young child apparently abandoned at a local beach. Batya is one of the servers at the wedding reception of Keren, a young bride who breaks her leg in trying to escape from a locked toilet stall, which ruins her chance at a romantic honeymoon in the Caribbean. One of the guests is Joy, a Philippine chore woman attending the event with her employer, and who doesn''t speak any Hebrew (she communicates mainly in English), and who is guilt-ridden after having left her young son behind in the Philippines.', 'Meduzot (the Hebrew word for Jellyfish) tells the story of three very different Israeli women living in Tel Aviv whose intersecting stories weave an unlikely portrait of modern Israeli life. Batya, a catering waitress, takes in a young child apparently abandoned at a local beach. Batya is one of the servers at the wedding reception of Keren, a young bride who breaks her leg in trying to escape from a locked toilet stall, which ruins her chance at a romantic honeymoon in the Caribbean. One of the guests is Joy, a Philippine chore woman attending the event with her employer, and who doesn''t speak any Hebrew (she communicates mainly in English), and who is guilt-ridden after having left her young son behind in the Philippines.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hTCagyFazmGez993bLX9XgG3GiP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6391'),
  ('1008758430466268438', 'Jellyfish Eyes', 2013, 'Science Fiction, Animation, Comedy, Fantasy, Drama', 'Takashi Murakami, Yasutaka Nagano, Yoshihiro Nishimura', 'Takashi Murakami', 'Himeka Asami, Masataka Kubota, Asuka Kurosawa, Takumi Saitoh, Shota Sometani, Takuto Sueoka, Kanji Tsuda, Mayu Tsuruta', null, 'In present-day Japan, little Masashi moves from an evacuation center to a small village. There, he will discover that every child has the ability to communicate with a fantastic creature, but they are being used in an evil plan to collect the children’s negative energy.', 'In present-day Japan, little Masashi moves from an evacuation center to a small village. There, he will discover that every child has the ability to communicate with a fantastic creature, but they are being used in an evil plan to collect the children’s negative energy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ulx88cAuCfAcJicYh1J57BcsC94.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:228426'),
  ('1042922020781072428', 'Jem and the Holograms', 2015, 'Drama, Music', 'Jon M. Chu, Alice Brooks, Jeremy Phoenix', 'Ryan Landels', 'Aubrey Shea, Stefanie Scott, Hayley Kiyoko, Aurora Perrineau, Ryan Guzman, Molly Ringwald, Juliette Lewis, Isabella Kai', 'PG', 'As a small-town girl catapults from underground video sensation to global superstar, she and her three sisters begin a one-in-a-million journey of discovering that some talents are too special to keep hidden. Four aspiring musicians will take the world by storm when they see that the key to creating your own destiny lies in finding your own voice.', 'As a small-town girl catapults from underground video sensation to global superstar, she and her three sisters begin a one-in-a-million journey of discovering that some talents are too special to keep hidden. Four aspiring musicians will take the world by storm when they see that the key to creating your own destiny lies in finding your own voice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qwsx5i4xUW3YZoFWlrkpNTUfpZf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:266639'),
  ('493076384291865834', 'Jenaro, el de los 14', 1974, 'Comedy', 'Mariano Ozores Puchol, Zacarías Urbiola, Manuel Rojas', 'Mariano Ozores Puchol, Vicente Coello', 'Alfredo Landa, María Luisa San José, Mari Carmen Prendes, Josele Román, Juanjo Menéndez, Florinda Chico, Laly Soldevila, Ricardo Merino', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/43gEKB0hNkme5pC793wHx5pRfiY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:176116'),
  ('278171858959847651', 'Jenifer', 2005, 'Horror, TV Movie', 'Dario Argento, Attila Szalay', 'Steven Weber', 'Steven Weber, Laurie Brunetti, Carrie Anne Fleming, Kevin Crofton, Beau Starr, Julia Arkos, Jasmine Chan, Harris Allan', null, 'After a detective rescues a mute disfigured woman from being murdered, he takes her into his home to prevent her from staying in a mental hospital, a move which alienates his family and soon turns to obsession.', 'After a detective rescues a mute disfigured woman from being murdered, he takes her into his home to prevent her from staying in a mental hospital, a move which alienates his family and soon turns to obsession.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kxXxQmLlS0AIfim9TQmt8RhxsyY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:299438'),
  ('448785947913344474', 'Jennifer', 1953, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Joel Newton, James Wong Howe, Austen Jewell', null, 'Ida Lupino, Howard Duff, Robert Nichols, Mary Shipp, Ned Glass, Kitty McHugh, Russ Conway, Lorna Thayer', 'NR', 'A young woman is hired to take care of an eerie old mansion, where she finds herself entangled with an enigmatic murderer.', 'A young woman is hired to take care of an eerie old mansion, where she finds herself entangled with an enigmatic murderer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rE8HyFRpinYmeDc6VLT07pwoUZD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66763'),
  ('1095879472695402808', 'Jennifer', 1978, 'Horror', 'Brice Mack', 'Kay Cousins Johnson', 'Lisa Pelikan, Bert Convy, Nina Foch, Amy Johnston, John Gavin, Jeff Corey, Louise Hoven, Ray Underwood', 'PG', 'Ostracized at a snooty private school because of her rural, poor background, a scholarship student is tormented to the point where her only remaining recourse is revenge, using the only method she knows: her psychic control over snakes!', 'Ostracized at a snooty private school because of her rural, poor background, a scholarship student is tormented to the point where her only remaining recourse is revenge, using the only method she knows: her psychic control over snakes!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rdu3l5saidydmVYFI7VsszSVeNz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66762'),
  ('425353450188094517', 'Jennifer Eight', 1992, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Bruce Robinson, Conrad Hall, David B. Householter', 'Bruce Robinson', 'Andy Garcia, Lance Henriksen, Uma Thurman, Graham Beckel, Kathy Baker, Kevin Conway, John Malkovich, Perry Lang', 'R', 'John Berlin, a big-city cop from LA moves to a small-town police force and immediately finds himself investigating a murder. Using theories rejected by his colleagues, Berlin meets a young blind woman named Helena, whom he is attracted to. Meanwhile, a serial killer is on the loose—and only John knows it.', 'John Berlin, a big-city cop from LA moves to a small-town police force and immediately finds himself investigating a murder. Using theories rejected by his colleagues, Berlin meets a young blind woman named Helena, whom he is attracted to. Meanwhile, a serial killer is on the loose—and only John knows it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pMlk8spEliRD6hr4ILs5ubHeBGT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10424'),
  ('1035714556412954775', 'Jennifer''s Body', 2009, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Karyn Kusama, M. David Mullen, Gary Hawes', 'Diablo Cody', 'Megan Fox, Amanda Seyfried, Johnny Simmons, Adam Brody, Sal Cortez, Ryan Levine, Juan Riedinger, Colin Askey', 'R', 'Jennifer, a gorgeous, seductive cheerleader takes evil to a whole new level after she''s possessed by a sinister demon. Now it''s up to her best friend to stop Jennifer''s reign of terror before it''s too late.', 'Jennifer, a gorgeous, seductive cheerleader takes evil to a whole new level after she''s possessed by a sinister demon. Now it''s up to her best friend to stop Jennifer''s reign of terror before it''s too late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wrkjsGcFJxcQqR56kJUYAEKKg2T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19994'),
  ('1090463758890051899', 'Jenny', 1936, 'Drama, Romance', 'Roger Hubert, Marcel Carné', 'Jacques Prévert, Jacques Constant', 'Françoise Rosay, Albert Préjean, Lisette Lanvin, Charles Vanel, Roland Toutain, Sylvia Bataille, Jean-Louis Barrault, Robert Le Vigan', null, 'When her fiancé breaks off their engagement, Danielle leaves London and returns to her mother, Jenny, in Paris. With her business partner Benoît, Jenny runs what appears to be a respectable nightclub – it is in fact a place where wealthy men can buy the favours of attractive young women. Oblivious to her mother''s professional and personal life, Danielle meets a handsome young man named Lucien, and falls in love with him – not realising that he is Jenny''s lover...', 'When her fiancé breaks off their engagement, Danielle leaves London and returns to her mother, Jenny, in Paris. With her business partner Benoît, Jenny runs what appears to be a respectable nightclub – it is in fact a place where wealthy men can buy the favours of attractive young women. Oblivious to her mother''s professional and personal life, Danielle meets a handsome young man named Lucien, and falls in love with him – not realising that he is Jenny''s lover...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8VolTQAf9qunoQwlie7jh92O19q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76651'),
  ('382828145895730855', 'Jenny and the Soldier', 1947, 'Drama, Romance', 'Johan Jacobsen, Aage Wiltrup', 'Johan Jacobsen', 'Poul Reichhardt, Bodil Kjer, Elith Pio, Karin Nellemose, Johannes Meyer, Maria Garland, Sigfred Johansen, Gunnar Lauring', null, 'A good natured soldier with a killer right hand falls in love with a beautiful girl who has a troubled past.', 'A good natured soldier with a killer right hand falls in love with a beautiful girl who has a troubled past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7WHW6VNvHKPxnqcswC2hlBFQ0Kf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56872'),
  ('801439136611803489', 'Jenny Jenny', 1966, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Dinos Dimopoulos, Lakis Antonakos', 'Dinos Dimopoulos, Asimakis Gialamas', 'Jenny Karezi, Andreas Barkoulis, Dionysis Papagiannopoulos, Labros Konstadaras, Mary Lalopoulou, Dimitris Kalivokas, Maria Sokali, Nana Skiada', null, 'Jenny Skoutari, a student and the daughter of a party local commander Kosmas Skoutaris, gets use to visit the private library of - her father''s political rival - the shipowner Miltos Kassandris. Kassandris prepares his nephew - and a childhood friend of Jenny - Nikos Mantas, as a candidate for the next election. Mantas'' rival has a lead, and is backed by Skoutaris, who is facing financial problems. So Kassandris decides to force Jenny to marry his nephew with a fake marriage, while at the same time financially breaks down her father in order to secure the election of his nephew. This marriage, however, will lead to unexpected situations between the couple..', 'Jenny Skoutari, a student and the daughter of a party local commander Kosmas Skoutaris, gets use to visit the private library of - her father''s political rival - the shipowner Miltos Kassandris. Kassandris prepares his nephew - and a childhood friend of Jenny - Nikos Mantas, as a candidate for the next election. Mantas'' rival has a lead, and is backed by Skoutaris, who is facing financial problems. So Kassandris decides to force Jenny to marry his nephew with a fake marriage, while at the same time financially breaks down her father in order to secure the election of his nephew. This marriage, however, will lead to unexpected situations between the couple..', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wu4TNbacOFBq7YlITZ6YuYXcnOv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:183383'),
  ('575256405926588888', 'Jenny Lamour', 1947, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Henri-Georges Clouzot, Albert Lasry, Louis Wipf', 'Henri-Georges Clouzot, Jean Ferry', 'Louis Jouvet, Simone Renant, Bernard Blier, Suzy Delair, Pierre Larquey, Jeanne Fusier-Gir, Claudine Dupuis, Charles Dullin', null, 'Paris, France, December 1946. Jenny Lamour, an ambitious cabaret singer, and Maurice, her extremely jealous pianist husband, become involved in the thorough investigation of the murder of a shady businessman, led by Antoine, a peculiar and methodical police inspector.', 'Paris, France, December 1946. Jenny Lamour, an ambitious cabaret singer, and Maurice, her extremely jealous pianist husband, become involved in the thorough investigation of the murder of a shady businessman, led by Antoine, a peculiar and methodical police inspector.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1z7v34MT4pXYwiRGHRovlzuL6xp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49842'),
  ('103546048917539064', 'Jenny, Juno', 2005, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Kim Ho-joon, Kim Dong-cheon', 'Kim Ho-joon', 'Park Min-ji, Kim Hye-seong, Kang Nam-gil, Kim Ja-ok, Shim Eun-jin, Lim Dong-jin, Lee Eung-kyung, Suh Min-jung', null, 'Jenny, Juno centers on the title characters of Jenny and Juno, two fifteen year old middle school students whose one night of romance has dramatic consequences for both their lives. After careful deliberation, the two expectant parents decide to keep the baby.', 'Jenny, Juno centers on the title characters of Jenny and Juno, two fifteen year old middle school students whose one night of romance has dramatic consequences for both their lives. After careful deliberation, the two expectant parents decide to keep the baby.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s4NygSciWejQ5eIsEymBpcTYQxh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63210'),
  ('909838693949176424', 'Jenny''s Wedding', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Mary Agnes Donoghue, Seamus Tierney, Cristi Rickey', 'Mary Agnes Donoghue', 'Katherine Heigl, Tom Wilkinson, Linda Emond, Grace Gummer, Alexis Bledel, Sam McMurray, Diana Hardcastle, Matthew Metzger', 'PG-13', 'Jenny Farrell is getting married. But how will her straight-laced family react when they find out that the woman they thought was their daughter’s roommate is actually her fiancée? As the old-fashioned Farrells attempt to come to terms with the prospect of a surprise daughter-in-law, they face a difficult choice: either adapt with the times or risk being left behind.', 'Jenny Farrell is getting married. But how will her straight-laced family react when they find out that the woman they thought was their daughter’s roommate is actually her fiancée? As the old-fashioned Farrells attempt to come to terms with the prospect of a surprise daughter-in-law, they face a difficult choice: either adapt with the times or risk being left behind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lAMXZ8BVCCfyfhCSsvQRLG6cwxK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:342474'),
  ('1115435251325897181', 'Jeopardy', 1953, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'John Sturges, Victor Milner, Joel Freeman', 'Mel Dinelli', 'Barbara Stanwyck, Barry Sullivan, Ralph Meeker, Lee Aaker, Rico Alaniz, Salvador Baguez, Bob Castro, Carlos Conde', 'NR', 'A woman is kidnapped when she goes to get help for her husband who is trapped on a beach with the tide coming in to surely drown him.', 'A woman is kidnapped when she goes to get help for her husband who is trapped on a beach with the tide coming in to surely drown him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8eXPMsrLsTK2AcFSwbCoWWIeeRB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41611'),
  ('153241283745862803', 'Jeremiah', 1998, 'Adventure, Drama, TV Movie', 'Harry Winer, Raffaele Mertes', null, 'Patrick Dempsey, Oliver Reed, Klaus Maria Brandauer, Leonor Varela, Anna Maguire, Anita Zagaria, Vincent Regan, Andrea Occhipinti', 'PG-13', 'The young Jeremiah grows up in a priest''s family in the village of Anathoth, near Jerusalem. God appears to Jeremiah in different human guises on several occasions, and makes it clear that he has been selected to announce God''s message to the people of Jerusalem.', 'The young Jeremiah grows up in a priest''s family in the village of Anathoth, near Jerusalem. God appears to Jeremiah in different human guises on several occasions, and makes it clear that he has been selected to announce God''s message to the people of Jerusalem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3QeItnMubKWCs7geoxbqQConXXM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33201'),
  ('514434692113895054', 'Jeremiah Johnson', 1972, 'Adventure, Western, Drama, Action', 'Duke Callaghan, Sydney Pollack', 'John Milius, Edward Anhalt', 'Robert Redford, Will Geer, Delle Bolton, Josh Albee, Joaquín Martínez, Allyn Ann McLerie, Stefan Gierasch, Richard Angarola', 'PG', 'A mountain man who wishes to live the life of a hermit becomes the unwilling object of a long vendetta by Indians when he proves to be the match of their warriors in one-on-one combat on the early frontier.', 'A mountain man who wishes to live the life of a hermit becomes the unwilling object of a long vendetta by Indians when he proves to be the match of their warriors in one-on-one combat on the early frontier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fANj1S3UmBB51wnKxYRKtw8LMBn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11943'),
  ('886989527558704292', 'Jeremy', 1973, 'Drama, Family, Romance', 'Arthur Barron, Paul Goldsmith', 'Arthur Barron', 'Robby Benson, Glynnis O''Connor, Leonardo Cimino, Ned Wilson, Len Bari, Chris Bohn, Patricia Wheel, Ted Sorel', 'PG', 'Jeremy is learning cello at an arts school in New York. At school he spots Susan, who practices for a ballet audition, and he falls in love.', 'Jeremy is learning cello at an arts school in New York. At school he spots Susan, who practices for a ballet audition, and he falls in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/13GCcDh0Dxm3rXW8ho0zXX2mmke.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61574'),
  ('356732939014806703', 'Jérémy Ferrari - Vends 2 pièces à Beyrouth', 2017, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Jérémy Ferrari', null, 'If you ask him, "Can you do a comedy show about war?" Jeremy will say yes, because war is great! So he dug deep, dug deep, and dared to answer the questions you no longer dare to ask! Are we really protected by cops on rollerblades? Is Daesh really a start-up on the rise? Should companies that made their fortune thanks to the Nazi regime feel guilty? Can you be a humanitarian and have a teak terrace? He will also give you anti-terrorism training and explain why Al Qaeda without Bin Laden is like Apple without Steve Jobs.', 'If you ask him, "Can you do a comedy show about war?" Jeremy will say yes, because war is great! So he dug deep, dug deep, and dared to answer the questions you no longer dare to ask! Are we really protected by cops on rollerblades? Is Daesh really a start-up on the rise? Should companies that made their fortune thanks to the Nazi regime feel guilty? Can you be a humanitarian and have a teak terrace? He will also give you anti-terrorism training and explain why Al Qaeda without Bin Laden is like Apple without Steve Jobs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pCYvIlBhzOYQ6lNMKKHQKxd30IM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:441883'),
  ('764477998624312194', 'Jericho', 1991, 'History, Drama, Adventure', 'Luis Alberto Lamata, Mario Nazoa, Andrés Agustí', 'Luis Alberto Lamata, Vicky Machado', 'Cosme Cortázar, Francis Rueda, Alexander Milic, Reggie Nalder, Gonzalo Cubero, Wilfredo Cisneros', null, 'In 16th-century Spanish America, a Dominican friar named Santiago survives a brutal expedition and is absorbed into a Carib tribe. When he flees tribal conflict only to be captured by Spanish forces accused of heresy, he is forced to confront the clash between his ideals and the violence of conquest.', 'In 16th-century Spanish America, a Dominican friar named Santiago survives a brutal expedition and is absorbed into a Carib tribe. When he flees tribal conflict only to be captured by Spanish forces accused of heresy, he is forced to confront the clash between his ideals and the violence of conquest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2t1LiuxoL49qTdpwcgk73HVvclC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91807'),
  ('69793286877778998', 'Jericho Mansions', 2003, 'Mystery, Thriller, Drama', 'Alberto Sciamma, Alastair Meux, Rob Cotterill', 'Harriet Sand, Alberto Sciamma', 'James Caan, Geneviève Bujold, Jennifer Tilly, Maribel Verdú, Peter Keleghan, Pierre Rioux, Bruce Ramsay, Susan Glover', null, 'A murder in an old apartment building leads the superintendent to suspect everyone, and eventually himself, of the murder.', 'A murder in an old apartment building leads the superintendent to suspect everyone, and eventually himself, of the murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/auR8uFwk1Hi35kUVSMHYXxTK47u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74494'),
  ('614355354676296997', 'Jericho Ridge', 2024, 'Action, Thriller', 'Will Gilbey, Ruairí O''Brien', 'Will Gilbey', 'Nikki Amuka-Bird, Zack Morris, Philipp Christopher, Solly McLeod, Simon Kunz, Chris Reilly, Michael Socha, Zachary Hart', null, 'North Washington county sheriff Tabby finds herself alone in the sheriff’s office one night while her colleagues are out on patrol, but she soon finds out they’ve been set up by a murderous drug cartel while she herself comes under siege at the office, where she must battle desperately to save herself and her son.', 'North Washington county sheriff Tabby finds herself alone in the sheriff’s office one night while her colleagues are out on patrol, but she soon finds out they’ve been set up by a murderous drug cartel while she herself comes under siege at the office, where she must battle desperately to save herself and her son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Iwkd9m3vGo32bjibNrfM7dtwJd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:969926'),
  ('412471613800583570', 'Jerichow', 2009, 'Drama', 'Christian Petzold, Hans Fromm', 'Christian Petzold', 'Benno Fürmann, Nina Hoss, Hilmi Sözer, André Hennicke, Claudia Geisler-Bading, Marie Gruber, Knut Berger', null, 'In a small Northern German town, a dishonourably discharged Afghanistan veteran is offered a job as a deliveryman by an alcoholic Turkish entrepreneur, through which the former meets the latter''s gorgeous wife.', 'In a small Northern German town, a dishonourably discharged Afghanistan veteran is offered a job as a deliveryman by an alcoholic Turkish entrepreneur, through which the former meets the latter''s gorgeous wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n2UA8DNugSAOeFww2vNseczjIpj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12161'),
  ('166771331373028823', 'Jerky Turkey', 1945, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Tex Avery', null, 'Daws Butler, Bill Thompson, Tex Avery, Frank Graham, Leone LeDoux, Pat McGeehan', null, 'A dopey Pilgrim goes hunting a turkey who speaks in a Jimmy Durante impersonation and runs the local black market. War and rationing gags abound (Pilgrims line up behind a sign reading "Ye Cigarettes Today"), as well as a running gag featuring a bear wearing an "Eat at Joe''s" sandwich sign. The turkey harnesses the power of gags to save himself.', 'A dopey Pilgrim goes hunting a turkey who speaks in a Jimmy Durante impersonation and runs the local black market. War and rationing gags abound (Pilgrims line up behind a sign reading "Ye Cigarettes Today"), as well as a running gag featuring a bear wearing an "Eat at Joe''s" sandwich sign. The turkey harnesses the power of gags to save himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wHn96CwXMUnSFH0OpbC7GCWwV8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84891'),
