  ('205304300977804704', 'Jerrod Carmichael: Rothaniel', 2022, 'Comedy, Documentary', 'Bo Burnham, Sam Levy, Kether Abeles', 'Jerrod Carmichael', 'Jerrod Carmichael', null, 'Features Jerrod Carmichael in a standup comedy show at the legendary Blue Note Jazz Club in New York City.', 'Features Jerrod Carmichael in a standup comedy show at the legendary Blue Note Jazz Club in New York City.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/klYNX97TLtWz4zfaByWsoLH2BGT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:952326'),
  ('881039497563640439', 'Jerry & Marge Go Large', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'David Frankel, Susan Iskiwitch, Aiman A. Humaideh', 'Brad Copeland', 'Bryan Cranston, Annette Bening, Rainn Wilson, Larry Wilmore, Michael McKean, Jake McDorman, Anna Camp, Uly Schlesinger', 'PG-13', 'The remarkable true story of how retiree Jerry Selbee discovers a mathematical loophole in the Massachusetts lottery and, with the help of his wife, Marge, wins $27 million dollars and uses the money to revive their small Michigan town.', 'The remarkable true story of how retiree Jerry Selbee discovers a mathematical loophole in the Massachusetts lottery and, with the help of his wife, Marge, wins $27 million dollars and uses the money to revive their small Michigan town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bbBGSm1kjgmZ0O3bPUQIbA0xlKQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:843847'),
  ('734058605428716186', 'Jerry and Jumbo', 1953, 'Animation, Comedy', 'William Hanna, Joseph Barbera', null, null, 'NR', 'A baby elephant rolls off the circus train and right into Tom''s bed. He quickly allies himself with Jerry, and with a rolled-up trunk and some paint, passes himself off as a giant mouse. The two then keep trading places to the bafflement of Tom.', 'A baby elephant rolls off the circus train and right into Tom''s bed. He quickly allies himself with Jerry, and with a rolled-up trunk and some paint, passes himself off as a giant mouse. The two then keep trading places to the bafflement of Tom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5BgcsVQh48I3tQ6YQqEuhWtg331.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68620'),
  ('244124270948773156', 'Jerry and the Goldfish', 1951, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Joseph Barbera, William Hanna', null, 'Daws Butler', 'NR', 'Tom, whose appetite was whetted by a radio cooking program, wants to make a meal out of the pet goldfish. Jerry, who is friends with the fish, does what he can to thwart their feline foe.', 'Tom, whose appetite was whetted by a radio cooking program, wants to make a meal out of the pet goldfish. Jerry, who is friends with the fish, does what he can to thwart their feline foe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1uqdPD4WYy0WzJ1q3kRIEBmjlRj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68622'),
  ('618702346385039031', 'Jerry and the Lion', 1950, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Joseph Barbera, William Hanna', null, 'Paul Frees, Frank Graham', 'NR', 'Jerry agrees to help an escaped circus lion, whose first need is food. But first they''ll have to evade Tom, who heard the news bulletin and is armed with a shotgun.', 'Jerry agrees to help an escaped circus lion, whose first need is food. But first they''ll have to evade Tom, who heard the news bulletin and is armed with a shotgun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gFfZLohFOW4v7b86Kn4nxlnGnI2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68625'),
  ('378180102694650491', 'Jerry and Tom', 1998, 'Action, Comedy, Drama, Crime', 'Paul Sarossy, Saul Rubinek', 'Rick Cleveland', 'Joe Mantegna, Sam Rockwell, Maury Chaykin, Ted Danson, Charles Durning, William H. Macy, Peter Riegert, Sarah Polley', null, 'Tom and Jerry are two hit men, they work by day at a third-rate second-hand car dealership. Tom is a veteran and Jerry is a novice in their business, and their attitude toward their profession differs a lot. It shows when Tom is required to kill his old friend Karl.', 'Tom and Jerry are two hit men, they work by day at a third-rate second-hand car dealership. Tom is a veteran and Jerry is a novice in their business, and their attitude toward their profession differs a lot. It shows when Tom is required to kill his old friend Karl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7vb4RjMgdzPflqSpdUwwUjdwjTu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76891'),
  ('533391790246247561', 'Jerry Before Seinfeld', 2017, 'Comedy, Documentary', 'Michael Bonfiglio', 'Jerry Seinfeld', 'Jerry Seinfeld, Jay Leno, Mark Schiff, Jimmy Brogan, Johnny Carson, Andy Kaufman, Ed Koch', null, 'Jerry Seinfeld returns to the club that gave him his start in the 1970s, mixing iconic jokes with stories from his childhood and early days in comedy.', 'Jerry Seinfeld returns to the club that gave him his start in the 1970s, mixing iconic jokes with stories from his childhood and early days in comedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1HsldceVUztgRztwp3pOaVRJVlp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:473812'),
  ('543207344430045544', 'Jerry Cotton', 2010, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Cyrill Boss, Torsten Breuer, Philipp Stennert', 'Cyrill Boss, Philipp Stennert', 'Christian Tramitz, Christian Ulmen, Mónica Cruz, Christiane Paul, Heino Ferch, Jürgen Tarrach, Joram Voelklein, Herbert Knaup', null, 'Jerry Cotton is the best agent of the FBI and suspected of murder. So he has to find the real killers from gangster boss Serrano.', 'Jerry Cotton is the best agent of the FBI and suspected of murder. So he has to find the real killers from gangster boss Serrano.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pr08atsJROoCcCYrl7t0tgLYzJS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46281'),
  ('656149583711994754', 'Jerry Cotton: The Trap Snaps Shut at Midnight', 1966, 'Crime', 'Harald Philipp, Helmut Meewes', 'Kurt Nachmann, Fred Denger', 'George Nader, Horst Frank, Heinz Weiss, Richard Münch, Dominique Wilms, Allen Pinson, Alexander Allerson, Monika Grimm', null, 'Third Jerry Cotton Adaption. A big shipment of Nitroglycerine, enough to make a shambles of New York, mysteriously vanishes! It''s a race between agent Jerry Cotton and the underworld to see who can find the deadly explosive first. To complicate things further, the nitro must be found before a torrid heat wave causes it to blow much of the city sky high.', 'Third Jerry Cotton Adaption. A big shipment of Nitroglycerine, enough to make a shambles of New York, mysteriously vanishes! It''s a race between agent Jerry Cotton and the underworld to see who can find the deadly explosive first. To complicate things further, the nitro must be found before a torrid heat wave causes it to blow much of the city sky high.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yQwvo2m8cI6rkz8fT3bZ5XqZdUH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4557'),
  ('1101292926530782412', 'Jerry Lewis: The Man Behind the Clown', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Darrell Martin, Nicolas Le Gal, Grégory Monro', 'Grégory Monro', 'Jerry Lewis, Martin Scorsese, Sean Hayes, Pierre Étaix, Jonathan Rosenbaum, Louis Malle', null, 'Since the early days, Jerry Lewis—in the line of Chaplin, Keaton and Laurel—had the masses laughing with his visual gags, pantomime sketches and signature slapstick humor. Yet Lewis was far more than just a clown. He was also a groundbreaking filmmaker whose unquenchable curiosity led him to write, produce, stage and direct many of the films he appeared in, resulting in such adored classics as The Bellboy, The Ladies Man, The Errand Boy, and The Nutty Professor.', 'Since the early days, Jerry Lewis—in the line of Chaplin, Keaton and Laurel—had the masses laughing with his visual gags, pantomime sketches and signature slapstick humor. Yet Lewis was far more than just a clown. He was also a groundbreaking filmmaker whose unquenchable curiosity led him to write, produce, stage and direct many of the films he appeared in, resulting in such adored classics as The Bellboy, The Ladies Man, The Errand Boy, and The Nutty Professor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7oXJSJWsGFRkTTR6I7OZn6LU4Zn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:414789'),
  ('1003556326979416326', 'Jerry Maguire', 1996, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Janusz Kamiński, Cameron Crowe, Chuck Cohen', 'Cameron Crowe', 'Tom Cruise, Renée Zellweger, Cuba Gooding Jr., Kelly Preston, Jerry O''Connell, Jay Mohr, Regina King, Bonnie Hunt', 'R', 'Jerry Maguire used to be a typical sports agent: willing to do just about anything he could to get the biggest possible contracts for his clients, plus a nice commission for himself. Then, one day, he suddenly has second thoughts about what he''s really doing. When he voices these doubts, he ends up losing his job and all of his clients, save Rod Tidwell, an egomaniacal football player.', 'Jerry Maguire used to be a typical sports agent: willing to do just about anything he could to get the biggest possible contracts for his clients, plus a nice commission for himself. Then, one day, he suddenly has second thoughts about what he''s really doing. When he voices these doubts, he ends up losing his job and all of his clients, save Rod Tidwell, an egomaniacal football player.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lABvGN7fDk5ifnwZoxij6G96t2w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9390'),
  ('1092392059274152448', 'Jerry Seinfeld: 23 Hours to Kill', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Joe DeMaio', 'Jerry Seinfeld', 'Jerry Seinfeld', null, 'Jerry Seinfeld takes the stage in New York and tackles talking vs. texting, bad buffets vs. so-called "great" restaurants and the magic of Pop Tarts.', 'Jerry Seinfeld takes the stage in New York and tackles talking vs. texting, bad buffets vs. so-called "great" restaurants and the magic of Pop Tarts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qvAymJkltRoaxvievYiJfXGusD3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:696000'),
  ('539182251688961703', 'Jerry Seinfeld: I''m Telling You for the Last Time', 1998, 'Comedy', 'Marty Callner, Christian Clarke, Gabriel Beristain', 'Jerry Seinfeld', 'Jerry Seinfeld, Michael Barryte, Grace Bustos, George Carlin, Alan King, Robert Klein, Carol Leifer, Jay Leno', 'G', 'Taped for HBO in August 1998, on the final date of Jerry Seinfeld''s tour appearances at New York City''s Broadhurst Theater, I''m Telling You for the Last Time presents the standup comedian''s so-called "final" standup, or at least his final tour with the standup material that made him famous.', 'Taped for HBO in August 1998, on the final date of Jerry Seinfeld''s tour appearances at New York City''s Broadhurst Theater, I''m Telling You for the Last Time presents the standup comedian''s so-called "final" standup, or at least his final tour with the standup material that made him famous.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jffjpqXw6W9x6etUSYBkMPEQWRY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23319'),
  ('151877645145386645', 'Jerry-Go-Round', 1966, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Abe Levitow', null, null, null, 'Jerry is chased into a circus, where he removes a tack from the foot of an elephant. This gets him a friend for life, and a powerful ally in the continuing battles with Tom, not that it stops Tom from trying, even when Jerry becomes part of the act.', 'Jerry is chased into a circus, where he removes a tack from the foot of an elephant. This gets him a friend for life, and a powerful ally in the continuing battles with Tom, not that it stops Tom from trying, even when Jerry becomes part of the act.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h12IzZbfR71qLQkj27GfbpWUipH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:234396'),
  ('458558393274151713', 'Jerry, Jerry, Quite Contrary', 1966, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones, Maurice Noble', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'Jerry keeps sleepwalking and doing things unknowingly to Tom. He becomes aware of this and tries to stay awake.', 'Jerry keeps sleepwalking and doing things unknowingly to Tom. He becomes aware of this and tries to stay awake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ehs1bN08gQihkLNKt7vbp3OXqHQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:234328'),
  ('854472758666638477', 'Jerry''s Cousin', 1951, 'Animation, Comedy', 'William Hanna, Joseph Barbera', null, 'Paul Frees', 'NR', 'When Tom''s harassment gets out of hand, Jerry writes to his Cousin Muscles, a tough inner city mouse, and asks for his help.', 'When Tom''s harassment gets out of hand, Jerry writes to his Cousin Muscles, a tough inner city mouse, and asks for his help.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4n8aDOTi9SeoxV95UDqNNZenSk7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68630'),
  ('356164166527540761', 'Jerry''s Diary', 1949, 'Comedy, Animation', 'William Hanna, Joseph Barbera', null, 'Joseph Forte', 'NR', 'The kiddie radio host, Uncle Dudley, reminds his listeners that it is "Be Kind to Animals" week. Tom resolves to be kind to his mouse-nemesis, Jerry, but the cat changes his mind after sneaking a look at Jerry''s diary.', 'The kiddie radio host, Uncle Dudley, reminds his listeners that it is "Be Kind to Animals" week. Tom resolves to be kind to his mouse-nemesis, Jerry, but the cat changes his mind after sneaking a look at Jerry''s diary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xNrcVKTvmMg9rwKqqTy50IZ0xrP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68633'),
  ('832444245772845284', 'Jersey', 2019, 'Drama', 'Gowtam Tinnanuri, Sanu John Varghese', 'Gowtam Tinnanuri', 'Nani, Shraddha Srinath, Ronit Kamra, Harish Kalyan, Viswant Duddumpudi, Sathyaraj, Sanusha Santhosh, Sampath Raj', null, 'After his career fails to take off, a gifted cricketer in his mid-thirties decides that he’s not ready to give up quite yet.', 'After his career fails to take off, a gifted cricketer in his mid-thirties decides that he’s not ready to give up quite yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bU9q9yVtxeBiC0Do27CekHXNE6D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:592898'),
  ('348872684232835000', 'Jersey', 2022, 'Drama', 'Mukesh Chhabra, Vipul S Arora, Harshit Bhatia', 'Gowtam Tinnanuri', 'Shahid Kapoor, Mrunal Thakur, Pankaj Kapur, Ronit Kamra, Rituraj Singh, Geetika Mehandru, Prit Kamani, Anjum Batra', null, 'An ex-cricketer struggling to make ends meet, wants to fulfill his child''s wish of getting an Indian jersey but in the process comes face to face with his heroic past and is forced to decide if he will rise to the occasion and become a symbol of hope or continue to live a life as a loser?', 'An ex-cricketer struggling to make ends meet, wants to fulfill his child''s wish of getting an Indian jersey but in the process comes face to face with his heroic past and is forced to decide if he will rise to the occasion and become a symbol of hope or continue to live a life as a loser?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oH5AWyhNlx6kEzIhYPYltnLgnoG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:679018'),
  ('735071984100342192', 'Jersey Boys', 2014, 'Music, Drama', 'Clint Eastwood, Paula Case, David M. Bernstein', 'Rick Elice, Marshall Brickman', 'John Lloyd Young, Vincent Piazza, Michael Lomenda, Erich Bergen, Christopher Walken, Mike Doyle, Joseph Russo, Kathrine Narducci', 'R', 'A musical biopic of the Four Seasons—the rise, the tough times and personal clashes, and the ultimate triumph of a group of friends whose music became symbolic of a generation. Far from a mere tribute concert, it gets to the heart of the relationships at the centre of the group, with a special focus on frontman Frankie Valli, the small kid with the big falsetto.', 'A musical biopic of the Four Seasons—the rise, the tough times and personal clashes, and the ultimate triumph of a group of friends whose music became symbolic of a generation. Far from a mere tribute concert, it gets to the heart of the relationships at the centre of the group, with a special focus on frontman Frankie Valli, the small kid with the big falsetto.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kz956Y83YtT6vTyg0Q40mzRe2UM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:209451'),
  ('1024171914414945792', 'Jersey Girl', 1992, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'David Burton Morris, Marlene Arvan, Gary Sales', 'Gina Wendkos', 'Jami Gertz, Dylan McDermott, Sheryl Lee, Aida Turturro, Molly Price, Star Jasper, Joseph Mazzello, Philip Casnoff', 'PG-13', 'A working girl from New Jersey looks for love with a fast-lane Manhattan salesman from Queens.', 'A working girl from New Jersey looks for love with a fast-lane Manhattan salesman from Queens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5yQ3QSyZ4jDgqmn7Stb9A4GxUb9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54655'),
  ('172989370530045528', 'Jersey Girl', 2004, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Kevin Smith, Vilmos Zsigmond', 'Kevin Smith', 'Ben Affleck, Raquel Castro, Liv Tyler, George Carlin, Jason Biggs, Jennifer Lopez, Stephen Root, Mike Starr', 'PG-13', 'Ollie Trinke is a young, suave music publicist who seems to have it all, with a new wife and a baby on the way. But life deals him a bum hand when he''s suddenly faced with single fatherhood, a defunct career and having to move in with his father. To bounce back, it takes a new love and the courage instilled in him by his daughter.', 'Ollie Trinke is a young, suave music publicist who seems to have it all, with a new wife and a baby on the way. But life deals him a bum hand when he''s suddenly faced with single fatherhood, a defunct career and having to move in with his father. To bounce back, it takes a new love and the courage instilled in him by his daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nMmMWoSooR6QmCjdT0AvZardof1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9541'),
  ('469457036540518349', 'Jersey Shore Massacre', 2014, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Paul Tarnopol, Jay Shropshire', 'Paul Tarnopol', 'Danielle Dallacco, Angelica Boccella, Giovanni Roselli, Chris Lazzaro, Nicole Rutigliano, Christina Scaglione, Brenton Duplessie, Brett Azar', 'R', 'A typical weekend down the shore takes a bizarre turn as six girls and five obnoxious fist-pumpers become the unsuspecting targets of a deranged killer.', 'A typical weekend down the shore takes a bizarre turn as six girls and five obnoxious fist-pumpers become the unsuspecting targets of a deranged killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rHvk5ARkJfAwGYt0C3gqeXVU3Jh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:288154'),
  ('938028253386961071', 'Jersey Shore Shark Attack', 2012, 'TV Movie, Action, Science Fiction, Comedy, Horror', 'John Shepphird, Theo Angell, Fred Olen Ray', 'Richard Gnolfo, Michael Ciminera', 'Jack Scalia, Jeremy Luke, Joseph Russo, Daniel Booko, Alex Mauriello, Audi Resendez, Tony Sirico, Grant Harvey', 'R', 'Many years ago, hundreds of locals and tourists were massacred by giant man-eating sharks in the infamous 1916 Jersey Shore attacks. But that''s just a legend... or is it? It''s a holiday weekend on the Jersey Shore and, unbeknownst to anyone, underwater drills have attracted dozens of albino bull sharks to the pier. When a man goes missing, TC (The Complication), Nookie and friends fear the worst and plead with the police chief to close down the beach. It isn''t until a famous singer is eaten alive during a performance on the pier that the shark hunt begins. Now, the Preppies must work together with the Guidos in order to save the Jersey Shore and its inhabitants from another vicious slaughter.', 'Many years ago, hundreds of locals and tourists were massacred by giant man-eating sharks in the infamous 1916 Jersey Shore attacks. But that''s just a legend... or is it? It''s a holiday weekend on the Jersey Shore and, unbeknownst to anyone, underwater drills have attracted dozens of albino bull sharks to the pier. When a man goes missing, TC (The Complication), Nookie and friends fear the worst and plead with the police chief to close down the beach. It isn''t until a famous singer is eaten alive during a performance on the pier that the shark hunt begins. Now, the Preppies must work together with the Guidos in order to save the Jersey Shore and its inhabitants from another vicious slaughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iXICsou2NwPuIrcCyap0bpUxcSR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114003'),
  ('533311573700402578', 'Jerusalem', 1996, 'Drama', 'Bille August, Jörgen Persson', 'Bille August, Charlotte Lesche, Klas Östergren', 'Maria Bonnevie, Ulf Friberg, Pernilla August, Lena Endre, Sven-Bertil Taube, Reine Brynolfsson, Max von Sydow, Olympia Dukakis', null, 'Members of a devout Christian congregation try to start a new life in Palestine.', 'Members of a devout Christian congregation try to start a new life in Palestine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x0GX5ie4BGJaTin5Te4Q0HWZQ1l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:226594'),
  ('934897172990216379', 'Jérusalem : porte de Jaffa, côté Est', 1897, 'Documentary', 'Alexandre Promio', null, null, null, 'Small glimpse of city life in Jerusalem.', 'Small glimpse of city life in Jerusalem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wNjdjRBGOFQx39spLX5NiSam0Hx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:194615'),
  ('184425893669345819', 'Jeruzalem', 2016, 'Horror, Action, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Doron Paz, Yoav Paz, Rotem Yaron', 'Doron Paz, Yoav Paz', 'Yael Grobglas, Danielle Jadelyn, Yon Tumarkin, Tom Graziani, Moran Zelma, Gita Ben Nevat, Yael Hakshurian, Merav Eisenthal', 'R', 'When a couple of American young adults fly to Israel to visit the city of Jerusalem, a biblical nightmare falls upon the city.', 'When a couple of American young adults fly to Israel to visit the city of Jerusalem, a biblical nightmare falls upon the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hYkfUKjWlVP6GVqIW5wL2ruREGZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:339547'),
  ('252173927285447742', 'Jess & James', 2015, 'Drama, Romance', 'Santiago Giralt, Pablo Ramos', 'Santiago Giralt', 'Martín Karich, Nicolás Romeo, Federico Fontán, Alejandro Paker, Nahuel Mutti, Denise Yáñez, Umbra Colombo, Mónica Trejo', null, 'Jess is a bohemian youth with secrets to hide from his shrewd parents. James feels trapped living with his irritable mother. After meeting for a sexual encounter, the two young men set off on a spontaneous road trip across rural Argentina to reunite with Jess'' estranged brother. On their journey, they confront strange occurrences and engage in a ménage à trois affair that brings them closer. Their newly found affection grows, all while discovering a fresh vision of freedom and happiness. JESS & JAMES is a sexually charged road-trip movie, a love story, and a coming-of-age tale, set against the mythical landscape of the Argentinian Pampas.', 'Jess is a bohemian youth with secrets to hide from his shrewd parents. James feels trapped living with his irritable mother. After meeting for a sexual encounter, the two young men set off on a spontaneous road trip across rural Argentina to reunite with Jess'' estranged brother. On their journey, they confront strange occurrences and engage in a ménage à trois affair that brings them closer. Their newly found affection grows, all while discovering a fresh vision of freedom and happiness. JESS & JAMES is a sexually charged road-trip movie, a love story, and a coming-of-age tale, set against the mythical landscape of the Argentinian Pampas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1PPbp8X2bsMzlgtHsycVPrEfCT2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:365126'),
  ('468705898045922711', 'Jessabelle', 2014, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Kevin Greutert, Ken Blakey, Michael Fimognari', 'Robert Ben Garant', 'Sarah Snook, Mark Webber, Joelle Carter, David Andrews, Chris Ellis, Ana de la Reguera, Brian Hallisay, Larisa Oleynik', 'PG-13', 'A young woman recuperating at her father''s run-down home after a tragic accident soon encounters a terrifying presence with a connection to her long-deceased mother.', 'A young woman recuperating at her father''s run-down home after a tragic accident soon encounters a terrifying presence with a connection to her long-deceased mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9WP1ADKCeDG0avA0WSo4mUemTqW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:203834'),
  ('1100029371316569241', 'Jesse James', 1939, 'Western', 'Henry King, W. Howard Greene, George Barnes', 'Nunnally Johnson', 'Tyrone Power, Henry Fonda, Nancy Kelly, Randolph Scott, Henry Hull, Slim Summerville, J. Edward Bromberg, Brian Donlevy', 'NR', 'After railroad agents forcibly evict the James family from their family farm, Jesse and Frank turn to banditry for revenge.', 'After railroad agents forcibly evict the James family from their family farm, Jesse and Frank turn to banditry for revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s85NggId22ntp4pbYwTbtHdalnY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43829'),
  ('1006670917844741778', 'Jesse James Meets Frankenstein''s Daughter', 1966, 'Horror, Western, Science Fiction', 'William Beaudine, Lothrop B. Worth, Max Stein', 'Carl K. Hittleman', 'John Lupton, Narda Onyx, Estelita Rodriguez, Cal Bolder, Jim Davis, Steven Geray, Rayford Barnes, William Fawcett', null, 'Dr. Frankenstein''s Granddaughter Maria, and her brother assistant Rudolph, moved to the old west because the lightning storms there are more frequent and intense, which allows them to work on the experiments of their grandfather. But the experiments are failing and Rudolph''s been secretly killing the corpses afterwards. Meanwhile, the Lopez family leaves the town because of the evil going on there', 'Dr. Frankenstein''s Granddaughter Maria, and her brother assistant Rudolph, moved to the old west because the lightning storms there are more frequent and intense, which allows them to work on the experiments of their grandfather. But the experiments are failing and Rudolph''s been secretly killing the corpses afterwards. Meanwhile, the Lopez family leaves the town because of the evil going on there', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v4CQ0oP2ISRReZABJNcVWrvetCY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3149'),
  ('493700729802438176', 'Jesse Stone: Benefit of the Doubt', 2012, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime, Mystery', 'Robert Harmon, David Gribble, Jason Shipley', 'Tom Selleck, Michael Brandman', 'Tom Selleck, Kathy Baker, Kohl Sudduth, Gloria Reuben, Stephen McHattie, William Sadler, Robert Carradine, Jeff Geddis', 'PG-13', 'Jesse finds himself struggling to get his job back as the Paradise police chief, and he is forced to rely on his cop intuition to sort through a maze of misleading clues and hidden meanings as he attempts to solve a shocking and horrifying mob-related double homicide.', 'Jesse finds himself struggling to get his job back as the Paradise police chief, and he is forced to rely on his cop intuition to sort through a maze of misleading clues and hidden meanings as he attempts to solve a shocking and horrifying mob-related double homicide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rCv4dChKzqbnx86X2pOC15oHCwG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110148'),
  ('915371332053474323', 'Jesse Stone: Death in Paradise', 2006, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller, Mystery, TV Movie', 'Robert Harmon, David Gribble, Danielle Dumesnil', null, 'Tom Selleck, Viola Davis, Kohl Sudduth, Orla Brady, Gary Basaraba, John Diehl, Debra Christofferson, Mae Whitman', 'R', 'When Jesse Stone looks into the murder of a teen-age girl whose body is found floating in a local lake, it brings him up against the Boston mob and into the affluent world of a bestselling writer who exploits troubled teens.', 'When Jesse Stone looks into the murder of a teen-age girl whose body is found floating in a local lake, it brings him up against the Boston mob and into the affluent world of a bestselling writer who exploits troubled teens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zbRvYD01GzgwBqe5vHBFeoscuQA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30347'),
  ('761790942816274292', 'Jesse Stone: Innocents Lost', 2011, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Dick Lowry, Megan Banning, David Gribble', 'Tom Selleck, Michael Brandman', 'Tom Selleck, Kathy Baker, Kohl Sudduth, Gloria Reuben, Stephen McHattie, William Sadler, Eileen April Boylan, William Devane', 'PG-13', 'Jesse investigates the suspicious death of a young friend while the police force deals with the arrogant new police chief who is the son-in-law of a town councilman.', 'Jesse investigates the suspicious death of a young friend while the police force deals with the arrogant new police chief who is the son-in-law of a town councilman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qCzPYSNc5gib1oVGhhrUAXLvIv1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59238'),
  ('554502429086076893', 'Jesse Stone: Lost in Paradise', 2015, 'Drama, TV Movie, Crime, Mystery', 'Robert Harmon, David Gribble, Mary Reynolds', null, 'Tom Selleck, William Devane, Gloria Reuben, Luke Perry, Leslie Hope, Al Sapienza, Alex Carter, Kohl Sudduth', 'PG-13', 'Police Chief Jesse Stone now presides over the quiet, seaside village of Paradise, Massachusetts. When the facts don''t add up in a brutal Boston-area murder case, Jesse opens an investigation filled with surprises, unlikely suspects and grave danger. Though it''s widely believed the murder was committed by an incarcerated serial killer, Jesse suspects another killer is at large and is hell-bent on bringing him to justice.', 'Police Chief Jesse Stone now presides over the quiet, seaside village of Paradise, Massachusetts. When the facts don''t add up in a brutal Boston-area murder case, Jesse opens an investigation filled with surprises, unlikely suspects and grave danger. Though it''s widely believed the murder was committed by an incarcerated serial killer, Jesse suspects another killer is at large and is hell-bent on bringing him to justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gw5ax5lElk0G1MRDFIQT4V8xUZU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:361263'),
  ('24251890673039300', 'Jesse Stone: Night Passage', 2006, 'Drama, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Robert Harmon, Richard Coleman, Danielle Dumesnil', null, 'Tom Selleck, Saul Rubinek, Viola Davis, Kohl Sudduth, Stephen Baldwin, Polly Shannon, Stephanie March, Mike Starr', 'R', 'A prequel to "Stone Cold", the story picks up after Jesse Stone is fired from the Los Angeles Police Department. He becomes an unlikely candidate recruited by a town council to become police chief of Paradise, MA, a small fishing town on Boston''s North Shore. The board hopes his failed experience will keep him from digging too deep into the town''s secrets. His first assignment is to investigate the murder of his predecessor whose death may be tied to a local domestic disturbance case, with connections to money laundering and murder involving some of the town''s most affluent names as possible suspects.', 'A prequel to "Stone Cold", the story picks up after Jesse Stone is fired from the Los Angeles Police Department. He becomes an unlikely candidate recruited by a town council to become police chief of Paradise, MA, a small fishing town on Boston''s North Shore. The board hopes his failed experience will keep him from digging too deep into the town''s secrets. His first assignment is to investigate the murder of his predecessor whose death may be tied to a local domestic disturbance case, with connections to money laundering and murder involving some of the town''s most affluent names as possible suspects.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k06aaP4jfTK5k77uQX7mrV12vT4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31047'),
  ('761998115009437796', 'Jesse Stone: No Remorse', 2010, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime, Mystery', 'Robert Harmon, Michele E. Dutka, David Gribble', 'Tom Selleck, Michael Brandman', 'Tom Selleck, Kathy Baker, Kohl Sudduth, Stephen McHattie, Krista Allen, William Sadler, Mae Whitman, Saul Rubinek', 'R', 'Police Chief Jesse Stone, who was suspended by the Paradise, Mass. Town Council, begins moonlighting for his friend, State Homicide Commander Healy, by investigating a series of murders in Boston, leaving Rose and Suitcase to handle a crime spree in Paradise on their own. Jesse pours his energy into his work in an effort to push away his twin demons: booze and women. When his investigation leads to notorious mob boss Gino Fish, Jesse''s pursuit becomes hazardous.', 'Police Chief Jesse Stone, who was suspended by the Paradise, Mass. Town Council, begins moonlighting for his friend, State Homicide Commander Healy, by investigating a series of murders in Boston, leaving Rose and Suitcase to handle a crime spree in Paradise on their own. Jesse pours his energy into his work in an effort to push away his twin demons: booze and women. When his investigation leads to notorious mob boss Gino Fish, Jesse''s pursuit becomes hazardous.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tcqnCLdPigSFlZzsug3Mwmx8qLC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43263'),
  ('418921803630261413', 'Jesse Stone: Sea Change', 2007, 'Drama, Crime, TV Movie, Thriller', 'Robert Harmon, Rene Ohashi, Kay Robertson', null, 'Tom Selleck, Kathy Baker, Kohl Sudduth, Rebecca Pidgeon, Sean Young, Mika Boorem, Stephen McHattie, William Sadler', 'PG-13', 'Police Chief Jesse Stone''s relationship with his ex-wife worsens, and he fears he''s relapsing into alcoholism. To get his mind off his problems, Jesse begins working on the unsolved murder of a bank teller shot during a robbery. Also, his investigation of an alleged rape draws him into conflict with the town council — which hopes to preserve Paradise''s reputation as an ideal seaside resort.', 'Police Chief Jesse Stone''s relationship with his ex-wife worsens, and he fears he''s relapsing into alcoholism. To get his mind off his problems, Jesse begins working on the unsolved murder of a bank teller shot during a robbery. Also, his investigation of an alleged rape draws him into conflict with the town council — which hopes to preserve Paradise''s reputation as an ideal seaside resort.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cjJVPwyTwR89APErU7SE0LmBaPl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26114'),
  ('344616278200500050', 'Jesse Stone: Thin Ice', 2009, 'Drama, Crime, TV Movie, Mystery, Thriller', 'Robert Harmon, Bruce Zwicker, Libby Hodgson', null, 'Tom Selleck, Kathy Baker, Kohl Sudduth, Leslie Hope, Stephen McHattie, William Sadler, Jessica Hecht, Joanna Miles', 'PG-13', 'Jesse Stone and Captain Healy are shot during an unauthorized stake-out in Boston. Meanwhile, a cryptic letter sent from Paradise leads the mother of a kidnapped child to Stone. Though her son was declared dead, she hopes he will reopen the case.', 'Jesse Stone and Captain Healy are shot during an unauthorized stake-out in Boston. Meanwhile, a cryptic letter sent from Paradise leads the mother of a kidnapped child to Stone. Though her son was declared dead, she hopes he will reopen the case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qLI3yvi9JOueey6ifydSzmvGRcK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22555'),
  ('447574926686481370', 'Jessi''s Girls', 1975, 'Western', 'Al Adamson, Gary Graver, John D''Amato', 'Budd Donnelly', 'Sondra Currie, Geoffrey Land, Ben Frank, Regina Carrol, Jennifer Bishop, Ellyn Stern, Joe Cortese, Jon Shark', 'R', 'A young Mormon couple is attacked by a bunch of outlaws. They kill the man and the woman is raped several times and left for dead in the desert. With the last ounce of her strength she gets to the hut of an old hermit who nurses her back to health and teaches her how to shoot. The woman then frees three female criminals and seeks vengeance on the outlaws.', 'A young Mormon couple is attacked by a bunch of outlaws. They kill the man and the woman is raped several times and left for dead in the desert. With the last ounce of her strength she gets to the hut of an old hermit who nurses her back to health and teaches her how to shoot. The woman then frees three female criminals and seeks vengeance on the outlaws.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zeiPLQAfGCEzjQUayKVo2twJS3g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:446884'),
  ('72890867332729109', 'Jessica', 1962, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Jean Negulesco, Oreste Palella, Piero Portalupi', 'Edith R. Sommer', 'Maurice Chevalier, Angie Dickinson, Noël-Noël, Gabriele Ferzetti, Sylva Koscina, Agnes Moorehead, Marcel Dalio, Antonio Cifariello', null, 'When the men of a Sicilian village start obsessing over ravishing blonde midwife Jessica, angry females revolt by refusing to have sex with their husbands. As the local priest tries to encourage procreation, Jessica falls for a tricky recluse.', 'When the men of a Sicilian village start obsessing over ravishing blonde midwife Jessica, angry females revolt by refusing to have sex with their husbands. As the local priest tries to encourage procreation, Jessica falls for a tricky recluse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/emXHuiMFjPuYKBE9FeIkmQNNmy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98894'),
  ('773584759528207615', 'Jessica Darling''s It List', 2016, 'Family', 'Ali Scher, Damian Horan', 'Julie Sherman Wolfe', 'Chloe East, Emma Rayne Lyle, Ashley Liao, Eva Bella, Jane Widdop, Jacob Melton, Blair Fowler, Jane Sibbett', 'G', 'Jessica Darling – a smart, witty, opinionated girl heading into 7th grade – was never too concerned about where she''d fit in the middle school hierarchy. But before her first day of school, her older sister — the super popular Bethany, now in college—decides to help out by giving her the “It List”—a cheat sheet on how to navigate the middle school maze and rise to the top of the popularity chain. The instructions appear simple enough to follow, but, like life, nothing is as easy as it seems.', 'Jessica Darling – a smart, witty, opinionated girl heading into 7th grade – was never too concerned about where she''d fit in the middle school hierarchy. But before her first day of school, her older sister — the super popular Bethany, now in college—decides to help out by giving her the “It List”—a cheat sheet on how to navigate the middle school maze and rise to the top of the popularity chain. The instructions appear simple enough to follow, but, like life, nothing is as easy as it seems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jBKr84871j6gA7Hylliu9nntMO7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:370765'),
  ('1052292241199415294', 'Jessica Forever', 2019, 'Drama, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Caroline Poggi, Jonathan Vinel, Marine Atlan', 'Caroline Poggi, Jonathan Vinel', 'Aomi Muyock, Sebastian Urzendowsky, Augustin Raguenet, Lukas Ionesco, Paul Hamy, Eddy Suiveng, Maya Coline, Angelina Woreth', null, 'Jessica is the leader of a group of lost boys with a violent past who now seek peace and harmony. She is the only one to have ever brought them love and understanding. They only wish to create a world where they can live in peace together, and forever.', 'Jessica is the leader of a group of lost boys with a violent past who now seek peace and harmony. She is the only one to have ever brought them love and understanding. They only wish to create a world where they can live in peace together, and forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wzfxrR5rXI5KtD21rKARd5qNmcd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:515048'),
  ('176337255174971950', 'Jester Till', 2003, 'Animation, Family', 'Eberhard Junkersdorf', 'Peter Carpentier, Eberhard Junkersdorf, Christopher Vogler', 'Mario Adorf, Veronica Ferres, Christian Tramitz, Dieter Landuris, Rick Kavanian, Oliver Mink, Hannes Jaenicke, Katharina Thalbach', 'PG', 'One of Europe''s most beloved folk tale hero, Jester Till is the ultimate prankster embodying the simple wisdom and earthy humor of medieval European peasant folk. In this adventure tale, Till is on his way to the city to visit his grandfather, the slightly absent-minded wizard Marcus. The old man are brewing up a magical happiness potion he feels the townsfolk need. The potion however is tampered with and Marcus vanishes in a horrendous explosion. Till embarks on an adventurous quest to find him.', 'One of Europe''s most beloved folk tale hero, Jester Till is the ultimate prankster embodying the simple wisdom and earthy humor of medieval European peasant folk. In this adventure tale, Till is on his way to the city to visit his grandfather, the slightly absent-minded wizard Marcus. The old man are brewing up a magical happiness potion he feels the townsfolk need. The potion however is tampered with and Marcus vanishes in a horrendous explosion. Till embarks on an adventurous quest to find him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iWQ54Hcyu8M7SQNThOGx5MzwCJU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90530'),
  ('527213496826165758', 'Jesu, Joy of Man''s Desiring', 2012, 'Comedy, History', 'Jean-Christophe Hembert, Jean-Christophe Hembert', null, 'Alexandre Astier', null, 'In 1733, Johann Sebastian Bach gives an explosive and unexpected music lesson at the Leipzig church.', 'In 1733, Johann Sebastian Bach gives an explosive and unexpected music lesson at the Leipzig church.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mSsHebU0XJ8xm2MfYJbo0jnSePi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145349'),
