  ('283504668861868094', 'Jesus Henry Christ', 2012, 'Comedy, Family, Drama', 'Dennis Lee, Daniel Moder', 'Dennis Lee', 'Michael Sheen, Toni Collette, Jason Spevack, Samantha Weinstein, Melyssa Ade, Oprah Winfrey, Frank Moore, Paul Braunstein', 'PG-13', 'At the age of ten, Henry James Hermin, a boy who was conceived in a petri-dish and raised by his feminist mother, follows a string of Post-It notes in hopes of finding his biological father.', 'At the age of ten, Henry James Hermin, a boy who was conceived in a petri-dish and raised by his feminist mother, follows a string of Post-It notes in hopes of finding his biological father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cdK3OU14K8zjWjDlhXY2rNRjKUQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96973'),
