  ('781986477012491477', 'Jesus of Montreal', 1989, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Denys Arcand, Guy Dufaux', 'Denys Arcand', 'Lothaire Bluteau, Catherine Wilkening, Johanne-Marie Tremblay, Rémy Girard, Robert Lepage, Gilles Pelletier, Yves Jacques, Cédric Noël', null, 'A group of actors putting on an interpretive Passion Play in Montreal begin to experience a meshing of their characters and their private lives as the production takes form against the growing opposition of the Catholic church.', 'A group of actors putting on an interpretive Passion Play in Montreal begin to experience a meshing of their characters and their private lives as the production takes form against the growing opposition of the Catholic church.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/evtfMmuJyCQch2JIdWO2SdGWgJA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4486'),
  ('231791409987676250', 'Jesus of Nazareth', 1942, 'History, Drama', 'Víctor Herrera, José Díaz Morales', 'José Díaz Morales, Alfonso Lapeña', 'José Cibrián, Adriana Lamar, Aurora Walker, José Baviera, Rafael María de Labra, Enrique García Álvarez, José Pidal, Arturo Soto Rangel', null, 'The biblical story of The Messiah from his baptism through his crucifixion.', 'The biblical story of The Messiah from his baptism through his crucifixion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zSsIs2zldC25pFlCHM7UOqNCYzu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:432375'),
  ('355403096228773990', 'Jesus Revolution', 2023, 'Drama, History', 'Brent McCorkle, Jon Erwin, Akis Konstantakopoulos', 'Jon Erwin, Jon Gunn', 'Joel Courtney, Kelsey Grammer, Jonathan Roumie, Kimberly Williams-Paisley, Anna Grace Barlow, Julia Campbell, Alexia Ioannides, Matthew Montemaro', 'PG-13', 'In the 1970s, aimless teenager Greg Laurie searches for all the right things in all the wrong places until he meets Lonnie Frisbee, a charismatic hippie/street preacher. Together with local pastor Chuck Smith, they open the doors of a languishing church to an unexpected revival.', 'In the 1970s, aimless teenager Greg Laurie searches for all the right things in all the wrong places until he meets Lonnie Frisbee, a charismatic hippie/street preacher. Together with local pastor Chuck Smith, they open the doors of a languishing church to an unexpected revival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A3qqrl8lJvlpRCwkbUEADXzVaDC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:719256'),
  ('1048993325211525096', 'Jesus Shows You the Way to the Highway', 2020, 'Science Fiction, Comedy, Action', 'Miguel Llansó, Erik Põllumaa, Israel Seoane', 'Miguel Llansó', 'Daniel Tadesse, Agustín Mateo, Guillermo Llansó, Solomon Tashe, Gerda-Annette Allikas, Rene Köster, Lauri Lagle, Carlo Pironti', null, 'CIA agents Palmer and Gagano are tasked with the perilous mission of destroying “The Soviet Union!" As they enter the system using a VR simulation, their mission quickly turns into a delirious trap, far more complex than expected, as the fabric of reality starts unraveling around them.', 'CIA agents Palmer and Gagano are tasked with the perilous mission of destroying “The Soviet Union!" As they enter the system using a VR simulation, their mission quickly turns into a delirious trap, far more complex than expected, as the fabric of reality starts unraveling around them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t13ZvZrp7ELk8uqq7zpWtplJA3L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:605808'),
