  ('386911904207059238', 'Jet Lag', 2002, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Danièle Thompson, Patrick Blossier', 'Danièle Thompson, Christopher Thompson', 'Jean Reno, Juliette Binoche, Sergi López, Scali Delpeyrat, Karine Belly, Raoul Billerey, Nadège Beausson-Diagne, Alice Taglioni', null, 'At Charles de Gaulle Airport in Paris, a beautician on her way to a new job in Mexico accidentally meets a cook who is on his way back from America. Labor strikes, bad weather, and pure luck cause the two of them to share a room overnight at the airport Hilton hotel. Will their initial mutual indifference and downright hostility turn into a one night stand or perhaps something more?', 'At Charles de Gaulle Airport in Paris, a beautician on her way to a new job in Mexico accidentally meets a cook who is on his way back from America. Labor strikes, bad weather, and pure luck cause the two of them to share a room overnight at the airport Hilton hotel. Will their initial mutual indifference and downright hostility turn into a one night stand or perhaps something more?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/us5es90wJgcXcWbFbmQG1yp6pEk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18300'),
  ('450398774673442981', 'Jet Pilot', 1957, 'Action, Adventure, Romance', 'Josef von Sternberg, Fred Fleck, James Lane', 'Jules Furthman', 'John Wayne, Janet Leigh, Jay C. Flippen, Paul Fix, Richard Rober, Roland Winters, Hans Conried, Ivan Triesault', 'G', 'John Wayne stars as U.S. Air Force aviator Jim Shannon, who''s tasked with escorting a Soviet pilot (Janet Leigh) claiming -- at the height of the Cold War -- that she wants to defect. After falling in love with and wedding the fetching flyer, Shannon learns from his superiors that she''s a spy on a mission to extract military secrets. To save his new wife from prison and deportation, Shannon devises a risky plan in this 1957 drama.', 'John Wayne stars as U.S. Air Force aviator Jim Shannon, who''s tasked with escorting a Soviet pilot (Janet Leigh) claiming -- at the height of the Cold War -- that she wants to defect. After falling in love with and wedding the fetching flyer, Shannon learns from his superiors that she''s a spy on a mission to extract military secrets. To save his new wife from prison and deportation, Shannon devises a risky plan in this 1957 drama.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/itCjPSUVfS2bQBl3oxdqwQJx40H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53906'),
  ('412478289529693352', 'Jet Set', 2000, 'Comedy', 'Fabien Onteniente, Franco Di Giacomo, Odile Abergel', 'Fabien Onteniente, Olivier Chavarot, Bruno Solo', 'Samuel Le Bihan, Lambert Wilson, Bruno Solo, Estelle Larrivaz, Lorànt Deutsch, Ornella Muti, Ariadna Gil, José Garcia', null, 'In the working-class Paris suburb of Montreuil, Jimmy''s restaurant, the Bombay Bar, is on the verge of being closed down by creditors. Jimmy is despondent -- the fact that his wife is about to have a baby isn''t helping matters -- when he and his business partner Fifi find unlikely inspiration in the form of "Riches et Sympas," a TV show dedicated to the lives of the rich and famous. Figuring that getting the "right" people to frequent their business will ensure its reputation, Jimmy and Fifi persuade Jimmy''s friend, the laid-back, unemployed Mike, to pose as a nobleman and lure his moneyed associates to the Bombay Bar. Mike agrees, and after crashing a posh charity ball, he finds himself being taken in by the likes of society fixture Arthus de Poulignac and Evrard, the latter of whom ensconces Mike in his private mansion. Unfortunately, Mike soon becomes a little too fond of his newly-acquired lifestyle, leaving Jimmy to wonder what to do with the monster he unwittingly created.', 'In the working-class Paris suburb of Montreuil, Jimmy''s restaurant, the Bombay Bar, is on the verge of being closed down by creditors. Jimmy is despondent -- the fact that his wife is about to have a baby isn''t helping matters -- when he and his business partner Fifi find unlikely inspiration in the form of "Riches et Sympas," a TV show dedicated to the lives of the rich and famous. Figuring that getting the "right" people to frequent their business will ensure its reputation, Jimmy and Fifi persuade Jimmy''s friend, the laid-back, unemployed Mike, to pose as a nobleman and lure his moneyed associates to the Bombay Bar. Mike agrees, and after crashing a posh charity ball, he finds himself being taken in by the likes of society fixture Arthus de Poulignac and Evrard, the latter of whom ensconces Mike in his private mansion. Unfortunately, Mike soon becomes a little too fond of his newly-acquired lifestyle, leaving Jimmy to wonder what to do with the monster he unwittingly created.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/svtsHwTS49PzXU3zXeQAZgE5j6H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51861'),
  ('856868702675197224', 'Jet Storm', 1959, 'Thriller', 'Cy Endfield, Michael Stevenson, Jack Hildyard', 'Cy Endfield', 'Richard Attenborough, Stanley Baker, Harry Secombe, Hermione Baddeley, George Rose, Mai Zetterling, Diane Cilento, Virginia Maskell', 'NR', 'Crisis in the air: A passenger aboard a commercial airplane flying from London to New York threatens to detonate a bomb over the Atlantic.', 'Crisis in the air: A passenger aboard a commercial airplane flying from London to New York threatens to detonate a bomb over the Atlantic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9mdpGhwje48y0RM5Bq1AGKe91jk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41099'),
  ('525599757706343612', 'Jethica', 2023, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Drama, Horror', 'Pete Ohs, Pete Ohs, Patryk Bychoski', 'Ashley Denise Robinson, Will Madden, Pete Ohs', 'Callie Hernandez, Ashley Denise Robinson, Will Madden, Andy Faulkner, Ross Yingst, Alan Palomo, Stephanie Hunt', 'NR', 'While hiding out in New Mexico after a freak accident, Elena runs into Jessica, an old friend from high school. When Jessica''s stalker suddenly shows up at their door, they must seek help from beyond the grave to get rid of him, for good.', 'While hiding out in New Mexico after a freak accident, Elena runs into Jessica, an old friend from high school. When Jessica''s stalker suddenly shows up at their door, they must seek help from beyond the grave to get rid of him, for good.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Q5KZ6JMFbfWftCrrW1C2VQlu5S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:934601'),
  ('488251738572239586', 'Jetsons: The Movie', 1990, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Science Fiction', 'William Hanna, Joseph Barbera, Ray Patterson', 'Dennis Marks', 'George O''Hanlon, Mel Blanc, Penny Singleton, Tiffany, Patric Zimmerman, Don Messick, Jean Vander Pyl, Brad Garrett', 'G', 'George Jetson is forced to uproot his family when Mr. Spacely promotes him to take charge of a new factory on a distant planet.', 'George Jetson is forced to uproot his family when Mr. Spacely promotes him to take charge of a new factory on a distant planet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u7MciwvfyYrvZEua22wz48Puu7O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17009'),
  ('399762664546907189', 'Jeune Femme', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Léonor Serraille, Émilie Noblet, Aurélien Lebret', 'Bastien Daret, Clémence Carré', 'Laetitia Dosch, Grégoire Monsaingeon, Souleymane Seye Ndiaye, Léonie Simaga, Erika Sainte, Lila-Rose Gilberti, Audrey Bonnet, Nathalie Richard', null, 'Broke, with nothing but her cat to her name and doors closing in her face, Paula is back in Paris after a long absence. As she meets different people along the way, there is one thing she knows for sure: she''s determined to make a new start and she''ll do it with style and panache.', 'Broke, with nothing but her cat to her name and doors closing in her face, Paula is back in Paris after a long absence. As she meets different people along the way, there is one thing she knows for sure: she''s determined to make a new start and she''ll do it with style and panache.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zz3WiqmC0ySu03Ruzlc0bKyOaqb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:452016'),
  ('1081660592761911382', 'Jeune Juliette', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Olivier Gossot, Anne Émond, Nathalie Boutrie', 'Anne Émond', 'Alexane Jamieson, Léanne Désilets, Gabriel Beaudet, Robin Aubert, Antoine Desrochers, Christophe Levac, Stéphane Crête, Julien Leclerc', null, 'Fourteen-year old Juliette lives in the country with her father and her older brother. When Juliette was younger, her mother left the family to pursue her career in New York; from that moment, Juliette started to gain weight. Today, she’s not obese, but she’s clearly the heaviest girl at her high school. But that doesn’t stop her from being vivacious, funny and unrepentantly rebellious. Juliette has big dreams: she wants to throw the best parties, move to New York to live with her mother, and date the most gorgeous guy in her school, an older boy who is about to graduate. In short, she wants everything she can’t have—which sometimes makes her forget to appreciate those who really love her. We follow this brazen and endearing girl during her hectic last few weeks before summer vacation, and watch as she does some growing up—but not too much.', 'Fourteen-year old Juliette lives in the country with her father and her older brother. When Juliette was younger, her mother left the family to pursue her career in New York; from that moment, Juliette started to gain weight. Today, she’s not obese, but she’s clearly the heaviest girl at her high school. But that doesn’t stop her from being vivacious, funny and unrepentantly rebellious. Juliette has big dreams: she wants to throw the best parties, move to New York to live with her mother, and date the most gorgeous guy in her school, an older boy who is about to graduate. In short, she wants everything she can’t have—which sometimes makes her forget to appreciate those who really love her. We follow this brazen and endearing girl during her hectic last few weeks before summer vacation, and watch as she does some growing up—but not too much.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v76LdU7Q4XOzKR8u3vXAY3URmOn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:611843'),
  ('475002065819855797', 'Jew Suss: Rise and Fall', 2010, 'Drama, War', 'Carl-Friedrich Koschnick, Oskar Roehler', 'Franz Novotny, Oskar Roehler, Klaus Richter', 'Tobias Moretti, Moritz Bleibtreu, Martina Gedeck, Justus von Dohnányi, Armin Rohde, Paula Kalenberg, Ralf Bauer, Robert Stadlober', null, 'This intricate historical drama tells the story of actor Ferdinand Marian (Tobias Moretti), who is ordered by Nazi propagandist Joseph Goebbels to star in the 1940 anti-Semitic film Jew Suss. Despite his cooperation, Ferdinand''s actions have unexpected costs. Ferdinand''s Jewish wife, Anna (Martina Gedeck), is sent to a concentration camp, and as World War II intensifies, he rebels against the Nazis, leading to the destruction of his career.', 'This intricate historical drama tells the story of actor Ferdinand Marian (Tobias Moretti), who is ordered by Nazi propagandist Joseph Goebbels to star in the 1940 anti-Semitic film Jew Suss. Despite his cooperation, Ferdinand''s actions have unexpected costs. Ferdinand''s Jewish wife, Anna (Martina Gedeck), is sent to a concentration camp, and as World War II intensifies, he rebels against the Nazis, leading to the destruction of his career.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t0BFriqdnKoHga3TM9LofydEzKA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61623'),
