  ('1054177943065142560', 'Jewel Thief', 1967, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Vijay Anand, Somnath Rangroo, Prabhuji Jasbir', 'Vijay Anand', 'Dev Anand, Vyjayanthimala, Tanuja Samarth, Ashok Kumar, D.K. Sapru, Anju Mahendru, Helen, Nazir Hussain', null, 'Vinay finds himself constantly mistaken for a look-alike jewel thief. To clear his name, he joins hands with the police to impersonate the thief and catch the real culprit. When the thief decides to counter by posing as Vinay, their true identities become thoroughly muddled.', 'Vinay finds himself constantly mistaken for a look-alike jewel thief. To clear his name, he joins hands with the police to impersonate the thief and catch the real culprit. When the thief decides to counter by posing as Vinay, their true identities become thoroughly muddled.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bDgXjS4bXj2RDj3KpIb023d7AAT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48922'),
