  ('1117535259966973902', 'Jezabel', 2022, 'Thriller, Crime, Mystery, Science Fiction', 'Hernán Jabes, Gerard Uzcategui', 'Hernán Jabes, Eduardo Sánchez Rugeles', 'Gabriel Agüero, Eliane Chipia, Johanna Juliethe, Shakti Maal, Erich Wildpret, Cesar Cova, María Conchita Alonso, Rossana Hernández', null, 'Four upper-class high school students live carefree between drugs, games and love until one of the girls, Eli, is brutally killed. Sixteen years later, the memory of the crime torments Alain, another member of the group.', 'Four upper-class high school students live carefree between drugs, games and love until one of the girls, Eli, is brutally killed. Sixteen years later, the memory of the crime torments Alain, another member of the group.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4zBkbAXsx5IUx97ndJm18UoxIKd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:772445'),
