  ('1012463622592210090', 'JFK Revisited: Through the Looking Glass', 2021, 'Documentary, History', 'Oliver Stone, Robert Richardson', 'James DiEugenio', 'Whoopi Goldberg, Donald Sutherland, Oliver Stone, Robert F. Kennedy Jr., David Talbot, Cyril H. Wecht, Henry C. Lee, Douglas Horne', null, 'Thirty years after the release of his film JFK (1991), filmmaker Oliver Stone reviews recently declassified evidence related to the assassination of President John F. Kennedy, which took place in Dallas on November 22, 1963.', 'Thirty years after the release of his film JFK (1991), filmmaker Oliver Stone reviews recently declassified evidence related to the assassination of President John F. Kennedy, which took place in Dallas on November 22, 1963.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uWwEWzjkmuNGXpMhpVsrhNNB0NV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:836486'),
  ('971910071105962202', 'JGA', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Alireza Golafshan', 'Alireza Golafshan', 'Luise Heyer, Taneshia Abt, Teresa Rizos, Dimitrij Schaad, Axel Stein, Trystan Pütter, Arnel Taci, Julia Hartmann', null, 'Two bachelorette parties meet under the Ibizan sun. This could simply be a fun getaway for the single girls - if the future groom wouldn''t be Jasmin''s ex-boyfriend and her own wedding not just a fake one.', 'Two bachelorette parties meet under the Ibizan sun. This could simply be a fun getaway for the single girls - if the future groom wouldn''t be Jasmin''s ex-boyfriend and her own wedding not just a fake one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9DPr7xEvSg7W5AqWecDa7TV4mbq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:859278'),
  ('357942273334774231', 'Jhoom Barabar Jhoom', 2007, 'Drama, Romance', 'Shaad Ali, Ayananka Bose', 'Habib Faisal', 'Abhishek Bachchan, Lara Dutta, Preity Zinta, Bobby Deol, Robert Galas, Piyush Mishra, Hubertus Geller, Ameet Chana', null, 'London, an overcrowded cafe, one table to share. Two strangers tell each other “how I met my fiancé” stories to kill time. Rikki met his fiance Anaida at the Ritz in Paris and Alvira met her prince charming Steve at Madame Tussauds', 'London, an overcrowded cafe, one table to share. Two strangers tell each other “how I met my fiancé” stories to kill time. Rikki met his fiance Anaida at the Ritz in Paris and Alvira met her prince charming Steve at Madame Tussauds', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u1KsUXW4Rjageid0zSYRQMFoUte.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14162'),
  ('41684297414111486', 'Jhooth Bole Kauwa Kaate', 1998, null, 'Hrishikesh Mukherjee', null, 'Anil Kapoor, Juhi Chawla Mehta, Amrish Puri, Anupam Kher, Reema Lagoo, Sajid Khan, Harish Patel, Harpal Singh', null, 'Abhyankar is an orthodox head of his family, a retired police officer, he has values which he wants his family to also uphold. As a result of his values, his daughter is unable to be forthright and is unable to introduce the young man she loves. She concocts a scheme whereby her father would approve of her lover. What results is quite hilarious.', 'Abhyankar is an orthodox head of his family, a retired police officer, he has values which he wants his family to also uphold. As a result of his values, his daughter is unable to be forthright and is unable to introduce the young man she loves. She concocts a scheme whereby her father would approve of her lover. What results is quite hilarious.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vk7sYgPmN4e9kdMDlcncHKoizzs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:166234'),
  ('1007057321263038796', 'Jhootha Hi Sahi', 2010, 'Drama, Romance', 'Manoj Lobo, Abbas Tyrewala', 'Paakhi A. Tyrewala', 'Paakhi A. Tyrewala, John Abraham, Manasi Scott, Raghu Ram', null, 'A suicidal woman''s "final" call mistakenly connects her to a man who gives her something to live for.', 'A suicidal woman''s "final" call mistakenly connects her to a man who gives her something to live for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d3j20TIls5bKHgzc7d0XOGbx1QR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48826'),
  ('177583533917855710', 'Jhund', 2022, 'Drama', 'Sudhakar Reddy Yakkanti, Nagraj Popatrao Manjule', 'Nagraj Popatrao Manjule', 'Amitabh Bachchan, Ankush Gedam, Rinku Rajguru, Akash Thosar, Kishore Kadam, Arjun Radhakrishnan, Priyanshu Thakur, Rajiya Suhel', null, 'A retired sports teacher transforms a bunch of teenage slum goons into disciplined football players against all odds.', 'A retired sports teacher transforms a bunch of teenage slum goons into disciplined football players against all odds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A5rzrjzdzEuPX7Gcc4KphutBejj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:665685'),
  ('67450228665175424', 'Jia Zhangke, A Guy from Fenyang', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Inti Briones, Walter Salles', 'Walter Salles, Jean-Michel Frodon', 'Jia Zhangke, Wang Hongwei, Zhao Tao, Han Sanming, Nelson Yu Lik-wai', null, 'Chinese filmmaker Jia Zhangke returns to the shooting locations of his films, along with his actors, friends and close collaborators. Jia recalls the inspiration sources for his movies, such as Platform, Still Life and A Touch of Sin. The film is the memory of a filmmaker and of a country in convulsion, China, which reveals itself little by little.', 'Chinese filmmaker Jia Zhangke returns to the shooting locations of his films, along with his actors, friends and close collaborators. Jia recalls the inspiration sources for his movies, such as Platform, Still Life and A Touch of Sin. The film is the memory of a filmmaker and of a country in convulsion, China, which reveals itself little by little.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dwqQNXIDs59sQPWPB6H98rGMyrQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:299751'),
  ('1021789450112023686', 'Jian Bing Man', 2015, 'Action, Comedy, Drama', 'Dong Chengpeng', 'Dong Chengpeng', 'Dong Chengpeng, Yuan Shanshan, Liu Yan, Sandra Ng Kwan-Yu, Eric Tsang Chi-Wai, Yue Yunpeng, Yi Yunhe, Liang Chao', null, 'Beijing, the present day. Popular TV personality Da Peng is invited by gangster businessman Wang Hai to make a film in which he will invest. Wang insists that Da Peng''s co-star is TV drama actress Du Xiaoxiao. However, after a nightclub scandal involving Da Peng goes viral, he''s blackballed by a powerful internet executive and finds himself unable to attract any male co-star. Wang also wants his investment back. Da Peng decides to make his own movie on the cheap, using a script he has about an alien, A Li, who arrives on Earth and has various adventures as a superhero.', 'Beijing, the present day. Popular TV personality Da Peng is invited by gangster businessman Wang Hai to make a film in which he will invest. Wang insists that Da Peng''s co-star is TV drama actress Du Xiaoxiao. However, after a nightclub scandal involving Da Peng goes viral, he''s blackballed by a powerful internet executive and finds himself unable to attract any male co-star. Wang also wants his investment back. Da Peng decides to make his own movie on the cheap, using a script he has about an alien, A Li, who arrives on Earth and has various adventures as a superhero.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sN6WqOcalzLEiHXkgDFVIAXHYhH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:348595'),
  ('290357481182627926', 'Jiang Hu', 2004, 'Drama, Crime, Action', 'Wong Ching-Po, Charlie Lam Chi-Kin', 'Christine To Chi-Long', 'Andy Lau, Jacky Cheung Hok-Yau, Eric Tsang Chi-Wai, Shawn Yue Man-Lok, Edison Chen, Jacklyn Wu Chien-Lien, Norman Tsui Siu-Keung, Tony Ho', null, 'When Triad leader Hung considers leaving the world of the gangsters, a brutal war begins in the world of jiang-hu. Meanwhile, an internal conflict begins between Hung and his best man, Left-Hand.', 'When Triad leader Hung considers leaving the world of the gangsters, a brutal war begins in the world of jiang-hu. Meanwhile, an internal conflict begins between Hung and his best man, Left-Hand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wcS8IVN8lTpDzSL3xl2YUcYsmVn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38030'),
  ('1009773537179723409', 'Jiang Hu: The Triad Zone', 2000, 'Comedy, Crime, Romance', 'Dante Lam Chiu-Yin, Cheung Man-Po', 'Amy Chin Siu-Wai, Chan Hing-Kai', 'Tony Leung Ka-fai, Sandra Ng Kwan-Yu, Anthony Wong Chau-Sang, Eason Chan Yik-Shun, Jo Kok Cho-Lam, Roy Cheung Yiu-Yeung, Chan Fai-Hung, Helena Law Lan', null, 'Gang leader Jimmy Yam gathers all of his closest people after receiving a death threat in order to reveal their true nature.', 'Gang leader Jimmy Yam gathers all of his closest people after receiving a death threat in order to reveal their true nature.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gIMrSwXeVBKNImbQTFti3L8BKsE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125708'),
  ('594225487070991127', 'Jiang Ziya', 2020, 'Animation, Action, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Li Ruijie, Cheng Teng, Wei Li', 'Xie Xiying', 'Zheng Xi, Jiang Guangtao, Ji Guanlin, Sheng Feng, Yang Ning, Meme Yan, Chen Siyu, Tong Xinzhu', null, 'Atop the ruins of war, top commander Jiang Ziya is given the task to banish the Nine-tailed Fox Demon who threatens all mortals'' very existence. When he discovers the Nine-tailed Fox''s life linked to the soul of an innocent girl, he is faced with a challenging decision: follow the will of heaven or find his own path to righteousness.', 'Atop the ruins of war, top commander Jiang Ziya is given the task to banish the Nine-tailed Fox Demon who threatens all mortals'' very existence. When he discovers the Nine-tailed Fox''s life linked to the soul of an innocent girl, he is faced with a challenging decision: follow the will of heaven or find his own path to righteousness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eDq4dGgNHxPbT3Y5S6mfymsQ0rQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:635389'),
  ('919155428914216239', 'Jigarthanda', 2014, 'Music, Crime, Comedy, Thriller', 'Karthik Subbaraj, Gavemic U Ary', 'Karthik Subbaraj', 'Siddharth, Bobby Simha, Karunakaran, Lakshmi Menon, Ramachandran Durairaj, Kaalaiyan, Guru Somasundaram, Sangili Murugan', null, 'A budding director endeavors to research a merciless gangster for making a film on gangsterism. But his secret attempts to conduct the research fail when he gets caught for snooping.', 'A budding director endeavors to research a merciless gangster for making a film on gangsterism. But his secret attempts to conduct the research fail when he gets caught for snooping.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oDcQE70RYc78iBYgHRknl64QKTu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270766'),
  ('491667038024374914', 'Jigarthanda DoubleX', 2023, 'Action, Drama, Comedy', 'Karthik Subbaraj, S. Thirunavukkarasu, Avinash R', 'Karthik Subbaraj', 'Raghava Lawrence, S. J. Suryah, Naveen Chandra, Nimisha Sajayan, Ilavarasu, Sathyan Sivakumar, Sanchana Natarajan, Kapila Venu', null, 'A notorious gangster is incited to transform into a film hero and opts for a filmmaker and their project descends into a scenario they had never anticipated.', 'A notorious gangster is incited to transform into a film hero and opts for a filmmaker and their project descends into a scenario they had never anticipated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rlPTdgLfgsSv8WiQXRZ2AVIDwAi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1007074'),
  ('604693651892573199', 'Jigen Daisuke', 2023, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Hajime Hashimoto, Hironori Yamasaki, Koji Iwakiri', 'Yoshimasa Akamatsu', 'Tetsuji Tamayama, Yoko Maki, Kotoka Maki, Honami Sato, Yasukaze Motomiya, Kazuki Namioka, Eugene Nomura, Yuuki Tsujimoto', 'PG-13', 'Feeling unhappy with his gun, Jigen is looking for the world’s best gunsmith. He finally finds out that Chiharu, who runs a watch shop, is the person he’s been seeking. Then, Jigen meets Oto, who comes to Chiharu’s shop looking for a gun. Jigen finds out about Oto''s secrets and the mysterious organization that’s after her. After Oto is kidnapped, Jigen gets into a desperate battle to save her.', 'Feeling unhappy with his gun, Jigen is looking for the world’s best gunsmith. He finally finds out that Chiharu, who runs a watch shop, is the person he’s been seeking. Then, Jigen meets Oto, who comes to Chiharu’s shop looking for a gun. Jigen finds out about Oto''s secrets and the mysterious organization that’s after her. After Oto is kidnapped, Jigen gets into a desperate battle to save her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rBeAZ1YiwVQSdeiHCWzGtJhKvbV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1157049'),
  ('550694073123867902', 'Jigoku', 1960, 'Horror, Drama', 'Nobuo Nakagawa, Mamoru Morita, Keinosuke Tsuchiya', 'Nobuo Nakagawa, Ichirō Miyagawa', 'Shigeru Amachi, Utako Mitsuya, Yōichi Numata, Hiroshi Hayashi, Kanjūrō Arashi, Jun Ōtomo, Akiko Yamashita, Kiyoko Tsuji', null, 'A group of sinners involved in interconnected tales of murder, revenge, deceit and adultery all meet at the Gates of Hell.', 'A group of sinners involved in interconnected tales of murder, revenge, deceit and adultery all meet at the Gates of Hell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ehiMOuKE7i9WHgvs7dSIZelsHwA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50173'),
  ('1064494807454202057', 'Jigra', 2024, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Vasan Bala, Karan Mally, Swapnil S. Sonawane', 'Debashish Irengbam', 'Alia Bhatt, Vedang Raina, Manoj Pahwa, Vivek Gomber, Akashdeep Sabir, Harssh A. Singh, Aditya Nanda, Adhiraj Singh', null, 'When Ankur is wrongfully imprisoned and sentenced to death in a foreign country, his steely sister Satya is driven by a lethal resolve to break him free.', 'When Ankur is wrongfully imprisoned and sentenced to death in a foreign country, his steely sister Satya is driven by a lethal resolve to break him free.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mhnT27mgtiMNowOhAlMWSqBoSyb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1184889'),
  ('945924499076308604', 'Jigsaw', 1949, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Fletcher Markle, Don Malkames, Sal Scoppa Jr.', 'Fletcher Markle, Vincent McConnor', 'Franchot Tone, Jean Wallace, Myron McCormick, Marc Lawrence, Winifred Lenihan, Doe Avedon, Hedley Rainnie, Walter Vaughan', 'NR', 'New York Assistant District Attorney Howard Malloy launches an investigation into a series of murders related to a neo-fascist organisation.', 'New York Assistant District Attorney Howard Malloy launches an investigation into a series of murders related to a neo-fascist organisation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Kr66T46Ml49mFM3qA8FpbkpYgh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23022'),
  ('927593464940243491', 'Jigsaw', 1962, 'Mystery, Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Val Guest, Arthur Grant', 'Val Guest', 'Jack Warner, Yolande Donlan, Michael Goodliffe, John Le Mesurier, John Barron, Moira Redmond, Christine Bocca, Brian Oulton', null, 'A woman is found murdered in a seaside house along the coast from Brighton in the county of East Sussex, England. Local D.I. Fred Fellows and D.S. Jim Wilks lead an investigation methodically following up leads and clues mostly in Brighton and Hove but also further afield. _-= Based on the novel "Sleep Long My Love" by Hillary Waugh and Inspired by the Brighton Trunk Murders of the late 1930''s =-_', 'A woman is found murdered in a seaside house along the coast from Brighton in the county of East Sussex, England. Local D.I. Fred Fellows and D.S. Jim Wilks lead an investigation methodically following up leads and clues mostly in Brighton and Hove but also further afield. _-= Based on the novel "Sleep Long My Love" by Hillary Waugh and Inspired by the Brighton Trunk Murders of the late 1930''s =-_', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aQfhEyE2BBjsr4LzAoQu1x9cZSn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93193'),
  ('757875514909389690', 'Jigsaw', 2017, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Ben Nott, Michael Spierig, Peter Spierig', 'Josh Stolberg, Pete Goldfinger', 'Tobin Bell, Matt Passmore, Callum Keith Rennie, Hannah Emily Anderson, Clé Bennett, Laura Vandervoort, Paul Braunstein, Mandela Van Peebles', 'R', 'Law enforcement finds itself chasing the ghost of a man dead for over a decade, embroiled in a diabolical new game that''s only just begun.', 'Law enforcement finds itself chasing the ghost of a man dead for over a decade, embroiled in a diabolical new game that''s only just begun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7RwHxhdUNS996JPFNB9a7CJtlwR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:298250'),
  ('475753811169426349', 'Jikirag', 2022, 'Horror', 'Leigah Keewatin, Jessica Moutray, Alexander J. Baxter', 'Alexander J. Baxter', 'Tracey Roath, Alexander J. Baxter, Roy Campsall, Josefin Jönsson Tysén, Corey Woods, Brian Johnston, Jessica Moutray', null, 'A pagan village, founded on the bones of both innocent and foul, is deeply rooted within the heart of an ancient Eden. When a balance of flesh and soil decays, the last surviving village elder battles madness and the macabre to save her people from not only themselves, but the monstrous judgement that burrows up from below.', 'A pagan village, founded on the bones of both innocent and foul, is deeply rooted within the heart of an ancient Eden. When a balance of flesh and soil decays, the last surviving village elder battles madness and the macabre to save her people from not only themselves, but the monstrous judgement that burrows up from below.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yhK0h9KTrGSgp0CdsN9UOlg5YQI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1005772'),
  ('29314504436093853', 'Jill Rips', 2000, 'Thriller', 'Anthony Hickox, David Pelletier', 'Kevin Bernhardt, Gareth Wardell', 'Dolph Lundgren, Danielle Brett, Sandi Ross, Charles Seixas, Kristi Angus, Kylie Bax, Roberta Angelica, Rufus Crawford', 'R', 'A tough guy goes undercover on a personal mission of vengeance into the hardcore world of S&amp;M, to find out who''s responsible for the death of his brother.', 'A tough guy goes undercover on a personal mission of vengeance into the hardcore world of S&amp;M, to find out who''s responsible for the death of his brother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cfuc1GSUQaN56gc8y5nvkXwRkLF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:122163'),
  ('309389502132923073', 'Jilla', 2014, 'Action', 'Nesan, Ganesh Rajavelu', 'Nesan', 'Mohanlal, Vijay, Sampath Raj, Kajal Aggarwal, Mahat Raghavendra, Nivetha Thomas, Soori, Pradeep Ram Singh Rawat', null, 'A cop decides to take on his godfather, who raised him from childhood, and make him realize the error of his ways.', 'A cop decides to take on his godfather, who raised him from childhood, and make him realize the error of his ways.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kUBsvLoyzgxTqTvuiE0PmJHpsRU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:246087'),
  ('222817898300472554', 'Jim & Andy: The Great Beyond', 2017, 'Documentary, Drama, Comedy', 'Chris Smith, Brantley Gutierrez', null, 'Jim Carrey, Danny DeVito, Miloš Forman, Judd Hirsch, Peter Bonerz, Randall Carver, Andy Dick, Paul Giamatti', null, 'Offbeat documentarian Chris Smith provides a behind-the-scenes look at how Jim Carrey adopted the persona of idiosyncratic comedian Andy Kaufman on the set of Man on the Moon.', 'Offbeat documentarian Chris Smith provides a behind-the-scenes look at how Jim Carrey adopted the persona of idiosyncratic comedian Andy Kaufman on the set of Man on the Moon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kKzopOFXz9YfsCTqg3XpF0GoypX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:469019'),
  ('299528659053328696', 'Jim and the Pirates Blom', 1987, 'Family, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Hans Alfredson, Ralph M. Evers', 'Stellan Skarsgård, Hans Alfredson', 'Johan Åkerblom, Ewa Fröling, Jan Malmsjö, Stellan Skarsgård, Stig Olin, Folke Lindh, Jesper Danielsson, Sten Hellström', null, 'Jim Olsson, eight years old, lives in a small, boring town. His father has passed away recently, but comes back in Jim''s fantasies to tell stories. In his daydreams, Jim has all kinds of adventures.', 'Jim Olsson, eight years old, lives in a small, boring town. His father has passed away recently, but comes back in Jim''s fantasies to tell stories. In his daydreams, Jim has all kinds of adventures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aerlsP5hpiRRm5NZKrfgeX5WDjy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74881'),
  ('33078768267426200', 'Jim Button and Luke the Engine Driver', 2018, 'Adventure, Family, Fantasy', 'Dennis Gansel, Torsten Breuer, Jan Stoltz', 'Sebastian Niemann, Dirk Ahner, Andrew Birkin', 'Henning Baum, Solomon Gordon, Annette Frier, Uwe Ochsenknecht, Christoph Maria Herbst, Milan Peschel, Rick Kavanian, Eden Gough', null, 'A young orphan boy Jim Button, his best friend Luke and a magical steam engine called Emma travel across the world in search of the truth about where Jim came from. Battling pirates and dragons, outsmarting make-believe giants, they must travel through the Forest of a Thousand Wonders, beyond the End of the World to find the hidden Dragon City.', 'A young orphan boy Jim Button, his best friend Luke and a magical steam engine called Emma travel across the world in search of the truth about where Jim came from. Battling pirates and dragons, outsmarting make-believe giants, they must travel through the Forest of a Thousand Wonders, beyond the End of the World to find the hidden Dragon City.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pkJEkOOr1qn5HLGGhkJ0bTTPVET.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:422742'),
  ('1124018564207035889', 'Jim Button and the Wild 13', 2020, 'Adventure, Family, Fantasy', 'Philip Peschlow, Dennis Gansel, Christian Kratzert', 'Dirk Ahner', 'Henning Baum, Solomon Gordon, Annette Frier, Milan Peschel, Rick Kavanian, Uwe Ochsenknecht, Christoph Maria Herbst, Leighanne Esperanzate', null, 'A year has gone by since Jim Button and his best friend, the engine driver Luke, returned from their dangerous adventure in Dragon City. Life on Morrowland goes its leisurely way again. Suddenly, dark clouds are gathering over the tranquil island of Morrowland: the notorious pirate gang "The Wild 13" has learned that the dragon Mrs Grindtooth has been conquered by Jim and Luke and now swears revenge. To protect Morrowland from another threat, the two of them set off with their steam engines Emma and Molly on a dangerous journey where they meet old friends like princess Li Si, Mr. Tur Tur and Nepomuk and make new friends with Sursulapichi, a real mermaid. On their adventure, Jim''s most fervent wish might also come true: to find out the truth about his mysterious origins.', 'A year has gone by since Jim Button and his best friend, the engine driver Luke, returned from their dangerous adventure in Dragon City. Life on Morrowland goes its leisurely way again. Suddenly, dark clouds are gathering over the tranquil island of Morrowland: the notorious pirate gang "The Wild 13" has learned that the dragon Mrs Grindtooth has been conquered by Jim and Luke and now swears revenge. To protect Morrowland from another threat, the two of them set off with their steam engines Emma and Molly on a dangerous journey where they meet old friends like princess Li Si, Mr. Tur Tur and Nepomuk and make new friends with Sursulapichi, a real mermaid. On their adventure, Jim''s most fervent wish might also come true: to find out the truth about his mysterious origins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ySWayaStxjpTXuwyRdKrPkicBFI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:616180'),
  ('285034289741541124', 'Jim Carrey: America Unmasked', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Thibaut Sève', null, 'Lison Daniel', null, 'Composed of numerous archives and film clips, this documentary is the story of a transgressive actor, a pirate who came to crack America''s too perfect mask to reveal its most infantile and moronic face, right in the heart of the Hollywood system.', 'Composed of numerous archives and film clips, this documentary is the story of a transgressive actor, a pirate who came to crack America''s too perfect mask to reveal its most infantile and moronic face, right in the heart of the Hollywood system.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7iBEBzOGAdPpuJ8PZCd3dTZDYii.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:869944'),
  ('1021697916856379522', 'Jim Carrey: Unnatural Act', 1991, 'Comedy, TV Movie, Documentary', 'Michael French', 'Jim Carrey', 'Jim Carrey, Wayne Flemming, Jacquie Holroyd, Leayanne Connolly, Denise Kennedy', null, 'Jim explores multiple aspects of life including religion, marriage and his own sanity. This stand-up special was taped at Theatre Passe Muraille, Toronto, Canada, in front of a live audience.', 'Jim explores multiple aspects of life including religion, marriage and his own sanity. This stand-up special was taped at Theatre Passe Muraille, Toronto, Canada, in front of a live audience.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oNr4ySv6ShqgALkljFZZRO5GkfX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24665'),
  ('923283828462447205', 'Jim Gaffigan: Beyond the Pale', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Michael Drumm', 'Jim Gaffigan', 'Jim Gaffigan', null, 'The affable, towheaded comic demonstrates his hysterical brand of self-effacing comedy and deadpan delivery at two sold-out shows at Chicago''s Vic Theater. It''s OK to laugh at this pale white guy...''cause nobody''s laughing at Jim Gaffigan harder than Jim Gaffigan!', 'The affable, towheaded comic demonstrates his hysterical brand of self-effacing comedy and deadpan delivery at two sold-out shows at Chicago''s Vic Theater. It''s OK to laugh at this pale white guy...''cause nobody''s laughing at Jim Gaffigan harder than Jim Gaffigan!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wY49QXYWm6tnVNPItjPxtQThAxv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108930'),
  ('128285121048249332', 'Jim Gaffigan: Cinco', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Jeannie Gaffigan', 'Jim Gaffigan, Jeannie Gaffigan', 'Jim Gaffigan', null, 'America''s king of clean comedy delivers wickedly funny jokes in his fifth hour-long special.', 'America''s king of clean comedy delivers wickedly funny jokes in his fifth hour-long special.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lQ6wVl0FOBy0aJm0IqPRLiguh44.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:432959'),
  ('655538894411193002', 'Jim Gaffigan: Comedy Monster', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Jim Gaffigan', 'Jim Gaffigan', 'Jim Gaffigan', null, 'Comedy icon Jim Gaffigan offers some thoughts on the hot mess that was 2021, as well as his takes on marching bands, billionaires in space, and more.', 'Comedy icon Jim Gaffigan offers some thoughts on the hot mess that was 2021, as well as his takes on marching bands, billionaires in space, and more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hWeCGk21qWMYyFYVMRPlx4VjPks.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:903303'),
  ('140802493840289590', 'Jim Gaffigan: King Baby', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Troy Miller', 'Jim Gaffigan', 'Jim Gaffigan', 'NR', 'The greatly anticipated follow up to the platinum selling Beyond the Pale. In this Austin performance that capped off the 2008 sold-out stand up tour, Gaffigan does not let the audience catch their breath. This all-new show proves no other comedian working today can romanticize laziness and over-indulgence like Jim Gaffigan.', 'The greatly anticipated follow up to the platinum selling Beyond the Pale. In this Austin performance that capped off the 2008 sold-out stand up tour, Gaffigan does not let the audience catch their breath. This all-new show proves no other comedian working today can romanticize laziness and over-indulgence like Jim Gaffigan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wcD3IL6NmsioH5R6qCY4yFijWlx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20837'),
  ('263772088543587221', 'Jim Gaffigan: Mr. Universe', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Jay Karas', 'Jim Gaffigan, Jeannie Gaffigan', 'Jim Gaffigan', null, 'Funnyman Jim Gaffigan offers up his unique take on everything from Disney World to overweight whales in this live show from Washington, D.C.', 'Funnyman Jim Gaffigan offers up his unique take on everything from Disney World to overweight whales in this live show from Washington, D.C.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/weUy08h9xGNKutN608aqFWJDM9O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101449'),
  ('299945989764297789', 'Jim Gaffigan: Obsessed', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Jay Chapman', 'Jim Gaffigan', 'Jim Gaffigan', null, 'Jim Gaffigan bursts back on the scene with this eagerly anticipated fourth comedy special. Dubbed the "King of Clean Comedy" by The Wall Street Journal, Jim''s obsession with all things food comes to fruition on Obsessed as he tackles a cornucopia of new food topics from fruit to seafood to donuts. Get ready for 70 minutes of non-stop laughs at Jim''s twisted-yet-enlightened observations on the seemingly mundane topics that have made him a fixture in the comedy world for audiences of all ages.', 'Jim Gaffigan bursts back on the scene with this eagerly anticipated fourth comedy special. Dubbed the "King of Clean Comedy" by The Wall Street Journal, Jim''s obsession with all things food comes to fruition on Obsessed as he tackles a cornucopia of new food topics from fruit to seafood to donuts. Get ready for 70 minutes of non-stop laughs at Jim''s twisted-yet-enlightened observations on the seemingly mundane topics that have made him a fixture in the comedy world for audiences of all ages.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/seaGy4VUA5guc1L0VodDjIGaTAT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:263111'),
  ('67507877723512513', 'Jim Henson Idea Man', 2024, 'Documentary', 'Ron Howard, Igor Martinović, Jenni Morello', 'Mark Monroe', 'Jim Henson, Frank Oz, Dave Goelz, Fran Brill, Rita Moreno, Jennifer Connelly, Brian Henson, Lisa Henson', 'PG', 'Featuring unprecedented access to Jim Henson''s personal archives, filmmaker Ron Howard brings us a fascinating and insightful look at a complex man whose boundless imagination inspired the world.', 'Featuring unprecedented access to Jim Henson''s personal archives, filmmaker Ron Howard brings us a fascinating and insightful look at a complex man whose boundless imagination inspired the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w1IYhFVW2XyKfkIyZ65jZ2Uyn6Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1273196'),
  ('692746978738305651', 'Jim Jefferies: Alcoholocaust', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Tim Kirkby', 'Jim Jefferies', 'Jim Jefferies', null, 'Share this *Alcoholocaust: (Meaning: The aftermath of a drinking party, usually resulting in every available horizontal surface being covered in empty booze containers, spilled beverages and a general sticky alcoholic residue.) Jim Jefferies, the globally renowned Australian stand-up, returns to Just For Laughs with his brand new solo show. Alcoholocaust includes some of Jim’s favourite wild antics over the past year. As always, his material is set in reality, which is what provides him with his trademark brutally frank style. Among other things, you will hear about a hilarious yet touching true story involving his friend’s severely disabled brother, plus Jim’s traditional pet peeves – religion & idiots.', 'Share this *Alcoholocaust: (Meaning: The aftermath of a drinking party, usually resulting in every available horizontal surface being covered in empty booze containers, spilled beverages and a general sticky alcoholic residue.) Jim Jefferies, the globally renowned Australian stand-up, returns to Just For Laughs with his brand new solo show. Alcoholocaust includes some of Jim’s favourite wild antics over the past year. As always, his material is set in reality, which is what provides him with his trademark brutally frank style. Among other things, you will hear about a hilarious yet touching true story involving his friend’s severely disabled brother, plus Jim’s traditional pet peeves – religion & idiots.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8qyfH2KEV5MGt4opGp5GiPhqavC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49505'),
  ('294303798395297771', 'Jim Jefferies: Bare', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Shannon Hartman', 'Jim Jefferies', 'Jim Jefferies', 'R', 'Smart, crude, and in-your-face, Australian comic/actor/equal-opportunity-offender Jim Jefferies is not for the faint of heart. Whether he is lampooning gun control, auditioning disabled actors, or over-sharing sexual experiences, the FXX "Legit" star proves nothing is out of bounds and even less, off limits. Filmed during the Boston run of his recent stand up tour.', 'Smart, crude, and in-your-face, Australian comic/actor/equal-opportunity-offender Jim Jefferies is not for the faint of heart. Whether he is lampooning gun control, auditioning disabled actors, or over-sharing sexual experiences, the FXX "Legit" star proves nothing is out of bounds and even less, off limits. Filmed during the Boston run of his recent stand up tour.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pqGtStSCU0F3cZyEItCaqol24Mi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:289333'),
  ('340706946432289663', 'Jim Jefferies: Freedumb', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Ryan Polito, Jay Lafayette', 'Jim Jefferies', 'Jim Jefferies', null, 'Returning for a second Netflix comedy special, Jim Jefferies unleashes his famously ferocious black humor to a packed house in Nashville, Tennessee.', 'Returning for a second Netflix comedy special, Jim Jefferies unleashes his famously ferocious black humor to a packed house in Nashville, Tennessee.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pveFZQKiUomWAxXu65zGSwiKoKD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:404022'),
  ('184842287427280302', 'Jim Jefferies: Fully Functional', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Jay Karas', 'Jim Jefferies', 'Jim Jefferies', 'R', 'There''s something magical about an Australian accent that seems to make even the most caustic wit come off with good-natured charm. And that delicate blend of deviant behavior and good intentions has skyrocketed Aussie comic Jim Jefferies to international acclaim with critics and fans alike. In this new hour-long special, the man hailed by Q Magazine as "Britain''s most offensive stand-up comedian" shares fresh tales from his life on the edge, including a menage a trois in Montreal and attending a party where God is on the guest list.', 'There''s something magical about an Australian accent that seems to make even the most caustic wit come off with good-natured charm. And that delicate blend of deviant behavior and good intentions has skyrocketed Aussie comic Jim Jefferies to international acclaim with critics and fans alike. In this new hour-long special, the man hailed by Q Magazine as "Britain''s most offensive stand-up comedian" shares fresh tales from his life on the edge, including a menage a trois in Montreal and attending a party where God is on the guest list.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ospzpJrBaCorNQlZC6VFBqwwUjk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146837'),
  ('758081630513992661', 'Jim Jefferies: High n'' Dry', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Scott Zabielski', 'Jim Jefferies', 'Jim Jefferies', 'R', 'No topic is off limits for Jim Jefferies as he muses on stoned koalas, his dad’s vasectomy confusion and choosing between his hair and his sex drive.', 'No topic is off limits for Jim Jefferies as he muses on stoned koalas, his dad’s vasectomy confusion and choosing between his hair and his sex drive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xHWhtNZAEt7jyEpGvpb9iJHoRh3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1078764'),
  ('662971737755211449', 'Jim Jefferies: I Swear to God', 2009, 'Comedy', 'John Moffitt', 'Jim Jefferies', 'Jim Jefferies', 'NR', 'Jim Jefferies: I Swear to God: The easily offended might do best to avoid Jim Jefferies’ raunchy, rude humor (or at least imbibe the two-drink minimum beforehand), but the Australian-born comedian provides plenty of laughs for everyone else in this HBO special. In I Swear to God, Jefferies continues his patented brand of comedy that once got him punched by an audience member, discussing the idiocy of no-smoking signs, sluts vs. studs, and his father’s Holocaust jokes.', 'Jim Jefferies: I Swear to God: The easily offended might do best to avoid Jim Jefferies’ raunchy, rude humor (or at least imbibe the two-drink minimum beforehand), but the Australian-born comedian provides plenty of laughs for everyone else in this HBO special. In I Swear to God, Jefferies continues his patented brand of comedy that once got him punched by an audience member, discussing the idiocy of no-smoking signs, sluts vs. studs, and his father’s Holocaust jokes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8GyTQCTnXE5JExI9Z8lncyRCpoO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31981'),
  ('1054840949876740566', 'Jim Jefferies: Intolerant', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Scott Zabielski', 'Jim Jefferies', 'Jim Jefferies', null, 'Between scenes from an excruciating date, Jim Jefferies digs into generational differences, his own bad habits and the shifting boundaries in comedy.', 'Between scenes from an excruciating date, Jim Jefferies digs into generational differences, his own bad habits and the shifting boundaries in comedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h4lRLoaeISvLncMVwGt8BcecGIM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:718831'),
  ('817137226705860293', 'Jim Jefferies: This Is Me Now', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Scott Zabielski', 'Jim Jefferies', 'Jim Jefferies', null, 'The gleefully irreverent Jefferies skewers “grabby” celebrities, political hypocrisy and his own ill-advised career moves in a brash stand-up special.', 'The gleefully irreverent Jefferies skewers “grabby” celebrities, political hypocrisy and his own ill-advised career moves in a brash stand-up special.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wwsPAZuz5WUkzjZJMgM0sFXjZES.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:532374'),
  ('607436678805853923', 'Jim Jefferies: Two Limb Policy', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Scott Zabielski', 'Jim Jefferies', 'Jim Jefferies', 'R', 'Comedian Jim Jefferies unleashes his thoughts on tiny mustaches, straight-guy struggles and why acting doesn''t count as a real job.', 'Comedian Jim Jefferies unleashes his thoughts on tiny mustaches, straight-guy struggles and why acting doesn''t count as a real job.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fTtQ0Garm1BcexZIxfEdWdzE5j8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1517042'),
  ('610352638728798250', 'Jim Thorpe – All-American', 1951, 'Drama', 'Michael Curtiz, David Curtiz, Ernest Haller', 'Douglas Morrow, Everett Freeman', 'Burt Lancaster, Charles Bickford, Steve Cochran, Phyllis Thaxter, Dick Wesson, Jack Big Head, Sonny Chorre, Al Mejia', null, 'The triumph and tragedy of Native American Jim Thorpe, who, after winning both the pentathlon and decathlon in the same Olympics, is stripped of his medals on a technicality.', 'The triumph and tragedy of Native American Jim Thorpe, who, after winning both the pentathlon and decathlon in the same Olympics, is stripped of his medals on a technicality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dFtIs3baceJcAXmcspoGZ0mZ55h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60853'),
  ('204258542767752726', 'Jim''s Story', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Arthur Dezanneau, Ethan Renault, Jean-Marie Larrieu', 'Arnaud Larrieu, Jean-Marie Larrieu', 'Karim Leklou, Laetitia Dosch, Sara Giraudeau, Bertrand Belin, Noée Abita, Andranic Manet, Eol Personne, Suzanne De Baecque', null, 'Aymeric runs into Florence, a former coworker, one evening in Saint-Claude in the Haut-Jura. She is six months pregnant and single. When she gives birth to Jim, Aymeric is there. They spend happy years together until Christophe, Jim''s biological father, shows up... It could be the start of a melodrama, it''s also the start of an odyssey into fatherhood.', 'Aymeric runs into Florence, a former coworker, one evening in Saint-Claude in the Haut-Jura. She is six months pregnant and single. When she gives birth to Jim, Aymeric is there. They spend happy years together until Christophe, Jim''s biological father, shows up... It could be the start of a melodrama, it''s also the start of an odyssey into fatherhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tUqCflwDzyPwmv8J5rUrVLoQUY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1102938'),
  ('1152449166007346882', 'Jimi Hendrix', 1973, 'Documentary, Music', 'Joe Boyd, John Head, Gary Weis', null, 'Arthur Allen, Albert Allen, Eric Barrett, Stella Benabon, Paul Caruso, Dick Cavett, Eric Clapton, Billy Cox', 'R', 'Made shortly after his death, this documentary explores the brief life and remarkable legacy of guitarist Jimi Hendrix. After finding fame in the U.K., Hendrix brought his act back to the U.S., where his influential playing style left a blazing imprint on a whole generation of musicians. Employing interviews with family and contemporaries, such as Eric Clapton, as well as scorching live performances from Woodstock and Isle of Wight, the film paints an indelible portrait of a rock ''n'' roll legend.', 'Made shortly after his death, this documentary explores the brief life and remarkable legacy of guitarist Jimi Hendrix. After finding fame in the U.K., Hendrix brought his act back to the U.S., where his influential playing style left a blazing imprint on a whole generation of musicians. Employing interviews with family and contemporaries, such as Eric Clapton, as well as scorching live performances from Woodstock and Isle of Wight, the film paints an indelible portrait of a rock ''n'' roll legend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9oeGx5bfr4NbvIEF7t22yqshPU4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:364442'),
  ('990963922259900953', 'Jimi Hendrix: Live at Woodstock', 1999, 'Music, Documentary', 'Chris Hegedus, Erez Laufer', 'Jimi Hendrix', 'Jimi Hendrix, Billy Cox, Mitch Mitchell, Larry Lee, Juma Sultan, Jerry Velez', 'NR', 'Nine o''clock on Monday morning, August 18, 1969: while the work force was starting the day, Jimi Hendrix was taking the stage at Woodstock. While hundreds of thousands had already left, 25,000 people remained to see this incredible performance. Hendrix, along with drummer Mitch Mitchell and bassist Billy Cox, offered masterly renditions of the songs of the recently disbanded Experience ("Hey Joe," "Foxey Lady"), and gave a preview of the blues-based Band of Gypsys ("Izabella," "Hear My Train A Comin''"), as well as Jimi''s era-defining rendition of "The Star Spangled Banner." Though the weekend had witnessed some landmark performances by other great artists, this performance from Hendrix is regarded by many as the defining moment in a festival ripe with defining moments.', 'Nine o''clock on Monday morning, August 18, 1969: while the work force was starting the day, Jimi Hendrix was taking the stage at Woodstock. While hundreds of thousands had already left, 25,000 people remained to see this incredible performance. Hendrix, along with drummer Mitch Mitchell and bassist Billy Cox, offered masterly renditions of the songs of the recently disbanded Experience ("Hey Joe," "Foxey Lady"), and gave a preview of the blues-based Band of Gypsys ("Izabella," "Hear My Train A Comin''"), as well as Jimi''s era-defining rendition of "The Star Spangled Banner." Though the weekend had witnessed some landmark performances by other great artists, this performance from Hendrix is regarded by many as the defining moment in a festival ripe with defining moments.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uyvkkUtf1iFe2PraO1mlpzgf8KG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48685'),
  ('436523768581681624', 'Jimi Plays Monterey', 1987, 'Documentary, Music', 'Chris Hegedus, D. A. Pennebaker, Bob Neuwirth', null, 'John Phillips, Jimi Hendrix, Noel Redding, Mitch Mitchell, Art Garfunkel, George Harrison, Mick Jagger, Brian Jones', 'NR', 'Jimi Hendrix''s debut American set at 1967''s Monterey Pop Festival is generally considered one of the most radical and legendary live shows ever. Virtually unknown to American audiences at the time, even though he was already an established entity in the UK, Hendrix and his two-piece Experience explode on stage, ripping through blues classics "Rock Me Baby" and Howlin'' Wolf''s "Killing Floor," interpreting and electrifying Bob Dylan''s "Like a Rolling Stone," debuting songs from his yet-to-be-released first album and closing with the now historic sacrificing/burning of his guitar during an unhinged version of "Wild Thing" that even its writer Chip Taylor would never have imagined. Hendrix uses feedback and distortion to enhance the songs in whisper-to-scream intensity, blazing territory that had not been previously explored with as much soul-frazzled power.', 'Jimi Hendrix''s debut American set at 1967''s Monterey Pop Festival is generally considered one of the most radical and legendary live shows ever. Virtually unknown to American audiences at the time, even though he was already an established entity in the UK, Hendrix and his two-piece Experience explode on stage, ripping through blues classics "Rock Me Baby" and Howlin'' Wolf''s "Killing Floor," interpreting and electrifying Bob Dylan''s "Like a Rolling Stone," debuting songs from his yet-to-be-released first album and closing with the now historic sacrificing/burning of his guitar during an unhinged version of "Wild Thing" that even its writer Chip Taylor would never have imagined. Hendrix uses feedback and distortion to enhance the songs in whisper-to-scream intensity, blazing territory that had not been previously explored with as much soul-frazzled power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lpO4JSRMzGH1A8KbXhyDFvlNe3D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26028'),
  ('771404358400873645', 'Jimi: All Is by My Side', 2013, 'Drama, Music', 'John Ridley, Tim Fleming, Charlie Endean', 'John Ridley', 'André 3000, Hayley Atwell, Imogen Poots, Burn Gorman, Ruth Negga, Amy De Bhrún, Laurence Kinlan, Robbie Jarvis', 'R', 'A drama based on Jimi Hendrix''s life as he left New York City for London, where his career took off.', 'A drama based on Jimi Hendrix''s life as he left New York City for London, where his career took off.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dsNU5nwOy30WfTet32cLiOsFkkN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:192133'),
  ('257964560393588890', 'Jimin''s Production Diary', 2023, 'Documentary, Music', 'Park Jun-soo, Kim Kyung-won', null, 'Jimin, RM, Jung Kook, Pdogg', null, 'This documentary chronicles the creation of FACE, Jimin''s debut solo album, as he embarks on a new artistic journey.', 'This documentary chronicles the creation of FACE, Jimin''s debut solo album, as he embarks on a new artistic journey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/swFKG8R2Ct8OG8cCNMoCQAD7aqv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1189705'),
  ('181607549336183846', 'Jiminy Glick in Lalawood', 2005, 'Comedy, Mystery', 'Vadim Jean, Mike Fox', 'Michael Short, Paul Flaherty, Martin Short', 'Martin Short, Jan Hooks, Linda Cardellini, Janeane Garofalo, John Michael Higgins, Elizabeth Perkins, Larry Joe Campbell, Mo Collins', 'R', 'Hungry for an A-list interview that could launch him into the gossip rag stratosphere, Jiminy Glick, a small-time journalist with big aspirations and an even bigger appetite, drags his wife and kids across the country to the star-studded Toronto Film Festival. But in between the nonstop parties and all-you-can-eat buffets, Glick soon finds himself in the middle of an outrageously scandalous mystery that becomes the celebrity scoop of the decade!', 'Hungry for an A-list interview that could launch him into the gossip rag stratosphere, Jiminy Glick, a small-time journalist with big aspirations and an even bigger appetite, drags his wife and kids across the country to the star-studded Toronto Film Festival. But in between the nonstop parties and all-you-can-eat buffets, Glick soon finds himself in the middle of an outrageously scandalous mystery that becomes the celebrity scoop of the decade!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xggAb26HJ64LTx7SYIn58nIM1b0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67445'),
  ('36927443913296951', 'Jimmy & The Demons', 2026, 'Documentary', 'Cindy Meehl, Scott Ruderman', null, 'James Grashow, Guzzy Grashow', null, 'In this charming and profound portrait of artistic devotion, celebrated sculptor James Grashow embarks, at age 79, on a four year odyssey to complete his magnum opus: a gigantic, intricate wooden sculpture dubbed "The Cathedral."', 'In this charming and profound portrait of artistic devotion, celebrated sculptor James Grashow embarks, at age 79, on a four year odyssey to complete his magnum opus: a gigantic, intricate wooden sculpture dubbed "The Cathedral."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jXhCYcGpyBIvHfy16KAWbgGbC6l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1465784'),
  ('436921245416495465', 'Jimmy and Judy', 2006, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Randall Rubin, Jon Schroder, Ben Kufrin', 'Randall Rubin, Jon Schroder', 'Edward Furlong, Rachael Bella, William Sadler, Chaney Kley, A.J. Buckley, James Eckhouse, Jane Leigh Connelly, Patrick Bristow', 'R', 'Two misunderstood suburban kids challenge society and run from the police while documenting all of their deeds with a digital camera.', 'Two misunderstood suburban kids challenge society and run from the police while documenting all of their deeds with a digital camera.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eCrr9LMCYpHlKzzKNXlTcMBs9xD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18869'),
  ('770528778485153968', 'Jimmy Carr: Comedian', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Dominic Brigstocke', 'Jimmy Carr', 'Jimmy Carr', null, 'Recorded live at London''s Bloomsbury theatre, the posh-suited gagster unleashes his rapid-fire wit upon his audience, with jokes that are just too rude for TV.', 'Recorded live at London''s Bloomsbury theatre, the posh-suited gagster unleashes his rapid-fire wit upon his audience, with jokes that are just too rude for TV.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o1Zzp5l8yJ6Ev2a6vDF5RvbHwEe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15372'),
  ('206885122878628253', 'Jimmy Carr: Funny Business', 2016, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Sam Wrench', 'Jimmy Carr', 'Jimmy Carr', null, 'British comedian Jimmy Carr unleashes his deadpan delivery and wickedly funny one-liners to a sold-out audience at the UK''s Hammersmith Apollo.', 'British comedian Jimmy Carr unleashes his deadpan delivery and wickedly funny one-liners to a sold-out audience at the UK''s Hammersmith Apollo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2FIjVbiim46ir5r2PtXebz7d9tH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:387054'),
  ('771944487349307335', 'Jimmy Carr: His Dark Material', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Brian Klein, Phil Piotrowsky, Nigel Catmur', 'Jimmy Carr', 'Jimmy Carr', null, 'Jimmy Carr finds humor in the darkest of places in this stand-up special that features his dry, sardonic wit — and some jokes he calls "career enders."', 'Jimmy Carr finds humor in the darkest of places in this stand-up special that features his dry, sardonic wit — and some jokes he calls "career enders."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i0JKuE6hyWw3bwEY3Yi7BYPh7dy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:904263'),
  ('585159310310119828', 'Jimmy Carr: In Concert', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Dominic Brigstocke', 'Jimmy Carr', 'Jimmy Carr', null, 'Britain''s foremost multi award winning joke technician Jimmy Carr returns with his fourth live stand up DVD, Jimmy Carr In Concert.', 'Britain''s foremost multi award winning joke technician Jimmy Carr returns with his fourth live stand up DVD, Jimmy Carr In Concert.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qo5zlEqlKMVyddBs6Oj7TkuIVJU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15429'),
  ('531613836705063568', 'Jimmy Carr: Natural Born Killer', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Jimmy Carr, Brian Klein, Phil Piotrowsky', 'Jimmy Carr', 'Jimmy Carr', 'R', 'Jimmy Carr refutes the idea that you can''t joke about anything these days with his edgy takes on gun control, religion, cancel culture and consent.', 'Jimmy Carr refutes the idea that you can''t joke about anything these days with his edgy takes on gun control, religion, cancel culture and consent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ntu2EZsk1HDaV7OjhZJT7OumSt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1262852'),
  ('245716668194754620', 'Jimmy Carr: Stand Up', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Dominic Brigstocke, Steve Nolan', 'Jimmy Carr', 'Jimmy Carr', null, 'Jimmy Carr returns with a brand new live stand-up DVD. Recorded live at London''s Bloomsbury theatre, Jimmy unleashes brand new material upon his audience that is just too rude for TV, taking his dry and sardonic wit and delightfully crafted jokes to a whole new level', 'Jimmy Carr returns with a brand new live stand-up DVD. Recorded live at London''s Bloomsbury theatre, Jimmy unleashes brand new material upon his audience that is just too rude for TV, taking his dry and sardonic wit and delightfully crafted jokes to a whole new level', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dq9qd7pmxwEJ1EWsoQThRXvA5LI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19499'),
  ('703127472328074433', 'Jimmy Carr: Telling Jokes', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Steve Nolan, Tristram Shapeero', 'Jimmy Carr', 'Jimmy Carr', null, 'Jimmy Carr delivers more of his cynical take on life''s little absurdities in his trademark deadpan style in this live stand-up release. Jimmy unleashes his rapid-fire joke-telling and razor-sharp wit on topics ranging from religion and sex, to bullying and political correctness. Those brave enough to heckle are quickly put in their place by an array of colourful if brutal put-downs.', 'Jimmy Carr delivers more of his cynical take on life''s little absurdities in his trademark deadpan style in this live stand-up release. Jimmy unleashes his rapid-fire joke-telling and razor-sharp wit on topics ranging from religion and sex, to bullying and political correctness. Those brave enough to heckle are quickly put in their place by an array of colourful if brutal put-downs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wrfNw9UxWnOWPscLVXBZytGRItl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24784'),
  ('732495403708181419', 'Jimmy Carr: The Best of Ultimate Gold Greatest Hits', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Brian Klein', 'Jimmy Carr', 'Jimmy Carr', null, 'Nothing is off limits as Jimmy Carr serves up the most outrageous jokes from his stand-up career in a special that''s not for the faint of heart.', 'Nothing is off limits as Jimmy Carr serves up the most outrageous jokes from his stand-up career in a special that''s not for the faint of heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tXYRtTnHTeOmto6eGcJIgoSo6pu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:587682'),
  ('811834385574533979', 'Jimmy Hollywood', 1994, 'Comedy', 'Barry Levinson, Peter Sova', 'Barry Levinson', 'Joe Pesci, Christian Slater, Victoria Abril, Jason Beghe, John Cothran, Robert LaSardo, Richard Kind, Marcus Giamatti', 'R', 'Jimmy Alto is an actor wannabe who stumbles into the role of a lifetime. He becomes a vigilante crime-fighter, aided by his sidekick William, who has suffered a head wound and has problems with short-term memory. Jimmy''s vigilante alter ego soon becomes a media wonder--but Jimmy remains a total unknown and his long-suffering girl friend Lorraine is getting fed up with the whole situation.', 'Jimmy Alto is an actor wannabe who stumbles into the role of a lifetime. He becomes a vigilante crime-fighter, aided by his sidekick William, who has suffered a head wound and has problems with short-term memory. Jimmy''s vigilante alter ego soon becomes a media wonder--but Jimmy remains a total unknown and his long-suffering girl friend Lorraine is getting fed up with the whole situation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o066KgKkw32T4ShvgYO7qHDzZt0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31643'),
  ('1007901510677165545', 'Jimmy Neutron: Boy Genius', 2001, 'Family, Comedy, Adventure, Animation, Science Fiction', 'John A. Davis, Steve Kolbe, Chris Sherrod', 'Steve Oedekerk, J. David Stem, John A. Davis', 'Debi Derryberry, Megan Cavanagh, Mark DeCarlo, Jeffrey Garcia, Patrick Stewart, Martin Short, Frank Welker, Rob Paulsen', 'G', 'Jimmy Neutron is a boy genius and way ahead of his friends, but when it comes to being cool, he''s a little behind. All until one day when his parents, and parents all over Earth are kidnapped by aliens, it''s up to him to lead all the children of the world to rescue their parents.', 'Jimmy Neutron is a boy genius and way ahead of his friends, but when it comes to being cool, he''s a little behind. All until one day when his parents, and parents all over Earth are kidnapped by aliens, it''s up to him to lead all the children of the world to rescue their parents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pUwdquA6Bf3Gq8yT5iQL1Yq0jkl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12589'),
  ('695984516754239560', 'Jimmy O. Yang: Good Deal', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Marcus Raboy', 'Jimmy O. Yang', 'Jimmy O. Yang', 'R', 'In his debut standup special, Good Deal, Jimmy will tell you all about his take on Asian representation, how he learned to speak English from rap videos, dating tall women, and pursuing his dreams only to disappoint his old school Chinese parents. From assimilation to representation, Jimmy O. Yang delivers an absolutely hilarious hour of comedy in Good Deal.', 'In his debut standup special, Good Deal, Jimmy will tell you all about his take on Asian representation, how he learned to speak English from rap videos, dating tall women, and pursuing his dreams only to disappoint his old school Chinese parents. From assimilation to representation, Jimmy O. Yang delivers an absolutely hilarious hour of comedy in Good Deal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xEgv1ZupccVoMQ2ZCEWuO4GdjI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:699198'),
  ('361442328036985299', 'Jimmy P.', 2013, 'Drama', 'Arnaud Desplechin, Stéphane Fontaine', 'Julie Peyr, Kent Jones, Arnaud Desplechin', 'Benicio del Toro, Mathieu Amalric, Gina McKee, Larry Pine, Joseph Cross, Elya Baskin, Gary Farmer, Michelle Thrush', null, 'At the end of WWII, Jimmy Picard, a Native American Blackfoot who fought in France, suffers from unexplainable symptoms and is admitted to a military hospital. When doctors suspect schizophrenia, an eccentric psychoanalyst takes up the case and starts a conversation with the veteran.', 'At the end of WWII, Jimmy Picard, a Native American Blackfoot who fought in France, suffers from unexplainable symptoms and is admitted to a military hospital. When doctors suspect schizophrenia, an eccentric psychoanalyst takes up the case and starts a conversation with the veteran.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fjOBKLWWV8vqk68NLksUSa20LEo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:160768'),
  ('747419558980399484', 'Jimmy the Gent', 1934, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance, Crime', 'Michael Curtiz, Ira H. Morgan, Maxwell Arnow', 'Bertram Millhauser', 'James Cagney, Bette Davis, Allen Jenkins, Alan Dinehart, Alice White, Arthur Hohl, Phillip Reed, Hobart Cavanaugh', 'NR', 'An unpolished racketeer, whose racket is finding heirs for unclaimed fortunes, affects ethics and tea-drinking manners to win back the sweetheart who now works for his seemingly upright competitor.', 'An unpolished racketeer, whose racket is finding heirs for unclaimed fortunes, affects ethics and tea-drinking manners to win back the sweetheart who now works for his seemingly upright competitor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fZuLSS7X5j5SddIwQzp9cJbpK5Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81396'),
  ('611216050888039318', 'Jimmy Timmy Power Hour', 2004, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Fantasy, TV Movie, Science Fiction, Action', 'Keith Alcorn, Butch Hartman', 'Gene Grillo, Butch Hartman, Steve Marmel', 'Debi Derryberry, Tara Strong, Megan Cavanagh, Mark DeCarlo, Rob Paulsen, Jeffrey Garcia, Carolyn Lawrence, Crystal Scales', 'G', 'Mayhem reigns supreme in the animated kingdom as whiz kid Jimmy Neutron and Timmy from "The Fairly Oddparents" swap places in each other''s worlds.', 'Mayhem reigns supreme in the animated kingdom as whiz kid Jimmy Neutron and Timmy from "The Fairly Oddparents" swap places in each other''s worlds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oJTKUJqa9vh2ZnYpq3dlYaZn73E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40706'),
  ('506404130659041167', 'Jimmy Timmy Power Hour 2: When Nerds Collide', 2006, 'Animation, Adventure, Comedy, TV Movie, Science Fiction, Fantasy, Action', 'Keith Alcorn, Mike Gasaway, Butch Hartman', 'Gene Grillo, Steve Marmel', 'Debi Derryberry, Tara Strong, Rob Paulsen, Jeffrey Garcia, Carolyn Lawrence, Crystal Scales, Frank Welker, Susanne Blakeslee', 'G', 'Cartoon worlds collide in this hourlong adventure starring whiz kid Jimmy Neutron and Timmy Turner from "The Fairly OddParents." When the boys duel over Cindy Vortex, it draws the attention of Jimmy''s archenemy, Prof. Calamitous, who teams with Wanda and Cosmo, forcing Jimmy and Timmy to work together to save the world from the all-powerful villain.', 'Cartoon worlds collide in this hourlong adventure starring whiz kid Jimmy Neutron and Timmy Turner from "The Fairly OddParents." When the boys duel over Cindy Vortex, it draws the attention of Jimmy''s archenemy, Prof. Calamitous, who teams with Wanda and Cosmo, forcing Jimmy and Timmy to work together to save the world from the all-powerful villain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f131UejUYxrRmZ1LeitAYihNdvW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40707'),
  ('990889733877307300', 'Jimmy Timmy Power Hour 3: The Jerkinators!', 2006, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, TV Movie, Science Fiction, Fantasy, Animation', 'Keith Alcorn, Mike Gasaway, Butch Hartman', 'Jed Spingarn, Steve Marmel', 'Debi Derryberry, Tara Strong, Jeff Garlin, Rob Paulsen, Jeffrey Garcia, Carolyn Lawrence, Crystal Scales, Mark DeCarlo', 'G', 'Back for their third and zaniest adventure yet, Nickelodeon''s boy genius Jimmy Neutron and Timmy from "The Fairly Odd Parents" unite to sculpt a wonder robot. Cartoon calamity ensues when the power-hungry robot develops a mind of his own and turns on his creative inventors.', 'Back for their third and zaniest adventure yet, Nickelodeon''s boy genius Jimmy Neutron and Timmy from "The Fairly Odd Parents" unite to sculpt a wonder robot. Cartoon calamity ensues when the power-hungry robot develops a mind of his own and turns on his creative inventors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1YjtY8k7T17tgDdWLUPV7Hbc18B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40708'),
  ('488458618434314070', 'Jimmy''s Hall', 2014, 'History, Drama', 'Ken Loach, Robbie Ryan, Daire Glynn', 'Paul Laverty, Donal O''Kelly', 'Barry Ward, Simone Kirby, Jim Norton, Andrew Scott, Brían F. O''Byrne, Francis Magee, Karl Geary, Shane Cullen', 'PG-13', 'Jimmy Gralton returns from New York and reopens his beloved community hall, only to meet opposition from the local parish.', 'Jimmy Gralton returns from New York and reopens his beloved community hall, only to meet opposition from the local parish.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lo5MjmuMTTcgGVsup5RvjtDj4T7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:262958'),
  ('1058013056129886740', 'Jimpa', 2026, 'Drama', 'Sophie Hyde, Nikki Barrett, Susanne Groen', 'Matthew Cormack, Sophie Hyde', 'Aud Mason-Hyde, Olivia Colman, John Lithgow, Cody Fern, Maya Carey, Bryn Chapman Parish, Eamon Farren, Daniel Henshall', null, 'Hannah and her non-binary teenager Frances visit her gay grandfather Jimpa in Amsterdam. Frances expresses a desire to stay with their grandfather for a year, challenging Hannah''s parenting beliefs and forcing her to confront past issues.', 'Hannah and her non-binary teenager Frances visit her gay grandfather Jimpa in Amsterdam. Frances expresses a desire to stay with their grandfather for a year, challenging Hannah''s parenting beliefs and forcing her to confront past issues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/giSERsYBGUcfj9ctB0h9d5ympo8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1286491'),
  ('1138268458249738181', 'Jîn', 2013, 'Drama, War', 'Reha Erdem', 'Reha Erdem', 'Deniz Hasgüler, Onur Ünsal, Sabahattin Yakut, Yıldırım Şimşek, Sema Kuray, Mahmut Altuner, Mehmet Kurt, Saygın Soysal', null, 'A bitter conflict has raged between guerrillas and the army in Turkey''s Kurdish regions for over 30 years. Large expanses have now become war zones. Countless young people have lost their lives to the conflict. This dangerous but incredibly beautiful mountainous country is home to 17-year-old Jîn. But she is no longer safe since she secretly stole away from a group of rebels with whom she was fighting. Now she wanders the picturesque landscape alone, caught between two fronts. All of a sudden, the sound of gunfire and explosions rend the air above the untouched natural scenery. Attack is threatened from all sides. Desperate to find peace, Jîn decides to escape to another part of the country – an impossible plan, since the military is omnipresent and there are road blocks everywhere. As a Kurd without identity papers she risks arrest at every turn. In addition, as a woman with no family to shield her, many men will see her as fair game. But her courage is unbroken.', 'A bitter conflict has raged between guerrillas and the army in Turkey''s Kurdish regions for over 30 years. Large expanses have now become war zones. Countless young people have lost their lives to the conflict. This dangerous but incredibly beautiful mountainous country is home to 17-year-old Jîn. But she is no longer safe since she secretly stole away from a group of rebels with whom she was fighting. Now she wanders the picturesque landscape alone, caught between two fronts. All of a sudden, the sound of gunfire and explosions rend the air above the untouched natural scenery. Attack is threatened from all sides. Desperate to find peace, Jîn decides to escape to another part of the country – an impossible plan, since the military is omnipresent and there are road blocks everywhere. As a Kurd without identity papers she risks arrest at every turn. In addition, as a woman with no family to shield her, many men will see her as fair game. But her courage is unbroken.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7BO2cTgI1EWd8OJTV9KXZ3Xjug1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:165140'),
  ('288470783772083738', 'Jin-Roh: The Wolf Brigade', 1999, 'Animation, Drama, Romance, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Hiroyuki Okiura, Hisao Shirai, Tetsuya Nishio', 'Satoshi Kon', 'Yoshikatsu Fujiki, Sumi Mutoh, Eri Sendai, Hiroyuki Kinoshita, Kohsei Hirota, Yukihiro Yoshida, Ryuichi Horibe, Kenji Nakagawa', 'R', 'A member of an elite paramilitary counter-terrorism unit becomes traumatized after witnessing the suicide bombing of a young girl and is forced to undergo retraining. However, unbeknownst to him, he becomes a key player in a dispute between rival police divisions, as he finds himself increasingly involved with the sister of the girl he saw die.', 'A member of an elite paramilitary counter-terrorism unit becomes traumatized after witnessing the suicide bombing of a young girl and is forced to undergo retraining. However, unbeknownst to him, he becomes a key player in a dispute between rival police divisions, as he finds himself increasingly involved with the sister of the girl he saw die.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/63EMBxmcafkc4cWuUWQh2Ttd2jh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:823'),
  ('162352045848341963', 'Jindabyne', 2006, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Ray Lawrence, David Williamson', 'Beatrix Christian', 'Laura Linney, Gabriel Byrne, Deborra-Lee Furness, John Howard, Riley Von Husen, Leah Purcell, Stelios Yiakmis, Alice Garner', 'R', 'Outside the Australian town of Jindabyne, local man Stuart Kane is on a fishing trip with friends when they discover the body of a murdered girl.', 'Outside the Australian town of Jindabyne, local man Stuart Kane is on a fishing trip with friends when they discover the body of a murdered girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zozfpvbl8OezjqBsgFByTGkbnw8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4657'),
  ('662286577900155434', 'Jingle All the Way', 1996, 'Family, Adventure, Comedy', 'Victor J. Kemper, Brian Levant, Tony Fanning', 'Randy Kornfield', 'Arnold Schwarzenegger, Sinbad, Phil Hartman, Rita Wilson, Robert Conrad, Martin Mull, Jake Lloyd, Jim Belushi', 'PG', 'Howard Langston, a salesman for a mattress company, is constantly kept busy at his job, disappointing his son. After he misses his son''s karate exposition, Howard vows to make it up to him by buying an action figure of his son''s favorite television hero for Christmas. Unfortunately for Howard, it is Christmas Eve, and every store is sold out of Turbo Man. Now, Howard must travel all over town and compete with everybody else to find a Turbo Man action figure.', 'Howard Langston, a salesman for a mattress company, is constantly kept busy at his job, disappointing his son. After he misses his son''s karate exposition, Howard vows to make it up to him by buying an action figure of his son''s favorite television hero for Christmas. Unfortunately for Howard, it is Christmas Eve, and every store is sold out of Turbo Man. Now, Howard must travel all over town and compete with everybody else to find a Turbo Man action figure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lHLOUt0ZIQLC5asHdIQBoTUvaEp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9279'),
  ('606128446137873396', 'Jingle All the Way 2', 2014, 'Family, Comedy', 'Barry Donlevy, Alex Zamm', 'Stephen Mazur', 'Larry the Cable Guy, Brian Stepanek, Lauren K. Robek, Lindsay Maxwell, Kennedi Clements, David Milchard, Meredith McGeachie, Matty Finochio', 'PG', 'Larry''s daughter wants only one thing for Christmas - a talking bear. His daughter''s step-dad intends to make sure that Larry can''t get one.', 'Larry''s daughter wants only one thing for Christmas - a talking bear. His daughter''s step-dad intends to make sure that Larry can''t get one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x8JinWPxZIZY9HzJvvsC5puYsNu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:289728'),
  ('256733504204175712', 'Jingle Bell Bride', 2020, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Graham Talbot, Nelson Talbot, Allan Harmon', 'Marcy Holland', 'Julie Gonzalo, Ronnie Rowe, BJ Harrison, Lucia Walters, Alison Araya, Donna Benedicto, Kehli O''Byrne, Keenan Mentzos', null, 'Wedding planner Jessica Perez travels to a remote town in Alaska to find a rare flower for a celebrity client and is charmed by the small town during Christmas, as well as the handsome local helping her.', 'Wedding planner Jessica Perez travels to a remote town in Alaska to find a rare flower for a celebrity client and is charmed by the small town during Christmas, as well as the handsome local helping her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ladbthyyye2ZbhmVRY5cVpkYuvm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:737763'),
  ('892449258255629810', 'Jingle Bell Heist', 2025, 'Romance, Crime, Comedy', 'Michael Fimognari, Michael Fimognari, Phil Booth', 'Abby McDonald, Amy Reed', 'Olivia Holt, Connor Swindells, Lucy Punch, Peter Serafinowicz, Natasha Joseph, Poppy Drayton, Michael Salami, Belal Sabir', 'PG-13', 'Two down-on-their-luck hourly workers team up to rob a posh London department store on Christmas Eve. Will they steal each other''s hearts along the way?', 'Two down-on-their-luck hourly workers team up to rob a posh London department store on Christmas Eve. Will they steal each other''s hearts along the way?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rVOQF2Ucekug1B80A9crVx7Jn90.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1218762'),
  ('633151043176313620', 'Jingle Bell Princess', 2021, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Don McBrearty, Jonathan Yapp', 'James D. Hughes, Blaine Chiappetta', 'Trevor Donovan, Merritt Patterson, Charlie Boyle, Marnie McPhail, Matthew Finlan, Lindsay Owen Pierre, Cherion Drakes, Dan Willmott', 'G', 'An actual princess has some mechanical issues and is temporarily grounded. Does she have time for a lobster roll? It is Christmas time in Maine which means snow, quaint scenery, and lots of Christmas lights near the ocean. With the crew distracted attending to the repair, Princess Amelia deplanes to walk through a magical Christmas tree lot near the airport perimeter.', 'An actual princess has some mechanical issues and is temporarily grounded. Does she have time for a lobster roll? It is Christmas time in Maine which means snow, quaint scenery, and lots of Christmas lights near the ocean. With the crew distracted attending to the repair, Princess Amelia deplanes to walk through a magical Christmas tree lot near the airport perimeter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jqxh21dySEujfIvxQaIV3ti6oj5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:874257'),
  ('1088470094982061007', 'Jingle Bell Run', 2024, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Lucie Guest, Justin Sebastian', 'Stephanie Sourapas, Tom McCurrie', 'Ashley Williams, Andrew W. Walker, Caitlin Howden, David James Lewis, Hamza Fouad, Teana-Marie Smith, EaeMya ThynGi, Emilio Merritt', null, 'Self-described bookworm Avery is paired with retired hockey star Wes to compete in a holiday race across America. The team struggles through themed challenges until romance runs its course.', 'Self-described bookworm Avery is paired with retired hockey star Wes to compete in a holiday race across America. The team struggles through themed challenges until romance runs its course.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rctASGYJTuAWVemZ4ZR1ZSj50T6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1361135'),
  ('964190903366322327', 'Jingle Jangle: A Christmas Journey', 2020, 'Family, Fantasy, Music', 'David E. Talbert, Remi Adefarasin, Dan Channing-Williams', 'David E. Talbert', 'Forest Whitaker, Keegan-Michael Key, Hugh Bonneville, Anika Noni Rose, Madalen Mills, Phylicia Rashād, Ricky Martin, Justin Cornwell', 'PG', 'An imaginary world comes to life in a holiday tale of an eccentric toymaker, his adventurous granddaughter, and a magical invention that has the power to change their lives forever.', 'An imaginary world comes to life in a holiday tale of an eccentric toymaker, his adventurous granddaughter, and a magical invention that has the power to change their lives forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5RbyHIVydD3Krmec1LlUV7rRjet.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:622855'),
  ('893398822756535024', 'Jinn', 2014, 'Thriller', 'Ajmal Zaheer Ahmad, Robert Mehnert', 'Ajmal Zaheer Ahmad', 'Dominic Rains, Ray Park, William Atherton, Faran Tahir, Serinda Swan, Walter Phelan, Milica Govich, Danny Mooney', 'PG-13', 'From the beginning, stories of angels and men have captured our imaginations and have been etched into our history crossing all boundaries of culture, religion, and time. These two races have dominated the landscape of modern mythology for countless centuries, almost washing away the evidence that a third ever existed. This third race, born of smokeless fire, was called the jinn. Similar to humans in many ways, the jinn lived invisibly among us and only under dire or unusual circumstances were our paths ever meant to cross.', 'From the beginning, stories of angels and men have captured our imaginations and have been etched into our history crossing all boundaries of culture, religion, and time. These two races have dominated the landscape of modern mythology for countless centuries, almost washing away the evidence that a third ever existed. This third race, born of smokeless fire, was called the jinn. Similar to humans in many ways, the jinn lived invisibly among us and only under dire or unusual circumstances were our paths ever meant to cross.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2mI2gzLVsG6Py5hb86MsCO7xYKU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52653'),
  ('930066860427241753', 'Jinnah', 1998, 'History, War, Drama', 'Jamil Dehlavi, Nicholas D. Knowland', 'Akbar Ahmed, Jamil Dehlavi', 'Christopher Lee, James Fox, Maria Aitken, Shashi Kapoor, Richard Lintern, Indira Varma, Sam Dastor, Robert Ashby', null, 'Biography of Mohammed Ali Jinnah, the founder of modern Pakistan is told through flashbacks as his soul tries to find eternal rest. The flashbacks start in 1947 as Jinnah pleads for a separate nation for the Muslim minority, infuriating Lord Mountbatten. Mountbatten then tries to enlist Gandhi & Nehru to persuade Jinnah to stop his efforts. Gandhi sides with Jinnah, which upsets Nehru. However, Jinnah turns down the offer to become prime minister and the film takes another slide back to 1916, which reveals all of the political implications that have occurred.', 'Biography of Mohammed Ali Jinnah, the founder of modern Pakistan is told through flashbacks as his soul tries to find eternal rest. The flashbacks start in 1947 as Jinnah pleads for a separate nation for the Muslim minority, infuriating Lord Mountbatten. Mountbatten then tries to enlist Gandhi & Nehru to persuade Jinnah to stop his efforts. Gandhi sides with Jinnah, which upsets Nehru. However, Jinnah turns down the offer to become prime minister and the film takes another slide back to 1916, which reveals all of the political implications that have occurred.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6gNDyfZhQEOkeVWbsfTMOuvXx8V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41614'),
  ('654619552808175613', 'Jinxed', 2013, 'Family, Fantasy, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Stephen Herek, Thomas M. Harting', 'Neal Israel, Aury Wallington', 'Ciara Bravo, Jack Griffo, Jacob Bertrand, Elena Kampouris, Burkely Duffield, Keegan Connor Tracy, Donavon Stinson, Jay Brazeau', 'G', 'Meet the Murphys, a family with never ending bad luck. "Anything that can go wrong, will go wrong," it''s Murphy''s law! Over a century ago a witch put a magical curse on their great-great grandfather and the whole family has been jinxed for generations! After Meg Murphy (played by Big Time Rush''s Ciara Bravo) and her family''s house is destroyed in yet another freak accident, the family moves into their grandfather''s house in Harvest Hills. In a not-so-strange case of bad luck, Meg''s nemesis Ivy is also spending the summer in town. But things start to look up, kind of, when Meg meets a local boy named Brett and he casts another spell on her, a love spell that is! With help from her brother Charlie, Meg more determined than ever, must break the hex on her catastrophically cursed family! Watch this doomed teen try for a normal existence in a world full of hijinks!', 'Meet the Murphys, a family with never ending bad luck. "Anything that can go wrong, will go wrong," it''s Murphy''s law! Over a century ago a witch put a magical curse on their great-great grandfather and the whole family has been jinxed for generations! After Meg Murphy (played by Big Time Rush''s Ciara Bravo) and her family''s house is destroyed in yet another freak accident, the family moves into their grandfather''s house in Harvest Hills. In a not-so-strange case of bad luck, Meg''s nemesis Ivy is also spending the summer in town. But things start to look up, kind of, when Meg meets a local boy named Brett and he casts another spell on her, a love spell that is! With help from her brother Charlie, Meg more determined than ever, must break the hex on her catastrophically cursed family! Watch this doomed teen try for a normal existence in a world full of hijinks!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v2ClGoeLyX4Vmgzk6Q80OANCFi6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:246569'),
  ('713497464027652703', 'Jinxed!', 1982, 'Comedy', 'Don Siegel, Vilmos Zsigmond', 'David Newman, Frank D. Gilroy', 'Bette Midler, Ken Wahl, Rip Torn, Jack Elam, Val Avery, Benson Fong, Jacqueline Scott, F. William Parker', 'R', 'Harold, a professional gambler, and his girlfriend Bonita, a lounge singer, follow Willie, a young blackjack dealer, around the western U.S. Harold has a jinx on Willie and can''t lose with him. Bonita and Willie meet and fall for each other and plot to do away with Harold and collect on his life insurance.', 'Harold, a professional gambler, and his girlfriend Bonita, a lounge singer, follow Willie, a young blackjack dealer, around the western U.S. Harold has a jinx on Willie and can''t lose with him. Bonita and Willie meet and fall for each other and plot to do away with Harold and collect on his life insurance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x0qfhkkrKK9z1Sh2qbunXLTcp2m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79008'),
  ('386487190020772651', 'Jiraiya the Hero', 1921, 'Action, Fantasy', 'Shōzō Makino, Shigeto Miki', null, 'Matsunosuke Onoe, Suminojo Ichikawa, Kijaku Ôtani, Chosei Kataoka, Shôen Kataoka, En''ichirō Jitsukawa, Ichitarô Kataoka, Masatada Makino', null, 'Jiraiya is some sort of super-ninja with superpowers. He can fly, he can avoid detection by turning himself into a toad, and he has some sort of ability to vanish.', 'Jiraiya is some sort of super-ninja with superpowers. He can fly, he can avoid detection by turning himself into a toad, and he has some sort of ability to vanish.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ahcIW6b7lUo8DxebEqZLQ55odu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46749'),
  ('1023352082543139266', 'Jiro Dreams of Sushi', 2011, 'Documentary', 'David Gelb, David Gelb', null, 'Jiro Ono, Masuhiro Yamamoto, Yoshikazu Ono, Takashi Ono, Daisuke Nakazama, Hachiro Mizutani, Harutaki Takahashi, Hiroki Fujita', 'PG', 'Revered sushi chef Jiro Ono strives for perfection in his work, while his eldest son, Yoshikazu, has trouble living up to his father''s legacy.', 'Revered sushi chef Jiro Ono strives for perfection in his work, while his eldest son, Yoshikazu, has trouble living up to his father''s legacy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iVrkM4jSJw1IsOpW5jTtY5QxVqj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80767'),
  ('790505784840325481', 'Jis Desh Mein Ganga Rehta Hai', 2000, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Mahesh Manjrekar', 'Mahesh Manjrekar', 'Govinda, Sonali Bendre, Rinke Khanna, Milind Gunaji, Reema Lagoo, Shakti Kapoor, Supriya Karnik, Himani Shivpuri', null, 'Gangaram alias Ganga has been raised by his foster parents who reside in the village thus he gets accustom to village life. 24 years later his birth parents multi-millionaire Avinash and his wife Radha comes to ask him to move into their bungalow located in the city to which Ganga agrees and goes to bid farewell to his friends and girlfriend Saawni. While in the city Ganga is introduced to his elder brother, Milind, his wife, Supriya, and his younger brother; Ganga finds it very hard to adjust to the city life and is often scuffed at. Avinash arranges his marriage with equally wealthy Tina to which he agrees although he is not comfortable with this marriage as he is still in love with Saawni; meanwhile Ganga''s honest policy gets him and his new found family into further problems.', 'Gangaram alias Ganga has been raised by his foster parents who reside in the village thus he gets accustom to village life. 24 years later his birth parents multi-millionaire Avinash and his wife Radha comes to ask him to move into their bungalow located in the city to which Ganga agrees and goes to bid farewell to his friends and girlfriend Saawni. While in the city Ganga is introduced to his elder brother, Milind, his wife, Supriya, and his younger brother; Ganga finds it very hard to adjust to the city life and is often scuffed at. Avinash arranges his marriage with equally wealthy Tina to which he agrees although he is not comfortable with this marriage as he is still in love with Saawni; meanwhile Ganga''s honest policy gets him and his new found family into further problems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7uafbugXyAchvkdWJMA0JkmrvNe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:348762'),
  ('170753652590742748', 'Jiseul', 2013, 'Drama, History, War', 'Yang Jung-hun, Choo Kyoung-yeob, O Muel', 'O Muel', 'Oh Young-soon, Moon Suk-bum, Kim Dong-ho, Kim Soon-duk, Son Wook, Yang Jung-won, Lee Kyung-joon, Park Soon-dong', null, 'The populace of a South Korean island rebels against police brutality. The protesters are labeled as communists, and the army is dispatched.', 'The populace of a South Korean island rebels against police brutality. The protesters are labeled as communists, and the army is dispatched.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5AeNLcIVfoyf0QcxKisaXp1Dsvv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133756'),
  ('45494078097690466', 'Jism', 2003, 'Thriller', 'Amit Saxena', 'Mahesh Bhatt', 'Bipasha Basu, John Abraham, Gulshan Grover, Vinay Pathak, Ranvir Shorey, Anahita Oberoi, Harsh Vasisht', null, 'Kabir Lal is an alcoholic lawyer whose life is looking as if going down the drain. One morning he sees a stunningly attractive woman on a beach and is instantly enamored by her. By chance he sees her again in a restaurant and offers to buy her a drink. In the process he learns that her name is Sonia and she is married. Unable to resist, he asks her whether she would show him her home. It marks the beginning of a passionate affair, during which Kabir is told that Sonia''s husband neglects her. But Sonia cannot leave him because she cannot support herself without her husband''s money. Sonia suggests murder and Kabir, blind with lust, agrees. They manage to kill Sonia''s husband and make it look like an accident, but then Kabir gets to see Sonia''s other side: she no longer is the passionate lover as before, but is a cool-headed mean woman now who won''t let go of her wealth at any cost.', 'Kabir Lal is an alcoholic lawyer whose life is looking as if going down the drain. One morning he sees a stunningly attractive woman on a beach and is instantly enamored by her. By chance he sees her again in a restaurant and offers to buy her a drink. In the process he learns that her name is Sonia and she is married. Unable to resist, he asks her whether she would show him her home. It marks the beginning of a passionate affair, during which Kabir is told that Sonia''s husband neglects her. But Sonia cannot leave him because she cannot support herself without her husband''s money. Sonia suggests murder and Kabir, blind with lust, agrees. They manage to kill Sonia''s husband and make it look like an accident, but then Kabir gets to see Sonia''s other side: she no longer is the passionate lover as before, but is a cool-headed mean woman now who won''t let go of her wealth at any cost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/afSVOdens3jMc1QzLA3Ps3XGSbR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48391'),
  ('311154538731890775', 'Jism 2', 2012, 'Thriller', 'Pooja Bhatt', 'Mahesh Bhatt', 'Sunny Leone, Randeep Hooda, Arunoday Singh, Arif Zakaria, Sumit Nijhawan, Imran Zahid', null, 'A porn star is hired by a dashing intelligence officer as a ''honey-trap'' for a dreaded assassin. She not only has to confront her bitter-sweet past, but is also forced to make an impossible choice - one that will put her own life in jeopardy.', 'A porn star is hired by a dashing intelligence officer as a ''honey-trap'' for a dreaded assassin. She not only has to confront her bitter-sweet past, but is also forced to make an impossible choice - one that will put her own life in jeopardy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8pnZpGsKA4JxPvpjqAtC8YPoS4p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124093'),
  ('3127495772058181', 'Jitterbugs', 1943, 'Comedy', 'Emil Newman, Lucien N. Andriot, Malcolm St. Clair', 'Scott Darling', 'Stan Laurel, Oliver Hardy, Vivian Blaine, Robert Bailey, Douglas Fowley, Noel Madison, Lee Patrick, Robert Emmett Keane', 'NR', 'The two-man Laurel and Hardy Zoot Suit Band find themselves fronting a scam for "gasolene pills" in wartime oil-short America. They are however soon on the side of the angels helping recover $10,000 for an attractive young lady whose family have themselves been swindled.', 'The two-man Laurel and Hardy Zoot Suit Band find themselves fronting a scam for "gasolene pills" in wartime oil-short America. They are however soon on the side of the angels helping recover $10,000 for an attractive young lady whose family have themselves been swindled.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nxODaNXqdDtavloCtPwiotVjok6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71098'),
  ('112596169178629651', 'Jiu Jitsu', 2020, 'Action, Science Fiction, Fantasy', 'Dimitri Logothetis, Gerardo Madrazo, Brian O''Sullivan', 'Dimitri Logothetis, Jim McGrath', 'Alain Moussi, Nicolas Cage, Tony Jaa, JuJu Chan, Eddie Steeples, Marie Avgeropoulos, Frank Grillo, June Sasitorn', 'R', 'Every six years, an ancient order of jiu-jitsu fighters joins forces to battle a vicious race of alien invaders. But when a celebrated war hero goes down in defeat, the fate of the planet and mankind hangs in the balance.', 'Every six years, an ancient order of jiu-jitsu fighters joins forces to battle a vicious race of alien invaders. But when a celebrated war hero goes down in defeat, the fate of the planet and mankind hangs in the balance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eLT8Cu357VOwBVTitkmlDEg32Fs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:590706'),
  ('1033372469998999332', 'Jivaro', 1954, 'Adventure, Action, Romance', 'Edward Ludwig, William McGarry, W. Wallace Kelley', 'Winston Miller', 'Fernando Lamas, Rhonda Fleming, Brian Keith, Pascual García Peña, Morgan Farley, Rita Moreno, Richard Denning, Marvin Miller', 'NR', 'At Rio Galdez''s remote Brazilian trading post live assorted outcast Americans and Europeans, including Jerry Russell, ex-engineer who became obsessed with the Jivaro headhunters'' treasure, quit his job, and took up with the bottle and local girl Maroa. But he still gets letters from his nominal fiancée in California, and unexpectedly the shapely, glamorous Alice Parker arrives, expecting to marry a rich planter. Disillusioned, Alice is almost ready to fall into Rio''s arms when news comes that Jerry is missing in Jivaro country.', 'At Rio Galdez''s remote Brazilian trading post live assorted outcast Americans and Europeans, including Jerry Russell, ex-engineer who became obsessed with the Jivaro headhunters'' treasure, quit his job, and took up with the bottle and local girl Maroa. But he still gets letters from his nominal fiancée in California, and unexpectedly the shapely, glamorous Alice Parker arrives, expecting to marry a rich planter. Disillusioned, Alice is almost ready to fall into Rio''s arms when news comes that Jerry is missing in Jivaro country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/auJ7hC98RsPcMEN2Oxy2eHo8csQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112886'),
  ('808677334238604974', 'JJ+E', 2021, 'Romance, Drama', 'Henri Rondahl, Matilda Forsberg, Simon Ekbäck Nordström', 'Dunja Vujovic', 'Mustapha Aarab, Elsa Öhrn, Magnus Krepper, Marika Lagercrantz, Simon Mezher, Loreen, Albin Grenholm, Jonay Pineda Skallak', null, 'Elisabeth and John John are raised in the same city, yet they live light years apart, separated economically, socially and culturally. That is until the day they start in the same high school class.', 'Elisabeth and John John are raised in the same city, yet they live light years apart, separated economically, socially and culturally. That is until the day they start in the same high school class.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g1OngP0vWRGrafk99vBgz6i4Xln.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:726916'),
  ('692904129127443834', 'JK Ninja Girls', 2017, 'Action, Comedy', 'Genta Satou', 'Kazuhiko Ban', 'Ayano Hamaura, Reiko Inoue, Ayaka Hirose, Rio Fujii, Minami Nomura, Rena Ogawa', null, 'The Kanto area and Kansai area are in secret tug of war. Descendants of ninja from Kansai harass Kanto area. One day, 4 female high school students from Tokyo transfer to a new school. They are descendants of ninja who are sent to protect Tokyo.', 'The Kanto area and Kansai area are in secret tug of war. Descendants of ninja from Kansai harass Kanto area. One day, 4 female high school students from Tokyo transfer to a new school. They are descendants of ninja who are sent to protect Tokyo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x43hOqJChhiTcFRdyaN25dCjKay.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:571177'),
  ('438096974064057276', 'JL Family Ranch: The Wedding Gift', 2020, 'TV Movie, Family', 'Sean McNamara, Sean Patrick Fahey, R. Michael Givens', 'Mark Hefti', 'Jon Voight, Teri Polo, James Caan, Bo Derek, Dylan Walsh, Trevor Donovan, Skyler Shaye, Zeb Slone', null, 'When Henry proposes it looks like Rebecca will get her fairytale ending until her daughter invites a visitor from her past to the ranch that will change the Petersons and Landsburgs forever.', 'When Henry proposes it looks like Rebecca will get her fairytale ending until her daughter invites a visitor from her past to the ranch that will change the Petersons and Landsburgs forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/CMUAwaNAnLEyployKEH16GBLU4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:689927'),
  ('898269077859795090', 'JL''s Passion', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Carlos Nader', null, 'José Leonilson', null, 'In January 1990, at the age of 33, the artist José Leonilson starts registering an intimate journal in a tape recorder. His views on events that shook both Brazil, such as the resignation of former president Collor, and overseas, such as the fall of the Berlin Wall, permeate his confessions. He also talks about his impressions on the various movies he used to watch. The records of this sensitive artist in tune with modern life did not intend, at first, anything more than register the harmony that existed between his life and his peculiar and intimate work. However, J.L. suffers the unexpected blow of the discovery that he himself is HIV positive. The uncertainty and urgency in his life begin to permeate his reports.', 'In January 1990, at the age of 33, the artist José Leonilson starts registering an intimate journal in a tape recorder. His views on events that shook both Brazil, such as the resignation of former president Collor, and overseas, such as the fall of the Berlin Wall, permeate his confessions. He also talks about his impressions on the various movies he used to watch. The records of this sensitive artist in tune with modern life did not intend, at first, anything more than register the harmony that existed between his life and his peculiar and intimate work. However, J.L. suffers the unexpected blow of the discovery that he himself is HIV positive. The uncertainty and urgency in his life begin to permeate his reports.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eFvErfLXK0ADRWwNpbmmcVptWW6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:373748'),
  ('956323915592787782', 'JLA Adventures: Trapped in Time', 2014, 'Family, Animation, Action, Science Fiction', 'Giancarlo Volpe', 'Michael Ryan', 'Diedrich Bader, Laura Bailey, Dante Basco, Corey Burton, Grey DeLisle, Peter Jessop, Fred Tatasciore, Jack De Sena', 'NR', 'Get ready for a battle of the ages when the Justice League faces off against its archenemies, the Legion of Doom, in an all-new movie from DC Comics. A mysterious being known as the Time Trapper arises, and a sinister plan led by Lex Luthor sends the Legion of Doom back in time to eliminate Superman, Wonder Woman and Batman before they become super heroes. For Aquaman, Flash and Cyborg, along with teen super heroes Karate Kid and Dawnstar, the stakes have never been higher, the rescue mission never deadlier. So join the fight for the future as the Justice League confronts its ultimate challenge… the threat of having never existed!', 'Get ready for a battle of the ages when the Justice League faces off against its archenemies, the Legion of Doom, in an all-new movie from DC Comics. A mysterious being known as the Time Trapper arises, and a sinister plan led by Lex Luthor sends the Legion of Doom back in time to eliminate Superman, Wonder Woman and Batman before they become super heroes. For Aquaman, Flash and Cyborg, along with teen super heroes Karate Kid and Dawnstar, the stakes have never been higher, the rescue mission never deadlier. So join the fight for the future as the Justice League confronts its ultimate challenge… the threat of having never existed!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qchNuTbnleCtlIB8wyV03f36VuF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:251768'),
  ('957353213111624858', 'JLG/JLG: Self-Portrait in December', 1995, 'Documentary', 'Jean-Luc Godard', 'Jean-Luc Godard', 'Jean-Luc Godard, Geneviève Pasquier, Denis Jadót, Brigitte Bastien, Elisabeth Kaza, André S. Labarthe, Bernard Eisenschitz, Nathalie Aguillar', null, 'Director Jean-Luc Godard reflects in this movie about his place in film history, the interaction of film industry and film as art, as well as the act of creating art.', 'Director Jean-Luc Godard reflects in this movie about his place in film history, the interaction of film industry and film as art, as well as the act of creating art.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/svvG0RLY1XcuriBw87BGmJjol9G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104931'),
