  ('539036722688066860', 'Jo Jo Dancer, Your Life Is Calling', 1986, 'Drama, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Richard Pryor, John A. Alonzo', 'Richard Pryor, Paul Mooney, Rocco Urbisci', 'Richard Pryor, Debbie Allen, Art Evans, Fay Hauser, Barbara Williams, Carmen McRae, Paula Kelly, Diahnne Abbott', 'R', 'Although Jo Jo Dancer has achieved success as a stand-up comedian, he hasn''t found happiness. After receiving severe burns in a narcotics-related incident, Jo Jo remains in a coma, and, while in this state, he looks back on his life. Drifting off into memories of his troubled childhood, Jo Jo revisits his youth, recalling his eventual rise to fame and the decadence that followed. As he considers his existence, he must decide if he wants to go on living or not.', 'Although Jo Jo Dancer has achieved success as a stand-up comedian, he hasn''t found happiness. After receiving severe burns in a narcotics-related incident, Jo Jo remains in a coma, and, while in this state, he looks back on his life. Drifting off into memories of his troubled childhood, Jo Jo revisits his youth, recalling his eventual rise to fame and the decadence that followed. As he considers his existence, he must decide if he wants to go on living or not.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iId4ABGALLN6gF1OoYW8KGiG25V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63510'),
  ('391079043478081034', 'Jo Pil-ho: The Dawning Rage', 2019, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Lee Chol-o, Park Si-hwan, Lee Jeong-beom', 'Lee Jeong-beom', 'Lee Sun-kyun, Jeon So-nee, Park Hae-joon, Lee You-young, Park Byung-eun, Song Young-chang, Kim Min-jae, Jung Ga-ram', null, 'On the run from a dogged internal affairs agent, a corrupt cop reluctantly teams up with a defiant teen to unravel a conspiracy before it''s too late.', 'On the run from a dogged internal affairs agent, a corrupt cop reluctantly teams up with a defiant teen to unravel a conspiracy before it''s too late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k4QPUYRupu7Jv8ZWS9hiLw5OuhB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:574303'),
  ('622705528731468391', 'Jo''s Boy', 2010, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Philippe Guillard, Ludovic Colbeau-Justin', 'Philippe Guillard', 'Gérard Lanvin, Olivier Marchal, Vincent Moscato, Jérémie Duvall, Karina Lombard, Abbes Zahmani, Pierre Laplace, Lionnel Astier', null, 'Grandson of a legendary rugby player, son of a legendary rugby player, and he himself a legendary rugby player, Jo Canavero raises his only son, Tom, in a small village in the Tarn region. To the great displeasure of Jo, thirteen-year-old Tom is as good at math as he is useless on the rugby field. For a Canavero, the legend can''t stop there, even if it means setting up a rugby team specifically for Tom, despite the wishes of the whole village and of Tom himself.', 'Grandson of a legendary rugby player, son of a legendary rugby player, and he himself a legendary rugby player, Jo Canavero raises his only son, Tom, in a small village in the Tarn region. To the great displeasure of Jo, thirteen-year-old Tom is as good at math as he is useless on the rugby field. For a Canavero, the legend can''t stop there, even if it means setting up a rugby team specifically for Tom, despite the wishes of the whole village and of Tom himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pY3vfGvn0HLMQKJjt3tTn7RNWf6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52043'),
  ('1000448542222408781', 'Joachim, Put It in the Machine', 1974, 'Comedy', 'Oldřich Lipský, Jiří Býček, Jaroslav Kučera', 'Zdeněk Svěrák, Ladislav Smoljak, Oldřich Lipský', 'Luděk Sobota, Marta Vančurová, Věra Ferbasová, Josef Dvořák, Ladislav Smoljak, Zdeněk Svěrák, Václav Lohniský, Karel Novák', null, 'A sincere provincial young man, Frantisek Koudelka leaves to work in Prague. For the trip he buys a computer made horoscope with biorhythms charts, marked according to his date of birth, there are trappy, precarious, unsuccessful and even critical days and few successful days. The clumsy luckless person Frantisek has finally a guidance for his life.', 'A sincere provincial young man, Frantisek Koudelka leaves to work in Prague. For the trip he buys a computer made horoscope with biorhythms charts, marked according to his date of birth, there are trappy, precarious, unsuccessful and even critical days and few successful days. The clumsy luckless person Frantisek has finally a guidance for his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iT3KLI8yn9S9KRC6XYZHxNZVX6n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:234426'),
  ('797799818658824449', 'Joachim''s Dictionary', 1966, 'Animation', 'Walerian Borowczyk, Cain Gomorrhy, Constantine Tchikine', 'Walerian Borowczyk, Ligia Branice', null, null, 'A light-hearted animated romp through the alphabet, with each letter identified by both a word and a visual interpretation of that word, by the crudely-drawn Joachim.', 'A light-hearted animated romp through the alphabet, with each letter identified by both a word and a visual interpretation of that word, by the crudely-drawn Joachim.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pSFnlNUzsZTmxeI4lPUXLyvGLso.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:291430'),
  ('709212555361952336', 'Joan Didion: The Center Will Not Hold', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Griffin Dunne, William Rexer, Reed Morano', null, 'Joan Didion, Griffin Dunne, Hilton Als, David Hare, Phyllis Rifield, Amy Robinson, Shelley Wanger, Harrison Ford', 'PG-13', 'Literary icon Joan Didion reflects on her remarkable career and personal struggles in this intimate documentary directed by her nephew, Griffin Dunne.', 'Literary icon Joan Didion reflects on her remarkable career and personal struggles in this intimate documentary directed by her nephew, Griffin Dunne.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xgry0bnJVrcIA3IpZ1CkAg6qEtw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:473408'),
  ('348618978043250932', 'Joan Lui', 1985, 'Music, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Adriano Celentano, Maria Pia Rocco, Alfio Contini', 'Adriano Celentano', 'Adriano Celentano, Claudia Mori, Federica Moro, Edwin Marian, Gian, Mirko Setaro, Hal Yamanouchi, Piero Nuti', null, 'In a world ravaged by violence, and other serious social problems, Joan - a character that alludes to Christ (which represents the return to Earth) arrives to Italy by train and preaching for the salvation of mankind, condemning the hypocrisy and hedonism.', 'In a world ravaged by violence, and other serious social problems, Joan - a character that alludes to Christ (which represents the return to Earth) arrives to Italy by train and preaching for the salvation of mankind, condemning the hypocrisy and hedonism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eEeqqeiDW8BrzLYO6xdKEiizV6i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50193'),
  ('667058819457024670', 'Joan of Arc', 1900, 'Drama, History', 'Georges Méliès', 'Georges Méliès', 'Jeanne Calvière, Georges Méliès, Jehanne d''Alcy, Bleuette Bernon', null, 'A divinely inspired peasant woman becomes an army captain for France and then is martyred after she is captured.', 'A divinely inspired peasant woman becomes an army captain for France and then is martyred after she is captured.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rmn8BxsBQafNmd8C3F52s0m9PK4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106030'),
  ('487694137356604229', 'Joan of Arc', 1948, 'Drama, History', 'Victor Fleming, Joseph A. Valentine, Edward Salven', 'Maxwell Anderson, Andrew Solt', 'Ingrid Bergman, Francis L. Sullivan, J. Carrol Naish, Ward Bond, Shepperd Strudwick, Gene Lockhart, John Emery, Leif Erickson', 'NR', 'In the 15th Century, France is a defeated and ruined nation after the One Hundred Years War against England. The fourteen-year-old farm girl Joan of Arc claims to hear voices from Heaven asking her to lead God''s Army against Orleans and crowning the weak Dauphin Charles VII as King of France. Joan gathers the people with her faith, forms an army, and conquers Orleans.', 'In the 15th Century, France is a defeated and ruined nation after the One Hundred Years War against England. The fourteen-year-old farm girl Joan of Arc claims to hear voices from Heaven asking her to lead God''s Army against Orleans and crowning the weak Dauphin Charles VII as King of France. Joan gathers the people with her faith, forms an army, and conquers Orleans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ho3rFoxHaQad2tH3FYUSlvnQWUY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43443'),
  ('155185786438208373', 'Joan of Arc', 2019, 'Drama, War, History', 'Rémi Bouvier, Bruno Dumont', 'Bruno Dumont', 'Lise Leplat Prudhomme, Fabrice Luchini, Jean-François Causeret, Annick Lavieville, Daniel Dienne, Fabien Fenet, Robert Hanicotte, Justine Herbez', null, 'In the 15th century, both France and England stake a blood claim for the French throne. Believing that God had chosen her, young Joan leads the army of the King of France. When she is captured, the Church sends her for trial on charges of heresy. Refusing to accept the accusations, the graceful Joan will stay true to her mission.', 'In the 15th century, both France and England stake a blood claim for the French throne. Believing that God had chosen her, young Joan leads the army of the King of France. When she is captured, the Church sends her for trial on charges of heresy. Refusing to accept the accusations, the graceful Joan will stay true to her mission.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wH4m2KRh2te4RDMtYAzD8yKgWgX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:540111'),
  ('974143614087934847', 'Joan of Arc at the Stake', 1954, 'Drama, History', 'Roberto Rossellini, Gábor Pogány', 'Roberto Rossellini', 'Ingrid Bergman, Tullio Carminati, Giacinto Prandelli, Augusto Romani, Agnese Dubbini, Anna Tarallo, Silvio Santanelli, Mario Prandelli', null, 'Joan of Arc is being burned alive for heresy. In a kind of dream state, she departs from her body and begins to look back upon her life. She begins this journey in a depressed and demoralized state. However, a priest appears to help guide her. First, he shows her those that accused her in the guise of animal characters, in order to show her their true nature. Then, he shows her the good that she has performed for people. In the end, she is proud of what she has done and is ready to face the flames.', 'Joan of Arc is being burned alive for heresy. In a kind of dream state, she departs from her body and begins to look back upon her life. She begins this journey in a depressed and demoralized state. However, a priest appears to help guide her. First, he shows her those that accused her in the guise of animal characters, in order to show her their true nature. Then, he shows her the good that she has performed for people. In the end, she is proud of what she has done and is ready to face the flames.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8yApbHnhbKchGiBKvSdXO3Z3XtK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:155956'),
  ('772923535175781370', 'Joan of Paris', 1942, 'Romance, War, Drama', 'Robert Stevenson, Robert Aldrich', 'Ellis St. Joseph, Charles Bennett', 'Michèle Morgan, Paul Henreid, Thomas Mitchell, Laird Cregar, May Robson, Alan Ladd, Alexander Granach, Jack Briggs', 'NR', 'An RAF squadron is brought down over occupied France. The flyers get to Paris in spite of the fact that the youngest, Baby, is injured. He must be hidden and his wounds cared for. The Gestapo has already issued orders for their arrest.', 'An RAF squadron is brought down over occupied France. The flyers get to Paris in spite of the fact that the youngest, Baby, is injured. He must be hidden and his wounds cared for. The Gestapo has already issued orders for their arrest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lM0ri6gFkEvLQ4trLy2OKkJpdNB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45801'),
  ('306799440319398810', 'Joan the Maid I: The Battles', 1994, 'History, Drama, War', 'Jacques Rivette, William Lubtchansky', 'Pascal Bonitzer, Christine Laurent', 'Sandrine Bonnaire, Tatiana Moukhine, Jean-Marie Richier, Baptiste Roussillon, Jean-Luc Petit, Bernadette Giraud, Jean-Claude Jay, Olivier Cruveiller', 'PG', 'Convinced only she can lead France to victory against the invading English, Jeanne leaves her childhood home to plead with Charles, heir to the French throne, to allow her to guide his troops on the battlefield.', 'Convinced only she can lead France to victory against the invading English, Jeanne leaves her childhood home to plead with Charles, heir to the French throne, to allow her to guide his troops on the battlefield.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qUt6YzLR8NIQcqkbXwPjK556Hfr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142373'),
  ('405742007742592898', 'Joan the Maid II: The Prisons', 1994, 'History, Drama', 'Jacques Rivette, William Lubtchansky', 'Pascal Bonitzer, Christine Laurent', 'Sandrine Bonnaire, André Marcon, Jean-Louis Richard, Marcel Bozonnet, Patrick Le Mauff, Didier Sauvegrain, Jean-Pierre Lorit, Bruno Wolkowitch', 'PG', 'Jeanne has succeeded in lifting the siege of Orléans and Charles has been crowned King of France. However, she is injured in an attempt to take Paris, weakening her position at court. Captured by the enemy and put on trial, she finds both her life and the sanctity of her body at stake.', 'Jeanne has succeeded in lifting the siege of Orléans and Charles has been crowned King of France. However, she is injured in an attempt to take Paris, weakening her position at court. Captured by the enemy and put on trial, she finds both her life and the sanctity of her body at stake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hHP7tnfLhJziKSLzeGzTvDx30Pj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142374'),
  ('643328007846571948', 'Joanna', 1968, 'Comedy, Music, Drama', 'Michael Sarne, Walter Lassally', 'Michael Sarne', 'Geneviève Waïte, Calvin Lockhart, Donald Sutherland, Christian Doermer, Glenna Forster-Jones, Marda Vanne, Fiona Lewis, Manning Wilson', null, 'When 17 year old Joanna comes to Swinging London, she meets a host of colourful characters, discovers the pleasures of casual sex and falls in love. That''s when things get complicated.', 'When 17 year old Joanna comes to Swinging London, she meets a host of colourful characters, discovers the pleasures of casual sex and falls in love. That''s when things get complicated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/474AfVZKtzXKU9oiVifTvuKCvak.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94662'),
  ('549703406209523294', 'João, o Maestro', 2017, 'Drama', 'Mauro Lima, Fernanda Polastri, Fernanda Nakamura', 'Márcio Alemão, Mauro Lima', 'Alexandre Nero, Rodrigo Pandolfo, Davi Campolongo, Caco Ciocler, Fernanda Nobre, Alinne Moraes, Giulio Lopes, Ondina Clais', null, 'João Carlos Martins was a child with serious health problems. Because of this, he had a reclusive childhood. But one day, the piano came into his life. He arises as a stubborn boy who, in a few years turns into one of the biggest promises of the world classical music.', 'João Carlos Martins was a child with serious health problems. Because of this, he had a reclusive childhood. But one day, the piano came into his life. He arises as a stubborn boy who, in a few years turns into one of the biggest promises of the world classical music.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AoDIYvfFqZWI4MWP3M3VzOvnXyY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:466870'),
  ('393081702902162817', 'Joaquim', 2017, 'Drama, History', 'Marcelo Gomes, Pierre de Kerchove', 'Marcelo Gomes', 'Júlio Machado, Isabél Zuaa, Rômulo Braga, Nuno Lopes, Welket Bungué, Diogo Dória, Eduardo Moreira, Karay Rya Pua', null, 'Brazil, 18th century. The colony of Portugal endures a decline in gold production. A Portuguese minority rules over a corrupt and autocratic society. Joaquim is an efficient soldier, famous for capturing gold smugglers. While waiting for his promotion to Lieutenant, he leaves for a risky mission in search of new gold mines - the only way to buy the freedom of Blackie, a slave he is in love with. Inspired by the true story of Tiradentes, the first leader of the Brazilian revolutionary movement.', 'Brazil, 18th century. The colony of Portugal endures a decline in gold production. A Portuguese minority rules over a corrupt and autocratic society. Joaquim is an efficient soldier, famous for capturing gold smugglers. While waiting for his promotion to Lieutenant, he leaves for a risky mission in search of new gold mines - the only way to buy the freedom of Blackie, a slave he is in love with. Inspired by the true story of Tiradentes, the first leader of the Brazilian revolutionary movement.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y1KE2HYfKHwXN0j454Fqf60CIh3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:436349'),
  ('280984987057216886', 'Job: The Last Grey Cell', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Konrad Niewolski, Mikołaj Łebkowski', 'Konrad Niewolski', 'Tomasz Borkowski, Andrzej Andrzejewski, Borys Szyc, Agnieszka Włodarczyk, Katarzyna Bargiełowska, Henryk Gołębiewski, Krzysztof Ibisz, Elżbieta Jarosik', null, 'Three friends from the neighborhood – Adi, Pele and Chemist – are often referred to as freeloaders, morons, losers. This is a gross simplification! In fact they are underestimated by the world. It hasn''t appreciated them YET. Life presents them with challenges and difficulties, like bad luck at work or mentally ill neighbor''s dog or a grandmother who steals their hashish. But they do not give up!', 'Three friends from the neighborhood – Adi, Pele and Chemist – are often referred to as freeloaders, morons, losers. This is a gross simplification! In fact they are underestimated by the world. It hasn''t appreciated them YET. Life presents them with challenges and difficulties, like bad luck at work or mentally ill neighbor''s dog or a grandmother who steals their hashish. But they do not give up!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bu0kqwhtQ2ZPSecvlLWS7u6IPaI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26314'),
  ('1009738208018145220', 'Jobs', 2013, 'Drama, History', 'Joshua Michael Stern, Russell Carpenter, Gary Marcus', 'Matt Whiteley', 'Ashton Kutcher, Josh Gad, Lukas Haas, Victor Rasuk, Eddie Hassell, Ron Eldard, Nelson Franklin, Elden Henson', 'PG-13', 'The story of Steve Jobs'' ascension from college dropout into one of the most revered creative entrepreneurs of the 20th century.', 'The story of Steve Jobs'' ascension from college dropout into one of the most revered creative entrepreneurs of the 20th century.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mOyZ0UAWaOJartFq2G3Cv0soFtQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115782'),
  ('308837362136686687', 'Jockey', 2021, 'Drama', 'Clint Bentley, Adolpho Veloso', 'Clint Bentley, Greg Kwedar', 'Clifton Collins Jr., Moisés Arias, Molly Parker, Logan Cormier, Vincent Francia, Danny Garcia, Marlon St. Julien, Ryan Barber', 'R', 'An aging jockey is determined to win one last championship, but his dream is complicated when a young rookie shows up claiming to be his son.', 'An aging jockey is determined to win one last championship, but his dream is complicated when a young rookie shows up claiming to be his son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eMgskfX9BfG6i872hawQC17dPzr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:776511'),
  ('1073088641957418401', 'Jockey', 2026, 'Action, Adventure, Drama', 'Pragabhal, Prabhu Jacky', 'Pragabhal', 'Yuvan Krishna, Ridhaan Krishna, Ammu Abhirami, Ranga, Kapil Kapilan', null, 'The film Jackie is based on the ancient goat fighting tradition of Madurai. In a village in Madurai, Ramar and Karthi enter their goats into a goat fight competition. Ramars goat wins the competition. Envious, Karthi tries to take revenge on Ramar and his goat, causing various troubles for Ramar. Ramar thwarts these attempts and protects his goat.', 'The film Jackie is based on the ancient goat fighting tradition of Madurai. In a village in Madurai, Ramar and Karthi enter their goats into a goat fight competition. Ramars goat wins the competition. Envious, Karthi tries to take revenge on Ramar and his goat, causing various troubles for Ramar. Ramar thwarts these attempts and protects his goat.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F69zi48P9NIwPq7qdssxQ8qqbBNG.jpg', 'plex:movie:jockey-2026-1'),
  ('317198982355072332', 'Jocks', 1986, 'Comedy', 'Steve Carver, Gregory R. Wolf, Debra DuVal', 'David Oas, Michael Lanahan', 'Scott Strader, Perry Lang, Mariska Hargitay, Richard Roundtree, R.G. Armstrong, Stoney Jackson, Adam Mills, Trinidad Silva', 'R', 'When an odd-ball tennis team of a Los Angeles college sets out on a road trip to a regional college tennis tournament in fun-filled Las Vegas, all the stops are out and literally "anything goes" both on and off the court.', 'When an odd-ball tennis team of a Los Angeles college sets out on a road trip to a regional college tennis tournament in fun-filled Las Vegas, all the stops are out and literally "anything goes" both on and off the court.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tgjpxqrugdbnADyKGvo65kySaBL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67693'),
  ('997227911358961337', 'Jodhaa Akbar', 2008, 'Romance, History, Drama', 'Ashutosh Gowariker, Nitin Kulkarni, Murlidhar Shinde', 'Ashutosh Gowariker, Haidar Ali', 'Hrithik Roshan, Aishwarya Rai Bachchan, Sonu Sood, Kulbhushan Kharbanda, Suhasini Mulay, Raza Murad, Poonam Sinha, Rajesh Vivek', 'PG-13', 'A sixteenth century love story about a marriage of alliance that gave birth to true love between a Mughal emperor and a Rajput princess.', 'A sixteenth century love story about a marriage of alliance that gave birth to true love between a Mughal emperor and a Rajput princess.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gPjgeywFNTlh9IUuXWy85nn4h8J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14073'),
  ('62000534763356460', 'Jodi No. 1', 2001, 'Comedy, Romance', 'K. S. Prakash Rao, David Dhawan', 'Imtiaz Patel', 'Govinda, Sanjay Dutt, Twinkle Khanna, Monica Bedi, Shakti Kapoor, Anupam Kher, Tiku Talsania, Rajat Bedi', null, 'Partners in crime Jai and Veeru set their next target on a rich businessman, Rai Bahadur. Things turn hilarious when both of them fall for his daughters.', 'Partners in crime Jai and Veeru set their next target on a rich businessman, Rai Bahadur. Things turn hilarious when both of them fall for his daughters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wa9cSm4exWeevID8TBHH7ZQYPi9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46430'),
  ('400448161049723231', 'Jodie Foster: Hollywood Under the Skin', 2021, 'Documentary, TV Movie', 'Camille Juza, Yal Sadat', 'Camille Juza, Yal Sadat', 'Jodie Foster, B. Ruby Rich, Jordan Mintzer, Jonathan Demme, Claude Chabrol, Clovis Goux, Mathieu Kassovitz', null, 'From her precocious status as a sex symbol to her consecration as a filmmaker, Jodie Foster''s story is about a feminist struggle, albeit atypical, fought on and off the screen. This film sets out to retrace her remarkable journey within the Hollywood industry.', 'From her precocious status as a sex symbol to her consecration as a filmmaker, Jodie Foster''s story is about a feminist struggle, albeit atypical, fought on and off the screen. This film sets out to retrace her remarkable journey within the Hollywood industry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jebdlRpJ2pHTcjTNKP8IDrvXeVm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:837550'),
  ('1060060643977899716', 'Jodorowsky''s Dune', 2013, 'Documentary', 'Frank Pavich, David Cavallo, Syd Garon', null, 'Alejandro Jodorowsky, Michel Seydoux, Chris Foss, H. R. Giger, Jean-Paul Gibon, Brontis Jodorowsky, Amanda Lear, Christian Wander', 'PG-13', 'In 1974, Chilean-French director Alejandro Jodorowsky embarked on the quixotic project of adapting Frank Herbert''s influential novel Dune (1969) for the big screen. After investing two years, and millions of dollars, the gigantic project ended in failure; but the artists Jodorowsky brought together to carry it out continued to work together, and ended up laying the foundations for modern science fiction cinema.', 'In 1974, Chilean-French director Alejandro Jodorowsky embarked on the quixotic project of adapting Frank Herbert''s influential novel Dune (1969) for the big screen. After investing two years, and millions of dollars, the gigantic project ended in failure; but the artists Jodorowsky brought together to carry it out continued to work together, and ended up laying the foundations for modern science fiction cinema.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mv1zSd6P59D43iYQXs7qx01nSiX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:191720'),
  ('257368870433758530', 'Joe', 1970, 'Drama, Crime', 'John G. Avildsen, John G. Avildsen, Michael Lerner', 'Norman Wexler', 'Peter Boyle, Dennis Patrick, Susan Sarandon, Patrick McDermott, K Callan, Tim Lewis, Estelle Omens, Bob O''Connell', 'R', 'After murdering his daughter''s drug-dealing boyfriend, a wealthy ad executive stumbles into a bar and strikes up an uneasy alliance with Joe Curran, a drunken bigot with a bloodlust who works at a local factory.', 'After murdering his daughter''s drug-dealing boyfriend, a wealthy ad executive stumbles into a bar and strikes up an uneasy alliance with Joe Curran, a drunken bigot with a bloodlust who works at a local factory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2x4YCP8uV4cKOS5ZEKt1Cc1h4eF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46691'),
  ('1101395412982728766', 'Joe', 2014, 'Drama', 'David Gordon Green, Tim Orr, Rochelle Harvey', 'Gary Hawkins', 'Nicolas Cage, Tye Sheridan, Ronnie Gene Blevins, Sue Rock, Heather Kafka, Gary Poulter, Adriene Mishler, Brenda Isaacs Booth', 'R', 'The rough-hewn boss of a lumber crew courts trouble when he steps in to protect the youngest member of his team from an abusive father.', 'The rough-hewn boss of a lumber crew courts trouble when he steps in to protect the youngest member of his team from an abusive father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/numu669Pf8wOPcqImONWORYx0Pp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:157847'),
  ('481603001052349894', 'Joe Bell', 2020, 'Drama', 'Reinaldo Marcus Green, Jacques Jouffret, Chris Carroll', 'Larry McMurtry, Diana Ossana', 'Mark Wahlberg, Reid Miller, Connie Britton, Maxwell Jenkins, Morgan Lily, Gary Sinise, Tara Buck, Ash Santos', 'R', 'The true story of a small town, working class father who embarks on a solo walk across the U.S. to crusade against bullying after his son is tormented in high school for being gay.', 'The true story of a small town, working class father who embarks on a solo walk across the U.S. to crusade against bullying after his son is tormented in high school for being gay.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9HfQD60w6f6PPkfdiI6ipJSw0bD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:552269'),
  ('491130452540271868', 'Joe Dirt', 2001, 'Mystery, Adventure, Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'John R. Leonetti, Dennie Gordon, Marty Eli Schwartz', 'David Spade, Fred Wolf', 'David Spade, Dennis Miller, Brittany Daniel, Kid Rock, Adam Beach, Erik Per Sullivan, Jaime Pressly, Christopher Walken', 'PG-13', 'Joe Dirt is a janitor with a mullet hairdo, acid-washed jeans and a dream to find the parents that he lost at the Grand Canyon when he was a belligerent, trailer park-raised eight-year-old. Now, blasting Van Halen in his jacked-up economy car, the irrepressibly optimistic Joe hits the road alone in search of his folks.', 'Joe Dirt is a janitor with a mullet hairdo, acid-washed jeans and a dream to find the parents that he lost at the Grand Canyon when he was a belligerent, trailer park-raised eight-year-old. Now, blasting Van Halen in his jacked-up economy car, the irrepressibly optimistic Joe hits the road alone in search of his folks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yykDEtHk6DMtZK8EaxW88YyQ054.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10956'),
  ('275719110690270570', 'Joe Dirt 2: Beautiful Loser', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Fred Wolf, Ryan Miningham, Jeff Overfield', 'David Spade, Fred Wolf', 'David Spade, Brittany Daniel, Patrick Warburton, Mark McGrath, Dennis Miller, Christopher Walken, Toby Bronson, Ron Flagge', 'NR', 'When happy family man Joe Dirt finds himself transported to the recent past, he begins an epic journey to get back to his loved ones in the present.', 'When happy family man Joe Dirt finds himself transported to the recent past, he begins an epic journey to get back to his loved ones in the present.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nde744Wjaj11BXA4npXcByLDMkw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:335970'),
  ('1065318504613034916', 'Joe Hill', 1971, 'Drama', 'Bo Widerberg', 'Bo Widerberg', 'Thommy Berggren, Anja Schmidt, Kelvin Malave, Evert Anderson, Cathy Smith, Hasse Persson, David Moritz, Richard Weber', 'NR', 'In the early 20th-century, the legendary Joe Hill emigrates with his brother to the United States. However, after a short time, he loses touch with his brother. After a few jobs but struck by all the injustice and tragedy, he becomes active in the forbidden IWW (Industrial Workers of the World), a union for workers without trades. It is forbidden to demonstrate and speak in public but Joe finds a loophole by singing his manifests with the Salvation Army. As his allies grow, so do his enemies.', 'In the early 20th-century, the legendary Joe Hill emigrates with his brother to the United States. However, after a short time, he loses touch with his brother. After a few jobs but struck by all the injustice and tragedy, he becomes active in the forbidden IWW (Industrial Workers of the World), a union for workers without trades. It is forbidden to demonstrate and speak in public but Joe finds a loophole by singing his manifests with the Salvation Army. As his allies grow, so do his enemies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tguCZY7GtDSLgL6cJWFYexARqB3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74746'),
  ('251835092598876831', 'Joe Kidd', 1972, 'Western, Drama', 'Bruce Surtees, John Sturges, James Fargo', 'Elmore Leonard', 'Clint Eastwood, Robert Duvall, John Saxon, Don Stroud, Stella Garcia, James Wainwright, Paul Koslo, Gregory Walcott', 'PG', 'A band of Mexicans find their U. S. land claims denied and all the records destroyed in a courthouse fire. Their leader, Louis Chama, encourages them to use force to regain their land. A wealthy landowner wanting the same decides to hire a gang of killers with Joe Kidd to track Chama.', 'A band of Mexicans find their U. S. land claims denied and all the records destroyed in a courthouse fire. Their leader, Louis Chama, encourages them to use force to regain their land. A wealthy landowner wanting the same decides to hire a gang of killers with Joe Kidd to track Chama.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gwVL6a6ZPijqM5hB4n2Ztg1akWY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14881'),
  ('188189882931176810', 'Joe Rogan: Burn the Boats', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Anthony Giordano', 'Joe Rogan', 'Joe Rogan', 'R', 'Podcast host Joe Rogan delivers a live stand-up set at the Majestic Theatre in San Antonio, Texas.', 'Podcast host Joe Rogan delivers a live stand-up set at the Majestic Theatre in San Antonio, Texas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1EvgC9ND9BS0tqvI1pVfMBy9gQy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1315161'),
  ('494880622744660111', 'Joe Rogan: Live', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Michael Blieden', 'Joe Rogan', 'Joe Rogan, Joey Diaz', null, 'Regardless of Joe Rogan''s success on television with the Ultimate Fighting Championship or hosting Fear Factor or co-starring in NewsRadio, his true love is stand-up comedy. With more than 15 years as a touring comedian, Rogan has honed an opinionated comedic style that challenges the status quo. From his unorthodox ideas for peace in the Middle East to debunking the myth of Noah''s Ark and appreciating the vastness of space - all of the energy of a live Joe Rogan performance is captured on Joe Rogan: Live!', 'Regardless of Joe Rogan''s success on television with the Ultimate Fighting Championship or hosting Fear Factor or co-starring in NewsRadio, his true love is stand-up comedy. With more than 15 years as a touring comedian, Rogan has honed an opinionated comedic style that challenges the status quo. From his unorthodox ideas for peace in the Middle East to debunking the myth of Noah''s Ark and appreciating the vastness of space - all of the energy of a live Joe Rogan performance is captured on Joe Rogan: Live!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iwcrJ1uUwIFmBPpiFPGXgfQiOq6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24439'),
  ('84429527918373989', 'Joe Rogan: Strange Times', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Anthony Giordano', 'Joe Rogan', 'Joe Rogan', null, 'Outspoken as ever, comedian Joe Rogan takes on politics, pro wrestling, pot laws, cats, vegans and much more in a stand-up special shot in Boston.', 'Outspoken as ever, comedian Joe Rogan takes on politics, pro wrestling, pot laws, cats, vegans and much more in a stand-up special shot in Boston.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nxV9XiWQsp0J9bOpReKiAnKrzNj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:550248'),
  ('308613474173596958', 'Joe Rogan: Triggered', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Dave Regen, Anthony Giordano', 'Joe Rogan', 'Joe Rogan', null, 'Unleashing his inquisitive, intense comedic style, Rogan explores everything from raising kids and Santa Claus to pot gummies and talking to dolphins.', 'Unleashing his inquisitive, intense comedic style, Rogan explores everything from raising kids and Santa Claus to pot gummies and talking to dolphins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/696PN5LYRMPpJAxh2pv6HHvaJpg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:421854'),
  ('724983769505116750', 'Joe Somebody', 2001, 'Comedy, Romance, Family, Drama', 'John Pasquin, Daryn Okada, Mark Tobey', 'John Scott Shepherd', 'Tim Allen, Julie Bowen, Kelly Lynch, Greg Germann, Hayden Panettiere, Patrick Warburton, Jim Belushi, Ken Marino', 'PG', 'When underappreciated video specialist Joe Scheffer is brutally humiliated by office bully Mark McKinney in front of his daughter, Joe begins a quest for personal redemption. He proceeds by enduring a personal makeover and takes martial arts lessons from a B-action star. As news spreads of his rematch with Mark, Joe suddenly finds himself the center of attention, ascending the corporate ladder and growing in popularity.', 'When underappreciated video specialist Joe Scheffer is brutally humiliated by office bully Mark McKinney in front of his daughter, Joe begins a quest for personal redemption. He proceeds by enduring a personal makeover and takes martial arts lessons from a B-action star. As news spreads of his rematch with Mark, Joe suddenly finds himself the center of attention, ascending the corporate ladder and growing in popularity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9AJvAour6cslSMy9Q0WLd0jIJh1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12312'),
  ('156111348610788965', 'Joe Speedboot', 2026, 'Drama', 'Sam de Jong', 'Jan Eilander, Daniël Samkalden', 'Tobias Kersloot, Daan Buringa, QiQi van Boheemen, Ramses van Hall, Chris Peters', null, 'Based on the bestselling novel of the same name by Tommy Wieringa, about the friendship between the wheelchair-bound Fransje Hermans and the adventurous Joe Speedboot, who turns Fransje''s life upside down with new dreams and adventures.', 'Based on the bestselling novel of the same name by Tommy Wieringa, about the friendship between the wheelchair-bound Fransje Hermans and the adventurous Joe Speedboot, who turns Fransje''s life upside down with new dreams and adventures.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FrFI1RwCuU0FyHymPq0PmDmYJwHZ.jpg', 'plex:movie:joe-speedboot'),
  ('159567446200747001', 'Joe Strummer: The Future Is Unwritten', 2007, 'Music, Documentary', 'Julien Temple', null, 'Joe Strummer, Topper Headon, Paul Simonon, Terry Chimes, Steve Jones, Don Letts, John Cooper Clarke, Jim Jarmusch', null, 'As the front man of the Clash from 1977 onwards, Joe Strummer changed people''s lives forever. Four years after his death, his influence reaches out around the world, more strongly now than ever before. In "The Future Is Unwritten", from British film director Julien Temple, Joe Strummer is revealed not just as a legend or musician, but as a true communicator of our times. Drawing on both a shared punk history and the close personal friendship which developed over the last years of Joe''s life, Julien Temple''s film is a celebration of Joe Strummer - before, during and after the Clash.', 'As the front man of the Clash from 1977 onwards, Joe Strummer changed people''s lives forever. Four years after his death, his influence reaches out around the world, more strongly now than ever before. In "The Future Is Unwritten", from British film director Julien Temple, Joe Strummer is revealed not just as a legend or musician, but as a true communicator of our times. Drawing on both a shared punk history and the close personal friendship which developed over the last years of Joe''s life, Julien Temple''s film is a celebration of Joe Strummer - before, during and after the Clash.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oWFvG5b7128EQvi06Hg4nm5Iw6b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18893'),
  ('767550619107382452', 'Joe the King', 1999, 'Crime, Drama', 'Frank Whaley, Michael Mayers', 'Frank Whaley', 'Noah Fleiss, Karen Young, Camryn Manheim, Austin Pendleton, Val Kilmer, Max Ligosh, James Costa, Jenny Robertson', null, 'A destitute 14-year-old struggles to keep his life together despite harsh abuse at his mother''s hands, harsher abuse at his father''s, and a growing separation from his slightly older brother.', 'A destitute 14-year-old struggles to keep his life together despite harsh abuse at his mother''s hands, harsher abuse at his father''s, and a growing separation from his slightly older brother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pJy18dUA9J9XDuKiboTjEtj6YWL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53151'),
  ('1054641820150564824', 'Joe Versus the Volcano', 1990, 'Comedy, Romance', 'John Patrick Shanley, Alan Edmisten, William M. Elvin', 'John Patrick Shanley', 'Tom Hanks, Meg Ryan, Lloyd Bridges, Dan Hedaya, Ossie Davis, Barry McGovern, Robert Stack, Amanda Plummer', 'PG-13', 'Hypochondriac Joe Banks finds out he has six months to live, quits his dead end job, musters the courage to ask his co-worker out on a date, and is then hired to jump into a volcano by a mysterious visitor.', 'Hypochondriac Joe Banks finds out he has six months to live, quits his dead end job, musters the courage to ask his co-worker out on a date, and is then hired to jump into a volcano by a mysterious visitor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fwjMUuDZUxedfsUpVQKQN8cYfzB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2565'),
  ('554370188697833734', 'Joe: The Busybody', 1971, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Jean Girault, Henri Decaë', 'Claude Magnier', 'Louis de Funès, Claude Gensac, Michel Galabru, Bernard Blier, Guy Tréjan, Ferdy Mayne, Yvonne Clech, Florence Blot', null, 'A writer accidentally shoots his blackmailer and tries to hide the body.', 'A writer accidentally shoots his blackmailer and tries to hide the body.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oO916dKqqKIWcQjUnbWjEcLF47Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12598'),
  ('467923153712390639', 'Joe''s Apartment', 1996, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'John Payson, Peter Deming, Carlos Saldanha', 'John Payson', 'Jerry O''Connell, Megan Ward, Billy West, Reginald Hudlin, Willi One Blood, Tracy Vilar, Sandra ''Pepa'' Denton, Robert Vaughn', 'PG-13', 'A nice guy has just moved to New York and discovers that he must share his run-down apartment with a couple thousand singing, dancing cockroaches.', 'A nice guy has just moved to New York and discovers that he must share his run-down apartment with a couple thousand singing, dancing cockroaches.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a06jrMRurcq7sYdhFK2LNs8bRt8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11962'),
  ('1144359375198345334', 'Joe''s Apt.', 1992, 'Comedy', 'John Payson', 'John Payson', 'Arija Bareikis, Mark Rosenthal', null, 'It''s just a silly story of all the roaches that live with a 20-something named Joe.', 'It''s just a silly story of all the roaches that live with a 20-something named Joe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k6lHU8hP9onW3RgrIya1YhrxZcc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:201298'),
  ('822674715502785821', 'Joe''s College Road Trip', 2026, 'Comedy', 'Tyler Perry, Michael Watson', 'Tyler Perry', 'Tyler Perry, Jermaine Harris, Amber Reign Smith, Bethany Anne Lind, Jeremy Gimenez, Millie Jackson, Wil Deusner, Patricia Williams', 'R', 'To teach his sheltered grandson about the real world, Madea''s foul-mouthed brother Joe takes the college-bound teen on a raucous cross-country road trip.', 'To teach his sheltered grandson about the real world, Madea''s foul-mouthed brother Joe takes the college-bound teen on a raucous cross-country road trip.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jWGOCUlzF4aCVLwHoiuqWWfhcrA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1243460'),
  ('989292755965387405', 'Joel', 2018, 'Drama', 'Carlos Sorin, Iván Gierasinchuk, Inés Vera', 'Carlos Sorin', 'Victoria Almeida, Diego Gentile, Joel Noguera, Ana Katz, Gustavo Daniele, Emilce Festa, Rodrigo Muñoz, Claudia Pérez', null, 'Unable to have kids of their own, Cecilia and Diego get a call from the adoption agency they registered to, some time ago. The sudden arrival of Joel, a 9 year old with a very hard backstory, will change the course of their lives.', 'Unable to have kids of their own, Cecilia and Diego get a call from the adoption agency they registered to, some time ago. The sudden arrival of Joel, a 9 year old with a very hard backstory, will change the course of their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/78QnEr4oNtfcAE1o1yaDZ9ytyed.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:531818'),
  ('520459768431552320', 'Joey', 1997, 'Comedy, Family, Adventure', 'Ian Barry, David Burr', 'Stuart Beattie', 'Rebecca Gibney, Jamie Croft, Alex McKenna, Harold Hopkins, Tony Briggs, Ruth Cracknell, Ed Begley Jr., Martin Jacobs', null, 'Billy is a boy who is trying to save a baby kangaroo called Joey when it is caught and taken to Sydney. Linda, the young daughter of the U.S. Ambassador is helping Billy in his task.', 'Billy is a boy who is trying to save a baby kangaroo called Joey when it is caught and taken to Sydney. Linda, the young daughter of the U.S. Ambassador is helping Billy in his task.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mSH5d9iSKMbYwHP01IfHghqH5vl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102909'),
  ('620344289890141245', 'Jofroi', 1934, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Marcel Pagnol, Willy Faktorovitch', 'Marcel Pagnol', 'Vincent Scotto, Henri Poupon, Annie Toinon, Odette Roger, Charles Blavette, André Robert, José Tyrand, Henry Darbey', null, 'Jofroi sells his orchard to Alphonse. Alphonse wants to use the land for crops, so he starts to cut down the trees. Jofroi is furious: how can someone cut down those trees? He threatens to commit suicide so that the small town will blame Alphonse and Alphonse’s life will be miserable. Alphonse, the curate, the teacher, and some of the townsfolk spend the rest of the movie trying to keep Jofroi from committing suicide…', 'Jofroi sells his orchard to Alphonse. Alphonse wants to use the land for crops, so he starts to cut down the trees. Jofroi is furious: how can someone cut down those trees? He threatens to commit suicide so that the small town will blame Alphonse and Alphonse’s life will be miserable. Alphonse, the curate, the teacher, and some of the townsfolk spend the rest of the movie trying to keep Jofroi from committing suicide…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/abOdoKL2SGUeHJeyaX6iCvkXfYx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65893'),
  ('869540063371614044', 'Jogi', 2022, 'Crime, Drama', 'Ali Abbas Zafar, Marcin Łaskawiec, Abhishek Banerjee', 'Ali Abbas Zafar, Sukhmani Sadana', 'Diljit Dosanjh, Kumud Mishra, Mohammed Zeeshan Ayyub, Hiten Tejwani, Paresh Pahuja, Amyra Dastur, Apindereep Singh, Neelu Kohli', null, 'Amid tension in 1980s India, three friends of different faiths unite in a noble yet dangerous effort to save hundreds in their town.', 'Amid tension in 1980s India, three friends of different faiths unite in a noble yet dangerous effort to save hundreds in their town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aQJ93gdI2htbZfOLX41PnkRxW3l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1014386'),
  ('1083571584706854404', 'Johan', 1976, 'Drama', 'Philippe Vallois, François About', null, 'Éric Guadagnan, Ivan Roberto, Pierre Commoy, Patrice Pascal, Georges Barber, Alexandre Grecq, Marie-Christine Weill, Manolo Rosales', null, 'Johan details the director''s quest for an actor to play his titular lover, the real deal having been incarcerated just prior to shooting on charges of petty theft.', 'Johan details the director''s quest for an actor to play his titular lover, the real deal having been incarcerated just prior to shooting on charges of petty theft.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lywSpmYtjZPZoI8CokGowK7aQMv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34726'),
  ('527422641979686000', 'Johan Falk: GSI - Gruppen för särskilda insatser', 2009, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Anders Nilsson, Per-Arne Svensson', 'Anders Nilsson, Joakim Hansson', 'Jakob Eklund, Joel Kinnaman, Mikael Tornving, Meliz Karlge, Reuben Sallmander, Jens Hultén, Jacqueline Ramel, André Sjöberg', null, 'Johan works in tandem with the GSI organized crime unit to bring in a cadre of armored car robbers', 'Johan works in tandem with the GSI organized crime unit to bring in a cadre of armored car robbers', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fOhRWX5nSsNjYrLZe50nbdCS3lm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24023'),
  ('1094244414356521944', 'Johan Falk: Leo Gaut', 2009, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Richard Holm', 'Fredrik T Olsson', 'Jakob Eklund, Peter Andersson, Marie Richardson, Jacqueline Ramel, Joel Kinnaman, Tind Soneby, Mikael Tornving, Meliz Karlge', 'PG-13', 'A car explodes in front of a primary school where GSI boss Patrick Agrell has just left his children. The event reunites Johan Falk with Leo Gaut, a former criminal restaurant owner who Johan put behind bars a decade ago.', 'A car explodes in front of a primary school where GSI boss Patrick Agrell has just left his children. The event reunites Johan Falk with Leo Gaut, a former criminal restaurant owner who Johan put behind bars a decade ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aIxSuEAwXmIBDnKNoOP69c3Wt0j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24024'),
  ('148964195909251053', 'Johan Falk: National Target', 2009, 'Crime, Action, Thriller', 'Richard Holm', 'Björn Carlström', 'Jakob Eklund, Joel Kinnaman, Samuli Edelmann, Jacqueline Ramel, Mikael Tornving, Jens Hultén, Meliz Karlge, Anastasios Soulis', 'PG-13', 'Frank Wagner goes deeper undercover to infiltrate Europe''s most dangerous Mafia, the Russian-est, consisting of ex - KGB officers.', 'Frank Wagner goes deeper undercover to infiltrate Europe''s most dangerous Mafia, the Russian-est, consisting of ex - KGB officers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lXkdIyUuSTieOGQbxT6QjqphYSh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24025'),
  ('818345192043655916', 'Johan Falk: Operation Näktergal', 2009, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Daniel Lind Lagerlöf', 'Stefan Karlsson', 'Jakob Eklund, Joel Kinnaman, Jacqueline Ramel, Meliz Karlge, Henrik Norlén, Anja Antonowicz, Stipe Erceg, Kjell Wilhelmsen', 'PG-13', 'Johan Falk and his colleagues at the GSI go after sex traffickers importing young women from the East and forcing them into prostitution.', 'Johan Falk and his colleagues at the GSI go after sex traffickers importing young women from the East and forcing them into prostitution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k15ho9b3YEVtFf0txA56Rim0wto.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24713'),
  ('1008726341946671587', 'Johan Falk: The Outlaws', 2009, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Daniel Lind Lagerlöf', 'Fredrik T Olsson', 'Jakob Eklund, Joel Kinnaman, Jacqueline Ramel, Meliz Karlge, Mirosław Zbrojewicz, Fredrik Dolk, André Sjöberg, Henrik Norlén', 'PG-13', 'Johan is a two-fisted Gothenburg cop who finds himself in a shoot-out with jewel robbers. After the smoke has cleared, one robber, shot by his accomplice, and an innocent bystander, are dead. Three witnesses, including Helen, identify thug extraordinaire Leo Gaut as being the dead crook''s trigger-happy colleague. Gaut soon threatens the three witnesses, and only Johan, the badge-wearing hero, can save them.', 'Johan is a two-fisted Gothenburg cop who finds himself in a shoot-out with jewel robbers. After the smoke has cleared, one robber, shot by his accomplice, and an innocent bystander, are dead. Three witnesses, including Helen, identify thug extraordinaire Leo Gaut as being the dead crook''s trigger-happy colleague. Gaut soon threatens the three witnesses, and only Johan, the badge-wearing hero, can save them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/el0EbbBsh8zWKYiiuANQxznELr5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24712'),
  ('820979785597190655', 'Johan Falk: Vapenbröder', 2009, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Anders Nilsson, Per-Arne Svensson', 'Fredrik T Olsson', 'Jakob Eklund, Joel Kinnaman, Mikael Tornving, Jacqueline Ramel, Jens Hultén, Anastasios Soulis, Meliz Karlge, Martin Wallström', 'PG-13', 'John Falk is on a routine mission with the Gothenburg police special unit GSI. With the help of a Norwegian undercover police and a civilian infiltrator in one of Gothenburg''s heaviest criminal gangs, the GSI are trying buy six assault rifles and thus get them off the street. But suddenly everything changes when a new unknown player suddenly and immediately wants to buy not only those weapons but even more, including armor-piercing shells. GSI realizes that this can not be any ordinary robbers. Someone will start a war on the streets of Gothenburg. At the same time as the situation gets more and more complicated for John Falk''s infiltrator Frank Wagner when the leader of the gang he infiltrated realize that one of his own leaking to the police.', 'John Falk is on a routine mission with the Gothenburg police special unit GSI. With the help of a Norwegian undercover police and a civilian infiltrator in one of Gothenburg''s heaviest criminal gangs, the GSI are trying buy six assault rifles and thus get them off the street. But suddenly everything changes when a new unknown player suddenly and immediately wants to buy not only those weapons but even more, including armor-piercing shells. GSI realizes that this can not be any ordinary robbers. Someone will start a war on the streets of Gothenburg. At the same time as the situation gets more and more complicated for John Falk''s infiltrator Frank Wagner when the leader of the gang he infiltrated realize that one of his own leaking to the police.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fB8Vqq4KnCVKCAIwYRLG1WdauFi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24026'),
  ('650076232137735352', 'Johann Mouse', 1953, 'Animation, Comedy, Music', 'Joseph Barbera, William Hanna, Scott Bradley', null, 'Hans Conried', 'NR', 'At the home of Viennese composer Johann Strauss lived Johann Mouse. Whenever the composer played his waltzes, the mouse would dance to the music, unable to control himself. One day, when Strauss was away, the house cat played his master''s music. When word got out about a piano-playing cat and a dancing mouse, they were commanded to perform for the emperor.', 'At the home of Viennese composer Johann Strauss lived Johann Mouse. Whenever the composer played his waltzes, the mouse would dance to the music, unable to control himself. One day, when Strauss was away, the house cat played his master''s music. When word got out about a piano-playing cat and a dancing mouse, they were commanded to perform for the emperor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5gk5w3A67TPoiMDViSDKzcSmVlI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68986'),
  ('469204329342304772', 'Johatsu - Into Thin Air', 2024, 'Documentary', 'Andreas Hartmann, Arata Mori, Andreas Hartmann', 'Andreas Hartmann', null, null, 'In Japan, thousands of people disappear voluntarily every year. And there are companies ready to help those who want to disappear without a trace and start a new life somewhere else. Meet some of them in a film that soberly examines a modern phenomenon.', 'In Japan, thousands of people disappear voluntarily every year. And there are companies ready to help those who want to disappear without a trace and start a new life somewhere else. Meet some of them in a film that soberly examines a modern phenomenon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zqpTW88dOfLUTNnqCkHM5c6Yamw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1249236'),
  ('521535732719942502', 'John & Carolyn: Love, Beauty & Loss', 2026, 'News, Documentary, Drama, Romance', 'Dave Hoffman', null, 'John F. Kennedy, Jr., Carolyn Bessette-Kennedy', 'TV-PG', 'Love, ambition and legacy collide under an unrelenting public spotlight throughout John F. Kennedy Jr. and Carolyn Bessette Kennedy''s relationship and tragic deaths in the 1990s.', 'Love, ambition and legacy collide under an unrelenting public spotlight throughout John F. Kennedy Jr. and Carolyn Bessette Kennedy''s relationship and tragic deaths in the 1990s.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fds0ROwKXcDQUycABGUmFtGIsiSY.jpg', 'plex:movie:john-and-carolyn-love-beauty-and-loss'),
  ('353708678616885348', 'John and Mary', 1969, 'Drama, Romance', 'Peter Yates, Gayne Rescher, Stephen J. Barnett', 'John Mortimer', 'Dustin Hoffman, Mia Farrow, Michael Tolan, Sunny Griffin, Stanley Beck, Tyne Daly, Alix Elias, Julie Garfield', 'PG', 'John and Mary meet in a singles bar, sleep together, and spend the next day getting to know each other.', 'John and Mary meet in a singles bar, sleep together, and spend the next day getting to know each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Uw1LUoDDhBpv9orJOEj1xQytRF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61742'),
  ('291603389940016817', 'John and the Hole', 2021, 'Drama, Thriller, Horror', 'David Ketterer Spencer, Pascual Sisto, Paul Ozgur', 'Nicolás Giacobone', 'Charlie Shotwell, Taissa Farmiga, Jennifer Ehle, Michael C. Hall, Lucien Spelman, Ivy O''Brien, Pamela Jayne Morgan, Georgia Lyman', 'NR', 'While exploring the neighboring woods, 13-year-old John discovers an unfinished bunker — a deep hole in the ground. Seemingly without provocation, he drugs his affluent parents and older sister and drags their unconscious bodies into the bunker, where he holds them captive. As they anxiously wait for John to free them from the hole, the boy returns home, where he can finally do what he wants.', 'While exploring the neighboring woods, 13-year-old John discovers an unfinished bunker — a deep hole in the ground. Seemingly without provocation, he drugs his affluent parents and older sister and drags their unconscious bodies into the bunker, where he holds them captive. As they anxiously wait for John to free them from the hole, the boy returns home, where he can finally do what he wants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rLYJ7YaVqEkF7jYbQDprmSSkWWW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:682532'),
  ('524227447891860259', 'John Bishop: Work in Progress - Live In Top Secret Comedy Club', 2025, 'Comedy', null, null, 'John Bishop', null, 'In October 2000, John Bishop stepped onto the stage at the Frog and Bucket Comedy Club in Manchester to perform for the first time, to just a handful of people – and that night his life changed forever. Fast forward 25 years and John is now one of the biggest names in comedy. To celebrate this landmark quarter of a century making people laugh, John embarks on his ’25’ UK and Ireland arena tour this autumn, with an intimate run of ‘work in progress’ shows during August.', 'In October 2000, John Bishop stepped onto the stage at the Frog and Bucket Comedy Club in Manchester to perform for the first time, to just a handful of people – and that night his life changed forever. Fast forward 25 years and John is now one of the biggest names in comedy. To celebrate this landmark quarter of a century making people laugh, John embarks on his ’25’ UK and Ireland arena tour this autumn, with an intimate run of ‘work in progress’ shows during August.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jA8aDpBzsqFcYA5afCSES6iLBgS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1501895'),
  ('164208209551538251', 'John Candy: I Like Me', 2025, 'Documentary', 'Colin Hanks, Justin Kane', null, 'John Candy, Tom Hanks, Steve Martin, Martin Short, Eugene Levy, Macaulay Culkin, Bill Murray, Catherine O''Hara', 'PG-13', 'Those who knew iconic funnyman John Candy best share his story, in their own words, through never-before-seen archival footage, imagery, and interviews.', 'Those who knew iconic funnyman John Candy best share his story, in their own words, through never-before-seen archival footage, imagery, and interviews.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mNEJdx9WSXeyMmkuQfTeY4zouNx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1492608'),
  ('664040618803997237', 'John Carter', 2012, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Andrew Stanton, Dan Mindel, Naaman Marshall', 'Michael Chabon, Andrew Stanton, Mark Andrews', 'Taylor Kitsch, Lynn Collins, Samantha Morton, Mark Strong, Ciarán Hinds, Dominic West, James Purefoy, Willem Dafoe', 'PG-13', 'John Carter is a war-weary, former military captain who''s inexplicably transported to the mysterious and exotic planet of Barsoom (Mars) and reluctantly becomes embroiled in an epic conflict. It''s a world on the brink of collapse, and Carter rediscovers his humanity when he realizes the survival of Barsoom and its people rests in his hands.', 'John Carter is a war-weary, former military captain who''s inexplicably transported to the mysterious and exotic planet of Barsoom (Mars) and reluctantly becomes embroiled in an epic conflict. It''s a world on the brink of collapse, and Carter rediscovers his humanity when he realizes the survival of Barsoom and its people rests in his hands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lCxz1Yus07QCQQCb6I0Dr3Lmqpx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49529'),
  ('545791933056802317', 'John Denver and the Muppets: A Christmas Together', 1979, 'Family, Music, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Shelley Jensen, Tony Charmoli', 'Bob Finkel, Herbert Baker, Jon Stone', 'John Denver, Jim Henson, Frank Oz, Richard Hunt, Dave Goelz, Jerry Nelson, Steve Whitmire, Kathryn Mullen', null, 'In this beloved holiday classic, Kermit the Frog, Miss Piggy and all the Muppets join the singer for a heart-warming Christmas celebration, with traditional carols as well as lesser-known holiday songs.', 'In this beloved holiday classic, Kermit the Frog, Miss Piggy and all the Muppets join the singer for a heart-warming Christmas celebration, with traditional carols as well as lesser-known holiday songs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/75AnOShTV8tq8aDDHxe5jfegxZy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45731'),
  ('768772656476190651', 'John Dies at the End', 2013, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Don Coscarelli, Mike Gioulakis, Jeff Shiffman', 'Don Coscarelli', 'Chase Williamson, Rob Mayes, Paul Giamatti, Clancy Brown, Glynn Turman, Doug Jones, Daniel Roebuck, Fabianne Therese', 'R', 'A new drug promises out-of-body experiences, but users are coming back changed forever, and an otherworldly invasion of Earth is underway.', 'A new drug promises out-of-body experiences, but users are coming back changed forever, and an otherworldly invasion of Earth is underway.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1IsviP0Tb05xUAFWz5b7FJ0qIHP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75761'),
  ('842406667920565326', 'John Doe: Vigilante', 2014, 'Thriller, Crime', 'David Parker, Greg Spiller, Brendan Campbell', 'Stephen M. Coates', 'Jamie Bamber, Lachy Hulme, Gary Abrahams, Sam Parsonson, Brendan Clearkin, Brooke Ryan, Ditch Davey, Louise Crawford', 'R', 'When John Doe is convicted of being a vigilante serial killer, a vigilante group named ''Speak for the Dead'' emerges in support of John''s cause—elevating the debate about justice versus vengeance.', 'When John Doe is convicted of being a vigilante serial killer, a vigilante group named ''Speak for the Dead'' emerges in support of John''s cause—elevating the debate about justice versus vengeance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6bsz5CNrgw84xsx0FTnrDt8Yuub.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:253849'),
  ('536883378913065109', 'John Ford: The Man Who Invented America', 2019, 'Documentary, TV Movie', 'Alberto Marquardt, Olivier Raffet, Jean-Christophe Klotz', 'Jean-Christophe Klotz, François Bringer', 'Jean-Christophe Klotz, Joseph McBride, Cécile Gornet, Michel Cieutat, Jennifer Ortiz, Fermin Ortiz, Nancy Schoenberger, Dan Ford', null, 'Over a 50-year career and more than a hundred movies, filmmaker John Ford (1894-1973) forged the legend of the Far West. By giving a face to the underprivileged, from humble cowboys to persecuted minorities, he revealed like no one else the great social divisions that existed and still exist in the United States. More than four decades after his death, what remains of his legacy and humanistic values in the memory of those who love his work?', 'Over a 50-year career and more than a hundred movies, filmmaker John Ford (1894-1973) forged the legend of the Far West. By giving a face to the underprivileged, from humble cowboys to persecuted minorities, he revealed like no one else the great social divisions that existed and still exist in the United States. More than four decades after his death, what remains of his legacy and humanistic values in the memory of those who love his work?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aXbZJTKSPhNZ2Q1ZXy2IGlmitq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:585598'),
  ('1093556757415981892', 'John From', 2016, 'Drama', 'Ricardo Lameiras, Francisco Pinhão Botelho, Andresa Soares', 'Mariana Ricardo, João Nicolau', 'Júlia Palha, Clara Riedenstein, Filipe Vargas, Adriano Luz, Leonor Silveira, João Xavier, Daniel Cotrim, Vasco Pimentel', null, 'Rita is fifteen and spends the summer between warm afternoons of teenage love and party nights with her friend Sara. From Portugal to the South Pacific, the pleasures of this routine will take a turn when the young girl visits the art show of a new neighbor in the local community.', 'Rita is fifteen and spends the summer between warm afternoons of teenage love and party nights with her friend Sara. From Portugal to the South Pacific, the pleasures of this routine will take a turn when the young girl visits the art show of a new neighbor in the local community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mRmYWu9oLzlhn1t4pulsCEEMTyp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:364002'),
  ('548727263142846603', 'John Henry', 2000, 'Animation, Drama, Family', 'Mark Henn', 'Shirley Pierce', 'Alfre Woodard, Tim Hodge, Geoffrey Jones, Dave Murray, Carrie Harrington', 'G', 'The story of the legendary steel-driving folk hero born with a hammer in his hands, who pitted his strength against a mighty railroad-building machine.', 'The story of the legendary steel-driving folk hero born with a hammer in his hands, who pitted his strength against a mighty railroad-building machine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/piq4SfzUDGPCi4viD0lcbtPgulS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:197725'),
  ('874422003685279947', 'John Henry', 2020, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Will Forbes, Isiah Donté Lee', 'Will Forbes, Doug Skinner', 'Terry Crews, Ludacris, Maestro Harrell, Kimberly Hébert Gregory, Ken Foree, Gerald ''Slink'' Johnson, Dohn Norwood, Tyler Alvarez', null, 'Ex-gang member John Henry is a quiet man with a violent past. When two immigrant kids on the run from his former South Los Angeles gang leader stumble into his life, John is forced to reconcile with his past in order to try and give them a future.', 'Ex-gang member John Henry is a quiet man with a violent past. When two immigrant kids on the run from his former South Los Angeles gang leader stumble into his life, John is forced to reconcile with his past in order to try and give them a future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zwtOfT2hUs9TjqOnqj40JyJ71Ke.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:658199'),
  ('995370383695050321', 'John Henry and the Inky-Poo', 1946, 'Animation, Drama', 'George Pal', null, 'Rex Ingram', null, 'In this Puppetoon animated short film (an Academy Award Best Short Subject, Cartoons nominee), legendary American folklore figure John Henry (voice of Rex Ingram) goes to work for the C&O Railroad, which shortly thereafter buys an automatic steel-driving engine, The Inky-Poo. John Henry matches his strength against the engine, saying that any man can beat a machine because a man has a mind. Can he prevail? In 2015 this film, deemed "culturally, historically, or aesthetically significant", was selected for preservation in the United States National Film Registry. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in partnership with UCLA Film & Television Archive in 2009.', 'In this Puppetoon animated short film (an Academy Award Best Short Subject, Cartoons nominee), legendary American folklore figure John Henry (voice of Rex Ingram) goes to work for the C&O Railroad, which shortly thereafter buys an automatic steel-driving engine, The Inky-Poo. John Henry matches his strength against the engine, saying that any man can beat a machine because a man has a mind. Can he prevail? In 2015 this film, deemed "culturally, historically, or aesthetically significant", was selected for preservation in the United States National Film Registry. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in partnership with UCLA Film & Television Archive in 2009.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qAGZlHcV2eTluxJ5R9gUve63Qbh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:237065'),
  ('1112391866186967978', 'John Huston: The Man, the Movies, the Maverick', 1988, 'Documentary', 'Frank Martin, Harry Dawson', 'Charles Degelman, Frank Martin', 'John Huston, Robert Mitchum, Paul Newman, Lauren Bacall, Evelyn Keyes, Arthur Miller, Marietta Tree, Michael Fitzgerald', null, 'Biography of risk-taker and raconteur John Huston from his childhood to become one of the most highly respected filmmakers in the world.', 'Biography of risk-taker and raconteur John Huston from his childhood to become one of the most highly respected filmmakers in the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/znWwKNlmyeRtDC9GXXE2lFcb6aa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:191600'),
  ('25102769858935998', 'John Leguizamo: Freak', 1998, 'Comedy', 'Spike Lee, Malik Hassan Sayeed', 'David Bar Katz, John Leguizamo', 'John Leguizamo', null, 'John Leguizamo''s semi-falsified, one-man stand-up performance as...himself. This is his autobiographical story, about his life growing up, and his journey to try to be accepted by his father. We see this story through a bizarre myriad of characters and situations, which include the eccentric Uncle Sanny, the Fat Boy Called Bitch (John''s little brother, Poochie), his mom, his evil grandmothers, and Lee Stratsberg, not to mention a brief appearance by Cantinflas as God.', 'John Leguizamo''s semi-falsified, one-man stand-up performance as...himself. This is his autobiographical story, about his life growing up, and his journey to try to be accepted by his father. We see this story through a bizarre myriad of characters and situations, which include the eccentric Uncle Sanny, the Fat Boy Called Bitch (John''s little brother, Poochie), his mom, his evil grandmothers, and Lee Stratsberg, not to mention a brief appearance by Cantinflas as God.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vbKc7ykP9Wn8PqQBo6ObT4SzMn1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37407'),
  ('1111036666134499331', 'John McEnroe: In the Realm of Perfection', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Julien Faraut', 'Julien Faraut', 'John McEnroe, Mathieu Amalric, Jacques Pernod, Cédric Quignon-Fleuret, Nicolas Thibault, Serge Daney, Tom Hulce, Gil de Kermadec', null, 'An immersive film essay on tennis legend John McEnroe at the height of his career as the world champion, documenting his strive for perfection, frustrations, and the hardest loss of his career at the 1984 Roland-Garros French Open.', 'An immersive film essay on tennis legend John McEnroe at the height of his career as the world champion, documenting his strive for perfection, frustrations, and the hardest loss of his career at the 1984 Roland-Garros French Open.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ma4pAX8yJTrspQGRVAFyxyVFBoH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:499555'),
  ('1023597544659805439', 'John Mulaney & The Sack Lunch Bunch', 2019, 'Comedy, Family, Music', 'Rhys Thomas, Laura Merians Gonçalves', 'John Mulaney, Marika Sawyer', 'John Mulaney, Jake Gyllenhaal, Annaleigh Ashford, Natasha Lyonne, David Byrne, Richard Kind, André De Shields, Alexander Bello', 'PG', 'John Mulaney and his kid pals tackle existential topics for all ages with catchy songs, comedy sketches and special guests in a nostalgic variety special.', 'John Mulaney and his kid pals tackle existential topics for all ages with catchy songs, comedy sketches and special guests in a nostalgic variety special.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rP8knLNDHN6VlUi89nWuqaWUdoo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:650073'),
