  ('211253451391968435', 'John Mulaney: Kid Gorgeous at Radio City', 2018, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Alex Timbers, Cameron Barnett', 'John Mulaney', 'John Mulaney', null, 'John Mulaney relays stories from his childhood and "SNL," eviscerates the value of college and laments getting older in this electric comedy special.', 'John Mulaney relays stories from his childhood and "SNL," eviscerates the value of college and laments getting older in this electric comedy special.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fERO7sktbElVbGS1SGDKzQJWxtn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:520594'),
