  ('429565253863571760', 'John Tucker Must Die', 2006, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Anthony B. Richmond, Betty Thomas', 'Jeff Lowell', 'Jesse Metcalfe, Brittany Snow, Ashanti, Sophia Bush, Arielle Kebbel, Penn Badgley, Jenny McCarthy, Terrell J. Ramsey', 'PG-13', 'After discovering they are all dating the same same guy, three popular students from different cliques band together for revenge, so they enlist the help of a new gal in town and conspire to break the jerk''s heart, while destroying his reputation.', 'After discovering they are all dating the same same guy, three popular students from different cliques band together for revenge, so they enlist the help of a new gal in town and conspire to break the jerk''s heart, while destroying his reputation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l8B01BFBpIyycO2DopROessWzQU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9293'),
  ('189413559589230525', 'John Was Trying to Contact Aliens', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Matthew Killip', null, 'John Shepherd', null, 'John Shepherd spent 30 years trying to contact extraterrestrials by broadcasting music millions of miles into space. After giving up the search, he makes a different connection here on earth.', 'John Shepherd spent 30 years trying to contact extraterrestrials by broadcasting music millions of miles into space. After giving up the search, he makes a different connection here on earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ofVHqDmJ47si1SHwJaAhx8nkmU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:656353'),
  ('59602508271534401', 'John Wayne - America at All Costs', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Jean-Baptiste Péretié, Arthur Le Ret', null, 'John Wayne, Randy Roberts, Nancy Schoenberger, Phil Caputo', null, 'This is the story of a man who climbed the Hollywood ladder, one rung at a time, until he reached the top and became the most popular American actor of his era.', 'This is the story of a man who climbed the Hollywood ladder, one rung at a time, until he reached the top and became the most popular American actor of his era.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oTwOCKk8sXaJQDNy0uqS1klkBfT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:653831'),
  ('515103666105530522', 'John Wick', 2014, 'Action, Thriller', 'Jonathan Sela, Raul Abrego, Carl Baldasso', 'Derek Kolstad', 'Keanu Reeves, Michael Nyqvist, Alfie Allen, Willem Dafoe, Dean Winters, Adrianne Palicki, Omer Barnea, Toby Leonard Moore', 'R', 'Ex-hitman John Wick comes out of retirement to track down the gangsters that took everything from him.', 'Ex-hitman John Wick comes out of retirement to track down the gangsters that took everything from him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wXqWR7dHncNRbxoEGybEy7QTe9h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:245891'),
  ('67328366702974162', 'John Wick: Chapter 2', 2017, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Darrin Prescott, Chad Stahelski, Robert Mattigetz', 'Derek Kolstad', 'Keanu Reeves, Common, Laurence Fishburne, Riccardo Scamarcio, Ruby Rose, Lance Reddick, Peter Stormare, Bridget Moynahan', 'R', 'John Wick is forced out of retirement by a former associate looking to seize control of a shadowy international assassins’ guild. Bound by a blood oath to aid him, Wick travels to Rome and does battle against some of the world’s most dangerous killers.', 'John Wick is forced out of retirement by a former associate looking to seize control of a shadowy international assassins’ guild. Bound by a blood oath to aid him, Wick travels to Rome and does battle against some of the world’s most dangerous killers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hXWBc0ioZP3cN4zCu6SN3YHXZVO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:324552'),
  ('733928967834020864', 'John Wick: Chapter 3 - Parabellum', 2019, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Chad Stahelski, Ian Bailie, Chris Shriver', 'Chris Collins, Marc Abrams, Derek Kolstad', 'Keanu Reeves, Halle Berry, Ian McShane, Laurence Fishburne, Mark Dacascos, Asia Kate Dillon, Lance Reddick, Anjelica Huston', 'R', 'Super-assassin John Wick returns with a $14 million price tag on his head and an army of bounty-hunting killers on his trail. After killing a member of the shadowy international assassin’s guild, the High Table, John Wick is excommunicado, but the world’s most ruthless hit men and women await his every turn.', 'Super-assassin John Wick returns with a $14 million price tag on his head and an army of bounty-hunting killers on his trail. After killing a member of the shadowy international assassin’s guild, the High Table, John Wick is excommunicado, but the world’s most ruthless hit men and women await his every turn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ziEuG1essDuWuC5lpWUaw1uXY2O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:458156'),
  ('287814331579989377', 'John Wick: Chapter 4', 2023, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Jeremy Marks, Andreas Olshausen, Scott Rogers', 'Shay Hatten, Michael Finch', 'Keanu Reeves, Donnie Yen, Bill Skarsgård, Ian McShane, Laurence Fishburne, Lance Reddick, Clancy Brown, Hiroyuki Sanada', 'R', 'With the price on his head ever increasing, John Wick uncovers a path to defeating The High Table. But before he can earn his freedom, Wick must face off against a new enemy with powerful alliances across the globe and forces that turn old friends into foes.', 'With the price on his head ever increasing, John Wick uncovers a path to defeating The High Table. But before he can earn his freedom, Wick must face off against a new enemy with powerful alliances across the globe and forces that turn old friends into foes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vZloFAK7NmvMGKE7VkF5UHaz0I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:603692'),
  ('101395025377400992', 'Johnnie Waterman', 1994, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jan Jakub Kolski, Piotr Lenar', 'Jan Jakub Kolski', 'Franciszek Pieczka, Bogusław Linda, Grażyna Błęcka-Kolska, Katarzyna Aleksandrowicz, Olgierd Łukaszewicz', null, 'On the road wandering minstrel finds a mare, which, upholstered and sickly, is dying. He buries mare and casts a curse in the village where the animal was tortured. In the village lives Jańcio, a philosopher, a man loving life and his young wife, Weronka. Jańcio lives in harmony with God and is not expecting that he will be put to the test by him. He is convinced he has the power to make miracles. He leaves his pregnant wife, and goes to see the world, promising to return before the due date.', 'On the road wandering minstrel finds a mare, which, upholstered and sickly, is dying. He buries mare and casts a curse in the village where the animal was tortured. In the village lives Jańcio, a philosopher, a man loving life and his young wife, Weronka. Jańcio lives in harmony with God and is not expecting that he will be put to the test by him. He is convinced he has the power to make miracles. He leaves his pregnant wife, and goes to see the world, promising to return before the due date.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fEM963zFGTB6zrDOcWPzckDlg2Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:262001'),
  ('945245148434695881', 'Johnny', 1980, 'Drama, Action, Romance', 'Ashok Kumar Agarwal, J. Mahendran', 'J. Mahendran', 'Rajinikanth, Sridevi, Unni Mary, K. Balaji, Suruli Rajan, Samikannu, Prabhakar Reddy, V. Gopalakrishnan', null, 'Johnny loves Archana, a popular singer, but their lives are disrupted when Johnny''s lookalike kills his lover and tries to pin the blame on Johnny.', 'Johnny loves Archana, a popular singer, but their lives are disrupted when Johnny''s lookalike kills his lover and tries to pin the blame on Johnny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sIGz4Q4uy1Df0selWsYVWZC1L60.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:331546'),
  ('47726457772637301', 'Johnny', 2022, 'Drama', 'Daniel Jaroszek, Michał Dąbal, Marcin Kasiński', 'Maciej Kraszewski', 'Dawid Ogrodnik, Piotr Trojan, Beata Zygarlicka, Grażyna Bułka, Maria Pakulnis, Joachim Lamża, Marta Stalmierska, Jakub Nosiadek', null, 'After a court order sends him to work at a hospice, an ex-criminal strikes up a friendship with a compassionate priest who changes his life.', 'After a court order sends him to work at a hospice, an ex-criminal strikes up a friendship with a compassionate priest who changes his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6UoWEfDbLm8q9VtrnLRp0ORzbNd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:920220'),
  ('295686624563640108', 'Johnny & Clyde', 2023, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Tom DeNucci, Amy Lippens, Glenn Ciano', 'Nick Principe, Tom DeNucci', 'Avan Jogia, Ajani Russell, Megan Fox, Tyson Ritter, Vanessa Angel, Sydney Jenkins, Armen Garo, Bai Ling', 'R', 'Johnny and Clyde are two serial killers who are madly in love and on an endless crime spree. Alana (Megan Fox) is the confident and cunning owner of a prosperous casino that generates tens of millions of dollars each year. Johnny and Clyde decide to assemble a ragtag group of criminals and misfits to steal from Alana''s casino and pull off the heist of the century. Unfortunately for Johnny and Clyde''s crew, Alana has a deadly weapon at her disposal – the monstrous slasher spirit known as Bakwas.', 'Johnny and Clyde are two serial killers who are madly in love and on an endless crime spree. Alana (Megan Fox) is the confident and cunning owner of a prosperous casino that generates tens of millions of dollars each year. Johnny and Clyde decide to assemble a ragtag group of criminals and misfits to steal from Alana''s casino and pull off the heist of the century. Unfortunately for Johnny and Clyde''s crew, Alana has a deadly weapon at her disposal – the monstrous slasher spirit known as Bakwas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cdfdR90WYCTQmYoQ0aDRZP8I2IL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:857553'),
  ('874744928079180166', 'Johnny 2.0', 1998, 'Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Neill Fearnley, Manfred Guthe', 'Wynne McLaughlin', 'Jeff Fahey, Tahnee Welch, Michael Ironside, John Neville, Von Flores, Michael Rhoades, Martin Roach, Cliff Saunders', 'NR', 'Awakening from a 15-year coma, scientist Johnny Dalton discovers that his life has been illusory and that he is merely a clone of the real Dr. Dalton. With the help of rebel leader Nikki Holland, Dalton sets out to find his maker in a futuristic society fraught with danger and secrecy.', 'Awakening from a 15-year coma, scientist Johnny Dalton discovers that his life has been illusory and that he is merely a clone of the real Dr. Dalton. With the help of rebel leader Nikki Holland, Dalton sets out to find his maker in a futuristic society fraught with danger and secrecy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l58zeSL0y8XdPIWSYUtDAaIENqo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76287'),
  ('176800404243759248', 'Johnny 316', 1998, 'Drama, Romance', 'Erick Ifergan, Toby Irwin, Vincent Jerome', 'K.A. Rivers', 'Vincent Gallo, Nina Brosh, Melissa van der Schyff, Seymour Cassel, Louise Fletcher, Francis Milton, Eyal Doron, Gregory Sierra', 'NR', 'A preacher without resources spends his days reciting Bible verses. One day he meets a young jobless girl who wanders on Hollywood Boulevard. An impossible love story begins.', 'A preacher without resources spends his days reciting Bible verses. One day he meets a young jobless girl who wanders on Hollywood Boulevard. An impossible love story begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3yknIqlAb38JbeaBn4eBtT2D5mj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:205107'),
  ('678577871328857678', 'Johnny Allegro', 1949, 'Crime, Drama', 'Ted Tetzlaff, Joseph F. Biroc, Earl Bellamy', 'Guy Endore, Karen DeWolf', 'George Raft, Nina Foch, George Macready, Will Geer, Gloria Henry, Ivan Triesault, Harry Antrim, William Phillips', 'NR', 'Treasury Department officials recruit a florist (Raft) to lead them to a wanted criminal (Macready); but once he gets too close, he finds he''s the hunted.', 'Treasury Department officials recruit a florist (Raft) to lead them to a wanted criminal (Macready); but once he gets too close, he finds he''s the hunted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8yA6QUdAFH2oAKbGWl5J7c524Yn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44669'),
  ('357895274147346205', 'Johnny Angel', 1945, 'Crime, Drama', 'Edwin L. Marin, Harry J. Wild, Sam Ruman', 'Steve Fisher', 'George Raft, Claire Trevor, Signe Hasso, Lowell Gilmore, Hoagy Carmichael, Marvin Miller, Margaret Wycherly, J. Farrell MacDonald', 'NR', 'George Raft plays a sailor who sets out to solve his father''s mysterious death.', 'George Raft plays a sailor who sets out to solve his father''s mysterious death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/asBgX6c8kNas1O0WbfoCRUPc1mp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42191'),
  ('468669437962667585', 'Johnny Apollo', 1940, 'Drama, Crime, Romance', 'Arthur C. Miller, Henry Hathaway', 'Philip Dunne, Rowland Brown', 'Tyrone Power, Dorothy Lamour, Edward Arnold, Lloyd Nolan, Charley Grapewin, Lionel Atwill, Marc Lawrence, Jonathan Hale', 'NR', 'Wall Street broker Robert Cain, Sr., is jailed for embezzling. His college graduate son Bob then turns to crime to raise money for his father''s release. As assistant to mobster Mickey Dwyer, then falls for Dwyer''s girl Lucky. He winds up in the same prison as his father.', 'Wall Street broker Robert Cain, Sr., is jailed for embezzling. His college graduate son Bob then turns to crime to raise money for his father''s release. As assistant to mobster Mickey Dwyer, then falls for Dwyer''s girl Lucky. He winds up in the same prison as his father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hYmGde6YNfJAYpG91kJu6dVKjuU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66707'),
  ('494291149882894960', 'Johnny Be Good', 1988, 'Comedy', 'Bud S. Smith, Robert D. Yeoman', 'David Obst, Jeff Buhai, Steve Zacharias', 'Anthony Michael Hall, Robert Downey Jr., Uma Thurman, Paul Gleason, Steve James, Jennifer Tilly, Seymour Cassel, Marshall Bell', 'R', 'It''s recruiting time and despite being short and scrawny, Johnny Walker is America''s hottest young football prospect. His dilemma: should he take one of the many offers from college talent scouts or should he attend the local state college with his girlfriend and give up his football career?', 'It''s recruiting time and despite being short and scrawny, Johnny Walker is America''s hottest young football prospect. His dilemma: should he take one of the many offers from college talent scouts or should he attend the local state college with his girlfriend and give up his football career?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xYHplg2N28n4z4WW0VeoZMRI58X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20443'),
  ('381673595483795821', 'Johnny Belinda', 1948, 'Drama', 'Jean Negulesco, Ted D. McCord', 'Allen Vincent, Irma von Cube', 'Jane Wyman, Lew Ayres, Charles Bickford, Agnes Moorehead, Stephen McNally, Jan Sterling, Rosalind Ivan, Dan Seymour', 'NR', 'A small-town doctor helps a deaf-mute farm girl learn to communicate.', 'A small-town doctor helps a deaf-mute farm girl learn to communicate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lIkYFx7ZaU56iG507lgLoSh1GNR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62000'),
  ('665691418315314184', 'Johnny Come Lately', 1943, 'Drama', 'William K. Howard, Lowell J. Farrell, Leigh Harline', 'John Van Druten', 'James Cagney, Grace George, Marjorie Main, Marjorie Lord, Hattie McDaniel, Edward McNamara, William Henry, Robert Barrat', 'NR', 'Cagney is a human dynamo as a drifter who helps save ailing Grace George from losing her newspaper. The pace is fast, and audiences of all ages will be pleased. The supporting cast, have all the small-town characterizations down pat -- with Margaret Hamilton a standout. Cagney himself, had genuine affection for this film, and listed it among his top five movie-making experiences at a retrospective the year before he died. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive, in partnership with the UCLA Film & Television Archive, in 2013.', 'Cagney is a human dynamo as a drifter who helps save ailing Grace George from losing her newspaper. The pace is fast, and audiences of all ages will be pleased. The supporting cast, have all the small-town characterizations down pat -- with Margaret Hamilton a standout. Cagney himself, had genuine affection for this film, and listed it among his top five movie-making experiences at a retrospective the year before he died. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive, in partnership with the UCLA Film & Television Archive, in 2013.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Cso3GYcNt1zyXsFdA1jaFhWwjK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114186'),
  ('580012617359424389', 'Johnny Cool', 1963, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'William Asher, Sam Leavitt', 'Joseph Landon', 'Henry Silva, Elizabeth Montgomery, Richard Anderson, Jim Backus, Joey Bishop, Brad Dexter, Wanda Hendrix, Hank Henry', 'NR', 'A deported gangster trains an Italian convict to take over his operations in the U.S.', 'A deported gangster trains an Italian convict to take over his operations in the U.S.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q9xo7i31O5KbUUPBR96YPj1u9WO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72901'),
  ('1142688325597676058', 'Johnny Corncob', 1973, 'Adventure, Animation, Fantasy', 'Marcell Jankovics, István Vajda, Emőke Marsovszky', 'Péter Szoboszlay, Tamás Sipos, Marcell Jankovics', 'György Cserhalmi, Anikó Nagy, Erzsi Pártos, Antal Farkas, Gábor Mádi Szabó, György Bárdy, János Körmendi, Erzsébet Kútvölgyi', null, 'A traditional Hungarian poetic fairytale that describes the epic adventures of a young shepherd through love, war, magic and death.', 'A traditional Hungarian poetic fairytale that describes the epic adventures of a young shepherd through love, war, magic and death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pcmz6fSbu1w05JwzLuHuqVW8wn5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41078'),
  ('37412821376704100', 'Johnny Dangerously', 1984, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Amy Heckerling, David M. Walsh', 'Harry Colomby, Jeff Harris, Norman Steinberg', 'Michael Keaton, Joe Piscopo, Marilu Henner, Maureen Stapleton, Peter Boyle, Griffin Dunne, Glynnis O''Connor, Dom DeLuise', 'PG-13', 'An honest, goodhearted man is forced to turn to a life of crime to finance his neurotic mother''s skyrocketing medical bills.', 'An honest, goodhearted man is forced to turn to a life of crime to finance his neurotic mother''s skyrocketing medical bills.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1cvCWlLDt9cIWN3ZUI6UKgV210x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16806'),
  ('218865118387436250', 'Johnny Depp: The Love of the Bizarre', 2023, 'Documentary, TV Movie', 'Régis Brochier', null, null, null, 'Johnny Depp started off as a punk band guitarist, turning to acting to help pay the bills. But his dabbling catapulted him to global fame and there was no going back. Throughout his career, Depp has had fame and infamy in equal measure. His roles are often that of the isolated anti-hero: Edward Scissorhands, Donnie Brasco, Raoul Duke in Las Vegas Parano, and Captain Jack Sparrow in Pirates of the Caribbean. His poetic outsider characters reveal a critical view of American society.', 'Johnny Depp started off as a punk band guitarist, turning to acting to help pay the bills. But his dabbling catapulted him to global fame and there was no going back. Throughout his career, Depp has had fame and infamy in equal measure. His roles are often that of the isolated anti-hero: Edward Scissorhands, Donnie Brasco, Raoul Duke in Las Vegas Parano, and Captain Jack Sparrow in Pirates of the Caribbean. His poetic outsider characters reveal a critical view of American society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uU8KgJcbyvPJJKIpK4lkD7R59we.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:930333'),
  ('855463391655539987', 'Johnny Eager', 1941, 'Crime, Drama', 'Harold Rosson, Mervyn LeRoy, Al Shenberg', 'John Lee Mahin, James Edward Grant', 'Robert Taylor, Lana Turner, Edward Arnold, Van Heflin, Robert Sterling, Patricia Dane, Glenda Farrell, Henry O''Neill', 'NR', 'A charming racketeer seduces the DA''s stepdaughter for revenge, then falls in love.', 'A charming racketeer seduces the DA''s stepdaughter for revenge, then falls in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eT56vNkYEHo1rv4xhtI3aJLKuUp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41495'),
  ('465705881146104518', 'Johnny English', 2003, 'Adventure, Action, Comedy', 'Remi Adefarasin, John Frankish, Peter Howitt', 'Neal Purvis, Robert Wade, William Davies', 'Rowan Atkinson, Natalie Imbruglia, Ben Miller, John Malkovich, Greg Wise, Tasha de Vasconcelos, Douglas McFerran, Steve Nicolson', 'PG', 'A lowly pencil pusher working for MI7, Johnny English is suddenly promoted to super spy after Agent One is assassinated and every other agent is blown up at his funeral. When a billionaire entrepreneur sponsors the exhibition of the Crown Jewels—and the valuable gems disappear on the opening night and on English''s watch—the newly-designated agent must jump into action to find the thief and recover the missing gems.', 'A lowly pencil pusher working for MI7, Johnny English is suddenly promoted to super spy after Agent One is assassinated and every other agent is blown up at his funeral. When a billionaire entrepreneur sponsors the exhibition of the Crown Jewels—and the valuable gems disappear on the opening night and on English''s watch—the newly-designated agent must jump into action to find the thief and recover the missing gems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mmzW88tnkB2MnOV3Un2F9IUxSnZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9486'),
  ('977030250935615579', 'Johnny English Reborn', 2011, 'Crime, Action, Comedy', 'Oliver Parker, Jeremy Braben, Steven Desbrow', 'William Davies', 'Rowan Atkinson, Gillian Anderson, Dominic West, Rosamund Pike, Daniel Kaluuya, Tim McInnerny, Richard Schiff, Burn Gorman', 'PG', 'The most prominent heads of state in the world begin gathering for a conference that could have a major impact on global politics. When MI-7 receives word that the Chinese premier has become the target of some high-powered killers, it falls on Johnny English to save the day. Armed with the latest high-tech weaponry and gadgets that would make even James Bond jealous, the once-disgraced agent uncovers evidence of a massive conspiracy involving some of the world''s most powerful organisations, and vows to redeem his tarnished reputation by stopping the killers before they can strike.', 'The most prominent heads of state in the world begin gathering for a conference that could have a major impact on global politics. When MI-7 receives word that the Chinese premier has become the target of some high-powered killers, it falls on Johnny English to save the day. Armed with the latest high-tech weaponry and gadgets that would make even James Bond jealous, the once-disgraced agent uncovers evidence of a massive conspiracy involving some of the world''s most powerful organisations, and vows to redeem his tarnished reputation by stopping the killers before they can strike.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zDbrU0eSnRGh5gHc1iqTACTNNyT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58233'),
  ('33859480083934951', 'Johnny English Strikes Again', 2018, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'David Kerr, Gregory Fangeaux, Florian Hoffmeister', 'William Davies', 'Rowan Atkinson, Olga Kurylenko, Ben Miller, Emma Thompson, Jake Lacy, Adam James, Charles Dance, Michael Gambon', 'PG', 'Disaster strikes when a criminal mastermind reveals the identities of all active undercover agents in Britain. The secret service can now rely on only one man - Johnny English. Currently teaching at a minor prep school, Johnny springs back into action to find the mysterious hacker. For this mission to succeed, he’ll need all of his skills - what few he has - as the man with yesterday’s analogue methods faces off against tomorrow’s digital technology.', 'Disaster strikes when a criminal mastermind reveals the identities of all active undercover agents in Britain. The secret service can now rely on only one man - Johnny English. Currently teaching at a minor prep school, Johnny springs back into action to find the mysterious hacker. For this mission to succeed, he’ll need all of his skills - what few he has - as the man with yesterday’s analogue methods faces off against tomorrow’s digital technology.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tCBxnZwLiY1BOKw3tH6AxHZdqPh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:463272'),
  ('623752397868719569', 'Johnny Express', 2014, 'Animation, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Woo Kyung-min', 'Woo Kyung-min, Jisang Kim', null, null, 'In the year 2150, Johnny, a lazy Space Delivery Man, must deliver a package on a planet he does not fully understand.', 'In the year 2150, Johnny, a lazy Space Delivery Man, must deliver a package on a planet he does not fully understand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5eHUeluD8dKncrT6nEOuRUhFUAH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:269711'),
  ('672659303596500326', 'Johnny Frank Garrett''s Last Word', 2016, 'Horror', 'Simon Rumley, Milton Kam', 'Marc Haimes, Ben Ketai', 'Sean Patrick Flanery, Erin Cummings, Mike Doyle, Cassie Shea Watson, Jon Michael Davis, Devin Bonnée, Jon Arthur, Dodge Prince', null, 'When a young man is executed for committing murder, he leaves behind a curse letter, promising vengeance for all those connected to his unfair trial.', 'When a young man is executed for committing murder, he leaves behind a curse letter, promising vengeance for all those connected to his unfair trial.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l2ggnCpQwfnNKe5PVp3ENp0H6Jm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:310043'),
  ('471396282152129365', 'Johnny Gaddaar', 2007, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Sriram Raghavan, C.K. Muraleedharan, Aditya Uppoor', 'Sriram Raghavan', 'Neil Nitin Mukesh, Dharmendra, Zakir Hussain, Vinay Pathak, Dayanand Shetty, Govind Namdeo, Rimi Sen, Ashwini Kalsekar', null, 'Five men get involved in a drug deal set up by a corrupt police officer, but the plan goes awry when the youngest member decides to steal the money.', 'Five men get involved in a drug deal set up by a corrupt police officer, but the plan goes awry when the youngest member decides to steal the money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jWpo1qCIefGxJjQOURu2IfQgQK4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20129'),
  ('1060245233876964145', 'Johnny Got His Gun', 1971, 'War, Drama', 'Dalton Trumbo, Jules Brenner, Christopher Trumbo', 'Luis Buñuel', 'Timothy Bottoms, Kathy Fields, Marsha Hunt, Jason Robards, Donald Sutherland, Charles McGraw, Sandy Brown Wyeth, Don ''Red'' Barry', 'PG', 'A young American soldier, rendered in pseudocoma from an artillery shell from WWI, recalls his life leading up to that point.', 'A young American soldier, rendered in pseudocoma from an artillery shell from WWI, recalls his life leading up to that point.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ryIY3FPmTtXu9g6W4I69qCdkxKj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16328'),
  ('950393475517540162', 'Johnny Guitar', 1954, 'Western, Drama, Romance', 'Nicholas Ray, Harry Stradling Sr., Herbert E. Mendelson', 'Nicholas Ray, Ben Maddow', 'Joan Crawford, Sterling Hayden, Mercedes McCambridge, Scott Brady, Ward Bond, Ben Cooper, Ernest Borgnine, John Carradine', 'NR', 'On the outskirts of town, the hard-nosed Vienna owns a saloon frequented by the undesirables of the region, including Dancin'' Kid and his gang. Another patron of Vienna''s establishment is Johnny Guitar, a former gunslinger and her lover. When a heist is pulled in town that results in a man''s death, Emma Small, Vienna''s rival, rallies the townsfolk to take revenge on Vienna''s saloon – even without proof of her wrongdoing.', 'On the outskirts of town, the hard-nosed Vienna owns a saloon frequented by the undesirables of the region, including Dancin'' Kid and his gang. Another patron of Vienna''s establishment is Johnny Guitar, a former gunslinger and her lover. When a heist is pulled in town that results in a man''s death, Emma Small, Vienna''s rival, rallies the townsfolk to take revenge on Vienna''s saloon – even without proof of her wrongdoing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bap37yOCwcR9x4YDsNUaSo9nIp9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26596'),
  ('313700672307853368', 'Johnny Hamlet', 1968, 'Western', 'Enzo G. Castellari, Angelo Filippini, Carlo Moscovini', 'Tito Carpi, Francesco Scardamaglia, Enzo G. Castellari', 'Andrea Giordana, Gilbert Roland, Horst Frank, Ennio Girolami, Ignazio Spalla, Françoise Prévost, Stefania Careddu, Manuel Serrano', null, 'On his way back from the Civil War, Johnny Hamilton is visited in his sleep by the ghost of his father who lets him know that he has been murdered and who asks him to avenge him. Back in the family ranch, Johnny finds that not only has his father been killed but that Gertrude, his mother, has married her late husband''s brother Claude. The latter is now the owner of the ranch and of all the properties of the deceased. Polonius, a ruthless bandit, is supposed to have killed Johnny''s father. But couldn''t it be Claude...?', 'On his way back from the Civil War, Johnny Hamilton is visited in his sleep by the ghost of his father who lets him know that he has been murdered and who asks him to avenge him. Back in the family ranch, Johnny finds that not only has his father been killed but that Gertrude, his mother, has married her late husband''s brother Claude. The latter is now the owner of the ranch and of all the properties of the deceased. Polonius, a ruthless bandit, is supposed to have killed Johnny''s father. But couldn''t it be Claude...?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9wseJlHIZfe2NjK1njPj798rCEz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73740'),
  ('1100753394381425111', 'Johnny Handsome', 1989, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Matthew F. Leonetti, Walter Hill, Allan Graf', 'Ken Friedman', 'Mickey Rourke, Ellen Barkin, Morgan Freeman, Forest Whitaker, Elizabeth McGovern, Lance Henriksen, Scott Wilson, David Schramm', 'R', 'A career criminal who has been deformed since birth is given a new face by a kindly doctor and paroled from prison. It appears that he has gone straight, but he is really planning his revenge on the man who killed his mentor and sent him to prison.', 'A career criminal who has been deformed since birth is given a new face by a kindly doctor and paroled from prison. It appears that he has gone straight, but he is really planning his revenge on the man who killed his mentor and sent him to prison.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/delteT6vYAGIKiGrRatxQJI1U5a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:505'),
  ('79088335012233783', 'Johnny Kapahala: Back on Board', 2007, 'Family, Comedy, Drama, TV Movie', 'Eric Bross', 'Ann Austen, Douglas Sloan, Annie DeYoung', 'Brandon Baker, Cary-Hiroyuki Tagawa, Jake T. Austin, Robyn Lively, Mary Page Keller, Yuji Okumoto, Rose McIver, Jonathan McDaniel', null, 'Johnny Kapahala, a teen snowboarding champion from Vermont, returns to Oahu, Hawaii, for the wedding of his hero -- his grandfather, local surf legend Johnny Tsunami -- and to catch a few famous Kauai waves. When Johnny arrives, he meets his new family including "Uncle Chris" (the 12-year-old son of his new step-grandmother) who resents the upcoming marriage. Chris''s only interest is to join a mountain boarding crew led by a teenage bully. When Johnny''s grandfather and his new wife open a surf shop that also caters to mountain boarders, they are soon embroiled in a turf war with a rival shop owner who wants to shut their business down.', 'Johnny Kapahala, a teen snowboarding champion from Vermont, returns to Oahu, Hawaii, for the wedding of his hero -- his grandfather, local surf legend Johnny Tsunami -- and to catch a few famous Kauai waves. When Johnny arrives, he meets his new family including "Uncle Chris" (the 12-year-old son of his new step-grandmother) who resents the upcoming marriage. Chris''s only interest is to join a mountain boarding crew led by a teenage bully. When Johnny''s grandfather and his new wife open a surf shop that also caters to mountain boarders, they are soon embroiled in a turf war with a rival shop owner who wants to shut their business down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nYSEqCT49HsxOs8MVXRnOHxfgFx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62527'),
  ('371693090062383530', 'Johnny Keep Walking!', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Dong Runnian, Xie Zhengyu', 'Dong Runnian', 'Dong Chengpeng, White-K, Sabrina Zhuang, Wang Xun, Sun Yizhou, Li Naiwen, Ouyang Fenqiang, Li Fei', null, 'A simple technician at a rural factory is mistakenly promoted to a high-level managerial position at corporate headquarters due to a series of clerical errors and a bribery scheme gone wrong.', 'A simple technician at a rural factory is mistakenly promoted to a high-level managerial position at corporate headquarters due to a series of clerical errors and a bribery scheme gone wrong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8055dyA5XJbEcN9JjECZ1WsR62o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1173076'),
  ('508360054246171865', 'Johnny Larsen', 1979, 'Romance, Drama', 'Morten Arnfred', 'Morten Arnfred, John Nehm', 'Allan Olsen, Aksel Erhardtsen, Jannie Faurschou, Anne Marie Helger, Frits Helmuth, Hanne Ribens, Karl Stegger, Berthe Qvistgaard', null, 'From a working class coming-of-age novel, Morten Arnfred fashioned his feature film to recapture the feel, the sting, the pain, but also the spirit of solidarity of the 1950s in the metropolitan city of Copenhagen: at the center, young Johnny, helpless, hapless, happy, unhappy, going through the motions of growing up. Bodil awards: Best Film and Best Actor (Allan Olsen).', 'From a working class coming-of-age novel, Morten Arnfred fashioned his feature film to recapture the feel, the sting, the pain, but also the spirit of solidarity of the 1950s in the metropolitan city of Copenhagen: at the center, young Johnny, helpless, hapless, happy, unhappy, going through the motions of growing up. Bodil awards: Best Film and Best Actor (Allan Olsen).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j0M9eFvTTW4bqDPMCPpGK4dx2iV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33348'),
  ('966979475625781234', 'Johnny Mad Dog', 2008, 'Drama, History, War', 'Jean-Stéphane Sauvaire', 'Jean-Stéphane Sauvaire', 'Christopher Minie, Daisy Victoria Vandy, Dagbeh Tweh, Barry Chernoh, Cornelius Keagon', null, 'A cast of unknown performers are used in this drama about child soldiers fighting a war in an unnamed African country.', 'A cast of unknown performers are used in this drama about child soldiers fighting a war in an unnamed African country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7YspfHUzOSpqdEiGJIR9P6ab0g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8929'),
  ('256852304646102466', 'Johnny Mnemonic', 1995, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 'François Protat, Robert Longo, Kim Karon', 'William Gibson', 'Keanu Reeves, Dina Meyer, Takeshi Kitano, Ice-T, Dolph Lundgren, Denis Akiyama, Henry Rollins, Barbara Sukowa', 'R', 'In a dystopian 2021, Johnny is a data trafficker who has an implant that allows him to securely store data too sensitive for regular computer networks. On one delivery run, he accepts a package that not only exceeds the implant''s safety limits—and will kill him if the data is not removed in time—but also contains information far more important and valuable than he had ever imagined. On a race against time, he must avoid the assassins sent to kill him and remove the data before it, too, ends his life.', 'In a dystopian 2021, Johnny is a data trafficker who has an implant that allows him to securely store data too sensitive for regular computer networks. On one delivery run, he accepts a package that not only exceeds the implant''s safety limits—and will kill him if the data is not removed in time—but also contains information far more important and valuable than he had ever imagined. On a race against time, he must avoid the assassins sent to kill him and remove the data before it, too, ends his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iH8Jgi8qvb7pnBfI8fVGaUbyRna.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9886'),
  ('273236066369508136', 'Johnny Nobody', 1961, 'Crime, Mystery', 'Nigel Patrick, Ted Moore, Ted Sturgis', 'Albert Z. Carr, Patrick Kirwan', 'Nigel Patrick, Yvonne Mitchell, William Bendix, Aldo Ray, Cyril Cusack, Bernie Winters, Niall MacGinnis, Noel Purcell', 'NR', 'When the atheistic ranting of Irish-American author James Mulcahy upsets the inhabitants of the Irish village to which he has retired, a mob threatens him. But moments after he has dared God to strike him dead, a stranger appears and does so. The man, dubbed "Johnny Nobody" by the press, claims no knowledge of Mulcahy or even of himself. He asks the help of the village priest, Father Carey, in his upcoming trial for Mulcahy''s murder. While the amnesiac Johnny goes to trial, Father Carey mulls questions of belief raised by the case. And then, the good father learns a little more about Johnny Nobody...', 'When the atheistic ranting of Irish-American author James Mulcahy upsets the inhabitants of the Irish village to which he has retired, a mob threatens him. But moments after he has dared God to strike him dead, a stranger appears and does so. The man, dubbed "Johnny Nobody" by the press, claims no knowledge of Mulcahy or even of himself. He asks the help of the village priest, Father Carey, in his upcoming trial for Mulcahy''s murder. While the amnesiac Johnny goes to trial, Father Carey mulls questions of belief raised by the case. And then, the good father learns a little more about Johnny Nobody...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h55gMulGNplTxMOTfVIiJeG4h7d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:424290'),
  ('50861018159382186', 'Johnny O''Clock', 1947, 'Crime, Drama', 'Robert Rossen, Burnett Guffey, Carl Hiecke', 'Robert Rossen', 'Dick Powell, Evelyn Keyes, Lee J. Cobb, Ellen Drew, Nina Foch, Thomas Gomez, John Kellogg, Jim Bannon', 'NR', 'When an employee at an illegal gambling den dies suspiciously, her sister, Nancy, looks into the situation and falls for Johnny O''Clock, a suave partner in the underground casino. Selfish and non-committal by nature, Johnny slowly begins to return Nancy''s affection and decides to run away with her, but conflict within his business threatens their plans. As Johnny tries to distance himself from the casino, his shady past comes back to haunt him.', 'When an employee at an illegal gambling den dies suspiciously, her sister, Nancy, looks into the situation and falls for Johnny O''Clock, a suave partner in the underground casino. Selfish and non-committal by nature, Johnny slowly begins to return Nancy''s affection and decides to run away with her, but conflict within his business threatens their plans. As Johnny tries to distance himself from the casino, his shady past comes back to haunt him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9lT7qfwSKI30rnp108uA75txQUj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19335'),
  ('114707834035468017', 'Johnny One Hundred Pesos', 1993, 'Drama, Crime', 'Gustavo Graef-Marino, José Luis Arredondo, Patricia Navarrete', 'Gustavo Graef-Marino, Gerardo Cáceres', 'Armando Araiza, Patricia Rivera, Willy Semler, Aldo Parodi, Rodolfo Bravo, Sergio Hernández, Luis Gnecco, Boris Quercia', 'PG-13', 'Based on real events, 17-year-old Johnny García becomes involved with four older thugs who are planning to rob a money-laundering business masquerading as a video store. As they try to escape, a swarm of exploitative media attention awaits.', 'Based on real events, 17-year-old Johnny García becomes involved with four older thugs who are planning to rob a money-laundering business masquerading as a video store. As they try to escape, a swarm of exploitative media attention awaits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nLvLJ0HmRvhQtJ2MD7Edjew2Pcf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49688'),
  ('767919175127091524', 'Johnny Reno', 1966, 'Action, Western', 'R.G. Springsteen, Harold E. Stine, James A. Rosenberger', 'Steve Fisher', 'Dana Andrews, Jane Russell, Lon Chaney Jr., John Agar, Lyle Bettger, Tom Drake, Richard Arlen, Robert Lowery', 'NR', 'The townsfolk are set on lynching an accused killer held in the town lockup. But US Marshal Johnny Reno stands in their way.', 'The townsfolk are set on lynching an accused killer held in the town lockup. But US Marshal Johnny Reno stands in their way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9zgdHAKGOZoorJOEtRsAxQLwwz9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102288'),
  ('238889155962991687', 'Johnny Skidmarks', 1998, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Timothy Bird, Melissa V. Barnes, Athena Alexander', 'William Preston Robertson, John Raffo', 'Peter Gallagher, Frances McDormand, John Lithgow, John Kapelos, Jack Black, Charlie Spradling, Michael D. Weatherred, Lee Arenberg', 'R', 'Johnny Scardino is working for blackmailers, photographing wealthy guys in seedy motels. One such assignment turns the wrong way and blackmailers die one by one. Is Johnny the next on the list?', 'Johnny Scardino is working for blackmailers, photographing wealthy guys in seedy motels. One such assignment turns the wrong way and blackmailers die one by one. Is Johnny the next on the list?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f7q1Cpc6cyjgGFhhPehAWY25VgD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68744'),
  ('66918915270824730', 'Johnny Stecchino', 1991, 'Comedy', 'Roberto Benigni, Giuseppe Lanci, Gianni Arduini', 'Roberto Benigni, Vincenzo Cerami', 'Roberto Benigni, Nicoletta Braschi, Paolo Bonacelli, Franco Volpi, Ivano Marescotti, Turi Scalia, Loredana Romito, Alessandro De Santis', null, 'Good hearted but not very wordly-wise, Dante is happy driving the school bus for a group of mentally handicapped children, while feeling he is somehow missing out on life and love. So he is very excited when after nearly being knocked down by her car he meets Maria, who seems immediately enamoured of him. He is soon invited to her sumptuous Palermo villa, little suspecting that this is part of a plot. He bears an amazing likeness to Maria''s stool-pigeon gangster husband and it would be convenient for them if the mobster, in the shape of Dante, was seen to be dead and buried.', 'Good hearted but not very wordly-wise, Dante is happy driving the school bus for a group of mentally handicapped children, while feeling he is somehow missing out on life and love. So he is very excited when after nearly being knocked down by her car he meets Maria, who seems immediately enamoured of him. He is soon invited to her sumptuous Palermo villa, little suspecting that this is part of a plot. He bears an amazing likeness to Maria''s stool-pigeon gangster husband and it would be convenient for them if the mobster, in the shape of Dante, was seen to be dead and buried.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5scWsRsH5MUJEgXB52w0fM6I2gM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12776'),
  ('486292281358064849', 'Johnny Stool Pigeon', 1949, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Maury Gertsman, William Castle, Gordon McLean', 'Robert L. Richards', 'Howard Duff, Shelley Winters, Dan Duryea, Tony Curtis, John McIntire, Gar Moore, Leif Erickson, Barry Kelley', 'NR', 'A federal agent infiltrates a crime syndicate.', 'A federal agent infiltrates a crime syndicate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cphh3s2kMCcYFWGgNOvFunwwNck.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70151'),
  ('878111445227135004', 'Johnny Suede', 1991, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Tom DiCillo, Joe DeSalvo', 'Tom DiCillo', 'Brad Pitt, Catherine Keener, Calvin Levels, Alison Moir, Nick Cave, Peter McRobbie, Ashley Gardner, Dennis Parlato', 'R', 'Johnny Suede (Brad Pitt) longs to be a teen-age idol like Ricky Nelson. He has a pair of black suede shoes, an impressive pompadour, a guitar, and some pals who will play backup for him. Yet he doesn''t have much talent or drive.', 'Johnny Suede (Brad Pitt) longs to be a teen-age idol like Ricky Nelson. He has a pair of black suede shoes, an impressive pompadour, a guitar, and some pals who will play backup for him. Yet he doesn''t have much talent or drive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x1ZvgHwDUFsgqWhYUEcJcyHmZQW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45145'),
  ('77130202778159653', 'Johnny the Partisan', 2000, 'Drama, War', 'Guido Chiesa, Gherardo Gossi, Fabrizio Bava', 'Antonio Leotti, Guido Chiesa', 'Stefano Dionisi, Gabriele Montanari, Toni Bertorelli, Lina Bernardi, Fabrizio Gifuni, Stefano Scherini, Maximilian Nisi, Flavio Bonacci', null, 'After the 8th September 1943 north of Italy is occupied by Germans. Italian army collapsed and the soldiers are escaped to the mountains trying to set up a resistance. Many civilians did the same and Johnny, an English literature student, is among them. Johnny avoids to band together the red partisans (communists) and tries to be part of the azure bands (former regular soldiers). But in both cases he is deluded by the partisan bands and discovers that the partisan war is less poetic and genuine that he thought. At one point anyway the partisans free Alba from Germans. When the city falls again in German hands Johnny escape with Ettore and Pierre. But, one after another, German army and Italian fascists captures the partisans and Johnny will pass the winter alone and isolated. He then finds the way to participate to one of the last attack to occupants, in fact the war will be over two months later.', 'After the 8th September 1943 north of Italy is occupied by Germans. Italian army collapsed and the soldiers are escaped to the mountains trying to set up a resistance. Many civilians did the same and Johnny, an English literature student, is among them. Johnny avoids to band together the red partisans (communists) and tries to be part of the azure bands (former regular soldiers). But in both cases he is deluded by the partisan bands and discovers that the partisan war is less poetic and genuine that he thought. At one point anyway the partisans free Alba from Germans. When the city falls again in German hands Johnny escape with Ettore and Pierre. But, one after another, German army and Italian fascists captures the partisans and Johnny will pass the winter alone and isolated. He then finds the way to participate to one of the last attack to occupants, in fact the war will be over two months later.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/na2T1wOLjGxAZzss0R7a5rfRhQk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88660'),
  ('55514078963929667', 'Johnny Tremain', 1957, 'Drama, Family, War', 'Robert Stevenson, Charles P. Boyle, William Beaudine Jr.', 'Thomas W. Blackburn', 'Hal Stalmaster, Richard Beymer, Luana Patten, Jeff York, Sebastian Cabot, Rusty Lane, Walter Sande, Whit Bissell', 'NR', 'When an injury bars him from pursuing his trade, Revolutionary War-era silversmith''s apprentice Johnny Tremain finds a new life in the ranks of the Sons of Liberty army, taking part in the Boston Tea Party and Paul Revere''s legendary ride.', 'When an injury bars him from pursuing his trade, Revolutionary War-era silversmith''s apprentice Johnny Tremain finds a new life in the ranks of the Sons of Liberty army, taking part in the Boston Tea Party and Paul Revere''s legendary ride.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cQKl3B4lfqKB9hoO8EGYRQiWZfm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43229'),
