  ('264768800120467094', 'Joint Custody', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Alexandra Leclère, Jean-Marc Fabre', 'Alexandra Leclère', 'Didier Bourdon, Isabelle Carré, Valérie Bonneton, Hélène Vincent, Laurent Stocker, Michel Vuillermoz, Jackie Berroyer, Billie Blain', null, 'A wife finds out her husband has a mistress. She decides to propose her to share her life with her husband, alternating every two weeks.', 'A wife finds out her husband has a mistress. She decides to propose her to share her life with her husband, alternating every two weeks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/heGJlmfQUn7rqNsBUF04Jv3v8sw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:451504'),
  ('781247285011224468', 'Joji', 2021, 'Drama, Crime', 'Roy T M, Dileesh Pothan, Saheed Arafath', 'Syam Pushkaran', 'Fahadh Faasil, Baburaj, P N Sunny, Unnimaya Prasad, Basil Joseph, Joji Mundakayam, Alister Alex, Shammi Thilakan', null, 'Joji, an engineering dropout and the youngest son of a rich family lives with his aspirations of becoming super wealthy. Driven by greed and blind ambition, he decides to execute his plans following an unexpected event in the family.', 'Joji, an engineering dropout and the youngest son of a rich family lives with his aspirations of becoming super wealthy. Driven by greed and blind ambition, he decides to execute his plans following an unexpected event in the family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iXAUPTb8XNSf5B4zyUAEajz2vFu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:791779'),
  ('489499164919686463', 'Jojo Rabbit', 2019, 'Comedy, War, Drama', 'Taika Waititi, Mihai Malaimare Jr., Mark Taylor', 'Taika Waititi', 'Roman Griffin Davis, Thomasin McKenzie, Scarlett Johansson, Taika Waititi, Sam Rockwell, Rebel Wilson, Alfie Allen, Stephen Merchant', 'PG-13', 'Jojo, a lonely German boy during World War II has his world shaken when he learns that his single mother is hiding a Jewish girl in their home. Influenced by a buffoonish imaginary version of Adolf Hitler, he begins to question his beliefs and confront the conflict between propaganda and his own humanity.', 'Jojo, a lonely German boy during World War II has his world shaken when he learns that his single mother is hiding a Jewish girl in their home. Influenced by a buffoonish imaginary version of Adolf Hitler, he begins to question his beliefs and confront the conflict between propaganda and his own humanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7GsM4mtM0worCtIVeiQt28HieeN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:515001'),
  ('1130491798169695684', 'JoJo''s Bizarre Adventure: Diamond Is Unbreakable – Chapter 1', 2017, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy, Thriller', 'Ryûsuke Kurahashi, Carla Celda, Anna Pujol Tauler', 'Itaru Era', 'Kento Yamazaki, Ryunosuke Kamiki, Yūsuke Iseya, Masaki Okada, Mackenyu, Nana Komatsu, Arisa Mizuki, Jun Kunimura', null, 'Morioh, 1999—a normally quiet and peaceful town has recently become a hotbed of strange activity. Jōtarō Kūjō, now a marine biologist, heads to the mysterious town to meet Jōsuke Higashikata. While the two may seem like strangers at first, Jōsuke is actually the illegitimate child of Jōtarō''s grandfather, Joseph Joestar. When they meet, Jōtarō realizes that he may have more in common with Jōsuke than just a blood relation. Along with the mild-mannered Kōichi Hirose and the boisterous Okuyasu Nijimura, the group dedicates themselves to investigating recent disappearances and other suspicious occurrences within Morioh. Aided by the power of Stands, the four men will encounter danger at every street corner, as it is up to them to unravel the town''s secrets, before another occurs.', 'Morioh, 1999—a normally quiet and peaceful town has recently become a hotbed of strange activity. Jōtarō Kūjō, now a marine biologist, heads to the mysterious town to meet Jōsuke Higashikata. While the two may seem like strangers at first, Jōsuke is actually the illegitimate child of Jōtarō''s grandfather, Joseph Joestar. When they meet, Jōtarō realizes that he may have more in common with Jōsuke than just a blood relation. Along with the mild-mannered Kōichi Hirose and the boisterous Okuyasu Nijimura, the group dedicates themselves to investigating recent disappearances and other suspicious occurrences within Morioh. Aided by the power of Stands, the four men will encounter danger at every street corner, as it is up to them to unravel the town''s secrets, before another occurs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sAfNSZ8Th0nb979e6ss5ftTT0Rh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:431572'),
  ('625722036164516790', 'JoJo''s Bizarre Adventure: Phantom Blood', 2007, 'Action, Animation, Adventure', 'Junichi Hayama, Yasunori Honda, Hideo Okazaki', 'Mitsuhiro Yamada', 'Katsuyuki Konishi, Hikaru Midorikawa, Nana Mizuki, Rikiya Koyama, Tsutomu Isobe, Kazutaka Ozawa, Toru Nara, Yoshinori Sonobe', null, 'An adaptation of the original five volume arc of the popular JoJo''s Bizarre Adventure manga, covering the Phantom Blood chapters. Jonathan Joestar is an aristocratic boy whose life is suddenly turned upside down by a mysterious new boy who arrives, Dio Brando. Dio has a connection to his father, and over time, a rivalry forms as Dio becomes obsessed with a mysterious, ancient, and mystical stone mask that Jonathan''s father keeps. This film has not been publicly released outside of its original limited run in Japanese theaters and is considered virtually lost.', 'An adaptation of the original five volume arc of the popular JoJo''s Bizarre Adventure manga, covering the Phantom Blood chapters. Jonathan Joestar is an aristocratic boy whose life is suddenly turned upside down by a mysterious new boy who arrives, Dio Brando. Dio has a connection to his father, and over time, a rivalry forms as Dio becomes obsessed with a mysterious, ancient, and mystical stone mask that Jonathan''s father keeps. This film has not been publicly released outside of its original limited run in Japanese theaters and is considered virtually lost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hgnnUSkKuEpXfs0IpTu5uCsdcKx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:387470'),
  ('994929559524280390', 'Joker', 1991, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Sune Lund-Sørensen', 'Björn Skifs, Bengt Palmers', 'Björn Skifs, Aja Rodas-Evrén, Johan Ulveson, Marie-Chantal Long, Jacob Nordenson, Catherine Hansson, Gert Fylking, Johan Paulsen', null, 'Nicke loves practical jokes. When his best friend Pelle is getting married, Nicke is hosting the bachelor party. It will start with the kidnapping of Pelle. Everything goes wrong when Pelle is kidnapped for real by a terrorist group.', 'Nicke loves practical jokes. When his best friend Pelle is getting married, Nicke is hosting the bachelor party. It will start with the kidnapping of Pelle. Everything goes wrong when Pelle is kidnapped for real by a terrorist group.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rY8eu4yQTwpZgz8BEVKfGIh8TUG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146486'),
  ('466474220118113024', 'Joker', 2012, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Shirish Kunder, Sudeep Chatterjee', 'Shirish Kunder', 'Akshay Kumar, Sonakshi Sinha, Shreyas Talpade, Minissha Lamba, Sanjay Mishra, Arya Babbar, Pitobash, Chitrangada Singh', null, 'In 1947 when the maps of India and Pakistan were being drawn, an oversight ensured that the village of Paglapur didn''t find a place in either country. Over 60 years later, Paglapur is isolated, and in need of help. The residents seek help, but as a direct result of being left off the map, they find no one willing to accept Paglapur, and its problems, as their jurisdiction. The villagers decide they need to draw media attention to Paglapur, and in so doing, gain acceptance and help from those who had previously denied them.', 'In 1947 when the maps of India and Pakistan were being drawn, an oversight ensured that the village of Paglapur didn''t find a place in either country. Over 60 years later, Paglapur is isolated, and in need of help. The residents seek help, but as a direct result of being left off the map, they find no one willing to accept Paglapur, and its problems, as their jurisdiction. The villagers decide they need to draw media attention to Paglapur, and in so doing, gain acceptance and help from those who had previously denied them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gA3xoiTWuaqEAiBXUqTv0gfZRSA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129507'),
  ('475622181633273208', 'Joker', 2019, 'Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Lawrence Sher, Laura Ballinger, David Webb', 'Todd Phillips, Scott Silver', 'Joaquin Phoenix, Robert De Niro, Zazie Beetz, Frances Conroy, Brett Cullen, Shea Whigham, Bill Camp, Glenn Fleshler', 'R', 'During the 1980s, a failed stand-up comedian is driven insane and turns to a life of crime and chaos in Gotham City while becoming an infamous psychopathic crime figure.', 'During the 1980s, a failed stand-up comedian is driven insane and turns to a life of crime and chaos in Gotham City while becoming an infamous psychopathic crime figure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/udDclJoHjfjb8Ekgsd4FDteOkCU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:475557'),
  ('276042186478647351', 'Joker Game', 2015, 'Action, Thriller', 'Yū Irie', 'Yusuke Watanabe', 'Kazuya Kamenashi, Kyoko Fukada, Yūsuke Iseya, Hiroshi Yamamoto, Kiyohiko Shibukawa, Kyūsaku Shimada, Hiromasa Taguchi, Ken Mitsuishi', null, 'Set along a backdrop of a fictitious second world war at an international city in Asia. In Japan, Lieutenant Colonel Yuki (Yusuke Iseya) recommends the creation of spy training school "D Kikan". Meanwhile, Kato (Kazuya Kamenashi) is facing capital punishment for his refusal to follow a superior''s order. Kato is then scouted by "D Kikan". He goes through a harsh training regiment and faces his first mission as a spy. In order to seize American ambassador Graham''s confidential documents "Black Note." Kato infiltrates into an international city. A battle to gain possession of the "Black Note" ensues between Kato, a mysterious woman named Rin (Kyoko Fukada), the British Spy Agency, the Soviet Spy Agency and the radical army in Japan.', 'Set along a backdrop of a fictitious second world war at an international city in Asia. In Japan, Lieutenant Colonel Yuki (Yusuke Iseya) recommends the creation of spy training school "D Kikan". Meanwhile, Kato (Kazuya Kamenashi) is facing capital punishment for his refusal to follow a superior''s order. Kato is then scouted by "D Kikan". He goes through a harsh training regiment and faces his first mission as a spy. In order to seize American ambassador Graham''s confidential documents "Black Note." Kato infiltrates into an international city. A battle to gain possession of the "Black Note" ensues between Kato, a mysterious woman named Rin (Kyoko Fukada), the British Spy Agency, the Soviet Spy Agency and the radical army in Japan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5eIDcK1AU2bG2WwpwyMz73sbqhc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:319669'),
  ('313187082551141343', 'Joker: Folie à Deux', 2024, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Ryan Robert Howard, David Webb, Travis Rehwaldt', 'Scott Silver, Todd Phillips, Todd Phillips', 'Joaquin Phoenix, Lady Gaga, Brendan Gleeson, Catherine Keener, Zazie Beetz, Steve Coogan, Harry Lawtey, Leigh Gill', 'R', 'While struggling with his dual identity, Arthur Fleck not only stumbles upon true love, but also finds the music that''s always been inside him.', 'While struggling with his dual identity, Arthur Fleck not only stumbles upon true love, but also finds the music that''s always been inside him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aciP8Km0waTLXEYf5ybFK5CSUxl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:889737'),
  ('1030045430845540201', 'Joker: Put on a Happy Face', 2020, 'Documentary', null, 'Yuri Ramondelli', 'Kevin Conroy, Neal Adams, Will Arnett, David Ayer, Christian Bale, Brian Bolland, Alan Burnett, Tim Burton', null, 'Featuring interviews with filmmakers and industry legends, discover the origins and evolution of The Joker, and learn why The Clown Prince of Crime is universally hailed as the greatest comic-book supervillain of all time.', 'Featuring interviews with filmmakers and industry legends, discover the origins and evolution of The Joker, and learn why The Clown Prince of Crime is universally hailed as the greatest comic-book supervillain of all time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/am5Sst8LFmU0bhPrzU3km4RRy3J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:734586'),
  ('694629352068525283', 'Jokes & Cigarettes', 2023, 'Drama', 'Sergi Vilanova Claudín, David Trueba, Anice Mateu', 'David Trueba, Albert Espinosa', 'David Verdaguer, Carolina Yuste, César Tormo, Francesc Ferrer, Sigfrid Monleón, Candela Serrat, Valentí Guardiola, Marina Salas', null, 'Barcelona, Spain, in the late sixties. Eugenio, a young jeweler who has fallen in love with Conchita, a singer, to the point of learning to play the guitar to accompany her in her performances, will first have to learn to overcome his stage fright.', 'Barcelona, Spain, in the late sixties. Eugenio, a young jeweler who has fallen in love with Conchita, a singer, to the point of learning to play the guitar to accompany her in her performances, will first have to learn to overcome his stage fright.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dMy781akRaOg9EnKLPbW5uvjJGS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1138248'),
  ('974499160613421272', 'Jolene', 2010, 'Drama', 'Dan Ireland, Claudio Rocha, Rod Smith', 'Dennis Yares', 'Jessica Chastain, Frances Fisher, Rupert Friend, Dermot Mulroney, Zeberiah Newman, Denise Richards, Theresa Russell, Michael Vartan', 'R', 'A teenage orphan spends ten years traveling to experience life.', 'A teenage orphan spends ten years traveling to experience life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5udqbFUVTzevHpDkel4CElpNEBR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43727'),
  ('74281626332877108', 'Jolly Blu', 1998, 'Music, Comedy', 'Franco Balboni, Stefano Salvati, Yozo Tokuda', 'Riccardo Cassini', 'Max Pezzali, Gabriele Baldoni, Giuliano Brunazzi, Francesco Casale, Dario Cassini, Sara D''Amario, Angelo D''Amelio, Massimo Di Michele', null, 'A group of friends usually meet at Jolly Blue, a bar that is a point of reference for all young people in the area. But when their meeting place is about to be closed, they work hard to ensure this doesn''t happen and confide in the bartender.', 'A group of friends usually meet at Jolly Blue, a bar that is a point of reference for all young people in the area. But when their meeting place is about to be closed, they work hard to ensure this doesn''t happen and confide in the bartender.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xkU7FGL7IdSNeQX1gshYikDvGkt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58038'),
  ('795148081115712905', 'Jolly Fellows', 1934, 'Music, Comedy', 'Grigori Aleksandrov, Vladimir Nilsen', 'Vladimir Mass, Nikolay Erdman, Grigori Aleksandrov', 'Leonid Utyosov, Lyubov Orlova, Mariya Strelkova, Fyodor Kurikhin, Emmanuil Geller, Yelena Tyapkina, Niki Otto, Arnold Arnold', null, 'Merry Fellows was the first Soviet musical comedy. Set in Odessa and Moscow in the 1930s. Shepherd Kostya Potekhin (Utyosov) is mistaken for an international concert star. He falls in love with Anyuta (Orlova) and plays the "star" for her. In a cascade of comic musical numbers he becomes the leader of a Jazz-Band and gives a hilarious show at the Odessa Music Hall. Now he is destined to perform at the Bolshoi Theatre in Moscow.', 'Merry Fellows was the first Soviet musical comedy. Set in Odessa and Moscow in the 1930s. Shepherd Kostya Potekhin (Utyosov) is mistaken for an international concert star. He falls in love with Anyuta (Orlova) and plays the "star" for her. In a cascade of comic musical numbers he becomes the leader of a Jazz-Band and gives a hilarious show at the Odessa Music Hall. Now he is destined to perform at the Bolshoi Theatre in Moscow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ws1Wkrq1vHFe6n9eY1F10oMbrH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37128'),
  ('640236885308556480', 'Jolly Good Christmas', 2022, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Jonathan Wright, Russ Goozee', 'Ron Oliver', 'Will Kemp, Reshma Shetty, Callum Blue, Suzi McLaughlin, James Faulkner, Sophie Hopkins, Amerjit Deu, Montana Manning', 'G', 'David is an American architect who relocates across the pond to take up a job at a prestigious London firm. As the clock counts down to Christmas Day, David is running out of time to buy his girlfriend – who also happens to be his boss’s daughter – a thoughtful present so he resorts to buying her a somewhat uninspired gift card.', 'David is an American architect who relocates across the pond to take up a job at a prestigious London firm. As the clock counts down to Christmas Day, David is running out of time to buy his girlfriend – who also happens to be his boss’s daughter – a thoughtful present so he resorts to buying her a somewhat uninspired gift card.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/26YADsX1ub5IhnYHIMoSAZBeRDR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:974213'),
  ('755594449852021966', 'Jolly Life', 2009, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Yılmaz Erdoğan', 'Yılmaz Erdoğan', 'Yılmaz Erdoğan, Ersin Korkut, Büşra Pekin, Cezmi Baskın, Erdal Tosun, Rıza Akın, Sinan Bengier, Ayberk Atilla', null, 'Burdened by troubles and caught between cultures, Riza takes a job as a mall Santa and finds that real life may not be so different from make believe.', 'Burdened by troubles and caught between cultures, Riza takes a job as a mall Santa and finds that real life may not be so different from make believe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rw9ZF58yRHPsSZXTboJBLrsZXvW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52667'),
  ('816572442714163750', 'Jolly Little Elves', 1934, 'Music, Animation, Comedy', 'Manuel Moreno', null, 'Bernice Hansen', null, 'A poor shoemaker and his wife have only a stale donut and a cup of coffee left to share. An elf drops by, and they offer to share with him. He teaches them (in song) to dunk the donut in the coffee. Later, as they sleep, he brings several other elves back, and they work through the night making shoes in humorous ways. The shoes are a success. Soon, the shoemaker and his wife are quite prosperous. They treat the elves to a feast of donuts and coffee, and the elves treat us to another chorus of "Dunk! Dunk! Dunk!".', 'A poor shoemaker and his wife have only a stale donut and a cup of coffee left to share. An elf drops by, and they offer to share with him. He teaches them (in song) to dunk the donut in the coffee. Later, as they sleep, he brings several other elves back, and they work through the night making shoes in humorous ways. The shoes are a success. Soon, the shoemaker and his wife are quite prosperous. They treat the elves to a feast of donuts and coffee, and the elves treat us to another chorus of "Dunk! Dunk! Dunk!".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eoQVSSGkmf3ARAfweNr1ZlHssms.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:180775'),
  ('127012526885274061', 'Jolly LLB', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Subhash Kapoor', 'Subhash Kapoor', 'Arshad Warsi, Boman Irani, Saurabh Shukla, Amrita Rao, Harsh Chhaya, Manoj Pahwa, Ramesh Deo, Sanjay Mishra', 'NR', 'Wanting to earn fame and fortune, a small time lawyer files a PIL for an infamous hit-and-run, and thus learns what it really is like to be a lawyer.', 'Wanting to earn fame and fortune, a small time lawyer files a PIL for an infamous hit-and-run, and thus learns what it really is like to be a lawyer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zmh8eBq0MdwqHl7NMyVOnAhNu7I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:177358'),
  ('230584653854490543', 'Jolly LLB 2', 2017, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Subhash Kapoor, Kamaljeet Negi, Sakshi Mehta', 'Subhash Kapoor', 'Akshay Kumar, Annu Kapoor, Saurabh Shukla, Huma Qureshi, Kumud Mishra, Sayani Gupta, Ram Gopal Bajaj, Manav Kaul', null, 'A blunt, abrasive and yet oddly compassionate Jagdishwar Mishra aka Jolly, a small-time struggling lawyer who moves from Kanpur to the city of Nawabs to pursue his dream of becoming a big-time lawyer.', 'A blunt, abrasive and yet oddly compassionate Jagdishwar Mishra aka Jolly, a small-time struggling lawyer who moves from Kanpur to the city of Nawabs to pursue his dream of becoming a big-time lawyer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n9MjoGmaYagaaETCQP0S6Ch3JLH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:412090'),
  ('617823958796335606', 'Jolly LLB 3', 2025, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Subhash Kapoor, Rangarajan Rambadran, Parvez Shaikh', 'Subhash Kapoor', 'Akshay Kumar, Arshad Warsi, Saurabh Shukla, Gajraj Rao, Amrita Rao, Huma Qureshi, Seema Biswas, Robin Das', null, 'The third part of the Jolly LLB trilogy brings back Jagdish Tyagi and Jagdishwar Mishra for the biggest face-off as penurious widow Janki Devi Solanki awaits justice against business tycoon Haribhai Khaitan in a satire on the judiciary, justice and the gulf between the privileged and the people on the other side of the spectrum.', 'The third part of the Jolly LLB trilogy brings back Jagdish Tyagi and Jagdishwar Mishra for the biggest face-off as penurious widow Janki Devi Solanki awaits justice against business tycoon Haribhai Khaitan in a satire on the judiciary, justice and the gulf between the privileged and the people on the other side of the spectrum.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bwRoU9p5GvjxgPfmIgsfcJ4ydng.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1015981'),
  ('857742753757819186', 'Jolly Roger', 1999, 'Animation', 'Mark Baker', 'Mark Baker, Neville Astley', 'Morwenna Banks, Gordon Kennedy, John Sparkes, Dave Western', null, 'After marauding and sinking another ship, a band of pirates capture a female passenger, then send her overboard as punishment for her defiance. She vows revenge, and fortunately is rescued by a small passing ship carrying only its captain, his first mate and a cat. They cross paths with the pirates, but both sides - after seeming to have victory within their grasp - meet a fate neither could have predicted. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2008.', 'After marauding and sinking another ship, a band of pirates capture a female passenger, then send her overboard as punishment for her defiance. She vows revenge, and fortunately is rescued by a small passing ship carrying only its captain, his first mate and a cat. They cross paths with the pirates, but both sides - after seeming to have victory within their grasp - meet a fate neither could have predicted. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2008.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qrSJLp0JwYASO44Y5sHTdDiToSa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:220834'),
  ('630669973873843244', 'Jolson Sings Again', 1949, 'Drama, Music', 'Henry Levin, William E. Snyder', 'Sidney Buchman', 'Larry Parks, Barbara Hale, William Demarest, Ludwig Donath, Bill Goodwin, Myron McCormick, Tamara Shayne, Bing Crosby', 'NR', 'In this sequel to The Jolson Story, we pick up the singer''s career just as he has returned to the stage after a premature retirement. But his wife has left him and the appeal of the spotlight isn''t what it used to be. This time Jolson trades in the stage for life in the fast lane: women, horses, travel. It takes the death of Moma Yoelson and World War II to bring Jolson back to earth - and to the stage. Once again teamed with manager Steve Martin, Jolson travels the world entertaining troops everywhere from Alaska to Africa. When he finally collapses from exhaustion it takes young, pretty nurse Ellen Clark to show him there''s more to life than "just rushing around".', 'In this sequel to The Jolson Story, we pick up the singer''s career just as he has returned to the stage after a premature retirement. But his wife has left him and the appeal of the spotlight isn''t what it used to be. This time Jolson trades in the stage for life in the fast lane: women, horses, travel. It takes the death of Moma Yoelson and World War II to bring Jolson back to earth - and to the stage. Once again teamed with manager Steve Martin, Jolson travels the world entertaining troops everywhere from Alaska to Africa. When he finally collapses from exhaustion it takes young, pretty nurse Ellen Clark to show him there''s more to life than "just rushing around".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sswaVzdGmBrDL1Ki0KfpLcclww2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43435'),
  ('117171578958492329', 'Jolt', 2021, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Tom Coulommiers, Monika Hristova, Elliot-Joshua Coogan', 'Scott Wascha', 'Kate Beckinsale, Stanley Tucci, Bobby Cannavale, Jai Courtney, Laverne Cox, David Bradley, Susan Sarandon, Ori Pfeffer', 'R', 'A bouncer with an anger management problem goes on a furious and resentful rampage after the murder of a friend.', 'A bouncer with an anger management problem goes on a furious and resentful rampage after the murder of a friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b0fBzqCmHr0a0XkeAdhc02XhKXG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:617502'),
  ('505063956001793633', 'Jonah', 2016, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Lô Politi', 'Lô Politi, Élcio Verçosa Filho', 'Jesuíta Barbosa, Laura Neiva, Luam Marques, Criolo, João Fábio Cabral, Chay Suede, Roberto Birindelli, Chris Couto', null, 'During Carnival in São Paulo, a young man and young woman who knew each other as children meet again after many years and the social barriers that have kept them apart. Bad decisions lead the boy to hide with the girl inside a whale float.', 'During Carnival in São Paulo, a young man and young woman who knew each other as children meet again after many years and the social barriers that have kept them apart. Bad decisions lead the boy to hide with the girl inside a whale float.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gfd4w6U8IA1Im9WUsAMcQSJj68z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:364327'),
  ('852596251006344161', 'Jonah and the Pink Whale', 1995, 'Drama', 'Juan Carlos Valdivia, Henner Hofmann', 'Juan Carlos Valdivia, Wolfgango Montes', 'Dino García, María Renée Prudencio, Claudia Lobo, Julieta Egurrola, Guillermo Gil, Elías Serrano, Percy Fernández, Milton Cortez', null, 'A schoolteacher in the small city of Santa Cruz de la Sierra has a passionate affair with his frigid wife''s sister—despite the risk of having to confront not only his wife, but also his dubious father-in-law.', 'A schoolteacher in the small city of Santa Cruz de la Sierra has a passionate affair with his frigid wife''s sister—despite the risk of having to confront not only his wife, but also his dubious father-in-law.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pwskqeGw90hXekODhpvHbLrnojT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107584'),
  ('375076902591246343', 'Jonah Hex', 2010, 'Western, Fantasy, Thriller', 'Jimmy Hayward, Mitchell Amundsen, Seth Reed', 'Mark Neveldine, Brian Taylor', 'Josh Brolin, John Malkovich, Megan Fox, Michael Fassbender, Will Arnett, Aidan Quinn, Wes Bentley, John Gallagher Jr.', 'PG-13', 'Gunslinger Jonah Hex is appointed by President Ulysses Grant to track down terrorist Quentin Turnbull, a former Confederate officer determined on unleashing hell on earth. Jonah not only secures freedom by accepting this task, he also gets revenge on the man who slew his wife and child.', 'Gunslinger Jonah Hex is appointed by President Ulysses Grant to track down terrorist Quentin Turnbull, a former Confederate officer determined on unleashing hell on earth. Jonah not only secures freedom by accepting this task, he also gets revenge on the man who slew his wife and child.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xwAdu0lOO2Y5sXjK87glhJg3c6r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20533'),
  ('327202848880053020', 'Jonah Who Will Be 25 in the Year 2000', 1976, 'Drama', 'Alain Tanner, Renato Berta', 'Alain Tanner, John Berger', 'Myriam Boyer, Jean-Luc Bideau, Miou-Miou, Rufus, Jacques Denis, Roger Jendly, Myriam Mézières, Dominique Labourier', null, 'A look at the lives of several men and women in their 30s as they confront the slim gains of the "revolutionary" sixties. Max, a dissatisfied copy editor; Myriam, a redhead into tantric sex; and Marie, a supermarket checker who gives unauthorized discounts to the elderly, search for renewed meaning on a communal farm. The title character, a six-year-old child, is the carrier of their hopes for the future.', 'A look at the lives of several men and women in their 30s as they confront the slim gains of the "revolutionary" sixties. Max, a dissatisfied copy editor; Myriam, a redhead into tantric sex; and Marie, a supermarket checker who gives unauthorized discounts to the elderly, search for renewed meaning on a communal farm. The title character, a six-year-old child, is the carrier of their hopes for the future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zwqnEiUygCOGRZJvbzaTRF6tbsC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42237'),
  ('337004133158213260', 'Jonah: A VeggieTales Movie', 2002, 'Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Family, Music', 'Mike Nawrocki, Phil Vischer, Henry Vera', 'Phil Vischer, Mike Nawrocki', 'Phil Vischer, Mike Nawrocki, Tim Hodge, Lisa Vischer, Dan Anderson, Kristin Blegen, Shelby Morimoto, Jim Poole', 'G', 'Get ready as Bob the Tomato, Larry the Cucumber and the rest of the Veggies set sail on a whale of an adventure in Big Idea''s first full-length, 3-D animated feature film. This is the story of Jonah and the Whale as you''ve never seen it before - a story where we learn that one of the best gifts you can give - or get - is a second chance.', 'Get ready as Bob the Tomato, Larry the Cucumber and the rest of the Veggies set sail on a whale of an adventure in Big Idea''s first full-length, 3-D animated feature film. This is the story of Jonah and the Whale as you''ve never seen it before - a story where we learn that one of the best gifts you can give - or get - is a second chance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xJ6ImpQIqZxBh4eE2813ljQ0TQ3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15173'),
  ('1135459057969523504', 'Jonas', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Robert Wilde, Frank Lamm', 'Christian Ulmen', 'Christian Ulmen', null, 'Jonas is 18-years-old and has had to repeat several years of his education. His acceptance into Brandenburg''s Paul Dessau Comprehensive School is his last chance at getting any qualifications. The experimental film project ''Jonas'' is mix of fiction and documentary. It was shot during actual lessons at a comprehensive school in Brandenburg. It uses the teachers and pupils of the school, and stars Christian Ulmen as Jonas. The aim of the project was to capture the influence of an artificial figure in a real space. Made with a subtly wry smile, this is a fascinating study of the school system, puberty, love and music.', 'Jonas is 18-years-old and has had to repeat several years of his education. His acceptance into Brandenburg''s Paul Dessau Comprehensive School is his last chance at getting any qualifications. The experimental film project ''Jonas'' is mix of fiction and documentary. It was shot during actual lessons at a comprehensive school in Brandenburg. It uses the teachers and pupils of the school, and stars Christian Ulmen as Jonas. The aim of the project was to capture the influence of an artificial figure in a real space. Made with a subtly wry smile, this is a fascinating study of the school system, puberty, love and music.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/io2mVCZyf13pdNKyv9vkXYJI5v0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79361'),
  ('506583576691546809', 'Jonas and the Backyard Circus', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Haroldo Borges, Ernesto Molinero, Paula Gomes', 'Paula Gomes', 'Jonas Laborda, Wilma Macedo, Neide Silva, Wanderson Silva, Micael Nunes, Ian Laborda, Gutinho Silva, Mateus Lima', null, 'Jonas is 13 years old and his life''s dream is to maintain the circus that he created in his backyard. While he faces this challenge, he will live the adventure of growing up.', 'Jonas is 13 years old and his life''s dream is to maintain the circus that he created in his backyard. While he faces this challenge, he will live the adventure of growing up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lCDXx45jLOIz94500uQyVQHWnJs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:393026'),
  ('882396425827645885', 'Jonas Brothers Family Roast', 2021, 'Comedy, Music, Documentary', 'Alex Van Wagner', 'Bryan Tucker, James Longman, Janette Timm Vico', 'Nick Jonas, Joe Jonas, Kevin Jonas, Danielle Jonas, Priyanka Chopra Jonas, Sophie Turner, Kenan Thompson, Pete Davidson', null, 'Kevin, Joe and Nick face down quick wits and deep cuts in this comedy special featuring Pete Davidson, John Legend and more. Hosted by Kenan Thompson.', 'Kevin, Joe and Nick face down quick wits and deep cuts in this comedy special featuring Pete Davidson, John Legend and more. Hosted by Kenan Thompson.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eEEj1mC2N2oTrluubqA5dYRwvOb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:894155'),
  ('28591018635551230', 'Jonas Brothers: The Concert Experience', 2009, 'Documentary, Music', 'Bruce Hendricks, Mitchell Amundsen, Reed Smoot', null, 'Nick Jonas, Joe Jonas, Kevin Jonas, Demi Lovato, Taylor Swift, Robert Feggans, Frankie Jonas, John Lloyd Taylor', 'G', 'Grab a backstage pass to the Jonas Brothers'' motion picture debut! Kevin, Joe and Nick are "Burning Up" the stage and inviting you inside their personal world for the adventure of a lifetime. This colossal movie event launches the world''s hottest band straight into your living room – and includes guest appearances by chart-topping artists Demi Lovato and Taylor Swift! Secure your VIP pass to a once-in-a-lifetime experience with the Jonas Brothers. Get ready to hang out with this multitalented trio, and take an intimate look at what their lives are like offstage and behind the scenes. It''s the music-filled movie event perfect for the whole family!', 'Grab a backstage pass to the Jonas Brothers'' motion picture debut! Kevin, Joe and Nick are "Burning Up" the stage and inviting you inside their personal world for the adventure of a lifetime. This colossal movie event launches the world''s hottest band straight into your living room – and includes guest appearances by chart-topping artists Demi Lovato and Taylor Swift! Secure your VIP pass to a once-in-a-lifetime experience with the Jonas Brothers. Get ready to hang out with this multitalented trio, and take an intimate look at what their lives are like offstage and behind the scenes. It''s the music-filled movie event perfect for the whole family!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gUgLeFsVDuOQdzZkLW4IRw0FICb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40534'),
  ('601005878524339237', 'Jonathan', 1970, 'Horror, Drama', 'Hans W. Geißendörfer, Robby Müller, Urs Aebersold', 'Hans W. Geißendörfer', 'Jürgen Jung, Hans-Dieter Jendreyko, Paul Albert Krumm, Hertha von Walther, Oskar von Schab, Ilona Grübel, Arthur Brauss, Wilfried Klaus', null, 'A group of vampires terrorizes a small village on the German North Sea Coast. The young Jonathan joins a group of fellow students and locals, who plan an uprising against the vampires.', 'A group of vampires terrorizes a small village on the German North Sea Coast. The young Jonathan joins a group of fellow students and locals, who plan an uprising against the vampires.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9cPYdnIVEyZICPRAbaGOUDYUrb5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:262187'),
  ('613172937984894926', 'Jonathan', 2016, 'Drama', 'Piotr J. Lewandowski, Jeremy Rouse', 'Piotr J. Lewandowski', 'Jannis Niewöhner, André Hennicke, Julia Koschitz, Thomas Sarbacher, Barbara Auer, Max Mauff, Leon Seidel, Carsten Strauch', null, 'A young man struggles with the pressure of caring for his terminally ill father while trying to unlock a secret that his father seems determined to keep from him. The story takes another dramatic turn when Ron, Burghardt’s long-lost friend from his youth, re-appears — and a well-kept family secret is uncovered.', 'A young man struggles with the pressure of caring for his terminally ill father while trying to unlock a secret that his father seems determined to keep from him. The story takes another dramatic turn when Ron, Burghardt’s long-lost friend from his youth, re-appears — and a well-kept family secret is uncovered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/myBiRSPMOknyhaGRbZUtNy9Q9YO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:380874'),
  ('703434498352204461', 'Jonathan', 2018, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'Bill Oliver, Zach Kuperstein', 'Peter Nickowitz, Gregory Davis, Bill Oliver', 'Suki Waterhouse, Ansel Elgort, Patricia Clarkson, Joe Egender, Douglas Hodge, Matt Bomer, Souléymane Sy Savané, Shunori Ramanathan', 'NR', 'Jonathan is a young man with a strange condition that only his brother understands. But when he begins to yearn for a different life, their unique bond becomes increasingly tested.', 'Jonathan is a young man with a strange condition that only his brother understands. But when he begins to yearn for a different life, their unique bond becomes increasingly tested.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nTd0PBJkA1HLM9yImDnRZDzGAwb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:422619'),
  ('285933250443348847', 'Jonathan Livingston Seagull', 1973, 'Drama, Family', 'Hall Bartlett, Jack Couffer', 'Hall Bartlett', 'James Franciscus, Juliet Mills, Philip Ahn, David Ladd, Dorothy McGuire, Richard Crenna, Kelly Harmon, Hal Holbrook', 'G', 'Jonathan is sick and tired of the boring life in his seagull clan. He rather experiments with new, always more daring flying techniques. Since he doesn''t fit in, the elders expel him from the clan. So he sets out to discover the world beyond the horizon in a quest for wisdom.', 'Jonathan is sick and tired of the boring life in his seagull clan. He rather experiments with new, always more daring flying techniques. Since he doesn''t fit in, the elders expel him from the clan. So he sets out to discover the world beyond the horizon in a quest for wisdom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jP4Cw7YBVvuZ0Yl4s7mKIKNInyF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56150'),
  ('653677885581412498', 'Jonathan of the Bears', 1995, 'Action, Western', 'Enzo G. Castellari, Mikhail Agranovich, Rita Agostini', 'Enzo G. Castellari, Lorenzo De Luca', 'Franco Nero, John Saxon, Floyd ''Red Crow'' Westerman, David Hess, Rodrigo Obregón, Clive Riche, Bobby Rhodes, Ennio Girolami', null, 'A young boy witnesses his parents'' murder. Later, as he grows up, he befriends a bear in the wilderness and the chief of a local Indian tribe, and he stays with the Indians, but makes an enemy of the chief''s son. As he enters adulthood he sets out to find the men responsible for his parents'' deaths.', 'A young boy witnesses his parents'' murder. Later, as he grows up, he befriends a bear in the wilderness and the chief of a local Indian tribe, and he stays with the Indians, but makes an enemy of the chief''s son. As he enters adulthood he sets out to find the men responsible for his parents'' deaths.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xW5qr1nIxiTXG0P4XQdjn8IEZ2o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42764'),
  ('505628403312193229', 'Jonestown: Paradise Lost', 2007, 'History, Documentary, Crime, Drama', 'Tim Wolochatiuk', 'Jason Sherman', 'Ted Biggs, Rick Roberts, Quentin Krog, Brendan Murray, Alon Nashman, Greg Ellwand, Kevin Otto, Adrienne Pearce', null, 'Jonestown: Paradise Lost is a documentary on the final days of Jonestown, the Peoples Temple, and Jim Jones. From eyewitness and survivor accounts, it recreates the last week before the mass murder-suicide on November 18, 1978.', 'Jonestown: Paradise Lost is a documentary on the final days of Jonestown, the Peoples Temple, and Jim Jones. From eyewitness and survivor accounts, it recreates the last week before the mass murder-suicide on November 18, 1978.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sN1aeEy8iqcPq13AyVH7s4AljqP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121135'),
  ('967391584052983624', 'Jonestown: The Life and Death of Peoples Temple', 2006, 'Documentary, History, TV Movie', 'Stanley Nelson', null, 'Claire Janaro, Deborah Layton, Garrett Lambrev, Hue Fortson Jr., Janet Shular, Jim Jones, Leo J. Ryan, Jackie Speier', 'NR', 'Featuring never-before-seen footage, this documentary delivers a startling new look at the Peoples Temple, headed by preacher Jim Jones who, in 1978, led more than 900 members to Guyana, where he orchestrated a mass suicide via tainted punch.', 'Featuring never-before-seen footage, this documentary delivers a startling new look at the Peoples Temple, headed by preacher Jim Jones who, in 1978, led more than 900 members to Guyana, where he orchestrated a mass suicide via tainted punch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5c9aoJ1LbcAYp6cWF3rZCVtrQ1W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36676'),
  ('207343350398006653', 'Joni', 1979, 'Drama', 'James F. Collier, Frank Raymond', 'James F. Collier', 'Joni Eareckson Tada, Bert Remsen, Katherine De Hetre, Cooper Huckabee, John Milford, Jay W. MacIntosh, Ernie Hudson, Michael Mancini', null, 'Based on Joni Eareckson''s autobiography. She becomes paralyzed after breaking her neck in a swimming accident at age 17. Trying to cope with her new life, she learns to paint using her mouth.', 'Based on Joni Eareckson''s autobiography. She becomes paralyzed after breaking her neck in a swimming accident at age 17. Trying to cope with her new life, she learns to paint using her mouth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qMvW2i5OzRKJyqbzsqddAIOOnP7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124523'),
  ('159297307075257064', 'Joni pata de conejo', 2024, 'Action', 'Ismael Vazquez Nervión', null, 'Jose Valero, Gregor Acuña-Pohl', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a3nKPtKs7SRB6bdlaxPbD7f7eKJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1373893'),
  ('142493623959886349', 'Joni''s Promise', 2005, 'Adventure, Comedy, Romance', 'Joko Anwar, Ipung Rachmat Syaiful, Rama Adi', 'Joko Anwar', 'Nicholas Saputra, Mariana Renata, Rachel Maryam, Surya Saputra, Gito Rollies, Dwiky Riza, Ria Irawan, Fedi Nuril', null, 'A film delivery man promises a beautiful young woman to deliver a film reel on time to a movie theater, but the the whole city seems to conspire against him.', 'A film delivery man promises a beautiful young woman to deliver a film reel on time to a movie theater, but the the whole city seems to conspire against him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a2Be0icT9HAY6ml6PgVVYLVsCRt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39064'),
  ('742315449877763244', 'Jonny''s Golden Quest', 1993, 'Animation, Adventure, Family, Mystery, TV Movie', 'Don Lusk, Paul Sommer', 'Mark Young, Sean Roche', 'Will Estes, Ed Gilbert, Meredith MacRae, George Hearn, Anndi McAfee, Don Messick, Rob Paulsen, Whit Hertford', 'NR', 'In the first feature-length animated movie based on the Hanna-Barbera series, Jonny Quest fans get to meet the women behind the adventurous men. Joining scientist Benton Quest, his plucky son Jonny, bodyguard Race Bannon and Jonny''s young pal Hadji are Benton''s biologist wife Rachel, Race''s ex-wife Jade and young 12-year-old Jessie, who harbors a big secret. Throughout, Team Quest battles the evil schemes of modern-day alchemist Dr. Zin, who has cloned himself and created an army of mutant reptiles in the Peruvian rain forest. The clash there results in a tragedy that changes Jonny''s life forever - and later leads to a worldwide pursuit of Zin that includes examining rare Leonardo da Vinci documents in Paris, exploring the Roman catacombs and a final confrontation in the Australian outback.', 'In the first feature-length animated movie based on the Hanna-Barbera series, Jonny Quest fans get to meet the women behind the adventurous men. Joining scientist Benton Quest, his plucky son Jonny, bodyguard Race Bannon and Jonny''s young pal Hadji are Benton''s biologist wife Rachel, Race''s ex-wife Jade and young 12-year-old Jessie, who harbors a big secret. Throughout, Team Quest battles the evil schemes of modern-day alchemist Dr. Zin, who has cloned himself and created an army of mutant reptiles in the Peruvian rain forest. The clash there results in a tragedy that changes Jonny''s life forever - and later leads to a worldwide pursuit of Zin that includes examining rare Leonardo da Vinci documents in Paris, exploring the Roman catacombs and a final confrontation in the Australian outback.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sXrSqhLKo25eyMHka6JKe3YO9Ss.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:211223'),
  ('216328133478648709', 'Jönssonligan & den svarta diamanten', 1992, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Hans Åke Gabrielsson, Rolf Lindström, Magdalena Jangard', 'Hans Åke Gabrielsson, Rolf Börjlind', 'Ulf Brunnberg, Björn Gustafson, Peter Haber, Birgitta Andersson, Elias Ringquist, Björn Granath, Pontus Gustafsson, Bernt Lindqvist', null, 'Sickan, the leader of the criminal Jönsson gang is incarcerated in a mental institution, attended by Dr M.A. Busé, who admire a handbook in crime that Sickan has been writing. Blackmailed by the nefarious banker Wall-Enberg, Dr Busé and Sickan''s partners Vanheden and Dynamite-Harry execute Sickan''s plan of stealing the valuable Black Diamond of the Romanovs from the National Museum.', 'Sickan, the leader of the criminal Jönsson gang is incarcerated in a mental institution, attended by Dr M.A. Busé, who admire a handbook in crime that Sickan has been writing. Blackmailed by the nefarious banker Wall-Enberg, Dr Busé and Sickan''s partners Vanheden and Dynamite-Harry execute Sickan''s plan of stealing the valuable Black Diamond of the Romanovs from the National Museum.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qD54LiOT4xywx3HUKjCAw58BRhR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23654'),
  ('747421353442057089', 'Joram', 2023, 'Adventure, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Devashish Makhija, Piyush Puty, Abhishek Banerjee', 'Devashish Makhija, Aman Vishera', 'Manoj Bajpayee, Tannishtha Chatterjee, Mohammed Zeeshan Ayyub, Smita Tambe, Jacky Bhavsar, Aditya Kumar Bhagat, Apurva Mahesh, Kajal Keshav', null, 'A father is on the run with his little baby girl to escape the ghosts of his past and the forces that want him dead.', 'A father is on the run with his little baby girl to escape the ghosts of his past and the forces that want him dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r5QNn8wyKlVb4J5tRmhNFvqmT68.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1063708'),
  ('722009880631820435', 'Jorel''s Brother Christmas Special: Santa''s Brother', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Federico Nicolai, Juliano Enrico, Zé Brandão', 'Zé Brandão', 'Andrei Duarte, Melissa Garcia, Cecília Lemes, César Marchetti, Hugo Picchi Neto', null, 'Jorel''s family prepares for Christmas Eve with a big dinner, flashing lights, plates, cutlery and cups, only used on very special occasions. The china cabinet is finally opened.', 'Jorel''s family prepares for Christmas Eve with a big dinner, flashing lights, plates, cutlery and cups, only used on very special occasions. The china cabinet is finally opened.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mxW52O017kOnxRob4Df8sSMYt8S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1056212'),
  ('1002259678916715409', 'Joru ka Ghulam', 2000, null, 'Shakeel Noorani', 'Ikram Akhtar', 'Govinda, Twinkle Khanna, Kader Khan, Ashok Saraf, Ashish Vidhyarthi, Ali Asgar, Razak Khan, Rakhi Sawant', null, 'Dhaneshwar Pitamber, has four daughters. All the four daughters are not ready to marry, each one having their own reason. The daughters always play mischievous tricks on the one coming with a proposal of marriage, and their gang leader is the youngest daughter Durga. Kader Khan is so desperate to get his daughters married that he is ready to give a dowry of five crores to each son-in-law. Raja and Kanahaiya are small time con men at the airport. Raju Patel is an NRI from America who comes to India to get married to one of the daughters of Dhaneshwar.', 'Dhaneshwar Pitamber, has four daughters. All the four daughters are not ready to marry, each one having their own reason. The daughters always play mischievous tricks on the one coming with a proposal of marriage, and their gang leader is the youngest daughter Durga. Kader Khan is so desperate to get his daughters married that he is ready to give a dowry of five crores to each son-in-law. Raja and Kanahaiya are small time con men at the airport. Raju Patel is an NRI from America who comes to India to get married to one of the daughters of Dhaneshwar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lqukWizp1euDvBjfx7FNFsQt5sp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:232696'),
  ('880301824297532193', 'Jory', 1973, 'Western', 'Jorge Fons, Jorge Stahl Jr.', 'Gerald Herman, Robert Irving', 'John Marley, B.J. Thomas, Robby Benson, Claudio Brook, Patricia Aspíllaga, Brad Dexter, Benny Baker, Todd Martin', null, 'Jory is a fifteen-year-old boy who joins a horse-drive after his father is killed by a drunkard. The drive''s leader and a likable cowhand take the boy under their wing, and find that tragedy has taught him how to take care of himself better than anyone could expect.', 'Jory is a fifteen-year-old boy who joins a horse-drive after his father is killed by a drunkard. The drive''s leader and a likable cowhand take the boy under their wing, and find that tragedy has taught him how to take care of himself better than anyone could expect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ga3YVCCuASwR3fSTlgKFgyKBoFR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:215398'),
  ('207549949386085748', 'José', 2020, 'Drama', 'Li Cheng, Paolo Giron', 'Li Cheng, George F. Roberson', 'Enrique Salanic, Manolo Herrera, Ana Cecilia Mota, Jhakelyn Waleska Gonzalez Gonzalez, Esteban López, Cesar Lorenzo Yojcom Candido, Juan Andres Molina Cardona, Alba Irene Lemus', null, 'José lives with his mother in Guatemala: a tough life in one of the world''s most dangerous, religious, and impoverished countries. José is her youngest and favorite child, and her life is going to church and selling sandwiches. He spends his days on crowded buses and in the streets delivering food. Resigned and aloof, in free moments he plays with his phone and looks for random sex. When he meets Luis, José is thrust into a dimension of passion and pain and self-reflection that was previously unimaginable.', 'José lives with his mother in Guatemala: a tough life in one of the world''s most dangerous, religious, and impoverished countries. José is her youngest and favorite child, and her life is going to church and selling sandwiches. He spends his days on crowded buses and in the streets delivering food. Resigned and aloof, in free moments he plays with his phone and looks for random sex. When he meets Luis, José is thrust into a dimension of passion and pain and self-reflection that was previously unimaginable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Aikhna2Q1dvosEIsH28jLzXUPAv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:539434'),
  ('43320479656569044', 'José & Pilar', 2010, 'Documentary', 'Miguel Gonçalves Mendes, Daniel Neves', null, 'José Saramago, Pilar del Río, Gael García Bernal, Gabriel García Márquez, Paco Ibáñez', null, 'A deeply moving story about love, loss and literature, this documentary follows the days of José Saramago, the Nobel-laureate Portuguese novelist, and his wife, Pilar del Río. The film shows their whirlwind life of international travel, his passion for completing his masterpiece "The Elephant''s Journey", and how their love quietly sustains them throughout.', 'A deeply moving story about love, loss and literature, this documentary follows the days of José Saramago, the Nobel-laureate Portuguese novelist, and his wife, Pilar del Río. The film shows their whirlwind life of international travel, his passion for completing his masterpiece "The Elephant''s Journey", and how their love quietly sustains them throughout.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ifK7pLn4d683YBc6mwkgs2DOvxy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94639'),
  ('516328772380298965', 'Josée', 2020, 'Romance, Drama', 'Kim Jong-kwan, Jung Hae-ji, Cho Young-jik', 'Aya Watanabe, Kim Jong-kwan', 'Han Ji-min, Nam Joo-hyuk, Heo Jin, Park Ye-jin, Jo Bok-rae, Lee So-hee, Lee Sung-wook, Kim Keum-soon', null, 'Young-seok, who feels overwhelmed and lonely in what should be his glorious youth, meets a woman who introduces herself as Josée, and they share a once-in-a-lifetime romance.', 'Young-seok, who feels overwhelmed and lonely in what should be his glorious youth, meets a woman who introduces herself as Josée, and they share a once-in-a-lifetime romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8SmPto6JQ1zTANDffKPi2yUW1YJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:602301'),
  ('327734046273357514', 'Josee, the Tiger and the Fish', 2003, 'Drama, Romance', 'Isshin Inudo, Akinori Igarashi', 'Aya Watanabe', 'Satoshi Tsumabuki, Chizuru Ikewaki, Juri Ueno, Noriko Eguchi, Hirofumi Arai, Itsuji Itao, Eiko Shinya, Koji Ohkura', null, 'A part-time employee in a mahjong parlour runs across a young woman, who is unable to walk, in baby carriage. He becomes friends with the woman and begins to feel enamoured with her.', 'A part-time employee in a mahjong parlour runs across a young woman, who is unable to walk, in baby carriage. He becomes friends with the woman and begins to feel enamoured with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1fdnR6AHQQAVNKWFSInrSxZqBxF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72443'),
  ('195045412206970098', 'Josee, the Tiger and the Fish', 2020, 'Animation, Drama, Romance', 'Takahiro Ikeda, Kazuhiro Wakabayashi, Makoto Honda', 'Sayaka Kuwamura', 'Taishi Nakagawa, Kaya Kiyohara, Yume Miyamoto, Kazuyuki Okitsu, Lynn, Chiemi Matsutera, Kanji Obana, Shintarou Moriyama', null, 'With dreams of diving abroad, Tsuneo gets a job assisting Josee, an artist whose imagination takes her far beyond her wheelchair. But when the tide turns against them, they push each other to places they never thought possible, and inspire a love fit for a storybook.', 'With dreams of diving abroad, Tsuneo gets a job assisting Josee, an artist whose imagination takes her far beyond her wheelchair. But when the tide turns against them, they push each other to places they never thought possible, and inspire a love fit for a storybook.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z1D8xi9x4uEhyFruo7uEHXUMD4K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:652837'),
  ('1025581654678992026', 'Josefa’s Return', 2024, 'Drama', 'Dirk Kummer', 'Uli Brée', 'Adele Neuhauser, Eva Mattes, Hayal Kaya, Ulrich Noethen, Riccardo Campione, Matthias Matschke, Florian Jahr, Luise Kinseher', null, 'Over 40 years ago, Josefa left her home village in a dispute. A lot has happened in the meantime. Now she returns as a mature woman to where she is still known as a man.', 'Over 40 years ago, Josefa left her home village in a dispute. A lot has happened in the meantime. Now she returns as a mature woman to where she is still known as a man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ugwasNA0KR0fflYh17cdTaXhB3C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1317113'),
  ('670897671587814957', 'Josefine M.', 1970, 'Comedy, History', 'Kurt Nachmann, Heinz Hölscher', null, 'Christine Schuberth, Renate Kasché, Kai Fischer, Bert Fortell, Uli Steigberg, Astrid Boner, Alon D''Armand, Harry Hardt', null, 'Josefine is a young streetwalker in Vienna at the turn of the 20th century. She manages to sleep her way to the top by marrying a British aristocrat, and she delights in telling ribald stories of her sordid past to moralistic prudes.', 'Josefine is a young streetwalker in Vienna at the turn of the 20th century. She manages to sleep her way to the top by marrying a British aristocrat, and she delights in telling ribald stories of her sordid past to moralistic prudes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p0oID5Cble2troUsrlONi8leSvG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:222953'),
  ('507309001961898104', 'Joselito vagabundo', 1966, 'Drama, Family, Music', 'Miguel Morayta, Manuel Merino', 'Antonio de Jaén, Miguel Morayta', 'Joselito, Sara García, David Reynoso, Miguel Ángel Álvarez, Fernando Luján, Blanca Sánchez, Cesáreo Quezadas ''Pulgarcito'', Ángel Garasa', null, 'Rene, a street urchin, is coerced by the head of a gang of thieves, Frank, who wants to force him to remain in their organization. One day, Rene meets Anita, a young aristocrat to whom Frank attempted to rob. And because she feels sympathy for him, the boy will have the opportunity to change his life and leave the country to make a deal with a rich heir, Fernando de Ponce, which proposes Rene to supplant him before his old aunt, who does not know him.', 'Rene, a street urchin, is coerced by the head of a gang of thieves, Frank, who wants to force him to remain in their organization. One day, Rene meets Anita, a young aristocrat to whom Frank attempted to rob. And because she feels sympathy for him, the boy will have the opportunity to change his life and leave the country to make a deal with a rich heir, Fernando de Ponce, which proposes Rene to supplant him before his old aunt, who does not know him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jmU2H1AEwOsh23vs6FFWYjTO1W9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110551'),
  ('583446316012597420', 'Josep', 2020, 'Animation, Drama, History', 'Juan Carlos Concha Riveros, Aurel', 'Jean-Louis Milesi', 'Sergi López, Alba Pujol, Sílvia Pérez Cruz, Valérie Lemercier, Gérard Hernandez, David Marsais, Bruno Solo, Thomas VDB', null, 'February 1939. Overwhelmed by the flood of Republicans fleeing Franco''s dictatorship, the French government''s solution consists in confining the Spanish refugees in concentration camps where they have no other choice than to build their own shelters, feed off the horses which have carried them out of their country, and die by the hundred for lack of hygiene and water... In one of these camps, two men, separated by barbwire, will become friends. One is a guard the other is Josep Bartoli (Barcelona 1910 - New York 1995), a cartoonist who fights against the Franco regime.', 'February 1939. Overwhelmed by the flood of Republicans fleeing Franco''s dictatorship, the French government''s solution consists in confining the Spanish refugees in concentration camps where they have no other choice than to build their own shelters, feed off the horses which have carried them out of their country, and die by the hundred for lack of hygiene and water... In one of these camps, two men, separated by barbwire, will become friends. One is a guard the other is Josep Bartoli (Barcelona 1910 - New York 1995), a cartoonist who fights against the Franco regime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o0pwyA3PqgqfguXUKc475SJYR2x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:680952'),
  ('900919378646210264', 'Joseph', 1995, 'Adventure, Drama, TV Movie', 'Roger Young, Raffaele Mertes', 'Lionel Chetwynd', 'Ben Kingsley, Paul Mercurio, Dominique Sanda, Lesley Ann Warren, Martin Landau, Alice Krige, Warren Clarke, Monica Bellucci', 'PG-13', 'Joseph, favored son of Jacob and great-grandson of Abraham, is sold into slavery by his jealous brothers. Rising to become prime minister of Egypt. Joseph governed the country during a seven year famine, during which his brothers visit Egypt seeking grain, only to encounter their brother, presumed long dead.', 'Joseph, favored son of Jacob and great-grandson of Abraham, is sold into slavery by his jealous brothers. Rising to become prime minister of Egypt. Joseph governed the country during a seven year famine, during which his brothers visit Egypt seeking grain, only to encounter their brother, presumed long dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lBscKQzEJY1XF2ReZT2vIGrMQ1k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2405'),
  ('895999981010246245', 'Joseph and the Amazing Technicolor Dreamcoat', 1999, 'Family', 'David Mallet, Nicky James, Dez Gray', 'Tim Rice', 'Donny Osmond, Maria Friedman, Richard Attenborough, Joan Collins, Ian McNeice, Robert Torti, Christopher Biggins, Alex Jennings', null, 'Joseph, the favored son of Jacob, is betrayed by his jealous brothers, sold into slavery, and driven to Egypt. Though beset with adversity, Joseph perseveres through wit and faith and becomes the Governor of Egypt, second only to the Pharaoh.', 'Joseph, the favored son of Jacob, is betrayed by his jealous brothers, sold into slavery, and driven to Egypt. Though beset with adversity, Joseph perseveres through wit and faith and becomes the Governor of Egypt, second only to the Pharaoh.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dUdvCUFlez1puCgzKFa5u4j5fTD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24272'),
  ('270913029724596287', 'Joseph Andrews', 1977, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Tony Richardson, Andrew Grieve, David Watkin', 'Chris Bryant, Allan Scott', 'Ann-Margret, Peter Firth, Michael Hordern, Beryl Reid, Jim Dale, Natalie Ogle, Peter Bull, Kenneth Cranham', 'R', 'Lady Booby alias ''Belle'', the lively wife of the fat landed squire Sir Thomas Booby, has a lusty eye on the attractive, intelligent villager Joseph Andrews, a Latin pupil and protégé of parson Adams, and makes him their footman. Joseph''s heart belongs to a country girl, foundling Fanny Goodwill, but his masters take him on a fashionable trip to Bath, where the spoiled society comes mainly to see and be seen, but drowns in the famous Roman baths. When the all but grieving lady finds Joseph''s Christian virtue and true love resist her lusting passes just as well as the many ladies who fancy her footman, she fires the boy. He''s found and nursed by an innkeeper''s maid, which stirs lusts there, again besides his honorable conduct, but is found by the good parson.', 'Lady Booby alias ''Belle'', the lively wife of the fat landed squire Sir Thomas Booby, has a lusty eye on the attractive, intelligent villager Joseph Andrews, a Latin pupil and protégé of parson Adams, and makes him their footman. Joseph''s heart belongs to a country girl, foundling Fanny Goodwill, but his masters take him on a fashionable trip to Bath, where the spoiled society comes mainly to see and be seen, but drowns in the famous Roman baths. When the all but grieving lady finds Joseph''s Christian virtue and true love resist her lusting passes just as well as the many ladies who fancy her footman, she fires the boy. He''s found and nursed by an innkeeper''s maid, which stirs lusts there, again besides his honorable conduct, but is found by the good parson.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bNoiWaadblEnpvDeuAV4FsK21Uw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42221'),
  ('533218857560939668', 'Joseph Kilian', 1964, 'Drama', 'Pavel Horák, Jiřina Matiasková, Zdenka Pešulová', 'Pavel Juráček, Jan Schmidt', 'Karel Vašíček, Consuela Morávková, Ivan Růžička, Pavel Bártl, Jiří Stivín, Pavel Šilhánek, Jaroslav Zrotal, Stanislav Michler', null, 'The story is about Harold, an isolated figure in an overwhelming world of totalitarian bureaucracy. Harold tries to find the elusive Joseph Kilian, an old acquaintance, in Prague. When Harold stumbles across a state-run cat-lending store, he impulsively rents a feline for the day. Later, he attempts to return the cat and finds that the store no longer exists. Now with a furry companion, Harold continues his search for Kilian. Written and directed by Pavel Juracek, this 40 minute film effectively aims its allegorical shots at personality cults and the absurdities of a totalitarian regime.', 'The story is about Harold, an isolated figure in an overwhelming world of totalitarian bureaucracy. Harold tries to find the elusive Joseph Kilian, an old acquaintance, in Prague. When Harold stumbles across a state-run cat-lending store, he impulsively rents a feline for the day. Later, he attempts to return the cat and finds that the store no longer exists. Now with a furry companion, Harold continues his search for Kilian. Written and directed by Pavel Juracek, this 40 minute film effectively aims its allegorical shots at personality cults and the absurdities of a totalitarian regime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oTecj3TOHjfxFZEooYp3NRbQBv5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151614'),
  ('669849651402981874', 'Joseph: King of Dreams', 2000, 'Family, Animation, Drama', 'Rob LaDuca, Robert C. Ramirez', 'Eugenia Bostwick-Singer, Joe Stillman, Raymond Singer', 'Ben Affleck, Mark Hamill, Richard Herd, Maureen McGovern, Jodi Benson, Judith Light, James Eckhouse, Richard McGonagle', 'G', 'In this animated retelling of the story from the Bible''s Book of Genesis, Joseph''s gift of dream interpretation and his brilliantly colored coat inspires jealousy in his brothers.', 'In this animated retelling of the story from the Bible''s Book of Genesis, Joseph''s gift of dream interpretation and his brilliantly colored coat inspires jealousy in his brothers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ou0JqPXFbQcphqkMx1grfsmeJFX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16366'),
  ('11374689823304345', 'Josephine', 2013, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Romain Winding, Agnès Obadia', 'Agnès Obadia, Samantha Mazéras', 'Marilou Berry, Mehdi Nebbou, Bérengère Krief, Charlie Dupont, Amelle Chahbi, Alice Pol, Cyril Gueï, Caroline Anglade', null, 'Josephine doesn''t like her job and keeps on having relationships without a future. Her sister and parents keep pushing her to find a good husband. To shut them up, she creates a handsome Brazilian millionaire but her little white lie has a flip side - she loses everything to find the love of her life.', 'Josephine doesn''t like her job and keeps on having relationships without a future. Her sister and parents keep pushing her to find a good husband. To shut them up, she creates a handsome Brazilian millionaire but her little white lie has a flip side - she loses everything to find the love of her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iXu2U7KUdMwahA0Wwuk83cbHZCs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:199661'),
  ('1066131263507188832', 'Josephine', 2021, 'Drama', 'Javier Marco', 'Belén Sánchez Arévalo', 'Emma Suárez, Roberto Álamo, Miguel Bernardeau, Olivia Delcán, Manolo Solo, Simón Andreu, Pedro Casablanc, Belén Ponce de León', null, 'Josefina depicts Middle Age Juan''s love angle, Juan was a prison guard and the lady he loved''s son Sergio was a prisoner in prison, and he loses his job because of his love.', 'Josefina depicts Middle Age Juan''s love angle, Juan was a prison guard and the lady he loved''s son Sergio was a prisoner in prison, and he loses his job because of his love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2FkGbxnjon6LDUFLmkDELJ5ewyf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:816706'),
  ('580914726800478801', 'Josephine', 2026, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Beth de Araújo, Laura Klein, Greta Zozula, Ava Berkofsky, Kat Hess, Cara Conaway', 'Beth de Araújo', 'Mason Reeves, Philip Ettinger, Syra McCarthy, Eleanore Pienta, Dana Millican', null, 'After eight-year-old Josephine accidentally witnesses a crime in Golden Gate Park, she begins to act out violently to protect herself. This emotional trauma leads to conflicts between her parents as they search for justice, and a way to feel safe again.', 'After eight-year-old Josephine accidentally witnesses a crime in Golden Gate Park, she begins to act out violently to protect herself. This emotional trauma leads to conflicts between her parents as they search for justice, and a way to feel safe again.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FeqMWdviWwaRahQ7QkHLpXCpqIfu.jpg', 'plex:movie:josephine-2026'),
  ('983633290283991506', 'Josephine, Pregnant & Fabulous', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Marilou Berry', 'Pénélope Bagieu, Marilou Berry', 'Marilou Berry, Mehdi Nebbou, Medi Sadoun, Sarah Suco, Vanessa Guide, Cyril Gueï, Josiane Balasko, Catherine Jacob', null, 'At last, Josephine has found her perfect non-smoker-cat-loving-amazing-cook-perfect-man-soulmate. They’ve been in love for two years and everything is peachy. Until she realizes she’s… pregnant. Time for Josephine to transform her life, mature into a responsible adult, not become like her mother, get a job, hold on to her man, refrain from falling out with her friends, and tell her sister, who''s been crashing at her place, that she''s got to move out. A bunch of overwhelming challenges that Josephine will have to face in her own, special way.', 'At last, Josephine has found her perfect non-smoker-cat-loving-amazing-cook-perfect-man-soulmate. They’ve been in love for two years and everything is peachy. Until she realizes she’s… pregnant. Time for Josephine to transform her life, mature into a responsible adult, not become like her mother, get a job, hold on to her man, refrain from falling out with her friends, and tell her sister, who''s been crashing at her place, that she''s got to move out. A bunch of overwhelming challenges that Josephine will have to face in her own, special way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bpOkrfI5EjmGMFzNzKf1njACQPU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:369780'),
  ('641731217854865817', 'Josh', 2000, 'Romance, Drama', 'K. V. Anand, Mansoor Khan, Aditi V Makim', 'Mansoor Khan, Neeraj Vora', 'Chandrachur Singh, Aishwarya Rai Bachchan, Shah Rukh Khan, Sharad S. Kapoor, Priya Gill, Sharat Saxena, Vivek Vaswani, Suhas Joshi', null, 'Two gangs fight for control of the streets: the Scorpions, led by Prakash and the Eagles, fronted by Max. When Prakash''s brother Rahul comes to visit, he meets and quickly falls in love with Shirley, not realizing she''s the sister of his brother''s rival, Max. Though Rahul tries to keep their relationship secret, it''s only a matter of time before it brings the gang rivalry to a head.', 'Two gangs fight for control of the streets: the Scorpions, led by Prakash and the Eagles, fronted by Max. When Prakash''s brother Rahul comes to visit, he meets and quickly falls in love with Shirley, not realizing she''s the sister of his brother''s rival, Max. Though Rahul tries to keep their relationship secret, it''s only a matter of time before it brings the gang rivalry to a head.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/epulB8WC1mGIEFJPZr50LVCKt6k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:131940'),
  ('1152442063630042142', 'Josh & S.A.M.', 1993, 'Adventure, Action, Comedy', 'Billy Weber, Carrie Frazier, Shani Ginsberg', 'Frank Deese', 'Jacob Tierney, Noah Fleiss, Martha Plimpton, Stephen Tobolowsky, Joan Allen, Chris Penn, Maury Chaykin, Ronald Guttman', 'PG-13', 'Josh and Sam are two brothers facing change, their mother is about to marry a French accountant and the kids are sent to go live with their father in Florida. Meanwhile, Josh tells Sam that he is a "S.A.M." that is going to be sent to Africa to fight in a war and that Canada is a safe haven for any S.A.M. unwilling to fight. Will Josh & S.A.M. make it to Canada or will they wish they should have never left home?', 'Josh and Sam are two brothers facing change, their mother is about to marry a French accountant and the kids are sent to go live with their father in Florida. Meanwhile, Josh tells Sam that he is a "S.A.M." that is going to be sent to Africa to fight in a war and that Canada is a safe haven for any S.A.M. unwilling to fight. Will Josh & S.A.M. make it to Canada or will they wish they should have never left home?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dWggqpyiZzhvpIyef5ZPB4Lsscu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48706'),
  ('1047354748443205541', 'Joshua', 1976, 'Drama, Thriller, Western', 'Larry G. Spangler', null, 'Fred Williamson, Cal Bartlett, Brenda Venus, Isela Vega, Bud Stout, Henry Kendrick, Ralph Willingham, Kathryn Jackson', 'R', 'A black soldier returns from fighting for the Union in the Civil War only to find out that his mother has been murdered by a gang of white thugs. He becomes a bounty hunter, determined to track down and kill the men who killed his mother.', 'A black soldier returns from fighting for the Union in the Civil War only to find out that his mother has been murdered by a gang of white thugs. He becomes a bounty hunter, determined to track down and kill the men who killed his mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c6461HtKSlZWrVqDubGZUL56Iue.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79688'),
  ('661299209595807330', 'Joshua', 2007, 'Drama, Thriller, Horror', 'George Ratliff, Benoît Debie', 'George Ratliff, David Gilbert', 'Sam Rockwell, Vera Farmiga, Jacob Kogan, Celia Weston, Dallas Roberts, Michael McKean, Randy Ryan, Nancy Giles', 'R', 'The arrival of a newborn girl causes the gradual disintegration of the Cairn family; particularly for 9-year-old Joshua, an eccentric boy whose proper upbringing and refined tastes both take a sinister turn.', 'The arrival of a newborn girl causes the gradual disintegration of the Cairn family; particularly for 9-year-old Joshua, an eccentric boy whose proper upbringing and refined tastes both take a sinister turn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/91yHfa0apWqMr8HmuwUPrVKYuDR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5956'),
  ('988016998726916531', 'Joshua and the Promised Land', 2004, 'Animation, Adventure, Family, Fantasy', 'Jim Lion, Jim Lion', 'Jim Lion', 'Jonathan Dauermann, Kerry Orrman, Harland Greene, Jim Lion, Nick Vetter, Gail Archer, Josef Gatling, Jon Mozenda', 'NR', '“Joshua and the Promised Land” comes as a heartwarming tale for the whole family in the tradition of C.S. Lewis and J.R.R. Tolkien – about the courage one learns from trusting God – and as a result, finding the ability to overcome many of life’s problems. Join young Joshua Carter on an epic dream-adventure – from the parting of the Red Sea as the Hebrews escape from Egypt, through forty years in the wilderness, finally to the fall of the sinful city of Jericho.', '“Joshua and the Promised Land” comes as a heartwarming tale for the whole family in the tradition of C.S. Lewis and J.R.R. Tolkien – about the courage one learns from trusting God – and as a result, finding the ability to overcome many of life’s problems. Join young Joshua Carter on an epic dream-adventure – from the parting of the Red Sea as the Hebrews escape from Egypt, through forty years in the wilderness, finally to the fall of the sinful city of Jericho.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nyv2rXXdTrtAUpCEqRqFpYTtmiV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:412823'),
  ('25425017229561090', 'Joshua Then and Now', 1985, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Ted Kotcheff, David Bailey, François Protat', 'Mordecai Richler', 'James Woods, Gabrielle Lazure, Alan Arkin, Robert Joy, Michael Sarrazin, Linda Sorensen, Alan Scarfe, Alexander Knox', null, 'Based on a novel by Mordecai Richler, allegedly his autobiography, it tells the story of a Jewish writer, from his life as a young boy in Montreal to his more complicated grown-up life.', 'Based on a novel by Mordecai Richler, allegedly his autobiography, it tells the story of a Jewish writer, from his life as a young boy in Montreal to his more complicated grown-up life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hemwTJfxeffxfl51av6PvFTSMgX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:187219'),
  ('539318773736381504', 'Joshua Tree', 1993, 'Action', 'Vic Armstrong, Daniel L. Turrett, George Pattison', 'Steven Pressfield', 'Dolph Lundgren, Kristian Alfonso, George Segal, Geoffrey Lewis, Beau Starr, Michelle Phillips, Matt Battaglia, Bert Remsen', 'R', 'A Los Angeles police detective tracks a fugitive who heads for the desert with a deputy sheriff as hostage.', 'A Los Angeles police detective tracks a fugitive who heads for the desert with a deputy sheriff as hostage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kKYMrf2iwyyBYbGYnzPVWV8LXUQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26127'),
  ('689789293716169301', 'Joshua: Teenager vs. Superpower', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Joe Piscatella', null, 'Joshua Wong, Agnes Chow', null, 'When the Chinese Communist Party backtracks on its promise of autonomy to Hong Kong, teenager Joshua Wong decides to save his city. Rallying thousands of kids to skip school and occupy the streets, Joshua becomes an unlikely leader in Hong Kong and one of China’s most notorious dissidents.', 'When the Chinese Communist Party backtracks on its promise of autonomy to Hong Kong, teenager Joshua Wong decides to save his city. Rallying thousands of kids to skip school and occupy the streets, Joshua becomes an unlikely leader in Hong Kong and one of China’s most notorious dissidents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v9IW1YPkk8urwhsqmSJ8iiKUvA2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:433084'),
  ('1094792844384844672', 'Joshy', 2016, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Jeff Baena, Patrice Lucien Cochet', 'Jeff Baena', 'Thomas Middleditch, Adam Pally, Alex Ross Perry, Nick Kroll, Jenny Slate, Aubrey Plaza, Alison Brie, Brett Gelman', 'R', 'After his engagement ends badly, Josh decides to take advantage of his bachelor-party plans in Ojai, California, with the few friends still willing to join him. Focused on drugs and their own hangups, his self-absorbed friends refuse to confront the elephant in the room and ask Josh how he’s feeling. As welcome and unwelcome guests stop by, Josh will attempt to find some closure over this weekend with the guys.', 'After his engagement ends badly, Josh decides to take advantage of his bachelor-party plans in Ojai, California, with the few friends still willing to join him. Focused on drugs and their own hangups, his self-absorbed friends refuse to confront the elephant in the room and ask Josh how he’s feeling. As welcome and unwelcome guests stop by, Josh will attempt to find some closure over this weekend with the guys.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qccbXBSGXopEmDN9BoFeWV5EgDA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:352695'),
  ('836313679897315846', 'Josie', 2018, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Eric England, Zoë White', 'Anthony Ragnone II', 'Sophie Turner, Dylan McDermott, Jack Kilmer, Daeg Faerch, Lombardo Boyar, Robin Bartlett, Kurt Fuller, George Todd McLachlan', null, 'Everyone knows everyone in the southern town of Baymont. So when tattooed, sweet-talking Josie struts into town, heads turn. Striking up relationships with young punk Gator and loner Hank, she quickly becomes a hot topic of local gossip.', 'Everyone knows everyone in the southern town of Baymont. So when tattooed, sweet-talking Josie struts into town, heads turn. Striking up relationships with young punk Gator and loner Hank, she quickly becomes a hot topic of local gossip.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sXwATbG3eJjkteGh1YaqV1PGeGb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:414187'),
  ('383802046893489452', 'Josie and the Pussycats', 2001, 'Comedy, Music', 'Deborah Kaplan, Harry Elfont, Matthew Libatique', 'Deborah Kaplan, Harry Elfont', 'Rachael Leigh Cook, Rosario Dawson, Tara Reid, Alan Cumming, Parker Posey, Gabriel Mann, Paulo Costanzo, Missi Pyle', 'PG-13', 'Josie, Melody and Val are three small-town girl musicians determined to take their rock band out of their garage and straight to the top, while remaining true to their look, style and sound. They get a record deal which brings fame and fortune but soon realize they are pawns of two people who want to control the youth of America. They must clear their names, even if it means losing fame and fortune.', 'Josie, Melody and Val are three small-town girl musicians determined to take their rock band out of their garage and straight to the top, while remaining true to their look, style and sound. They get a record deal which brings fame and fortune but soon realize they are pawns of two people who want to control the youth of America. They must clear their names, even if it means losing fame and fortune.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dYwbqjnSFsvCGok8gsqRcY8ewTU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19366'),
  ('125548354022989663', 'Jossy''s', 2014, 'Science Fiction, Action, Comedy', 'Yuichi Fukuda, Kazuaki Yoshizawa', 'Yuichi Fukuda', 'Mirei Kiritani, Mitsuki Takahata, Mizuki Yamamoto, Mina Fujii, Kasumi Arimura, Shunsuke Daitoh, Yoshinori Okada, Sarutoki Minagawa', null, 'To battle a malicious monster, five women are gathered in front of Commander Charles against their will. The five women are selected because they each have a family name that represents a color. The five women are filled with doubts about what they are able to do collectively, but they go up against the monster using their lethal technique "Women Tornado". The five women can only use the "Women Tornado" when they are all gathered together.', 'To battle a malicious monster, five women are gathered in front of Commander Charles against their will. The five women are selected because they each have a family name that represents a color. The five women are filled with doubts about what they are able to do collectively, but they go up against the monster using their lethal technique "Women Tornado". The five women can only use the "Women Tornado" when they are all gathered together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a5A5SffM4m2wQWHXXRm1b4OqMml.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:254304'),
  ('787396269286407906', 'Joulubileet', 1996, 'Comedy', 'Jari Halonen, Lotta Ora, Timo Heinänen', 'Jari Halonen', 'Jorma Tommila, Antti Reini, Rauno Juvonen, Oiva Lohtander, Sari Havas, Jari Halonen, Maija-Liisa Peuhu, Jukka Kärkkäinen', null, 'A story of Mike, just out of prison, and his buddies throwing a Christmas party under the most obscure circumstances is filled with juicy dialogue and plot twists that will definitely make your jaw drop – and have you chuckle for days after.', 'A story of Mike, just out of prison, and his buddies throwing a Christmas party under the most obscure circumstances is filled with juicy dialogue and plot twists that will definitely make your jaw drop – and have you chuckle for days after.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nBTDWA54R0heqyjtyyMMxF55PiF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:231472'),
  ('821437180954670260', 'Jour de Fête', 1949, 'Comedy', 'Jacques Mercanton, Jacques Tati', 'Henri Marquet, René Wheeler, Jacques Tati', 'Jacques Tati, Guy Decomble, Paul Frankeur, Santa Relli, Maine Vallée, Roger Rafal, Jacques Beauvais, Delcassan', null, 'Jour de Fête tells the story of an inept and easily-distracted French mailman who frequently interrupts his duties to converse with the local inhabitants, as well as inspect the traveling fair that has come to his small community. Influenced by too much wine and a newsreel account of rapid transportation methods used by the United States postal system, he goes to hilarious lengths to speed the delivery of mail while aboard his bicycle.', 'Jour de Fête tells the story of an inept and easily-distracted French mailman who frequently interrupts his duties to converse with the local inhabitants, as well as inspect the traveling fair that has come to his small community. Influenced by too much wine and a newsreel account of rapid transportation methods used by the United States postal system, he goes to hilarious lengths to speed the delivery of mail while aboard his bicycle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x1wwNdrBywcmZSfIsO8qcaZxYWR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4595'),
  ('24593416044137548', 'Jour de gloire', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Cosme Castro, Jeanne Frenkel', 'Cosme Castro, Jeanne Frenkel', 'Félix Moati, Julien Campani, Julia Faure, Kamel Abdessadok, Anne Loiret', null, 'April 24, 2022, second round of the French presidential election. Felix, who has been living in Melbourne for several years, returns to his childhood village in Lot-et-Garonne after the death of his mother to deal with administrative matters, and with the firm intention of voting against Marine Le Pen. He is welcomed by Julien, his older brother, who has remained in the family home. Despite the past complicity and the emotion of the reunion, many things now oppose them', 'April 24, 2022, second round of the French presidential election. Felix, who has been living in Melbourne for several years, returns to his childhood village in Lot-et-Garonne after the death of his mother to deal with administrative matters, and with the firm intention of voting against Marine Le Pen. He is welcomed by Julien, his older brother, who has remained in the family home. Despite the past complicity and the emotion of the reunion, many things now oppose them', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2VR3ESst2XFVC7IVU7KG05GOd9z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:956166'),
  ('975152006924937449', 'Journal de France', 2012, 'Documentary', 'Raymond Depardon, Claudine Nougaret', null, 'Raymond Depardon, Claudine Nougaret', null, 'A journal, a voyage through time. He photographs France, she rediscovers the unseen footage he has so carefully kept: his first steps behind the camera, his TV reports from around the world, snatches of their memories and of our history.', 'A journal, a voyage through time. He photographs France, she rediscovers the unseen footage he has so carefully kept: his first steps behind the camera, his TV reports from around the world, snatches of their memories and of our history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mgZskKHdF88epwiEuLZhHc3SLMn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126326'),
  ('381897084607729861', 'Journal of a Crime', 1934, 'Crime, Thriller', 'William Keighley, Ernest Haller', 'Charles Kenyon, F. Hugh Herbert', 'Ruth Chatterton, Adolphe Menjou, Claire Dodd, George Barbier, Douglass Dumbrille, Noel Madison, Henry O''Neill, Phillip Reed', null, 'A woman murders her husband''s mistress and someone else gets accused of the crime.', 'A woman murders her husband''s mistress and someone else gets accused of the crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qelKPaCQP5dEGqANxnsnlEqxt9X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:188463'),
  ('332385987229398114', 'Journey 2: The Mysterious Island', 2012, 'Adventure, Action, Science Fiction', 'Brad Peyton, David Tattersall, John Hockridge', 'Mark Gunn, Brian Gunn', 'Dwayne Johnson, Josh Hutcherson, Vanessa Hudgens, Luis Guzmán, Michael Caine, Kristin Davis, Anna Colwell, Stephen Caudill', 'PG', 'Sean Anderson partners with his mom''s boyfriend on a mission to find his grandfather, who is thought to be missing on a mythical island.', 'Sean Anderson partners with his mom''s boyfriend on a mission to find his grandfather, who is thought to be missing on a mythical island.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uFm2vnp9LhHx5MNo1Ego6O3vUhl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72545'),
  ('59320575094287670', 'Journey Back to Christmas', 2016, 'Drama, Family, TV Movie', 'Pieter Stathis, Mel Damski', 'Maria Nation', 'Candace Cameron Bure, Oliver Hudson, Tom Skerritt, Brooke Nevin, Meghan Heffern, Gwynyth Walsh, Raven Stewart, Claire Rankin', 'G', 'WWII has ended and Hanna is still grieving over her husband''s disappearance. When the Christmas Comet appears for the first time in 70 years, Hanna is caught in a terrible storm and knocked unconscious. When she wakes up, she''s in 2016.', 'WWII has ended and Hanna is still grieving over her husband''s disappearance. When the Christmas Comet appears for the first time in 70 years, Hanna is caught in a terrible storm and knocked unconscious. When she wakes up, she''s in 2016.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5N6QVpPHkNhc1ba6HAaNRwi8B2M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:421758'),
  ('514989779105410999', 'Journey Back to Oz', 1972, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy', 'Hal Sutherland', 'Fred Ladd, Norm Prescott', 'Liza Minnelli, Paul Lynde, Ethel Merman, Milton Berle, Mickey Rooney, Danny Thomas, Herschel Bernardi, Paul Ford', 'G', 'Dorothy and Toto return to Oz to find the Scarecrow ruling the Emerald City. Unfortunately for the new overseer, the wicked Mombi is conspiring to take over the city. With the help of the Tin Woodsman, the Cowardly Lion and other familiar friends, Dorothy sets out to save Oz.', 'Dorothy and Toto return to Oz to find the Scarecrow ruling the Emerald City. Unfortunately for the new overseer, the wicked Mombi is conspiring to take over the city. With the help of the Tin Woodsman, the Cowardly Lion and other familiar friends, Dorothy sets out to save Oz.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bX9rBErQllVx1rKezflwPDvstda.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:187542'),
  ('1180521416984878', 'Journey for Margaret', 1942, 'Drama, War', 'W.S. Van Dyke, Ray June', 'David Hertz, William Ludwig', 'Robert Young, Laraine Day, Fay Bainter, Nigel Bruce, Margaret O''Brien, William Severn, Elisabeth Risdon, Doris Lloyd', null, 'An American newspaperman and his wife, end up in London after several retreats in the opening days of WWII. After a shrapnel wound and loss of her baby she returns to America. War weary, he is forced to do a story about war orphans, where he meets Margaret.', 'An American newspaperman and his wife, end up in London after several retreats in the opening days of WWII. After a shrapnel wound and loss of her baby she returns to America. War weary, he is forced to do a story about war orphans, where he meets Margaret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qyxboyhOo8d8LBgCDH3FEAv2QWF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43526'),
  ('789330091110942279', 'Journey from Greece', 2017, 'Drama, Music', 'Patrick Ghiringhelli, Tony Gatlif', 'Tony Gatlif', 'Daphné Patakia, Maryne Cayon, Simon Abkarian, Kimon Kouris, Yannis Bostantzoglou, Solon Lekkas, Eleftheria Komi, Seray Yalçin', null, 'Djam, a young Greek woman, is sent to Istanbul by her uncle Kakourgos, a former sailor with a passion for Rebetiko, to find a rare part that will repair their boat. In Istanbul, she encounters Avril, a nineteen-year-old French girl, alone and without any money, who came to Turkey as a voluntary worker with refugees. Djam, generous, cheeky, unpredictable, and free-spirited, takes Avril under her wing on the way to Mytilene. A journey filled with encounters, music, sharing, and hope.', 'Djam, a young Greek woman, is sent to Istanbul by her uncle Kakourgos, a former sailor with a passion for Rebetiko, to find a rare part that will repair their boat. In Istanbul, she encounters Avril, a nineteen-year-old French girl, alone and without any money, who came to Turkey as a voluntary worker with refugees. Djam, generous, cheeky, unpredictable, and free-spirited, takes Avril under her wing on the way to Mytilene. A journey filled with encounters, music, sharing, and hope.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6X3jTD0Ct6mUpXcl6HNYedyiVDj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:463633'),
  ('183927353690776906', 'Journey into Fear', 1943, 'Thriller, War', 'Norman Foster, Karl Struss', 'Joseph Cotten, Orson Welles', 'Joseph Cotten, Dolores del Río, Ruth Warrick, Agnes Moorehead, Orson Welles, Everett Sloane, Jack Durant, Eustace Wyatt', 'NR', 'An American ballistics expert in Turkey finds himself targeted by Nazi agents. Safe passage home by ship is arranged for him, but he soon discovers that his pursuers are also on board.', 'An American ballistics expert in Turkey finds himself targeted by Nazi agents. Safe passage home by ship is arranged for him, but he soon discovers that his pursuers are also on board.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2VVW1rCSHYW5n1IV7dhDoWa4OCT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21366'),
  ('261366751434898001', 'Journey into Fear', 1975, 'Thriller', 'Daniel Mann, Harry Waxman', 'Trevor Wallace', 'Sam Waterston, Zero Mostel, Yvette Mimieux, Ian McShane, Joseph Wiseman, Scott Marlowe, Shelley Winters, Stanley Holloway', 'R', 'U.S geologist discovers something about Oil that proves VERY threatening to the Turkish and Arab business people.', 'U.S geologist discovers something about Oil that proves VERY threatening to the Turkish and Arab business people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hpwhvnefWCqcfSjkmSqkoKf2GJE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:200331'),
  ('89506047279146798', 'Journey Into the Depth of the Student''s Soul', 1939, 'Comedy', 'Martin Frič, Rudolf Stahl, Eduard Šimáček', 'Jaroslav Žák, Jan Kaplan, Martin Frič', 'Jindřich Plachta, Jaroslav Průcha, Jaroslav Marvan, Miloš Nedbal, František Kreuzmann, Jarmila Holmová, Ludvík Veverka, František Vnouček', null, 'Small stories from a grammar school.', 'Small stories from a grammar school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xy6bnyk6XPr8SDWk0WWdMuOB8mC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47710'),
  ('252205229445410602', 'Journey into the Night', 1921, 'Drama', 'F. W. Murnau, Max Lutze', 'Carl Mayer', 'Olaf Fønss, Erna Morena, Conrad Veidt, Gudrun Bruun Stephensen, Clementine Plessner', null, 'Dr. Egil Börne, an eminent physician, comes under the spell of an unscrupulous cabaret dancer and deserts his fiancée. The plot finds echoes throughout the Weimar period, including Sternberg’s The Blue Angel. Conrad Veidt appears in a supporting role as a sinister blind painter, whose entrance eerily presages Murnau’s Nosferatu. Der Gang in die Nacht, the earliest surviving film by F. W. Murnau, is also, paradoxically, the only Murnau film for which the original camera negative exists.', 'Dr. Egil Börne, an eminent physician, comes under the spell of an unscrupulous cabaret dancer and deserts his fiancée. The plot finds echoes throughout the Weimar period, including Sternberg’s The Blue Angel. Conrad Veidt appears in a supporting role as a sinister blind painter, whose entrance eerily presages Murnau’s Nosferatu. Der Gang in die Nacht, the earliest surviving film by F. W. Murnau, is also, paradoxically, the only Murnau film for which the original camera negative exists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p8YTVpLBJsJAUro6f42gvxig8Um.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:175422'),
  ('8507939976559202', 'Journey of Honor', 1991, 'Drama, Action, Adventure', 'Gordon Hessler, John T. Connor', 'Nelson Gidding, Sho Kosugi', 'Sho Kosugi, David Essex, Kane Kosugi, Christopher Lee, Norman Lloyd, Ronald Pickup, John Rhys-Davies, Polly Walker', null, 'The son of a besieged Shogun in war-torn 17th century Japan travels to Spain to buy weaponry from the king.', 'The son of a besieged Shogun in war-torn 17th century Japan travels to Spain to buy weaponry from the king.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uEQwAigG53GBlKY19GB2RQ8lY1I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40789'),
  ('1072404117978043959', 'Journey of Hope', 1990, 'Drama', 'Xavier Koller, Elemér Ragályi', 'Feride Çiçekoğlu, Xavier Koller', 'Nur Sürer, Necmettin Çobanoğlu, Emin Sivas, Yaman Okay, Sebastiano Filocamo, Dietmar Schönherr, Mathias Gnädinger, Andrea Zogg', null, 'In a village in eastern Turkey, tales of the economic success of Turks in Switzerland inspire Haydar to convince his wife Meryem that they must go. He sells their livestock and small plot of land in exchange for passage for two. He wants to leave their seven children in the care of the eldest and his parents; his father advises him to take one son to be educated in Europe. Will anyone reach the land of promise?', 'In a village in eastern Turkey, tales of the economic success of Turks in Switzerland inspire Haydar to convince his wife Meryem that they must go. He sells their livestock and small plot of land in exchange for passage for two. He wants to leave their seven children in the care of the eldest and his parents; his father advises him to take one son to be educated in Europe. Will anyone reach the land of promise?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dbNpWp7sGGIN2Qk8v10oxvNKFfq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41834'),
  ('465980509615142587', 'Journey of My Heart', 2021, 'TV Movie, Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Sean Cox, Lucie Guest', 'Bruce D. Johnson', 'Rhiannon Fish, Darien Martin, Grace Dove, Paul C. Grenier, Bethany Brown, Marion Eisman, Dan Payne, Riun Garner', 'G', 'Abby, a wildlife biologist, travels to remote Alaska where she finds inspirational guidance from a Native American family and possible romance from a rugged wilderness guide.', 'Abby, a wildlife biologist, travels to remote Alaska where she finds inspirational guidance from a Native American family and possible romance from a rugged wilderness guide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gmcWVAKTJnbNXP9lmKYG82as4EQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:866275'),
  ('784240388453817553', 'Journey on a Clock Hand', 1997, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Ömer Kavur, Erdal Kahraman', null, 'Mehmet Aslantuğ, Şahika Tekand, Tuncel Kurtiz, Aytaç Arman, Nüvit Özdoğru, Rana Cabbar, Macit Koper, Kenan Bal', null, 'A Turkish watchmaker is employed to mend a village clock that has not worked for some seven years. However, what seems like a simple and un-exciting task is plunged into a web of mystery and intrigue when the watchmaker innocently witnesses the murder of a beautiful woman on his first day in the village.', 'A Turkish watchmaker is employed to mend a village clock that has not worked for some seven years. However, what seems like a simple and un-exciting task is plunged into a web of mystery and intrigue when the watchmaker innocently witnesses the murder of a beautiful woman on his first day in the village.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kkuwFe88GJX5E5sBvjsLtVKTV7F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:287177'),
  ('319004098189280', 'Journey Through China', 2015, 'Drama', 'Zoltan Mayer, Georges Lechaptois', 'Zoltan Mayer', 'Yolande Moreau, Lin Dongfu, Liu Lingzi, Dong Qing, Yilin Yang, André Wilms, Li Chenwei, Geneviève Casile', null, 'Liliane, a provincial nurse in her peaceful fifties, must cope with the accidental death of her son in China. She decides to fly there in order to repatriate the body. This mourning journey will soon turn out to be a trip of discovery of her son whom she didn''t see for years and a trip to make a fresh start through the insight of a new culture.', 'Liliane, a provincial nurse in her peaceful fifties, must cope with the accidental death of her son in China. She decides to fly there in order to repatriate the body. This mourning journey will soon turn out to be a trip of discovery of her son whom she didn''t see for years and a trip to make a fresh start through the insight of a new culture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bwxB8MiB5b4rW6SlIJRHqHihYOy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:331112'),
  ('1089263844105162340', 'Journey to a Mother''s Room', 2018, 'Drama', 'Celia Rico Clavellino, Santiago Racaj', 'Celia Rico Clavellino', 'Lola Dueñas, Anna Castillo, Pedro Casablanc, Adelfa Calvo, Marisol Membrillo, Ana Mena', null, 'The movie about a daughter, who leaves home for the first time. Her mother, left behind, doesn''t know how to fill the empty place.', 'The movie about a daughter, who leaves home for the first time. Her mother, left behind, doesn''t know how to fill the empty place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/68iONxNT2eEcel6Fu9IyLO5dWdQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:533989'),
  ('351652522176447475', 'Journey to Bethlehem', 2023, 'Family, Drama', 'Adam Anders', 'Peter Barsocchini, Adam Anders', 'Fiona Palomo, Milo Manheim, Omid Djalili, Rizwan Manji, Geno Segers, Moriah Peters, Joel Smallbone, Lecrae', 'PG', 'A young woman carrying an unimaginable responsibility. A young man torn between love and honor. A jealous king who will stop at nothing to keep his crown.', 'A young woman carrying an unimaginable responsibility. A young man torn between love and honor. A jealous king who will stop at nothing to keep his crown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cJgF1vjiNoRAh5UePmiPfjrw6Iv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1092329'),
  ('1150002298324643940', 'Journey to Greenland', 2016, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Sébastien Betbeder', 'Sébastien Betbeder', 'Thomas Blanchard, Thomas Scimeca, François Chattot, Ole Eliassen, Adam Eskildsen, Benedikte Eliassen, Mathias Petersen, Judith Henry', null, 'Thomas and Thomas are going through a rough patch: they are both thirty-something actors living in Paris. They randomly decide to leave the city and fly away to Kullorsuaq, one of the most remote villages of Greenland, where Thomas'' father Nathan lives. Among the Inuit community, they will discover the charms of the local customs and their friendship will be challenged.', 'Thomas and Thomas are going through a rough patch: they are both thirty-something actors living in Paris. They randomly decide to leave the city and fly away to Kullorsuaq, one of the most remote villages of Greenland, where Thomas'' father Nathan lives. Among the Inuit community, they will discover the charms of the local customs and their friendship will be challenged.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aVHA9WrWlTudWzfGY0gKAM1ghKY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:396920'),
  ('1108575996263429424', 'Journey to Italy', 1954, 'Drama, Romance', 'Roberto Rossellini, Enzo Serafin, Marcello Caracciolo Di Laurino', 'Roberto Rossellini, Vitaliano Brancati', 'Ingrid Bergman, George Sanders, Jackie Frost, Maria Mauban, Anna Proclemer, Leslie Daniels, Natalia Ray, Paul Müller', 'NR', 'Married for eight years with no children, Brits Katherine and Alex Joyce are driving to Italy, their ultimate destination just outside of Naples to sell the villa they have just inherited from his uncle, the villa where they will be staying during their time there. On the drive, they come to the realization that this trip marks the first time that they have truly been alone together, and as such don''t really know one another in the true sense.', 'Married for eight years with no children, Brits Katherine and Alex Joyce are driving to Italy, their ultimate destination just outside of Naples to sell the villa they have just inherited from his uncle, the villa where they will be staying during their time there. On the drive, they come to the realization that this trip marks the first time that they have truly been alone together, and as such don''t really know one another in the true sense.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d470qCzer5cTLRdeN0iTCQCJiOc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2748'),
  ('1088842120186769715', 'Journey to Mars', 2005, 'Animation, Adventure', 'Juan Pablo Zaramella, Juan Pablo Zaramella, Silvina Cornillon', 'Mario Rulloni, Juan Pablo Zaramella', 'Joaquin Alsamendi Sorio, Mario Rulloni, Adolfo Stambulsky, Berta Doureff, Maria Cristina Bocca, Hilda Pietra, Maria Eugenia Vallet, Juan Pablo D''Aqui', null, 'Journey to Mars (Viaje a Marte) is an animated stop motion short film. This independent production, which was made in Argentina, is the result of two years hard work. Since then, it has won 50 awards in different festivals around the world, competing in many cases against real action productions. The short tells the story of Antonio, a boy from the 60s, who is a great fan of science fiction tv serials and space trips. In view of the child''s passion, his grandfather decides to take him to Mars in his tow truck.', 'Journey to Mars (Viaje a Marte) is an animated stop motion short film. This independent production, which was made in Argentina, is the result of two years hard work. Since then, it has won 50 awards in different festivals around the world, competing in many cases against real action productions. The short tells the story of Antonio, a boy from the 60s, who is a great fan of science fiction tv serials and space trips. In view of the child''s passion, his grandfather decides to take him to Mars in his tow truck.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p42nT2CNXjirDvVxBZ8FLkQEddC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46692'),
  ('673803973961349944', 'Journey to Portugal', 2011, 'Romance, Drama', 'Sérgio Tréfaut, Edgar Moura', 'Sérgio Tréfaut', 'Maria de Medeiros, Isabel Ruth, Makena Diop, Jorge Barros, Mykola Chaban, Rebeca Close, João Pedro Bénard, José Wallenstein', null, 'Maria, a Ukrainian doctor, comes to Portugal to spend a year with Greco, her husband who is also a doctor. Upon arrival at Faro airport she is the only person from Kiev approached by agents of Immigration and Customs that lead her to a room of interrogation, without any explanations. All this occurs because the authorities suspect that something illegal should be behind her trip, since she is from Eastern Europe and her husband is Senegalese.', 'Maria, a Ukrainian doctor, comes to Portugal to spend a year with Greco, her husband who is also a doctor. Upon arrival at Faro airport she is the only person from Kiev approached by agents of Immigration and Customs that lead her to a room of interrogation, without any explanations. All this occurs because the authorities suspect that something illegal should be behind her trip, since she is from Eastern Europe and her husband is Senegalese.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qzSWXqUKAXMTIxpbbBKjFk0EqCS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109260'),
  ('105220016129186242', 'Journey to Saturn', 2008, 'Action, Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Thorbjørn Christoffersen, Kresten Vestbjerg Andersen', 'Nikolaj Arcel', 'Casper Christensen, Frank Hvam, Ali Kazim, Iben Hjejle, Peter Belli, Lars Hjortshøj, Simon Jul Jørgensen, Klaus Bondam', null, 'A Danish crew of misfits travel to Saturn in search for natural resources. However, the planet is colonized by a ruthless army of Aliens that turn their eye on Earth and invade Denmark. Thus, the crew change their mission to liberate Denmark.', 'A Danish crew of misfits travel to Saturn in search for natural resources. However, the planet is colonized by a ruthless army of Aliens that turn their eye on Earth and invade Denmark. Thus, the crew change their mission to liberate Denmark.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lB8iKvq6UTDvp1C60JcALvdH1gX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16016'),
  ('628929947446020732', 'Journey to Shiloh', 1968, 'Drama, War, Western', 'Jack Doran, William Hale, Enzo A. Martinelli', 'Gene L. Coon', 'James Caan, Michael Sarrazin, Brenda Scott, Don Stroud, Paul Petersen, Michael Burns, Jan-Michael Vincent, Harrison Ford', 'NR', 'At the beginning of the Civil War, seven friends embark on a cross-country journey in order to join the Confederate army.', 'At the beginning of the Civil War, seven friends embark on a cross-country journey in order to join the Confederate army.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eiBcYW3ZcwbOSJk3FD2wMC6OQqJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79863'),
  ('1150653324850370731', 'Journey to the Beginning of Time', 1955, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Family', 'Karel Zeman, Antonín Horák, Václav Pazderník', 'Karel Zeman, J. A. Novotný', 'Vladimír Bejval, Petr Herrmann, Josef Lukáš, Zdeněk Husták, Bedřich Šetena', null, 'Four schoolboys go on an awe-inspiring expedition back through time, where they behold landscapes and creatures that have long since vanished from the earth.', 'Four schoolboys go on an awe-inspiring expedition back through time, where they behold landscapes and creatures that have long since vanished from the earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yKWg2fPLAyz3DQ00T4bYTZTm7SQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8779'),
  ('1106055286038062327', 'Journey to the Beyond', 1980, 'Horror', 'Sebastià d''Arbó, Fernando Cobo', 'Jean Daniela Colbor, Sebastià d''Arbó', 'Narciso Ibáñez Menta, Emilio Gutiérrez Caba, Ramiro Oliveros, Berta Cabré, Ovidi Montllor, Antonio Molino Rojo, Rosa Morata, Carlos Martos', null, 'A doctor in parapsychology invites some people to their mansion. They all have lived some kind of paranormal experiences.', 'A doctor in parapsychology invites some people to their mansion. They all have lived some kind of paranormal experiences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dE7fjYjQ96fCzu2yCTWDR5iSIOD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:314977'),
  ('3760914685292152', 'Journey to the Center of the Earth', 1959, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Family', 'Leo Tover, Henry Levin, Hal Herman', 'Walter Reisch, Charles Brackett', 'James Mason, Arlene Dahl, Pat Boone, Peter Ronson, Thayer David, Diane Baker, Alan Napier, Ben Wright', 'G', 'An Edinburgh professor and assorted colleagues follow an explorer''s trail down an extinct Icelandic volcano to the earth''s center.', 'An Edinburgh professor and assorted colleagues follow an explorer''s trail down an extinct Icelandic volcano to the earth''s center.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nWn9MRFkC1M13hVf17mT0BfYKbg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11571'),
  ('1083753234523833206', 'Journey to the Center of the Earth', 1988, 'Fantasy, Action, Science Fiction, Family', 'Albert Pyun, Rusty Lemorande, Tom Fraser', 'Debra Ricci, Sandra Berg, Albert Pyun', 'Emo Philips, Paul Carafotes, Jaclyn Bernstein, Kathy Ireland, Janie du Plessis, Nicola Cowper, Lochner De Kock, Ilan Mitchell-Smith', 'PG', 'An English nanny and one of two brothers fall down a Hawaiian cave, all the way to Atlantis.', 'An English nanny and one of two brothers fall down a Hawaiian cave, all the way to Atlantis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yHjOfJ0WMYWdH9iY7Us9GXD4p9n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:122894'),
  ('807151977954344144', 'Journey to the Center of the Earth', 1993, 'Adventure, TV Movie, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'William Dear, Ronald Víctor García', 'David Mickey Evans, Robert Gunter', 'David Dundara, Kim Miyori, John Neville, Jeffrey Nordling, Tim Russ, Carel Struycken, Fabiana Udenio, Justina Vail Evans', null, 'This made-for-TV film version uses the title and general premise of Jules Verne''s novel, but had its heroes carry out the journey in an earth-penetrating machine. A television series was supposed to follow, but was never produced. Cast includes John Neville, F. Murray Abraham and Kim Miyori.', 'This made-for-TV film version uses the title and general premise of Jules Verne''s novel, but had its heroes carry out the journey in an earth-penetrating machine. A television series was supposed to follow, but was never produced. Cast includes John Neville, F. Murray Abraham and Kim Miyori.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5NYLJdcmgNamWzEomppp2NGgjPv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:257001'),
  ('1054086471030835326', 'Journey to the Center of the Earth', 2008, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction, Fantasy', 'Davey Jones, Scott D. Wheeler', 'Davey Jones, Jules Verne', 'Dedee Pfeiffer, Greg Evigan, Vanessa Evigan, Jennifer Dorogi, Sara Tomko, Caroline Attwood, Leah Grimsson, Jason S. Gray', 'PG-13', 'When an accident leaves a group of researchers trapped beneath the earth''s crust, it''s up to a drill team, led by Joseph Harnet, to rescue them. But once underground, the team discovers a mysterious -- and horrifying -- subterranean universe.', 'When an accident leaves a group of researchers trapped beneath the earth''s crust, it''s up to a drill team, led by Joseph Harnet, to rescue them. But once underground, the team discovers a mysterious -- and horrifying -- subterranean universe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/on6hrhmind13nVHVtk8M6IepEjh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45361'),
  ('97709454496853955', 'Journey to the Center of Time', 1967, 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Fantasy', 'David L. Hewitt', null, 'Scott Brady, Anthony Eisley, Abraham Sofaer, Gigi Perreau, Austin Green, Poupée Gamin, Tracy Olsen, Andy Davis', 'NR', 'Scientists must prove their time travel experiments can produce results, so their funding won''t be cut off. They push their equipment, and travel 5000 years into the future, where they encounter aliens who are looking for a planet to colonize.', 'Scientists must prove their time travel experiments can produce results, so their funding won''t be cut off. They push their equipment, and travel 5000 years into the future, where they encounter aliens who are looking for a planet to colonize.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8hoM0XajwMQhsTGgW9TnCvgtqMV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46139'),
  ('933180154380995221', 'Journey to the Centre of the Earth', 1977, 'Family, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Juan Piquer Simón, Andrés Berenguer, Rodolfo Medina', 'Juan Piquer Simón, John Melson, Carlos Puerto', 'Kenneth More, Pep Munné, Frank Braña, Jack Taylor, Ivonne Sentis, José María Caffarel, Lone Fleming, Emiliano Redondo', null, 'A 19th-century expedition to the Earth''s core reveals primordial wonders, prehistoric monsters and a subterranean civilization that may convey the greatest discovery of all.', 'A 19th-century expedition to the Earth''s core reveals primordial wonders, prehistoric monsters and a subterranean civilization that may convey the greatest discovery of all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rIPIgMhdQ2UUVwnyW4iC2jY8jNT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28481'),
  ('334984450515980156', 'Journey to the Christmas Star', 1976, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Family', 'Ola Solum, Hans Nord, Ingeborg Kvamme', 'Axel Helgeland, Ola Solum', 'Hanne Krogh, Knut Risan, Bente Børsum, Ingrid Larsen, Alf Nordvang, Harald Heide-Steen Jr., Knut Walle, Anne Marit Jacobsen', null, 'Once upon a time a little girl went out to find the Christmas Star.', 'Once upon a time a little girl went out to find the Christmas Star.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sQokJ1OyvwRzYgKwxjNp1NvH4hQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60767'),
  ('198672466362006916', 'Journey to the Christmas Star', 2012, 'Fantasy, Adventure, Family', 'Nils Gaup, Odd Reinhardt Nicolaysen', 'Kamilla Krogsveen', 'Vilde Zeiner, Anders Baasmo Christiansen, Agnes Kittelsen, Stig Werner Moe, Eilif Hellum Noraker, Knut Walle, Sofie Asplin, Kristin Zachariassen', null, '13 year old kind-hearted Sonja arrives at a tiny village together with a company of bandits. But there is a curse on the village. A long time ago, the King’s only daughter Goldhair disappeared while searching for the Christmas Star. The Queen died of a broken heart, leaving the shattered King all on his own. From that day on, the King cursed the Christmas Star, thereby causing darkness and grief to descend upon the land. However, an old sage has revealed that Goldhair is still alive, and will return only if the King finds the way back to the Christmas Star. Ever since, the King has been searching for the Christmas Star every Christmas, but all in vain.', '13 year old kind-hearted Sonja arrives at a tiny village together with a company of bandits. But there is a curse on the village. A long time ago, the King’s only daughter Goldhair disappeared while searching for the Christmas Star. The Queen died of a broken heart, leaving the shattered King all on his own. From that day on, the King cursed the Christmas Star, thereby causing darkness and grief to descend upon the land. However, an old sage has revealed that Goldhair is still alive, and will return only if the King finds the way back to the Christmas Star. Ever since, the King has been searching for the Christmas Star every Christmas, but all in vain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ysqFnW2TrlD6W9H9dn1FLgVhpsq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:149427'),
  ('192572677549373689', 'Journey to the End of the Night', 2006, 'Thriller', 'Eric Eason, Uli Burtin', 'Eric Eason', 'Brendan Fraser, Yasiin Bey, Scott Glenn, Alice Braga, Catalina Sandino Moreno, Ruy Polanah, Matheus Nachtergaele, Molly Howe', null, 'In a dark and decadent area of São Paulo, the exiled Americans Rosso and his son Paul own a brothel. Paul is a compulsive gambler addicted in cocaine and his father is married with the former prostitute Angie, and they have a little son. When a client is killed by his wife in their establishment, they find a suitcase with drugs.', 'In a dark and decadent area of São Paulo, the exiled Americans Rosso and his son Paul own a brothel. Paul is a compulsive gambler addicted in cocaine and his father is married with the former prostitute Angie, and they have a little son. When a client is killed by his wife in their establishment, they find a suitcase with drugs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3R7jh0a1RAQpoIIVDRohrZdMeiD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15558'),
  ('72781390713077164', 'Journey to the Seventh Planet', 1962, 'Adventure, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Sidney W. Pink, Szasza Zalabery, Aage Wiltrup', 'Ib Melchior, Sidney W. Pink', 'John Agar, Carl Ottosen, Ove Sprogøe, Louis Miehe-Renard, Greta Thyssen, Ann Smyrner, Mimi Heinrich, Annie Birgit Garde', null, 'A space expedition to Uranus is menaced by a giant brain that can make illusions come true.', 'A space expedition to Uranus is menaced by a giant brain that can make illusions come true.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f80iztZfwhYVd0jBOGCKwj47ChY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29570'),
  ('104664069174303667', 'Journey to the Shore', 2015, 'Drama, Fantasy, Romance', 'Kiyoshi Kurosawa, Akiko Ashizawa, Yuya Okuro', 'Takashi Ujita, Kiyoshi Kurosawa', 'Eri Fukatsu, Tadanobu Asano, Masao Komatsu, Nozomi Muraoka, Tetsuya Chiba, Kaoru Okunuki, Masaaki Akahori, Yumiko Ise', null, 'Mizuki''s husband Yusuke has been missing for three years. He suddenly comes back home as a ghost and asks Mizuki to go on a trip with him. Their trip consists of visiting the people that helped Yusuke on his previous travel.', 'Mizuki''s husband Yusuke has been missing for three years. He suddenly comes back home as a ghost and asks Mizuki to go on a trip with him. Their trip consists of visiting the people that helped Yusuke on his previous travel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wjrWzXzdAXU310oJRTu5KiolTNk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:334991'),
  ('438322295865212640', 'Journey to the Sun', 1999, 'Drama', 'Yeşim Ustaoğlu, Jacek Petrycki', 'Yeşim Ustaoğlu', 'Nazmi Kırık, Newroz Baz, Mizgin Kapazan, Ara Güler, Lucia Marano', null, 'Mehmet, a young Turkish man newly migrated from Tire, takes a job searching for water leaks below the surface of the streets of Istanbul. Due to a strange set of events, he is mistaken for a Kurd, imprisoned, and brutally beaten. Upon his release, he becomes an outcast marked as a Kurd.', 'Mehmet, a young Turkish man newly migrated from Tire, takes a job searching for water leaks below the surface of the streets of Istanbul. Due to a strange set of events, he is mistaken for a Kurd, imprisoned, and brutally beaten. Upon his release, he becomes an outcast marked as a Kurd.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ilI1iWve88t1fhwYMZpwIZYBab.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47215'),
  ('237795433402464662', 'Journey to the West', 2014, 'Drama, Documentary', 'Tsai Ming-liang, Antoine Héberlé', null, 'Lee Kang-sheng, Denis Lavant', null, 'In 2014, Tsai Ming-Liang was invited to make a film for the MarseilleFID, Marseille International Film Festival. Since he was not familiar with Marseille, he decided to make a film as tourist, capturing the beautiful Mediterranean sunshine in the late summer of that year. He also invited famous French actor, Denis Lavant, to appear alongside Lee Kang-Sheng playing Xuanzang. "Journey to the West" was invited to be the opening short film at the Berlin International Film Festival the same year.', 'In 2014, Tsai Ming-Liang was invited to make a film for the MarseilleFID, Marseille International Film Festival. Since he was not familiar with Marseille, he decided to make a film as tourist, capturing the beautiful Mediterranean sunshine in the late summer of that year. He also invited famous French actor, Denis Lavant, to appear alongside Lee Kang-Sheng playing Xuanzang. "Journey to the West" was invited to be the opening short film at the Berlin International Film Festival the same year.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nbJAOPJi5D2WtiveqjOlRdlMWYI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:255554'),
  ('372562213833341167', 'Journey to the West', 2023, 'Adventure, Comedy, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Kong Dashan, Matthias Delvaux, Zhao Yilong', 'Kong Dashan, Roy Wang', 'Yang Haoyu, Ai Liya, Roy Wang, Jiang Qiming, Sheng Chenchen, Frant Gwo, Gong Geer, Luo Juan', null, 'Tang Zhijun, an editor of a science fiction magazine, attempts to find signs of an alien civilisation. When a strange young man claims to have received instructions from aliens, Tang and his team follow him in search of extraterrestrial creatures.', 'Tang Zhijun, an editor of a science fiction magazine, attempts to find signs of an alien civilisation. When a strange young man claims to have received instructions from aliens, Tang and his team follow him in search of extraterrestrial creatures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4nnvERfV7YOiHQ3Ua8cw6bHsD9d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:851977'),
  ('588077914295817735', 'Journey to the West: Conquering the Demons', 2013, 'Action, Fantasy, Adventure, Comedy', 'Choi Sung-Fai, Stephen Chow, Hwang Byeong-sik', 'Stephen Chow, Ivy Kong Yuk-Yee, Lee Sheung-Ching', 'Wen Zhang, Shu Qi, Huang Bo, Show Lo, Lee Sheung-Ching, Chen Bingqiang, Cheng Sihan, Xing Yu', 'PG-13', 'In a world plagued by demons who cause great human suffering, young demon hunter Tang Sanzang must fight against monstrous demons, as well as contend with a beautiful demon hunting woman on his path to enlightenment.', 'In a world plagued by demons who cause great human suffering, young demon hunter Tang Sanzang must fight against monstrous demons, as well as contend with a beautiful demon hunting woman on his path to enlightenment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/XcFMQQfx1gMlh1RyEednP6frNC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:170657'),
  ('305881456321994536', 'Journey to the West: The Demons Strike Back', 2017, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Action', 'Tsui Hark, Kang Byoung-ho, Moon Sung-oh', 'Stephen Chow', 'Kris Wu, Lin Gengxin, Yao Chen, Lin Yun, Yang Yiwei, Mengke Bateer, Wang Likun, Bao Bei''er', 'PG-13', 'Tang Monk brings three disciples on a journey to the West. On the outside, everything seems harmonious. However, tension is present beneath the surface, and their hearts and minds are not in agreement. After a series of demon-capturing events, the monk and his disciples gain mutual understanding of each others'' hardships and unease. Finally, they resolve their inner conflict and work together to become an all-conquering, demon-exorcising team.', 'Tang Monk brings three disciples on a journey to the West. On the outside, everything seems harmonious. However, tension is present beneath the surface, and their hearts and minds are not in agreement. After a series of demon-capturing events, the monk and his disciples gain mutual understanding of each others'' hardships and unease. Finally, they resolve their inner conflict and work together to become an all-conquering, demon-exorcising team.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8YcgbJatxoBjQqQHF52NdcdkIJZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:435800'),
  ('415585397286191841', 'Journey with Papa', 1982, 'Comedy', 'Alberto Sordi, Sergio D''Offizi, Paola Scola', 'Augusto Caminito', 'Alberto Sordi, Carlo Verdone, Edy Angelillo, Giuliana Calandra, Ugo Bologna, Angelo Infanti, Victoria Zinny, Gabriele Torrei', null, 'Armando is the daddy, Cristiano is the adult son. Each of them lives his life in a different way respect the other: Armando is an old play-boy and often he "buys" his women with his money; Cristiano is a shy guy who lives in a community with other guys like him. The movie proceeds showing us, ironically, the differences, the different ways to think, to act, to treat the women between father and son.', 'Armando is the daddy, Cristiano is the adult son. Each of them lives his life in a different way respect the other: Armando is an old play-boy and often he "buys" his women with his money; Cristiano is a shy guy who lives in a community with other guys like him. The movie proceeds showing us, ironically, the differences, the different ways to think, to act, to treat the women between father and son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dAp4UQZIfQfJTyn7N4fdQdtSYRF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47245'),
  ('462612264521930609', 'Journey''s End', 2017, 'War, Drama, Action', 'Saul Dibb, David Stafford, Michael Curtis', 'Simon Reade', 'Asa Butterfield, Sam Claflin, Paul Bettany, Tom Sturridge, Toby Jones, Stephen Graham, Robert Glenister, Theo Barklem-Biggs', 'R', 'Set in a dugout in Aisne in 1918, a group of British officers, led by the mentally disintegrating young officer Stanhope, variously await their fate.', 'Set in a dugout in Aisne in 1918, a group of British officers, led by the mentally disintegrating young officer Stanhope, variously await their fate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5gGkt84bCPt7XRo35FcsrOeer78.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:438259'),
