  ('111115397935329176', 'Joy Division', 2006, 'Drama', 'Bryan Loftus, Reg Traviss', null, 'Ed Stoppard, Tom Schilling, Bernadette Heerwagen, Bernard Hill, Lea Mornar, Sean Chapman, Thomas Darchinger, Levente Törköly', null, 'A teenage orphan fights against the Red Army at the end of WWII and in the aftermath is ''adopted'' by a Commissar. Years later he is sent to London during the Cold war to work for the KGB, where he questions his life.', 'A teenage orphan fights against the Red Army at the end of WWII and in the aftermath is ''adopted'' by a Commissar. Years later he is sent to London during the Cold war to work for the KGB, where he questions his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nY4OiLvIN2gH0AQJP0AjnhLwlcg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10079'),
