  ('799989309502762729', 'Judas & Jesus', 2008, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Olaf Encke, Claudia Romero', 'Olaf Encke', 'Friedemann Encke, Olaf Encke, Sandra Pfeiffer, Klaus Hensheid, Die Suurbiers, Peter Kock', null, 'Judas is the hero and Jesus is the villain in this lewd retelling of the classic Bible story. Depicted through anthropomorphic animals, we see a unique alternative perspective. Judas (an unscrupulous black goat) has been at odds with Jesus (a self-righteous white sheep) ever since childhood. However, when an opportunity arises to sell Jesus out for the 30 Euros he needs to get into Maria Magdalena''s sex show, things finally seem to start going Judas'' way. But what will Jesus'' adoring fans have to say about it?', 'Judas is the hero and Jesus is the villain in this lewd retelling of the classic Bible story. Depicted through anthropomorphic animals, we see a unique alternative perspective. Judas (an unscrupulous black goat) has been at odds with Jesus (a self-righteous white sheep) ever since childhood. However, when an opportunity arises to sell Jesus out for the 30 Euros he needs to get into Maria Magdalena''s sex show, things finally seem to start going Judas'' way. But what will Jesus'' adoring fans have to say about it?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bnuQpUnmo2rvjLGYehcf9qnaGKE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34102'),
  ('947049278096918381', 'Judas and the Black Messiah', 2021, 'Drama, History', 'Donna Belajac, Frederic Roth, Geza Kassai', 'Will Berson, Shaka King', 'Daniel Kaluuya, LaKeith Stanfield, Jesse Plemons, Dominique Fishback, Ashton Sanders, Algee Smith, Darrell Britt-Gibson, Lil Rel Howery', 'R', 'Bill O''Neal infiltrates the Black Panthers on the orders of FBI Agent Mitchell and J. Edgar Hoover. As Black Panther Chairman Fred Hampton ascends—falling for a fellow revolutionary en route—a battle wages for O’Neal’s soul.', 'Bill O''Neal infiltrates the Black Panthers on the orders of FBI Agent Mitchell and J. Edgar Hoover. As Black Panther Chairman Fred Hampton ascends—falling for a fellow revolutionary en route—a battle wages for O’Neal’s soul.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iIgr75GoqFxe1X5Wz9siOODGe9u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:583406'),
  ('212366102934114486', 'Judas Kiss', 1998, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Sebastian Gutierrez, James Chressanthis', 'Sebastian Gutierrez', 'Carla Gugino, Simon Baker, Emma Thompson, Alan Rickman, Gil Bellows, Til Schweiger, Hal Holbrook, Philip Baker Hall', 'R', 'The shooting of a U.S. senator''s wife raises the stakes for kidnappers seeking a hefty ransom for a computer magnate.', 'The shooting of a U.S. senator''s wife raises the stakes for kidnappers seeking a hefty ransom for a computer magnate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aBwSiD2kjlarWe7zXYFvfGdlUon.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37516'),
  ('1136027826874322080', 'Judas Kiss', 2011, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'J.T. Tepnapa', 'J.T. Tepnapa, Carlos Pedraza', 'Dennis Bateman, Brent Corrigan, Richard Harmon, Charlie David, Genevieve Buechner, Timo Descamps, Julia Morizawa, Brian Sutherland', null, 'A quirk in time and space gives a failed filmmaker the chance to reshape his destiny when he visits his peculiar alma mater.', 'A quirk in time and space gives a failed filmmaker the chance to reshape his destiny when he visits his peculiar alma mater.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7AI0hUYnzGXOsFcMiULJAaUKo94.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71208'),
  ('59133089367114497', 'Judd Apatow: The Return', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Marcus Raboy, Dylan Sanford', 'Judd Apatow', 'Judd Apatow, Maude Apatow', null, 'Renowned producer, director and writer Judd Apatow makes his long-awaited return to stand-up comedy with this new special shot in Montreal.', 'Renowned producer, director and writer Judd Apatow makes his long-awaited return to stand-up comedy with this new special shot in Montreal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h83KVdM6UMJplVA8jgXWk60Kk1Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:487156'),
  ('1148817603294653376', 'Jude', 1996, 'Drama, Romance', 'Michael Winterbottom, Eduardo Serra, Howard Arundel', 'Hossein Amini', 'Kate Winslet, Christopher Eccleston, Liam Cunningham, Rachel Griffiths, June Whitfield, James Nesbitt, Paul Bown, Berwick Kaler', 'R', 'In late 19th-century England, Jude aspires to be an academic, but is hobbled by his blue-collar background. Instead, he works as a stonemason and is trapped in an unloving marriage to a farmer''s daughter named Arabella. But when his wife leaves him, Jude sees an opportunity to improve himself. He moves to the city and begins an affair with his married cousin, Sue, courting tragedy every step of the way.', 'In late 19th-century England, Jude aspires to be an academic, but is hobbled by his blue-collar background. Instead, he works as a stonemason and is trapped in an unloving marriage to a farmer''s daughter named Arabella. But when his wife leaves him, Jude sees an opportunity to improve himself. He moves to the city and begins an affair with his married cousin, Sue, courting tragedy every step of the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pK7hcjrvgRisQC7i1XwiA1B97sJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25147'),
  ('263198825696006674', 'Judex', 1916, 'Drama, Crime', 'Louis Feuillade, Léon Klausse, André Glatti', 'Arthur Bernède, Louis Feuillade', 'René Cresté, Musidora, René Poyen, Édouard Mathé, Gaston Michel, Yvonne Dario, Yvette Andréyor, Juliette Clarens', null, 'When an unscrupulous banker ruins his family, a young man swears to bring him to justice, so he adopts a new identity, the mysterious Judex, and ominously disguised and sunk into the muddy path of vengeance, punishes the crooks and protects the innocents. (Originally a twelve-part epic serial.)', 'When an unscrupulous banker ruins his family, a young man swears to bring him to justice, so he adopts a new identity, the mysterious Judex, and ominously disguised and sunk into the muddy path of vengeance, punishes the crooks and protects the innocents. (Originally a twelve-part epic serial.)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t01u9TqcExE6bEqiyMGsImyjRoZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56801'),
  ('61427533223039192', 'Judex', 1963, 'Crime, Thriller, Mystery', 'Georges Franju, Marcel Fradetal, Michel Worms', null, 'Channing Pollock, Francine Bergé, Édith Scob, Théo Sarapo, Sylva Koscina, René Génin, Roger Fradet, André Méliès', null, 'Georges Franju''s Judex is an arch, playful tribute to the serials of the influential silent filmmaker Louis Feuillade. Franju shuffles through the plot of Feuillade''s lengthy serial of the same name, about an adventurer named Judex whose revenge against the corrupt banker Favraux unleashes a complicated series of schemes.', 'Georges Franju''s Judex is an arch, playful tribute to the serials of the influential silent filmmaker Louis Feuillade. Franju shuffles through the plot of Feuillade''s lengthy serial of the same name, about an adventurer named Judex whose revenge against the corrupt banker Favraux unleashes a complicated series of schemes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v9QWXz5F11R0yZpCcxIH1W50BHP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56800'),
  ('494728071302239013', 'Judge', 1991, 'Fantasy, Animation, Horror, Action, Thriller, Mystery, Crime', 'Shin Matsuo, Hiroshi Negishi, Akihiko Iguchi', 'Fujihiko Hosono', 'Kaneto Shiozawa, Keiko Yamamoto, Miki Ito, Shinya Ôtaki, Tomomichi Nishimura, Wataru Takagi, Yuri Amano, Yuzuru Fujimoto', null, 'An executive accused of murder by his own victim is brought before the court of the dead to answer for his crimes.', 'An executive accused of murder by his own victim is brought before the court of the dead to answer for his crimes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jv4bJ3OPJGbjGs4NZ3N7a3Mmymi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51096'),
  ('1131761730085138502', 'Judge', 2013, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Yo Kohatsu', null, 'Koji Seto, Kasumi Arimura, Jiro Sato, Sotaro Tanaka, Kazuyoshi Taira, Fukino Kawate, Yuko Nishimaru', null, 'Seven people who committed the seven deadly sins : lust, gluttony, greed, sloth, wrath, envy and pride are locked up in a sealed space by someone. These seven people must play a game which is a matter of life or death.', 'Seven people who committed the seven deadly sins : lust, gluttony, greed, sloth, wrath, envy and pride are locked up in a sealed space by someone. These seven people must play a game which is a matter of life or death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wvctm92zszGcfZMNZcr9IuBQKhb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:336190'),
  ('196789630235624109', 'Judge Archer', 2016, 'Action, Drama', 'Wang Tianlin, Xu Haofeng', 'Xu Haofeng', 'Song Yang, Yu Chenghui, Chengyuan Li, Zhao Zheng, Wang Yanni, Li Chang-Lin, Ma Jun, Wang Xingkai', null, 'The spear signifies political power, the arrow personal ambition. What happens when the two collide?', 'The spear signifies political power, the arrow personal ambition. What happens when the two collide?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tA3kBsEAbtzlPn186TlEt86Yr7H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:264518'),
  ('566885652740069162', 'Judge Dredd', 1995, 'Science Fiction, Action', 'Danny Cannon, Adrian Biddle, Christopher Newman', 'William Wisher, Steven E. de Souza', 'Sylvester Stallone, Diane Lane, Armand Assante, Rob Schneider, Jürgen Prochnow, Max von Sydow, Christopher Adamson, Joanna Miles', 'R', 'In a dystopian future, Dredd, the most famous judge (a cop with instant field judiciary powers) is convicted for a crime he did not commit while his murderous counterpart escapes.', 'In a dystopian future, Dredd, the most famous judge (a cop with instant field judiciary powers) is convicted for a crime he did not commit while his murderous counterpart escapes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cfSnKn8NDU3m8UxihjVcYprA0Aq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9482'),
  ('856060914872860585', 'Judge Fayard Called the Sheriff', 1977, 'Drama, Crime', 'Yves Boisset, Jacques Loiseleux', 'Luc Béraud, Claude Veillot, Yves Boisset', 'Patrick Dewaere, Aurore Clément, Philippe Léotard, Michel Auclair, Jean Bouise, Daniel Ivernel, Jean-Marc Bory, Henri Garcin', null, 'Jean-Marie Fayard is a young examining magistrate in a large provincial french city. He belongs to that generation of judges who are endeavoring to re-adapt the notion of justice to our changing times. His methods are not agreeable to every one. Criticism and pressure are brought to bear upon him but he is aware of his value, professionally, and refuses to make any concessions. He follows an unwavering course. He uses dynamic methods and takes uncustomary initiatives. He behaves like a crusader, a battler, whence the nickname given him by the reporters : the sheriff.', 'Jean-Marie Fayard is a young examining magistrate in a large provincial french city. He belongs to that generation of judges who are endeavoring to re-adapt the notion of justice to our changing times. His methods are not agreeable to every one. Criticism and pressure are brought to bear upon him but he is aware of his value, professionally, and refuses to make any concessions. He follows an unwavering course. He uses dynamic methods and takes uncustomary initiatives. He behaves like a crusader, a battler, whence the nickname given him by the reporters : the sheriff.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xRe6vroIxarVUVkq134H6ciiIdz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74822'),
  ('800672635952333490', 'Judge Priest', 1934, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'John Ford, George Schneiderman, Edward O''Fearna', 'Irvin S. Cobb', 'Will Rogers, Tom Brown, Anita Louise, Henry B. Walthall, David Landau, Rochelle Hudson, Roger Imhof, Frank Melton', 'NR', 'Judge Priest, a proud Confederate veteran, restores the justice in a small town in the Post-Bellum Kentucky using his common sense and his great sense of humanity.', 'Judge Priest, a proud Confederate veteran, restores the justice in a small town in the Post-Bellum Kentucky using his common sense and his great sense of humanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vo7jPkmVR4M0rlw4wwM31bUopyK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23024'),
  ('810151523024333060', 'Judge!', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Akira Nagai, Naoki Noda, Masaaki Yoshimura', 'Yoshimitsu Sawamoto', 'Satoshi Tsumabuki, Keiko Kitagawa, Lily Franky, Kyoka Suzuki, Etsushi Toyokawa, Yoshiyoshi Arakawa, Tetsuji Tamayama, Hyunri', null, 'After taking the blame for another disastrous advertising campaign, Ota Kiichiro is asked by his arrogant boss Otaki Ichiro to take his place as a judge at the world''s biggest advertising competition in Los Angeles.', 'After taking the blame for another disastrous advertising campaign, Ota Kiichiro is asked by his arrogant boss Otaki Ichiro to take his place as a judge at the world''s biggest advertising competition in Los Angeles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7DNkG6MBpbn2vnKnat9es7wUtkt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:264905'),
  ('227935602537282459', 'Judgement', 1999, 'Drama', 'Park Chan-wook, Yoo Heung-sam, Kim Tae-in', 'Park Chan-wook', 'Ki Joo-bong, Ko In-bae, Kwon Nam-hee, Park Ji-il, Choi Hak-rak, Myeong Soon-mi, Lee Jong-yong', null, 'At the identification of a dead body, a couple and a morgue employee both claim to be related to the deceased, and therefore the rightful recipient of an indemnity of at least 520,000.', 'At the identification of a dead body, a couple and a morgue employee both claim to be related to the deceased, and therefore the rightful recipient of an indemnity of at least 520,000.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e6XjuAabaLE7wRjS6MTllzVH0BW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37836'),
  ('18940505384865067', 'Judgementall Hai Kya', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama, Thriller', 'Prakash Kovelamudi, Zarir Cama, Jashvender Chauhan', 'Kanika Dhillon', 'Kangana Ranaut, Rajkummar Rao, Jimmy Shergill, Amyra Dastur, Amrita Puri, Satish Kaushik, Brijendra Kala, Hussain Dalal', null, 'When Bobby meets her new tenants, a young married couple, their perfectly normal life leaves her really curious. But then a murder takes place and Bobby suspects Keshav has a role to play in the crime.', 'When Bobby meets her new tenants, a young married couple, their perfectly normal life leaves her really curious. But then a murder takes place and Bobby suspects Keshav has a role to play in the crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eXyTnYhWLjXEggUTOoFqZRCteml.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:551688'),
  ('1081206460100634429', 'Judgment', 1990, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Tom Topor, Elemér Ragályi, Junie Lowry-Johnson', 'Tom Topor', 'Keith Carradine, Blythe Danner, Jack Warden, David Strathairn, Michael Faustino, Bob Gunton, Mitchell Ryan, Robert Joy', 'PG-13', 'Fact-based story of a Louisiana priest accused of molesting young parishioners, and of the family of one of his victims, caught between their loyalty to their son and to their Church.', 'Fact-based story of a Louisiana priest accused of molesting young parishioners, and of the family of one of his victims, caught between their loyalty to their son and to their Church.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xcCkH6wLtcPKmsJagShtKpPpUxH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:369454'),
  ('753706989013941795', 'Judgment Day', 1999, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'John Terlesky, Maximo Munzi', 'William Carson, Fred Olen Ray', 'Ice-T, Suzy Amis, Mario Van Peebles, Coolio, Linden Ashby, Tommy Lister Jr., Mark Deakins, David Wells', 'R', 'This sci-fi thriller finds the world in imminent danger when a collision in outer space sends huge pieces of interstellar debris on a path headed straight for Earth. A scientist has designed a system that would stop the largest meteor fragments from striking the earth, but a fanatical religious cult have made it their business to stop him. A convicted murderer (Ice-T) with ties to the group must now join forces with an FBI agent (Suzy Amis) to free the scientist from the cult''s clutches and prevent millions of needless deaths. Mario Van Peebles and Linden Ashby appear in supporting roles', 'This sci-fi thriller finds the world in imminent danger when a collision in outer space sends huge pieces of interstellar debris on a path headed straight for Earth. A scientist has designed a system that would stop the largest meteor fragments from striking the earth, but a fanatical religious cult have made it their business to stop him. A convicted murderer (Ice-T) with ties to the group must now join forces with an FBI agent (Suzy Amis) to free the scientist from the cult''s clutches and prevent millions of needless deaths. Mario Van Peebles and Linden Ashby appear in supporting roles', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gSidTyBx5S2JVajuxAIKCatswff.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77530'),
  ('359589071552763864', 'Judgment in Berlin', 1988, 'Drama', 'Leo Penn, Eva M. Schoenecker, Stefan Diepenbrock', 'Joshua Sinclair, Leo Penn, Douglas Graham', 'Martin Sheen, Sam Wanamaker, Max Gail, Jürgen Heinrich, Heinz Hoenig, Cristine Rose, Sean Penn, Jutta Speidel', 'PG', 'An American judge in Germany must decide if the hijacking of an East German plane into West Berlin was justified.', 'An American judge in Germany must decide if the hijacking of an East German plane into West Berlin was justified.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/52T7312KrMtCXWSLOys0GRY6a8R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68752'),
  ('141575770164097092', 'Judgment Night', 1993, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Stephen Hopkins, Peter Levy', 'Lewis Colick', 'Emilio Estevez, Cuba Gooding Jr., Denis Leary, Stephen Dorff, Jeremy Piven, Peter Greene, Michael DeLorenzo, Everlast', 'R', 'Four young friends, while taking a shortcut en route to a local boxing match, witness a brutal murder which leaves them running for their lives.', 'Four young friends, while taking a shortcut en route to a local boxing match, witness a brutal murder which leaves them running for their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3rvvpS9YPM5HB2f4HYiNiJVtdam.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6'),
  ('677035996252697834', 'Judwaa', 1997, 'Romance, Comedy, Action', 'David Dhawan, W. B. Rao', null, 'Salman Khan, Karisma Kapoor, Rambha, Kader Khan, Bindu Desai, Shakti Kapoor, Mukesh Rishi, Reema Lagoo', null, 'Identical twins Raja and Prem are separated at birth and raised in drastically different backgrounds. While Prem becomes a singer in the USA, Raja''s life leads him to become a tough-talking thug in India. When Prem comes to India, who''s who confusion brews and leads to hilarious consequences.', 'Identical twins Raja and Prem are separated at birth and raised in drastically different backgrounds. While Prem becomes a singer in the USA, Raja''s life leads him to become a tough-talking thug in India. When Prem comes to India, who''s who confusion brews and leads to hilarious consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hC1prtsvTKSUh6FzRun7zD0XXUB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161238'),
  ('134962081386179872', 'Judwaa 2', 2017, 'Action, Comedy, Romance', 'David Dhawan, Ayananka Bose', 'David Dhawan', 'Varun Dhawan, Jacqueline Fernandez, Taapsee Pannu, Anupam Kher, Upasna Singh, Rajpal Yadav, Pavan Malhotra, Ali Asgar', null, 'Separated at birth and peculiarly connected via their reflexes, twins Prem and Raja are reunited with each other as they set out to take down the underground smuggling world.', 'Separated at birth and peculiarly connected via their reflexes, twins Prem and Raja are reunited with each other as they set out to take down the underground smuggling world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3BlL1cbOTkzHSXTy3Lw95OfiCKX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:456565'),
  ('863900629420564225', 'Judy', 2019, 'Drama, History, Music', 'Matt Dunkley, Stephen Carney, James Price', 'Tom Edge', 'Renée Zellweger, Jessie Buckley, Finn Wittrock, Rufus Sewell, Michael Gambon, Richard Cordery, Royce Pierreson, Darci Shaw', 'PG-13', 'Thirty years after starring in "The Wizard of Oz," beloved actress and singer Judy Garland arrives in London to perform sold-out shows at the Talk of the Town nightclub. While there, she reminisces with friends and fans and begins a whirlwind romance with musician Mickey Deans, her soon-to-be fifth husband.', 'Thirty years after starring in "The Wizard of Oz," beloved actress and singer Judy Garland arrives in London to perform sold-out shows at the Talk of the Town nightclub. While there, she reminisces with friends and fans and begins a whirlwind romance with musician Mickey Deans, her soon-to-be fifth husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iqJhHjD6k6T07waELjMKDpQJUP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:491283'),
  ('313958999060475042', 'Judy & Punch', 2019, 'Drama, Thriller, Comedy, Crime', 'Mirrah Foulkes, Stefan Duscio', 'Mirrah Foulkes', 'Mia Wasikowska, Damon Herriman, Benedict Hardie, Terry Norris, Don Bridges, Tom Budge, Eddie Baroo, Michael M. Foster', null, 'In the anarchic town of Seaside, nowhere near the sea, puppeteers Judy and Punch are trying to resurrect their marionette show. The show is a hit due to Judy''s superior puppeteering but Punch''s driving ambition and penchant for whisky lead to an inevitable tragedy that Judy must avenge.', 'In the anarchic town of Seaside, nowhere near the sea, puppeteers Judy and Punch are trying to resurrect their marionette show. The show is a hit due to Judy''s superior puppeteering but Punch''s driving ambition and penchant for whisky lead to an inevitable tragedy that Judy must avenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a0WRxfrVjPNelq7UuRoRnIZWn5A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:506554'),
  ('237840678565676698', 'Judy Berlin', 1999, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Eric Mendelsohn, Jeffrey Seckendorf, Wendy Jo Cohen', 'Eric Mendelsohn', 'Barbara Barrie, Bob Dishy, Edie Falco, Carlin Glynn, Aaron Harnick, Bette Henritze, Madeline Kahn, Julie Kavner', null, 'Judy Berlin is an aspiring actress whose idealism is at odds with her small suburban community, where a solar eclipse induces town inhabitants (a lonely housewife, a frustrated schoolteacher, and a struggling filmmaker) to search for solace and understanding in themselves and one another.', 'Judy Berlin is an aspiring actress whose idealism is at odds with her small suburban community, where a solar eclipse induces town inhabitants (a lonely housewife, a frustrated schoolteacher, and a struggling filmmaker) to search for solace and understanding in themselves and one another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vBLRFlrUOvYM2dlDQx5oaZSTVnl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36048'),
