  ('92089447213549029', 'Jug Face', 2013, 'Horror, Thriller, Drama', 'Chad Crawford Kinkle, Chris Heinrich', 'Chad Crawford Kinkle', 'Sean Bridgers, Lauren Ashley Carter, Sean Young, Larry Fessenden, Daniel Manche, Kaitlin Cullum, David S. Greathouse, Katie Groshong', 'R', 'When a supernatural pit worshipped by a remote community in the woods demands a new blood sacrifice, a young woman struggles to find a way to survive as the pit lashes out in anger.', 'When a supernatural pit worshipped by a remote community in the woods demands a new blood sacrifice, a young woman struggles to find a way to survive as the pit lashes out in anger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tBNRzn69tdvQPiKNNu5RA3WcMx9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:157115'),
  ('1066455064706687976', 'Jugaremos en el bosque', 2024, 'Horror', 'Alejandra Cárdenas, Guillermo Granillo', 'Alejandra Cárdenas, Carlos Eduardo Aguilar Franco', 'Lucía Gómez-Robledo, Alejandro Cuétara, Julieta Egurrola, Arturo Ripstein, Lucía Uribe, Alonso Navarro, Carolina Torres, Juan Ríos', null, 'After the death of his son, Javier hopes that restoring his family''s abandoned ranch will allow him and his wife Mariana, who attempted suicide, a new beginning, but his grandmother refuses.', 'After the death of his son, Javier hopes that restoring his family''s abandoned ranch will allow him and his wife Mariana, who attempted suicide, a new beginning, but his grandmother refuses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bwa3t1jTCo3IFe6iwRQY3rHEoz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1249013'),
