  ('625330474060149732', 'Juggernaut', 1974, 'Thriller, Action', 'Richard Lester, David Tringham, Andy Armstrong', 'Richard Alan Simmons, Alan Plater', 'Richard Harris, Omar Sharif, David Hemmings, Anthony Hopkins, Shirley Knight, Ian Holm, Clifton James, Roy Kinnear', 'PG', 'A terrorist demands a huge ransom in exchange for information on how to disarm the seven bombs he has planted aboard a trans-Atlantic cruise ship. Inspired by real events.', 'A terrorist demands a huge ransom in exchange for information on how to disarm the seven bombs he has planted aboard a trans-Atlantic cruise ship. Inspired by real events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3c0qJYBVeDy1Jg0RBhlt60JA9x5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29805'),
  ('15052356407194580', 'JugJugg Jeeyo', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jay I. Patel, Ganesh Pednekar, Panchami Ghavri', 'Rishabh Sharma, Sumit Batheja, Anurag Singh', 'Varun Dhawan, Kiara Advani, Anil Kapoor, Neetu Singh, Prajakta Koli, Maniesh Paul, Tisca Chopra, Savant Singh Premi', null, 'A marriage. A re-marriage. A pending divorce. It''s been five years since Kukoo and Nainaa got married after knowing each other practically all their lives, and now they need to break it to their family that they want a divorce. Kukoo''s parents, Bheem and Geeta, a couple that everyone looks up to, have no plans of making Kukoo and Naina''s lives easier. They have their own plans and set of surprises in store for the young couple; all this in the middle of Kukoo''s sister''s wedding.', 'A marriage. A re-marriage. A pending divorce. It''s been five years since Kukoo and Nainaa got married after knowing each other practically all their lives, and now they need to break it to their family that they want a divorce. Kukoo''s parents, Bheem and Geeta, a couple that everyone looks up to, have no plans of making Kukoo and Naina''s lives easier. They have their own plans and set of surprises in store for the young couple; all this in the middle of Kukoo''s sister''s wedding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ovyWtXhPRKKpSyMUIVYBWiurggY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:765019'),
  ('824702528772917173', 'Juha', 1999, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Aki Kaurismäki, Timo Salminen, Erja Dammert', 'Aki Kaurismäki', 'Sakari Kuosmanen, Kati Outinen, André Wilms, Elina Salo, Markku Peltola, Esko Nikkari, Ona Kamu, Outi Mäenpää', 'NR', 'A farmer''s wife is seduced into running away from her stolid older husband by a city slicker, who enslaves her in a brothel.', 'A farmer''s wife is seduced into running away from her stolid older husband by a city slicker, who enslaves her in a brothel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/idh0ybgYH0ttildtRjxaRrYWWto.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55257'),
  ('782605543930314794', 'Juice', 1992, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Ernest R. Dickerson, Larry Banks, H.H. Cooper', 'Gerard Brown, Ernest R. Dickerson', 'Omar Epps, Tupac Shakur, Khalil Kain, Jermaine Hopkins, Cindy Herron, Samuel L. Jackson, Queen Latifah, Vincent Laresca', 'R', 'Four Harlem friends -- Bishop, Q, Steel and Raheem -- dabble in petty crime, but they decide to go big by knocking off a convenience store. Bishop, the magnetic leader of the group, has the gun. But Q has different aspirations. He wants to be a DJ and happens to have a gig the night of the robbery. Unfortunately for him, Bishop isn''t willing to take no for answer in a game where everything''s for keeps.', 'Four Harlem friends -- Bishop, Q, Steel and Raheem -- dabble in petty crime, but they decide to go big by knocking off a convenience store. Bishop, the magnetic leader of the group, has the gun. But Q has different aspirations. He wants to be a DJ and happens to have a gig the night of the robbery. Unfortunately for him, Bishop isn''t willing to take no for answer in a game where everything''s for keeps.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hfXFPMhNjLnCugBHMN0nrtKW7Ra.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16136'),
  ('974106795369441543', 'Juice', 2017, 'Drama', 'Neeraj Ghaywan, Honey Trehan, Nishant Pradhan', 'Neeraj Ghaywan', 'Shefali Shah, Manish Chaudhary, Pubali Sanyal, Suman Mukhopadhyay, Shahnawaz Pradhan, Suneeta Sengupta, Shreedhar Dubey, Raviza Chauhan', null, 'Manju Singh and her husband are hosting a get-together of families on a really warm night. Between the snacks, drinks and the laughs, something completely unexpected happens.', 'Manju Singh and her husband are hosting a get-together of families on a really warm night. Between the snacks, drinks and the laughs, something completely unexpected happens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dD07ZUsAJBap8yaEZsyYJ6S2CWX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:496056'),
  ('384710626835217244', 'Juicio de faldas', 1969, 'Music', 'José Luis Sáenz de Heredia, Emilio Foriscot, Luis Ligero', 'Rafael J. Salvia, José Luis Sáenz de Heredia', 'Concha Velasco, Manolo Escobar, José «Saza» Sazatornil, Antonio Ozores, Guadalupe Muñoz Sampedro, Perla Cristal, Tony Soler, Manolo Otero', null, 'When truck driver Manolo is accused of a grave crime by a young woman from a nearby town, his fate hangs in the balance. Enter Marta—a sharp, determined lawyer whose brilliance quickly shatters his initial mistrust. As she digs through layers of small-town secrets and conflicting testimonies, Marta becomes convinced of Manolo’s innocence. But with circumstantial evidence stacked against him, the only way out is to uncover the real culprit—before the law forces a choice between prison or a marriage he refuses to accept.', 'When truck driver Manolo is accused of a grave crime by a young woman from a nearby town, his fate hangs in the balance. Enter Marta—a sharp, determined lawyer whose brilliance quickly shatters his initial mistrust. As she digs through layers of small-town secrets and conflicting testimonies, Marta becomes convinced of Manolo’s innocence. But with circumstantial evidence stacked against him, the only way out is to uncover the real culprit—before the law forces a choice between prison or a marriage he refuses to accept.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8SUeiAhBAOvOUZtiZVWDX5Sgdbu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:297685'),
  ('82373492058294539', 'Jujutsu Kaisen 0', 2021, 'Animation, Action, Fantasy', 'Yui Umemoto, Teppei Ito, Kentaro Kimura', 'Hiroshi Seko', 'Megumi Ogata, Kana Hanazawa, Yuichi Nakamura, Takahiro Sakurai, Mikako Komatsu, Koki Uchiyama, Tomokazu Seki, Mitsuo Iwata', 'PG-13', 'Yuta Okkotsu is a nervous high school student who is suffering from a serious problem—his childhood friend Rika has turned into a curse and won''t leave him alone. Since Rika is no ordinary curse, his plight is noticed by Satoru Gojo, a teacher at Jujutsu High, a school where fledgling exorcists learn how to combat curses. Gojo convinces Yuta to enroll, but can he learn enough in time to confront the curse that haunts him?', 'Yuta Okkotsu is a nervous high school student who is suffering from a serious problem—his childhood friend Rika has turned into a curse and won''t leave him alone. Since Rika is no ordinary curse, his plight is noticed by Satoru Gojo, a teacher at Jujutsu High, a school where fledgling exorcists learn how to combat curses. Gojo convinces Yuta to enroll, but can he learn enough in time to confront the curse that haunts him?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/23oJaeBh0FDk2mQ2P240PU9Xxfh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:810693'),
  ('1062441719724371997', 'JUJUTSU KAISEN: Execution', 2025, 'Animation, Action, Fantasy', 'Shota Goshozono, Daisuke Ishikawa, Teppei Ito', 'Hiroshi Seko', 'Junya Enoki, Megumi Ogata, Koji Yusa, Daisuke Namikawa, Yuma Uchida, Asami Seto, Kenjiro Tsuda, Subaru Kimura', 'R', 'A veil abruptly descends over the busy Shibuya area amid the bustling Halloween crowds, trapping countless civilians inside. Satoru Gojo, the strongest jujutsu sorcerer, steps into the chaos. But lying in wait are curse users and spirits scheming to seal him away. Yuji Itadori, accompanied by his classmates and other top-tier jujutsu sorcerers, enters the fray in an unprecedented clash of curses — the Shibuya Incident. In the aftermath, ten colonies across Japan are transformed into dens of curses in a plan orchestrated by Noritoshi Kamo. As the deadly Culling Game starts, Special Grade sorcerer Yuta Okkotsu is assigned to carry out Yuji''s execution for his perceived crimes. A compilation movie of Shibuya Incident including the first two episodes of the Culling Games arc.', 'A veil abruptly descends over the busy Shibuya area amid the bustling Halloween crowds, trapping countless civilians inside. Satoru Gojo, the strongest jujutsu sorcerer, steps into the chaos. But lying in wait are curse users and spirits scheming to seal him away. Yuji Itadori, accompanied by his classmates and other top-tier jujutsu sorcerers, enters the fray in an unprecedented clash of curses — the Shibuya Incident. In the aftermath, ten colonies across Japan are transformed into dens of curses in a plan orchestrated by Noritoshi Kamo. As the deadly Culling Game starts, Special Grade sorcerer Yuta Okkotsu is assigned to carry out Yuji''s execution for his perceived crimes. A compilation movie of Shibuya Incident including the first two episodes of the Culling Games arc.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v0s3dx6am0RzfsuK3KdEy8ZoCDs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1539104'),
  ('83680475257600307', 'JUJUTSU KAISEN: Hidden Inventory / Premature Death - The Movie', 2025, 'Animation, Action, Fantasy', 'Shota Goshozono, Ryota Aikei, Daisuke Ishikawa', 'Hiroshi Seko', 'Yuichi Nakamura, Takahiro Sakurai, Anna Nagase, Takehito Koyasu, Aya Endo, Risa Shimizu', 'NR', 'Pursued by a religious cult and other curse users, former friends Satoru Gojo and Suguru Geto are the only sorcerers capable of carrying the difficult task of protecting Riko Amanai, a student who has been designated to be sacrificed as the Star Plasma Vessel, until she can fulfill her duty.', 'Pursued by a religious cult and other curse users, former friends Satoru Gojo and Suguru Geto are the only sorcerers capable of carrying the difficult task of protecting Riko Amanai, a student who has been designated to be sacrificed as the Star Plasma Vessel, until she can fulfill her duty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kZkyr1sRzarENrxjtltPvmHRrTk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1338799'),
  ('101421531134901665', 'Juke Box Jamboree', 1942, 'Animation, Comedy, Music', 'Alex Lovy', null, 'Zedra Conde', null, 'A mouse, sleeping in the Zowie Cafe, has his sleep disturbed by the jukebox.', 'A mouse, sleeping in the Zowie Cafe, has his sleep disturbed by the jukebox.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4VfevFXQKd2jrceOYMrCkicpsG6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:236612'),
  ('679956124427341586', 'Juken Sentai Gekiranger vs. Boukenger', 2008, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction, Fantasy', 'Noboru Takemoto, Hirofumi Ishigaki', 'Naruhisa Arakawa', 'Hiroki Suzuki, Mina Fukui, Manpei Takagi, Riki Miura, Sôtarô, Hirofumi Araki, Yuka Hirata, Mitsuomi Takahashi', null, 'The team-up movie between Juken Sentai Gekiranger and GoGo Sentai Boukenger. Gekirangers are visited by Boukengers when someone from space with ultimate power threatens the existence of Earth', 'The team-up movie between Juken Sentai Gekiranger and GoGo Sentai Boukenger. Gekirangers are visited by Boukengers when someone from space with ultimate power threatens the existence of Earth', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aHugDPo8gzIAwTslSkWPj6sOLxK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:188216'),
  ('872461892876602554', 'Jules', 2023, 'Comedy, Science Fiction, Drama', 'David Weller, Peter Dorsey, Luke Cantarella', 'Gavin Steckler', 'Ben Kingsley, Harriet Sansom Harris, Jane Curtin, Jade Quon, Teddy Cañez, Narea Kang, Edward James Hyland, Blair Baker', 'PG-13', 'A flying saucer lands in the backyard of an elderly suburbanite with memory problems, who forms a bond with the scared alien inside.', 'A flying saucer lands in the backyard of an elderly suburbanite with memory problems, who forms a bond with the scared alien inside.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yMOWu8rpZPiBI0j8MInBTtNO0vU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1072371'),
  ('799732224802923973', 'Jules and Dolores', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Caito Ortiz', 'Caito Ortiz, Lusa Silvestre', 'Paulo Tiefenthaler, Danilo Grangheia, Taís Araújo, Mr. Catra, Milhem Cortaz, Thelmo Fernandes, Leandro Firmino, Otto Jr.', null, 'On December 19th, 1983, the dream was taken away. The most coveted trophy of all time, the Jules Rimet Cup disappeared from the headquarters of CBF, the Brazilian Football Association. Let me explain: every 4 years FIFA holds a Football World Cup. Back then, only a country that won the Cup three times could keep the trophy for good. This privilege was reserved to Brazil when they won for the 3rd time in 1970. The beautiful trophy was kept as a symbol of superiority in the headquarters of CBF, in Rio de Janeiro. “Jules and Dolores” is a pop comedy that tell us the real, preposterous and unusual story behind this theft.', 'On December 19th, 1983, the dream was taken away. The most coveted trophy of all time, the Jules Rimet Cup disappeared from the headquarters of CBF, the Brazilian Football Association. Let me explain: every 4 years FIFA holds a Football World Cup. Back then, only a country that won the Cup three times could keep the trophy for good. This privilege was reserved to Brazil when they won for the 3rd time in 1970. The beautiful trophy was kept as a symbol of superiority in the headquarters of CBF, in Rio de Janeiro. “Jules and Dolores” is a pop comedy that tell us the real, preposterous and unusual story behind this theft.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jTpawXfV72mMfJYpIgJt4Yd9GZQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:381066'),
  ('57124638048755835', 'Jules and Jim', 1962, 'Drama, Romance', 'François Truffaut, Raoul Coutard, Robert Bober', null, 'Jeanne Moreau, Oskar Werner, Henri Serre, Marie Dubois, Sabine Haudepin, Vanna Urbino, Serge Rezvani, Anny Nelsen', 'NR', 'In the carefree days before World War I, introverted Austrian author Jules strikes up a friendship with the exuberant Frenchman Jim and both men fall for the impulsive and beautiful Catherine.', 'In the carefree days before World War I, introverted Austrian author Jules strikes up a friendship with the exuberant Frenchman Jim and both men fall for the impulsive and beautiful Catherine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kuFjZlcZhQFDtIjuI3GQJjsQG03.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1628'),
  ('722430887709417490', 'Jules Verne''s Rocket to the Moon', 1967, 'Comedy, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Don Sharp, Reginald H. Wyer', 'Dave Freeman', 'Burl Ives, Troy Donahue, Gert Fröbe, Hermione Gingold, Lionel Jeffries, Dennis Price, Daliah Lavi, Stratford Johns', null, 'Phineas T. Barnum and friends finance the first flight to the moon but find the task a little above them. They attempt to blast their rocket into orbit from a massive gun barrel built into the side of a Welsh mountain, but money troubles, spies and saboteurs ensure that the plan is doomed before it starts...', 'Phineas T. Barnum and friends finance the first flight to the moon but find the task a little above them. They attempt to blast their rocket into orbit from a massive gun barrel built into the side of a Welsh mountain, but money troubles, spies and saboteurs ensure that the plan is doomed before it starts...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rXKXIYkAAOsEpxm2HBjIran2o1c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48135'),
  ('711842383969356757', 'Julia', 1974, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Sigi Rothemund, Heinz Hölscher, Uli Strobel', 'Wolfgang Bauer', 'Ekkehardt Belle, Jean-Claude Bouillon, Sylvia Kristel, Teri Tordai, Gisela Hahn, Peter Berling, Rose Renée Roth, Christine Glasner', 'R', 'German boarding school student Pauli hopes to lose his virginity while visiting his father in Italy.', 'German boarding school student Pauli hopes to lose his virginity while visiting his father in Italy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/juyoOQttuYsmlk5n1j3j6JdiGSR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70914'),
  ('472113511347127732', 'Julia', 1977, 'Drama, Romance, Thriller', 'Alain Bonnot, Anthony Waye, Fred Zinnemann', 'Alvin Sargent', 'Jane Fonda, Vanessa Redgrave, Jason Robards, Maximilian Schell, Hal Holbrook, Rosemary Murphy, Meryl Streep, Dora Doll', 'PG', 'At the behest of an old and dear friend, playwright Lillian Hellman undertakes a dangerous mission to smuggle funds into Nazi Germany.', 'At the behest of an old and dear friend, playwright Lillian Hellman undertakes a dangerous mission to smuggle funds into Nazi Germany.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qHtPzs9eVCilp88c1arq73gH6xk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42222'),
  ('148268652796434544', 'Julia', 1999, 'Drama, Romance', 'Roy Stuart', null, 'Anna Bielska, Genevieve Essesse, Tina Aumont, Christine Donval, Pascal Mufflet', null, 'Giulia is an independent young woman who is prepared to offer her body and her spirit against all the religious taboos.', 'Giulia is an independent young woman who is prepared to offer her body and her spirit against all the religious taboos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k35vXTo16eCi0UDDRmtIhLR1Esi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:257657'),
  ('520053043065523585', 'Julia', 2008, 'Drama', 'Erick Zonca, Yorick Le Saux', 'Erick Zonca, Aude Py', 'Tilda Swinton, Saul Rubinek, Kate del Castillo, Aidan Gould, Jude Ciccolella, Bruno Bichir, Horacio García Rojas, Gaston Peterson', 'R', 'An alcoholic becomes involved in a fellow A.A. member''s plan to kidnap her young son from the boy''s wealthy grandfather.', 'An alcoholic becomes involved in a fellow A.A. member''s plan to kidnap her young son from the boy''s wealthy grandfather.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9TuusjQoZqbsFr5DmnuBV7amoBB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7351'),
  ('242379862071856989', 'Julia and Julia', 1988, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Peter Del Monte, Giuseppe Rotunno', 'Peter Del Monte, Silvia Napolitano, Sandro Petraglia', 'Kathleen Turner, Gabriel Byrne, Sting, Gabriele Ferzetti, Yorgo Voyagis, John Steiner, Renato Scarpa, Angela Goodwin', null, 'A grieving woman, haunted by the loss of her husband on their wedding day, suddenly finds herself slipping between two realities—one where she remains a widow and another where he is alive with their son. As she struggles to distinguish truth from illusion, she becomes entangled in love, betrayal, and mystery, questioning her sanity while searching for answers in a world that keeps shifting.', 'A grieving woman, haunted by the loss of her husband on their wedding day, suddenly finds herself slipping between two realities—one where she remains a widow and another where he is alive with their son. As she struggles to distinguish truth from illusion, she becomes entangled in love, betrayal, and mystery, questioning her sanity while searching for answers in a world that keeps shifting.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6GPNV1piaFgYXduDIMc9FIMh7Dx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58084'),
  ('136451727797988958', 'Julia Misbehaves', 1948, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Jack Conway, Joseph Ruttenberg, Marvin Stuart', 'Margery Sharp, Monckton Hoffe', 'Greer Garson, Walter Pidgeon, Peter Lawford, Elizabeth Taylor, Cesar Romero, Lucile Watson, Nigel Bruce, Mary Boland', 'G', 'Julia and William were married and soon separated by his snobbish family. They meet again many years later, when their daughter he has raised invites her mother to her wedding, with the disapproval of William''s mother.', 'Julia and William were married and soon separated by his snobbish family. They meet again many years later, when their daughter he has raised invites her mother to her wedding, with the disapproval of William''s mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qX9lZApUTrJvgvzj6mUttkKL4Ze.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69483'),
  ('849106064765860476', 'Julia X', 2011, 'Horror', 'P.J. Pettiette', 'Matt Cunningham', 'Valerie Azlynn, Kevin Sorbo, Alicia Leigh Willis, Joel David Moore, Ving Rhames, Saxon Sharbino, Gregg Brazzel, Meg Rains', 'NR', 'Meeting a man on the Internet, Julia decides to see him in person, only to get abducted and branded with the letter "x" by that guy. A game of cat and mouse follows, but the story has an unexpected twist.', 'Meeting a man on the Internet, Julia decides to see him in person, only to get abducted and branded with the letter "x" by that guy. A game of cat and mouse follows, but the story has an unexpected twist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z8OrB7nM2HBAz7IQ3s8PQlKFDr2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84228'),
  ('301701963716829208', 'Julia''s Eyes', 2010, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Guillem Morales, Óscar Faura, Reyes Matabuena', 'Oriol Paulo, Guillem Morales', 'Belén Rueda, Lluís Homar, Pablo Derqui, Francesc Orella, Joan Dalmau, Julia Gutiérrez Caba, Boris Ruiz, Dani Codina', 'NR', 'Julia, a woman suffering from a degenerative sight disease, finds her blind sister Sara hung in a basement. Despite all signs pointing to suicide, Julia decides to investigate what she intuitively feels is a murder case.', 'Julia, a woman suffering from a degenerative sight disease, finds her blind sister Sara hung in a basement. Despite all signs pointing to suicide, Julia decides to investigate what she intuitively feels is a murder case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p9HqHVdW9oedgRMyZkBov8hDQiW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52274'),
  ('11634211425964724', 'Julia(s)', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Pauline Thomas, Arthur Baudu, Aude Mancel', 'Olivier Treiner, Camille Moreau', 'Lou de Laâge, Raphaël Personnaz, Grégory Gadebois, Denis Podalydès, Esther Garrel, Dylan Raffin, Aliocha Schneider, Marc de Panda', null, 'Paris 2052. Julia, 80 years old, had a fulfilled life. On her birthday, she reflects on the decisions and circumstances that could have led her on different paths. From the age of 17 to this day, her life was full of small but critical moments. Each was a turning point with dramatic consequences. What would have happened if she had forgotten her passport, chosen a different line at the store, driven the scooter this one time...? Is her life a succession of coincidences and accidents or a ready-made path?', 'Paris 2052. Julia, 80 years old, had a fulfilled life. On her birthday, she reflects on the decisions and circumstances that could have led her on different paths. From the age of 17 to this day, her life was full of small but critical moments. Each was a turning point with dramatic consequences. What would have happened if she had forgotten her passport, chosen a different line at the store, driven the scooter this one time...? Is her life a succession of coincidences and accidents or a ready-made path?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lB8Lzfkd3FPnDWcrEpvvFFMDjee.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:892530'),
  ('904661808577480557', 'Julian', 2012, 'Drama', 'António da Silva', 'Timothy Smith, Julian, António da Silva', 'Rodrigo Peñalosa, Julian', null, 'Julian is an experimental biographical piece about two men – Julian and Antonio – who disconnected themselves from the anxious city, and allowed their spirits to be taken by nature. It is a slightly voyeuristic love letter about and to Julian – the Swiss man whom the narrator has briefly met in London and, shortly after, invited to a road-trip to Portugal.', 'Julian is an experimental biographical piece about two men – Julian and Antonio – who disconnected themselves from the anxious city, and allowed their spirits to be taken by nature. It is a slightly voyeuristic love letter about and to Julian – the Swiss man whom the narrator has briefly met in London and, shortly after, invited to a road-trip to Portugal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rxLraxfrEHfziD2G4fSIxBuJDg2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:231824'),
  ('781150609009667578', 'Julian Po', 1997, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Bernd Heinl, Alan Wade, Jim LaClair', 'Alan Wade', 'Christian Slater, Robin Tunney, Michael Parks, Cherry Jones, Frankie Faison, Harve Presnell, Allison Janney, LaTanya Richardson Jackson', null, 'Christian Slater is a stranger who comes to a small town. The local citizens think he''s up to no good. After bothering him for a while, he blurts out in frustration, that he is there to kill himself.', 'Christian Slater is a stranger who comes to a small town. The local citizens think he''s up to no good. After bothering him for a while, he blurts out in frustration, that he is there to kill himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2kdCZztkyS0sgtoWaLp3zebp1uE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100196'),
  ('431716496073136659', 'Julie', 1956, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Gilbert Mandelik, Fred Jackman Jr., Andrew L. Stone', 'Andrew L. Stone', 'Doris Day, Louis Jourdan, Barry Sullivan, Frank Lovejoy, Jack Kelly, Ann Robinson, Barney Phillips, Jack Kruschen', 'NR', 'A terrified stewardess is stalked by her psychotic estranged husband.', 'A terrified stewardess is stalked by her psychotic estranged husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oqErT25YdLQEkE1TrLihbOl2AIb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45726'),
  ('148451309625433374', 'Julie & Julia', 2009, 'Romance, Drama', 'Nora Ephron, Stephen Goldblatt, Jeffrey T. Bernstein', 'Nora Ephron', 'Meryl Streep, Amy Adams, Stanley Tucci, Chris Messina, Linda Emond, Helen Carey, Mary Lynn Rajskub, Jane Lynch', 'PG-13', 'Julia Child and Julie Powell – both of whom wrote memoirs – find their lives intertwined. Though separated by time and space, both women are at loose ends... until they discover that with the right combination of passion, fearlessness and butter, anything is possible.', 'Julia Child and Julie Powell – both of whom wrote memoirs – find their lives intertwined. Though separated by time and space, both women are at loose ends... until they discover that with the right combination of passion, fearlessness and butter, anything is possible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1QZNWOOwfRi86ZApGvr2TtJZPBK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24803'),
  ('707082852567090351', 'Julie Darling', 1983, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Paul Nicholas, Miklós Lente', 'Paul Nicholas, Maurice Smith', 'Anthony Franciosa, Sybil Danning, Isabelle Mejias, Paul Hubbard, Cindy Girling, Reinhard Kolldehoff, Michael Tregor, Natascha Rybakowski', 'R', 'A teenage girl whose inaction caused her mother''s death arranges a similarly gruesome fate for her stepmother and brother.', 'A teenage girl whose inaction caused her mother''s death arranges a similarly gruesome fate for her stepmother and brother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w6wBlnLHmJVC7nV3vO5Sx4UfTBX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81475'),
  ('1014612894007613895', 'Julie Keeps Quiet', 2024, 'Drama', 'Leonardo Van Dijl, Nicolas Karakatsanis, Joke Pevenage', 'Leonardo Van Dijl, Ruth Becquart', 'Tessa Van den Broeck, Grace Biot, Alyssa Lorette, Ruth Becquart, Koen De Bouw, Pierre Gervais, Claire Bodson, Laurent Caron', null, 'As the star player at an elite tennis academy, Julie’s life revolves around the game she loves. When her coach falls under investigation and is suddenly suspended, all of the club’s players are encouraged to speak up. But Julie decides to keep quiet...', 'As the star player at an elite tennis academy, Julie’s life revolves around the game she loves. When her coach falls under investigation and is suddenly suspended, all of the club’s players are encouraged to speak up. But Julie decides to keep quiet...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/HscPMTxowVUG4I20uWEdnD3PaT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1187308'),
  ('151994636868205134', 'Julie pot-de-colle', 1977, 'Comedy', 'Philippe de Broca', 'Jean-Claude Carrière', 'Jean-Claude Brialy, Marlène Jobert, Christian Alers, Philippe Rouleau, Alexandra Stewart, Catherine Alric', null, 'Julie asks Jean-Luc Farlot, authorized signatory of a big European bank to help her disguise a murder as an accident.', 'Julie asks Jean-Luc Farlot, authorized signatory of a big European bank to help her disguise a murder as an accident.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3lCcP07XFFVIn42eR4k3z3kZH28.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:365551'),
  ('1144439846377836995', 'Julien Donkey-Boy', 1999, 'Drama', 'Harmony Korine, Anthony Dod Mantle', 'Harmony Korine', 'Ewen Bremner, Chloë Sevigny, Werner Herzog, Evan Neumann, Joyce Korine, Alvin Law, Brian Fisk, Miriram Martinez', 'R', 'Undiagnosed, untreated and generally untethered schizophrenic Julien lives with his pregnant younger sister, anorexic aspiring wrestler brother, sympathetic grandmother, and severely depressed and abusive German father.', 'Undiagnosed, untreated and generally untethered schizophrenic Julien lives with his pregnant younger sister, anorexic aspiring wrestler brother, sympathetic grandmother, and severely depressed and abusive German father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mK8pJA05Sdp3Hc4KWHMqhaMEbVW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42881'),
  ('183654290630658434', 'Juliet & Romeo', 2025, 'Romance, Drama', 'Timothy Scott Bogart, Byron Werner, Amy Kate Dolan', 'Timothy Scott Bogart', 'Clara Rugaard, Jamie Ward, Jason Isaacs, Dan Fogler, Rebel Wilson, Rupert Everett, Derek Jacobi, Lidia Vitale', 'PG-13', 'Set in 1301 at the end of Medieval times, our most famous star-crossed lovers turn the tides on the history Shakespeare based his own story on, as they reveal the truth to the very future of the Empire. But the biggest twist in this most beloved of tales, is leaving the poetry of Iambic Pentameter in the past, for the original pop music that rockets these ever-present themes right to the heart of our characters in the most surprising, and perhaps most powerful way that has ever been seen, or heard, before... The greatest love story of all time, set to the greatest music of our time.', 'Set in 1301 at the end of Medieval times, our most famous star-crossed lovers turn the tides on the history Shakespeare based his own story on, as they reveal the truth to the very future of the Empire. But the biggest twist in this most beloved of tales, is leaving the poetry of Iambic Pentameter in the past, for the original pop music that rockets these ever-present themes right to the heart of our characters in the most surprising, and perhaps most powerful way that has ever been seen, or heard, before... The greatest love story of all time, set to the greatest music of our time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4spOdjLgRAbIYO7mu22DQ2iInz7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1103857'),
  ('370235472916622282', 'Juliet in Paris', 1967, 'Horror, Drama, Mystery', 'Pierre-William Glenn, Claude Miller', null, 'Juliet Berto', null, 'A young student, alone in Paris, is engaged in strange and bloody experiences of which she is both the authorizer and the victim.', 'A young student, alone in Paris, is engaged in strange and bloody experiences of which she is both the authorizer and the victim.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yxuJ1coJpJfAZ23WeADLHS94cSt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:539288'),
  ('1068777621590958370', 'Juliet of the Spirits', 1965, 'Comedy, Drama, Fantasy', 'Federico Fellini, Francesco Aluigi, Gianni Di Venanzo', 'Federico Fellini, Tullio Pinelli, Ennio Flaiano', 'Giulietta Masina, Sandra Milo, Mario Pisu, Valentina Cortese, Valeska Gert, José Luis de Vilallonga, Friedrich von Ledebur, Caterina Boratto', null, 'Middle-aged Giulietta grows suspicious of her husband, Giorgio, when his behavior grows increasingly questionable. One night when Giorgio initiates a seance amongst his friends, Giulietta gets in touch with spirits and learns more about herself and her painful past. Slightly skeptical, but intrigued, she visits a mystic who gives her more information -- and nudges her toward the realization that her husband is indeed a philanderer.', 'Middle-aged Giulietta grows suspicious of her husband, Giorgio, when his behavior grows increasingly questionable. One night when Giorgio initiates a seance amongst his friends, Giulietta gets in touch with spirits and learns more about herself and her painful past. Slightly skeptical, but intrigued, she visits a mystic who gives her more information -- and nudges her toward the realization that her husband is indeed a philanderer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/NbN10moPWQiiIKDJsC7A3j4Mcy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19120'),
  ('787792700570230812', 'Juliet, Naked', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Jesse Peretz, Remi Adefarasin, Emily Perowne', 'Tamara Jenkins, Jim Taylor, Evgenia Peretz', 'Rose Byrne, Ethan Hawke, Chris O''Dowd, Azhy Robertson, Lily Brazier, Megan Dodds, Ayoola Smart, Enzo Cilenti', 'R', 'Annie is stuck in a long-term relationship with Duncan – an obsessive fan of obscure rocker Tucker Crowe. When the acoustic demo of Tucker''s hit record from 25 years ago surfaces, its discovery leads to a life-changing encounter with the elusive rocker himself.', 'Annie is stuck in a long-term relationship with Duncan – an obsessive fan of obscure rocker Tucker Crowe. When the acoustic demo of Tucker''s hit record from 25 years ago surfaces, its discovery leads to a life-changing encounter with the elusive rocker himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tj4lbeWQBvPwGjadEAAjJdQolko.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:458344'),
  ('210110341379693192', 'Julieta', 2016, 'Drama, Romance', 'Pedro Almodóvar, Jean-Claude Larrieu', 'Pedro Almodóvar', 'Emma Suárez, Adriana Ugarte, Daniel Grao, Inma Cuesta, Darío Grandinetti, Michelle Jenner, Pilar Castro, Nathalie Poza', 'R', 'The film spans 30 years in Julieta’s life from a nostalgic 1985 where everything seems hopeful, to 2015 where her life appears to be beyond repair and she is on the verge of madness.', 'The film spans 30 years in Julieta’s life from a nostalgic 1985 where everything seems hopeful, to 2015 where her life appears to be beyond repair and she is on the verge of madness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z4aErD1RQQ3alpu3PoUu408HEVc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:332872'),
  ('7434034242637633', 'Juliette', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Pierre Godeau, Muriel Cravatte', 'Saskia de Rothschild, Pierre Godeau', 'Àstrid Bergès-Frisbey, Féodor Atkine, Yannik Landrein, Élodie Bouchez, Sébastien Houbani, Roman Kolinka, Nina Meurisse, Yoli Fuller', null, 'Young Juliette is obsessed with dying in tragedy, just as her namesake. Desperate to find her Romeo before her 15th birthday, Juliette goes to great lengths to make her classmates fall deeply in love with her.', 'Young Juliette is obsessed with dying in tragedy, just as her namesake. Desperate to find her Romeo before her 15th birthday, Juliette goes to great lengths to make her classmates fall deeply in love with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jC2KXYaSdTOpo9X0COo4DATEdPK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:203726'),
  ('535244725987392107', 'Juliette dans son bain', 2022, 'Comedy, TV Movie, Drama', 'Jean-Paul Lilienfeld', 'Gilles Taurand, Jean-Paul Lilienfeld', 'André Dussollier, Marisa Berenson, Jean-François Balmer, Nicolas Bridet, Charlotte Gabris, Bruno Todeschini, Marie-Christine Orry, Manue Fleytoux', null, 'Ronny Kandiotis, a billionaire and art lover, is the guest of a major museum, on the occasion of a donation to France of two paintings, one by Gauguin and the other by Munch. The same evening, his daughter Lara, is kidnapped by a mysterious organization, which demands as ransom the publication of texts casting opprobrium on this supposedly virtuous man, while the media is already actively seizing the case.', 'Ronny Kandiotis, a billionaire and art lover, is the guest of a major museum, on the occasion of a donation to France of two paintings, one by Gauguin and the other by Munch. The same evening, his daughter Lara, is kidnapped by a mysterious organization, which demands as ransom the publication of texts casting opprobrium on this supposedly virtuous man, while the media is already actively seizing the case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eolkexTFh5o0lf42KF9djDpZxTy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:965312'),
  ('650583493850496644', 'Juliette in Spring', 2024, 'Drama', 'Blandine Lenoir, Brice Pancot', 'Blandine Lenoir, Maud Ameline', 'Izïa Higelin, Jean-Pierre Darroussin, Sophie Guillemin, Salif Cissé, Noémie Lvovsky, Éric Caravaca, Liliane Rovère, Leny Morand', null, 'Juliette goes back in her hometown to spend some time with her family. She finds herself between a loving but moody father, a New Age mother, a sister in the midst of an existential crisis, and a grandmother slowly losing her mind. Buried memories and family secrets rise to the surface in this sweet, tender and sometimes extravagant family portrait.', 'Juliette goes back in her hometown to spend some time with her family. She finds herself between a loving but moody father, a New Age mother, a sister in the midst of an existential crisis, and a grandmother slowly losing her mind. Buried memories and family secrets rise to the surface in this sweet, tender and sometimes extravagant family portrait.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tAsdLuwi7JVoHQvMRpn95JBXBrO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1000965'),
  ('815142261814197410', 'Juliette, or Key of Dreams', 1951, 'Drama, Fantasy, Romance', 'Marcel Carné, Henri Alekan', 'Georges Neveux', 'Gérard Philipe, Suzanne Cloutier, Gabrielle Fontan, Jean-Roger Caussimon, Édouard Delmont, René Génin, Roland Lesaffre, Arthur Devère', null, 'Michel has stolen from his employer, Mr Bellanger, for the love of Juliette. He is now in jail. One night, while sleeping in his cell, he wakes up all of a sudden, the gates open and he finds himself in a strange village where all the inhabitants have lost their memory. There, meets Juliette again who seems to agree to marry a powerful man, who might well be Bluebeard...', 'Michel has stolen from his employer, Mr Bellanger, for the love of Juliette. He is now in jail. One night, while sleeping in his cell, he wakes up all of a sudden, the gates open and he finds himself in a strange village where all the inhabitants have lost their memory. There, meets Juliette again who seems to agree to marry a powerful man, who might well be Bluebeard...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/px3iQgtKflMkSV6XlKInK3wqiiX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117239'),
  ('677295243474202673', 'Julio Begins in July', 1979, 'Drama', 'Silvio Caiozzi, Luis Alarcón, Víctor Segura', 'Gustavo Frías', 'Elsa Alarcón, Juan Cristóbal Meza, Luis Alarcón, Shlomit Baytelman, Tennyson Ferrada, Jaime Vadell, Delfina Guzmán, Marcial Edwards', null, 'This is the story of a teenager at the turn of the century in the conservative higher classes of Chile and the initiation rites in his society.', 'This is the story of a teenager at the turn of the century in the conservative higher classes of Chile and the initiation rites in his society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/si3tNNltgOL7XHRcbq8DZARNBG4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107426'),
  ('1074247589013285587', 'Julio Sumiu', 2014, 'Drama, Comedy, Crime', 'Pedro Sotero, Roberto Berliner, Luciana Baptista', 'Beto Silva, Patrícia Andrade', 'Lília Cabral, Carolina Dieckmmann, Fiuk, Augusto Madeira, Dudu Sandroni, Stepan Nercessian, Leandro Firmino, Hugo Grativol', null, 'Rio de Janeiro, in the period in which the Police Pacification Units (PPUs) were beginning to be deployed in the city. Edna (Lilia Cabral) is the mother of Julio (Pedro Nercessian) and Silvio (Fiuk). One day she wakes up desperate to see that Julio just disappeared!', 'Rio de Janeiro, in the period in which the Police Pacification Units (PPUs) were beginning to be deployed in the city. Edna (Lilia Cabral) is the mother of Julio (Pedro Nercessian) and Silvio (Fiuk). One day she wakes up desperate to see that Julio just disappeared!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Vd3FwktS5GqKDiLwS2VpNW37WK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:227929'),
  ('1059837027620155987', 'Julius Caesar', 1953, 'Drama, History', 'Howard W. Koch, Joseph Ruttenberg, Joseph L. Mankiewicz', null, 'Marlon Brando, James Mason, John Gielgud, Louis Calhern, Edmond O''Brien, Greer Garson, Deborah Kerr, George Macready', 'NR', 'The growing ambition of Julius Caesar is a source of major concern to his close friend Brutus. Cassius persuades him to participate in his plot to assassinate Caesar but both have sorely underestimated Mark Antony.', 'The growing ambition of Julius Caesar is a source of major concern to his close friend Brutus. Cassius persuades him to participate in his plot to assassinate Caesar but both have sorely underestimated Mark Antony.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2nzpmJ9MIdd5TKXJd53KgKdZ6eT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18019'),
  ('479112120654436069', 'Julius Caesar', 1970, 'War, Drama, History', 'Stuart Burge, Tony Buck, Tony Curtis', 'Robert Furnival', 'Charlton Heston, Jason Robards, John Gielgud, Robert Vaughn, Richard Chamberlain, Christopher Lee, Richard Johnson, Diana Rigg', 'G', 'All-star cast glamorizes this lavish 1970 remake of the classic William Shakespeare play, which portrays the assassination of Julius Caesar on the Ides of March, and the resulting war between the faction led by the assassins and the faction led by Mark Anthony.', 'All-star cast glamorizes this lavish 1970 remake of the classic William Shakespeare play, which portrays the assassination of Julius Caesar on the Ides of March, and the resulting war between the faction led by the assassins and the faction led by Mark Anthony.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vM8TTna0YBCfXsOjS3GkfKOzwu8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42592'),
  ('83516065181798679', 'July 14', 1933, 'Comedy, Romance', 'René Clair, Georges Périnal, Hermann Storr', 'René Clair', 'Annabella, George Rigaud, Raymond Cordy, Paul Ollivier, Raymond Aimos, Thomy Bourdelle, Michel André, Pola Illéry', null, 'A light, comedy romance about a cab driver named Jean and a flower girl named Anna that takes place in Paris during the Bastille day celebration of July 14th.', 'A light, comedy romance about a cab driver named Jean and a flower girl named Anna that takes place in Paris during the Bastille day celebration of July 14th.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wzCFlcx4B2pX58eZCA0REJOmDvG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:205380'),
  ('1072471902462777184', 'July Rain', 1967, 'Drama, Romance', 'Marlen Khutsiyev, German Lavrov, Boris Vengerovsky', 'Marlen Khutsiyev, Anatoli Grebnev', 'Evgeniya Uralova, Aleksandr Belyavskiy, Yuri Vizbor, Aleksandr Mitta, Alla Pokrovskaya, Valentina Sharykina, Evgeniya Kozyreva, Ilya Bylinkin', null, 'Lena, a woman in her late twenties, loves her boyfriend, but in time comes to see that their relationship serves no useful function. What''s more, she sees that her friends are for the most part empty-headed lackeys, causing her to wonder just what is the point of her life.', 'Lena, a woman in her late twenties, loves her boyfriend, but in time comes to see that their relationship serves no useful function. What''s more, she sees that her friends are for the most part empty-headed lackeys, causing her to wonder just what is the point of her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/497CGtHQXdoZXnifLu5CGtWgqbG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104810'),
  ('958604759256971703', 'July Rhapsody', 2002, 'Drama, Romance', 'Ann Hui, Kwan Pung-Leung, Connie Ng Sau-wah', 'Ivy Ho', 'Jacky Cheung Hok-Yau, Anita Mui Yim-Fong, Karena Lam Kar-Yan, Shaun Tam Chun-Yin, Tou Tsung-hua, Eric Kot Man-Fai, Jin Hui Man-jun, Leung Tin', null, 'Outwardly, Lam takes pride in his job teaching Chinese literature at an elite school and in his caring wife and two sons. But deep down, the forty-year-old wrestles with unfulfilled desires stoked by jealousy over his friends’ professional successes and the advances of a flirtatious student. The sudden return of his former mentor finally upsets this delicate balance, forcing Lam to unearth the long-hidden truth about who he is and gain a new perspective on how to live the rest of his life.', 'Outwardly, Lam takes pride in his job teaching Chinese literature at an elite school and in his caring wife and two sons. But deep down, the forty-year-old wrestles with unfulfilled desires stoked by jealousy over his friends’ professional successes and the advances of a flirtatious student. The sudden return of his former mentor finally upsets this delicate balance, forcing Lam to unearth the long-hidden truth about who he is and gain a new perspective on how to live the rest of his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A8J2cRXxPCxcma09kbEcg12SjG6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51484'),
  ('979120104784492966', 'July Tales', 2018, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Alan Guichaoua, Guillaume Brac', 'Guillaume Brac', 'Hanne Mathisen Haga, Andrea Romano, Sipan Mouradian, Milena Csergo, Lucie Grunstein, Salomé Diénis Meulien, Roman Jean-Elie, Jean Joudé', null, 'Two languorous summer days, two thorny tales of romantic misunderstanding: in part one, two girlfriends head to the Cergy leisure park for a day of swimming and equally vigorous flirtation; in the second, a Norwegian exchange student finds herself the target of unwanted attention from two would-be suitors.', 'Two languorous summer days, two thorny tales of romantic misunderstanding: in part one, two girlfriends head to the Cergy leisure park for a day of swimming and equally vigorous flirtation; in the second, a Norwegian exchange student finds herself the target of unwanted attention from two would-be suitors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g7VHIYIgLi4H741sGycNo4OGdea.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:467746'),
  ('123441609432113466', 'Jumanji', 1995, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Family', 'Joe Johnston, Thomas E. Ackerman, George Hull', 'Jim Strain, Jonathan Hensleigh, Greg Taylor', 'Robin Williams, Kirsten Dunst, Bradley Pierce, Bonnie Hunt, Jonathan Hyde, Bebe Neuwirth, David Alan Grier, Adam Hann-Byrd', 'PG', 'When siblings Judy and Peter discover an enchanted board game that opens the door to a magical world, they unwittingly invite Alan -- an adult who''s been trapped inside the game for 26 years -- into their living room. Alan''s only hope for freedom is to finish the game, which proves risky as all three find themselves running from giant rhinoceroses, evil monkeys and other terrifying creatures.', 'When siblings Judy and Peter discover an enchanted board game that opens the door to a magical world, they unwittingly invite Alan -- an adult who''s been trapped inside the game for 26 years -- into their living room. Alan''s only hope for freedom is to finish the game, which proves risky as all three find themselves running from giant rhinoceroses, evil monkeys and other terrifying creatures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vgpXmVaVyUL7GGiDeiK1mKEKzcX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8844'),
  ('132647195753368225', 'Jumanji 3', 2026, 'Fantasy, Adventure, Comedy', 'Jake Kasdan, Ben Davis, John Wildermuth', 'Jake Kasdan', 'Dwayne Johnson, Kevin Hart, Jack Black, Karen Gillan, Awkwafina, Alex Wolff, Morgan Turner, Madison Iseman', null, 'The third film in the Jumanji reboot franchise. Plot TBA.', 'The third film in the Jumanji reboot franchise. Plot TBA.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cjTddWunz5IG6r1ZrhqtGKsVPxq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1260649'),
  ('379574307636177916', 'Jumanji: The Next Level', 2019, 'Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Jake Kasdan, Andrew Max Cahn, Gyula Pados', 'Jeff Pinkner, Scott Rosenberg, Jake Kasdan', 'Dwayne Johnson, Kevin Hart, Jack Black, Karen Gillan, Awkwafina, Nick Jonas, Alex Wolff, Morgan Turner', 'PG-13', 'As the gang return to Jumanji to rescue one of their own, they discover that nothing is as they expect. The players will have to brave parts unknown and unexplored in order to escape the world’s most dangerous game.', 'As the gang return to Jumanji to rescue one of their own, they discover that nothing is as they expect. The players will have to brave parts unknown and unexplored in order to escape the world’s most dangerous game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jyw8VKYEiM1UDzPB7NsisUgBeJ8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:512200'),
  ('218005492603923325', 'Jumanji: Welcome to the Jungle', 2017, 'Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy, Action', 'Paul Schneider, Matt Rebenkoff, Jack Gill', 'Jim Strain, Greg Taylor, Jonathan Hensleigh', 'Dwayne Johnson, Kevin Hart, Jack Black, Karen Gillan, Rhys Darby, Bobby Cannavale, Nick Jonas, Alex Wolff', 'PG-13', 'Four teenagers in detention discover an old video game console with a game they’ve never heard of. When they decide to play, they are immediately sucked into the jungle world of Jumanji in the bodies of their avatars. They’ll have to complete the adventure of their lives filled with fun, thrills and danger or be stuck in the game forever!', 'Four teenagers in detention discover an old video game console with a game they’ve never heard of. When they decide to play, they are immediately sucked into the jungle world of Jumanji in the bodies of their avatars. They’ll have to complete the adventure of their lives filled with fun, thrills and danger or be stuck in the game forever!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pSgXKPU5h6U89ipF7HBYajvYt7j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:353486'),
  ('1002787836696041314', 'Jumbo', 2020, 'Fantasy, Romance', 'Alex Brown, Jordy Gonçalves Carvalho, Bruno Du Bois', 'Zoé Wittock', 'Noémie Merlant, Emmanuelle Bercot, Sam Louwyck, Bastien Bouillon, Tracy Dossou, Jonathan Bartholme, Eduard Nemcsenko, Noah Daccrissio', 'NR', 'Jeanne, a shy young woman, works as a night guard at an amusement park and has a close relationship with her mother. While no man can compete with this opposed duo, Jeanne begins to develop strange romantic feelings for Jumbo, the latest attraction at the theme park...', 'Jeanne, a shy young woman, works as a night guard at an amusement park and has a close relationship with her mother. While no man can compete with this opposed duo, Jeanne begins to develop strange romantic feelings for Jumbo, the latest attraction at the theme park...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dTrDxlTrqojxyNt82BbTSbJHhWU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:510631'),
  ('235693174867793413', 'Jumbo', 2025, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama, Family, Fantasy', 'Ryan Adriandhy, Widya Fajriah, Arnand Pratikto', 'Widya Arifianti, Ryan Adriandhy', 'Prince Poetiray, Quinn Salman, Graciella Abigail, M. Yusuf Ozkan, M. Adhiyat, Angga Yunanda, Ratna Riantiarno, Den Bagus Satrio Sasono', null, 'Desperate to prove to his peers that he’s more than a chubby kid that never wins at anything, little Don wishes to win his local talent show by performing a stageplay inspired from a storybook written by his late parents. When unfortunately a bully stole that book, at the same time a little ghost appeared from the spirit world asking for Don’s help to reunite her with her parents’ spirits. The two new friends then embark on an exciting adventure to help each other and learn the true meaning of friendship.', 'Desperate to prove to his peers that he’s more than a chubby kid that never wins at anything, little Don wishes to win his local talent show by performing a stageplay inspired from a storybook written by his late parents. When unfortunately a bully stole that book, at the same time a little ghost appeared from the spirit world asking for Don’s help to reunite her with her parents’ spirits. The two new friends then embark on an exciting adventure to help each other and learn the true meaning of friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Wzkp1jHJda9M8q96tAfFIbQLvB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1049082'),
  ('408330559537966265', 'Jump', 2023, 'Music, Documentary', null, null, 'Karen Polinesia, Lesslie Polinesia, Rafa Polinesio, Cecilia Cantú, Iñaki López', null, 'Mexico''s National Auditorium offers a journey through Rafa, Karen, and Lesslie`s musical transformation and evolution in an unforgettable visual and musical experience that moves the viewer to think about and incorporate a clear message on positive changes. This behind-the-scenes look brings us closer to the great adventure of the "JUMP Show" and all it entails. We`ll explore a wide range of emotions and family ties between the Polinesios and the situations that took them to their limits before they could face change.', 'Mexico''s National Auditorium offers a journey through Rafa, Karen, and Lesslie`s musical transformation and evolution in an unforgettable visual and musical experience that moves the viewer to think about and incorporate a clear message on positive changes. This behind-the-scenes look brings us closer to the great adventure of the "JUMP Show" and all it entails. We`ll explore a wide range of emotions and family ties between the Polinesios and the situations that took them to their limits before they could face change.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2AhdI96EWwizwuSDWrD4Vn1NKFE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1169582'),
  ('931406008823476600', 'Jump Ashin!', 2011, 'Drama', 'Lin Yu-Hsien, Hsia Shao-yu', null, 'Eddie Peng Yu-Yan, Lawrence Ko Yu-Luen, Zaizai Lin, Hank Chen Han-Dian, Lung Siu-Wah, Pan Li-li, Jay Ho Chieh, Li Kuan-I', null, 'Ashin has spent his enitre life training for the national team in gymnastics. His mother believes his work will amount to nothing and asks his high school coach to take him off the team. Ashin then quits the sport entirely. He quickly falls in with wrong crowd and finds himself in a lot of trouble. Ashin leaves his small hometown of Yilan. Will he ever get back to the sport that he loves?', 'Ashin has spent his enitre life training for the national team in gymnastics. His mother believes his work will amount to nothing and asks his high school coach to take him off the team. Ashin then quits the sport entirely. He quickly falls in with wrong crowd and finds himself in a lot of trouble. Ashin leaves his small hometown of Yilan. Will he ever get back to the sport that he loves?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hoPuw9QeDzDD5TpEtJHAFE9gGbF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79597'),
  ('886856434282557206', 'Jump In!', 2007, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Paul Hoen, David A. Makin', 'Doreen Spicer, Regina Y. Hicks, Karin Gist', 'Corbin Bleu, Keke Palmer, David Reivers, Shanica Knowles, Laivan Greene, Kylee Russell, Patrick Johnson Jr., Micah Williams', null, 'A young boxer, Izzy Daniels, trains to follow in his father''s footsteps by winning the Golden Glove. But when his friend, Mary asks him to substitute for a team member in a Double Dutch tournament, the young man discovers a hidden passion for jump roping, all while finding love with Mary and navigating conflict with himself and his father about boxing.', 'A young boxer, Izzy Daniels, trains to follow in his father''s footsteps by winning the Golden Glove. But when his friend, Mary asks him to substitute for a team member in a Double Dutch tournament, the young man discovers a hidden passion for jump roping, all while finding love with Mary and navigating conflict with himself and his father about boxing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bC15nPOGIOXohhqzC2GTg0DlqIy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13968'),
  ('82970637490264904', 'Jumper', 2008, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Doug Liman, Barry Peterson, Thomas Valentine', 'Jim Uhls, Simon Kinberg, David S. Goyer', 'Hayden Christensen, Jamie Bell, Samuel L. Jackson, Rachel Bilson, Michael Rooker, Diane Lane, AnnaSophia Robb, Max Thieriot', 'PG-13', 'David Rice is a man who knows no boundaries, a Jumper, born with the uncanny ability to teleport instantly to anywhere on Earth. When he discovers others like himself, David is thrust into a dangerous and bloodthirsty war while being hunted by a sinister and determined group of zealots who have sworn to destroy all Jumpers. Now, David’s extraordinary gift may be his only hope for survival!', 'David Rice is a man who knows no boundaries, a Jumper, born with the uncanny ability to teleport instantly to anywhere on Earth. When he discovers others like himself, David is thrust into a dangerous and bloodthirsty war while being hunted by a sinister and determined group of zealots who have sworn to destroy all Jumpers. Now, David’s extraordinary gift may be his only hope for survival!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3pPZ9JhNz3VMmASVir5SMHvTDUU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8247'),
  ('772426873082171522', 'Jumpin'' at the Bedside', 1976, 'Comedy, Romance', 'John Hilbard', 'Gitte Palsby, John Hilbard', 'Ole Søltoft, Søren Strømberg, Annie Birgit Garde, Vivi Rau, Paul Hagen, Steen Frøhne, Anne Bie Warburg, Ulla Jessen', null, 'The head of a big engineering firm is a workaholic who neglects his pretty young wife - leading to her joining an "escort" service as a means of sexual relief. All is well, until the escort service is hired to entertain the engineering firm''s clients at a swingers'' party.', 'The head of a big engineering firm is a workaholic who neglects his pretty young wife - leading to her joining an "escort" service as a means of sexual relief. All is well, until the escort service is hired to entertain the engineering firm''s clients at a swingers'' party.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rp4h6gN6aDrnse6q47ghhpKotR8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24934'),
  ('758392079559978197', 'Jumpin'' at the Boneyard', 1991, 'Drama', 'Jeff Stanzler, Brian Gutherman, Lloyd Steven Goldfine', 'Jeff Stanzler', 'Tim Roth, Alexis Arquette, Danitra Vance, Kathleen Chalfant, Samuel L. Jackson, Luis Guzmán, Elizabeth Bracco, Jeffrey Wright', 'R', 'Manny tries to get his crack addict brother, Danny, to clean up.', 'Manny tries to get his crack addict brother, Danny, to clean up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zsfmHzlblEOC9iU0oNB99YtIEpj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:226251'),
  ('168503774788083985', 'Jumpin'' Jack Flash', 1986, 'Romance, Comedy, Thriller', 'Penny Marshall, Matthew F. Leonetti, Daniel Ducovny', 'Chris Thompson, David Franzoni, Charles Shyer', 'Whoopi Goldberg, Stephen Collins, John Wood, Carol Kane, Annie Potts, Peter Michael Goetz, Roscoe Lee Browne, Sara Botsford', 'R', 'Terry works for a bank, and uses computers to communicate with clients all over the world. One day, she gets a strange coded message from an unknown source. After decoding the message, Terry becomes embroiled in an espionage ring. People are killed, and Terry is chased. Throughout, she remains in contact with this mysterious person, who needs Terry''s help save his life.', 'Terry works for a bank, and uses computers to communicate with clients all over the world. One day, she gets a strange coded message from an unknown source. After decoding the message, Terry becomes embroiled in an espionage ring. People are killed, and Terry is chased. Throughout, she remains in contact with this mysterious person, who needs Terry''s help save his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/znVUM7RUBwQ16Q9lTmuMpaWJ7so.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10945'),
  ('36313843582303042', 'Jumpin'' Jupiter', 1955, 'Animation, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Chuck Jones', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'A strange alien captures Porky Pig and Sylvester''s entire campsite as a sample to take back to its planet, but only Sylvester figures out what is really going on.', 'A strange alien captures Porky Pig and Sylvester''s entire campsite as a sample to take back to its planet, but only Sylvester figures out what is really going on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fcw3zKLrmEL8JzPZ03EBu1BlSxz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84591'),
  ('2605712760693750', 'Jumping', 1984, 'Animation, Fantasy', 'Osamu Tezuka', 'Osamu Tezuka', null, null, 'A boy walks down the street and as he goes along his strides increase. Eventually he leaps over towns, forests, and oceans, seeing many things and surprising many people along the way.', 'A boy walks down the street and as he goes along his strides increase. Eventually he leaps over towns, forests, and oceans, seeing many things and surprising many people along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jEtZqTXZ8pGlue6KDw8Mnczcza0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47217'),
  ('235314227165099062', 'Jumping from High Places', 2022, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Daniele Massaccesi, Maurilio Mangano, Roy Bava', 'Alice Urciuolo', 'Federica Torchetti, Celeste Savino, Cristiano Caccamo, Lorenzo Richelmy, Fausto Maria Sciarappa, Anna Ferruzzo, Roberto Galano, Beatrice Modica', 'PG-13', 'To honor her best friend''s last wish, a young woman with severe anxiety confronts her greatest fears to try and reclaim her life — and perhaps find love.', 'To honor her best friend''s last wish, a young woman with severe anxiety confronts her greatest fears to try and reclaim her life — and perhaps find love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sPHpbnhFNGyYGzXMT5BQatdIYQN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1024426'),
  ('846865152290756084', 'Jumping Jacks', 1952, 'Comedy', 'Norman Taurog, Daniel L. Fapp, Joseph J. Lilley', 'Frederic I. Rinaldo, Robert Lees, Herbert Baker', 'Dean Martin, Jerry Lewis, Mona Freeman, Don DeFore, Robert Strauss, Richard Erdman, Ray Teal, Marcy McGuire', null, 'Nightclub entertainer Hap Smith has a new act since his former partner Chick Allen joined the army. With his lovely new female partner, Hap now plays a clownish parody of a soldier. When Chick organises a soldier show at Fort Benning, he realizes he needs his former partner''s help—so, to get onto the base, Hap impersonates a hapless real soldier, but circumstances force them to prolong the masquerade, creating an increasingly tangled Army-sized SNAFU.', 'Nightclub entertainer Hap Smith has a new act since his former partner Chick Allen joined the army. With his lovely new female partner, Hap now plays a clownish parody of a soldier. When Chick organises a soldier show at Fort Benning, he realizes he needs his former partner''s help—so, to get onto the base, Hap impersonates a hapless real soldier, but circumstances force them to prolong the masquerade, creating an increasingly tangled Army-sized SNAFU.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v2E61e3iyn6fO4V4SiT0hRstpMg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43359'),
  ('430505373042476780', 'Jumping Over Puddles', 1971, 'Drama, Family', 'Josef Illík, Milada Mikešová, Karel Kachyňa', 'Jan Procházka, Karel Kachyňa', 'Vladimír Dlouhý, Zdena Hadrbolcová, Karel Hlušička, Vladimír Šmeral, Darja Hajská, Josef Karlík, Bořivoj Navrátil, Jaroslav Satoranský', null, 'This Czechoslovakian children’s film takes place during the last days of the Austro-Hungarian empire. The young son of a horse trainer loves nothing more than riding his horse, until he is stricken by polio…', 'This Czechoslovakian children’s film takes place during the last days of the Austro-Hungarian empire. The young son of a horse trainer loves nothing more than riding his horse, until he is stricken by polio…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/viF3PqH7jT33XUXZ8BhF3A7RujW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:285974'),
  ('506528475267682206', 'Jumping Ship', 2001, 'TV Movie, Family, Drama, Comedy', 'Michael Lange, David Burr, Darren Mallett', 'Chad Hayes, Carey Hayes', 'Joey Lawrence, Matthew Lawrence, Andrew Lawrence, Susan Walters, Stephen Burleigh, Anthony Brandon Wong, Jaime Passier-Armstrong, Martin Dingle Wall', 'G', 'Michael has big plans to show his cousin Tommy a good time aboard a luxury yacht until he discovers that the yacht he''s chartered is actually an old rusted fishing boat. But when modern-day pirates chase the fishing boat, the boys are forced to jump ship, leaving them stranded on a desert island with the boat''s captain, Jake Hunter.', 'Michael has big plans to show his cousin Tommy a good time aboard a luxury yacht until he discovers that the yacht he''s chartered is actually an old rusted fishing boat. But when modern-day pirates chase the fishing boat, the boys are forced to jump ship, leaving them stranded on a desert island with the boat''s captain, Jake Hunter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4bLzgESoL4yetAPXayVJByPVKQl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68027'),
  ('522094049101673457', 'Jumping the Blanket', 1895, 'Documentary, Comedy', 'Louis Lumière', null, null, null, 'Four men stand holding what appears to be a blanket, while one wearing a hat stands watching. A sixth man then runs towards them and attempts to jump into the blanket.', 'Four men stand holding what appears to be a blanket, while one wearing a hat stands watching. A sixth man then runs towards them and attempts to jump into the blanket.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pecbDDzuOOMq8rF4sR2sxNlr5LZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127773'),
  ('478280486509453345', 'Jumping the Broom', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Salim Akil, Anastas N. Michos', 'Elizabeth Hunter, Arlene Gibbs', 'Paula Patton, Laz Alonso, Angela Bassett, Loretta Devine, Meagan Good, Tasha Smith, Julie Bowen, DeRay Davis', 'PG-13', 'Two very different families converge on Martha''s Vineyard one weekend for a wedding.', 'Two very different families converge on Martha''s Vineyard one weekend for a wedding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/60OXQUsWfAdSimqwAAJ5EvBxTre.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57119'),
  ('964066989052376456', 'June', 2015, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'L. Gustavo Cooper, Matthew Sewell, Ryan Patrick Dean', 'L. Gustavo Cooper, Sharon Y. Cobb', 'Casper Van Dien, Victoria Pratt, Addy Miller, Eddie Jemison, Aiden Flowers, Joshua R. Todd, Lance E. Nichols, Rachel Whitman Groves', null, 'June is different from all other nine-year old girls. She is an orphan hiding a secret. Bad things happen when she gets upset, supernatural things. June has been in many foster homes usually leaving them destroyed. But this time it will be different. June has a new foster home and she really likes her new parents. She will have to face the force within her to protect her new parents and to save herself.', 'June is different from all other nine-year old girls. She is an orphan hiding a secret. Bad things happen when she gets upset, supernatural things. June has been in many foster homes usually leaving them destroyed. But this time it will be different. June has a new foster home and she really likes her new parents. She will have to face the force within her to protect her new parents and to save herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zvHlijzVA5hNOmy6vMi0vSlnlsh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:341886'),
  ('392163183548719389', 'June Again', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Emily Carse, Isabel Stanfield, J.J. Winlove', 'J.J. Winlove', 'Noni Hazlehurst, Claudia Karvan, Stephen Curry, Di Adams, Wayne Blair, Peta Carolan, Otis Dhanji, Brendan Donoghue', null, 'A woman experiences a medical miracle, after which she has only a few days to bring together her estranged children, save the family''s wallpaper business and rekindle an old flame.', 'A woman experiences a medical miracle, after which she has only a few days to bring together her estranged children, save the family''s wallpaper business and rekindle an old flame.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bHYKFNDLHFzlprre5qsuFdC9rFj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:590304'),
