  ('99683906839718292', 'June Bride', 1948, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Bretaigne Windust, Ted D. McCord, Sherry Shourds', 'Ranald MacDougall', 'Bette Davis, Robert Montgomery, Fay Bainter, Betty Lynn, Tom Tully, Barbara Bates, Jerome Cowan, Mary Wickes', 'NR', 'A magazine''s staff, including bickering ex-lovers Linda and Carey, cover an Indiana wedding, which goes slightly wrong.', 'A magazine''s staff, including bickering ex-lovers Linda and Carey, cover an Indiana wedding, which goes slightly wrong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jAsPwmgj9VtFo5icRXJQ1vyUeN9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107593'),
