  ('770360905831482367', 'June Turmoil', 1969, 'Documentary', 'Želimir Žilnik', null, 'Dragoljub Vojnov, Stevo Žigon, Dragoljub Mićunović', null, 'The film speaks of student demonstrations in Belgrade, 1969 and of the critical quality, enthusiasm and discipline of this form of protest. It was the most powerful public criticism of "red bourgeoisie" - members of communist apparatus, who suppressed creativity and affirmation of new generations throughout Eastern block.', 'The film speaks of student demonstrations in Belgrade, 1969 and of the critical quality, enthusiasm and discipline of this form of protest. It was the most powerful public criticism of "red bourgeoisie" - members of communist apparatus, who suppressed creativity and affirmation of new generations throughout Eastern block.', null, 'tmdb:movie:341023'),
  ('677141477022068591', 'Junebug', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Phil Morrison, Peter Donahue', 'Angus MacLachlan', 'Amy Adams, Embeth Davidtz, Ben McKenzie, Alessandro Nivola, Celia Weston, Scott Wilson, David Kuhn, Alicia Van Couvering', 'R', 'On the way to meet with an independent artist in the South, newlywed art dealer Madeleine is convinced by her husband, George, that they should stop to meet his family in North Carolina. Madeleine''s affluent lifestyle clashes with the family, but she befriends George''s wide-eyed and pregnant sister-in-law, Ashley, who is nearing her due date. Through the family, Madeleine gains greater insight into George''s character.', 'On the way to meet with an independent artist in the South, newlywed art dealer Madeleine is convinced by her husband, George, that they should stop to meet his family in North Carolina. Madeleine''s affluent lifestyle clashes with the family, but she befriends George''s wide-eyed and pregnant sister-in-law, Ashley, who is nearing her due date. Through the family, Madeleine gains greater insight into George''s character.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/asC6UOPrR6OlNMiyXbeXWu08SOG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1444'),
  ('183317679692770776', 'Jung', 2000, 'Action', 'Sanjay Gupta, Sameer Arya', 'Anurag Kashyap, Abhinav Kashyap', 'Sanjay Dutt, Raveena Tandon, Jackie Shroff, Aditya Pancholi, Shilpa Shetty Kundra, Saurabh Shukla, Neeraj Vora, Sanjay Mishra', null, 'The son of Police Inspector Veer Chauhan requires a near impossible to find bone-marrow transplant. With time running out, Veer finds a viable candidate, a criminal he was responsible for apprehending.', 'The son of Police Inspector Veer Chauhan requires a near impossible to find bone-marrow transplant. With time running out, Veer finds a viable candidate, a criminal he was responsible for apprehending.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nNNUkYlTjngVYM25N1O8o7abyIZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:303406'),
  ('766882961987586281', 'JUNG_E', 2023, 'Science Fiction', 'Yeon Sang-ho, Jo Gyeong-hun, Jun Young-seok', 'Yeon Sang-ho', 'Kang Soo-youn, Kim Hyun-joo, Ryu Kyung-soo, Uhm Ji-won, Lee Dong-hee, Han Woo-yeol, Lee Ga-kyung, Shin Min-jae', null, 'On an uninhabitable 22nd-century Earth, the outcome of a civil war hinges on cloning the brain of an elite soldier to create a robot mercenary.', 'On an uninhabitable 22nd-century Earth, the outcome of a civil war hinges on cloning the brain of an elite soldier to create a robot mercenary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z2nfRxZCGFgAnVhb9pZO87TyTX5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:843794'),
  ('1041247600329404252', 'Jungle', 2017, 'Adventure, Drama, Thriller', 'Ian Kenny, Greg McLean, Stefan Duscio', 'Justin Monjo', 'Daniel Radcliffe, Alex Russell, Thomas Kretschmann, Joel Jackson, Yasmin Kassim, Luis Jose Lopez, Lily Sullivan, Jacek Koman', 'R', 'In 1981, an enthusiastic young adventurer follows his dreams into the Bolivian Amazon jungle with two friends and a guide with a mysterious past. Their journey quickly turns into a terrifying ordeal as the darkest elements of human nature and the deadliest threats of the wilderness lead to an all-out fight for survival.', 'In 1981, an enthusiastic young adventurer follows his dreams into the Bolivian Amazon jungle with two friends and a guide with a mysterious past. Their journey quickly turns into a terrifying ordeal as the darkest elements of human nature and the deadliest threats of the wilderness lead to an all-out fight for survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tDgxknTVwrScxpCYyGUjXSn5NRk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:390062'),
  ('753464566189169007', 'Jungle 2 Jungle', 1997, 'Comedy, Family', 'John Pasquin, Tony Pierce-Roberts, Glen Trotiner', 'Hervé Palud, Thierry Lhermitte, Philippe Bruneau', 'Tim Allen, Martin Short, JoBeth Williams, Lolita Davidovich, Sam Huntington, David Ogden Stiers, Bob Dishy, Valerie Mahaffey', 'PG', 'Uptight New York City executive, Michael Cromwell, pursues his soon-to-be ex-wife to South America and returns home with the son he never knew he had—a boy raised in a tribal village in Brazil. Armed with only his blowgun, the 13-year-old Mimi-Siku discovers that the world outside his jungle home is indeed a strange place.', 'Uptight New York City executive, Michael Cromwell, pursues his soon-to-be ex-wife to South America and returns home with the son he never knew he had—a boy raised in a tribal village in Brazil. Armed with only his blowgun, the 13-year-old Mimi-Siku discovers that the world outside his jungle home is indeed a strange place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xRKfvheWRfkirm0kzdBAydUjiK5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9446'),
  ('581429430763324123', 'Jungle Beat: The Movie', 2020, 'Family, Animation, Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Brent Dawes, Charl James Collocott', 'Brent Dawes', 'David Menkin, David Rintoul, Gavin Peter, Florrie Wilkinson, Adam Neill, Jason Pennycooke, Robert G. Slade, Emma Lungiswa De Wet', 'G', 'The Jungle Beat animals think it’s the best thing ever when an alien arrives in the jungle bringing with him the power of speech. They also surprisingly think it’s the best thing ever when they find out that he’s been sent to conquer them.', 'The Jungle Beat animals think it’s the best thing ever when an alien arrives in the jungle bringing with him the power of speech. They also surprisingly think it’s the best thing ever when they find out that he’s been sent to conquer them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cgC67SOxd9xkjN4Bnvjtuj1vI8T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:663459'),
  ('740023163637321973', 'Jungle Book', 1942, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Family', 'Zoltan Korda, Lee Garmes, W. Howard Greene', null, 'Sabu, Joseph Calleia, John Qualen, Frank Puglia, Rosemary DeCamp, Patricia O''Rourke, Ralph Byrd, Faith Brook', 'NR', 'Mowgli, lost in the jungle when a toddler, raised by wolves, years later happens upon his human village and reconnects with its inhabitants, including his widowed mother. Continuing to maintain a relationship with the jungle, adventures follow.', 'Mowgli, lost in the jungle when a toddler, raised by wolves, years later happens upon his human village and reconnects with its inhabitants, including his widowed mother. Continuing to maintain a relationship with the jungle, adventures follow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zYkffyYCFO1Li1f20MyaAYUaYC4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23033'),
  ('513710803099479441', 'Jungle Book', 1990, 'Animation, Family', 'Jim Simon', 'Roger Scott Olsen', 'Pat Musick, Jim Cummings, Jeannie Elias, Kath Soucie', 'G', 'The infant Mowgli, separated from his family and lost in the jungle, is found and raised by the animals. Baloo the bear tries to teach Mowgli the ways of the jungle, but some of the other jungle animals have their own plans for the young man-cub!', 'The infant Mowgli, separated from his family and lost in the jungle, is found and raised by the animals. Baloo the bear tries to teach Mowgli the ways of the jungle, but some of the other jungle animals have their own plans for the young man-cub!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rLwbVPx4fhWwKQjOMFQYWq8Ja6A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:308870'),
  ('712074025843978228', 'Jungle Book', 1995, 'Animation, Adventure, Family, Music, Drama', 'Toshiyuki Hiruma, Takashi Masunaga', 'Lawrence H. Hartstein', 'Tony Ail, Nathan Aswell, Bailee Reid, Kathleen Barr, Garry Chalk, Lillian Carlson, Ian James Corlett, Michael Donovan', 'NR', 'When Mowgli was just a baby, or as his adopted parents call him, a "man cub," Shere Khan the tiger went after Mowgli''s mother and father. Baby Mowgli wondered off into the den of a wolf family with newly arrived cubs. The mother wolf wants to add Mowgli to her pack of cubs and when the others see how brave Mowgli is, they agree. Shere Khan, having been searching for the baby since he attacked the parents, finally finds him in the wolf den. When the wolves protect him, Shere Khan vows to hunt Mowgli down someday and becomes driven to destroy him.', 'When Mowgli was just a baby, or as his adopted parents call him, a "man cub," Shere Khan the tiger went after Mowgli''s mother and father. Baby Mowgli wondered off into the den of a wolf family with newly arrived cubs. The mother wolf wants to add Mowgli to her pack of cubs and when the others see how brave Mowgli is, they agree. Shere Khan, having been searching for the baby since he attacked the parents, finally finds him in the wolf den. When the wolves protect him, Shere Khan vows to hunt Mowgli down someday and becomes driven to destroy him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y40M9x9Crf3FFxT80vcxczqPPwv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105984'),
  ('657441788103574993', 'Jungle Bride', 1933, 'Adventure, Crime, Drama', 'Harry O. Hoyt, Albert H. Kelley, André Barlatier', null, 'Anita Page, Charles Starrett, Kenneth Thomson, Eddie Borden, Clarence Geldart, Gertrude Simpson, Alfred Cross, Jay Emmett', null, 'Four survivors of a ship wreck are stranded on a deserted island, including a woman and the man she believes is responsible for the murder which her brother is in prison for.', 'Four survivors of a ship wreck are stranded on a deserted island, including a woman and the man she believes is responsible for the murder which her brother is in prison for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rlu7mJRutDhAVZHQPpaZHc5bgqw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:164294'),
  ('264855956126712888', 'Jungle Cat', 1960, 'Documentary, Family', 'James Algar', null, 'Winston Hibler', null, 'This final True-Life Adventure would also appear to be one of the best, as we go into the South American jungle to observe the jaguar. Jungle Cat is more intimate than its kin, allowing individual animal characters to be developed. Central to the cast is a pair of jaguars (one ebony), whose fighting leads to love and, not long after, two babies (one resembling each parent).', 'This final True-Life Adventure would also appear to be one of the best, as we go into the South American jungle to observe the jaguar. Jungle Cat is more intimate than its kin, allowing individual animal characters to be developed. Central to the cast is a pair of jaguars (one ebony), whose fighting leads to love and, not long after, two babies (one resembling each parent).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/poEszXVyBTs2zE4lCInKpMOdHsd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:179188'),
  ('373295324073314681', 'Jungle Child', 2011, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Roland Suso Richter', 'Natalie Scharf, Beth Serlin, Florian Schumacher', 'Thomas Kretschmann, Nadja Uhl, Michael Baral, Isolde Barth, John Keogh, Sina Tkotsch, Tina Engel, Stella Kunkat', null, 'A family of a German linguist lives with an indigenous tribe in Papua New Guinea.', 'A family of a German linguist lives with an indigenous tribe in Papua New Guinea.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1attOCQq326foyqVl9zOrZ0MkzH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54517'),
  ('791973811770516174', 'Jungle Cruise', 2021, 'Fantasy, Adventure, Action', 'David Lazan, Eric Richard Lasko, David H. Venghaus Jr.', 'John Requa, Glenn Ficarra, Michael Green', 'Dwayne Johnson, Emily Blunt, Edgar Ramírez, Jack Whitehall, Jesse Plemons, Paul Giamatti, Veronica Falcón, Dani Rovira', 'PG-13', 'Dr. Lily Houghton enlists the aid of wisecracking skipper Frank Wolff to take her down the Amazon in his dilapidated boat. Together, they search for an ancient tree that holds the power to heal – a discovery that will change the future of medicine.', 'Dr. Lily Houghton enlists the aid of wisecracking skipper Frank Wolff to take her down the Amazon in his dilapidated boat. Together, they search for an ancient tree that holds the power to heal – a discovery that will change the future of medicine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yKy9ELL8CON5sqDg4yIvBb5LTZL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:451048'),
  ('997121429476897994', 'Jungle Drums', 1943, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, Fantasy, Family, Thriller, War', 'Dan Gordon, Orestes Calpini', null, 'Joan Alexander, Jackson Beck, Bud Collyer, Jack Mercer, Julian Noa', null, 'Superman discovers a secret Nazi base in the jungle.', 'Superman discovers a secret Nazi base in the jungle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iPYxBvWGNdcw1r3l6PQfcXl0jy0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146062'),
  ('1025321547665858638', 'Jungle Emperor Leo', 1997, 'Adventure, Animation, Family', 'Yoshio Takeuchi, Koichi Chiba', 'Yoshio Takeuchi', 'Masane Tsukayama, Chieko Baisho, Tomoko Ishimura, Hekiru Shiina, Kaneta Kimotsuki, Naoki Tatsuta, Masatô Ibu, Ranran Suzuki', null, 'Tezuka Osamu''s most famous work "Jungle Emperor Leo" has been made into an animated version a number of times. In this theater version, Tezuka Osamu was able for the first time to depict the theme that "All life is equal" through Leo''s self-sacrifice.', 'Tezuka Osamu''s most famous work "Jungle Emperor Leo" has been made into an animated version a number of times. In this theater version, Tezuka Osamu was able for the first time to depict the theme that "All life is equal" through Leo''s self-sacrifice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/46ygt6dQuPk9E8DOjpDYK1zAnvt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14368'),
  ('322555596460142911', 'Jungle Erotic', 1970, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Louis Soulanes, Zygmunt Sulistrowski, Sebastiano Celeste', 'Zygmunt Sulistrowski, Jordan Arthur Deutsch', 'Zygmunt Sulistrowski, Carrie Rochelle, Brigitte Lahaie, Maude Carolle, Alice Marie, Pierre Chapel', 'R', 'Young women have an adventure in the African jungle', 'Young women have an adventure in the African jungle', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p9nB7LRpdVmZS3XapJdV8PvIwQL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106678'),
  ('387201328000009273', 'Jungle Fever', 1991, 'Drama, Romance', 'Ernest R. Dickerson, Spike Lee, Randy Fletcher', 'Spike Lee', 'Wesley Snipes, Annabella Sciorra, Spike Lee, Ossie Davis, Ruby Dee, Samuel L. Jackson, Lonette McKee, John Turturro', 'R', 'A successful and married black man contemplates having an affair with a white girl from work. He''s quite rightly worried that the racial difference would make an already taboo relationship even worse.', 'A successful and married black man contemplates having an affair with a white girl from work. He''s quite rightly worried that the racial difference would make an already taboo relationship even worse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pw7cOdwCylBuiv6rvosBSkcgKEe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1713'),
  ('1119651731395838933', 'Jungle Girl and the Lost Island of Dinosaurs', 2002, 'Animation', 'Susan Beak, Geoff Beak', null, 'Katy Manning, Troy Planet', null, 'The story of Emma Sharp, a prim and proper English child who becomes the Jungle Girl. On their way home to England, Emma and her father, William are wrecked on a mysterious uncharted island. The crew of their boat, Captain Jack and his mate Terry, steal the island''s precious Golden Monkey statue. This act unleashes a herd of dinosaurs and threatens the safety of the entire island. Beano the talking dolphin, asks Emma to help him save the island. This she does, aided by Samson the toucan, Chuntee the chimp and Zelinka the Python. The statue is returned, the island is saved and Emma returns home with a new thirst for adventure.', 'The story of Emma Sharp, a prim and proper English child who becomes the Jungle Girl. On their way home to England, Emma and her father, William are wrecked on a mysterious uncharted island. The crew of their boat, Captain Jack and his mate Terry, steal the island''s precious Golden Monkey statue. This act unleashes a herd of dinosaurs and threatens the safety of the entire island. Beano the talking dolphin, asks Emma to help him save the island. This she does, aided by Samson the toucan, Chuntee the chimp and Zelinka the Python. The statue is returned, the island is saved and Emma returns home with a new thirst for adventure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gz5WfD6GFgWOzFbljdM01yt4i8L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:306110'),
  ('139874502167258457', 'Jungle Goddess', 1948, 'Romance, Action, Adventure, Crime', 'Lewis D. Collins, Melville Shyer, Carl Berger', 'Jo Pagano', 'George Reeves, Wanda McKay, Ralph Byrd, Armida, Smoki Whitfield, Dolores Castle, Rudy Robles, Linda Leighton', 'NR', 'When a plane carrying the daughter of a millionaire crashes in an African jungle, two pilots set out to collect the reward. They discover that she has become the goddess of a primitive tribe. An insurgent witch doctor and fierce wild animals make escape from the jungle difficult for the trio.', 'When a plane carrying the daughter of a millionaire crashes in an African jungle, two pilots set out to collect the reward. They discover that she has become the goddess of a primitive tribe. An insurgent witch doctor and fierce wild animals make escape from the jungle difficult for the trio.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6dE1BMWbQ3CYgFtJMcl1cZ81o9i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:160793'),
  ('129236472249922928', 'Jungle Heat', 1985, 'Action, War', 'Jobic Wong', 'Jobic Wong', 'Sam J. Jones, Dorian Tan Tao-Liang, Ronald Chin Han, Christopher Doyle, Craig Scott Galper, Lenny Bryce, Robert M. Delahunt, Lilia Nguyen', null, 'Towards the end of the Vietnam war, the US is running low on drivers for their supplies so they bring in a new lot of recruits and have to train them to survive in the dangers of wartorn Vietnam. The recruits are trained briefly by an American officer but are quickly handed off to their South Vietnamese officers and are made to go out into the dangers of Vietnam without getting the protection they need by the Americans who are more concerned with withdrawing their own troops instead of protecting the South Vietnamese', 'Towards the end of the Vietnam war, the US is running low on drivers for their supplies so they bring in a new lot of recruits and have to train them to survive in the dangers of wartorn Vietnam. The recruits are trained briefly by an American officer but are quickly handed off to their South Vietnamese officers and are made to go out into the dangers of Vietnam without getting the protection they need by the Americans who are more concerned with withdrawing their own troops instead of protecting the South Vietnamese', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bumudxiKoKM8NyXE6agq3CU9cqy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:278864'),
  ('1049132543547722372', 'Jungle Jitters', 1938, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Tedd Pierce, Mel Blanc', null, 'Starts out with a tribe of African cannibals imitating Native Americans. After this, they do the new Warner Bros. Looney Tunes theme "The Merry-Go-Round Broke Down." Then a sloppy stuttering salesman knocks on their doors, and they bring him in and put him in a pot of boiling water. The queen of the tribe wants to see the man. She falls in love with him. They get married, but when the salesman sees he has to kiss the bride, he decides he''d be better off being dinner for a tribe of hungry cannibals. One of the “Censored 11” banned from TV syndication by United Artists in 1968 for racist stereotyping.', 'Starts out with a tribe of African cannibals imitating Native Americans. After this, they do the new Warner Bros. Looney Tunes theme "The Merry-Go-Round Broke Down." Then a sloppy stuttering salesman knocks on their doors, and they bring him in and put him in a pot of boiling water. The queen of the tribe wants to see the man. She falls in love with him. They get married, but when the salesman sees he has to kiss the bride, he decides he''d be better off being dinner for a tribe of hungry cannibals. One of the “Censored 11” banned from TV syndication by United Artists in 1968 for racist stereotyping.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7mxzskA1CblfO2klu46GmWtsz38.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:205879'),
  ('12424780367046938', 'Jungle Man', 1941, 'Action, Adventure', 'Harry L. Fraser, Mervyn Freeman, Jack Greenhalgh', 'Rita Douglas', 'Buster Crabbe, Charles Middleton, Sheila Darcy, Vince Barnett, Weldon Heyburn, Robert Carson, Paul Scott, Hal Price', 'NR', 'An expedition sets out to darkest Africa to find the fabled City of the Dead, and must battle thick jungle, hostile natives, wild animals and a deadly epidemic.', 'An expedition sets out to darkest Africa to find the fabled City of the Dead, and must battle thick jungle, hostile natives, wild animals and a deadly epidemic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cYwUf5ZvbKEf6tNUeyl6U7MgAQh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:388183'),
  ('1144344608095732550', 'Jungle Rhythm', 1929, 'Animation', 'Walt Disney', null, null, null, 'Mickey''s on African safari, riding on an elephant, but his shotgun disintegrates the first time he tries to use it. To sooth the vicious beasts, he plays tunes, sings, and dances, using the various animals and objects around him as instruments.', 'Mickey''s on African safari, riding on an elephant, but his shotgun disintegrates the first time he tries to use it. To sooth the vicious beasts, he plays tunes, sings, and dances, using the various animals and objects around him as instruments.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/76QUqULWmpAhJZx2Cl3wE40PiBe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190371'),
  ('565857542483191122', 'Jungle Run', 2021, 'Adventure, Action', 'Noah Luke, Noah Luke', 'Marc Gottlieb', 'Richard Grieco, Alyson Gorske, Jamie Petitto, Wade Hunt Williams, Jack Pearson, Benny Bernard Jr., Christian De Jesus, Rey''Von Miller', null, 'A brother and sister''s journey into the jungle to find their missing father.', 'A brother and sister''s journey into the jungle to find their missing father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n6jf8Un9VX3Sw8ZhQUFuFSG0nij.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:844636'),
  ('1066063498307725479', 'Jungle Warriors', 1984, 'Action, Adventure', 'Ernst Ritter von Theumer, Nicholas Josef von Sternberg', 'Ernst Ritter von Theumer, Robert Collector', 'Nina van Pallandt, Paul L. Smith, John Vernon, Alex Cord, Sybil Danning, Marjoe Gortner, Woody Strode, Kai Wulff', 'R', 'A group of models fly into the jungle of some South American country to look for a photo location. Their plane is shot down and they are captured by a drug baron''s private army. At the same time, the Mafia''s representative arrive to negotiate future collaboration.', 'A group of models fly into the jungle of some South American country to look for a photo location. Their plane is shot down and they are captured by a drug baron''s private army. At the same time, the Mafia''s representative arrive to negotiate future collaboration.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cLRpfSFOiQTqAgFlGa9wTArkKaL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86509'),
  ('351592947857568977', 'Jungle Woman', 1944, 'Drama, Fantasy, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Reginald Le Borg, Jack MacKenzie, Paul Sawtell', 'Bernard Schubert, Edward Dein, Henry Sucher', 'Evelyn Ankers, J. Carrol Naish, Samuel S. Hinds, Lois Collier, Milburn Stone, Douglass Dumbrille, Acquanetta, Nana Bryant', null, 'Paula, the ape woman, has survived the ending of CAPTIVE WILD WOMAN and is running around a creepy old sanitarium run by the kindly Dr. Fletcher, reverting to her true gorilla form every once in a while to kill somebody.', 'Paula, the ape woman, has survived the ending of CAPTIVE WILD WOMAN and is running around a creepy old sanitarium run by the kindly Dr. Fletcher, reverting to her true gorilla form every once in a while to kill somebody.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3vvf9PwkvuwjkLh1KCupw7wXEIc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84710'),
  ('1112476361666426639', 'Junglee', 2019, 'Action, Adventure', 'Chuck Russell, Mark Irwin, Sachin Gadankush', 'Adam Prince, Raghaav Dar', 'Vidyut Jammwal, Pooja Sawant, Asha Bhat, Atul Kulkarni, Makrand Deshpande, Akshay Oberoi, Thalaivasal Vijay, Vishwanath Chatterjee', null, 'A vet returns home to his father''s elephant reserve where he encounters and fights an international poacher''s racket.', 'A vet returns home to his father''s elephant reserve where he encounters and fights an international poacher''s racket.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d5Jw6eXO3Qv9qu8oy5V4WCDDvki.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:560964'),
  ('799590459950133131', 'Jungleland', 2020, 'Drama', 'Colin Flaherty, Cameron K. Morton, Jake Martin', 'David Branson Smith, Max Winkler, Theodore Bressman', 'Charlie Hunnam, Jack O''Connell, Jessica Barden, Fran Kranz, Jonathan Majors, John Cullum, Owen Burke, Meredith Holzman', 'R', 'Stanley manages his boxer brother Lion but when a devastating loss in the ring leaves the pair in debt, an opportunity to recoup the cash leads to a series of misadventures that threaten to break the bond between them.', 'Stanley manages his boxer brother Lion but when a devastating loss in the ring leaves the pair in debt, an opportunity to recoup the cash leads to a series of misadventures that threaten to break the bond between them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/34jYoAAlkZnfyJiJWpjmrDc9zFR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:556501'),
  ('1141917587930902199', 'Junior', 1994, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Ivan Reitman, Adam Greenberg, Paul Sonski', 'Kevin Wade, Chris Conrad', 'Arnold Schwarzenegger, Danny DeVito, Emma Thompson, Frank Langella, Pamela Reed, Aida Turturro, James Eckhouse, Megan Cavanagh', 'PG-13', 'A research scientist becomes the world''s first pregnant man in order to test a drug he and a colleague have designed for expectant women. To carry out the trial, he has an embryo implant, believing that he will only carry the baby for three months – hardly expecting to face the prospect of giving birth.', 'A research scientist becomes the world''s first pregnant man in order to test a drug he and a colleague have designed for expectant women. To carry out the trial, he has an embryo implant, believing that he will only carry the baby for three months – hardly expecting to face the prospect of giving birth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/swxxtzYc60qqnFhfWMFdmx9QXvY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6280'),
  ('413983091240870580', 'Junior', 2011, 'Horror, Fantasy', 'Julia Ducournau, Claudine Natkin, Victoire Gounod', 'Julia Ducournau', 'Garance Marillier, Yacine N''Diaye, Aude Briant, Virgil Leclaire, Raphaël Mingau Lopes, Louis Dussol, Bernard Blancan, Virgile Bramly', null, 'A pimple-faced 13-year-old tomboy starts morphing in bizarre ways after catching stomach flu.', 'A pimple-faced 13-year-old tomboy starts morphing in bizarre ways after catching stomach flu.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4tRF43CbEYHmV8VywkbikQwATB8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:307130'),
  ('839474475766158642', 'Junior', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Pascal Bourdiaux, Fabrice Camoin', 'Daive Cohen', 'Kev Adams, Franck Dubosc, Nora Arnezeder, Valérie Benguigui, Héléna Noguerra, Alice Isaaz, Laurent Bateau, Eva Leonard', null, 'Alex is in love with Sandra since childhood but has never dared approach her.He asks Antoine, a lonely writer to help him seduce her, because in his time he was the only one to conquer the heart of the mother.', 'Alex is in love with Sandra since childhood but has never dared approach her.He asks Antoine, a lonely writer to help him seduce her, because in his time he was the only one to conquer the heart of the mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rXyvlWfEgVazefy4aRpgfcgeqx8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:252607'),
  ('158906628818976076', 'Junior and Karlson', 1968, 'Adventure, Animation, Family', 'Boris Stepantsev, Mikhail Druyan', 'Boris Larin', 'Vasiliy Livanov, Klara Rumyanova', null, 'A Soviet cult cartoon, so untypical for a Western viewer, especially, a little one. A boy named Malysh ("A Little One") suffers from solitude being the youngest of the three children in a Swedish family. The acute sense of solitude makes him desperately want a dog, but before he gets one, he "invents" a friend - the very Karlson who lives upon the roof. So typical for the Russian culture spirit of mischief, which is, actually, never punished, and the notion that relative welfare not necessarily means happiness made the book by Astrid Lindgren and its TV adaptations tremendously popular in the Soviet Union and nowadays Russia and vice versa - somewhat alienated to the Western reader and viewer (see User''s comments below). However, both the book and the cartoon are truly universal - entertaining and funny for the children and thought-provoking and somewhat sad for grownups.', 'A Soviet cult cartoon, so untypical for a Western viewer, especially, a little one. A boy named Malysh ("A Little One") suffers from solitude being the youngest of the three children in a Swedish family. The acute sense of solitude makes him desperately want a dog, but before he gets one, he "invents" a friend - the very Karlson who lives upon the roof. So typical for the Russian culture spirit of mischief, which is, actually, never punished, and the notion that relative welfare not necessarily means happiness made the book by Astrid Lindgren and its TV adaptations tremendously popular in the Soviet Union and nowadays Russia and vice versa - somewhat alienated to the Western reader and viewer (see User''s comments below). However, both the book and the cartoon are truly universal - entertaining and funny for the children and thought-provoking and somewhat sad for grownups.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/H4WHAm4yHcTUMvPgupZ5OcV4nc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77304'),
  ('425312553406476445', 'Junior Bonner', 1972, 'Western, Drama', 'Sam Peckinpah, Lucien Ballard, Frank Baur', 'Jeb Rosebrook', 'Steve McQueen, Robert Preston, Ida Lupino, Ben Johnson, Joe Don Baker, Barbara Leigh, Mary Murphy, Bill McKinney', 'PG', 'With his bronco-busting career on its last legs, Junior Bonner heads to his hometown to try his luck in the annual rodeo. But his fond childhood memories are shattered when he finds his family torn apart by his greedy brother and hard-drinking father.', 'With his bronco-busting career on its last legs, Junior Bonner heads to his hometown to try his luck in the annual rodeo. But his fond childhood memories are shattered when he finds his family torn apart by his greedy brother and hard-drinking father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qA85YYjQob3gPAFiafuIXFhSZSG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5927'),
  ('695359472975795251', 'Junior Majeur', 2017, 'Drama', 'Éric Tessier, Tobie Marier Robitaille', 'Emmanuelle Joly, Martin Bouchard', 'Antoine Olivier Pilon, Rémi Goulet, Alice Morel-Michaud, Normand Daneau, Claude Legault, Édith Cochrane, Daniel Thomas, Patrice Robitaille', null, 'Five years after winning the Quebec Pee-Wee tournament with his team, 18-year-old hockey prodigy Janeau Trudel is playing for the Chicoutimi Saguenéens in the Quebec Major Junior Hockey League.', 'Five years after winning the Quebec Pee-Wee tournament with his team, 18-year-old hockey prodigy Janeau Trudel is playing for the Chicoutimi Saguenéens in the Quebec Major Junior Hockey League.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eYynhCdMeZDG2xuuNxY5dgGPqBd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:483407'),
  ('781977231052088599', 'Juniors', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Hugo P. Thomas, Laurent Nogueira, Vadim Alsayed', 'Hugo P. Thomas, Jules Lugan', 'Vanessa Paradis, Franck Ropers, Ewan Bourdelles, Noah Zandouche, Alaïs Bertrand, Clara Machado, Aurélien Moulin, Marie Salvetat', null, 'Jordan, 14, is bored in the small village of Mornas. His mother, a nurse, is often away, so he keeps himself busy with his best friend Patrick by playing their console, affectionately named Jessica. When Jessica dies, Jordan and his friend decide to fake an illness and set up an online fund to buy a new one. As the lie spreads across the schoolyard, everyone''s attention finally turns to them. Their new-found popularity will put their unbreakable friendship to the test...', 'Jordan, 14, is bored in the small village of Mornas. His mother, a nurse, is often away, so he keeps himself busy with his best friend Patrick by playing their console, affectionately named Jessica. When Jessica dies, Jordan and his friend decide to fake an illness and set up an online fund to buy a new one. As the lie spreads across the schoolyard, everyone''s attention finally turns to them. Their new-found popularity will put their unbreakable friendship to the test...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dtMrGc0iEvB4FiinWRwTAXr05ft.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:958155'),
  ('524651821943422258', 'Juniper', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Matthew J. Saville, Marty Williams', 'Matthew J. Saville', 'Charlotte Rampling, Marton Csokas, George Ferrier, Carlos Muller, Edith Poor, Tāne Rolfe, Cameron Carter-Chan, Carlos Rakete', null, 'When a self-destructive teenager is suspended from school and asked to look after his feisty alcoholic grandmother as a punishment, the crazy time they spend together turns his life around.', 'When a self-destructive teenager is suspended from school and asked to look after his feisty alcoholic grandmother as a punishment, the crazy time they spend together turns his life around.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qkoN7oYsDeehYwOMu7oP15ZIUiZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:833257'),
  ('149995877266094911', 'Junk', 2000, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Atsushi Muroga, Takanobu Kato', 'Atsushi Muroga', 'Nobuyuki Asano, Shū Ehara, Tate Gouta, Yuji Kishimoto, Miwa Hamana, Kaori Shimamura, Kotaro Tanaka, Deborah Joy Vinall', null, 'Four crooks rob a jewelery shop, then head for an abandoned factory where they plan to fence the goods to the Yakuza. Unfortunately, their chosen location happens to be the same place where American scientists had previously experimented on resurrecting the dead.', 'Four crooks rob a jewelery shop, then head for an abandoned factory where they plan to fence the goods to the Yakuza. Unfortunately, their chosen location happens to be the same place where American scientists had previously experimented on resurrecting the dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/55jjfoppdnTkCAAV8URyNWCeF86.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39981'),
  ('846244459354623124', 'Junk', 2006, 'Crime, Horror, Thriller', 'Denis Neimand, Mikhail Mukasey, Natalya Roginskaya', 'Konstantin Murzenko', 'Alyona Babenko, Mikhail Efremov, Vyacheslav Razbegaev, Anatoliy Belyy, Aleksey Serebryakov, Igor Savochkin, Yusup Bakhshiev, Igor Lifanov', null, 'Marina (Alyona Babenko) is a journalist contemplating retiring, bored of writing stories of serial killers and murders that are front page news one day, and then are quickly forgotten the next. At a large house a lawyer is holed up, police are in the front garden, snipers on the roof and the lawyer asks for Marina. She’s a little surprised by this as she and the lawyer have only crossed paths a few times during her career, but agrees to go to the lawyers house. Arriving at the house she’s confronted by the large police presence, she’s given a quick debrief of the situation and requested not to go into the house. She declines and enters the house. Just inside the front door is the lawyers wife, she tell Marina that he’s lost it and locked the children in their rooms and that he’s going to kill them all.', 'Marina (Alyona Babenko) is a journalist contemplating retiring, bored of writing stories of serial killers and murders that are front page news one day, and then are quickly forgotten the next. At a large house a lawyer is holed up, police are in the front garden, snipers on the roof and the lawyer asks for Marina. She’s a little surprised by this as she and the lawyer have only crossed paths a few times during her career, but agrees to go to the lawyers house. Arriving at the house she’s confronted by the large police presence, she’s given a quick debrief of the situation and requested not to go into the house. She declines and enters the house. Just inside the front door is the lawyers wife, she tell Marina that he’s lost it and locked the children in their rooms and that he’s going to kill them all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7qzD0YunSvfXqF7kc3zoIdaLu36.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:135210'),
  ('880653112408469231', 'Junk Boy', 1987, 'Animation, Comedy, Romance', 'Katsuhisa Yamada, Yasunori Honda, Kinichi Ishikawa', 'Yukihiro Matsushita, Tatsuhiko Urahata', 'Takeshi Kusao, Toshiko Fujita, Yuko Minaguchi, Rei Sakuma, Kazuhiko Inoue, Emi Shinohara, Hiromi Tsuru, Keiichi Nanba', 'NR', 'Overconfident 23-year-old Ryouhei somehow lucks into a job at the lucrative skin mag Potato Boy, with his only qualification being an abnormally high sex drive. Immediately smitten with the publication''s prestigious editor Yuki (and just about every other female colleague), Ryouhei shows a libidinous instinct that could take Potato Boy to the next level — if he can ever take the job seriously.', 'Overconfident 23-year-old Ryouhei somehow lucks into a job at the lucrative skin mag Potato Boy, with his only qualification being an abnormally high sex drive. Immediately smitten with the publication''s prestigious editor Yuki (and just about every other female colleague), Ryouhei shows a libidinous instinct that could take Potato Boy to the next level — if he can ever take the job seriously.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jxF3fw11G2u3BWyhtst4f3mTJgq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60933'),
  ('785622394576219627', 'Junk Food', 1997, 'Drama', 'Hiroshi Ito, Akihiro Onodera, Yuji Higaki', 'Masashi Yamamoto', 'Kanji Tsuda, Onimaru, Arata Furuta, Miki Mia, Ali Ahmed, María Esther Moreno León, Yôichi Okamura, Mika Kumagai', null, 'Junk Food consists of four intertwining stories. The first and fourth sections show the morning routine of an blind, old Japanese woman, waking up, buying bread and milk, praying at the family altar; however, it is the second segment where the true story begins.', 'Junk Food consists of four intertwining stories. The first and fourth sections show the morning routine of an blind, old Japanese woman, waking up, buying bread and milk, praying at the family altar; however, it is the second segment where the true story begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rTPQHF34tepOSbUvxX6GgOusfyM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:229315'),
  ('844624249760016208', 'Junk Head', 2022, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 'Takahide Hori, Takahide Hori', 'Takahide Hori', 'Takahide Hori, Atsuko Miyake, Yuji Sugiyama', null, 'Mankind can no longer reproduce because of gene manipulation aimed at making life longer. The clones ruling the bottomless underworld may have become fertile. Parton is selected to go on a mission through a subterranean labyrinth crawling with monsters to secure humanity''s future.', 'Mankind can no longer reproduce because of gene manipulation aimed at making life longer. The clones ruling the bottomless underworld may have become fertile. Parton is selected to go on a mission through a subterranean labyrinth crawling with monsters to secure humanity''s future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t1pHIeZZGmr8TWMyn7r1TGoMnMo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:464768'),
  ('40773189123895028', 'Junk Head 1', 2013, 'Science Fiction, Animation', 'Takahide Hori', null, 'Takahide Hori', null, 'In the distant future, mankind begin research on clones that live underground in search of lost genetic information.', 'In the distant future, mankind begin research on clones that live underground in search of lost genetic information.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rUY5knSTqcXjURcb8QpAawAmpgd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:242112'),
  ('366067005570838562', 'Junk Mail', 1997, 'Comedy, Thriller', 'Pål Sletaune, Kjell Vassdal', 'Pål Sletaune, Jonny Halberg', 'Robert Skjærstad, Andrine Sæther, Per Egil Aske, Eli Anne Linnestad, Trond Høvik, Ådne Olav Sekkelsten, Trond Fausa Aurvåg, Henriette Steenstrup', null, 'Dimwitted, somewhat misanthropic Oslo mail carrier Roy''s quiet life changes dramatically on the day he steals a set of keys and lets himself into the apartment of a deaf woman who seems to be in trouble with a psychotic criminal. Though he doesn''t know it at the time, his and her fate are about to intertwine and this is not going to be to his benefit.', 'Dimwitted, somewhat misanthropic Oslo mail carrier Roy''s quiet life changes dramatically on the day he steals a set of keys and lets himself into the apartment of a deaf woman who seems to be in trouble with a psychotic criminal. Though he doesn''t know it at the time, his and her fate are about to intertwine and this is not going to be to his benefit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/adQQdVMN2wC5HJ94BiAMeyP7pZb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34582'),
  ('194552198301186361', 'Junk Town', 2006, 'Animation, Science Fiction', 'Nobutake Ito', null, null, null, 'A science fiction story about a young boy who discovers and befriends a small robot at a shopping arcade. The robot is hungry and he grows in size as he devours a number of machines of increasing size.', 'A science fiction story about a young boy who discovers and befriends a small robot at a shopping arcade. The robot is hungry and he grows in size as he devours a number of machines of increasing size.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nxS98rDPAFpizNg6HaTN0SNXtC6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73790'),
  ('449536600385629573', 'Junkopia', 1981, 'Documentary', 'Chris Marker, John Chapman, Frank Simeone', 'Chris Marker', 'Arielle Dombasle', null, 'Filmed along the Emeryville Mudflats near San Francisco, Junkopia captures a landscape of sculptural installations made from driftwood and discarded materials. Chris Marker, John Chapman, and Frank Simeone transform these ephemeral artworks—set against highways and the distant city—into a quiet meditation on art, decay, and the modern environment.', 'Filmed along the Emeryville Mudflats near San Francisco, Junkopia captures a landscape of sculptural installations made from driftwood and discarded materials. Chris Marker, John Chapman, and Frank Simeone transform these ephemeral artworks—set against highways and the distant city—into a quiet meditation on art, decay, and the modern environment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sHTMdRN1NgUNgTNAUrwg1Fdobnz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123742'),
  ('443209832129266664', 'Junkrat Train', 2021, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Lin Zhenzhao', 'Shuang Hou, Zhang Shengfan', 'Yin Chao-te, Zhu Ya, Ma Chenglong, Yang Yong, Grace Xia, Jiang Yongbo, 邓威, Cheng Junwen', null, 'A Chinese Department of Health junior clerk Su Zhenghuai is with his eldest daughter Su Wei and son Su Yuexuan are on their way to visit relatives in the provincial city when they meet the long-lost second daughter Su Ling. Unfortunately, the train is attacked by rats. Su Yuexuan is bitten by a rat and goes into a coma. In order to save his young son and many bitten passengers, Su Zhenghuai and Su Wei decide to make the dangerous venture to Xiaobaihe Hospital to get medicine.', 'A Chinese Department of Health junior clerk Su Zhenghuai is with his eldest daughter Su Wei and son Su Yuexuan are on their way to visit relatives in the provincial city when they meet the long-lost second daughter Su Ling. Unfortunately, the train is attacked by rats. Su Yuexuan is bitten by a rat and goes into a coma. In order to save his young son and many bitten passengers, Su Zhenghuai and Su Wei decide to make the dangerous venture to Xiaobaihe Hospital to get medicine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oD51TucgNiQfNI35h5sWSCucH1I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:783701'),
  ('809725641545357139', 'Junkyard Dog', 2023, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Jean-Baptiste Durand, Benoît Jaoul, Isabelle Harnist', 'Nicolas Fleureau, Emma Benestan', 'Anthony Bajon, Raphaël Quenard, Galatea Bellugi, Dominique Reymond, Bernard Blancan, Nathan Le Graciet, Mélanie Martinez, Mike Reilles', null, 'Childhood pals Dog and Mirales live in a little village in the south of France and spend their days just hanging out. To kill time, Mirales has got into the habit of teasing Dog mercilessly. But this summer is different: Dog meets Elsa and romance blossoms.', 'Childhood pals Dog and Mirales live in a little village in the south of France and spend their days just hanging out. To kill time, Mirales has got into the habit of teasing Dog mercilessly. But this summer is different: Dog meets Elsa and romance blossoms.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gxXAW8rqZQLNDcyzZD0vp3Wmgc8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:957608'),
  ('519965081244760692', 'Juno', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Jason Reitman, Eric Steelberg, Jason Blumenfeld', 'Diablo Cody', 'Elliot Page, Michael Cera, Jennifer Garner, Jason Bateman, J.K. Simmons, Allison Janney, Olivia Thirlby, Eileen Pedde', 'PG-13', 'Faced with an unplanned pregnancy, sixteen year old high-schooler, Juno MacGuff, makes an unusual decision regarding her unborn child.', 'Faced with an unplanned pregnancy, sixteen year old high-schooler, Juno MacGuff, makes an unusual decision regarding her unborn child.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jNIn2tVhpvFD6P9IojldI3mNYcn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7326'),
  ('323632289437493258', 'Juno and the Paycock', 1930, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Jack E. Cox, Alfred Hitchcock, Frank Mills', 'Alfred Hitchcock, Alma Reville', 'Barry Fitzgerald, Maire O''Neill, Edward Chapman, Sara Allgood, John Laurie, Kathleen O''Regan, Sidney Morgan, Dave Morris', null, 'In the slums of Dublin during the Irish Civil War, the Boyle family’s fragile stability collapses after news of an unexpected inheritance lures them into a false sense of prosperity. Captain Boyle, a boastful idler, squanders their meager resources, while his wife Juno holds the household together. When the fortune proves illusory, the family faces ruin, betrayal, and tragedy.', 'In the slums of Dublin during the Irish Civil War, the Boyle family’s fragile stability collapses after news of an unexpected inheritance lures them into a false sense of prosperity. Captain Boyle, a boastful idler, squanders their meager resources, while his wife Juno holds the household together. When the fortune proves illusory, the family faces ruin, betrayal, and tragedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eKAOKqfBacUDNhPwvXFxaP59Kyp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47695'),
  ('122050086794541877', 'Juntos e Enrolados', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Eduardo Vaisman, Rodrigo Van Der Put, Rodrigo Graciosa', 'Rodrigo Goulart, Cláudio Torres Gonzaga, Sabrina Garcia', 'Cacau Protásio, Rafael Portugal, Berta Loran, Emanuelle Araújo, Fafy Siqueira, Evelyn Castro, Fábio de Luca, Leandro Ramos', null, 'After two years together and a lot of financial planning, Júlio and Daiana finally reach their dream of holding the long-awaited wedding party, so that they can finally get married in the church as per the rules. Everything seems to be going well, until the groom receives a message on his cell phone before the ceremony begins.', 'After two years together and a lot of financial planning, Júlio and Daiana finally reach their dream of holding the long-awaited wedding party, so that they can finally get married in the church as per the rules. Everything seems to be going well, until the groom receives a message on his cell phone before the ceremony begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ciOCqvJiMQ3PkTEYLBv8q72QT9J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:687577'),
  ('319236872984328733', 'Junun', 2015, 'Music, Documentary', 'Paul Thomas Anderson', null, 'Shye Ben Tzur, Ehtisham Khan Ajmeri, Gufran Ali, Shazib Ali, Sabir Bamami, Aamir Bhiyani, Soheb Bhiyani, Ajaj Damami', null, 'A documentary capturing the creation of the album Junun inside Rajasthan’s 15th-century Mehrangarh Fort. Paul Thomas Anderson follows Jonny Greenwood, Shye Ben Tzur, Nigel Godrich, and the Rajasthan Express as they record a cross-cultural fusion of Indian, Israeli, and Western music.', 'A documentary capturing the creation of the album Junun inside Rajasthan’s 15th-century Mehrangarh Fort. Paul Thomas Anderson follows Jonny Greenwood, Shye Ben Tzur, Nigel Godrich, and the Rajasthan Express as they record a cross-cultural fusion of Indian, Israeli, and Western music.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tsssow8XqZgP6KhT39Shx45sWBK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:355600'),
  ('1045332733776967627', 'Jupiter Ascending', 2015, 'Science Fiction, Fantasy, Action', 'Lana Wachowski, Lilly Wachowski, Chris Downs', 'Lilly Wachowski, Lana Wachowski', 'Channing Tatum, Mila Kunis, Sean Bean, Eddie Redmayne, Douglas Booth, Tuppence Middleton, Nikki Amuka-Bird, Christina Cole', 'PG-13', 'In a universe where human genetic material is the most precious commodity, an impoverished young Earth woman becomes the key to strategic maneuvers and internal strife within a powerful dynasty…', 'In a universe where human genetic material is the most precious commodity, an impoverished young Earth woman becomes the key to strategic maneuvers and internal strife within a powerful dynasty…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2NCcAZ3M3F0FxENYmammBknwpVn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76757'),
  ('115414291421254170', 'Jupiter''s Moon', 2017, 'Science Fiction', 'Kornél Mundruczó, Tamás Dobos, Marcell Rév', 'Kornél Mundruczó, Kata Wéber', 'Merab Ninidze, György Cserhalmi, Mónika Balsai, Zsombor Jéger, Majd Asmi, Zsombor Barna, Szabolcs Bede-Fazekas, Ákos Birkás', null, 'A young refugee, Aryan, is shot while illegally trying to cross the Hungarian border. While tending him back to health, a doctor at a refugee camp discovers that Aryan has gained an extraordinary talent—he can levitate. Aryan is smuggled out by the doctor, who is intent on exploiting his secret.', 'A young refugee, Aryan, is shot while illegally trying to cross the Hungarian border. While tending him back to health, a doctor at a refugee camp discovers that Aryan has gained an extraordinary talent—he can levitate. Aryan is smuggled out by the doctor, who is intent on exploiting his secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lhxOYoKfLjaicDckUf8pX04ilOf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:444395'),
  ('867970559952535852', 'Jupiter''s Thigh', 1980, 'Comedy', 'Philippe de Broca', 'Michel Audiard', 'Philippe Noiret, Annie Girardot, Francis Perrin, Catherine Alric, Marc Dudicourt, Paulette Dubost, Roger Carel, Anna Gaylor', null, 'Antoine, a professor of Greek, and Lise, a police inspector, honeymoon in Greece. There they meet a young couple, Charles, an archaeologist, and Agnes, a dishy flirt. Charles unearths the lovely buttocks of a classical statue and is determined to donate it to the Louvre. Agnes wants to sell it and gets a handsome local sailor to take it for an appraisal. When the sailor is murdered, the police suspect Charles and arrest Antoine as his accomplice. Lise swings into action, but before she can clear the men, Agnes springs them from jail, and now Lise must help them elude the police, find the real murderer, and recover the statue fragment. More art goes missing. What is the statue''s secret?', 'Antoine, a professor of Greek, and Lise, a police inspector, honeymoon in Greece. There they meet a young couple, Charles, an archaeologist, and Agnes, a dishy flirt. Charles unearths the lovely buttocks of a classical statue and is determined to donate it to the Louvre. Agnes wants to sell it and gets a handsome local sailor to take it for an appraisal. When the sailor is murdered, the police suspect Charles and arrest Antoine as his accomplice. Lise swings into action, but before she can clear the men, Agnes springs them from jail, and now Lise must help them elude the police, find the real murderer, and recover the statue fragment. More art goes missing. What is the statue''s secret?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9SMaPrA63VxxvZnBIoHZ5p4o4ue.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61243'),
  ('778223196745797632', 'Jupiter''s Thunderballs', 1903, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Georges Méliès', null, 'With godly entrapments, Zeus appears on the horizon, engages Hermes as an audience, and tries to throw some thunderbolts. They fizzle. Hephaestus tries to make some repairs but succeeds only in heating the bolts and burning Zeus''s hands. Zeus conjures nine muses, but do their incantations help? He dismisses them as well as a visiting Pan, and his fits of pique become counter-productive. Can he get his powers back?', 'With godly entrapments, Zeus appears on the horizon, engages Hermes as an audience, and tries to throw some thunderbolts. They fizzle. Hephaestus tries to make some repairs but succeeds only in heating the bolts and burning Zeus''s hands. Zeus conjures nine muses, but do their incantations help? He dismisses them as well as a visiting Pan, and his fits of pique become counter-productive. Can he get his powers back?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kdQ1GpIl10dOYG1N3g6ATGj97Ij.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190683'),
  ('455536625702063040', 'Jurassic Attack', 2013, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Anthony Fankhauser, Stuart Brereton', 'Rafael Jordan', 'Corin Nemec, Vernon Wells, Gary Stretch, Michael Worth, Natascha Berg, Alicia Ziegler, Rachel Riley, Israel Sáez de Miguel', null, 'While returning from a military expedition a helicopter crash lands a commando unit in a dense, remote tropical jungle – a lost world populated by dinosaurs. Now they must find a way out of this isolated valley before becoming prey for prehistoric predators.', 'While returning from a military expedition a helicopter crash lands a commando unit in a dense, remote tropical jungle – a lost world populated by dinosaurs. Now they must find a way out of this isolated valley before becoming prey for prehistoric predators.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jHoma8SEt8zgQF8kZgdPpDfZLxX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:166660'),
  ('268648752109654706', 'Jurassic City', 2015, 'Action, Science Fiction, Horror', 'Sean Cain, Carl Soto, Stuart Brereton', 'Sean Cain', 'Ray Wise, Kevin Gage, Vernon Wells, Robert LaSardo, Dana Melanie, Sofia Mattsson, Kayla Carlyle, Jack Forcinito', null, 'When a top-secret laboratory is unexpectedly breached, thousands of rampaging raptors are unleashed on Los Angeles! A black-ops unit is mobilized to contain the creatures before they cause city-wide chaos. Simultaneously, a truckload of raptors is rerouted to a nearby prison. Upon their escape, these ferocious flesh-eaters are beyond containment. This is Jurassic judgment night for smoking hot sorority girls, sinister scientists, muscle-bound military and doomed death-row inmates! It''s about to get bloody in Jurassic City!', 'When a top-secret laboratory is unexpectedly breached, thousands of rampaging raptors are unleashed on Los Angeles! A black-ops unit is mobilized to contain the creatures before they cause city-wide chaos. Simultaneously, a truckload of raptors is rerouted to a nearby prison. Upon their escape, these ferocious flesh-eaters are beyond containment. This is Jurassic judgment night for smoking hot sorority girls, sinister scientists, muscle-bound military and doomed death-row inmates! It''s about to get bloody in Jurassic City!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vhpcMRNjB1hiKJPS4QPpmV5Mpvn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:315024'),
  ('711001791565328061', 'Jurassic Domination', 2022, 'Action, Science Fiction, Adventure, Horror', 'Brian Nowak, Thomas Hennessy, Nicholas Prainito', 'Jason Tozier', 'Jamie Bernadette, DeAngelo Davis, Kahlo De Jesus Buffington, Alissa Filoramo, Eric Guilmette, Eric Roberts, Miranda Meadows, Jack Pearson', null, 'When two military-made, weaponized dinosaurs attack a small mountain town, it''s up to the sheriff to figure out a way to stop the creatures before the dinos escape and wreak havoc nationwide.', 'When two military-made, weaponized dinosaurs attack a small mountain town, it''s up to the sheriff to figure out a way to stop the creatures before the dinos escape and wreak havoc nationwide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vnJW78GCymF5ZfJ5i1q0cRcugA1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:992090'),
  ('859577569763656879', 'Jurassic Galaxy', 2018, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 'James Kondelik, Joel Hodge, Jon Kondelik', 'Eric Paul Erickson, Jacoby Bancroft', 'Eric Paul Erickson, Madison West, Ryan Budds, Doug Burch, Jonathan Nation, Frankie Ray, Tamara Stayer', null, 'In the near future, a ship of space explorers crash land on an unknown planet. They''re soon met with some of their worst fears as they discover the planet is inhabited by monstrous dinosaurs.', 'In the near future, a ship of space explorers crash land on an unknown planet. They''re soon met with some of their worst fears as they discover the planet is inhabited by monstrous dinosaurs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l2F4yWfLs21lrUyEh4bNOzjTEsb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:540247'),
  ('36098231690288575', 'Jurassic Hunt', 2021, 'Action, Science Fiction, Thriller, Horror', 'Hank Braxtan', 'Jeffrey Giles, Jacoby Bancroft', 'Courtney Loggins, Ruben Pla, Tarkan Dospil, Joston Theney, Antuone Torbert, Heath C. Heine', 'R', 'Female adventurer Parker joins a crew of male trophy hunters in a remote wilderness park. Their goal: slaughter genetically recreated dinosaurs for sport using rifles, arrows, and grenades. After their guide is killed by raptors, the team tries to escape the park – but the hunters quickly become the hunted. Even worse, the park’s manager suspects Parker of being a spy and sends a hit squad after her. This battle’s about to become primitive!', 'Female adventurer Parker joins a crew of male trophy hunters in a remote wilderness park. Their goal: slaughter genetically recreated dinosaurs for sport using rifles, arrows, and grenades. After their guide is killed by raptors, the team tries to escape the park – but the hunters quickly become the hunted. Even worse, the park’s manager suspects Parker of being a spy and sends a hit squad after her. This battle’s about to become primitive!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bZnOioDq1ldaxKfUoj3DenHU7mp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:848278'),
  ('1127603117786281083', 'Jurassic Park', 1993, 'Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Steven Spielberg, Dean Cundey, Lauren Cory', 'Michael Crichton, David Koepp', 'Sam Neill, Laura Dern, Jeff Goldblum, Richard Attenborough, Bob Peck, Martin Ferrero, BD Wong, Joseph Mazzello', 'PG-13', 'A wealthy entrepreneur secretly creates a theme park featuring living dinosaurs drawn from prehistoric DNA. Before opening day, he invites a team of experts and his two eager grandchildren to experience the park and help calm anxious investors. However, the park is anything but amusing as the security systems go off-line and the dinosaurs escape.', 'A wealthy entrepreneur secretly creates a theme park featuring living dinosaurs drawn from prehistoric DNA. Before opening day, he invites a team of experts and his two eager grandchildren to experience the park and help calm anxious investors. However, the park is anything but amusing as the security systems go off-line and the dinosaurs escape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/maFjKnJ62hDQ9E66dKqDZgbUy0H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:329'),
  ('496134530016591481', 'Jurassic Park III', 2001, 'Adventure, Action, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Shelly Johnson, Joe Johnston, Greg Papalia', 'Jim Taylor, Peter Buchman, Alexander Payne', 'Sam Neill, William H. Macy, Téa Leoni, Alessandro Nivola, Trevor Morgan, Michael Jeter, John Diehl, Bruce A. Young', 'PG-13', 'In need of funds for research, Dr. Alan Grant accepts a large sum of money to accompany Paul and Amanda Kirby on an aerial tour of the infamous Isla Sorna. It isn''t long before all hell breaks loose and the stranded wayfarers must fight for survival as a host of new -- and even more deadly -- dinosaurs try to make snacks of them.', 'In need of funds for research, Dr. Alan Grant accepts a large sum of money to accompany Paul and Amanda Kirby on an aerial tour of the infamous Isla Sorna. It isn''t long before all hell breaks loose and the stranded wayfarers must fight for survival as a host of new -- and even more deadly -- dinosaurs try to make snacks of them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oQXj4NUfS3r3gHXtDOzcJgj1lLc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:331'),
  ('90536642408190587', 'Jurassic Shark', 2012, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Brett Kelly', 'David A. Lloyd', 'Emanuelle Carriere, Christine Emes, Celine Filion, Angela Parent, Duncan Milloy, Phil Dukarsky, Kyle Martellacci, Joshua Gilbert Crosby', null, 'When an oil company unwittingly unleashes a prehistoric shark from its icy prison, the Jurassic killer maroons a group of art thieves and a group of college students on an abandoned island', 'When an oil company unwittingly unleashes a prehistoric shark from its icy prison, the Jurassic killer maroons a group of art thieves and a group of college students on an abandoned island', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kl0e1dthiBM3B3jADe50d29N043.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120846'),
  ('535548780509065547', 'Jurassic World', 2015, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Colin Trevorrow, Samantha Avila, Ryan Shields Johnston', 'Rick Jaffa, Amanda Silver, Derek Connolly', 'Chris Pratt, Bryce Dallas Howard, Irrfan Khan, Vincent D''Onofrio, Ty Simpkins, Nick Robinson, Jake Johnson, Omar Sy', 'PG-13', 'Twenty-two years after the events of Jurassic Park, Isla Nublar now features a fully functioning dinosaur theme park, Jurassic World, as originally envisioned by John Hammond.', 'Twenty-two years after the events of Jurassic Park, Isla Nublar now features a fully functioning dinosaur theme park, Jurassic World, as originally envisioned by John Hammond.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rhr4y79GpxQF9IsfJItRXVaoGs4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:135397'),
  ('99982681520511618', 'Jurassic World Camp Cretaceous: Hidden Adventure', 2022, 'Action, Adventure, Animation', 'Eric Elrod, Leah Artwick, Michael Mullen', 'Bethany Armstrong Johnson, Sheela Shrinivas, Rick Williams', 'Paul-Mikél Williams, Sean Giambrone, Kausar Mohammed, Jenna Ortega, Ryan Potter, Raini Rodriguez, Bill Nye, Jeff Bergman', 'PG', 'After a big storm, food is scarce — and hungry dinos are everywhere. It''s up to you to help the Camp Fam survive in this thrilling interactive special.', 'After a big storm, food is scarce — and hungry dinos are everywhere. It''s up to you to help the Camp Fam survive in this thrilling interactive special.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ZeqXAT3EXu9uhFXwhyKlH4NAlM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1036956'),
  ('95623851152626632', 'Jurassic World Dominion', 2022, 'Adventure, Action, Science Fiction', 'Alex Bowens, Dominique Law, Keely Lanigan-Atkins', 'Emily Carmichael, Colin Trevorrow', 'Chris Pratt, Bryce Dallas Howard, Laura Dern, Sam Neill, Jeff Goldblum, DeWanda Wise, Mamoudou Athie, Isabella Sermon', 'PG-13', 'Four years after Isla Nublar was destroyed, dinosaurs now live—and hunt—alongside humans all over the world. This fragile balance will reshape the future and determine, once and for all, whether human beings are to remain the apex predators on a planet they now share with history''s most fearsome creatures.', 'Four years after Isla Nublar was destroyed, dinosaurs now live—and hunt—alongside humans all over the world. This fragile balance will reshape the future and determine, once and for all, whether human beings are to remain the apex predators on a planet they now share with history''s most fearsome creatures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jbAvCACjLf1ZG0unB2tdmx5HAf1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:507086'),
  ('555424120291272127', 'Jurassic World Rebirth', 2025, 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Action', 'Gareth Edwards, John Mathieson, Jina Jay', 'David Koepp', 'Scarlett Johansson, Mahershala Ali, Jonathan Bailey, Rupert Friend, Manuel Garcia-Rulfo, Luna Blaise, David Iacono, Audrina Miranda', 'PG-13', 'Five years after the events of Jurassic World Dominion, covert operations expert Zora Bennett is contracted to lead a skilled team on a top-secret mission to secure genetic material from the world''s three most massive dinosaurs. When Zora''s operation intersects with a civilian family whose boating expedition was capsized, they all find themselves stranded on an island where they come face-to-face with a sinister, shocking discovery that''s been hidden from the world for decades.', 'Five years after the events of Jurassic World Dominion, covert operations expert Zora Bennett is contracted to lead a skilled team on a top-secret mission to secure genetic material from the world''s three most massive dinosaurs. When Zora''s operation intersects with a civilian family whose boating expedition was capsized, they all find themselves stranded on an island where they come face-to-face with a sinister, shocking discovery that''s been hidden from the world for decades.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1RICxzeoNCAO5NpcRMIgg1XT6fm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1234821'),
  ('161498234407894380', 'Jurassic World Rebirth: The Making of a New Era', 2025, 'Documentary', 'Mikkel Zall', null, 'Scarlett Johansson, Jonathan Bailey, Mahershala Ali, Gareth Edwards, David Koepp, Rupert Friend, Manuel Garcia-Rulfo, Audrina Miranda', 'PG', 'A behind-the-scenes look with the cast and crew, featuring thrilling locations, deadly new dinosaurs and the next evolution of the iconic franchise.', 'A behind-the-scenes look with the cast and crew, featuring thrilling locations, deadly new dinosaurs and the next evolution of the iconic franchise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uJUzfTtbCUG1GXmVS24h8h0hXX3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1505898'),
  ('587911747816244362', 'Jurassic World: Fallen Kingdom', 2018, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'J. A. Bayona, Óscar Faura, Andrew Max Cahn', 'Derek Connolly, Colin Trevorrow', 'Chris Pratt, Bryce Dallas Howard, Rafe Spall, Justice Smith, Daniella Pineda, James Cromwell, Toby Jones, Ted Levine', 'PG-13', 'Three years after Jurassic World was destroyed, Isla Nublar now sits abandoned. When the island''s dormant volcano begins roaring to life, Owen and Claire mount a campaign to rescue the remaining dinosaurs from this extinction-level event.', 'Three years after Jurassic World was destroyed, Isla Nublar now sits abandoned. When the island''s dormant volcano begins roaring to life, Owen and Claire mount a campaign to rescue the remaining dinosaurs from this extinction-level event.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x2Us3jR6ToMJjbcPbLimYoxf6xr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:351286'),
  ('119054957835186407', 'Jürgen - Heute wird gelebt', 2017, 'Family, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Lars Jessen', 'Heinz Strunk, Peter Güde', 'Heinz Strunk, Charly Hübner, Friederike Kempter, Peter Heinrich Brix, Katja Danowski, David Bredin, Ole Fischer, Klaas Heufer-Umlauf', null, 'Middle-aged Jürgen and his pal Bernd, an odd couple without social competence, are attending a trip by ''EuropLove'' to Eastern Europe to finally find a woman.', 'Middle-aged Jürgen and his pal Bernd, an odd couple without social competence, are attending a trip by ''EuropLove'' to Eastern Europe to finally find a woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dsnk5CtqQB96nRILfRSTl2jy6gP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:474050'),
  ('772948150244686502', 'Juror #2', 2024, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Yves Bélanger, Michael Anthony Brown, Stephen S. Campanelli', 'Jonathan A. Abrams', 'Nicholas Hoult, Toni Collette, J.K. Simmons, Chris Messina, Gabriel Basso, Zoey Deutch, Cedric Yarbrough, Leslie Bibb', 'PG-13', 'While serving as a juror in a high profile murder trial, family man Justin Kemp finds himself struggling with a serious moral dilemma…one he could use to sway the jury verdict and potentially convict—or free—the accused killer.', 'While serving as a juror in a high profile murder trial, family man Justin Kemp finds himself struggling with a serious moral dilemma…one he could use to sway the jury verdict and potentially convict—or free—the accused killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ugQkpGajKFQ8eyOEhGheR0HfWQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1106739'),
  ('769525527393843055', 'Juror 8', 2019, 'Drama', 'Hong Seung-wan, Baek Yoon-seuk, Lee Jun-il', 'Hong Seung-wan', 'Moon So-ri, Park Hyung-sik, Baek Soo-jang, Cha Mi-kyeong, Yoon Kyung-ho, Seo Jeong-yeon, Cho Han-cheul, Cho Soo-hyang', null, 'Seoul, South Korea, September 21st, 2008. Eight citizens, the first to intervene as jurors in the country''s legal history, are randomly selected to examine a matricide case that appears to have been resolved due to the existence of apparently conclusive evidence.', 'Seoul, South Korea, September 21st, 2008. Eight citizens, the first to intervene as jurors in the country''s legal history, are randomly selected to examine a matricide case that appears to have been resolved due to the existence of apparently conclusive evidence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hNbbdoGVNzwOu22VW2sfiyxDtcK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:571603'),
  ('59534296640194894', 'Jury Duty', 1995, 'Comedy, Drama', 'John Fortenberry, Ruth A. Redfern, Avraham Karpick', 'Samantha Adams, Neil Tolkin, Barbara Williams', 'Pauly Shore, Tia Carrere, Stanley Tucci, Brian Doyle-Murray, Abe Vigoda, Charles Napier, Richard Edson, Richard Riehle', 'PG-13', 'When jobless Tommy Collins discovers that sequestered jurors earn free room and board as well as $5-a-day, he gets himself assigned to a jury in a murder trial. Once there, he does everything he can to prolong the trial and deliberations and make the sequestration more comfortable for himself.', 'When jobless Tommy Collins discovers that sequestered jurors earn free room and board as well as $5-a-day, he gets himself assigned to a jury in a murder trial. Once there, he does everything he can to prolong the trial and deliberations and make the sequestration more comfortable for himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/DbKQDPqBE4kCaePj4CHu6r3ZAb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19326'),
  ('157023687051916618', 'Jury of One', 1974, 'Crime, Drama', 'Jean Badal, André Cayatte', 'Paul Andréota', 'Jean Gabin, Sophia Loren, Michel Albertini, Gisèle Casadesus, Julien Bertheau, Muriel Catalá, Henri Garcin, Marthe Villalonga', null, 'A desperate woman, whose son is on trial for murder, blackmails the judge and kidnaps his wife.', 'A desperate woman, whose son is on trial for murder, blackmails the judge and kidnaps his wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x5qkucNKW5MJbTWW5voWXGxU7L3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4681'),
