  ('467481452790252476', 'Just a Breath Away', 2018, 'Drama, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Daniel Roby, Pierre-Yves Bastard, Tom Kan', 'Mathieu Delozier, Guillaume Lemans, Jimmy Bemon', 'Romain Duris, Olga Kurylenko, Fantine Harduin, Michel Robin, Anna Gaylor, Réphaël Ghrenassia, Erja Malatier, Alexis Manenti', null, 'When a deadly mist engulfs Paris, people find refuge in the upper floors of the buildings. With no information, no electricity and hardly any supplies, Mathieu, Anna and their daughter Sarah try to survive the disaster.', 'When a deadly mist engulfs Paris, people find refuge in the upper floors of the buildings. With no information, no electricity and hardly any supplies, Mathieu, Anna and their daughter Sarah try to survive the disaster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hjePJQDv7GitTrEU67TANuhbytv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:477489'),
  ('340517067353912883', 'Just a Couple of Days', 2024, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Julie Navarro, Jennifer Peyrot, Monica Mele', 'Julie Navarro, Marc Salbert', 'Camille Cottin, Benjamin Biolay, Amrullah Safi, Makita Samba, Loula Bartilla Besse, Saadia Bentaïeb, Olivier Charasson, Andranic Manet', null, 'After being reassigned from music to field reporting, a critic goes to a refugee camp near Paris during an evacuation. He experiences police violence and is thrust into becoming the face of the refugee cause.', 'After being reassigned from music to field reporting, a critic goes to a refugee camp near Paris during an evacuation. He experiences police violence and is thrust into becoming the face of the refugee cause.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sxPPpYkR9AsuYy7n5xbInbOzJa3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1001023'),
  ('257428020177456982', 'Just a Father', 2008, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Luca Lucini', 'Giulia Calenda', 'Luca Argentero, Diane Fleri, Fabio Troiano, Anna Foglietta, Sara D''Amario, Alessandro Sampaoli, Claudia Pandolfi, Gianni Bissacca', null, 'Carlo is a doctor that has recently lost his wife. Affected by the loss, he is supported by his family and friends, and, above all, for the love he feels towards his little daughter. And then, one day, he meets Camille.', 'Carlo is a doctor that has recently lost his wife. Affected by the loss, he is supported by his family and friends, and, above all, for the love he feels towards his little daughter. And then, one day, he meets Camille.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v1hUiRS7DSOUI6GIsCimyTwR1Kn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58400'),
  ('320281586344532430', 'Just a Gigolo', 1978, 'Drama', 'David Hemmings, Charly Steinberger', 'Julius Brammer, Irving Caesar, Ennio De Concini', 'David Bowie, Kim Novak, Marlene Dietrich, Maria Schell, Curd Jürgens, Erika Pluhar, David Hemmings, Sydne Rome', 'R', 'After World War I, a war hero returns to Berlin to find that there''s no place for him--he has no skills other than what he learned in the army, and can only find menial, low-paying jobs. He decides to become a gigolo to lonely rich women.', 'After World War I, a war hero returns to Berlin to find that there''s no place for him--he has no skills other than what he learned in the army, and can only find menial, low-paying jobs. He decides to become a gigolo to lonely rich women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y6Ztqro1S3b1TIEImILjAMLOgaa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12826'),
  ('959218412225565947', 'Just a Gigolo', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Olivier Baroux', 'Olivier Baroux, Kad Merad', 'Kad Merad, Anne Charrier, Léopold Moati, Pascal Elbé, Thierry Lhermitte, Anny Duperey, Lionel Abelanski, Guy Lecluyse', null, 'How to live happy and rich without working? To be Gigolo. But after 25 years of living with Denise, Alex the "gigolo" gets fired without notice and finds himself on the street. Forced to move to his sister and his nephew of 10 years, he then has an obsession: find quickly a rich heiress.', 'How to live happy and rich without working? To be Gigolo. But after 25 years of living with Denise, Alex the "gigolo" gets fired without notice and finds himself on the street. Forced to move to his sister and his nephew of 10 years, he then has an obsession: find quickly a rich heiress.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nAUQnJiio0mdPKkoBZAktq6qQyu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:544345'),
  ('763815385782414507', 'Just a Little Chemistry', 2015, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Alfonso Albacete, Carles Gusi', 'Mireia Llinàs, Alfonso Albacete', 'Ana Fernández, Alejo Sauras, Rodrigo Guirao Díaz, Jose Coronado, Natalia de Molina, María Esteve, Bibiana Fernández, Neus Asensi', null, 'Fan girl finds herself torn between the attraction for her film idol and her best male friend.', 'Fan girl finds herself torn between the attraction for her film idol and her best male friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nsbsRcBBnzKrQvqehRxZVI9B8KZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:277387'),
  ('111191190017017869', 'Just a Question of Love', 2000, 'Drama, Romance', 'Christian Faure, Louis-Philippe Capelle', 'Annick Larboulette, Pierre Pauquet', 'Cyrille Thouvenin, Stéphan Guérin-Tillié, Caroline Veyt, Éva Darlan, Danièle Denie, Idwig Stephane', null, 'After his gay cousin dies from hepatitis, young Laurent, who lives with his best friend Carole, falls in love with Cedric, a plant scientist. He''s afraid to inform his conservative parents that he is gay.', 'After his gay cousin dies from hepatitis, young Laurent, who lives with his best friend Carole, falls in love with Cedric, a plant scientist. He''s afraid to inform his conservative parents that he is gay.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/loqvaHycm5PjP5qZos2Zj7g9HKo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4369'),
  ('601049681056312720', 'Just a Sigh', 2013, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jérôme Bonnell, Pascal Lagriffoul', 'Jérôme Bonnell', 'Emmanuelle Devos, Gabriel Byrne, Gilles Privat, Aurélia Petit, Laurent Capelluto, Noémie Landreau, Françoise Lebrun, Denis Ménochet', 'PG-13', 'In the short break between performances in Calais, stage actress Alix makes a quick escape to Paris. On the train she meets a mysterious English stranger and, for the most fleeting of afternoons, imagines what the future could hold down a different road.', 'In the short break between performances in Calais, stage actress Alix makes a quick escape to Paris. On the train she meets a mysterious English stranger and, for the most fleeting of afternoons, imagines what the future could hold down a different road.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9AX5X090tdgFR4K7khvuBaAMmNx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:173912'),
  ('444968025253716110', 'Just About Love?', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Lola Doillon, Romain Lacourbas, Ophélie Gelber', 'Lola Doillon', 'Lucie Desclozeaux, Christa Théret, Gaël Tavares, Nicholas Schwerin, Shomron Haddad, Eloïse Etrillard, Vincent Romeuf, Jules Borie', null, 'End of High School, Beginning of Summer. A group of friends spend most of their time together, but little do they know that each and everyone of them has set their mind on pursuing one goal, the goal of every teenager : doing it for the first time. And sometimes the line between friendship, love and desire is really thin especially when you’re 15.', 'End of High School, Beginning of Summer. A group of friends spend most of their time together, but little do they know that each and everyone of them has set their mind on pursuing one goal, the goal of every teenager : doing it for the first time. And sometimes the line between friendship, love and desire is really thin especially when you’re 15.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rde5eDxcRVe4H3VYXzs6WzcgL7p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19098'),
  ('74810583560774641', 'Just Add Romance', 2019, 'TV Movie, Romance, Comedy', 'Ross Langill, Cassie Turgeon, Kevin Speckmaier', 'Karen Berger', 'Meghann Fahy, Luke Macfarlane, Brittney Wilson, Debs Howard, Caitlin Stryker, Favour Onwuka, Donna Christie, Theresa Wong', null, 'When Carly and Jason, exact opposites, compete on a famed cooking show for the chance at their own restaurant, what will matter more – their culinary careers or their potential love?', 'When Carly and Jason, exact opposites, compete on a famed cooking show for the chance at their own restaurant, what will matter more – their culinary careers or their potential love?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gwyriT9NvDgbG3V0BBYeV2B9Uh3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:583722'),
  ('52455843897337513', 'Just Add Water', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Hart Bochner, Aaron Barnes', 'Hart Bochner', 'Dylan Walsh, Jonah Hill, Justin Long, Danny DeVito, Tracy Middendorf, Melissa McCarthy, Anika Noni Rose, Lindsey Axelsson', 'R', 'An offbeat romantic comedy about a decent guy, Ray Tuckby, with a dead-end life in the dead-end town of Trona, CA. After encouragement from a stranger whom he happens upon, Ray begins to dream again. He sheds the parasites in his life, musters the nerve to pursue his childhood love, and finally takes back his community by toppling the local teenage Meth-baron.', 'An offbeat romantic comedy about a decent guy, Ray Tuckby, with a dead-end life in the dead-end town of Trona, CA. After encouragement from a stranger whom he happens upon, Ray begins to dream again. He sheds the parasites in his life, musters the nerve to pursue his childhood love, and finally takes back his community by toppling the local teenage Meth-baron.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8zK8ScSnJGA0lxK9xt1lPKLDJUx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15936'),
  ('296861957018669154', 'Just Another Christmas', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama, Fantasy, Family', 'Fernanda Mandriola, Bianca Paranhos, Natalia Soutto', 'Paulo Cursino', 'Leandro Hassum, Elisa Pinheiro, Arianne Botelho, Miguel Rômulo, Louise Cardoso, Levi Ferreira, Danielle Winits, Rodrigo Fagundes', null, 'After taking a very nasty fall on Christmas Eve, grinchy Jorge blacks out and wakes up one year later, with no memory of the year that has passed. He soon realizes that he’s doomed to keep waking up on Christmas Eve after Christmas Eve, having to deal with the aftermath of what his other self has done the other 364 days of the year.', 'After taking a very nasty fall on Christmas Eve, grinchy Jorge blacks out and wakes up one year later, with no memory of the year that has passed. He soon realizes that he’s doomed to keep waking up on Christmas Eve after Christmas Eve, having to deal with the aftermath of what his other self has done the other 364 days of the year.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pv4e8yKGMJAaZihYPFUjYHsG8Ob.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:755339'),
  ('1061118129502127451', 'Just Another Girl on the I.R.T.', 1993, 'Drama, Romance', 'Leslie Harris, Richard Connors, Tracey Moore', 'Leslie Harris', 'Ariyan A. Johnson, Kevin Thigpen, Ebony Jerido, Chequita Jackson, Jerard Washington, Tony Wilkes, Karen Robinson, Johnny Roses', 'R', 'Chantel Mitchell, a hip, articulate, black high-school girl in Brooklyn, is determined not to become "just another girl on the IRT" (the IRT is one of NYC''s subway lines). She dreams of medical school, a family, and an escape from the generational poverty and street-corner life her friends seem to have accepted as their lot. But personal and sexual challenges confront Chantel on her way to fulfilling these dreams.', 'Chantel Mitchell, a hip, articulate, black high-school girl in Brooklyn, is determined not to become "just another girl on the IRT" (the IRT is one of NYC''s subway lines). She dreams of medical school, a family, and an escape from the generational poverty and street-corner life her friends seem to have accepted as their lot. But personal and sexual challenges confront Chantel on her way to fulfilling these dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jjBthOisXwuyUqBd1BAmIzdSf4S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124088'),
  ('586638703452386400', 'Just Another Love Story', 2007, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Ole Bornedal, Dan Laustsen', 'Ole Bornedal', 'Anders W. Berthelsen, Rebecka Hemse, Nikolaj Lie Kaas, Charlotte Fich, Dejan Čukić, Ewa Fröling, Bent Mejding, Josephine Raahauge', null, 'Jonas is a Copenhagen homicide scene photographer, happily married, with two kids. One day, his car stalls, another car slams into him, runs head on into a third car and flips into the ditch. The other driver, Julia, is critically injured. He visits her in the hospital and is greeted by her family, who assumes he must be the Sebastian she told them about, the new fiance she met in Vietnam.', 'Jonas is a Copenhagen homicide scene photographer, happily married, with two kids. One day, his car stalls, another car slams into him, runs head on into a third car and flips into the ditch. The other driver, Julia, is critically injured. He visits her in the hospital and is greeted by her family, who assumes he must be the Sebastian she told them about, the new fiance she met in Vietnam.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9kEh1eILiAQ7aL5o0nb9ZUpCZR2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14898'),
  ('411345024471689074', 'Just Another Pandora''s Box', 2010, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Jeffrey Lau Chun-Wai', 'Jeffrey Lau Chun-Wai', 'Ronald Cheng Chung-Kei, Sun Li, Gigi Leung Wing-Kei, Athena Chu Yan, Eric Tsang Chi-Wai, Bruce Leung Siu-Lung, Huang Bo, Gillian Chung', null, 'Qing Ye Se only knows how to be a thief, but he runs into major trouble when he accidentally steals the heart of Rose, an immortal fairy. During a chaotic chase, Qing gets ahold of the Pandora''s Box, sending them both back in time to the Three Kingdoms era. Mistaken as a general, Qing is thrown right into the middle of the Battle of Red Cliff. Meanwhile, Rose continues to devise new ways to earn Qing''s affection, even if it means having to be someone', 'Qing Ye Se only knows how to be a thief, but he runs into major trouble when he accidentally steals the heart of Rose, an immortal fairy. During a chaotic chase, Qing gets ahold of the Pandora''s Box, sending them both back in time to the Three Kingdoms era. Mistaken as a general, Qing is thrown right into the middle of the Battle of Red Cliff. Meanwhile, Rose continues to devise new ways to earn Qing''s affection, even if it means having to be someone', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gbSxozqbSgt6Xc5dsOBuq2JamFs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41490'),
  ('898290918165874273', 'Just Around the Corner', 1938, 'Comedy, Music', 'Irving Cummings, Arthur C. Miller', 'J.P. McEvoy, Darrell Ware, Ethel Hill', 'Shirley Temple, Joan Davis, Charles Farrell, Amanda Duff, Bill Robinson, Bert Lahr, Franklin Pangborn, Cora Witherspoon', 'NR', 'Penny helps her idealistic architect father get his dream of a slum clearance project; The little miss dances with Corporal Jones.', 'Penny helps her idealistic architect father get his dream of a slum clearance project; The little miss dances with Corporal Jones.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/62WfUGlPycugm4eU9HnoDBmjcIM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43157'),
  ('597626307440060591', 'Just Before Dawn', 1981, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Jeff Lieberman, Dean King, Joel King', 'Mark Arywitz, Jeff Lieberman', 'George Kennedy, Mike Kellin, Chris Lemmon, Gregg Henry, Deborah Benson, Ralph Seymour, Katie Powell, John Hunsaker', 'R', 'In the Oregon mountains, a pair of hunters encounter a machete-wielding killer in an abandoned church. Meanwhile, five campers arrive to examine some property one of them has inherited but are warned by the forest ranger not to venture forth. Soon after they set up camp, they begin hearing strange noises, encounter a mysterious singing girl and start disappearing one by one.', 'In the Oregon mountains, a pair of hunters encounter a machete-wielding killer in an abandoned church. Meanwhile, five campers arrive to examine some property one of them has inherited but are warned by the forest ranger not to venture forth. Soon after they set up camp, they begin hearing strange noises, encounter a mysterious singing girl and start disappearing one by one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e3Y2iKXlbTxGVOJI9EgSxzGjUdt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39982'),
  ('958411437456681783', 'Just Before I Go', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Courteney Cox, Mark Schwartzbard', 'David Flebotte', 'Seann William Scott, Olivia Thirlby, Kate Walsh, Garret Dillahunt, Rob Riggle, David Arquette, Kyle Gallner, Jack Quaid', 'R', 'Ted Morgan has been treading water for most of his life. After his wife leaves him, Ted realizes he has nothing left to live for. Summoning the courage for one last act, Ted decides to go home and face the people he feels are responsible for creating the shell of a person he has become. But life is tricky. The more determined Ted is to confront his demons, to get closure, and to withdraw from his family, the more Ted is yanked into the chaos of their lives. So, when Ted Morgan decides to kill himself, he finds a reason to live.', 'Ted Morgan has been treading water for most of his life. After his wife leaves him, Ted realizes he has nothing left to live for. Summoning the courage for one last act, Ted decides to go home and face the people he feels are responsible for creating the shell of a person he has become. But life is tricky. The more determined Ted is to confront his demons, to get closure, and to withdraw from his family, the more Ted is yanked into the chaos of their lives. So, when Ted Morgan decides to kill himself, he finds a reason to live.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rEwXZIOh3CLVA5JJmxT5kaYY6ff.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258099'),
  ('583787557264835277', 'Just Before Losing Everything', 2013, 'Family, Drama', 'Xavier Legrand, Nathalie Durand', 'Xavier Legrand', 'Léa Drucker, Anne Benoît, Miljan Chatelain, Mathilde Auneveux, Denis Ménochet, Claire Dumas, Stéphane Schoukroun, Brigitte Barilley', null, 'Julien is 10 years old. He pretends to go to school but then hides out under a bridge, his backpack filled with clothes. A few kilometers away, 15-year-old Joséphine does the same and waits for the bus.', 'Julien is 10 years old. He pretends to go to school but then hides out under a bridge, his backpack filled with clothes. A few kilometers away, 15-year-old Joséphine does the same and waits for the bus.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b4g6tTko8kzq2AXOAhd8CnXoA4h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:222796'),
  ('78362293654167399', 'Just Before Nightfall', 1971, 'Drama, Crime', 'Claude Chabrol, Jean Rabier', 'Claude Chabrol', 'Stéphane Audran, Michel Bouquet, François Périer, Henri Attal, Jean Carmet, Dominique Zardi, Brigitte Périn, Pascal Gillot', null, 'A married man who killed the wife of his best friend during a tryst feels compelled to turn himself in.', 'A married man who killed the wife of his best friend during a tryst feels compelled to turn himself in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8dWKLlwGMeofbunbVvWfM9lzMdK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76200'),
  ('5266855834537729', 'Just Believe', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Alessandro Aronadio, Timoty Aliprandi', 'Edoardo Leo, Alessandro Aronadio, Valerio Cilio', 'Margherita Buy, Edoardo Leo, Giuseppe Battiston, Giulia Michelini, Massimiliano Bruno, Aleksandar Cvjetković, Franco Pinelli, Gegia', null, 'The owner of a dilapidated B&B has an idea: in order to dodge bankruptcy, he has to turn his business into a place of worship—a tax-free activity, where he''ll host pilgrims in exchange for a generous donation. He joins forces with an unscrupulous accountant and a failed novelist to come up with his new religion.', 'The owner of a dilapidated B&B has an idea: in order to dodge bankruptcy, he has to turn his business into a place of worship—a tax-free activity, where he''ll host pilgrims in exchange for a generous donation. He joins forces with an unscrupulous accountant and a failed novelist to come up with his new religion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kqGjUROxf2nak14rhB1NvPKGpDc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:492355'),
  ('532408524266593199', 'Just Between Friends', 1986, 'Drama, Romance', 'Allan Burns, Jordan Cronenweth', 'Allan Burns', 'Mary Tyler Moore, Ted Danson, Christine Lahti, Sam Waterston, Jane Greer, Julie Payne, Beverly Sanders, Salome Jens', 'PG-13', 'Holly and Sandy strike up an instant friendship; they don''t know however that they have more in common than they''d like. When tragedy strikes, their relationship is tested.', 'Holly and Sandy strike up an instant friendship; they don''t know however that they have more in common than they''d like. When tragedy strikes, their relationship is tested.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fQoi0iRtSA3xwNlmCUGvKc5R8FD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81824'),
  ('1072266473159104505', 'Just Buried', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama, Horror', 'Chaz Thorne, Christopher Porter', 'Chaz Thorne', 'Jay Baruchel, Rose Byrne, Graham Greene, Nigel Bennett, Sergio Di Zio, Reagan Pasternak, Brian Downey, Thomas Gibson', null, 'A young man inherits a nearly bankrupt funeral home from his estranged father. He falls in love with the alluring young mortician, only to find out she''s offing people to keep the place in business!', 'A young man inherits a nearly bankrupt funeral home from his estranged father. He falls in love with the alluring young mortician, only to find out she''s offing people to keep the place in business!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1gLnBaOGMaTVP7EumjWs9IBqeV7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15182'),
  ('989294899802895703', 'Just Call Me Nobody', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Du Jie, Kevin Chu', null, 'Xiao Shenyang, Zhao Benshan, Kelly Lin Hsi-Lei, Eric Tsang Chi-Wai, Mark Lee, Bi Chang, Guo Minger, Zhai Xingyue', null, 'Poor young cobbler Wu Di lives with his mother and is crazy about martial-arts picture books. One day he repairs the shoe of wandering swordswoman Yuelou and later helps save her in a fight with wanted criminal Tian Baguang, even though he has no martial-arts training. She tells him she owes him a life and can be found on Qin Mountain if he ever needs her. Yuelou is actually a princess who was due to marry the emperor but ran away after setting fire to her palace quarters. In love, Wu Di sets out to find her, fighting river pirate Dugu and his sidekick on the way, and also meeting a hermit Buddhist monk who offers to take him on as a pupil. Yuelou plans to attend a martial arts tournament to establish her name, little knowing that the emperor''s chief eunuch Cheng has arranged for her to be secretly protected by Penal Bureau officer Yang Guo and to win the tournament, so the emperor can award her the prize and persuade her to reconsider marriage.', 'Poor young cobbler Wu Di lives with his mother and is crazy about martial-arts picture books. One day he repairs the shoe of wandering swordswoman Yuelou and later helps save her in a fight with wanted criminal Tian Baguang, even though he has no martial-arts training. She tells him she owes him a life and can be found on Qin Mountain if he ever needs her. Yuelou is actually a princess who was due to marry the emperor but ran away after setting fire to her palace quarters. In love, Wu Di sets out to find her, fighting river pirate Dugu and his sidekick on the way, and also meeting a hermit Buddhist monk who offers to take him on as a pupil. Yuelou plans to attend a martial arts tournament to establish her name, little knowing that the emperor''s chief eunuch Cheng has arranged for her to be secretly protected by Penal Bureau officer Yang Guo and to win the tournament, so the emperor can award her the prize and persuade her to reconsider marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zpKeyqtKK02ITY28kOZW1ELzfzz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58365'),
  ('271447543656770082', 'Just Cause', 1995, 'Action, Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Arne Glimcher, Lajos Koltai, Chuck Picerni Jr.', 'Peter Stone, Jeb Stuart', 'Sean Connery, Laurence Fishburne, Blair Underwood, Kate Capshaw, Ruby Dee, Scarlett Johansson, Ed Harris, Christopher Murray', 'R', 'A Harvard professor is lured back into the courtroom after twenty-five years to take the case of a young black man condemned to death for the horrific murder of a child.', 'A Harvard professor is lured back into the courtroom after twenty-five years to take the case of a young black man condemned to death for the horrific murder of a child.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hbkS4UpgHcGhLlGy9YCX4WIJ4lu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9061'),
  ('323450395834277902', 'Just Dogs', 1932, 'Animation', 'Burt Gillett', null, 'Pinto Colvig', 'NR', 'Pluto''s cage-mate at the dog pound breaks out and lets all the other dogs out as well. In the park, that terrier keeps following Pluto too closely for Pluto''s tastes, until he digs up a huge bone and gives it to Pluto (who doesn''t particularly want to share). But soon all the other escaped dogs are chasing after the bone.', 'Pluto''s cage-mate at the dog pound breaks out and lets all the other dogs out as well. In the park, that terrier keeps following Pluto too closely for Pluto''s tastes, until he digs up a huge bone and gives it to Pluto (who doesn''t particularly want to share). But soon all the other escaped dogs are chasing after the bone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/guxsVIT4CkvYSuFi1ypvvj63JeY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70843'),
  ('752615964155319071', 'Just Don''t Think I''ll Scream', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Frank Beauvais', 'Frank Beauvais', 'Frank Beauvais', null, 'January 2016. The love story that brought me to this village in Alsace where I live ended six months ago. At 45, I am now alone, without a car, a job or any real prospects, surrounded by luxuriant nature, the proximity of which is not enough to calm the deep distress into which I am plunged. I am lost and I watch four to five films a day. I decide to record this stagnation, not by picking up a camera but by editing shots from the stream of films I watch.', 'January 2016. The love story that brought me to this village in Alsace where I live ended six months ago. At 45, I am now alone, without a car, a job or any real prospects, surrounded by luxuriant nature, the proximity of which is not enough to calm the deep distress into which I am plunged. I am lost and I watch four to five films a day. I decide to record this stagnation, not by picking up a camera but by editing shots from the stream of films I watch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fHqZ8dptMaYJoEUA1E09NayqabW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:577084'),
  ('242771417919602237', 'Just Ducky', 1953, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Joseph Barbera, William Hanna', null, 'Red Coffey', 'NR', 'Jerry Mouse befriends a newly hatched duckling who can''t swim and ends up protecting him against his feline nemesis, Tom.', 'Jerry Mouse befriends a newly hatched duckling who can''t swim and ends up protecting him against his feline nemesis, Tom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q5dIIgJfPKtPS7GQah9wPVR23zY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69096'),
  ('981968569113598837', 'Just for Laughs', 1997, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Laurent Barès, Lucas Belvaux', 'Lucas Belvaux', 'Ornella Muti, Jean-Pierre Léaud, Antoine Chappey, Tonie Marshall, Philippe Fretun, Bernard Mazzinghi, Philippe Saal, Bernard Fau', null, 'Michel and Juliette have just broken up over Michel''s affair with the much younger Romance. Alice and Nicolas are still together, but maybe this is because Nicolas does not know of Alice''s affair with handsome sports photographer Gaspard. This sly sex comedy, the sophomore effort of Belgian filmmaker Lucas Belvaux, follows the covert sexual misadventures of the troubled foursome.', 'Michel and Juliette have just broken up over Michel''s affair with the much younger Romance. Alice and Nicolas are still together, but maybe this is because Nicolas does not know of Alice''s affair with handsome sports photographer Gaspard. This sly sex comedy, the sophomore effort of Belgian filmmaker Lucas Belvaux, follows the covert sexual misadventures of the troubled foursome.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/isZ6cEbtzFAvbSxjPC7lqTzybNl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:341805'),
  ('717822398256308857', 'Just For Meeting You', 2023, 'Romance', 'Liu Yulin', 'Fan Wenwen, Hu Shuxin, 张皓宸', 'Liu Haocun, Song Weilong, Bu Guanjin, Guo Cheng, Gao Yalin, Ni Hongjie, Zhang Lei, Guo Keyu', null, 'Xu Niannian and Yang Yi met at the most beautiful time in their lives, sharing an unforgettable chapter of youthful love and growth.', 'Xu Niannian and Yang Yi met at the most beautiful time in their lives, sharing an unforgettable chapter of youthful love and growth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lXEk79BAq6NB3cDk3oXVV7vGrjT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:928333'),
  ('1115469564480742779', 'Just for the Hell of It', 1968, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Herschell Gordon Lewis', 'Allison Louise Downe', 'Ray Sager, Rodney Bedell, Agi Gyenes, Nancy Lee Noble, Steve White, Toni Newsholme, Julia Ames, Mindy Walters', null, 'A teenager, blamed for the terror befalling a Florida neighborhood, sets out to find the real culprits, who are in fact a punk gang leading local delinquents on a nihilistic spree of destruction and mayhem.', 'A teenager, blamed for the terror befalling a Florida neighborhood, sets out to find the real culprits, who are in fact a punk gang leading local delinquents on a nihilistic spree of destruction and mayhem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k5HF1RyjLgG8z9vZTFtcZzLUn7Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28167'),
  ('620110783091124610', 'Just for the Summer', 2020, 'Romance, Comedy, Family, Drama, TV Movie', 'Ryan Petey, Graham Cairns, C. Damon Harper', 'Jennifer Edwards, Amy Katherine Taylor', 'Hayley Sales, Brant Daugherty, Linda Darlow, Tasha Simms, Emma Johnson, Cassidy Nugent, Drew Weston, Charlie Nesbitt', 'PG', 'Penelope Campbell loves her annual summer vacations visiting her Grandma Dot, despite Dot''s constant attempts to set her up with every single man in town. This year, she bumps into Jason Humphrey, her childhood sweetheart. In order to evade the efforts of their matchmaking grandmothers, they make a pact pretending to date each other, but will the old sparks return?', 'Penelope Campbell loves her annual summer vacations visiting her Grandma Dot, despite Dot''s constant attempts to set her up with every single man in town. This year, she bumps into Jason Humphrey, her childhood sweetheart. In order to evade the efforts of their matchmaking grandmothers, they make a pact pretending to date each other, but will the old sparks return?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d5yEwLueHzlPO0v6FmUIhObKcA3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:690483'),
  ('123074574911485820', 'Just Friends', 2005, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Anthony B. Richmond, Roger Kumble, Jim Brebner', 'Adam ''Tex'' Davis', 'Ryan Reynolds, Amy Smart, Anna Faris, Chris Klein, Christopher Rodriguez Marquette, Julie Hagerty, Amy Matysio, Giacomo Beltrami', 'PG-13', 'While visiting his hometown during Christmas, a man comes face-to-face with his old high school crush whom he was best friends with – a woman whose rejection of him turned him into a ferocious womanizer.', 'While visiting his hometown during Christmas, a man comes face-to-face with his old high school crush whom he was best friends with – a woman whose rejection of him turned him into a ferocious womanizer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lh2EUTVOcESkdEOcsjYEW6qS1U0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10033'),
  ('532978280358950579', 'Just Friends', 2019, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Annemarie van de Mond', 'Henk Burger', 'Josha Stradowski, Majd Mardo, Jenny Arean, Tanja Jess, Nazmiye Oral, Sjoerd Dragtsma, Sonia Eijken, Melody Klaver', null, 'Joris is trying to come to terms with his broken family relationships on the 10th anniversary of his father’s death when he meets the free-spirited, Yad. Also dealing with family issues, Yad has returned home to The Netherlands after living on his own. Joris and Yad spark an instant connection and decide they want to be more than “just friends,” but fear their families could threaten their relationship.', 'Joris is trying to come to terms with his broken family relationships on the 10th anniversary of his father’s death when he meets the free-spirited, Yad. Also dealing with family issues, Yad has returned home to The Netherlands after living on his own. Joris and Yad spark an instant connection and decide they want to be more than “just friends,” but fear their families could threaten their relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1W75ZH4QGE52B7uOm2p3muAMkmP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:501902'),
  ('135024820014618405', 'Just Friends?', 2009, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Kim Jho Gwang-soo, Kim Myeong-joon, Go Yong-jin', 'Kim Jho Gwang-soo, Min Yong-keun', 'Lee Je-hoon, Yeon Woo-jin, Lee Sun-ju, Lee Chae-eun, Moon Seong-kwon, Son Cheol-min, Koh Soo-hee, Lee Choon-hyung', null, 'A sweet reunion turns heavy when Min-soo''s fear forces him to hide his love with two words: "just friends."', 'A sweet reunion turns heavy when Min-soo''s fear forces him to hide his love with two words: "just friends."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oTl5sIExhQyGMI2AlgbhszgdDRz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:169022'),
  ('60774418531429374', 'Just Getting Started', 2017, 'Action, Comedy', 'Ron Shelton, Barry Peterson, Steve Danton', 'Ron Shelton', 'Morgan Freeman, Tommy Lee Jones, Rene Russo, Joe Pantoliano, Glenne Headly, Sheryl Lee Ralph, Elizabeth Ashley, George Wallace', 'PG-13', 'Duke Diver is living the high life as the freewheeling manager of a luxurious resort in Palm Springs, Calif. He soon faces competition from Leo, a former military man who likes the same woman that Duke is interested in. When Diver''s past suddenly catches up with him, he must put aside his differences and reluctantly team up with Leo to stop whoever is trying to kill him.', 'Duke Diver is living the high life as the freewheeling manager of a luxurious resort in Palm Springs, Calif. He soon faces competition from Leo, a former military man who likes the same woman that Duke is interested in. When Diver''s past suddenly catches up with him, he must put aside his differences and reluctantly team up with Leo to stop whoever is trying to kill him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vtfYt7vi0cdzRCD7iUMTg3PPSoi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:398177'),
  ('542866889285013991', 'Just Go with It', 2011, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Dennis Dugan, Theo van de Sande, Conte Mark Matal', 'I. A. L. Diamond', 'Adam Sandler, Jennifer Aniston, Brooklyn Decker, Nicole Kidman, Nick Swardson, Bailee Madison, Griffin Gluck, Dave Matthews', 'PG-13', 'While romancing Palmer, a much younger schoolteacher, plastic surgeon Danny Maccabee enlists his loyal assistant Katherine to pretend to be his soon to be ex-wife, in order to cover up a careless lie. When more lies backfire, Katherine''s kids become involved, and everyone heads off for a weekend in Hawaii that will change all their lives.', 'While romancing Palmer, a much younger schoolteacher, plastic surgeon Danny Maccabee enlists his loyal assistant Katherine to pretend to be his soon to be ex-wife, in order to cover up a careless lie. When more lies backfire, Katherine''s kids become involved, and everyone heads off for a weekend in Hawaii that will change all their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3rz7bfGsPGcI6cfY002n9VrUgao.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50546'),
  ('203502028643298620', 'Just Heroes', 1989, 'Action, Crime', 'Wu Ma, John Woo, Cho Wai-Kei', 'Ni Kuang, Hau Chi-Keung', 'David Chiang Da-Wei, Danny Lee Sau-Yin, Chen Kuan-Tai, Tien Niu, Cally Kwong Mei-Wan, Wu Ma, James Wong Jim, Stephen Chow', null, 'A respected and well liked gang-boss is betrayed and killed. One of his three adopted sons are to take his place. One of them is the traitor.', 'A respected and well liked gang-boss is betrayed and killed. One of his three adopted sons are to take his place. One of them is the traitor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oMGx9dGNC5gQ4LvG2JX1GXYmNkd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74287'),
  ('264213064768885445', 'Just Imagine', 1930, 'Comedy, Music, Science Fiction, Fantasy', 'David Butler, Ad Schaumer, Ernest Palmer', 'Buddy G. DeSylva, Ray Henderson, Lew Brown', 'El Brendel, Maureen O''Sullivan, John Garrick, Marjorie White, Frank Albertson, Hobart Bosworth, Mischa Auer, George Irving', null, 'New York, 1980: airplanes have replaced cars, numbers have replaced names, pills have replaced food, government-arranged marriages have replaced love, and test tube babies have replaced ... well, you get the idea. Scientists revive a man struck by lightning in 1930; he is rechristened "Single O". He is befriended by J-21, who can''t marry the girl of his dreams because he isn''t "distinguished" enough -- until he is chosen for a 4-month expedition to Mars by a renegade scientist. The Mars J-21, his friend, and stowaway Single O visit is full of scantily clad women doing Busby Berkeley-style dance numbers and worshiping a fat middle-aged man.', 'New York, 1980: airplanes have replaced cars, numbers have replaced names, pills have replaced food, government-arranged marriages have replaced love, and test tube babies have replaced ... well, you get the idea. Scientists revive a man struck by lightning in 1930; he is rechristened "Single O". He is befriended by J-21, who can''t marry the girl of his dreams because he isn''t "distinguished" enough -- until he is chosen for a 4-month expedition to Mars by a renegade scientist. The Mars J-21, his friend, and stowaway Single O visit is full of scantily clad women doing Busby Berkeley-style dance numbers and worshiping a fat middle-aged man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3fY0nrTs0QhrpBLe6dGAosBYfv2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90395'),
  ('106327875784746803', 'Just in Time for Christmas', 2015, 'Fantasy, TV Movie, Romance, Drama', 'Sean McNamara, Danny Nowak', 'Don MacLeod, Helen Frost', 'Eloise Mumford, Michael Stahl-David, Christopher Lloyd, William Shatner, Tess Atkins, Laura Soltis, Christina Jastrzembska, Rob Heschl', null, 'Lindsay is faced with a life-altering decision as Christmas approaches: Stay in her tiny hometown and marry boyfriend Jason or accept a coveted post teaching at an Ivy League college on the other side of the country. What to do? Fortunately for Lindsay, she has some big-time help in the form of a magical messenger who is able to transport her three years into the future to see how it would all turn out.', 'Lindsay is faced with a life-altering decision as Christmas approaches: Stay in her tiny hometown and marry boyfriend Jason or accept a coveted post teaching at an Ivy League college on the other side of the country. What to do? Fortunately for Lindsay, she has some big-time help in the form of a magical messenger who is able to transport her three years into the future to see how it would all turn out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uyaCUEil9nBQmnCtt5zGcmztLXB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:363486'),
  ('448144924849244010', 'Just Kids', 2020, 'Drama', 'Christophe Blanc, Noé Bach', 'Christophe Blanc, Béryl Peillard', 'Kacey Mottet Klein, Andrea Maggiulli, Anamaria Vartolomei, Angelina Woreth, Yves Caumon, Ahmed Abdel Laoui, Pierre Vial, Lou Lambrecht', null, 'Jack, 19, Lisa, 17, and Mathis, 10, abruptly become orphans. Each sibling reacts differently to the family tragedy: Lisa spreads her wings. Jack, having just become of age is appointed as his brother’s guardian by court decision. A new life begins. But how does someone just barely out of adolescence himself become responsible for a child? And how does one construct a future when the past has become a dangerous obsession? Fortunately, youth’s strength and energy can work miracles…', 'Jack, 19, Lisa, 17, and Mathis, 10, abruptly become orphans. Each sibling reacts differently to the family tragedy: Lisa spreads her wings. Jack, having just become of age is appointed as his brother’s guardian by court decision. A new life begins. But how does someone just barely out of adolescence himself become responsible for a child? And how does one construct a future when the past has become a dangerous obsession? Fortunately, youth’s strength and energy can work miracles…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cE189KpcXo3AWvFsUzlFoh1iooZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:706568'),
  ('926762791165056794', 'Just Like a Woman', 1992, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Christopher Monger, Alan Hume', 'Nick Evans', 'Julie Walters, Adrian Pasdar, Paul Freeman, Susan Wooldridge, Gordon Kennedy, Ian Redford, Shelley Thompson, Togo Igawa', null, 'Gerald is a smart, young, high-flying American banker. Everything is great until his wife finds another woman''s underwear in their bedroom and subsequently throws him out. He finds lodgings with Monica, a recently divorced 50-year old housewife, who is smitten with Gerald. But after their first night of love, Gerald avoids her. Monica feels used and betrayed until Gerald confesses he likes to dress up as a woman. Monica learns to accept and eventually support Geraldine, Gerald''s alter ego.', 'Gerald is a smart, young, high-flying American banker. Everything is great until his wife finds another woman''s underwear in their bedroom and subsequently throws him out. He finds lodgings with Monica, a recently divorced 50-year old housewife, who is smitten with Gerald. But after their first night of love, Gerald avoids her. Monica feels used and betrayed until Gerald confesses he likes to dress up as a woman. Monica learns to accept and eventually support Geraldine, Gerald''s alter ego.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ulPjRRW76SDGSYdmMGfUOxHJ5W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161780'),
  ('53581146213130610', 'Just Like a Woman', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Amro Hamzawi, Antoinette Boulat, Léo Hinstin', 'Amro Hamzawi', 'Nora Hamzawi, André Marcon, Julia Faure, Dominique Reymond, Arthur Igual, Thomas Scimeca, Violaine Gillibert, Joséphine de la Baume', null, 'Éléonore Berthier, 34 years old, keeps living as a teenager, collecting odd jobs and one night stands. Following a burnout, her mother and sister decide to take action to help her make a fresh start.', 'Éléonore Berthier, 34 years old, keeps living as a teenager, collecting odd jobs and one night stands. Following a burnout, her mother and sister decide to take action to help her make a fresh start.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/OhjGJoYf8RUpjCitgkqaZpQSPk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:547523'),
  ('186808729244655441', 'Just Like Brothers', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Nicolas Massart, Hugo Gélin', 'Hugo Gélin, Hervé Mimran, Romain Protat', 'François-Xavier Demaison, Nicolas Duvauchelle, Pierre Niney, Mélanie Thierry, Florence Thomassin, Cécile Cassel, Micheline Presle, Philippe Laudenbach', null, 'Since Charlie is no longer there, the lives of Boris, Elie, and Maxime have been torn apart. These three men, who have nothing in common, all shared one thing: their love for Charlie. One loved her like a sister, one loved her like the woman of his dreams, one loved her like a friend. Except that Charlie is dead and none of them - not Boris, an accomplished businessman, not Elie, a night owl scriptwriter, and not Maxime, still living at home with his mother - know how to deal with it. But because she asked them to do so, they abruptly decide to undertake a journey together, heading for Corsica and the house that Charlie loved so much. Except that here they are stuck in a car together for over 500 miles. It''s going to be a long journey. Boris, Elie and Maxime, three men, three generations, no affinity. But by the time they arrive at their destination, they will have realized one majorly important thing: Charlie has changed their lives forever.', 'Since Charlie is no longer there, the lives of Boris, Elie, and Maxime have been torn apart. These three men, who have nothing in common, all shared one thing: their love for Charlie. One loved her like a sister, one loved her like the woman of his dreams, one loved her like a friend. Except that Charlie is dead and none of them - not Boris, an accomplished businessman, not Elie, a night owl scriptwriter, and not Maxime, still living at home with his mother - know how to deal with it. But because she asked them to do so, they abruptly decide to undertake a journey together, heading for Corsica and the house that Charlie loved so much. Except that here they are stuck in a car together for over 500 miles. It''s going to be a long journey. Boris, Elie and Maxime, three men, three generations, no affinity. But by the time they arrive at their destination, they will have realized one majorly important thing: Charlie has changed their lives forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/faimmushRwen8519t2vBBAWjrUr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143567'),
  ('1106253531907940643', 'Just Like Dad', 1995, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Blair Treu, Brian Sullivan', 'Wayne Allan Rice', 'Wallace Shawn, Ben Diskin, Nick Cassavetes, Frank Gerrish, Jarrett Lennon, Laura Innes, Michael Tucci, George Fisher', null, 'Embarrassed because he perceives his father as dull, a creative boy invents himself a new, more exciting one and finds the popularity he craves.', 'Embarrassed because he perceives his father as dull, a creative boy invents himself a new, more exciting one and finds the popularity he craves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xQZMuVIBHdWYikL9h7WFhkjigwp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107947'),
  ('50154418663909310', 'Just Like Heaven', 2005, 'Comedy, Romance, Fantasy', 'Daryn Okada, Mark Waters, Benjamin Rosenberg', 'Leslie Dixon, Peter Tolan', 'Reese Witherspoon, Mark Ruffalo, Donal Logue, Dina Spybey-Waters, Ben Shenkman, Jon Heder, Ivana Miličević, Caroline Aaron', 'PG-13', 'Shortly after David Abbott moves into his new San Francisco digs, he has an unwelcome visitor on his hands: winsome Elizabeth Masterson, who asserts that the apartment is hers -- and promptly vanishes. When she starts appearing and disappearing at will, David thinks she''s a ghost, while Elizabeth is convinced she''s alive.', 'Shortly after David Abbott moves into his new San Francisco digs, he has an unwelcome visitor on his hands: winsome Elizabeth Masterson, who asserts that the apartment is hers -- and promptly vanishes. When she starts appearing and disappearing at will, David thinks she''s a ghost, while Elizabeth is convinced she''s alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2cLbyVNhEEaUJGg7rfbLtX6454I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9007'),
  ('319561265707467628', 'Just Like Me', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Diego Kaplan, Martin Bustos, Mariana Cavagnaro Rouge', 'Juan Vera, Daniel Cúparo', 'Adrián Suar, Florencia Bertotti, Claudia Fontán, Gabriel Chame Buendía, Ana María Castel, Juan Carlos Galván, Andrés Ciavaglia, Andrea Goldberg', null, 'Refused to face his adulthood, a Casanova must deal with the fact that he has a young pregnant daughter from an earlier relationship.', 'Refused to face his adulthood, a Casanova must deal with the fact that he has a young pregnant daughter from an earlier relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sewd9NqQjMFaLXy6jYf3JSap5QZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49073'),
  ('928726078014562229', 'Just Like Our Parents', 2017, 'Drama', 'Laís Bodanzky, Pedro J. Márquez', 'Laís Bodanzky, Luiz Bolognesi', 'Maria Ribeiro, Paulo Vilhena, Clarisse Abujamra, Felipe Rocha, Sophia Valverde, Annalara Prates, Jorge Mautner, Herson Capri', null, 'Rosa is in her late 30s, a child of the 1970s with divorced parents. She lives with her own family in São Paulo. Overwhelmed by an eruption of individual passions, lies and the expectations of three generations, she tries to discover who she really is.', 'Rosa is in her late 30s, a child of the 1970s with divorced parents. She lives with her own family in São Paulo. Overwhelmed by an eruption of individual passions, lies and the expectations of three generations, she tries to discover who she really is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lU9VOndlXf4Dqu9FVpp8ubmizl2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:439066'),
  ('988841113579013191', 'Just Looking', 1999, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Jason Alexander, Fred Schuler', 'Marshall Karp', 'Ryan Merriman, Gretchen Mol, Patti LuPone, Peter Onorati, Richard V. Licata, Joey Franquinha, Amy Braverman, Ilana Levine', 'R', 'It''s 1955. Lenny is a 14-year old boy who is totally fascinated by sex. He is too scared to "do it," so he dedicates his summer to seeing two other people do it. Easier said than done. Caught in the act of spying, his mother and stepfather ship him off to spend the summer with his aunt and uncle in "the country" -- Queens. His plan looks like a bust and his summer seems destined for boredom, until he meets a whole new group of friends -- young teens who have a "sex club."', 'It''s 1955. Lenny is a 14-year old boy who is totally fascinated by sex. He is too scared to "do it," so he dedicates his summer to seeing two other people do it. Easier said than done. Caught in the act of spying, his mother and stepfather ship him off to spend the summer with his aunt and uncle in "the country" -- Queens. His plan looks like a bust and his summer seems destined for boredom, until he meets a whole new group of friends -- young teens who have a "sex club."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mNCDnjP2pMCH1PLKE3l6eXyDVUK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100975'),
  ('1073813816032183408', 'Just Love and a Thousand Songs', 2022, 'Music, Documentary', 'Diego Peskins', null, 'TINI, Jorge Blanco, Mercedes Lambre, Candelaria Molfese', 'PG', 'On the 10th anniversary of Violetta’s release, Tini gets together with her former castmates to celebrate, giving her fans an intimate, unique, and unforgettable show. Tini, Jorge Blanco, Candelaria Molfese, and Mercedes Lambre gave the audience a night to remember with their new versions of five of the show’s songs.', 'On the 10th anniversary of Violetta’s release, Tini gets together with her former castmates to celebrate, giving her fans an intimate, unique, and unforgettable show. Tini, Jorge Blanco, Candelaria Molfese, and Mercedes Lambre gave the audience a night to remember with their new versions of five of the show’s songs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4BnFvDXO7UVXhxTCUvhf7R3UirK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1050040'),
  ('1049672745073185780', 'Just Love Me', 2006, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Ryszard Zatorski, Tomasz Dobrowolski', 'Ryszard Zatorski', 'Maciej Zakościelny, Agnieszka Grochowska, Agnieszka Dygant, Julia Wróblewska, Grażyna Szapołowska, Tomasz Karolak, Jan Frycz, Przemysław Sadowski', null, 'Modern-day Warsaw shines in this romantic comedy about the love life of a young, hip architect. In his break-out role, popular Polish television star Maciej Zakoscielny plays the handsome young professional, who is torn between two women.', 'Modern-day Warsaw shines in this romantic comedy about the love life of a young, hip architect. In his break-out role, popular Polish television star Maciej Zakoscielny plays the handsome young professional, who is torn between two women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h5Xf57bKSYo4aEfsNQ5a3qbeIex.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81312'),
  ('671232585036373411', 'Just Married', 2003, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Shawn Levy, Jonathan Brown, Marty Eli Schwartz', 'Sam Harper', 'Ashton Kutcher, Brittany Murphy, Christian Kane, David Moscow, Monet Mazur, David Rasche, Thad Luckinbill, David Agranov', 'PG-13', 'Although Tom Leezak and Sarah McNerney come from different worlds, they are both unexpectedly swept off their feet after their first meeting. They quickly fall in love and plan to get married, despite opposition from Sarah''s uptight, rich family. After their wedding, the happy couple sets off - with the highest of hopes and ideals about love and marriage - on what they expect will be the perfect honeymoon in Italy. Thanks to a relentless string of bad luck with one disaster after another, and an impromptu visit from Sarah''s wealthy one-time ex-lover Peter Prentiss, the newlyweds experience the honeymoon from hell that tests the limits of their young love. Is it worth throwing away their love and marriage?', 'Although Tom Leezak and Sarah McNerney come from different worlds, they are both unexpectedly swept off their feet after their first meeting. They quickly fall in love and plan to get married, despite opposition from Sarah''s uptight, rich family. After their wedding, the happy couple sets off - with the highest of hopes and ideals about love and marriage - on what they expect will be the perfect honeymoon in Italy. Thanks to a relentless string of bad luck with one disaster after another, and an impromptu visit from Sarah''s wealthy one-time ex-lover Peter Prentiss, the newlyweds experience the honeymoon from hell that tests the limits of their young love. Is it worth throwing away their love and marriage?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/FRqnYDjbstsCgLSJJ3SifOh2ca.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12090'),
  ('370331916735649492', 'Just Married', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Luca Lucini', 'Fausto Brizzi, Fabio Bonifacci, Marco Martani', 'Luca Argentero, Dario Bandiera, Isabella Ragonese, Moran Atias, Carolina Crescentini, Filippo Nigro, Francesco Montanari, Gabriella Pession', null, 'Nicola, a policeman in Puglia, is a reformed ladies'' man with his heart set on marrying the daughter of the Indian ambassador.', 'Nicola, a policeman in Puglia, is a reformed ladies'' man with his heart set on marrying the daughter of the Indian ambassador.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qUQDJhNsX59Zo6f56xOB8oIaC0u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47355'),
  ('320448915992995143', 'Just My Luck', 1957, 'Comedy', 'John Paddy Carstairs', 'Alfred Shaughnessy, Peter Blackmore', 'Norman Wisdom, Margaret Rutherford, Jill Dixon, Leslie Phillips, Delphi Lawrence, Joan Sims, Edward Chapman, Peter Copley', null, 'Norman works in a jewellers workshop and fantasises (in the nicest way) about meeting the window dresser across the road from his workshop. He wants to buy her a diamond pendant but calculates it will take him over 100 years to save up for it. He is talked into betting a pound on a six horse accumulator at the Goodwood races with a slightly shady bookmaker. When he has won on the first five races, the bookie owes him over 16,000 pounds and everyone begins to worry. Everyone''s future depends on a single race ... what can be done ?', 'Norman works in a jewellers workshop and fantasises (in the nicest way) about meeting the window dresser across the road from his workshop. He wants to buy her a diamond pendant but calculates it will take him over 100 years to save up for it. He is talked into betting a pound on a six horse accumulator at the Goodwood races with a slightly shady bookmaker. When he has won on the first five races, the bookie owes him over 16,000 pounds and everyone begins to worry. Everyone''s future depends on a single race ... what can be done ?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/slgLcCHfNa7JEqgMFEpqaceUfJC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38381'),
  ('707206499389370068', 'Just My Luck', 2006, 'Comedy, Drama, Family, Fantasy, Romance', 'Dean Semler, Donald Petrie, Daniel Pearl', 'Amy Harris, I. Marlene King', 'Lindsay Lohan, Chris Pine, Samaire Armstrong, Bree Turner, Faizon Love, Missi Pyle, Makenzie Vega, Carlos Ponce', 'PG-13', 'Manhattanite Ashley is known to many as the luckiest woman around. After a chance encounter with a down-and-out young man, however, she realizes that she''s swapped her fortune for his.', 'Manhattanite Ashley is known to many as the luckiest woman around. After a chance encounter with a down-and-out young man, however, she realizes that she''s swapped her fortune for his.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wWpqG3zrrPZhvNLflYJdbW1NgY3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10025'),
  ('472528572605389830', 'Just My Type', 2020, 'Romance, Drama, TV Movie', 'Ron Stannett, Mellanie Siteman, Scooby Vincent', 'Steven Sessions', 'Bethany Joy Lenz, Brett Dalton, Michele Scarabelli, Nicole Major, Rebecca Olson, Link Baker, Colleen Wheeler, Fred Keating', null, 'Pop culture writer and aspiring novelist Vanessa Sills lands the interview of a lifetime with the illustrious, elusive and reclusive mystery author Martin Clayborne in his quaint rural town only to realize her own aspirations, dreams and romantic life have taken a back seat along the way. When Vanessa returns home to Portland and a mysterious gift arrives from Martin, she then makes a surprise decision, and finally takes her own advice to “go boldly in the direction of your dreams and live the life you imagine.”', 'Pop culture writer and aspiring novelist Vanessa Sills lands the interview of a lifetime with the illustrious, elusive and reclusive mystery author Martin Clayborne in his quaint rural town only to realize her own aspirations, dreams and romantic life have taken a back seat along the way. When Vanessa returns home to Portland and a mysterious gift arrives from Martin, she then makes a surprise decision, and finally takes her own advice to “go boldly in the direction of your dreams and live the life you imagine.”', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/93cw0Sin2TxjOColXn0YeuFeaGQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:676619'),
  ('357444128631561562', 'Just One Kiss', 2022, 'Romance, Comedy, TV Movie, Drama', 'Jeff Beesley, Adam Sliwinski, Paula Antil', 'Davide Reali, Diane Robin', 'Krysta Rodriguez, Santino Fontana, Illeana Douglas, Aida Turturro, Ava Grace Cooper, Alice Rose, Matty Finochio, Edward Ruttle', 'G', 'Through a series of chance encounters, sparks fly between college literature professor Mia and Tony, a headliner at a Manhattan supper club. Unbeknownst to them, Mia’s mother, Marlene, and Tony’s mother, Sofia, are working some maternal matchmaking magic.', 'Through a series of chance encounters, sparks fly between college literature professor Mia and Tony, a headliner at a Manhattan supper club. Unbeknownst to them, Mia’s mother, Marlene, and Tony’s mother, Sofia, are working some maternal matchmaking magic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Ox38838jryMO3yNrNlrN5n27ND.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:944941'),
  ('512217692292428520', 'Just One of the Girls', 1993, 'Comedy', 'Tobias A. Schliessler, Michael Keusch, Sheila Carpenter', 'Raul Fernandez', 'Corey Haim, Nicole Eggert, Cameron Bancroft, Gabe Khouth, Kevin McNulty, Wendy Van Riesen, Johannah Newmarch, Lochlyn Munro', 'R', 'To save himself from the biggest bully in school, Chris Calder has to dress himself up like a girl to avoid Curt. When the disguise works, he is forced to stay a girl - with disastrous results. Curt falls for the new girl in school while Chris falls for the bully''s sister, a beautiful blonde cheerleader. High school is hard enough without worrying if your wig is on straight. Chris soon find out he can''t hid in his sister''s skirts. But is he man enough to reveal his secret and fight for the girl he loves?', 'To save himself from the biggest bully in school, Chris Calder has to dress himself up like a girl to avoid Curt. When the disguise works, he is forced to stay a girl - with disastrous results. Curt falls for the new girl in school while Chris falls for the bully''s sister, a beautiful blonde cheerleader. High school is hard enough without worrying if your wig is on straight. Chris soon find out he can''t hid in his sister''s skirts. But is he man enough to reveal his secret and fight for the girl he loves?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hV0x35Ug6L1flMWUUGksQ6RmpOE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27885'),
  ('708175287959613390', 'Just One of the Guys', 1985, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Dennis Capps, Bill Scott, John McPherson', 'Jeff Franklin, Dennis Feldman', 'Joyce Hyser, Clayton Rohner, Billy Jayne, William Zabka, Toni Hudson, Leigh McCloskey, Sherilyn Fenn, Deborah Goodrich', 'PG-13', 'When Terry Griffith loses her high school''s writing competition, she''s convinced that it''s because she''s a girl. So Terry decides to change high schools and pose as a boy to prove her point. Her brother, Buddy, helps her pass as a guy so well that she is soon making friends with the boys at school, including the attractive Rick, who becomes her new best friend. But her gender-swapping makes things difficult when she falls in love with him.', 'When Terry Griffith loses her high school''s writing competition, she''s convinced that it''s because she''s a girl. So Terry decides to change high schools and pose as a boy to prove her point. Her brother, Buddy, helps her pass as a guy so well that she is soon making friends with the boys at school, including the attractive Rick, who becomes her new best friend. But her gender-swapping makes things difficult when she falls in love with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ffvsRv8ueYYK0H3zocmNRPd8yN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24548'),
  ('909371914714309740', 'Just One Small Favor', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Juana Macías', 'Cristóbal Garrido, Adolfo Valor', 'Alfonso Bassave, Inma Cuesta, Gonzalo de Castro, Diego Martín, Sara Sálamo, Pere Ponce, Isabel Ordaz, Luisa Gavasa', null, 'The Gallardos are a rich, well-respected family, who spend their summers in a beautiful country house, which is taken meticulous care of by Amparito. Dearly loved by the family’s three children, Teresa, Benja and Aura, Amparito, known to them as Nanny, has been like a second mother to them. When they receive the sad news of her death, the three siblings travel to the village to say their last goodbyes and see Tomás, the deceased’s only son. What they weren’t expecting is that Amparito’s dying wish was to be buried in the family cemetery. The Gallardos are clear: there’s no way! After refusing to do this favor, they receive an inheritance from Amparito... Some letters in which, far from giving them a sweet goodbye, she gets even, revealing skeletons in closets and hurtful truths that will turn their lives upside down. What the hell was Nanny thinking?', 'The Gallardos are a rich, well-respected family, who spend their summers in a beautiful country house, which is taken meticulous care of by Amparito. Dearly loved by the family’s three children, Teresa, Benja and Aura, Amparito, known to them as Nanny, has been like a second mother to them. When they receive the sad news of her death, the three siblings travel to the village to say their last goodbyes and see Tomás, the deceased’s only son. What they weren’t expecting is that Amparito’s dying wish was to be buried in the family cemetery. The Gallardos are clear: there’s no way! After refusing to do this favor, they receive an inheritance from Amparito... Some letters in which, far from giving them a sweet goodbye, she gets even, revealing skeletons in closets and hurtful truths that will turn their lives upside down. What the hell was Nanny thinking?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aACYVeSjpePT2QnhU8cHlMxz524.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1089979'),
  ('676668932739132842', 'Just One Time', 1998, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Lane Janger, Timothy Naylor, Jeffrey Roth', 'Lane Janger', 'Guillermo Díaz, Jennifer Esposito, Joelle Carter, Lane Janger', null, 'A man wants his girlfriend to have a sexual relationship with another girl, just one time.', 'A man wants his girlfriend to have a sexual relationship with another girl, just one time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gfaEc9wVy4GmPXGHauKKQfkX7Ap.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:518054'),
  ('1145093560856160038', 'Just One Time', 1999, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Lane Janger, Michael St. Hilaire', 'Lane Janger, Jennifer Vandever', 'Lane Janger, Joelle Carter, Guillermo Díaz, Jennifer Esposito, David Lee Russek, Vincent Laresca, Domenick Lombardozzi, Lázaro Pérez', 'R', 'When the fiancé of a fireman reluctantly agrees to participate in a ménage à trois with another woman, she does so on the condition that he reciprocate the favor with another man, which ultimately puts their impending marriage in jeopardy.', 'When the fiancé of a fireman reluctantly agrees to participate in a ménage à trois with another woman, she does so on the condition that he reciprocate the favor with another man, which ultimately puts their impending marriage in jeopardy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cAdV1mRjpkrqp8Y72iRH3khJQZH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49267'),
