  ('672637008475193580', 'Just Pals', 1920, 'Drama, Western', 'John Ford, George Schneiderman', 'Paul Schofield', 'Buck Jones, Helen Ferguson, George Stone, Duke R. Lee, William Buckley, Eunice Murdock Moore, Bert Appling, Edwin B. Tilton', null, 'Bim seems to be his town''s biggest loser, but when he takes a needy 13-year-old boy named Bill under his wing, it seems there may be some hope for Bim. After learning about Bill, a young teacher, Mary, whom Bim secretly adores, helps get the young boy into school. And when Bim then helps Mary repay a loan, defaulted on by shifty boyfriend, it becomes evident that Bim can reform. As the plot in this captivating film twist and turns, the stakes get higher, the action gets more intense and hope for Bim bounds upward.', 'Bim seems to be his town''s biggest loser, but when he takes a needy 13-year-old boy named Bill under his wing, it seems there may be some hope for Bim. After learning about Bill, a young teacher, Mary, whom Bim secretly adores, helps get the young boy into school. And when Bim then helps Mary repay a loan, defaulted on by shifty boyfriend, it becomes evident that Bim can reform. As the plot in this captivating film twist and turns, the stakes get higher, the action gets more intense and hope for Bim bounds upward.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wLsYC7mF2Kist6vEHjSs5QPdm4w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111747'),
  ('42672682623076736', 'Just Past Noon on a Tuesday', 2018, 'Drama, Romance', 'Matheus da Rocha Pereira, Travis Mathews', 'Travis Mathews', 'Gustavo Vinagre, Ronaldo Serruya, Lavínia Pannunzio, João Federici, Marco Donini', 'NR', 'Two strangers visit the penthouse of a recently deceased lover, only to find themselves learning more about each other.', 'Two strangers visit the penthouse of a recently deceased lover, only to find themselves learning more about each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qhUpI8FiLIB3WKyn209QiUEDUvw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:487939'),
