  ('541245227268700175', 'Just the Three of Us', 2019, 'Comedy', 'José Alcala, Philippe Guilbert', 'Jose Alcala, Agnès Caffin, Antoine Lacomblez', 'Daniel Auteuil, Catherine Frot, Bernard Le Coq, Solam Dejean-Lacréole, Vanessa Paric, Diouc Koma, India Hair, Olivier Loustau', null, 'Gilbert and Simone live a restless retreat in a village in the South of France. The departure of Étienne, her neighbor and lover, the lack of money, but especially the constant bitterness of her husband, push Simone to flee the home. Gilbert then realizes that he is ready to do anything to find his wife, his love.', 'Gilbert and Simone live a restless retreat in a village in the South of France. The departure of Étienne, her neighbor and lover, the lack of money, but especially the constant bitterness of her husband, push Simone to flee the home. Gilbert then realizes that he is ready to do anything to find his wife, his love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hXhA5QW73eX1X4zQQOYMOAqgNe2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:575600'),
  ('1095846381837585081', 'Just The Three of Us', 2010, 'Action, Thriller, Romance', 'Renaud Bertrand, Yves Cape', 'Virginie Chanu, Renaud Bertrand', 'Nathan Georgelin, Jacques Gamblin, Emmanuelle Béart, Stefano Accorsi, Audrey Dana, Sacha Briquet, Pierre Bertre, Hervé Sogne', null, '1970s, six-and-a-half-year-old Sébastien is a sensitive, highly imaginative child. Despite the affection he feels for his father, a dreamy inventor, he notices his mother''s loneliness and how there is a lack of love in her life. When they move the house, it won''t be long before he sees in Philippe, his new neighbor, an ideal Prince Charming for his mother.', '1970s, six-and-a-half-year-old Sébastien is a sensitive, highly imaginative child. Despite the affection he feels for his father, a dreamy inventor, he notices his mother''s loneliness and how there is a lack of love in her life. When they move the house, it won''t be long before he sees in Philippe, his new neighbor, an ideal Prince Charming for his mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Wnd9W2WGfkyZKGmCUY0y64t3jb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41150'),
  ('67860938291262396', 'Just the Ticket', 1998, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Richard Wenk, Ellen Kuras, Robert E. Warren', 'Richard Wenk', 'Andy Garcia, Andie MacDowell, Richard Bradford, Alice Drummond, Fred Asparagus, Louis Mustillo, Anita Elliott, Patrick Breen', 'R', 'Gary Starke is one of the best ticket scalpers in New York City. His girlfriend, Linda, doesn''t approve of his criminal lifestyle, though, and dumps him when she gets the opportunity to study cooking in Paris. Gary realizes that he has to give up scalping if he has any chance of winning her back. But before he does, he wants to cash out on one last big score. He gets his chance when the pope announces he''ll be performing Easter Mass at Yankee Stadium.', 'Gary Starke is one of the best ticket scalpers in New York City. His girlfriend, Linda, doesn''t approve of his criminal lifestyle, though, and dumps him when she gets the opportunity to study cooking in Paris. Gary realizes that he has to give up scalping if he has any chance of winning her back. But before he does, he wants to cash out on one last big score. He gets his chance when the pope announces he''ll be performing Easter Mass at Yankee Stadium.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5vsjad22y8jbjWwENUhF5T3O1RB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26425'),
  ('631987533922413914', 'Just the Two of Us', 2023, 'Thriller, Drama, Romance', 'Valérie Donzelli, Laurent Tangy, Anouk Barrere', 'Valérie Donzelli, Audrey Diwan', 'Virginie Efira, Melvil Poupaud, Dominique Reymond, Romane Bohringer, Virginie Ledoyen, Marie Rivière, Guang Huo, Laurence Côte', null, 'When Blanche meets Grégoire, she thinks she has found the one. The ties that bind them grow quickly, and a passionate affair ensues. Together, they relocate. For Blanche, far from her family, from her twin sister, Rose, a new life begins. But little by little, she finds herself caught in the grip of a deeply possessive and dangerous man.', 'When Blanche meets Grégoire, she thinks she has found the one. The ties that bind them grow quickly, and a passionate affair ensues. Together, they relocate. For Blanche, far from her family, from her twin sister, Rose, a new life begins. But little by little, she finds herself caught in the grip of a deeply possessive and dangerous man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bMYUYy5rR08Zh3pAmmWMH2gsrZV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:989672'),
  ('635030586813191521', 'Just the Way You Are', 1984, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Édouard Molinaro, Claude Lecomte', 'Allan Burns', 'Kristy McNichol, Michael Ontkean, Kaki Hunter, André Dussollier, Catherine Salviat, Robert Carradine, Alexandra Paul, Lance Guest', 'PG', 'Despite her success as a professional flute player and the constant attention of men around her, Susan Berlanger feels insecure because of her lame right leg. During a European tour, she decides to cover her leg with a cast to see how people will react to her as a nondisabled person.', 'Despite her success as a professional flute player and the constant attention of men around her, Susan Berlanger feels insecure because of her lame right leg. During a European tour, she decides to cover her leg with a cast to see how people will react to her as a nondisabled person.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uZ6Hk9E0sTqzyE31ISiPQLsM6YJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75597'),
  ('59331012301622664', 'Just to Be Sure', 2017, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Pierre Cottereau, Carine Tardieu', 'Raphaële Moussafir, Michel Leclerc, Carine Tardieu', 'François Damiens, Cécile de France, Alice de Lencquesaing, André Wilms, Guy Marchand, Estéban, Perrette Souplex, Aylin Mikaelian', null, 'Erwan, a strapping Breton who clears mines for a living, is shaken when he discovers that his father is not his father. Despite his affection for the man who raised him, he quietly sets out to find his biological father, and succeeds in locating Joseph, an endearing old codger he takes a liking to. Just when things look settled, another unexpected “bomb” hits Erwan in the form of Anna, an elusive nymph.', 'Erwan, a strapping Breton who clears mines for a living, is shaken when he discovers that his father is not his father. Despite his affection for the man who raised him, he quietly sets out to find his biological father, and succeeds in locating Joseph, an endearing old codger he takes a liking to. Just when things look settled, another unexpected “bomb” hits Erwan in the form of Anna, an elusive nymph.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xlnf99tJK93J1G9LlihOxdnWJoZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:418970'),
  ('7967370764462252', 'Just Visiting', 2001, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Jean-Marie Poiré, Ueli Steiger, David R. Ellis', 'Christian Clavier, Jean-Marie Poiré, John Hughes', 'Jean Reno, Christian Clavier, Christina Applegate, Matt Ross, Tara Reid, Bridgette Wilson-Sampras, John Aylward, Malcolm McDowell', 'PG', 'A knight and his valet are plagued by a witch, and to repair the damage they make use of the services of a wizard. However, something goes wrong and they are transported from the 12th century to the year 2000. There the knight meets some of his family and slowly learns what this new century is like. However, he still needs to get back to the 12th century to deal with the witch, so he starts looking for a wizard. Remake of 1993 French film Les Visiteurs (The Visitors).', 'A knight and his valet are plagued by a witch, and to repair the damage they make use of the services of a wizard. However, something goes wrong and they are transported from the 12th century to the year 2000. There the knight meets some of his family and slowly learns what this new century is like. However, he still needs to get back to the 12th century to deal with the witch, so he starts looking for a wizard. Remake of 1993 French film Les Visiteurs (The Visitors).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7KqzbefXjADSUE8j2ZsrudvAArY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56715'),
