  ('622882205450768751', 'Justice', 2004, 'Documentary', 'Maria Ramos, Paola Vieira, Flávio Zangrandi', 'Maria Ramos', 'Fátima Maria Clemente, Carlos Eduardo Rocha, Maria Ignez Kato, Elma Lusitano, Geraldo Luiz Mascarenhas Prado', null, 'In Justiça, Maria Ramos puts a camera where many Brazilians have never been – a criminal courtroom in Rio de Janeiro, following the daily routine of several characters. There are those that work there every day (public attorneys, judges, and prosecutors) and those that are merely passing through (the accused).', 'In Justiça, Maria Ramos puts a camera where many Brazilians have never been – a criminal courtroom in Rio de Janeiro, following the daily routine of several characters. There are those that work there every day (public attorneys, judges, and prosecutors) and those that are merely passing through (the accused).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mSx0KORbnavSku7dHyhNmEBfcIT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:228398'),
  ('931179030177335685', 'Justice', 2024, 'Crime', 'Michał Gazda, Tomasz Augustynek, Piotr Bagiński', 'Bartosz Staszczyszyn', 'Olaf Lubaszenko, Jędrzej Hycnar, Wiktoria Gorodecka, Magdalena Boczarska, Łukasz Szczepanowski, Stanisław Linowski, Nel Kaczmarek, Dariusz Toczek', 'R', 'A young detective seeks the help of a discharged police officer, giving him the chance to reclaim his old life in exchange for solving a bank raid case.', 'A young detective seeks the help of a discharged police officer, giving him the chance to reclaim his old life in exchange for solving a bank raid case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zrzKoiLUdKuKqtYOKS2orLRoUhv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1282138'),
  ('397955457198516080', 'Justice for Jeni', 2026, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Santhosh Ryan, Veeramani', 'Santhosh Ryan', 'Ashika Ashokan, Sandhra Anil, Sinan', null, 'Best friends and med students Jeni and Priyanka share big dreams until Jeni''s tragic rape and death. Grief-stricken Priya seeks justice, growing disillusioned with the system as she pursues legal action.', 'Best friends and med students Jeni and Priyanka share big dreams until Jeni''s tragic rape and death. Grief-stricken Priya seeks justice, growing disillusioned with the system as she pursues legal action.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FlxNJzRszqYgRSdWlyyXUJD0RHm4.jpg', 'plex:movie:justice-for-jeni'),
  ('216065587367840215', 'Justice High', 2020, 'Action, Comedy', 'Jang Il-ji, Johnny Chae', 'Johnny Chae, Lim Young-joon', 'Jeong Da-eun, Oh Seung-hoon, Son Woo-hyeon, Yoo Hyun-jong, Jung Eui-wook, Kim Tae-yoon, Kang Jeong-won', null, 'Today is righteous Chae-young’s first day of her transferred school after beaten a bully to nothing. Despite the dad’s warning, she saves her classmate Jong-gu from bullies again. Fascinated by her, Jong-gu asks how to be strong like her.', 'Today is righteous Chae-young’s first day of her transferred school after beaten a bully to nothing. Despite the dad’s warning, she saves her classmate Jong-gu from bullies again. Fascinated by her, Jong-gu asks how to be strong like her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lvOrm1XqWNJl1VL8bWxzTxPhqu3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:602305'),
  ('985953952604742829', 'Justice Is Done', 1950, 'Drama, Mystery', 'André Cayatte, Jean Bourgoin', 'André Cayatte, Charles Spaak', 'Michel Auclair, Antoine Balpêtré, Raymond Bussières, Jacques Castelot, Jean Debucourt, Noël Roquevert, Valentine Tessier, Claude Nollier', null, 'Elsa Lundenstein is accused of having murdered her lover. The jury discusses the case vividly. All members are somehow prejudiced because of personal life experience and subsequently each member reads something different into the presented facts.', 'Elsa Lundenstein is accused of having murdered her lover. The jury discusses the case vividly. All members are somehow prejudiced because of personal life experience and subsequently each member reads something different into the presented facts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nC0OX6oJeZN5vOzv4VoDvU9xiBe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67731'),
  ('552160877809905146', 'Justice League', 2017, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Fabian Wagner, Zack Snyder, Christian Huband', 'Chris Terrio, Joss Whedon', 'Ben Affleck, Henry Cavill, Amy Adams, Gal Gadot, Ezra Miller, Jason Momoa, Ray Fisher, Jeremy Irons', 'PG-13', 'Fuelled by his restored faith in humanity and inspired by Superman''s selfless act, Bruce Wayne and Diana Prince assemble a team of metahumans consisting of Barry Allen, Arthur Curry and Victor Stone to face the catastrophic threat of Steppenwolf and the Parademons who are on the hunt for three Mother Boxes on Earth.', 'Fuelled by his restored faith in humanity and inspired by Superman''s selfless act, Bruce Wayne and Diana Prince assemble a team of metahumans consisting of Barry Allen, Arthur Curry and Victor Stone to face the catastrophic threat of Steppenwolf and the Parademons who are on the hunt for three Mother Boxes on Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eifGNCSDuxJeS1loAXil5bIGgvC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:141052'),
  ('857551025909005639', 'Justice League Dark', 2017, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, Fantasy, Science Fiction, Horror', 'Jay Oliva', null, 'Matt Ryan, Jason O''Mara, Camilla Luddington, Nicholas Turturro, Rosario Dawson, Jerry O''Connell, Alfred Molina, Roger Cross', 'R', 'When innocent civilians begin committing unthinkable crimes across Metropolis, Gotham City and beyond, Batman must call upon mystical counterparts to eradicate this demonic threat to the planet; enter Justice League Dark. This team of Dark Arts specialists must unravel the mystery of Earth''s supernatural plague and contend with the rising, powerful villainous forces behind the siege—before it''s too late for all of mankind.', 'When innocent civilians begin committing unthinkable crimes across Metropolis, Gotham City and beyond, Batman must call upon mystical counterparts to eradicate this demonic threat to the planet; enter Justice League Dark. This team of Dark Arts specialists must unravel the mystery of Earth''s supernatural plague and contend with the rising, powerful villainous forces behind the siege—before it''s too late for all of mankind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gWcTaDFXDrOAPfVzfBFz0Aya5BE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:408220'),
  ('699976110459161801', 'Justice League of America', 1997, 'Fantasy, Action, Adventure, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Félix Alcalá, Barry M. Wilson', 'Lorne Cameron, David Hoselton, Scott Shepherd', 'Matthew Settle, Kimberly Oja, John Kassir, Michelle Hurd, Kenny Johnston, David Krumholtz, Elisa Donovan, Ron Pearson', null, 'The evil Weather Man is intent on destroying New Metro City with a series of malevolent meteorological mishaps. Can the super-powered (and semi-employed) Justice League of America save the day? Or will New Metro be drowned in a humongous tidal wave?', 'The evil Weather Man is intent on destroying New Metro City with a series of malevolent meteorological mishaps. Can the super-powered (and semi-employed) Justice League of America save the day? Or will New Metro be drowned in a humongous tidal wave?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Bd04JTvYC5UPrgvEkeThst3jG6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69336'),
  ('557462662617769566', 'Justice League vs. Teen Titans', 2016, 'Science Fiction, Action, Animation', 'Sam Liu', 'Alan Burnett, Bryan Q. Miller', 'Stuart Allan, Taissa Farmiga, Jason O''Mara, Rosario Dawson, Jerry O''Connell, Jon Bernthal, Sean Maher, Kari Wahlgren', 'PG-13', 'Robin is sent by Batman to work with the Teen Titans after his volatile behavior botches up a Justice League mission. The Titans must then step up to face Trigon after he possesses the League and threatens to conquer the world.', 'Robin is sent by Batman to work with the Teen Titans after his volatile behavior botches up a Justice League mission. The Titans must then step up to face Trigon after he possesses the League and threatens to conquer the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ctHGhbe19xIX6wlECsFydHiha4W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:379291'),
  ('661434387594259073', 'Justice League vs. the Fatal Five', 2019, 'Animation, Action, Science Fiction, Fantasy', 'Sam Liu, Wes Gleason, Matthew Girardi', null, 'Elyes Gabel, Diane Guerrero, Kevin Conroy, Susan Eisenberg, George Newbern, Daniela Bobadilla, Kevin Michael Richardson, Noel Fisher', 'PG-13', 'The Justice League faces a powerful new threat — the Fatal Five! Superman, Batman and Wonder Woman seek answers as the time-traveling trio of Mano, Persuader and Tharok terrorize Metropolis in search of budding Green Lantern, Jessica Cruz. With her unwilling help, they aim to free remaining Fatal Five members Emerald Empress and Validus to carry out their sinister plan. But the Justice League has also discovered an ally from another time in the peculiar Star Boy — brimming with volatile power, could he be the key to thwarting the Fatal Five? An epic battle against ultimate evil awaits!', 'The Justice League faces a powerful new threat — the Fatal Five! Superman, Batman and Wonder Woman seek answers as the time-traveling trio of Mano, Persuader and Tharok terrorize Metropolis in search of budding Green Lantern, Jessica Cruz. With her unwilling help, they aim to free remaining Fatal Five members Emerald Empress and Validus to carry out their sinister plan. But the Justice League has also discovered an ally from another time in the peculiar Star Boy — brimming with volatile power, could he be the key to thwarting the Fatal Five? An epic battle against ultimate evil awaits!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xXC0HrmyQDXlYTiHP7Tq6nzurDI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:537059'),
  ('1113590052697534350', 'Justice League x RWBY: Super Heroes & Huntsmen, Part One', 2023, 'Animation, Action, Fantasy', 'Kerry Shawcross, Joel Mann', 'Meghan Fitzmartin', 'Natalie Alyn Lind, Chandler Riggs, Nat Wolff, Lindsay Jones, Kara Eberle, Arryn Zech, Barbara Dunkelman, Ozioma Akagha', 'PG', 'Superman, Batman, Wonder Woman, Flash, Cyborg, Green Lantern and Vixen are transported to the strange world of Remnant and find themselves turned into teenagers. Meanwhile, Remnant heroes Ruby, Weiss, Blake and Yang must combine forces with the Justice League to uncover why their planet has been mysteriously altered before a superpowered Grimm destroys everything.', 'Superman, Batman, Wonder Woman, Flash, Cyborg, Green Lantern and Vixen are transported to the strange world of Remnant and find themselves turned into teenagers. Meanwhile, Remnant heroes Ruby, Weiss, Blake and Yang must combine forces with the Justice League to uncover why their planet has been mysteriously altered before a superpowered Grimm destroys everything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lCwLDdFH8oNRzUH0qgucdRGACAJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:997776'),
  ('157653114345323538', 'Justice League x RWBY: Super Heroes & Huntsmen, Part Two', 2023, 'Animation, Action, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Kerry Shawcross', 'Meghan Fitzmartin', 'Troy Baker, Travis Willingham, Laura Bailey, Lindsay Jones, Kara Eberle, Arryn Zech, Barbara Dunkelman, Christopher Sabat', 'PG', 'On the heels of successfully escaping a deadly digital trap, the members of the Justice League emerge in their own world to discover that Grimm, ravenous creatures from Remnant, have overtaken Earth! In order to defeat the monsters, they must call on their new friends – Team RWBY – for help!', 'On the heels of successfully escaping a deadly digital trap, the members of the Justice League emerge in their own world to discover that Grimm, ravenous creatures from Remnant, have overtaken Earth! In order to defeat the monsters, they must call on their new friends – Team RWBY – for help!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o9qmCvnJLCqMuKsrZ0tWvSCEWTz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1150537'),
  ('909758312876041863', 'Justice League: Crisis on Infinite Earths Part One', 2024, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Action', 'Jeff Wamester, Haeyoung Jung, Hanhyung Lee', 'Jim Krieg', 'Matt Bomer, Jensen Ackles, Darren Criss, Meg Donnelly, Stana Katic, Jimmi Simpson, Zachary Quinto, Jonathan Adams', 'PG-13', 'Death is coming. Worse than death: oblivion. Not just for our Earth, but for everyone, everywhere, in every universe! Against this ultimate destruction, the mysterious Monitor has gathered the greatest team of Super Heroes ever assembled. But what can the combined might of Superman, Wonder Woman, Batman, The Flash, Green Lantern and hundreds of Super Heroes from multiple Earths even do to save all of reality from an unstoppable antimatter armageddon?!', 'Death is coming. Worse than death: oblivion. Not just for our Earth, but for everyone, everywhere, in every universe! Against this ultimate destruction, the mysterious Monitor has gathered the greatest team of Super Heroes ever assembled. But what can the combined might of Superman, Wonder Woman, Batman, The Flash, Green Lantern and hundreds of Super Heroes from multiple Earths even do to save all of reality from an unstoppable antimatter armageddon?!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mcRVsjMbhFstRK9z2oGRHiIvulr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1155089'),
  ('295912886797423688', 'Justice League: Crisis on Infinite Earths Part Three', 2024, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Action', 'Jeff Wamester, Mac Whiting', 'Jim Krieg', 'Jensen Ackles, Darren Criss, Corey Stoll, Gideon Adlon, Ike Amadi, Geoffrey Arend, Troy Baker, Brian Bloom', 'PG-13', 'Now fully revealed as the ultimate threat to existence, the Anti-Monitor wages an unrelenting attack on the surviving Earths that struggle for survival in a pocket universe. One by one, these worlds and all their inhabitants are vaporized! On the planets that remain, even time itself is shattered, and heroes from the past join the Justice League and their rag-tag allies against the epitome of evil. But as they make their last stand, will the sacrifice of the superheroes be enough to save us all?', 'Now fully revealed as the ultimate threat to existence, the Anti-Monitor wages an unrelenting attack on the surviving Earths that struggle for survival in a pocket universe. One by one, these worlds and all their inhabitants are vaporized! On the planets that remain, even time itself is shattered, and heroes from the past join the Justice League and their rag-tag allies against the epitome of evil. But as they make their last stand, will the sacrifice of the superheroes be enough to save us all?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a3q8NkM8uTh9E23VsbUOdDSbBeN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1209290'),
  ('44885761822625701', 'Justice League: Crisis on Infinite Earths Part Two', 2024, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Action', 'Jeff Wamester, Mac Whiting', 'Jim Krieg', 'Jensen Ackles, Darren Criss, Meg Donnelly, Stana Katic, Jonathan Adams, Gideon Adlon, Geoffrey Arend, Troy Baker', 'PG-13', 'An endless army of shadow demons bent on the destruction of all reality swarms over our world and all parallel Earths! The only thing opposing them is the mightiest team of metahumans ever assembled. But not even the combined power of Superman, Batman, Wonder Woman, Green Lantern and all their fellow superheroes can slow down the onslaught of this invincible horde. What mysterious force is driving them? And how do the long-buried secrets of the Monitor and Supergirl threaten to crush our last defense?', 'An endless army of shadow demons bent on the destruction of all reality swarms over our world and all parallel Earths! The only thing opposing them is the mightiest team of metahumans ever assembled. But not even the combined power of Superman, Batman, Wonder Woman, Green Lantern and all their fellow superheroes can slow down the onslaught of this invincible horde. What mysterious force is driving them? And how do the long-buried secrets of the Monitor and Supergirl threaten to crush our last defense?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g8ak4QAGLZpqMs3CpnFHWWfIzJQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1209288'),
  ('1084484098632893020', 'Justice League: Crisis on Two Earths', 2010, 'Action, Adventure, Animation, Science Fiction, Fantasy', 'Sam Liu, Lauren Montgomery', 'Dwayne McDuffie', 'William Baldwin, Mark Harmon, Chris Noth, Gina Torres, James Woods, Jonathan Adams, Brian Bloom, Bruce Davison', 'PG-13', 'A heroic version of Lex Luthor from an alternate universe appears to recruit the Justice League to help save his Earth from the Crime Syndicate, an evil version of the League. What ensues is the ultimate battle of good versus evil in a war that threatens both planets and, through a devious plan launched by Batman''s counterpart Owlman, puts the balance of all existence in peril.', 'A heroic version of Lex Luthor from an alternate universe appears to recruit the Justice League to help save his Earth from the Crime Syndicate, an evil version of the League. What ensues is the ultimate battle of good versus evil in a war that threatens both planets and, through a devious plan launched by Batman''s counterpart Owlman, puts the balance of all existence in peril.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Cjrxbv0BIxzgKFC9PYcgmPtnMV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30061'),
  ('293266699747477948', 'Justice League: Doom', 2012, 'Action, Animation, Science Fiction, Fantasy', 'Lauren Montgomery', 'Dwayne McDuffie, Mark Waid', 'Kevin Conroy, Tim Daly, Susan Eisenberg, Michael Rosenbaum, Carl Lumbly, Paul Blackthorne, Bumper Robinson, Phil Morris', 'PG-13', 'An adaptation of Mark Waid''s "Tower of Babel" story from the JLA comic. Vandal Savage steals confidential files Batman has compiled on the members of the Justice League, and learns all their weaknesses.', 'An adaptation of Mark Waid''s "Tower of Babel" story from the JLA comic. Vandal Savage steals confidential files Batman has compiled on the members of the Justice League, and learns all their weaknesses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6IUhwX2fHPBzsKHpygW50a3tkEw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76589'),
  ('915985785258744030', 'Justice League: Gods and Monsters', 2015, 'Action, Animation, Fantasy, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Sam Liu', 'Alan Burnett', 'Benjamin Bratt, Michael C. Hall, Tamara Taylor, Jason Isaacs, C. Thomas Howell, Paget Brewster, Kari Wahlgren, Grey DeLisle', 'PG-13', 'In an alternate universe, very different versions of DC''s Trinity fight against the government after they are framed for an embassy bombing.', 'In an alternate universe, very different versions of DC''s Trinity fight against the government after they are framed for an embassy bombing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9EoqQuEZKmQIYjexoUbkxMcMCVr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:323027'),
  ('396893699629810717', 'Justice League: Secret Origins', 2001, 'Science Fiction, Animation, Action, Adventure', 'Dan Riba, Butch Lukic', 'Rich Fogel', 'Kevin Conroy, Susan Eisenberg, George Newbern, Carl Lumbly, Max Brooks, Maria Canals-Barrera, Phil LaMarr, Gary Cole', null, 'When global catastrophe strikes, the World''s Greatest Super Heroes answer the call to join Justice League. Justice League works together as a team to overcome a dangerous array of intersteller invaders and world conquering megalomaniacs.', 'When global catastrophe strikes, the World''s Greatest Super Heroes answer the call to join Justice League. Justice League works together as a team to overcome a dangerous array of intersteller invaders and world conquering megalomaniacs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4pfH0wH9hDETB06Y62MITnjBkY9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:300386'),
  ('416515241011145382', 'Justice League: Starcrossed - The Movie', 2004, 'Animation, Adventure, Family, Fantasy, Mystery', 'Butch Lukic, Dan Riba', 'Rich Fogel, John Ridley, Dwayne McDuffie', 'Kevin Conroy, Phil LaMarr, Susan Eisenberg, Maria Canals-Barrera, Carl Lumbly, George Newbern, Michael Rosenbaum, Victor Rivers', 'NR', 'When the Thanagarians visit Earth, Hawkgirl is forced to choose between loyalty to her people and love for her friends on her adopted planet Earth.', 'When the Thanagarians visit Earth, Hawkgirl is forced to choose between loyalty to her people and love for her friends on her adopted planet Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4euOQztpRoN4vJyH0wwjBCydecb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:268899'),
  ('1013255260932801944', 'Justice League: The New Frontier', 2008, 'Action, Adventure, Animation, Science Fiction', 'Dave Bullock', 'Stan Berkowitz', 'David Boreanaz, Miguel Ferrer, Neil Patrick Harris, John Heard, Lucy Lawless, Kyle MacLachlan, Lex Lang, Phil Morris', 'PG-13', 'The human race is threatened by a powerful creature, and only the combined power of Superman, Batman, Wonder Woman, Green Lantern, Martian Manhunter and The Flash can stop it. But can they overcome their differences to thwart this enemy using the combined strength of their newly formed Justice League?', 'The human race is threatened by a powerful creature, and only the combined power of Superman, Batman, Wonder Woman, Green Lantern, Martian Manhunter and The Flash can stop it. But can they overcome their differences to thwart this enemy using the combined strength of their newly formed Justice League?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bj25ueeYNkz4e5t8oMMaAOWmwOc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14011'),
  ('299310155001231958', 'Justice League: Throne of Atlantis', 2015, 'Science Fiction, Action, Animation, Adventure', 'Ethan Spaulding', 'Heath Corson', 'Sean Astin, Rosario Dawson, Nathan Fillion, Christopher Gorham, Matt Lanter, Sumalee Montano, Jerry O''Connell, Jason O''Mara', 'PG-13', 'After the events of Justice League: War, Ocean Master and Black Manta have declared a war against the surface in retaliation of the aftermath of Apokoliptian-tyrant Darkseid''s planetary invasion. Queen Atlanna seeks out her other son, Ocean Master’s half-brother Arthur Curry, a half-human with aquatic powers with no knowledge of his Atlantean heritage, to restore balance. Living with powers he doesn’t understand and seeing the danger around him, Curry takes steps to embrace his destiny, joining the Justice League, and with his new teammates he battles to save Earth from total destruction.', 'After the events of Justice League: War, Ocean Master and Black Manta have declared a war against the surface in retaliation of the aftermath of Apokoliptian-tyrant Darkseid''s planetary invasion. Queen Atlanna seeks out her other son, Ocean Master’s half-brother Arthur Curry, a half-human with aquatic powers with no knowledge of his Atlantean heritage, to restore balance. Living with powers he doesn’t understand and seeing the danger around him, Curry takes steps to embrace his destiny, joining the Justice League, and with his new teammates he battles to save Earth from total destruction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iaYZA8teYeIxmR8wRrEED5wwR0u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:297556'),
  ('975544183716844314', 'Justice League: War', 2014, 'Animation, Action', 'Jay Oliva', 'Heath Corson', 'Michelle Monaghan, Alan Tudyk, Sean Astin, Shemar Moore, Christopher Gorham, Justin Kirk, Jason O''Mara, George Newbern', 'PG-13', 'The world is under attack by an alien armada led by the powerful Apokoliptian, Darkseid. A group of superheroes consisting of Superman, Batman, Wonder Woman, The Flash, Green Lantern, Cyborg, and Shazam must set aside their differences and gather together to defend Earth.', 'The world is under attack by an alien armada led by the powerful Apokoliptian, Darkseid. A group of superheroes consisting of Superman, Batman, Wonder Woman, The Flash, Green Lantern, Cyborg, and Shazam must set aside their differences and gather together to defend Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pdNprWYdgcB8z4FLD3BhRmhEys1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:217993'),
  ('771226870186999221', 'Justice League: Warworld', 2023, 'Animation, Action, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Jeff Wamester, Baek Seung-chang, Jin Seong Kim', 'Josie Campbell, Ernie Altbacker, Jeremy Adams', 'Jensen Ackles, Darren Criss, Stana Katic, Ike Amadi, Troy Baker, Matt Bomer, Roger Cross, Brett Dalton', 'R', 'Until now, the Justice League has been a loose association of superpowered individuals. But when they are swept away to Warworld, a place of unending brutal gladiatorial combat, Batman, Superman, Wonder Woman and the others must somehow unite to form an unbeatable resistance able to lead an entire planet to freedom.', 'Until now, the Justice League has been a loose association of superpowered individuals. But when they are swept away to Warworld, a place of unending brutal gladiatorial combat, Batman, Superman, Wonder Woman and the others must somehow unite to form an unbeatable resistance able to lead an entire planet to freedom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pHdSS5G3wDwJp6jWgMpbSjNiTbr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1003581'),
  ('428761630943834007', 'Justice Society: World War II', 2021, 'Animation, War, Science Fiction', 'Jeff Wamester', 'Meghan Fitzmartin, Jeremy Adams', 'Matt Bomer, Stana Katic, Omid Abtahi, Chris Diamantopoulos, Matthew Mercer, Armen Taylor, Elysia Rotaru, Geoffrey Arend', 'PG-13', 'When the Flash finds himself dropped into the middle of World War II, he joins forces with Wonder Woman and her top-secret team known as the Justice Society of America.', 'When the Flash finds himself dropped into the middle of World War II, he joins forces with Wonder Woman and her top-secret team known as the Justice Society of America.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tOUJvmdjppmPYZOoykWmerSspMT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:736069'),
  ('611166353598849426', 'Justice, My Foot!', 1992, 'Comedy, Action, Crime', 'Johnnie To, Peter Pau Tak-Hai, Suk-Fun Yeung', 'Sandy Shaw Lai-King', 'Stephen Chow, Anita Mui Yim-Fong, Richard Ng Man-Tat, Carrie Ng Ka-Lai, Paul Chun Pui, Bryan Leung Kar-Yan, Eddy Ko Hung, Mimi Chu Mai-Mai', null, 'An unscrupulous lawyer with an equally eccentric kung-fu sidekick wife tries to bring justice to the court.', 'An unscrupulous lawyer with an equally eccentric kung-fu sidekick wife tries to bring justice to the court.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1GjRTLuy9C6HqiFhniugcAItYJ4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32517'),
  ('539480339251276350', 'Justin and the Knights of Valour', 2013, 'Animation, Adventure', 'Manuel Sicilia, Javier Fernandez', 'Matthew Jacobs, Manuel Sicilia', 'Saoirse Ronan, Freddie Highmore, Antonio Banderas, Mark Strong, Julie Walters, Olivia Williams, Alfred Molina, Charles Dance', 'PG', 'A heart-warming tale about friendship, honor & courage, which sees a young boy become a man as he embarks on a quest to become a knight.', 'A heart-warming tale about friendship, honor & courage, which sees a young boy become a man as he embarks on a quest to become a knight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z6GrOTKOazrLnHQWVrN1pA082qi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146381'),
  ('694979923856286410', 'Justin Bieber: Never Say Never', 2011, 'Music, Documentary, Family', 'Jon M. Chu, Reed Smoot, Dennis Anderson', null, 'Justin Bieber, Nathan Morris, Wanya Morris, Shawn Stockman, Miley Cyrus, Ludacris, Jaden Smith, Usher', 'G', 'Tells the story of Justin Bieber, the kid from Canada with the hair, the smile and the voice: It chronicles his unprecedented rise to fame, all the way from busking in the streets of Stratford, Canada to putting videos on YouTube to selling out Madison Square Garden in New York as the headline act during the My World Tour from 2010. It features Usher, Scooter Braun, Ludacris, Sean Kingston, Antonio "L.A." Reid, Boyz II Men, Miley Cyrus, Jaden Smith, Justin''s family members and parts of his crew and huge fanbase in a mix of interviews and guest performances.', 'Tells the story of Justin Bieber, the kid from Canada with the hair, the smile and the voice: It chronicles his unprecedented rise to fame, all the way from busking in the streets of Stratford, Canada to putting videos on YouTube to selling out Madison Square Garden in New York as the headline act during the My World Tour from 2010. It features Usher, Scooter Braun, Ludacris, Sean Kingston, Antonio "L.A." Reid, Boyz II Men, Miley Cyrus, Jaden Smith, Justin''s family members and parts of his crew and huge fanbase in a mix of interviews and guest performances.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dGNMD5XTBQN3teIth21ohKOCJcR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54518'),
  ('746483896500455168', 'Justin Bieber: Our World', 2021, 'Music, Documentary', 'Michael D. Ratner', null, 'Justin Bieber, Hailey Bieber, Nick DeMoura, Johnny Erasme, Chris Gratton, Bernard Harvey, DJ Tay James, Rory Kramer', 'PG', 'After a three-year hiatus from a full performance, and with concert venues shut down due to the pandemic, Bieber delivers an electrifying show to close out 2020 on the rooftop of the Beverly Hilton Hotel for 240 invited guests—and millions of fans across the globe watching via livestream. The film follows Bieber and his close-knit team in the month leading up to the show, as they rehearse and construct a monumental stage while adhering to strict health and safety protocols. The film also captures personal, self-shot moments between Bieber and his wife Hailey.', 'After a three-year hiatus from a full performance, and with concert venues shut down due to the pandemic, Bieber delivers an electrifying show to close out 2020 on the rooftop of the Beverly Hilton Hotel for 240 invited guests—and millions of fans across the globe watching via livestream. The film follows Bieber and his close-knit team in the month leading up to the show, as they rehearse and construct a monumental stage while adhering to strict health and safety protocols. The film also captures personal, self-shot moments between Bieber and his wife Hailey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iCzzCUgsFSlaEbgKKmJttSAUXGr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:871858'),
  ('694317918880393075', 'Justin Bieber''s Believe', 2013, 'Documentary, Music', 'Jon M. Chu, Karsten ''Crash'' Gopinath', 'Sarah Landman', 'Justin Bieber, Ryan Good, Usher, Pattie Mallette, Jeremy Bieber, Mike Posner, Max Martin, will.i.am', 'PG', 'A backstage and on-stage look at Justin Bieber during his rise to super stardom.', 'A backstage and on-stage look at Justin Bieber during his rise to super stardom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/WxwzHNSumoYLP15QppvomGJJYr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:229296'),
  ('504563435639898635', 'Justin de Marseille', 1935, 'Drama', 'Maurice Tourneur, Georges Benoît', 'Carlo Rim', 'Antonin Berval, Pierre Larquey, Alexandre Rignault, Ghislaine Bru, Line Noro, Paul Ollivier, Raymond Aimos, Armand Larcher', null, 'A respected gangster, Justin, finds himself in a deadly feud with his rival, the unscrupulous Esposito. The latter plans to steal a cargo of opium bound for China and to have Justin killed.', 'A respected gangster, Justin, finds himself in a deadly feud with his rival, the unscrupulous Esposito. The latter plans to steal a cargo of opium bound for China and to have Justin killed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/glH41wNDEppvxyM7Hg8IdEQ8fzP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63684'),
  ('1012461006443451669', 'Justin Timberlake + The Tennessee Kids', 2016, 'Music, Documentary', 'Jonathan Demme, Declan Quinn, H.H. Cooper', null, 'Justin Timberlake', null, 'In January 2015, at the MGM Grand Garden Arena in Las Vegas, the final nights of the "20/20 Experience World Tour", director Jonathan Demme captures what makes the show soar: gifted musicians, deft dancers and a magnetic star.', 'In January 2015, at the MGM Grand Garden Arena in Las Vegas, the final nights of the "20/20 Experience World Tour", director Jonathan Demme captures what makes the show soar: gifted musicians, deft dancers and a magnetic star.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5TDZqiRPBhUNDRermZ5HfKf4WoF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:408619'),
  ('1133916357461645654', 'Justine', 1969, 'Drama, Mystery, Romance', 'George Cukor, Maurice Vaccarino, Fred Harpman', 'Andrew Sarris, Lawrence B. Marcus', 'Anouk Aimée, Dirk Bogarde, Robert Forster, Anna Karina, Philippe Noiret, Michael York, John Vernon, Jack Albertson', null, 'In Alexandria, in 1938, Darley, a young British schoolmaster and poet, makes friends through Pursewarden, the British consular officer, with Justine, the beautiful and mysterious wife of a Coptic banker. He observes the affairs of her heart and incidentally discovers that she is involved in a plot against the British, meant to arm the Jewish underground in Palestine. The plot finally fails, Justine is sent to jail and Darley decides to return to England.', 'In Alexandria, in 1938, Darley, a young British schoolmaster and poet, makes friends through Pursewarden, the British consular officer, with Justine, the beautiful and mysterious wife of a Coptic banker. He observes the affairs of her heart and incidentally discovers that she is involved in a plot against the British, meant to arm the Jewish underground in Palestine. The plot finally fails, Justine is sent to jail and Darley decides to return to England.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7PxJ9T9zWMISMNPoGkYN9rprRn6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42609'),
  ('741383917822485999', 'Justine de Sade', 1972, 'Drama', 'Claude Pierson, Jean-Jacques Tarbès', 'Claude Pierson, Huguette Boisvert', 'Alice Arno, Yves Arcanel, Michel Bertay, Georges Beauvilliers, Chantal Broquet, Christian Chevreuse, Franco Fantasia, Lida Ferro', null, 'Therese, a beautiful but naive young girl, who finds herself being passed around from depraved pervert to depraved pervert, enduring just about every kind of sexual degradation there is while still believing that some kind stranger will eventually help her.', 'Therese, a beautiful but naive young girl, who finds herself being passed around from depraved pervert to depraved pervert, enduring just about every kind of sexual degradation there is while still believing that some kind stranger will eventually help her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1if6Ca9iJf25mG1Rg6RHeIlbajz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121810'),
  ('335593530905020988', 'Justinian''s Human Torches', 1908, 'History, Drama', 'Georges Méliès', null, null, null, 'During an orgy, Emperor Justinian orders three people to be torched alive.', 'During an orgy, Emperor Justinian orders three people to be torched alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6yImwavXjW0FPA7RZTXW6aD2LTs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:196628'),
  ('726168276765094809', 'Justinien Trouve, or God''s Bastard', 1993, 'Comedy, Drama, History', 'Christian Fechner', null, 'Pierre-Olivier Mornas, Bernard-Pierre Donnadieu, Ticky Holgado, Bernard Haller, Patrice Valota, Roland Blanche, Didier Pain, Bernard Farcy', null, 'Set in the French countryside in the 1600s, a lone rider deposits a newborn baby boy on the steps of a monastery, having bitten his nose off. The child is bought up by an ex-pirate and his wife and is taught to read, write, count, joust and fence, and is also given a wooden nose. However, he is ordered by a local baron to attend a tough seminary, but he soon rebels and makes an action-packed escape...', 'Set in the French countryside in the 1600s, a lone rider deposits a newborn baby boy on the steps of a monastery, having bitten his nose off. The child is bought up by an ex-pirate and his wife and is taught to read, write, count, joust and fence, and is also given a wooden nose. However, he is ordered by a local baron to attend a tough seminary, but he soon rebels and makes an action-packed escape...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/af0XtXaOWw9rcT7J7l6kTYrTNpD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53008'),
  ('606811443853254600', 'Justino, un asesino de la tercera edad', 1994, 'Comedy, Drama, Crime', 'Santiago Aguilar, Luis Guridi, Flavio Martínez Labiano', 'Santiago Aguilar, Luis Guridi', 'Saturnino García, Carlos Lucas, Carmen Segarra, Francisco Maestre, Concha Salinas, Carlos de Gabriel, Juanjo Puigcorbé, Alicia Hermida', null, 'Justino was working in a bull-ring but now he is retired. For him it is very difficult to adapt to the new situation although he will find soon a hobby without forgetting his profession.', 'Justino was working in a bull-ring but now he is retired. For him it is very difficult to adapt to the new situation although he will find soon a hobby without forgetting his profession.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AeGpsFB8S9cLwWxWxigX6fLlIQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115605'),
  ('522359964203613558', 'Juvenile Court', 1973, 'Documentary', 'William Brayne, Frederick Wiseman', null, null, null, '"Juvenile Court" shows the complex variety of cases before the Memphis Juvenile Court: foster home placement, drug abuse, armed robbery, child abuse, and sexual offenses. The sequences illustrate such issues as community protection vs. the desire for rehabilitation, the range and the limits of the choices available to the court, the psychology of the offender, and the constitutional and procedural questions involved in administering a juvenile court.', '"Juvenile Court" shows the complex variety of cases before the Memphis Juvenile Court: foster home placement, drug abuse, armed robbery, child abuse, and sexual offenses. The sequences illustrate such issues as community protection vs. the desire for rehabilitation, the range and the limits of the choices available to the court, the psychology of the offender, and the constitutional and procedural questions involved in administering a juvenile court.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pLhAyWpm2YcfwzYkTmyVrvuzZSE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114395'),
  ('702583375927138020', 'Juvenile Offender', 2012, 'Drama', 'Kang Yi-kwan, Park Chan-yun, Byun Bong-sun', 'Park Joo-young', 'Lee Jung-hyun, Seo Young-joo, Kang Rae-yeon, Jeong Seok-yong, Seo Young-hwa, Bae Sung-woo, Kim Ha-eun, Kang Hyuk-il', null, '16-year-old juvenile offender Ji-gu reunites with his young mom who he thought was dead, and the two try to make up for their time lost.', '16-year-old juvenile offender Ji-gu reunites with his young mom who he thought was dead, and the two try to make up for their time lost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ysDpYaUtXl1kOGvbTqnOdB5iiLg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128111'),
  ('665995645922222779', 'Juwanna Mann', 2002, 'Comedy', 'Jesse Vaughan, Reynaldo Villalobos, Pam Dixon', 'Bradley Allenstein', 'Miguel A. Núñez Jr., Vivica A. Fox, Kevin Pollak, Tommy Davidson, Ginuwine, Lil'' Kim, Dikembe Mutombo, Vlade Divac', 'PG-13', 'A basketball star is booted out of the NBA when his on-court antics go too far, so he poses as a woman and joins the WUBA.', 'A basketball star is booted out of the NBA when his on-court antics go too far, so he poses as a woman and joins the WUBA.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1m5sbTbifesBhCrkE0gJncwMGXw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35696'),
  ('47838828561514939', 'K', 1997, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Alexandre Arcady, Gerry Fisher, Christophe Cheysson', 'Jorge Semprún, Serge Raffy, Alexandre Arcady', 'Patrick Bruel, Isabella Ferrari, Marthe Keller, Pinkas Braun, Dieter Kirchlechner, Andreas Hoppe, Uwe Poppe', null, 'In this French crime film, set during the time of the Gulf War, an elderly German tourist is murdered in Paris by junk dealer Joseph Katz (Pinkas Braun), a friend of Paris detective Sam Bellamy (singer Patrick Bruel). Romantically involved with the victim''s daughter Emma Guter (Isabella Ferrari), Bellamy covers up the crime he witnessed. Joseph then mysteriously vanishes, and Bellamy heads for Berlin where the victim''s possessions are auctioned. After Bellamy finds the source of the well-hidden traffic in art stolen by Nazis from French Jews, he discovers a Nazi war criminal is blackmailing past associates. Incorporating background from journalist Hector Feliciano''s Lost Museum, the film is adapted from Guy Konopnicki''s novel, Pas de Kaddish pour Sylberstein (No Kaddish for Sylberstein).', 'In this French crime film, set during the time of the Gulf War, an elderly German tourist is murdered in Paris by junk dealer Joseph Katz (Pinkas Braun), a friend of Paris detective Sam Bellamy (singer Patrick Bruel). Romantically involved with the victim''s daughter Emma Guter (Isabella Ferrari), Bellamy covers up the crime he witnessed. Joseph then mysteriously vanishes, and Bellamy heads for Berlin where the victim''s possessions are auctioned. After Bellamy finds the source of the well-hidden traffic in art stolen by Nazis from French Jews, he discovers a Nazi war criminal is blackmailing past associates. Incorporating background from journalist Hector Feliciano''s Lost Museum, the film is adapted from Guy Konopnicki''s novel, Pas de Kaddish pour Sylberstein (No Kaddish for Sylberstein).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/34JN5ZW3J9dlaIs4UmBL3YjPQqv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76597'),
  ('482924373202858476', 'K', 2002, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Shoja Azari, Ghasem Ebrahimian, Benjamin Wolf', 'Shoja Azari', 'Oz Phillips, Shoja Azari, Shirin Neshat, Mohammad Ghaffari, Rick Poli, Heaven Lee Darling, Ann Parker, Shahram Karimi', null, 'Three stories. We see, but little is explained. In "The Married Couple," a salesman pays a call on an old customer who is with his wife in the upstairs bedroom of their ill adult son. Another salesman may beat him to the punch, but not before disorienting changes. A maid scrubs the floor. "In the Penal Colony": a man arrives at a penal colony where an officer demonstrates a bizarre apparatus, one that punches a message into the skin of a prisoner strapped beneath it. Who will be punished? In "Fratricide," a man is murdered at night by someone he knows well. A woman grieves.', 'Three stories. We see, but little is explained. In "The Married Couple," a salesman pays a call on an old customer who is with his wife in the upstairs bedroom of their ill adult son. Another salesman may beat him to the punch, but not before disorienting changes. A maid scrubs the floor. "In the Penal Colony": a man arrives at a penal colony where an officer demonstrates a bizarre apparatus, one that punches a message into the skin of a prisoner strapped beneath it. Who will be punished? In "Fratricide," a man is murdered at night by someone he knows well. A woman grieves.', null, 'tmdb:movie:49694'),
  ('915364936290714496', 'K-11', 2013, 'Drama', 'Jules Stewart, Adam Silver', 'Jules Stewart, Jared Kurt', 'Goran Višnjić, Kate del Castillo, D. B. Sweeney, Portia Doubleday, Jason Mewes, Sonya Eddy, Luis Moncada, Craig Owens', 'NR', 'Raymond Saxx Jr., a powerful record producer, wakes from a drug-induced blackout to find himself locked up and classified "K-11." Plunged into a nightmarish world ruled by a transsexual diva named Mousey, Raymond is truly a fish out of water. Complicating matters are a troubled young transgender named Butterfly, a predatory child molester and the ruthless Sheriff''s Deputy, Lt. Johnson. Ray''s struggle to contact the outside world and regain his freedom seems impossible, but he must learn to navigate this new power structure if he is ever going survive and be in control of his life again.', 'Raymond Saxx Jr., a powerful record producer, wakes from a drug-induced blackout to find himself locked up and classified "K-11." Plunged into a nightmarish world ruled by a transsexual diva named Mousey, Raymond is truly a fish out of water. Complicating matters are a troubled young transgender named Butterfly, a predatory child molester and the ruthless Sheriff''s Deputy, Lt. Johnson. Ray''s struggle to contact the outside world and regain his freedom seems impossible, but he must learn to navigate this new power structure if he is ever going survive and be in control of his life again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ucQn8bEqCRstAHscjH4ryV08QgZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:170178'),
  ('1083086176401382580', 'K-12', 2019, 'Fantasy, Horror', 'Melanie Martinez, Marc Kelly, Réka Belsö', 'Melanie Martinez', 'Melanie Martinez, Elita Harkov, Megan Gage, Maggie Budzyna, Zión Moreno, Marsalis Wilson, Zinnett Hendrix, Adrian Jurics', 'R', 'Cry Baby, a strong and sensitive girl, is sent off to a disturbing sleepaway school that’s hidden underneath a grandiose façade. Luckily, she has a sweet and unapologetic best friend who sticks up for her when she gets bullied by the other students whose brains are under control by the Principal and his wicked staff. With the help of the magical friends they meet along the way, as well as an Angelic Spirit Guide, they are able to gain the strength they need to fight off the school’s belligerent patriarchal conditioning.', 'Cry Baby, a strong and sensitive girl, is sent off to a disturbing sleepaway school that’s hidden underneath a grandiose façade. Luckily, she has a sweet and unapologetic best friend who sticks up for her when she gets bullied by the other students whose brains are under control by the Principal and his wicked staff. With the help of the magical friends they meet along the way, as well as an Angelic Spirit Guide, they are able to gain the strength they need to fight off the school’s belligerent patriarchal conditioning.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nVi0yBBPj5Z96JgGWVIg94kv7bR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:616584'),
  ('523657266164332889', 'K-19: The Widowmaker', 2002, 'Drama, History, Thriller, Mystery, War', 'Kathryn Bigelow, Jeff Cronenweth, Steve Danton', 'Christopher Kyle', 'Harrison Ford, Liam Neeson, Peter Sarsgaard, Joss Ackland, John Shrapnel, Donald Sumpter, Tim Woodward, Steve Nicolson', 'PG-13', 'When Russia''s first nuclear submarine malfunctions on its maiden voyage, the crew must race to save the ship and prevent a nuclear disaster.', 'When Russia''s first nuclear submarine malfunctions on its maiden voyage, the crew must race to save the ship and prevent a nuclear disaster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vImR0HQkJs7Xs2qgdXEUDeX49m0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8665'),
  ('937403655964553280', 'K-20: The Fiend with Twenty Faces', 2008, 'Action, Adventure, Crime', 'Shimako Sato, Naoki Kawamura, Tatsuro Koike', 'So Kitamura, Takashi Yamazaki', 'Takeshi Kaneshiro, Takako Matsu, Toru Nakamura, Kanata Hongo, Jun Kunimura, Yuki Imai, Fumiyo Kohinata, Takeshi Kaga', null, 'In an alternate version of 1949 Japan in which World War II never happened, the Japanese capital of Teito is home to both an ultra rich upper class and the dirt poor masses. The city is thrown into a state of panic when a phantom thief called “The Kaijin (Fiend) with 20 Faces” (K-20 for short) begins to use his mysterious abilities to steal from the rich and give to the poor. One day a circus acrobat named Heikichi Endo (Takeshi Kaneshiro) is framed for K-20’s crimes and becomes determined to clear his name. He teams up with K-20’s next target, a wealthy duchess named Yoko Hashiba (Takako Matsu) and her detective fiancé (Toru Nakamura), to take K-20 down once and for all.', 'In an alternate version of 1949 Japan in which World War II never happened, the Japanese capital of Teito is home to both an ultra rich upper class and the dirt poor masses. The city is thrown into a state of panic when a phantom thief called “The Kaijin (Fiend) with 20 Faces” (K-20 for short) begins to use his mysterious abilities to steal from the rich and give to the poor. One day a circus acrobat named Heikichi Endo (Takeshi Kaneshiro) is framed for K-20’s crimes and becomes determined to clear his name. He teams up with K-20’s next target, a wealthy duchess named Yoko Hashiba (Takako Matsu) and her detective fiancé (Toru Nakamura), to take K-20 down once and for all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9GAwNd8qh50YPSzhmiLR6t5yfVA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24410'),
  ('449564577281238752', 'K-9', 1989, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Rod Daniel, Dean Semler, Doug Metzger', 'Steven Siegel, Scott Myers', 'Jim Belushi, Mel Harris, Kevin Tighe, Ed O''Neill, James Handy, Daniel Davis, Cotter Smith, John Snyder', 'PG-13', 'The extravagant cop Michael Dooley needs some help to fight a drug dealer who has tried to kill him. A "friend" gives him a dog named Jerry Lee (Officer Lewis), who has been trained to smell drugs. With his help, Dooley sets out to put his enemy behind the bars, but Jerry Lee has a personality of his own and works only when he wants to. On the other hand, the dog is quite good at destroying Dooley''s car, house and sex-life...', 'The extravagant cop Michael Dooley needs some help to fight a drug dealer who has tried to kill him. A "friend" gives him a dog named Jerry Lee (Officer Lewis), who has been trained to smell drugs. With his help, Dooley sets out to put his enemy behind the bars, but Jerry Lee has a personality of his own and works only when he wants to. On the other hand, the dog is quite good at destroying Dooley''s car, house and sex-life...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/21mBNUe0X4WYywe6w5DyihltmAn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10345'),
  ('937311697383337474', 'K-9 World Cup', 2015, 'Animation, Family', 'Carlos Pimentel, Nathan Sifuentes', 'Omar Mustre, Dulce Belchez, Carlos Pimentel', 'Fernando Luján, Plutarco Haza, Maite Perroni, Raúl Araiza, Sergio Corona, Manuel Valdés, Pierre Angelo, Gaspar Henaine', null, 'The road to glory is walked as a pack. When the Mexicanine Republic becomes the host for the World Canine Cup, the coach has one chance to put together the best team in history; but the new warriors will have to learn to put aside their differences and work as a team, to show their country that ultimate football glory is more than just a dream.', 'The road to glory is walked as a pack. When the Mexicanine Republic becomes the host for the World Canine Cup, the coach has one chance to put together the best team in history; but the new warriors will have to learn to put aside their differences and work as a team, to show their country that ultimate football glory is more than just a dream.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lVVxsu65dcpyWqjISrT0ZU4qH5p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:331983'),
  ('436099907177909408', 'K-9: P.I.', 2002, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Richard J. Lewis, Roy H. Wagner', null, 'Jim Belushi, Gary Basaraba, Jody Racicot, Blu Mankuma, Christopher Shyer, Barbara Tyson, Jason Schombing, Kevin Durand', 'PG-13', 'Dooley and his K-9 partner Jerry Lee are ready to retire from the police force. But before he can retire with his pension he must work as a P.I. to find a set of high tech computer chips.', 'Dooley and his K-9 partner Jerry Lee are ready to retire from the police force. But before he can retire with his pension he must work as a P.I. to find a set of high tech computer chips.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2RdyzWbN3zTF1559GRnLbamy3V4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47354'),
  ('475854094085455563', 'K-9000', 1990, 'Science Fiction, TV Movie, Action, Comedy', 'Kim Manners, Frank Raymond', 'Steven E. de Souza, Michael Part', 'Chris Mulkey, Catherine Oxenberg, Dennis Haysbert, Dana Gladstone, Jerry Houser, Judson Scott, Anne Haney, Tom McFadden', null, 'A policeman and a scientist team up to recover her latest creation, a cybernetic, crime-fighting dog.', 'A policeman and a scientist team up to recover her latest creation, a cybernetic, crime-fighting dog.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yK6bx3QeK28kxnnM2otzFgZij1w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:140992'),
  ('1067511011037002923', 'K-911', 2000, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Charles T. Kanganis, George Mooradian', 'Gary Scott Thompson', 'Jim Belushi, Christine Tucci, James Handy, Wade Williams, Scotch Ellis Loring, J.J. Johnston, Joe Palese, Vincent Castellanos', 'PG-13', 'LAPD detective Mike Dooley and his dog, the German Shepherd Jerry Lee, have been successfully partnered for ten years, but Jerry’s advancing age has Dooley’s superiors suggesting retirement and they are forced to work with a younger K-9 team: female cop Sergeant Welles and her disciplined Doberman Zeus.', 'LAPD detective Mike Dooley and his dog, the German Shepherd Jerry Lee, have been successfully partnered for ten years, but Jerry’s advancing age has Dooley’s superiors suggesting retirement and they are forced to work with a younger K-9 team: female cop Sergeant Welles and her disciplined Doberman Zeus.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eYi2Kje8rfuoHzm5zkqa9nX5q8L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41586'),
  ('72786687694048499', 'K-ON! The Movie', 2011, 'Animation, Family, Adventure, Comedy, Music', 'Naoko Yamada, Naoko Yamada, Yukiko Horiguchi', 'Reiko Yoshida', 'Aki Toyosaki, Yoko Hikasa, Satomi Sato, Minako Kotobuki, Ayana Taketatsu, Madoka Yonezawa, Chika Fujitou, Asami Sanada', null, 'With graduation right around the corner, every member of the Light Music Club except for Azusa will be leaving for good. But the girls aren’t going to let something as silly as graduation tear them apart! For their final hurrah, the girls are going on the ultimate vacation tour— all the way to London! Their overseas journey will lead them on a trip of discovery and friendship as they take the stage one last time for their final encore together.', 'With graduation right around the corner, every member of the Light Music Club except for Azusa will be leaving for good. But the girls aren’t going to let something as silly as graduation tear them apart! For their final hurrah, the girls are going on the ultimate vacation tour— all the way to London! Their overseas journey will lead them on a trip of discovery and friendship as they take the stage one last time for their final encore together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aRe9m2K3IGhgruRc9yHUYxQIhI4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120811'),
  ('414976210162318459', 'K-PAX', 2001, 'Science Fiction, Drama, Mystery', 'Iain Softley, John Mathieson, Peter Kohn', 'Charles Leavitt', 'Jeff Bridges, Kevin Spacey, Mary McCormack, Alfre Woodard, David Patrick Kelly, Saul Williams, Peter Gerety, Celia Weston', 'PG-13', 'Prot is a patient at a mental hospital who claims to be from a far away planet. His psychiatrist tries to help him, only to begin to doubt his own explanations.', 'Prot is a patient at a mental hospital who claims to be from a far away planet. His psychiatrist tries to help him, only to begin to doubt his own explanations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tafXZX0I6rso7EyoEzfygfTqxq6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:167'),
  ('651257604550912700', 'K-Pops!', 2026, 'Comedy, Drama, Music, Family', 'Anderson .Paak, Edward J. Pei', 'Anderson .Paak, Jonnie Park, Khaila Amazan', 'Soul Rasheed, Yvette Nicole Brown, Jee Young Han, Cathy Shim, Kevin Woo', 'PG-13', 'A washed-up musician travels to Korea to write for K-pop stars, discovering that his long-lost son is set to front one of the country’s hottest new groups. He then jumps at the opportunity to capitalize on his son’s stardom for his own renaissance, but learns that fatherhood is much more fulfilling and meaningful than stardom.', 'A washed-up musician travels to Korea to write for K-pop stars, discovering that his long-lost son is set to front one of the country’s hottest new groups. He then jumps at the opportunity to capitalize on his son’s stardom for his own renaissance, but learns that fatherhood is much more fulfilling and meaningful than stardom.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F72KQHN1xUO6gWHLRRPyJcCQXlve.jpg', 'plex:movie:k-pops'),
  ('242905425169281296', 'K-Shop', 2016, 'Thriller, Horror, Crime', 'Chris Fergusson, Dan Pringle', 'Dan Pringle', 'Ziad Abaza, Scot Williams, Darren Morfitt, Kristin Atherton, Lucinda Rhodes Thakrar, Reece Noi, Steve McCarten, Martin W. Payne', null, 'After his father is killed in an altercation with drunken thugs, Salah''s world is plunged into darkness. Forced into running the family kebab shop alone, Salah struggles to manage the increasingly rowdy night life and when a fight with an angry customer goes fatally wrong, he finds himself with a dead body on his hands. With no faith in the authorities Salah disposes of the body in the one place he knows best… the kebabs.', 'After his father is killed in an altercation with drunken thugs, Salah''s world is plunged into darkness. Forced into running the family kebab shop alone, Salah struggles to manage the increasingly rowdy night life and when a fight with an angry customer goes fatally wrong, he finds himself with a dead body on his hands. With no faith in the authorities Salah disposes of the body in the one place he knows best… the kebabs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5sDSYDaRqFWp7oN5ga2CcSt9DYM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:403820'),
  ('525577999656911872', 'K: Missing Kings', 2014, 'Animation, Fantasy, Action', 'Shingo Suzuki, Makoto Furuta', null, 'Daisuke Namikawa, Daisuke Ono, Tomokazu Sugita, Mikako Komatsu, Kenjiro Tsuda, Hiro Shimono, Jun Fukuyama, Kaori Nazuka', null, 'The "Academy Island Incident" in which four "kings" cross paths... Since then, Silver Clansmen Kuroh Yatogami and Neko have been searching for their master, Shiro. Without finding any clues to Shiro''s whereabouts, the two became disheartened. However, one day, they see HOMRA members Rikio Kamamoto and Anna Kushina being chased by someone.', 'The "Academy Island Incident" in which four "kings" cross paths... Since then, Silver Clansmen Kuroh Yatogami and Neko have been searching for their master, Shiro. Without finding any clues to Shiro''s whereabouts, the two became disheartened. However, one day, they see HOMRA members Rikio Kamamoto and Anna Kushina being chased by someone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jFDuJDeQylLwGN7yMOr3qSDZdQJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:271708'),
