  ('1077106594938631328', 'K.G.F: Chapter 1', 2018, 'Action, Thriller, Adventure, Crime', 'Prashanth Neel, B Thimme Gowda, Bhuvan Gowda', 'Prashanth Neel', 'Yash, Srinidhi Shetty, Ramachandra Raju, Archana Jois, Anant Nag, Vasishta N. Simha, Achyuth Kumar, Ayyappa P. Sharma', 'PG-13', 'A period drama set in the 1970s, KGF follows the story of a fierce rebel who rises against the brutal oppression in Kolar Gold Fields and becomes the symbol of hope to legions of downtrodden people.', 'A period drama set in the 1970s, KGF follows the story of a fierce rebel who rises against the brutal oppression in Kolar Gold Fields and becomes the symbol of hope to legions of downtrodden people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ltHlJwvxKv7d0ooCiKSAvfwV9tX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:564147'),
  ('1101456723547276581', 'K.G.F: Chapter 2', 2022, 'Action, Thriller, Adventure, Crime', 'Prashanth Neel, Bhuvan Gowda, B Thimme Gowda', 'Prashanth Neel', 'Yash, Sanjay Dutt, Raveena Tandon, Srinidhi Shetty, Archana Jois, Achyuth Kumar, Rao Ramesh, Ayyappa P. Sharma', 'PG-13', 'The blood-soaked land of Kolar Gold Fields (KGF) has a new overlord now - Rocky, whose name strikes fear in the heart of his foes. His allies look up to Rocky as their Savior, the government sees him as a threat to law and order; enemies are clamoring for revenge and conspiring for his downfall. Bloodier battles and darker days await as Rocky continues on his quest for unchallenged supremacy.', 'The blood-soaked land of Kolar Gold Fields (KGF) has a new overlord now - Rocky, whose name strikes fear in the heart of his foes. His allies look up to Rocky as their Savior, the government sees him as a threat to law and order; enemies are clamoring for revenge and conspiring for his downfall. Bloodier battles and darker days await as Rocky continues on his quest for unchallenged supremacy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/khNVygolU0TxLIDWff5tQlAhZ23.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:587412'),
