  ('279746854703992779', 'Kaabil', 2017, 'Action, Thriller, Drama', 'Sudeep Chatterjee, Ayananka Bose, Sanjay Gupta', 'Vijay Kumar Mishra', 'Hrithik Roshan, Yami Gautam Dhar, Ronit Roy, Rohit Roy, Narendra Jha, Girish Kulkarni, Suresh Menon, Akhilendra Mishra', 'R', 'Rohan is a kind, happy young man who has been blind since birth and works as a voice-over artist for a living. Through friends, he meets Supriya, a working woman who is also blind, but proudly independent. The two start liking each other and get married. Rohan toughest journey starts in his quest of vengeance for Supriya''s indirect murderers.', 'Rohan is a kind, happy young man who has been blind since birth and works as a voice-over artist for a living. Through friends, he meets Supriya, a working woman who is also blind, but proudly independent. The two start liking each other and get married. Rohan toughest journey starts in his quest of vengeance for Supriya''s indirect murderers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ojs8b5N2BgFYoHCSb6vu0egZb6v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:403867'),
