  ('212050392496319821', 'Kaagaz', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Satish Kaushik', 'Satish Kaushik', 'Pankaj Tripathi, Amar Upadhyay, Monal Gajjar, Mita Vashisht, Satish Kaushik, Vijay Kumar, Salman Khan, Sharat Sonu', null, 'Kaagaz (transl. Paper) is a biographical drama about a farmer, Lal Bihari''s 19-year struggle to make himself come alive again when he is declared dead in Government records by interests keen to take over his assets.', 'Kaagaz (transl. Paper) is a biographical drama about a farmer, Lal Bihari''s 19-year struggle to make himself come alive again when he is declared dead in Government records by interests keen to take over his assets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wZq7tsSORRtIGAlf2QieWznXpeC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:776303'),
