  ('858316052734505763', 'Kaala', 2018, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'R Tamizh Thendral, Pa. Ranjith, G. Murali', 'Pa. Ranjith', 'Rajinikanth, Nana Patekar, Samuthirakani, Easwari Rao, Huma Qureshi, Manikandan, Anjali Patil, Aruldoss', null, 'Karikaalan consistently fights to keep the people of Dharavi, a slum in Mumbai, safe from the clutches of mighty politicians and the land mafia don, Hari Dhadha.', 'Karikaalan consistently fights to keep the people of Dharavi, a slum in Mumbai, safe from the clutches of mighty politicians and the land mafia don, Hari Dhadha.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xVAZZN4Av3e6YxwLgUWTYDNtta1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:459008'),
  ('195963844565215059', 'Kaala Patthar', 1979, 'Drama, Action, Thriller', 'Dilip Naik, K.G. Koregaonkar, Yash Chopra', 'Javed Akhtar, Salim Khan', 'Amitabh Bachchan, Shashi Kapoor, Shatrughan Sinha, Rakhee Gulzar, Parveen Babi, Neetu Singh, Parikshat Sahni, Prem Chopra', null, 'Vijay Singh is a disgraced former Merchant-Navy officer who is branded as a coward after he abandons his crew during an emergency. Guilt-ridden and trying to forget his past, he takes up work at a coal mine where he gets trapped with other miners after a flood hits them.', 'Vijay Singh is a disgraced former Merchant-Navy officer who is branded as a coward after he abandons his crew during an emergency. Guilt-ridden and trying to forget his past, he takes up work at a coal mine where he gets trapped with other miners after a flood hits them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2LgFnPtL8dUYb0FH8NbgodmoFWF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30627'),
  ('905384402761535391', 'Kaalakaandi', 2018, 'Comedy, Thriller, Drama', 'Akshat Verma, Himman Dhamija', 'karthik bera, Akshat Verma', 'Saif Ali Khan, Akshay Oberoi, Isha Talwar, Sobhita Dhulipala, Kunaal Roy Kapur, Deepak Dobriyal, Vijay Raaz, Shivam Patil', null, 'Unfolding through a course of a night in Mumbai, Kaalakaandi showcases three parallel tracks — a man who discovers he has terminal illness decides to let go of his principles and live a little; a woman involved in a hit-and-run seeks redemption and two goons must decide if they can trust each other.', 'Unfolding through a course of a night in Mumbai, Kaalakaandi showcases three parallel tracks — a man who discovers he has terminal illness decides to let go of his principles and live a little; a woman involved in a hit-and-run seeks redemption and two goons must decide if they can trust each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/osCsDcfTUVcecKwAoQWPYVLSLqv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:468469'),
  ('766658557256190291', 'Kaalapani', 1996, 'Action, Drama', 'Priyadarshan, Santosh Sivan', 'T Damodaran, Priyadarshan', 'Mohanlal, Prabhu, Amrish Puri, Tabu, Vineeth Radhakrishnan, Nedumudi Venu, Alex Draper, Annu Kapoor', null, 'Govardhan, a doctor by profession, is wrongly accused of bombing a train and is jailed by the British in Cellular Jail, also known as Kala Pani in Andaman and Nicobar Islands. He witnesses sufferings of hundreds of Indian prisoners there.', 'Govardhan, a doctor by profession, is wrongly accused of bombing a train and is jailed by the British in Cellular Jail, also known as Kala Pani in Andaman and Nicobar Islands. He witnesses sufferings of hundreds of Indian prisoners there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/byQ8bcRBpIOYW7OlNZCCYkAVUp2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:255459'),
