  ('661365194524014469', 'Kaantha', 2025, 'History, Crime, Drama', 'Selvamani Selvaraj, Dani Sanchez-Lopez, Himanshu Baluni', 'Thamizh Prabha, Selvamani Selvaraj', 'Dulquer Salmaan, Bhagyashri Borse, Samuthirakani, Ravindra Vijay, Rana Daggubati, Gayathrie Shankar, Nizhalgal Ravi, Vaiyapuri', null, 'Set in the backdrop of a film set, in the 1950’s in post colonial Madras, the film is centred around the professional rivalry between a film-maker trying to make his seminal film and the top reigning actor who the director once introduced. The rivalry spirals around the leading actress, a debutante and as the relationship between the three.', 'Set in the backdrop of a film set, in the 1950’s in post colonial Madras, the film is centred around the professional rivalry between a film-maker trying to make his seminal film and the top reigning actor who the director once introduced. The rivalry spirals around the leading actress, a debutante and as the relationship between the three.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a6A0CvOMUUbQNfgkRSPqf5JMpsU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1250508'),
  ('169883550017469231', 'Kaathal - The Core', 2023, 'Drama', 'Jeo Baby, Salu K Thomas, Doshy Maria George', 'Paulson Skaria, Adarsh Sukumaran', 'Mammootty, Jyothika, R. S. Panicker, Anagha Maya Ravi, Sudhi Kozhikode, Alister Alex, Joji Mundakayam, Chinnu Chandini Nair', null, 'Mathew Devassy, a retired bank manager decides to enter local panchayat elections. Unexpectedly, his wife Omana, shocks everyone by filing for divorce, claiming that Mathew is gay.', 'Mathew Devassy, a retired bank manager decides to enter local panchayat elections. Unexpectedly, his wife Omana, shocks everyone by filing for divorce, claiming that Mathew is gay.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uPtqA6uwGqL19gXjzSlmQ31XFn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1029947'),
