  ('798026294972426566', 'Kabei: Our Mother', 2008, 'Family, Drama', 'Yoji Yamada, Mutsuo Naganuma', 'Yoji Yamada, Emiko Hiramatsu', 'Mirai Shida, Tadanobu Asano, Chieko Baisho, Denden, Sayuri Yoshinaga, Mitsuru Fukikoshi, Keiko Toda, Daisuke Gori', null, 'Set in Tokyo in 1940, the peaceful life of the Nogami Family suddenly changes when the father, Shigeru, is arrested and accused of being a Communist. His wife Kayo works frantically from morning to night to maintain the household and bring up her two daughters with the support of Shigeru''s sister Hisako and Shigeru''s ex-student Yamazaki, but her husband does not return. WWII breaks out and casts dark shadows on the entire country, but Kayo still tries to keep her cheerful determination, and sustain the family with her love. This is an emotional drama of a mother and an eternal message for peace.', 'Set in Tokyo in 1940, the peaceful life of the Nogami Family suddenly changes when the father, Shigeru, is arrested and accused of being a Communist. His wife Kayo works frantically from morning to night to maintain the household and bring up her two daughters with the support of Shigeru''s sister Hisako and Shigeru''s ex-student Yamazaki, but her husband does not return. WWII breaks out and casts dark shadows on the entire country, but Kayo still tries to keep her cheerful determination, and sustain the family with her love. This is an emotional drama of a mother and an eternal message for peace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eRa4rdjTYCQzc6urELb0qlEycTE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25746'),
  ('992621779855295749', 'Kabhi Alvida Naa Kehna', 2006, 'Drama, Romance', 'Karan Johar, Anil Mehta, Tarun Mansukhani', 'Shibani Bathija, Karan Johar', 'Shah Rukh Khan, Rani Mukerji, Abhishek Bachchan, Preity Zinta, Amitabh Bachchan, Kirron Kher, Ahsaas Channa, Arjun Rampal', null, 'Dev and Maya are both married to different people. Settled into a life of domestic ritual, and convinced that they are happy in their respective relationships, they still yearn for something deeper and more meaningful, which is precisely what they find in each other.', 'Dev and Maya are both married to different people. Settled into a life of domestic ritual, and convinced that they are happy in their respective relationships, they still yearn for something deeper and more meaningful, which is precisely what they find in each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lwgH4S0km8lD7rk5qy78EKW8YEn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14395'),
  ('706388260871126854', 'Kabhi Haan Kabhi Naa', 1994, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Kundan Shah, Virendra Saini, Raaj Kumar Dahima', 'Kundan Shah, Pankaj Advani', 'Shah Rukh Khan, Suchitra Krishnamoorthi, Deepak Tijori, Satish Shah, Naseeruddin Shah, Tiku Talsania, Ajit Vachani, Rita Bhaduri', null, 'A man belongs to a middle-class family and is intent on pursuing his career with a music group, despite his dad''s disapproval. He is also in love with the lead singer, but she sees him mainly as a friend.', 'A man belongs to a middle-class family and is intent on pursuing his career with a music group, despite his dad''s disapproval. He is also in love with the lead singer, but she sees him mainly as a friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6FtBaFCz3UFFhXyE4JHxQDn43gM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15419'),
  ('1112202908019495290', 'Kabhi Kabhie', 1976, 'Drama, Romance', 'Yash Chopra, Romesh Bhalla', 'Sagar Sarhadi', 'Amitabh Bachchan, Shashi Kapoor, Rishi Kapoor, Rakhee Gulzar, Waheeda Rehman, Neetu Singh, Simi Garewal, Parikshat Sahni', null, 'A story spanning two generations, where two lovers are forced to marry against their will, but hold onto memories of their romance. Years later circumstances force them to confront their spouses, their children and each other.', 'A story spanning two generations, where two lovers are forced to marry against their will, but hold onto memories of their romance. Years later circumstances force them to confront their spouses, their children and each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zi7Gkgt1PHtC96tXafNzrNQwgRp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73443'),
  ('545457763735117430', 'Kabir Singh', 2019, 'Drama, Romance', 'Sandeep Reddy Vanga, Santhana Krishnan Ravichandran, Aditya Awandhe', 'Siddharth Singh, Garima Wahal', 'Shahid Kapoor, Kiara Advani, Arjan Bajwa, Suresh Oberoi, Nikita Dutta, Adil Hussain, Soham Majumdar, Amit Sharma', 'NR', 'Kabir, a genius yet hostile medical student, falls in love with Preeti from his college. When Preeti''s father spots the couple kissing, he opposes their relationship and decides to marry her off.', 'Kabir, a genius yet hostile medical student, falls in love with Preeti from his college. When Preeti''s father spots the couple kissing, he opposes their relationship and decides to marry her off.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/unqiPjtc6CGqs13zho7ZvWU85zu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:577328'),
  ('506779571670219525', 'Kabluey', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Scott Prendergast, Michael Lohmann', 'Scott Prendergast', 'Lisa Kudrow, Christine Taylor, Scott Prendergast, Conchata Ferrell, Jeffrey Dean Morgan, Angela Sarafyan, Chris Parnell, Teri Garr', 'PG-13', 'Leslie is left with few options when her husband is sent back to war in the Middle East. A modest amount of help arrives in the form of his brother, Salman, who is less than prepared to care for the couple''s two preadolescent boys. When Leslie still can''t make ends meet on her own, Salman is forced to find employment, but, with minimal qualifications, his only option is to become a mascot for a digital company by donning a bulbous blue costume.', 'Leslie is left with few options when her husband is sent back to war in the Middle East. A modest amount of help arrives in the form of his brother, Salman, who is less than prepared to care for the couple''s two preadolescent boys. When Leslie still can''t make ends meet on her own, Salman is forced to find employment, but, with minimal qualifications, his only option is to become a mascot for a digital company by donning a bulbous blue costume.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cb7kNCC6he2cXqejMWsmow9dPjD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15654'),
  ('105038457144092448', 'Kaboom', 2010, 'Comedy, Science Fiction, Mystery', 'Gregg Araki, Jake Worden, Ryan Reels', 'Gregg Araki', 'Thomas Dekker, Haley Bennett, Chris Zylka, Roxane Mesquida, Juno Temple, James Duval, Andy Fischer-Price, Brandy Futch', 'NR', 'Smith, a typical young college student who likes partying and engaging in acts of random sex and debauchery, has been having some interesting dreams revolving around two gorgeous women -- and is shocked when he meets the dream girls in real life. Lorelei looks just like his fantasy brunette, while a mysterious red-haired girl being chased by assassins draws him into an international conspiracy. Or is it all just a drug-induced hallucination?', 'Smith, a typical young college student who likes partying and engaging in acts of random sex and debauchery, has been having some interesting dreams revolving around two gorgeous women -- and is shocked when he meets the dream girls in real life. Lorelei looks just like his fantasy brunette, while a mysterious red-haired girl being chased by assassins draws him into an international conspiracy. Or is it all just a drug-induced hallucination?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tMKhfXGDCVlHH5NoGZdiBg0UDeS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46837'),
  ('416355223313052350', 'Kabukicho Love Hotel', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Ryuichi Hiroki, Atsuhiro Nabeshima', 'Haruhiko Arai, Futoshi Nakano', 'Shota Sometani, Atsuko Maeda, Lee Na-ra, Son Il-kwon, Kaho Minami, Yutaka Matsushige, Asuka Hinoi, Miwako Wagatsuma', null, 'This erotically charged drama traces the intersecting stories of a group of employees and visitors at a notorious "love hotel" in Tokyo''s red-light district.', 'This erotically charged drama traces the intersecting stories of a group of employees and visitors at a notorious "love hotel" in Tokyo''s red-light district.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/E1YF095i6S5DFsQHSolKhGYTPV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:287493'),
  ('10060454068982801', 'Kabul Between Prayers', 2026, 'Documentary', 'Aboozar Amini', 'Aboozar Amini, Jia Zhao', null, null, 'A devoted soldier of the Taliban''s ideology that has shaped his destiny since birth, Samim (23) struggles between the alluring promises of martyrdom and the mundanity of his daily existence as a husband and farmer. Samim''s younger brother, Rafi (14), idolizes his big brother as he navigates the confusion of adolescence, leaving behind playfulness to enter a world shaped by decades of military intervention and resulting radicalization.', 'A devoted soldier of the Taliban''s ideology that has shaped his destiny since birth, Samim (23) struggles between the alluring promises of martyrdom and the mundanity of his daily existence as a husband and farmer. Samim''s younger brother, Rafi (14), idolizes his big brother as he navigates the confusion of adolescence, leaving behind playfulness to enter a world shaped by decades of military intervention and resulting radicalization.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fp4chzKk2Pk8Szn4rrZfyUCp6K7G.jpg', 'plex:movie:kabul-between-prayers'),
  ('602418281217780385', 'Kabul Express', 2006, 'Action, Comedy, Drama, Thriller', 'Kabir Khan, Anshuman Mahaley', 'Kabir Khan', 'John Abraham, Arshad Warsi, Salman Shahid, Linda Arsenio, Hanif Hum Ghum', null, 'Five people - two Indian journalists, an American photojournalist, an Afghan guide and a Taliban soldier who takes them all hostage - are taken on a 48-hour journey into Afghanistan in a jeep called the Kabul Express, a special and unlikely bond developing between them along the way.', 'Five people - two Indian journalists, an American photojournalist, an Afghan guide and a Taliban soldier who takes them all hostage - are taken on a 48-hour journey into Afghanistan in a jeep called the Kabul Express, a special and unlikely bond developing between them along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/55JOXvEqxQtB1QQPAEmzCwpXXwY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30244'),
  ('232607820109258583', 'Kachche Dhaage', 1999, 'Action, Drama, Romance', 'Milan Luthria', 'Sanjay Chhel', 'Ajay Devgn, Saif Ali Khan, Manisha Koirala, Namrata Shirodkar, Maya Alagh, Sadashiv Amrapurkar, Govind Namdeo, Annu Kapoor', null, 'Dhananjay and Aaftab are half brothers who have never met. When they first do they instantly loathe each other, having nothing in common. One night, Aaftab blows up a loaded truck while trying to steal from it and attracts a mass of unwanted enforcers. Soon, Aaftab is forced to send Dhananjay into a trap but ends up with them both being handcuffed and escaping from the Border Security Force, the Central Bureau of Investigation, and the border mafia who are attempting to incriminate the brothers for anti-national activities and murder. Fate has it such that they are forced to escape on foot, on motorbikes, cars, stolen trucks, and even handcuffed to each other on a moving goods train.', 'Dhananjay and Aaftab are half brothers who have never met. When they first do they instantly loathe each other, having nothing in common. One night, Aaftab blows up a loaded truck while trying to steal from it and attracts a mass of unwanted enforcers. Soon, Aaftab is forced to send Dhananjay into a trap but ends up with them both being handcuffed and escaping from the Border Security Force, the Central Bureau of Investigation, and the border mafia who are attempting to incriminate the brothers for anti-national activities and murder. Fate has it such that they are forced to escape on foot, on motorbikes, cars, stolen trucks, and even handcuffed to each other on a moving goods train.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dldo2zZgGVlhvKG6DvqJd5nnjAt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:211275'),
  ('352249783934275850', 'Kaçma Birader', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Defne Deliormanlı, Murat Kaman, Olcay Oğuz', 'Emrah Kaman, Murat Kaman', 'Zafer Algöz, Melek Baykal, Emrah Kaman, Algı Eke, Cihan Ercan, Necip Memili, Nursel Köse, Meltem Yılmazkaya', null, 'A family with diversified members travels to İstanbul from Yozgat after their youngest son fell in love with a girl.', 'A family with diversified members travels to İstanbul from Yozgat after their youngest son fell in love with a girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sO27kvr7d9a2QF6JazYl53hODVB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:386579'),
  ('581452334724201271', 'Kadaicha', 1988, 'Horror', 'James Bogle, Deuel Droogan, Paul Grinder', 'Ian Coughlan', 'Zoe Carides, Tom Jennings, Eric Oldfield, Kerry McKay, Fiona Gauntlett, Natalie McCurry, Bruce Hughes, Steve Dodd', null, 'Teens of Kangaloola High are visited by a skull-faced Aboriginal apparition in their nightmares, and one by one they meet a violent end.', 'Teens of Kangaloola High are visited by a skull-faced Aboriginal apparition in their nightmares, and one by one they meet a violent end.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cAX5Q8tHS0MwH9VfUo1uVKlnHqY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132247'),
  ('664678871998887328', 'Kadaisi Vivasayi', 2022, 'Drama', 'M. Manikandan, M. Manikandan, Sivakumar Murugesan', 'M. Manikandan', 'Nallandi, Vijay Sethupathi, Yogi Babu, Muniswaran, Kaalaipandiyan, Raichal Rabecca Philip', null, 'Maayandi, the only farmer in a village that has abandoned farming, is charged with a petty case that leads to his imprisonment.', 'Maayandi, the only farmer in a village that has abandoned farming, is charged with a petty case that leads to his imprisonment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8TNnEojAEc8Kt6HMWgQNRPcL9J3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:613703'),
  ('297343349249985380', 'Kadak Singh', 2023, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Jogi Malang, Avik Mukhopadhyay, Aniruddha Roy Chowdhury', 'Ritesh Shah', 'Pankaj Tripathi, Sanjana Sanghi, Parvathy Thiruvothu, Jaya Ahsan, Dilip Shankar, Paresh Pahuja, Varun Buddhadev, Anindya Sengupta', null, 'AK Shrivastav, a quirky patient suffering from retrograde amnesia, uncovers the reason behind his condition while trying to recollect his life accurately', 'AK Shrivastav, a quirky patient suffering from retrograde amnesia, uncovers the reason behind his condition while trying to recollect his life accurately', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eB7VUbPWvbohPvmYn22XAtpmcvU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1072758'),
  ('130263633435972350', 'Kaddisch für einen Freund', 2012, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Leo Khasin, Mathias Schöningh', 'Leo Khasin', 'Ryszard Ronczewski, Neil Belakhdar, Neil Malik Abdullah, Sanam Afrashteh, Kida Khodr Ramadan, Younes Hussein Ramadan, Heinz W. Krückeberg, Anna Böttcher', null, 'Growing up in a Palestinian refugee camp, 14-year-old Ali Messalam learned to hate "the Jews" from an early age. After fleeing Lebanon with his family, he arrives in Berlin Kreuzberg. Here, Ali tries to make friends with the Arab youths in the neighborhood. But first he has to prove what he can do. As a test of courage, he is asked to break into the apartment of his Jewish-Russian neighbor Alexander. The youngsters follow Ali and trash the old man''s apartment to excess. But only Ali is recognized by Alexander, who returns early, and is reported to the police. In order to avoid a conviction and the associated deportation, he has only one chance: Ali must approach his hated enemy and ask for his support...', 'Growing up in a Palestinian refugee camp, 14-year-old Ali Messalam learned to hate "the Jews" from an early age. After fleeing Lebanon with his family, he arrives in Berlin Kreuzberg. Here, Ali tries to make friends with the Arab youths in the neighborhood. But first he has to prove what he can do. As a test of courage, he is asked to break into the apartment of his Jewish-Russian neighbor Alexander. The youngsters follow Ali and trash the old man''s apartment to excess. But only Ali is recognized by Alexander, who returns early, and is reported to the police. In order to avoid a conviction and the associated deportation, he has only one chance: Ali must approach his hated enemy and ask for his support...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b5CmEXQF6bIiEmUZ7fBc9zkDtZb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87334'),
  ('740772055252020239', 'Kadhal Kadhai Sollava', 2026, 'Drama, Romance', 'Kanmani Raja, Sajan Kalathil', 'Kanmani Raja', 'Jayaram, Athmeeya Rajan, Rittika Sen, Vijay Sethupathi, Nakul', null, 'A heartburns of lovers, without any inhibitions of their ages, people eagerly call him to tell their love stories. The radio program becomes an instant hit with people, meanwhile a young woman named Asha calls him and tells him her love story.', 'A heartburns of lovers, without any inhibitions of their ages, people eagerly call him to tell their love stories. The radio program becomes an instant hit with people, meanwhile a young woman named Asha calls him and tells him her love story.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fm.media-amazon.com%2Fimages%2FM%2FMV5BMjc3MTgxOWQtNWU2Mi00MjZkLWI4NjItZTMwNzM4ODdiYTE3XkEyXkFqcGc%40._V1_.jpg', 'plex:movie:kadhal-kadhai-sollava-2026'),
  ('362375545725405413', 'Kadhala Kadhala', 1998, 'Comedy', 'Singeetam Srinivasa Rao, S. Thirunavukkarasu', 'Kamal Haasan', 'Kamal Haasan, Prabhu Deva, Soundarya, Rambha, Vadivelu, M. S. Viswanathan, Srividya, Cho Ramaswamy', null, 'Two friends, both with the name of Lingam, create a comedy of errors and consequent chaos with their girlfriends and their families.', 'Two friends, both with the name of Lingam, create a comedy of errors and consequent chaos with their girlfriends and their families.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a499eAixHz3C3P7WbGnKzy8sSvv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66349'),
  ('127176290124038032', 'Kadhalukku Mariyaadai', 1997, 'Drama, Romance, Action', 'Fazil, Anandakuttan', 'Fazil', 'Vijay, Shalini, Srividya, Sivakumar, Charle, Dhamu, Radha Ravi, Thalaivasal Vijay', null, 'Jeevanandhan meets Mini in a book shop and their eyes meet leading to sparks of love in their hearts. Mini has a loving mother and three brothers, James, Thomas and Stephen and she is the apple of their eye. Mini is hesitant to reciprocate her love for Jeeva who steadily makes an inroad into her heart, the love affair incensing her family members who give him a thrashing each time he meets her. Jeeva''s parents are under the impression that their son is pursuing his MBA studies until his father receives an SOS from Jeeva, injured in one such beatings. His father Chandrasekhar is stunned by the developments and Jeeva''s mother is also shocked. Jeeva refuses to part company with Mini when his father arrives with his henchmen to take him back.', 'Jeevanandhan meets Mini in a book shop and their eyes meet leading to sparks of love in their hearts. Mini has a loving mother and three brothers, James, Thomas and Stephen and she is the apple of their eye. Mini is hesitant to reciprocate her love for Jeeva who steadily makes an inroad into her heart, the love affair incensing her family members who give him a thrashing each time he meets her. Jeeva''s parents are under the impression that their son is pursuing his MBA studies until his father receives an SOS from Jeeva, injured in one such beatings. His father Chandrasekhar is stunned by the developments and Jeeva''s mother is also shocked. Jeeva refuses to part company with Mini when his father arrives with his henchmen to take him back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/JWhGtMqWatEdePEcTaTNXLXTzc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69660'),
  ('103949775290142636', 'Kadosh', 1999, 'Drama, Romance', 'Amos Gitai, Renato Berta', 'Éliette Abécassis, Amos Gitai', 'Yaël Abecassis, Yoram Hattab, Meital Barda, Uri Klauzner', null, 'The year 2000 approaches in Jerusalem''s Orthodox Mea Shearim quarter, where the women work, keep house, and have children so the men can study the Torah and the Talmud. Rivka is happily and passionately married to Meir, but they remain childless. The yeshiva''s rabbi, who is Meir''s father, wants Meir to divorce Rivka: "a barren woman is no woman." Rivka''s sister, Malka, is in love with Yakov, a Jew shunned by the yeshiva as too secular. The rabbi arranges Malka''s marriage to Yossef, whose agitation when fulfilling religious duties approaches the grotesque. Can the sisters sort out their hearts'' desires within this patriarchal world? If not, have they any other options?', 'The year 2000 approaches in Jerusalem''s Orthodox Mea Shearim quarter, where the women work, keep house, and have children so the men can study the Torah and the Talmud. Rivka is happily and passionately married to Meir, but they remain childless. The yeshiva''s rabbi, who is Meir''s father, wants Meir to divorce Rivka: "a barren woman is no woman." Rivka''s sister, Malka, is in love with Yakov, a Jew shunned by the yeshiva as too secular. The rabbi arranges Malka''s marriage to Yossef, whose agitation when fulfilling religious duties approaches the grotesque. Can the sisters sort out their hearts'' desires within this patriarchal world? If not, have they any other options?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mQML6VNcmW80YlyS0Cfp7hnnrdP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40476'),
  ('433644302410113136', 'Kadri''nin Götürdüğü Yere Git', 2009, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Onur Tan', 'Uğur Uludağ', 'Şafak Sezer, Alp Kırşan, Ahmet Mümtaz Taylan, Esin Civangil, Eylem Şenkal, Nilgün Belgün, Cem Özer, Uğur Uludağ', null, 'Kadri and Cem are such good friends that they would do anything for each other. Cem has experienced a major disappointment in his love life and is in a state of depression. To help him get back to his old self, Kadir takes Cem to the Dionysos Hotel, the most beautiful hotel in Antalya. However, the hotel has another surprise in store: Cem''s ex-girlfriend Betül and her new boyfriend Hakan. This situation drags Kadir and Cem into a series of comical events. USTA (International Cinema Television Workshop), of which Cem Özer is a partner, brings together master actors in the same cast for its first comedy film.', 'Kadri and Cem are such good friends that they would do anything for each other. Cem has experienced a major disappointment in his love life and is in a state of depression. To help him get back to his old self, Kadir takes Cem to the Dionysos Hotel, the most beautiful hotel in Antalya. However, the hotel has another surprise in store: Cem''s ex-girlfriend Betül and her new boyfriend Hakan. This situation drags Kadir and Cem into a series of comical events. USTA (International Cinema Television Workshop), of which Cem Özer is a partner, brings together master actors in the same cast for its first comedy film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/96g0Vb0FE08ufH4wchtrrXwxsxF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52136'),
  ('1043726214527726063', 'Kaena: The Prophecy', 2003, 'Animation, Adventure', 'Pascal Pinon, Chris Delaporte, Patrick Bonneau', 'Patrick Daher', 'Cécile de France, Michael Lonsdale, Victoria Abril, François Siener, Jean-Michel Farcy, Jean Piat, Raymond Aquaviva, Adrien Antoine', 'PG-13', 'Compelled by a mysterious force, Kaena, a rebellious, high-spirited teenage girl will defy the High Priest and her people''s ancestral beliefs to take the perilous journey through the Axis and discover what dark secrets lie beyond the clouds.', 'Compelled by a mysterious force, Kaena, a rebellious, high-spirited teenage girl will defy the High Priest and her people''s ancestral beliefs to take the perilous journey through the Axis and discover what dark secrets lie beyond the clouds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ihIIh8BR9YwtG2noVZ3enkiiozb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11572'),
  ('378921939324232120', 'Kafes', 2015, 'Drama', 'Mahmut Kaptan', 'Lütfü Şehsuvaroğlu', 'İsmail Hacıoğlu, Nilay Duru, Şefik Onatoğlu, Fırat Şahin, Melda Arat, Erdal Cindoruk, Fatih Doğan, Cem Sultan Karabulut', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A2C7LH2MFFyikvrpqqVc9Y9y9Y7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:374867'),
  ('500790052543532813', 'Kafka', 1991, 'Drama, Mystery, Science Fiction', 'Steven Soderbergh, Walt Lloyd, Martin Malý', 'Lem Dobbs', 'Jeremy Irons, Theresa Russell, Joel Grey, Ian Holm, Jeroen Krabbé, Armin Mueller-Stahl, Alec Guinness, Brian Glover', 'PG-13', 'After a colleague is murdered, insurance worker Kafka gets embroiled in an underground group who are attempting to thwart a secret organization that controls the major events in society.', 'After a colleague is murdered, insurance worker Kafka gets embroiled in an underground group who are attempting to thwart a secret organization that controls the major events in society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eQh6IlLbQzqqgedwGcj3l9Ex3xJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2297'),
  ('734162091845060675', 'Kagero-za', 1981, 'Romance, Drama, Mystery', 'Seijun Suzuki, Kazue Nagatsuka', 'Yōzō Tanaka', 'Yūsaku Matsuda, Michiyo Yasuda, Eriko Kusuta, Yoshio Harada, Mariko Kaga, Katsuo Nakamura, Ryutaro Otomo, Eimei Esumi', null, 'A 1920s playwright meets a beautiful woman who may be the ghost of his patron''s deceased wife.', 'A 1920s playwright meets a beautiful woman who may be the ghost of his patron''s deceased wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c34WkpKgKQyg0SagGPgs72TO3hP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110901'),
  ('732600864634833942', 'Kaguya-sama Final: Love Is War', 2021, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Hayato Kawai', 'Yuichi Tokunaga', 'Sho Hirano, Kanna Hashimoto, Hayato Sano, Nana Asakawa, Mayu Hotta, Yuka Kageyama, Jiro Sato, Haruka Fukuhara', null, 'After years of intense mental battle, the war between Kaguya and Shirogane heads towards its crashing end. Who will be the first to admit their love?', 'After years of intense mental battle, the war between Kaguya and Shirogane heads towards its crashing end. Who will be the first to admit their love?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sM7kzxCXOQmdCiZNejMkfAxOo0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:852626'),
  ('1119276255087729436', 'Kaguya-sama: Love Is War', 2019, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Hayato Kawai, Tatsuya Yoshimura', 'Yuichi Tokunaga', 'Sho Hirano, Kanna Hashimoto, Hayato Sano, Nana Asakawa, Mayu Hotta, Natsumi Ikema, Masahiro Takashima, Jiro Sato', null, 'A high school girl and boy are part of the student council at a pricey school. They have a crush on one another, but have kept it under wraps so far. With awareness and an inkling of what the other one feels for each the challenge becomes to make the opposite side profess his or her love first.', 'A high school girl and boy are part of the student council at a pricey school. They have a crush on one another, but have kept it under wraps so far. With awareness and an inkling of what the other one feels for each the challenge becomes to make the opposite side profess his or her love first.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vhnzRUegUdydDA7DXyYpwn8bl9E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:617402'),
  ('581433780792365639', 'Kaguya-sama: Love Is War -The First Kiss That Never Ends-', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy, Romance', 'Hiroshi Yakou, Mamoru Hatakeyama, Yuki Kuribayashi', 'Yasuhiro Nakanishi', 'Makoto Furukawa, Aoi Koga, Konomi Kohara, Ryota Suzuki, Miyu Tomita, Yumiri Hanamori, Momo Asakura, Rina Hidaka', 'NR', 'After pining for one another and plotting for so long, Kaguya Shinomiya and Miyuki Shirogane finally have their climactic first kiss. However, they struggle to define their relationship. After all, how much of their true selves have they really shown to one another?', 'After pining for one another and plotting for so long, Kaguya Shinomiya and Miyuki Shirogane finally have their climactic first kiss. However, they struggle to define their relationship. After all, how much of their true selves have they really shown to one another?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jY092qLqa7qTMelwRiNPpLUolEz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:997317'),
  ('816401153674219372', 'Kahaani', 2012, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Sujoy Ghosh, Satyajit Pande', 'Sujoy Ghosh', 'Vidya Balan, Parambrata Chatterjee, Nawazuddin Siddiqui, Saswata Chatterjee, Kharaj Mukherjee, Dhritiman Chatterjee, Darshan Jariwala, Indraneil Sengupta', null, 'Pregnant and alone in the city of Kolkata, a woman begins a relentless search for her missing husband, only to find that nothing is what it seems.', 'Pregnant and alone in the city of Kolkata, a woman begins a relentless search for her missing husband, only to find that nothing is what it seems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/shsN1B7IPAQG1NLF6WVVi3X89lM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82825'),
  ('460888692867588851', 'Kahaani 2', 2016, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Sujoy Ghosh, Tapan Tushar Basu', 'Sujoy Ghosh', 'Vidya Balan, Arjun Rampal, Jugal Hansraj, Tota Roy Chowdhury, Kharaj Mukherjee, Naisha Khanna, Tunisha Sharma, Ardhendu Banerjee', 'PG-13', 'Vidya Sinha has only one obsession in life. She wants to see her teenage daughter Mini, who is paralysed waist-downwards, walk again. But, is this scenario as obvious as it seems? Or is Vidya an impersonator of Durga Rani Singh from Kalimpong, who is wanted for kidnapping and murder?', 'Vidya Sinha has only one obsession in life. She wants to see her teenage daughter Mini, who is paralysed waist-downwards, walk again. But, is this scenario as obvious as it seems? Or is Vidya an impersonator of Durga Rani Singh from Kalimpong, who is wanted for kidnapping and murder?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uT1wPvg5UBPCHkWAlgYQutgbsW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:413547'),
  ('994897107479192844', 'Kahin Pyaar Na Ho Jaaye', 2000, 'Romance, Family, Comedy', 'K. Murali Mohana Rao', 'Sanjay Chhel, Abbas Hirapurwala, Manoj Lalwani', 'Salman Khan, Rani Mukerji, Jackie Shroff, Raveena Tandon, Pooja Batra, Mohnish Behl, Kashmera Shah, Shakti Kapoor', null, 'Prem is in love with Nisha and plans to marry her, but on the day of the marriage Nisha does not show up. When Prem asks for an explanation, Nisha tells him that she is marrying a rich and wealthy young man from the US instead, who will be able to look after her and her ailing brother, devastating Prem.', 'Prem is in love with Nisha and plans to marry her, but on the day of the marriage Nisha does not show up. When Prem asks for an explanation, Nisha tells him that she is marrying a rich and wealthy young man from the US instead, who will be able to look after her and her ailing brother, devastating Prem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cb8oOM20UYi0BrmBKvRe9ZHOyKr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161219'),
  ('238115166486770180', 'Kahlil Gibran''s The Prophet', 2014, 'Animation', 'Roger Allers, Bill Plympton, Gaëtan Brizzi', 'Roger Allers', 'Salma Hayek Pinault, Liam Neeson, John Krasinski, Alfred Molina, Frank Langella, Quvenzhané Wallis, Assaf Cohen, Terri Douglas', 'PG', 'Exiled artist and poet Mustafa embarks on a journey home with his housekeeper and her daughter; together the trio must evade the authorities who fear that the truth in Mustafa''s words will incite rebellion.', 'Exiled artist and poet Mustafa embarks on a journey home with his housekeeper and her daughter; together the trio must evade the authorities who fear that the truth in Mustafa''s words will incite rebellion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rkg2thsR4r4H02FVVW1M1FyqhpL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:283161'),
  ('352665155775488884', 'Kaho Naa... Pyaar Hai', 2000, 'Romance, Drama, Action, Comedy', 'Rakesh Roshan, Kabir Lal', 'Ravi Kapoor, Honey Irani', 'Hrithik Roshan, Ameesha Patel, Anupam Kher, Dalip Tahil, Mohnish Behl, Ashish Vidhyarthi, Tannaz Irani, Johny Lever', null, 'Sonia and Rohit love each other but Rohit is mysteriously killed. When Sonia moves to New Zealand, she meets Raj, Rohit''s lookalike who helps her trace Rohit''s killer.', 'Sonia and Rohit love each other but Rohit is mysteriously killed. When Sonia moves to New Zealand, she meets Raj, Rohit''s lookalike who helps her trace Rohit''s killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/alALytPcaZyQkzOjnRgHMSRv8fq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16987'),
  ('165975307118308062', 'Kai Doh Maru', 2001, 'Animation, Action, Fantasy', 'Kanji Wakabayashi, Keiichi Momose', 'Nobuhisa Terado', 'Mitsuki Saiga, Showtaro Morikubo, Fumiko Osaka, Yurika Hino, Ai Orikasa, Hikaru Hanada, Ikue Kimura, Satoru Yanase', null, 'The battle for the Capital city of Kyo rages as warring political factions vie for power against hereditary rulers. After the murder of her parents at the hands of her seditious uncle, a young girl named Kintoki flees to the mountains to lead a harsh life; she is renamed Kai Doh Maru by the local villagers. Rescued by Raiko, the Captain of ''The Four Knights'' - honorable defenders who protect the peace of the city, she is raised within their group as a boy. Living among the Knights, she learns the practices of martial arts and develops into a skillful samurai, becoming a permanent member of their team. Now, as a young woman of seventeen, she begins to discover new feelings of passion and love for Raiko... but she also discovers that these new emotions cause a storm of jealousy and rage in another woman linked to her past.', 'The battle for the Capital city of Kyo rages as warring political factions vie for power against hereditary rulers. After the murder of her parents at the hands of her seditious uncle, a young girl named Kintoki flees to the mountains to lead a harsh life; she is renamed Kai Doh Maru by the local villagers. Rescued by Raiko, the Captain of ''The Four Knights'' - honorable defenders who protect the peace of the city, she is raised within their group as a boy. Living among the Knights, she learns the practices of martial arts and develops into a skillful samurai, becoming a permanent member of their team. Now, as a young woman of seventeen, she begins to discover new feelings of passion and love for Raiko... but she also discovers that these new emotions cause a storm of jealousy and rage in another woman linked to her past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9WFsZDnVWDvx7kCEkMTaKzEnl9h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44604'),
  ('126075716164012990', 'Kai Po Che!', 2013, 'Drama', 'Abhishek Kapoor, Anay Goswami, Mukesh Chhabra', 'Pubali Chaudhuri, Supratik Sen', 'Sushant Singh Rajput, Rajkummar Rao, Amit Sadh, Amrita Puri, Asif Basra, Manav Kaul, Tahir Raj Bhasin, Ajay Jadeja', 'NR', 'Three friends growing up in India at the turn of the millennium set out to open a training academy to produce the country''s next cricket stars.', 'Three friends growing up in India at the turn of the millennium set out to open a training academy to produce the country''s next cricket stars.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cAlv5vmDXzpVmTCk4DmggUbW7cd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:168245'),
  ('606452104281209196', 'Kaidan', 2007, 'Drama, Horror, Romance', 'Hideo Nakata, Ryuichi Saeki', 'Satoko Okudera', 'Kumiko Aso, Takaaki Enoki, Léona Hirota, Hitomi Kuroki, Tae Kimura, Asaka Seto, Kikunosuke Onoe V, Mao Inoue', null, 'Japan, 250 years ago. Soetsu is a moneylender who is killed by the cruel samurai Shinzaemon. His body is dumped in the Kasenega-Fuchi river. According to legend, all who drown in the river will never surface again. 20 Years later, Shinkichi, the handsome son of Shinzaemon, coincidentally meets Toyoshiga, the daughter of Soetsu. They fall in love. It is a doomed love, as the spirit of Soetsu is far from dead', 'Japan, 250 years ago. Soetsu is a moneylender who is killed by the cruel samurai Shinzaemon. His body is dumped in the Kasenega-Fuchi river. According to legend, all who drown in the river will never surface again. 20 Years later, Shinkichi, the handsome son of Shinzaemon, coincidentally meets Toyoshiga, the daughter of Soetsu. They fall in love. It is a doomed love, as the spirit of Soetsu is far from dead', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/movnIIJVG6LVZaRDsOP2BHiDcx3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73043'),
  ('718569867340694407', 'Kaiji 2: The Ultimate Gambler', 2011, 'Thriller, Drama, Mystery', 'Osamu Fujiishi, Tōya Satō', 'Jun''ya Yamazaki, Nobuyuki Fukumoto, Sachiko Ôguchi', 'Tatsuya Fujiwara, Yūsuke Iseya, Yuriko Yoshitaka, Katsuhisa Namase, Teruyuki Kagawa, Yoshizumi Ito, Hayato Kakizawa', null, '3 years after the ultimate life-or-death game with Teiai Group, Kaiji was entrapped by Teiai and again back in the underground, forced to do hard labour. One day, Kaiji wins a bet to get out of the underground with 1 million yen, and promises the other workers that he will save them. But to do so, he only has 14 days and needs 200 million yen! Kaiji meets his former rival Tonegawa and learns that there is a chance to turn the tables in the game. It was a monster casino machine that will make 1 billion yen if you win...', '3 years after the ultimate life-or-death game with Teiai Group, Kaiji was entrapped by Teiai and again back in the underground, forced to do hard labour. One day, Kaiji wins a bet to get out of the underground with 1 million yen, and promises the other workers that he will save them. But to do so, he only has 14 days and needs 200 million yen! Kaiji meets his former rival Tonegawa and learns that there is a chance to turn the tables in the game. It was a monster casino machine that will make 1 billion yen if you win...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zoSlYU7XoMcfZzk2ek199i4TJ8U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106417'),
  ('502686545692201820', 'Kaiji: Final Game', 2020, 'Action, Drama, Thriller, Mystery', 'Tōya Satō', 'Nobuyuki Fukumoto', 'Tatsuya Fujiwara, Sota Fukushi, Mackenyu, Nagisa Sekimizu, Kotaro Yoshida, Yuki Amami, Suzuki Matsuo, Katsuhisa Namase', null, 'Kaiji (played by Tatsuya Fujiwara) is about to have his life changed. The thrill is beyond anything he, or most people, have experienced. The adventure is not without risk and danger however. He is given four games, which are challenges, and include life and death situations. The film follows its prequels and things will get both mental and physical.', 'Kaiji (played by Tatsuya Fujiwara) is about to have his life changed. The thrill is beyond anything he, or most people, have experienced. The adventure is not without risk and danger however. He is given four games, which are challenges, and include life and death situations. The film follows its prequels and things will get both mental and physical.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cgkLaYfPzumdBKxC33EttpURnKn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:663509'),
  ('610862328347905948', 'Kaiji: The Ultimate Gambler', 2009, 'Thriller, Drama, Mystery', 'Tōya Satō, Katsumi Yanagijima', 'Mika Ohmori, Nobuyuki Fukumoto', 'Tatsuya Fujiwara, Yuki Amami, Teruyuki Kagawa, Taro Yamamoto, Ken Mitsuishi, Kenichi Matsuyama, Suzuki Matsuo, Kei Satō', null, 'Kaiji Ito moves to Japan after graduating from high school. Unable to find a job and frustrated with society at large, Kaiji spends his days gambling, vandalizing cars, and drinking booze. Two years later and his life is no better. A debt collector named Endo arrives to collect money owed. The debt collector offers two choices to Kaiji: spend 10 years paying off his loan or board a gambling boat for one night to repay his debt & possibly make a boat load of money. Could the debt collector Endo actually be setting up Kaiji? One way or another, for Kaiji it''s going to be the night of his life.', 'Kaiji Ito moves to Japan after graduating from high school. Unable to find a job and frustrated with society at large, Kaiji spends his days gambling, vandalizing cars, and drinking booze. Two years later and his life is no better. A debt collector named Endo arrives to collect money owed. The debt collector offers two choices to Kaiji: spend 10 years paying off his loan or board a gambling boat for one night to repay his debt & possibly make a boat load of money. Could the debt collector Endo actually be setting up Kaiji? One way or another, for Kaiji it''s going to be the night of his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8C7ga0p7Ae2l38TsP82OpWgAMno.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37961'),
  ('178811910862419818', 'Kaiju No. 8: Mission Recon', 2025, 'Animation, Action, Science Fiction', 'Shigeyuki Miya, Tomomi Kamiya', 'Ichiro Okouchi', 'Masaya Fukunishi, Wataru Katoh, Fairouz Ai, Tessyo Genda, Kengo Kawanishi, Keisuke Komoto, Kenta Miyake, Sayaka Senbongi', 'NR', 'In a Kaiju-filled Japan, Kafka Hibino works in monster disposal. After reuniting with his childhood friend Mina Ashiro, a rising star in the anti-Kaiju Defense Force, he decides to pursue his abandoned dream of joining the Force, when he suddenly transforms into the powerful "Kaiju No. 8." An action-packed recap of the first season of Kaiju No. 8 and a new original episode, Hoshina''s Day Off.', 'In a Kaiju-filled Japan, Kafka Hibino works in monster disposal. After reuniting with his childhood friend Mina Ashiro, a rising star in the anti-Kaiju Defense Force, he decides to pursue his abandoned dream of joining the Force, when he suddenly transforms into the powerful "Kaiju No. 8." An action-packed recap of the first season of Kaiju No. 8 and a new original episode, Hoshina''s Day Off.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1aEfyTWUK8ZBk4aw7Ck0qEoF8PW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1326106'),
  ('322876295806820142', 'Kaili Blues', 2016, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Bi Gan, Tianxing Wang, Chen Ji', 'Bi Gan', 'Chen Yongzhong, Daqing Zhao, Feiyang Luo, Lixun Xie, Shuai Zeng, Qin Guangqian, Shixue Yu, Guo Yue', 'NR', 'Chen Sheng goes off in search of his nephew who has been abandoned by his father. Along the way, he encounters numerous people from his past and also those from his future.', 'Chen Sheng goes off in search of his nephew who has been abandoned by his father. Along the way, he encounters numerous people from his past and also those from his future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eYRlg4v9FkdtWtDs66iViovE9Bf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:362178'),
  ('718348785972446703', 'Kaina of the Great Snow Sea: Star Sage', 2023, 'Animation, Fantasy', 'Hiroaki Ando', 'Tetsuya Yamada, Sadayuki Murai', 'Yoshimasa Hosoya, Rie Takahashi, Ayumu Murase, Maaya Sakamoto, Katsuyuki Konishi, Tomokazu Sugita, Nobuyuki Hiyama, Kenyu Horiuchi', null, 'Kaina returns to the icy Canopy, unsure of what he should do next. He and Ririha have brought peace to Atland and Valghia through an alliance. Now supplies run low, and the people need answers. Kaina, Ririha, and their small party set out to cross the snow in search of the great orbital spire tree. This is the first step to saving their people. Join Kaina on an expedition to save mankind!', 'Kaina returns to the icy Canopy, unsure of what he should do next. He and Ririha have brought peace to Atland and Valghia through an alliance. Now supplies run low, and the people need answers. Kaina, Ririha, and their small party set out to cross the snow in search of the great orbital spire tree. This is the first step to saving their people. Join Kaina on an expedition to save mankind!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tknSJyInVeBZhaIUHlzPpqA45Ej.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1071101'),
  ('362875605596678961', 'Kairat', 1992, 'Drama', 'Aubakir Suleev, Darezhan Omirbayev', 'Darezhan Omirbayev', 'Kairat Mahmetov, Indira Jeksembaeva, Baljan Bisembekova, Samat Beysenbin, Talgat Assetov', null, 'Living in Almaty, Kazakhstan, a young man is preparing to become a bus conductor. One day, in between wandering the city streets and going to the movies, he makes the acquaintance of a female student.', 'Living in Almaty, Kazakhstan, a young man is preparing to become a bus conductor. One day, in between wandering the city streets and going to the movies, he makes the acquaintance of a female student.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pzEYrQkRZaofAupeAB6ZVJNGYO3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162453'),
  ('492854953668067402', 'Kaiserschmarrndrama', 2021, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Stephan Schuh, Ed Herzog, Fabio Coletta', 'Ed Herzog, Stefan Betz', 'Sebastian Bezzel, Simon Schwarz, Lisa Maria Potthoff, Nora Waldstätten, Enzi Fuchs, Daniel Christensen, Olivia Pascal, Michael Ostrowski', null, 'A dicey murder investigation. A fuming best friend. A chaotic living situation. Village police officer Franz Eberhofer has a lot on his plate right now.', 'A dicey murder investigation. A fuming best friend. A chaotic living situation. Village police officer Franz Eberhofer has a lot on his plate right now.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sCv2XqNSUayGNfzB1Z2V0FhACu2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:700578'),
  ('1016223771595962959', 'Kaithi', 2019, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Lokesh Kanagaraj, Sathyan Sooryan', 'Lokesh Kanagaraj', 'Karthi, Narain, Arjun Das, Harish Uthaman, George Mariyan, KPY Dheena, Ramana, Amzath Khan', null, 'Dilli, a convicted criminal, is out on parole to meet his daughter. However, a drug bust sets him off on a mission to save the life of police officers.', 'Dilli, a convicted criminal, is out on parole to meet his daughter. However, a drug bust sets him off on a mission to save the life of police officers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mxvOvom5zKRp4WPURKrhjoatt4P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:587030'),
  ('1076346795205220499', 'Kaito Ruby', 1988, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Osame Maruike, Makoto Wada, Hideyuki Hirayama', 'Makoto Wada', 'Kyoko Koizumi, Hiroyuki Sanada, Kumi Mizuno, Kazuo Katō, Hiroko Isayama, Hideyo Amamoto, Kyôko Takami, Hideko Yoshida', null, 'Toru Hayashi is an unremarkable bachelor who lives with his mother, until one day a young woman named Rumi moves in in the apartment upstairs. Rumi is a self-proclaimed master thief, but she needs socially awkward Toru''s help to actually kickstart her so-called career.', 'Toru Hayashi is an unremarkable bachelor who lives with his mother, until one day a young woman named Rumi moves in in the apartment upstairs. Rumi is a self-proclaimed master thief, but she needs socially awkward Toru''s help to actually kickstart her so-called career.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f8KEfCaA6gTxhfg4Xk0LKeNJfQA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:500160'),
  ('334063800492514138', 'Kaizen', 2024, 'Documentary, TV Movie', 'Basile Monnot, Emilien Bernaux', 'Basile Monnot, Samy Bouyssié, Ines Benazzouz', 'Ines Benazzouz, Mathis Dumas, Manish Tamang', null, 'Becoming a mountaineer and climbing Everest in exactly one year? That’s the dream of Inoxtag, a 21-year-old very rich YouTuber who doesn’t do any sports. By following him for a year, we will discover in this documentary all the changes in his life to achieve this dream.', 'Becoming a mountaineer and climbing Everest in exactly one year? That’s the dream of Inoxtag, a 21-year-old very rich YouTuber who doesn’t do any sports. By following him for a year, we will discover in this documentary all the changes in his life to achieve this dream.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mbpZW0TOykpaEZwEIO5RR4ul3ca.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1341552'),
  ('50035918227605774', 'Kaizoku Sentai Gokaiger vs. Space Sheriff Gavan: The Movie', 2012, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Shojiro Nakazawa, Fumio Matsumura, Hirofumi Ishigaki', 'Naruhisa Arakawa', 'Ryota Ozawa, Yuki Yamada, Mao Ichimichi, Kazuki Shimizu, Yui Koike, Junya Ikeda, Kenji Ohba, Shiro Sano', null, 'The legendary Space Sheriff Gavan is hired to capture the Kaizoku Sentai Gokaiger. However, Gavan himself is captured by Ashurada, a Zangyack prison chief and descendant of his old enemy Don Horror, and jailed in the worst prison in the universe. The Gokaigers resolve to rescue the sheriff from the prison and join forces with him to fight Ashurada.', 'The legendary Space Sheriff Gavan is hired to capture the Kaizoku Sentai Gokaiger. However, Gavan himself is captured by Ashurada, a Zangyack prison chief and descendant of his old enemy Don Horror, and jailed in the worst prison in the universe. The Gokaigers resolve to rescue the sheriff from the prison and join forces with him to fight Ashurada.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Qw53GWAfnIEdqAQ9HGFmlInsie.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:200424'),
  ('654710902710060444', 'Kaizoku Sentai Gokaiger: The Movie - The Flying Ghost Ship', 2011, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction, Fantasy, Horror', 'Katsuya Watanabe, Fumie Arakawa, Kazuyuki Chatani', 'Naruhisa Arakawa', 'Ryota Ozawa, Yuki Yamada, Mao Ichimichi, Kazuki Shimizu, Yui Koike, Junya Ikeda, Yukari Tamura, Hirofumi Nojima', null, 'The Gokaigers embark on a quest to find the ghost ship that harbors the legendary God Eye, which grants any wish to whoever wields it. During their adventure, they must face Los Dark, the captain of the ghost ship, and a host of revived enemies of the previous Super Sentai teams such as Agent Abrella and Baseball Mask.', 'The Gokaigers embark on a quest to find the ghost ship that harbors the legendary God Eye, which grants any wish to whoever wields it. During their adventure, they must face Los Dark, the captain of the ghost ship, and a host of revived enemies of the previous Super Sentai teams such as Agent Abrella and Baseball Mask.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y0Pd9zQg261GaLri5RKhhRkacbB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:200426'),
  ('292434305481517627', 'Kaizoku Sentai: Ten Gokaiger', 2021, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Shojiro Nakazawa, Koichiro Hayama, Toshihiro Ogura', 'Naruhisa Arakawa', 'Ryota Ozawa, Yuki Yamada, Mao Ichimichi, Kazuki Shimizu, Yui Koike, Junya Ikeda, Tomokazu Seki, Kei Hosogai', null, 'Ten years have passed since the defeat of the Zangyack Empire, and the Gokaigers have seemingly disbanded and gone their separate ways. On Earth, “Super Sentai Derby Colosseum” has become the hottest gambling venue ever, with various Super Sentai battling each other for charitable causes. Suddenly, Captain Marvelous appears, issuing a challenge to the Colosseum’s administration and those who work for them... including Gai Ikari! Is it the Gokaigers or the people of Earth who have changed in the past ten years? And what of Joe, Luka, Doc, and Ahim? After ten years, an extraordinary battle is about to begin…', 'Ten years have passed since the defeat of the Zangyack Empire, and the Gokaigers have seemingly disbanded and gone their separate ways. On Earth, “Super Sentai Derby Colosseum” has become the hottest gambling venue ever, with various Super Sentai battling each other for charitable causes. Suddenly, Captain Marvelous appears, issuing a challenge to the Colosseum’s administration and those who work for them... including Gai Ikari! Is it the Gokaigers or the people of Earth who have changed in the past ten years? And what of Joe, Luka, Doc, and Ahim? After ten years, an extraordinary battle is about to begin…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aLb9GEXbvEyiMdMHAXv4oTQXiVn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:844041'),
  ('870915061287749921', 'Kajaki', 2014, 'Thriller, War, Adventure, Drama', 'Paul Katis, Chris Goodger', 'Tom Williams', 'Mark Stanley, Malachi Kirby, Ali Cook, David Elliot, Paul Luebke, Benjamin O''Mahony, Scott Kyle, Andy Gibbins', 'R', 'British soldiers guarding the Kajaki Dam set out to rescue a three-man team after one of them loses a leg to a landmine.', 'British soldiers guarding the Kajaki Dam set out to rescue a three-man team after one of them loses a leg to a landmine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/csL2D3ZbcxSoqoWyhYz4lDjdmk2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:306650'),
  ('646806704259405266', 'Kajillionaire', 2020, 'Crime, Drama, Comedy', 'Miranda July, Sebastian Winterø, Matthew Janssen', 'Miranda July, Elizabeth Litvitskiy', 'Evan Rachel Wood, Debra Winger, Gina Rodriguez, Richard Jenkins, Patricia Belcher, Kim Estes, Da''Vine Joy Randolph, Rachel Redleaf', 'R', 'Two con artists have spent 26 years training their only daughter to swindle, scam and steal at every turn. During a desperate and hastily conceived heist, they charm a stranger into joining them, only to have their entire world turned upside down.', 'Two con artists have spent 26 years training their only daughter to swindle, scam and steal at every turn. During a desperate and hastily conceived heist, they charm a stranger into joining them, only to have their entire world turned upside down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fkqJJDb4u9rEyJu8Jm8H1P2mux4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:541305'),
  ('615680785783985314', 'Kakashi', 2001, 'Horror', 'Norio Tsuruta', 'Ryuta Miyake, Osamu Murakami, Satoru Tamaki', 'Maho Nonami, Ko Shibasaki, Grace Yip Pui-Man, Yoshiki Arizono, Mizuho Igarashi, Yoji Tanaka, Kenzō Kawarasaki, Yukimi Koyanagi', null, 'The search for her vanished brother Tsuyoshi leads Kaoru to the lonesome village Kozukata in the Japanese back-land. The locals react repelling to her, which the exception of the Chinese girl Sally. As her car breaks down Kaoru is trapped in the village; will she have to repay for something she has done in the past?', 'The search for her vanished brother Tsuyoshi leads Kaoru to the lonesome village Kozukata in the Japanese back-land. The locals react repelling to her, which the exception of the Chinese girl Sally. As her car breaks down Kaoru is trapped in the village; will she have to repay for something she has done in the past?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yaMMtBDaDgUJ913qKkqayy6P21F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68527'),
  ('1004286373133543839', 'Kakegurui 2: Desperate Russian Roulette', 2021, 'Mystery, Thriller, Drama', 'Shinya Nagano, Tsutomu Hanabusa', 'Tsutomu Hanabusa, Minato Takano', 'Minami Hamabe, Ryusei Fujii, Mahiro Takasugi, Aoi Morikawa, Elaiza Ikeda, Yuma Yamoto, Yurika Nakamura, Natsume Mito', null, 'A school appears peaceful from a distance, but a fierce gambling battle takes place once again. Yumeko Jabami is involved in the battle.', 'A school appears peaceful from a distance, but a fierce gambling battle takes place once again. Yumeko Jabami is involved in the battle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ooO14QVGs9MWid8ItKra26jeQUP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:742396'),
  ('277592289490289728', 'Kakegurui: The Movie', 2019, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Takashi Komatsu, Tsutomu Hanabusa, Shinya Nagano', 'Minato Takano', 'Minami Hamabe, Mahiro Takasugi, Aoi Morikawa, Hio Miyazawa, Haruka Fukuhara, Marika Ito, Ruka Matsuda, Natsumi Okamoto', null, 'Hyakkaou Private Academy. An institution for the privileged with a very peculiar curriculum. You see, when you''re the sons and daughters of the wealthiest of the wealthy, it''s not athletic prowess or book smarts that keep you ahead. It''s reading your opponent, the art of the deal. What better way to hone those skills than with a rigorous curriculum of gambling? At Hyakkaou Private Academy, the winners live like kings, and the losers are put through the wringer. But when Yumeko Jabami enrols, she''s gonna teach these kids what a high roller really looks like!', 'Hyakkaou Private Academy. An institution for the privileged with a very peculiar curriculum. You see, when you''re the sons and daughters of the wealthiest of the wealthy, it''s not athletic prowess or book smarts that keep you ahead. It''s reading your opponent, the art of the deal. What better way to hone those skills than with a rigorous curriculum of gambling? At Hyakkaou Private Academy, the winners live like kings, and the losers are put through the wringer. But when Yumeko Jabami enrols, she''s gonna teach these kids what a high roller really looks like!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gA7DbJXZZDUNslMtx70QIK3wMYT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:564251'),
  ('208677957511821807', 'Kakekomi', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Masato Harada', 'Masato Harada', 'Erika Toda, Hikari Mitsushima, Yo Oizumi, Kirin Kiki, Shinichi Tsutsumi, Rina Uchiyama, Tsutomu Yamazaki, Shinji Takeda', null, 'Kakekomi tells the stories of Edo women in the 1800s that escape abusive husbands and lovers by taking refuge in Tokeiji, a monastery in Kamakura.', 'Kakekomi tells the stories of Edo women in the 1800s that escape abusive husbands and lovers by taking refuge in Tokeiji, a monastery in Kamakura.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oGYqLiLNezyUFaTdVCHe5HCD853.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:353760'),
  ('752222213070583930', 'Kakera: A Piece of Our Life', 2009, 'Drama, Romance', 'Momoko Ando, Koichi Ishii', 'Momoko Ando', 'Hikari Mitsushima, Eriko Nakamura, Ken Mitsuishi, Tasuku Nagaoka, Rino Katase, Ryu Morioka, Toshie Negishi, Megumi Ohori', null, 'A college student''s relationship is going nowhere until she meets a bisexual medical artist who makes prosthetic body parts.', 'A college student''s relationship is going nowhere until she meets a bisexual medical artist who makes prosthetic body parts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kPORvVq2qGsA1PWbblwkaKf7L8X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62390'),
  ('1126763073099668916', 'Kakkientruppen', 1977, 'Comedy', 'Marino Girolami, Marino Girolami', 'Carlo Veo, Marino Girolami', 'Gianfranco D''Angelo, Lino Banfi, Oreste Lionello, Mario Carotenuto, Riccardo Miniggio, Gian', null, 'Some crazy soldiers of the Wermacht, during the second world war, fight a "particular" war against the English enlisting among their troops even Sandokan.', 'Some crazy soldiers of the Wermacht, during the second world war, fight a "particular" war against the English enlisting among their troops even Sandokan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ylfO7SJFODOfv7vNigXurvh6b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127629'),
  ('74574411436347617', 'Kakurenbo: Hide & Seek', 2004, 'Animation, Horror', 'Shuhei Morita, Kisuke Koizumi', 'Shuhei Morita, Shiro Kuro', 'Junko Takeuchi, Ryou Naitou, Masami Suzuki, Akiko Kobayashi, Mika Ishibashi, Makoto Ueki', null, 'Among the ruins of the city, there is a game only children can play. It is called “Otokoyo”; a game of hide-and-seek. But whenever children play this game, one by one they would disappear into the blinds of the buildings… The story begins when a boy enters the world of Otokoyo, to find his missing sister.', 'Among the ruins of the city, there is a game only children can play. It is called “Otokoyo”; a game of hide-and-seek. But whenever children play this game, one by one they would disappear into the blinds of the buildings… The story begins when a boy enters the world of Otokoyo, to find his missing sister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u7RhGFaP1gFxZKNrm9nqZL1MNFb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27812'),
  ('421392730515821635', 'Kal Ho Naa Ho', 2003, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Anil Mehta, Nikkhil Advani, Mamta Anand', 'Karan Johar', 'Shah Rukh Khan, Preity Zinta, Saif Ali Khan, Jaya Bachchan, Sushma Seth, Reema Lagoo, Athit Naik, Jhanak Shukla', 'PG', 'An uptight MBA student falls for the charismatic new neighbor who charms her troubled family – but he has a secret that forces him to push her away.', 'An uptight MBA student falls for the charismatic new neighbor who charms her troubled family – but he has a secret that forces him to push her away.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zhMI6I0kSLnewTMwE0A8Tz3Cj2f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4254'),
  ('1108429180226548149', 'Kalakal', 2025, 'Drama, Romance', 'Roman Perez Jr.', null, 'Aliya Raymundo, Gold Aceron, Jero Flores, Divine Villareal, Zel Fernandez, Sheena Cole, Horace Mendoza, Ghen Gabriel', null, 'A seductive female garbage collector who embraces the life of an escort lady. Desperate to live a comfortable life, she leaves the dumpsite and enters the club. But can she also dump both her brother and her lover who remind her of her past?', 'A seductive female garbage collector who embraces the life of an escort lady. Desperate to live a comfortable life, she leaves the dumpsite and enters the club. But can she also dump both her brother and her lover who remind her of her past?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ai80zOJ3TYIe31OOHbEyjdb25OW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1476292'),
  ('1049314768580426015', 'Kalank', 2019, 'Drama, Romance', 'Abhishek Varman, Azaan Sami Khan, Samadrita Deb', 'Abhishek Varman, Hussain Dalal, Shibani Bathija', 'Alia Bhatt, Varun Dhawan, Aditya Roy Kapur, Sanjay Dutt, Madhuri Dixit, Sonakshi Sinha, Kunal Khemu, Kiara Advani', null, 'Set in 1945, in Pre-Independent India, the elite, opulent and solemn world of the Chaudhry family, and the wild, mysterious and musical underbelly of the town, Hira Mandi, clash when Roop Chaudhry encounters Zafar, a daredevil from Hira Mandi, unleashing deep-buried truths, secrets of betrayal and affairs that threaten to bring both worlds crashing down.', 'Set in 1945, in Pre-Independent India, the elite, opulent and solemn world of the Chaudhry family, and the wild, mysterious and musical underbelly of the town, Hira Mandi, clash when Roop Chaudhry encounters Zafar, a daredevil from Hira Mandi, unleashing deep-buried truths, secrets of betrayal and affairs that threaten to bring both worlds crashing down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aU4DMIzR7u3EHqQ123oLmi9JTbL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:556271'),
  ('888145132855301539', 'Kalashnikov AK-47', 2020, 'War, History, Drama', 'Mariya Shklyarevskaya, Maksim Antipov, Anastasiya Naumova', 'Sergei Bodrov, Anatoli Usov, Alexey Borodachev', 'Yura Borisov, Olga Lerman, Artur Smolyaninov, Eldar Kalimulin, Vitaliy Khaev, Valeriy Barinov, Anatoliy Lobotskiy, Aleksey Vertkov', null, 'A Russian military propaganda film about the tank commander Kalashnikov, severely injured in battle in 1941. The accident leaves him incapacitated and unable to return to the front line. While recovering in the hospital, he begins creating the initial sketches of what will become one of the world’s most legendary weapons. A self-taught inventor is only 29 when he develops the now iconic assault riffle — the AK-47. Shot in occupied Crimea.', 'A Russian military propaganda film about the tank commander Kalashnikov, severely injured in battle in 1941. The accident leaves him incapacitated and unable to return to the front line. While recovering in the hospital, he begins creating the initial sketches of what will become one of the world’s most legendary weapons. A self-taught inventor is only 29 when he develops the now iconic assault riffle — the AK-47. Shot in occupied Crimea.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ApfjrFsGunqLo5MKYGtFMTSTaMq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:592279'),
  ('576963206278039876', 'Kaleidoscope', 1935, 'Animation', 'Len Lye', null, null, null, 'For Kaleidoscope, which was sponsored by Churchman Cigarettes, Lye animated stenciled cigarette shapes and is said to have experimented by cutting out some of the shapes so that the light of the projector hit the screen directly. As in Colour Box Lye uses music by Don Baretto and his Cuban Orchestra. - Harvard Film Archive', 'For Kaleidoscope, which was sponsored by Churchman Cigarettes, Lye animated stenciled cigarette shapes and is said to have experimented by cutting out some of the shapes so that the light of the projector hit the screen directly. As in Colour Box Lye uses music by Don Baretto and his Cuban Orchestra. - Harvard Film Archive', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v2SKPBfbeS3yHKuNxvAiKquV2rf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:203087'),
  ('14291997747548592', 'Kaleidoscope', 1966, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Jack Smight, Kip Gowans, Jack Maxsted', 'Robert Carrington, Jane-Howard Hammerstein', 'Warren Beatty, Susannah York, Clive Revill, Eric Porter, Murray Melvin, George Sewell, Stanley Meadows, John Junkin', 'NR', 'Barney Lincoln is a rambling gambling man who scores sensational wins at poker and chemin de fer because he has succeeded in marking the original plates for the backs of all the playing cards manufactured in a plant in Geneva and used in all the gambling joints in Europe. In his gambling depredation, Barney is spotted by Angel McGinnis, the daughter of a Scotland Yard Inspector ''Manny'' McGinnis on the lookout for a man to do a job. The inspector enlists Barney''s help in playing poker with a shady London character whom Scotland Yard wants to force to financial ruin.', 'Barney Lincoln is a rambling gambling man who scores sensational wins at poker and chemin de fer because he has succeeded in marking the original plates for the backs of all the playing cards manufactured in a plant in Geneva and used in all the gambling joints in Europe. In his gambling depredation, Barney is spotted by Angel McGinnis, the daughter of a Scotland Yard Inspector ''Manny'' McGinnis on the lookout for a man to do a job. The inspector enlists Barney''s help in playing poker with a shady London character whom Scotland Yard wants to force to financial ruin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mjNRyDYeCXQWk6pGrm1AyqK9Ccf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35671'),
  ('857846136324118640', 'Kali: Avenging Angel', 2024, 'Action, Thriller, Adventure', 'Michel Taburiaux , Julien Seri, Karim Mekhaldi', 'Julien Seri, Pascal Sid, Cyril Ferment', 'Sabrina Ouazani, Philippe Bas, Olivia Côte, Thiago Fragoso, Mathieu Lardot, Thiago Thomé, Raquel Karro, Sophia Guedes', null, 'Lisa, aka Kali, has nothing left to lose when she finds out her husband has been executed in Rio to cover up a corruption scandal. A former Special Forces recruit, she heads to Brazil with fists, blood and explosives, to find out the truth.', 'Lisa, aka Kali, has nothing left to lose when she finds out her husband has been executed in Rio to cover up a corruption scandal. A former Special Forces recruit, she heads to Brazil with fists, blood and explosives, to find out the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7GC0TEOQ1ljAhtvcwdthAbb5D3h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1108354'),
  ('445645633718235169', 'Kalifornia', 1993, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Dominic Sena, Bojan Bazelli, Thomas Patrick Smith', 'Stephen Levy, Tim Metcalfe', 'Brad Pitt, David Duchovny, Juliette Lewis, Michelle Forbes, Sierra Pecheur, John Dullaghan, Kathy Larson, David Milford', 'R', 'A journalist duo go on a tour of serial killer murder sites with two companions, unaware that one of them is a serial killer himself.', 'A journalist duo go on a tour of serial killer murder sites with two companions, unaware that one of them is a serial killer himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aXyA3UvVaXBoX2zq9zH7NcK5rKT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10909'),
  ('384337342845420025', 'Kalimán in the Sinister World of Humanón', 1976, 'Adventure', 'Alberto Mariscal, Álex Phillips Jr., Humberto Gavaldón', null, 'Jeff Cooper, Milton Rodríguez, Lenka Erdos, Manuel Bravo, Carlos Cardán, Alberto Insua, Fernando Yapur, Carlos East', null, 'Kalimán: Women want to be with him, men want to be him! That old adage fits this character. The superhero was huge in Mexico, the subject of comic books and a radio show that was as popular as the Shadow''s was in the States. He''s a very philosophical, peace loving man who uses his brains and heart as well as brawn in his capers.', 'Kalimán: Women want to be with him, men want to be him! That old adage fits this character. The superhero was huge in Mexico, the subject of comic books and a radio show that was as popular as the Shadow''s was in the States. He''s a very philosophical, peace loving man who uses his brains and heart as well as brawn in his capers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/keKzfDmCXDFDjperpvbrOa4HgIu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107177'),
  ('613087509744732264', 'Kaliman, the Incredible Man', 1972, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Alberto Mariscal, Rosalío Solano', 'Hector Gonzalez Dueñas, Rafael Cutberto Navarro', 'Jeff Cooper, Nino del Arco, Adriana Roel, Charles Fawcett, Carlos Cardán, Susana Dosamantes, Chano Urueta, Roberto Dumont', null, 'Archaeologists, tomb robbers, a strange character and an adventurer undertake the search for the tomb of an Egyptian pharaoh, driven by different motivations: from the mere archaeological find to the destruction of humanity.', 'Archaeologists, tomb robbers, a strange character and an adventurer undertake the search for the tomb of an Egyptian pharaoh, driven by different motivations: from the mere archaeological find to the destruction of humanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hODDFeXgFV4iFtqDYBw4xKUjOOc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:286002'),
  ('171822326829578997', 'Kalki 2898-AD', 2024, 'Drama, Action, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Đorđe Stojiljković, Sahen Upadhyay, Nayanatara Manchala', 'Nag Ashwin', 'Amitabh Bachchan, Prabhas, Deepika Padukone, Kamal Haasan, Saswata Chatterjee, Shobana, Rajendra Prasad, Pasupathy', 'PG-13', 'In the year 2898 AD, around 6000 years after Kurukshetra war, Ashwatthama gears up for his final battle of redemption at the sign of hope in a dystopian world and Bhairava, a wisecracking and self-interested bounty hunter, tired of the perilous life becomes the hurdle in the process.', 'In the year 2898 AD, around 6000 years after Kurukshetra war, Ashwatthama gears up for his final battle of redemption at the sign of hope in a dystopian world and Bhairava, a wisecracking and self-interested bounty hunter, tired of the perilous life becomes the hurdle in the process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rstcAnBeCkxNQjNp3YXrF6IP1tW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:801688'),
  ('126226305545028818', 'Kalle Blomkvist Lives Dangerously', 1996, 'Family, Mystery', 'Göran Carmback, Kerstin Bonnier, Carl Sundberg', 'Göran Carmback', 'Malte Forsberg, Josefin Årling, Totte Steneby, Victor Sandberg, Bobbo Steneby, Johan Stattin, Leif Andrée, Catherine Hansson', null, 'The story is about a boy named Kalle Blomkvist who with his friends solves crimes. But also play the battle between the red rose and the white rose with his rival friends. But everything changes when Kalle Blomkvists friend finds a dead man in a cabin and then must his friends and he find the murdurer.', 'The story is about a boy named Kalle Blomkvist who with his friends solves crimes. But also play the battle between the red rose and the white rose with his rival friends. But everything changes when Kalle Blomkvists friend finds a dead man in a cabin and then must his friends and he find the murdurer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3qIT6ycHgGn759FMy2Y6agHGoqW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30700'),
  ('876122337745870828', 'Kally’s Mashup: A Very Kally''s Birthday', 2021, 'Music, Family, TV Movie, Romance', 'Jorge Navas, Manuel Castañeda', 'Peter Barsocchini, Adam Anders', 'Maia Reficco, Alex Hoyer, Johann Vera, Saraí Meza, Celeste Sanazi, Tomás Carullo Lizzio, Danielle Arciniegas, Carolina Ribón', null, 'Days before her birthday, Kally meets the latest pop icon, who is as successful as he is seductive, but ex-boyfriend Dante still has feelings for her and doesn''t want to lose her. While she''s having the time of her life, Kally must decide what to do with her career and her heart.', 'Days before her birthday, Kally meets the latest pop icon, who is as successful as he is seductive, but ex-boyfriend Dante still has feelings for her and doesn''t want to lose her. While she''s having the time of her life, Kally must decide what to do with her career and her heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/noQ4i2WUGcN6n5cks1mW0Q45ZcR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:788647'),
  ('635313825731251579', 'Kalt ist die Angst', 2017, 'TV Movie, Drama', 'Berno Kürten', null, 'Caroline Peters, Rudolf Kowalski, Christoph Maria Herbst, Anke Sevenich, Annika Blendl, Hans-Werner Meyer, Arndt Schwering-Sohnrey, Nika Emilia Lou Vamvakaris', null, 'Claire and David have been happily married for years, but there seems to be a curse on their marriage. They have been trying to have a child for a long time, but unfortunately without success. When David dies unexpectedly, Claire''s life is thrown into complete chaos. But as she tries to come to terms with the loss, she suddenly discovers dark secrets that cast her husband in a completely new light: the respected aid worker was apparently involved in dirty business in Africa. And then for years he has also kept it from Claire that he has been having regular sex with the call girl Sabina. Suddenly more and more strange things are happening and Claire suddenly feels persecuted. Could David have been murdered? If so, who has something to cover up? And what did David''s assistant Michael know? For Claire''s psychiatrist and David''s confidant Hagedorn, these are just delusions. But who can the widow trust now?', 'Claire and David have been happily married for years, but there seems to be a curse on their marriage. They have been trying to have a child for a long time, but unfortunately without success. When David dies unexpectedly, Claire''s life is thrown into complete chaos. But as she tries to come to terms with the loss, she suddenly discovers dark secrets that cast her husband in a completely new light: the respected aid worker was apparently involved in dirty business in Africa. And then for years he has also kept it from Claire that he has been having regular sex with the call girl Sabina. Suddenly more and more strange things are happening and Claire suddenly feels persecuted. Could David have been murdered? If so, who has something to cover up? And what did David''s assistant Michael know? For Claire''s psychiatrist and David''s confidant Hagedorn, these are just delusions. But who can the widow trust now?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xZycaQMZVXq5W6YKv3azHaKgQNc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:432655'),
  ('1129243433363735414', 'Kalyanaraman', 2002, 'Comedy, Family', 'P. Sukumar, Shafi', 'Benny P. Nayarambalam', 'Dileep, Navya Nair, Kunchacko Boban, Lal, Jyothirmayi, Lalu Alex, Kalaranjini, Boban Alummoodan', null, 'Ramankutty, a wedding planner, falls in love with Gauri and their families approve of their marriage. However, an astrologer''s shocking prediction about Ramankutty''s family creates complications.', 'Ramankutty, a wedding planner, falls in love with Gauri and their families approve of their marriage. However, an astrologer''s shocking prediction about Ramankutty''s family creates complications.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lp4nOZXHsB01190lgnrpILm6jiB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:351496'),
  ('408994798575579849', 'Kalyug', 2005, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Mohit Suri, Rituraj Narain, Lily Ahluwalia', 'Anand Sivakumaran', 'Kunal Khemu, Emraan Hashmi, Deepal Shaw, Smiley Suri, Amrita Singh, Ashutosh Rana, Atul Parchure, Farid Amiri', null, 'Kunal and Renuka''s marital bliss is shattered when a group of people film and upload a video of them being intimate on an adult website. Kunal fights to take them and their illegal racket down.', 'Kunal and Renuka''s marital bliss is shattered when a group of people film and upload a video of them being intimate on an adult website. Kunal fights to take them and their illegal racket down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zvs6wuMCdn0zTe3U7yeXboiHjin.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40017'),
  ('589924372121268090', 'Kama Sutra Rides Again', 1971, 'Animation', 'Bob Godfrey', null, null, null, 'Oscar nominated animated short from 1972. An animated short from British comedian Bob Godfrey.', 'Oscar nominated animated short from 1972. An animated short from British comedian Bob Godfrey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bteMMppSpRNgI3OLj8CTES3TUmT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:243363'),
  ('304798328270556587', 'Kama Sutra: A Tale of Love', 1997, 'Drama, History, Romance', 'Mira Nair, Declan Quinn', 'Helena Kriel, Mira Nair', 'Indira Varma, Sarita Choudhury, Ramon Tikaram, Naveen Andrews, Rekha, Khalid Tyabji, Arundathi Nag, Surabhi Bhansali', 'R', 'Tara and Maya are inseparable, with the same tastes, habits, and hobbies. Years later, the two have matured but have maintained their friendship. Tara marries local prince Raj Singh, who succeeds the throne as the sole heir. After the marriage, Raj seeks another female to satisfy his sexual desires, with his sights settling on Maya, putting a perhaps unforgivable strain on a longtime friendship.', 'Tara and Maya are inseparable, with the same tastes, habits, and hobbies. Years later, the two have matured but have maintained their friendship. Tara marries local prince Raj Singh, who succeeds the throne as the sole heir. After the marriage, Raj seeks another female to satisfy his sexual desires, with his sights settling on Maya, putting a perhaps unforgivable strain on a longtime friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sptijXzApZhbOyqYq9P7627RAYw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28005'),
  ('122834180360468714', 'Kamarád do deště', 1988, 'Crime, Comedy', 'Jaroslav Soukup, Josef Jarolímek, Dušan Vodák', 'Jaroslav Soukup, Miroslav Vaic', 'Sagvan Tofi, Lukáš Vaculík, Beata Andraszewicz, Karol Strasburger, Karel Augusta, Andrej Hryc, Ivan Vyskočil, Ladislav Lahoda', null, 'A young waiter named Michal gets into trouble when he is robbed of his daily takings, which he was supposed to deliver to the bank. He''s on probation, so it''s clear that no one trusts him. So he asks for help from a friend, Tomáš, a taxi driver, who borrows from Adamec, a dangerous bellhop. By chance, the two friends manage to find out that his colleague Kadlec and his son-in-law, garage keeper Bures, who is a stolen car dealer, are involved in Michal''s robbery. With the help of Michal''s girlfriend Magda, they devise a scam to punish the extortionist boss and hand over the two seemingly blameless scoundrels Kadlec and Bures to the police with the evidence.', 'A young waiter named Michal gets into trouble when he is robbed of his daily takings, which he was supposed to deliver to the bank. He''s on probation, so it''s clear that no one trusts him. So he asks for help from a friend, Tomáš, a taxi driver, who borrows from Adamec, a dangerous bellhop. By chance, the two friends manage to find out that his colleague Kadlec and his son-in-law, garage keeper Bures, who is a stolen car dealer, are involved in Michal''s robbery. With the help of Michal''s girlfriend Magda, they devise a scam to punish the extortionist boss and hand over the two seemingly blameless scoundrels Kadlec and Bures to the police with the evidence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b2ulIedYOqFW4NxDvtT2BB5wEyX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:140707'),
  ('854413291158871924', 'Kamarinskaja', 1895, 'Documentary', 'Max Skladanowsky', null, 'Tscherpanoff', null, 'Three dancers do a Russian folkloric step dance, facing the camera, in traditional clothes, fur hats and leather boots.', 'Three dancers do a Russian folkloric step dance, facing the camera, in traditional clothes, fur hats and leather boots.', null, 'tmdb:movie:194086'),
  ('1050225382943586613', 'Kambakkht Ishq', 2009, 'Action, Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Sabbir Khan, Vikas Sivaraman', null, 'Akshay Kumar, Kareena Kapoor Khan, Aftab Shivdasani, Amrita Arora, Sylvester Stallone, Boman Irani, Kirron Kher, Whoopi Goldberg', null, 'Simrita, a doctor, performs her first surgery on Viraj, a man she hates. She soon realises that she accidentally left her watch inside his body and must do whatever it takes to save her career.', 'Simrita, a doctor, performs her first surgery on Viraj, a man she hates. She soon realises that she accidentally left her watch inside his body and must do whatever it takes to save her career.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yiOoPDxP0r5bb3YGBtHI5rBp1xS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10788'),
  ('86410731006901401', 'Kamchatka', 2002, 'Drama', 'Marcelo Piñeyro, Alfredo Mayo, Ezequiel Crupnicoff', 'Marcelo Figueras, Marcelo Piñeyro', 'Ricardo Darín, Cecilia Roth, Héctor Alterio, Fernanda Mistral, Tomás Fonzi, Nicolás Cantafio, Mónica Scapparone, Matías Del Pozo', null, 'In 1976, Argentina fell into the hands of a de facto government. Thousands of citizens are persecuted and kidnapped. This is the case of the parents of two children, who, knowing they are wanted, decide to hide.', 'In 1976, Argentina fell into the hands of a de facto government. Thousands of citizens are persecuted and kidnapped. This is the case of the parents of two children, who, knowing they are wanted, decide to hide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/raielLvbmZw1SUTOWHVNciXcDHU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28710'),
  ('113651517866954156', 'Kamen Rider × Kamen Rider OOO & W Featuring Skull: Movie Wars Core', 2010, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction, Comedy, Drama', 'Ryuta Tasaki, Koji Kurata, Junpei Shiokawa', 'Riku Sanjou, Toshiki Inoue', 'Renn Kiriyama, Masaki Suda, Minehiro Kinomoto, Koji Kikkawa, Fumihiko Tachiki, Shu Watanabe, Shingo Nakagawa, Hikaru Yamamoto', null, 'Confronting a mysterious enemy, the Pteranodon Yummy, Kamen Rider W receives aid from Ryu, who has infuriated Akiko by being too busy to attend her wedding! Akiko demands to know why he even became a Kamen Rider in the first place and the Pteranodon Yummy as it uses the Memory Memory on her to give her the answer to her question. Meanwhile, at the Kougami Foundation, Kousei Kougami talks of the most avaricious man in Japan, Oda Nobunaga, whose final resting place was found. With Doctor Maki overseeing the process, Kougami commissions the creation of a Cell Medal homunculus based on Nobunaga himself. Later, Kamen Rider Core begins to destroy the area as Kamen Riders OOO and W team up to fight the enemy. However, Kamen Rider Core proves too powerful and the two go underground to destroy the Gaia Memory’s source of power to even the odds.', 'Confronting a mysterious enemy, the Pteranodon Yummy, Kamen Rider W receives aid from Ryu, who has infuriated Akiko by being too busy to attend her wedding! Akiko demands to know why he even became a Kamen Rider in the first place and the Pteranodon Yummy as it uses the Memory Memory on her to give her the answer to her question. Meanwhile, at the Kougami Foundation, Kousei Kougami talks of the most avaricious man in Japan, Oda Nobunaga, whose final resting place was found. With Doctor Maki overseeing the process, Kougami commissions the creation of a Cell Medal homunculus based on Nobunaga himself. Later, Kamen Rider Core begins to destroy the area as Kamen Riders OOO and W team up to fight the enemy. However, Kamen Rider Core proves too powerful and the two go underground to destroy the Gaia Memory’s source of power to even the odds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q8hPXJ7awwShDLUZRxq8yxdibLK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:188282'),
  ('838695005510070094', 'Kamen Rider × Kamen Rider W & Decade: Movie War 2010', 2009, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Ryuta Tasaki, Koji Kurata, Kyouhei Yamaguchi', 'Shouji Yonemura, Riku Sanjou', 'Masahiro Inoue, Kanna Mori, Ryouta Murai, Kimito Totani, Alice Hirose, Renn Kiriyama, Masaki Suda, Hikaru Yamamoto', null, 'Serving as the true ending to Kamen Rider Decade and revealing the origins of Kamen Rider W, this movie is split into three parts. In "Kamen Rider Decade: Final Chapter", Tsukasa Kadoya fully embraces his title as the Destroyer of Worlds. In "Kamen Rider W: Begins Night", Shotaro and Philip recount the night on when it all began. Elements of both parts converge in the movie''s final part, "Movie War 2010" as our heroes fight the forces of Super Shocker.', 'Serving as the true ending to Kamen Rider Decade and revealing the origins of Kamen Rider W, this movie is split into three parts. In "Kamen Rider Decade: Final Chapter", Tsukasa Kadoya fully embraces his title as the Destroyer of Worlds. In "Kamen Rider W: Begins Night", Shotaro and Philip recount the night on when it all began. Elements of both parts converge in the movie''s final part, "Movie War 2010" as our heroes fight the forces of Super Shocker.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k53uFP8lLCinMQGP4bY6kuwKLp8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108515'),
  ('608724265540176922', 'Kamen Rider × Kamen Rider Wizard & Fourze: Movie Wars Ultimatum', 2012, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction, Drama, Comedy', 'Koichi Sakamoto', 'Yoshio Urasawa, Kazuki Nakashima', 'Sota Fukushi, Ryuki Takahashi, Yoshiko Sengen, Ryo Yoshizawa, Rikako Sakata, Justin Tomimori, Shiho, Shion Tsuchiya', null, 'The first part is the Kamen Rider Fourze’s place five years after the events of the series. Gentaro is now a teacher at Amanogawa High as well as the Space Kamen Rider Club’s new academic advisor. However, a new school club called the Monster League, comprised by a group of psychic children led by Saburo Kazeta, which is supported by a mysterious man named Kageto Banba. The second part is Kamen Rider Wizard’s portion, where Haruto enters the Underworld of an unknown Gate to investigate the mysterious occurrings of monster appearances. He then runs into a young woman named Yu Kamimura who can become Belle Mask Poitrine and can use magic like him. The third and final part of the film is Movie War Ultimatum. The three Akumaizer from the Underworld to plan to invade the land of the living. Kamen Riders Wizard and Fourze must fight to stop the Akumaizer and their Monster Army.', 'The first part is the Kamen Rider Fourze’s place five years after the events of the series. Gentaro is now a teacher at Amanogawa High as well as the Space Kamen Rider Club’s new academic advisor. However, a new school club called the Monster League, comprised by a group of psychic children led by Saburo Kazeta, which is supported by a mysterious man named Kageto Banba. The second part is Kamen Rider Wizard’s portion, where Haruto enters the Underworld of an unknown Gate to investigate the mysterious occurrings of monster appearances. He then runs into a young woman named Yu Kamimura who can become Belle Mask Poitrine and can use magic like him. The third and final part of the film is Movie War Ultimatum. The three Akumaizer from the Underworld to plan to invade the land of the living. Kamen Riders Wizard and Fourze must fight to stop the Akumaizer and their Monster Army.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7T5XB93Kgcw7lEF9y84ji4hn8x2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:204634'),
  ('343186935402827011', 'Kamen Rider × Super Sentai × Space Sheriff: Super Hero Wars Z', 2013, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Osamu Kaneda, Gen Kobayashi', 'Shouji Yonemura', 'Yuma Ishigaki, Junya Ikeda, Arisa Komiya, Shunya Shiraishi, Makoto Okunaka, Tasuku Nagase, Junki Tozuka, Yuko Takayama', null, 'A new evil organization known as Space Shocker, which are led by the magic-using Space Ikadevil and Space Spider Man, threatens the Earth by causing an unknown phenomenon. The Space Sheriffs Gavan type-G and Sharivan are sent to execute all magic-users on Earth in response to the threat and begins to attack Kamen Riders Wizard and Beast. The Space Crime Syndicate Madou, who were once defeated by the original Sharivan return, to cause even more havoc in the world. During this, Yoko finds a mysterious little robot called Psycholon, which Space Shocker and the Madou are after for unknown reasons.', 'A new evil organization known as Space Shocker, which are led by the magic-using Space Ikadevil and Space Spider Man, threatens the Earth by causing an unknown phenomenon. The Space Sheriffs Gavan type-G and Sharivan are sent to execute all magic-users on Earth in response to the threat and begins to attack Kamen Riders Wizard and Beast. The Space Crime Syndicate Madou, who were once defeated by the original Sharivan return, to cause even more havoc in the world. During this, Yoko finds a mysterious little robot called Psycholon, which Space Shocker and the Madou are after for unknown reasons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/djDhEs3vnnH0SNtTC2IzLOuu4fd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:235343'),
  ('532402577217180759', 'Kamen Rider × Super Sentai: Super Hero Wars', 2012, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Osamu Kaneda, Hiroyuki Kato, Masao Inokuma', 'Shouji Yonemura', 'Masahiro Inoue, Ryota Ozawa, Sota Fukushi, Katsuhiro Suzuki, Kimito Totani, Ryo Yoshizawa, Shu Watanabe, Riho Takada', null, 'The Kamen Rider Club discovers that the Dai-Zangyack fleet is moving towards Earth, led by Captain Marvelous as their Great Emperor. With many revived Super Sentai villains under his command, Captain Marvelous plans to obtain the Great Power of the Kamen Riders which is said to be "Ultimate Treasure in the Universe". Meanwhile, Tsukasa Kadoya becomes the Great Leader of Dai-Shocker once again and recruits past enemies of the Kamen Riders to take down the Super Sentai teams.', 'The Kamen Rider Club discovers that the Dai-Zangyack fleet is moving towards Earth, led by Captain Marvelous as their Great Emperor. With many revived Super Sentai villains under his command, Captain Marvelous plans to obtain the Great Power of the Kamen Riders which is said to be "Ultimate Treasure in the Universe". Meanwhile, Tsukasa Kadoya becomes the Great Leader of Dai-Shocker once again and recruits past enemies of the Kamen Riders to take down the Super Sentai teams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/315YkN469xibroxtdyDUof6dPoG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:241697'),
  ('303090781273817206', 'Kamen Rider × Super Sentai: Ultra Super Hero Wars', 2017, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Osamu Kaneda', 'Shouji Yonemura', 'Hiroki Iijima, Toshiki Seto, Ruka Matsuda, Ukyo Matsumoto, Hayato Onozuka, Shouma Kai, Tetsuya Iwanaga, Hanamaru Hakata', null, 'The Game World launches an attack on the real world. In front of Kamen Rider Ex-Aid and the Uchu Sentai Kyuranger appears the "Arena of Death" where the destruction of the Earth will be decided. Trapped in this inescapable dimension, generations of Super Sentai and Kamen Riders must engage in a battle royale, an unprecedented battlefield of many puzzles connecting the real and game worlds. And then, "Those Heroes" revive... Everything is scaled up, all rules are broken! And when it seems like the real world will fall into a disaster, imagination brings forth unimaginable new heroes!', 'The Game World launches an attack on the real world. In front of Kamen Rider Ex-Aid and the Uchu Sentai Kyuranger appears the "Arena of Death" where the destruction of the Earth will be decided. Trapped in this inescapable dimension, generations of Super Sentai and Kamen Riders must engage in a battle royale, an unprecedented battlefield of many puzzles connecting the real and game worlds. And then, "Those Heroes" revive... Everything is scaled up, all rules are broken! And when it seems like the real world will fall into a disaster, imagination brings forth unimaginable new heroes!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ufgZ4J3cs5TYN8zFHeMJQXR7OT2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:433726'),
  ('828474371835660974', 'Kamen Rider 555 20th: Paradise Regained', 2024, 'Action, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Sanshiro Wada, Ryuta Tasaki, Kota Nakamura', 'Toshiki Inoue', 'Kento Handa, Yuria Haga, Rumika Fukuda, Daiji Asakawa, Kohei Murakami, Mitsuru Karahashi, Ray Fujita, Rui Yanagawa', null, 'Smart Brain, once Japan''s largest company, lost its power due to repeated internal conflicts and was placed under government control with the goal of exterminating Orphnochs. Mari Sonoda, who is living with Orphnochs at the Western Laundry Store Kikuchi, when Takumi Inui, who had disappeared several years earlier, reappeared.', 'Smart Brain, once Japan''s largest company, lost its power due to repeated internal conflicts and was placed under government control with the goal of exterminating Orphnochs. Mari Sonoda, who is living with Orphnochs at the Western Laundry Store Kikuchi, when Takumi Inui, who had disappeared several years earlier, reappeared.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qf73jO3I2NkhtgEKo0U2b8znLy8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1122715'),
  ('853814990062839558', 'Kamen Rider Amazons The Movie: The Final Judgment', 2018, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction, Horror, Mystery', 'Hidenori Ishida, Hidenori Ishida', 'Yuya Takahashi', 'Tom Fujita, Masashi Taniguchi, Rena Takeda, Ayu Higashi, Kota Miura, Yoshito Momiki, Mitsutoshi Shundo, Kanon Miyahara', null, 'The “Amazon Livestock Project,” a mysterious care facility, the Amazon extermination organization 4C (Competitive Creatures Control Center) pursuing Haruka Misuzawa . . . all come together in a tale of symbiosis and competition; the mortal combat between the carnivore and herbivore. And, finally, an end to the troubles and conflicts of the Riders, two beings confronting a fierce fate.', 'The “Amazon Livestock Project,” a mysterious care facility, the Amazon extermination organization 4C (Competitive Creatures Control Center) pursuing Haruka Misuzawa . . . all come together in a tale of symbiosis and competition; the mortal combat between the carnivore and herbivore. And, finally, an end to the troubles and conflicts of the Riders, two beings confronting a fierce fate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x3bYKdMMMsHbR9BHINAlfHUFXeT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:508830'),
  ('367312440418276873', 'Kamen Rider Black: Hurry to Demon Island!', 1988, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 'Fumio Matsumura, Naoki Iwahara, Osamu Kaneda', 'Shozo Uehara', 'Tetsuo Kurata, Akemi Inoue, Moyu Taguchi, Shotaro Ishinomori, Jun Yoshida, Hirokazu Shoji, Toshimichi Takahashi, Hitomi Yoshii', null, 'Originally known simply as Kamen Rider Black during its theatrical release. Children all over Tokyo mysteriously disappear without warning. Kotaro suspects that the Gorgom are behind the abductions and follows a suspicious-looking tour bus with children on it, only to lose its trail off a cliff. With the help of a fisherman, Kotaro travels to a remote island and uses his abilities as Kamen Rider Black to save the children and foil Gorgom''s latest evil scheme.', 'Originally known simply as Kamen Rider Black during its theatrical release. Children all over Tokyo mysteriously disappear without warning. Kotaro suspects that the Gorgom are behind the abductions and follows a suspicious-looking tour bus with children on it, only to lose its trail off a cliff. With the help of a fisherman, Kotaro travels to a remote island and uses his abilities as Kamen Rider Black to save the children and foil Gorgom''s latest evil scheme.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1CahZezHq8F136ptLBm6D39WpEq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:200422'),
  ('629256423966109291', 'Kamen Rider Blade: Missing Ace', 2004, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 'Masao Inokuma, Hidenori Ishida, Junpei Shiokawa', 'Toshiki Inoue', 'Takayuki Tsubaki, Kousei Amano, Ryoji Morimoto, Takahiro Hōjō, Yuki Kuroda, Yoko Mitsuya, Takao Sugiura, Yumi Egawa', null, 'Four years after an alternate ending to the series, in which Blade seals the Joker, the characters have moved on with their lives: Kenzaki is a garbage man, Mutsuki has graduated high school, and Kotarō has published a book about the Kamen Riders to great success. The Undead have been re-released, and a new trio of Kamen Riders—Glaive, Larc and Lance—have emerged from BOARD, now led by Tachibana. After recapturing two of the Category Aces, Kenzaki and Mutsuki join with the new Riders. When all the Undead are sealed once more, Glaive reveals himself to be the Albino Joker, a white version of the original Joker, and captures Kotarō''s niece to obtain the ultimate power, sealing her in the Vanity Card. In order to free Amane from the card, Hajime is unsealed from the Joker Card and the four Riders are again united, intent on saving Amane and stopping the Albino Joker.', 'Four years after an alternate ending to the series, in which Blade seals the Joker, the characters have moved on with their lives: Kenzaki is a garbage man, Mutsuki has graduated high school, and Kotarō has published a book about the Kamen Riders to great success. The Undead have been re-released, and a new trio of Kamen Riders—Glaive, Larc and Lance—have emerged from BOARD, now led by Tachibana. After recapturing two of the Category Aces, Kenzaki and Mutsuki join with the new Riders. When all the Undead are sealed once more, Glaive reveals himself to be the Albino Joker, a white version of the original Joker, and captures Kotarō''s niece to obtain the ultimate power, sealing her in the Vanity Card. In order to free Amane from the card, Hajime is unsealed from the Joker Card and the four Riders are again united, intent on saving Amane and stopping the Albino Joker.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tdQLPHz6CLUYd0PydTSju2nkpfN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38969'),
  ('52159835685671510', 'Kamen Rider Build The Movie: Be The One', 2018, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction, Drama', 'Atsushi Uetake, Kazuya Kamihoriuchi', 'Shogo Muto', 'Atsuhiro Inukai, Eiji Akaso, Kaho Takada, Kouhei Takeda, Yuki Ochi, Jouji Kokubo, Yukiaki Kiyama, Takashi Fujii', null, 'After the end of the civil war that tore apart Japan, the new governors of Touto, Hokuto and Seito work together to reunify the country. However, they are actually members of an extraterrestrial race called the "Blood Tribe" (the same species as Evolto), who assumed their government positions as part of a plan to destroy Earth as they have done to Mars and other planets before. Considering Sento Kiryū (Kamen Rider Build) a major threat to their plans, the Blood Tribe manipulates his friends and other civilians into attacking him. With even his close ally Ryūga Banjō (Kamen Rider Cross-Z) now against him, Sento must fight to survive and stop the Blood Tribe''s plan from succeeding.', 'After the end of the civil war that tore apart Japan, the new governors of Touto, Hokuto and Seito work together to reunify the country. However, they are actually members of an extraterrestrial race called the "Blood Tribe" (the same species as Evolto), who assumed their government positions as part of a plan to destroy Earth as they have done to Mars and other planets before. Considering Sento Kiryū (Kamen Rider Build) a major threat to their plans, the Blood Tribe manipulates his friends and other civilians into attacking him. With even his close ally Ryūga Banjō (Kamen Rider Cross-Z) now against him, Sento must fight to survive and stop the Blood Tribe''s plan from succeeding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i8qAIvjYzzJio4mBf6OXkd3ML8i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:543094'),
  ('1043672046156516551', 'Kamen Rider Decade: All Riders vs. Dai-Shocker', 2009, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Osamu Kaneda, Masao Inokuma, Takeshi Miyazaki', 'Shouji Yonemura', 'Masahiro Inoue, Ryouta Murai, Kanna Mori, Kimito Totani, Renji Ishibashi, Tatsuhito Okuda, Moe Arai, Ryuichi Ohura', null, 'Tsukasa travels to his home world of the World of Decade, where he discovers the origin of his powers and his true heritage as the leader of Dai-Shocker. The film features all ten of the lead Heisei Kamen Riders, as well as all of the Shōwa period Kamen Riders, leading to a total of 25 Riders.', 'Tsukasa travels to his home world of the World of Decade, where he discovers the origin of his powers and his true heritage as the leader of Dai-Shocker. The film features all ten of the lead Heisei Kamen Riders, as well as all of the Shōwa period Kamen Riders, leading to a total of 25 Riders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pZNhRgJReSLyFMqIDQcmMeIiQVd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30617'),
  ('850931708013064489', 'Kamen Rider Den-O & Kiva: Climax Deka', 2008, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Osamu Kaneda, Koji Kurata, Kyouhei Yamaguchi', 'Yasuko Kobayashi', 'Takeru Satoh, Yuichi Nakamura, Koji Seto, Tamaki Matsumoto, Rina Akiyama, Kenjirou Ishimaru, Wakana Matsumoto, Akira Nagata', null, 'With Kai’s defeat, Ryotaro and the rest of the DenLiner crew resume their time-traveling adventures by founding a detective agency to keep any other surviving Imagin in check. But when a rogue Imagin swipes Owner’s spare Den-O Pass, it’s up to the DenLiner Police and rookie detective Kazuya, along with a little help from another Rider, to stop the evil Imagin and save the past, present, and future!', 'With Kai’s defeat, Ryotaro and the rest of the DenLiner crew resume their time-traveling adventures by founding a detective agency to keep any other surviving Imagin in check. But when a rogue Imagin swipes Owner’s spare Den-O Pass, it’s up to the DenLiner Police and rookie detective Kazuya, along with a little help from another Rider, to stop the evil Imagin and save the past, present, and future!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wDxOYPQI5jwRIHlJpfA9DxoLxma.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38956'),
  ('1124119887821960407', 'Kamen Rider Den-O The Movie: I''m Born!', 2007, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Takao Nagaishi, Masao Inokuma, Takayuki Shibasaki', 'Yasuko Kobayashi', 'Takeru Satoh, Yuriko Shiratori, Yuichi Nakamura, Rina Akiyama, Kenjirou Ishimaru, Wakana Matsumoto, Akira Nagata, Ryo Ueno', null, 'With Gaoh having stolen the DenLiner and trapping the Imagins onboard, Ryotaro and Hana find themselves trapped in the year 2000 where they meet Ryotaro’s younger self, but Ryotaro is slowly forgetting everything having to do with Den-O! As Gaoh gets closer to his target, the only hope lies with Yuuto’s complex plans and a little bit of luck, or else time itself could fall victim to Gaoh’s evil desires!', 'With Gaoh having stolen the DenLiner and trapping the Imagins onboard, Ryotaro and Hana find themselves trapped in the year 2000 where they meet Ryotaro’s younger self, but Ryotaro is slowly forgetting everything having to do with Den-O! As Gaoh gets closer to his target, the only hope lies with Yuuto’s complex plans and a little bit of luck, or else time itself could fall victim to Gaoh’s evil desires!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/48AHpedVGxljPdze25fqhiK11ee.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38973'),
  ('452968062279482213', 'Kamen Rider Drive: Surprise Future', 2015, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure, Drama, Family, Mystery', 'Takayuki Shibasaki, Hirofumi Ishigaki, Junpei Shiokawa', 'Riku Sanjou', 'Ryoma Takeuchi, Mackenyu, Rio Uchida, Yu Inaba, Taiko Katono, Shun Nishime, Chris Peppler, Tsurutaro Kataoka', null, 'After witnessing a strange explosion, Shinnosuke Tomari is later visited by a young man claiming to be his son Eiji Tomari from the year 2035. Eiji warns Shinnosuke that a year from now, Mr. Belt''s AI will go berserk and lead to the Roidmudes overtaking humanity. However, Shinnosuke cannot immediately deal with this new information when the evil Kamen Rider Dark Drive also comes from the future, causing enough mayhem that leads to Shinnosuke being framed for it and becoming the public''s most wanted.', 'After witnessing a strange explosion, Shinnosuke Tomari is later visited by a young man claiming to be his son Eiji Tomari from the year 2035. Eiji warns Shinnosuke that a year from now, Mr. Belt''s AI will go berserk and lead to the Roidmudes overtaking humanity. However, Shinnosuke cannot immediately deal with this new information when the evil Kamen Rider Dark Drive also comes from the future, causing enough mayhem that leads to Shinnosuke being framed for it and becoming the public''s most wanted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aYcg4fn8QaDipo63nhOwsq1JIEo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:378676'),
  ('125517122075642291', 'Kamen Rider Fourze The Movie: It’s Space Time, Everybody!', 2012, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Koichi Sakamoto, Koji Kurata, Koichi Sakamoto', 'Kazuki Nakashima', 'Sota Fukushi, Ryuki Takahashi, Yoshiko Sengen, Ryo Yoshizawa, Rikako Sakata, Justin Tomimori, Shiho, Shion Tsuchiya', null, 'The Earth is threatened by the mysterious Space Ironmen brothers, and the Kamen Rider Club goes to the space to avoid them to be awakened. However, an agent of the Alicia Federation, Inga Blink, tries to stop them. Kamen Rider Forze and Meteor fight for the destiny of the Earth and for the friendship of all beings.', 'The Earth is threatened by the mysterious Space Ironmen brothers, and the Kamen Rider Club goes to the space to avoid them to be awakened. However, an agent of the Alicia Federation, Inga Blink, tries to stop them. Kamen Rider Forze and Meteor fight for the destiny of the Earth and for the friendship of all beings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sI8DdwcGdGRMyijc5cLsFHwKCog.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:167693'),
  ('1106807679725704615', 'Kamen Rider Geats × Revice: Movie Battle Royale', 2022, 'Action, Science Fiction, Adventure, Drama', 'Takayuki Shibasaki, Takeshi Miyazaki, Satoshi Fujita', 'Yuya Takahashi, Hanta Kinoshita', 'Kentaro Maeda, Subaru Kimura, Hideyoshi Kan, Takamasa Suga, Satoshi Matsuda, Takashi Hagino, Ryuga Sato, Yuna Hoshino', null, 'Geats, Revice, and Ryuki wage a fierce battle royale that transcends beyond the Heisei and Reiwa eras.', 'Geats, Revice, and Ryuki wage a fierce battle royale that transcends beyond the Heisei and Reiwa eras.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wwKOQPKYijGqLdqY7Bp4orYmA5E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1002780'),
  ('36809280642586819', 'Kamen Rider Heisei Generations FINAL: Build & Ex-Aid with Legend Riders', 2017, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Kazuya Kamihoriuchi, Takeshi Miyazaki', 'Shogo Muto, Yuya Takahashi', 'Atsuhiro Inukai, Hiroki Iijima, Shu Watanabe, Sota Fukushi, Gaku Sano, Shun Nishime, Eiji Akaso, Kaho Takada', null, 'Kamen Riders Build and Ex-Aid team up with the legendary heroes of the Heisei Generation - OOO, Fourze, Gaim, and Ghost.', 'Kamen Riders Build and Ex-Aid team up with the legendary heroes of the Heisei Generation - OOO, Fourze, Gaim, and Ghost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xcIBGEUf2f2aOQnTlbLT3NA9W4S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:479363'),
  ('142567356955862202', 'Kamen Rider Heisei Generations Forever', 2018, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction, Fantasy, Drama, Comedy', 'Kyouhei Yamaguchi, Junpei Shiokawa', 'Kento Shimoyama', 'So Okuno, Atsuhiro Inukai, Gaku Oshida, Eiji Akaso, Shieri Ohata, Kaho Takada, Keisuke Watanabe, Kouhei Takeda', 'PG', 'A young Kamen Rider fan is granted his wish of seeing Riders in person, initiating the ultimate Japanese superhero crossover meta film. The third and final installment of the Heisei Generations series finds Kamen Rider Zi-O and Kamen Rider Build joining forces with all of the other Heisei Generation Riders to reverse the damages of an evil Time Jacker named Tid, and save their legacy. Are Kamen Riders real? Will you believe?', 'A young Kamen Rider fan is granted his wish of seeing Riders in person, initiating the ultimate Japanese superhero crossover meta film. The third and final installment of the Heisei Generations series finds Kamen Rider Zi-O and Kamen Rider Build joining forces with all of the other Heisei Generation Riders to reverse the damages of an evil Time Jacker named Tid, and save their legacy. Are Kamen Riders real? Will you believe?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kHMuyjlvNIwhCaDFiRwnl45wF7z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:543103'),
  ('619329860914778301', 'Kamen Rider Heisei Generations: Dr. Pac-Man vs. Ex-Aid & Ghost with Legend Riders', 2016, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Koichi Sakamoto, Shu G. Momose, Takeshi Miyazaki', 'Yuya Takahashi', 'Akira Takano, Hiroki Iijima, Shouma Kai, Ryoma Takeuchi, Shun Nishime, Shunya Shiraishi, Gaku Sano, Toshiki Seto', null, 'As a computer virus based on Pac-Man invades Japan, a group of doctors attack Genm Corp and begin a wave of terror using stolen Proto Gashats. Ghost and Ex-Aid find themselves at the center of the fight in an effort to protect those most important to them. But they aren’t alone, as Heisei Riders from the past join them to stop Dr. Pac-Man!', 'As a computer virus based on Pac-Man invades Japan, a group of doctors attack Genm Corp and begin a wave of terror using stolen Proto Gashats. Ghost and Ex-Aid find themselves at the center of the fight in an effort to protect those most important to them. But they aren’t alone, as Heisei Riders from the past join them to stop Dr. Pac-Man!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6BuqvcfbdB3SXObxAGX1qYOQeH2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:433810'),
  ('1003488291482263298', 'Kamen Rider J', 1994, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Keita Amemiya, Fumio Matsumura', 'Shozo Uehara', 'Yuuta Mochizuki, Yuka Nomura, Kyoji Kamui, Yōko Mari, Satoshi Kurihara, Maho Maruyama, Shozo Iizuka, Rikako Aikawa', null, 'The story begins with three Aliens in human form preparing for a ritual to feed the Fog Mother''s "siblings". The Fog Mother last came to earth during the Prehistoric Age and is the cause of the extinction of the dinosaurs. Kenji and his kid sister are in the mountains, investigating all the deaths of animals and trees there. The Fog Mother sends the three aliens, "Gorai", "Zuu", and "Agito" to kidnap Kenji''s baby sister for the sacrifice.', 'The story begins with three Aliens in human form preparing for a ritual to feed the Fog Mother''s "siblings". The Fog Mother last came to earth during the Prehistoric Age and is the cause of the extinction of the dinosaurs. Kenji and his kid sister are in the mountains, investigating all the deaths of animals and trees there. The Fog Mother sends the three aliens, "Gorai", "Zuu", and "Agito" to kidnap Kenji''s baby sister for the sacrifice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eigCNQq0EI9ojtdBzbpmvuoFugW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:185958'),
  ('61510834847310276', 'Kamen Rider Kabuto: God Speed Love', 2006, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 'Hidenori Ishida, Masao Inokuma, Takeshi Miyazaki', 'Shouji Yonemura', 'Hiro Mizushima, Yuki Sato, Yui Satonaka, Katsuya Kobayashi, Mitsuki Koga, Musashi, Reika Fujisawa, Sean Wiig', null, 'In 1999, an enormous meteor crashed onto Earth carrying extraterrestrial creatures known as Worms within it. These creatures took on the identities of real humans and then killed them. In order to counter this new threat, ZECT was formed, who in turn created the Masked Rider System to combat the Worms. The battles lasts over seven years, depleting Earth''s resources and turning it into a barren wasteland. By present time, power struggles in ZECT have caused a new group, known as Neo-ZECT, to be created. Souji Tendou, a man weilding the Kabuto Zector, decides to sell his power to either ZECT or Neo-Zect for unkown reasons.', 'In 1999, an enormous meteor crashed onto Earth carrying extraterrestrial creatures known as Worms within it. These creatures took on the identities of real humans and then killed them. In order to counter this new threat, ZECT was formed, who in turn created the Masked Rider System to combat the Worms. The battles lasts over seven years, depleting Earth''s resources and turning it into a barren wasteland. By present time, power struggles in ZECT have caused a new group, known as Neo-ZECT, to be created. Souji Tendou, a man weilding the Kabuto Zector, decides to sell his power to either ZECT or Neo-Zect for unkown reasons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7eRCsy1ES4cTcYSBjuOFaaomFCJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37986'),
  ('110167212718387989', 'Kamen Rider Kiva: King of the Castle in the Demon World', 2008, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 'Takeshi Miyazaki, Michihiro Takeda, Ryuta Tasaki', 'Toshiki Inoue', 'Koji Seto, Kouhei Takeda, Shouma Yamamoto, Ken Horiuchi, Nana Yanagisawa, Tomokazu Sugita, Keisuke Kato, Yu Takahashi', null, 'When a powerful new foe known as the Legendorga arises in 2008, Wataru investigates the mystery behind the crisis, which brings him in contact with a man Nago once knew, Shiramine Takato, whose 3WA also possess their own Rider System. When Shiramine explains how everything began in 1986, Wataru uses Castle Doran’s Time Door to travel back in time, leading him to meet his father face-to-face at last. But has Wataru managed to change the future, or will the Legendorga still rise and enslave humanity?', 'When a powerful new foe known as the Legendorga arises in 2008, Wataru investigates the mystery behind the crisis, which brings him in contact with a man Nago once knew, Shiramine Takato, whose 3WA also possess their own Rider System. When Shiramine explains how everything began in 1986, Wataru uses Castle Doran’s Time Door to travel back in time, leading him to meet his father face-to-face at last. But has Wataru managed to change the future, or will the Legendorga still rise and enslave humanity?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a5ShSWZ8NIB8lpuzrTDFABqfEgl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:188281'),
  ('913921713772541242', 'Kamen Rider OOO 10th: The Core Medals of Resurrection', 2022, 'Action, Science Fiction, Fantasy, Drama, Comedy', 'Ryuta Tasaki, Takeshi Miyazaki, Koichiro Hayama', 'Nobuhiro Mouri', 'Shu Watanabe, Ryosuke Miura, Riho Takada, Hiroaki Iwanaga, Asaya Kimijima, Mayuko Arisue, Marie Kai, Takashi Ukaji', null, 'The year is 2021 and the world is in a state of chaos and fear. The ancient king OOO has come back to life after 800 years of dormancy. As the Kougami Foundation mounts a human resistance, Eiji Hino returns to Japan, believing he has at last found the means to revive the Greeed Ankh...', 'The year is 2021 and the world is in a state of chaos and fear. The ancient king OOO has come back to life after 800 years of dormancy. As the Kougami Foundation mounts a human resistance, Eiji Hino returns to Japan, believing he has at last found the means to revive the Greeed Ankh...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jqTWihvV6P5TMiCQ6klCe9S7Oz3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:894489'),
  ('640292902952952180', 'Kamen Rider OOO Wonderful: The Shogun and the 21 Core Medals', 2011, 'Action, Adventure, History, Science Fiction', 'Takayuki Shibasaki, Koji Kurata, Koichi Sakamoto', 'Yasuko Kobayashi', 'Shu Watanabe, Ryosuke Miura, Riho Takada, Hiroaki Iwanaga, Asaya Kimijima, Mayuko Arisue, Takashi Ukaji, Marie Kai', null, 'Leading an expedition in Germany, Kougami unseals the resting place of one of the alchemists that created the Core Medals in an effort to retrieve a set of lost Medals. However, upon the seal being undone, millions of Cell Medals erupt into a tower while creating a magical barrier that causes parts of Japan to flip over. As the alchemist reveals her plans to become a new OOO, Eiji and his friends are thrown into the past and must find their way back home and stop the alchemist before she destroys the world!', 'Leading an expedition in Germany, Kougami unseals the resting place of one of the alchemists that created the Core Medals in an effort to retrieve a set of lost Medals. However, upon the seal being undone, millions of Cell Medals erupt into a tower while creating a magical barrier that causes parts of Japan to flip over. As the alchemist reveals her plans to become a new OOO, Eiji and his friends are thrown into the past and must find their way back home and stop the alchemist before she destroys the world!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/77SkoCBagAO1unTpBwTSKAzNbJQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137261'),
  ('861780940318955612', 'Kamen Rider Reiwa: The First Generation', 2019, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Koji Kurata, Teruaki Sugihara', 'Yuya Takahashi', 'Fumiya Takahashi, So Okuno, Ryutaro Okada, Noa Tsurushima, Hiroe Igeta, Gaku Oshida, Shieri Ohata, Keisuke Watanabe', null, '12 years ago, the Daybreak Town Accident changed the world and brought forth a new prosperity towards artificial intelligence. But what if that were to all change? Sougo Tokiwa gave up his conquest for power after he chose to reset the world and live a mundane life. However as a Time Jacker began to alter history once again, Sougo is forced to take up the mantle as Kamen Rider Zi-O once again, as he meets Aruto Hiden, the native Rider of the world he has to save. This is the story of two Kamen Riders from two different worlds, whose fight together will ultimately determine the fate of all reality.', '12 years ago, the Daybreak Town Accident changed the world and brought forth a new prosperity towards artificial intelligence. But what if that were to all change? Sougo Tokiwa gave up his conquest for power after he chose to reset the world and live a mundane life. However as a Time Jacker began to alter history once again, Sougo is forced to take up the mantle as Kamen Rider Zi-O once again, as he meets Aruto Hiden, the native Rider of the world he has to save. This is the story of two Kamen Riders from two different worlds, whose fight together will ultimately determine the fate of all reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aTTB2rdlYAlLuQa9Y2rAVml4Nqg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:635339'),
  ('173716438399897766', 'Kamen Rider Saber + Kikai Sentai Zenkaiger: Super Hero Chronicles', 2021, 'Action, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Ryuta Tasaki, Toshikazu Kamiaka, Ryousuke Sakuno', 'Nobuhiro Mouri', 'Shuichiro Naito, Takaya Yamaguchi, Kiita Komagine, Atsuki Mashiko, Asuka Kawazu, Ryou Aoki, Yuki Ikushima, Eiji Togashi', null, 'Touma, Yuri and Mei somehow ended up in the World of Zenkaiger while four Zenkaigers, except Juran, ended up in the World of Saber. The reason for their swap is due to a man who wishes to rid the world of heroes. How does a teenage boy manga artist tie into this? And why are they sent into different stories filled with previous Kamen Riders and Super Sentai Teams?', 'Touma, Yuri and Mei somehow ended up in the World of Zenkaiger while four Zenkaigers, except Juran, ended up in the World of Saber. The reason for their swap is due to a man who wishes to rid the world of heroes. How does a teenage boy manga artist tie into this? And why are they sent into different stories filled with previous Kamen Riders and Super Sentai Teams?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tyIBW4AUvACoJwuFZm14e7aptK9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:826708'),
  ('607970146091186565', 'Kamen Rider SD: Strange?! Kumo Otoko', 1993, 'Animation, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Takenori Kawada', 'Toshiki Inoue', 'Hideyuki Tanaka, Keiichi Nanba, Joe Onodera, Ryoichi Tanaka, Yasuhiko Kawazu, Toshio Kobayashi, Hisao Egawa, Masaya Onosaka', null, '"Kamen Rider SD: Strange!? Kumo Otoko" is an animated OVA based on the gag manga Kamen Rider SD: Hurricane Legend. This cute and comedic short movie features chibi versions of the Showa Era Kamen Riders, as they team up against the evil GranShocker organization, while Kamen Rider Black RX tries to confess his love to female sports instructor Michiru.', '"Kamen Rider SD: Strange!? Kumo Otoko" is an animated OVA based on the gag manga Kamen Rider SD: Hurricane Legend. This cute and comedic short movie features chibi versions of the Showa Era Kamen Riders, as they team up against the evil GranShocker organization, while Kamen Rider Black RX tries to confess his love to female sports instructor Michiru.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9JpdDFwOxfLqwgLdG52SJ7A4etm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:434559'),
  ('271814551801703473', 'Kamen Rider W Forever: A to Z/The Gaia Memories of Fate', 2010, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Koichi Sakamoto, Koji Kurata, Ryoichi Ito', 'Riku Sanjou', 'Renn Kiriyama, Masaki Suda, Mitsuru Matsuoka, Minehiro Kinomoto, Shu Watanabe, Masayuki Deai, Hikaru Yamamoto, Takeshi Nadagi', null, 'Intercepting the transport carrying Foundation X’s new 2nd generation Gaia Memories, the special-ops unit NEVER, led by Daido Katsumi, intend to turn Fuuto into Hell on Earth. With Daido wielding the T2 Eternal Memory and a Lost Driver, granting him power in the form of Kamen Rider Eternal, Fuuto’s Kamen Riders are left powerless as Daido and his allies take control of Fuuto Tower, converting it into a massive laser weapon…', 'Intercepting the transport carrying Foundation X’s new 2nd generation Gaia Memories, the special-ops unit NEVER, led by Daido Katsumi, intend to turn Fuuto into Hell on Earth. With Daido wielding the T2 Eternal Memory and a Lost Driver, granting him power in the form of Kamen Rider Eternal, Fuuto’s Kamen Riders are left powerless as Daido and his allies take control of Fuuto Tower, converting it into a massive laser weapon…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g6ZhgWU4l24Ifh7rpiOTYzbbouT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:188288'),
  ('906125577042807295', 'Kamen Rider W Returns: Kamen Rider Accel', 2011, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Koichi Sakamoto', 'Keiichi Hasegawa', 'Renn Kiriyama, Masaki Suda, Hikaru Yamamoto, Minehiro Kinomoto, Yukari Taki, Minoru Tanaka, Mitsutoshi Shundo, Takeshi Nadagi', null, 'While settling into married life with Akiko, Ryu is brought into a case involving a woman named Katsuragi Aoi, a member of a pickpocketing ring with most of her teammates murdered from unknown masked vigilantes that Ryu fought as Accel. As the details of the case begin to unravel, Ryu is framed and Akiko believes that he may not be faithful to her. As the clock ticks down, Ryu must solve the case, clear his name, and save his marriage before everything comes to an explosive end!', 'While settling into married life with Akiko, Ryu is brought into a case involving a woman named Katsuragi Aoi, a member of a pickpocketing ring with most of her teammates murdered from unknown masked vigilantes that Ryu fought as Accel. As the details of the case begin to unravel, Ryu is framed and Akiko believes that he may not be faithful to her. As the clock ticks down, Ryu must solve the case, clear his name, and save his marriage before everything comes to an explosive end!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qIbmmg4YnwemPftvFx9f3XKvCdC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:212258'),
  ('401820761469305330', 'Kamen Rider W Returns: Kamen Rider Eternal', 2011, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Koichi Sakamoto, Koji Kurata, Ryoichi Ito', 'Riku Sanjou', 'Renn Kiriyama, Hikaru Yamamoto, Mitsuru Matsuoka, Aya Sugimoto, Genki Sudo, Minase Yashiro, Masayuki Deai, Gong Teyu', null, 'Set primarily before the events of Kamen Rider W Forever, Kamen Rider Eternal tells the story of Daido Katsumi, the formation of NEVER, the mission that led them to target Fuuto, and reveals just how Daido obtained his Lost Driver and got his first taste of the power of Kamen Rider Eternal. As a mysterious woman retells this story to Phillip and Shotaro, they realize that Daido may not have been the simple monster he first appeared to be…', 'Set primarily before the events of Kamen Rider W Forever, Kamen Rider Eternal tells the story of Daido Katsumi, the formation of NEVER, the mission that led them to target Fuuto, and reveals just how Daido obtained his Lost Driver and got his first taste of the power of Kamen Rider Eternal. As a mysterious woman retells this story to Phillip and Shotaro, they realize that Daido may not have been the simple monster he first appeared to be…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vzjKhUUeaTRX4quxtQWkI2RVb7r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:212262'),
  ('322503228119647621', 'Kamen Rider Wizard in Magic Land', 2013, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Shojiro Nakazawa', 'Junko Komura', 'Shunya Shiraishi, Tasuku Nagase, Makoto Okunaka, Junki Tozuka, Yuko Takayama, Takanori Jinnai, Tsubasa Takizawa, Ryo Tayano', null, 'A rainbow-colored tornado takes Haruto and Koyomi to an alternate reality called "Magic Land". There, its residents never developed science. Instead they put extensive research on magic. As a result, anyone has an ability to use magic, and some of them can even transform into a Kamen Rider Mage. When Haruto arrives, he meets a young orphan called Shiina. As Haruto explores Magic Land, he finds the Emerald Palace and meets Emperor Maya. He also meets Prime Minister Orma, who is known as Kamen Rider Sorcerer, who does not appear what he may seem to be...', 'A rainbow-colored tornado takes Haruto and Koyomi to an alternate reality called "Magic Land". There, its residents never developed science. Instead they put extensive research on magic. As a result, anyone has an ability to use magic, and some of them can even transform into a Kamen Rider Mage. When Haruto arrives, he meets a young orphan called Shiina. As Haruto explores Magic Land, he finds the Emerald Palace and meets Emperor Maya. He also meets Prime Minister Orma, who is known as Kamen Rider Sorcerer, who does not appear what he may seem to be...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cX5iSQsCeLn1VfLWvSoAEwdTWJk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:266037'),
  ('105362832701042542', 'Kamen Rider x Kamen Rider Fourze & OOO Movie Wars Mega Max', 2011, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Koichi Sakamoto, Koji Kurata, Kazuya Kamihoriuchi', 'Yasuko Kobayashi, Kazuki Nakashima', 'Sota Fukushi, Shu Watanabe, Renn Kiriyama, Masaki Suda, Ryosuke Miura, Erina Mano, Tetsu Inada, Takahiro Fujimoto', null, 'Movie War Mega Max featured the first seven Kamen Riders (Kamen Rider 1, 2, V3, Riderman, X, Amazon, and Stronger) to commemorate the franchise''s 40th anniversary. Trailers for the film shown during airings of Fourze also showed the return of Kamen Rider Double as well as a new form for Kamen Rider OOO. Unlike previous Movie War films, where they were divided into 3 segments, Movie War Mega Max is divided into 5 parts. Like previous Movie War films the secondary Kamen Rider of Kamen Rider Fourze, Kamen Rider Meteor, made his debut in the film.', 'Movie War Mega Max featured the first seven Kamen Riders (Kamen Rider 1, 2, V3, Riderman, X, Amazon, and Stronger) to commemorate the franchise''s 40th anniversary. Trailers for the film shown during airings of Fourze also showed the return of Kamen Rider Double as well as a new form for Kamen Rider OOO. Unlike previous Movie War films, where they were divided into 3 segments, Movie War Mega Max is divided into 5 parts. Like previous Movie War films the secondary Kamen Rider of Kamen Rider Fourze, Kamen Rider Meteor, made his debut in the film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rMD6t6pLzzAAtVF6A7PgJEC9S1m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:188198'),
  ('49664200757709095', 'Kamen Rider Zero-One: Real Time', 2020, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Koji Kurata, Teruaki Sugihara, Jun Watanabe', 'Yuya Takahashi', 'Fumiya Takahashi, Ryutaro Okada, Noa Tsurushima, Hiroe Igeta, Hideaki Ito, Daisuke Nakagawa, Shuya Sunagawa, Nachi Sakuragi', null, 'A mysterious man called Es/Kamen Rider Eden has emerged, committing simultaneous acts of terror across the world, with thousands of believers following his faith. While the people fall one by one and the world delves into chaos, Aruto Hiden stands up to stop him. Isamu Fuwa, Yaiba Yuia, Gai Amatsu, plus Jin and Horobi of MetsubouJinrai.net also transform into Kamen Riders and fight against the enemy while struggling to seek the truth.', 'A mysterious man called Es/Kamen Rider Eden has emerged, committing simultaneous acts of terror across the world, with thousands of believers following his faith. While the people fall one by one and the world delves into chaos, Aruto Hiden stands up to stop him. Isamu Fuwa, Yaiba Yuia, Gai Amatsu, plus Jin and Horobi of MetsubouJinrai.net also transform into Kamen Riders and fight against the enemy while struggling to seek the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fbhCFNn5qhMCfdcqqZmKUKJM84.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:756982'),
  ('660880642253794419', 'Kamen Rider Zi-O NEXT TIME: Geiz, Majesty', 2020, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction, Fantasy, Drama', 'Fumio Matsumura, Satoshi Morota, Takeshi Miyazaki', 'Nobuhiro Mouri', 'Gaku Oshida, Kimito Totani, So Okuno, Shieri Ohata, Keisuke Watanabe, Rihito Itagaki, Ayaka Konno, Kentarou Kanesaki', null, 'It''s September 2018, and a group of high school students are more than ever excited to pursue their dreams. Sougo Tokiwa wants to become a desirable king, and Keito "Geiz" Myokoin works tirelessly to become the true judo champion while trying to impress his crush, Alpina Tsukuyomi. However, one day Geiz suffers a career-ending injury during a judo match in a judo tournament, forcing him to give up his dream of become a judo champion. While still grieving, he was met by a mysterious man, who wanted to give Geiz a Ridewatch and a Driver. "My name is Woz, I came here to guide you to become a savior. If not, Sougo Tokiwa will become the worst and evillest demon king." Meanwhile, a new transfer student leads him to nothing but one grand conspiracy.', 'It''s September 2018, and a group of high school students are more than ever excited to pursue their dreams. Sougo Tokiwa wants to become a desirable king, and Keito "Geiz" Myokoin works tirelessly to become the true judo champion while trying to impress his crush, Alpina Tsukuyomi. However, one day Geiz suffers a career-ending injury during a judo match in a judo tournament, forcing him to give up his dream of become a judo champion. While still grieving, he was met by a mysterious man, who wanted to give Geiz a Ridewatch and a Driver. "My name is Woz, I came here to guide you to become a savior. If not, Sougo Tokiwa will become the worst and evillest demon king." Meanwhile, a new transfer student leads him to nothing but one grand conspiracy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mew5d3ZzFfVxFyPZ8ydJb18UOpr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:625985'),
  ('56639031186113120', 'Kamen Rider Zi-O the Movie: Over Quartzer', 2019, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction, Drama', 'Ryuta Tasaki, Takeshi Miyazaki, Toshikazu Kamiaka', 'Kento Shimoyama', 'So Okuno, Gaku Oshida, Shieri Ohata, Keisuke Watanabe, Yu Inaba, Chris Peppler, Tomoya Maeno, Jiei Wakabayashi', null, 'The Quartzers, calling themselves the Wardens of Time, appear after Sougo Tokiwa has collected all of the Heisei Era Ride Watches. A grand conspiracy behind the birth of the King of Time becomes ever clearer...', 'The Quartzers, calling themselves the Wardens of Time, appear after Sougo Tokiwa has collected all of the Heisei Era Ride Watches. A grand conspiracy behind the birth of the King of Time becomes ever clearer...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1dBh2g44wnRUypqPiPwGmCpbce0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:604165'),
  ('52800412509449939', 'Kamen Rider ZO', 1993, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Keita Amemiya, Osamu Kaneda, Fumio Matsumura', 'Noboru Sugimura', 'Hiroshi Tsuchikado, Isao Sasaki, Shohei Shibata, Hiroshi Inuzuka, Naomi Morinaga, Kenji Ohba, Masaru Yamashita, Iori Sakakibara', null, 'Masaru Aso was the lab assistant of geneticist Doctor Mochizuki, used as one of his experiments related the creation of the Neo Organism, enabling him to transform into a grasshopper-like being called Kamen Rider ZO. He fled into the mountainside and went into a coma before he was awakened by a telepathic call two years later with an unconscious urge to protect Hiroshi Mochizuki, the son of Doctor Mochizuki.', 'Masaru Aso was the lab assistant of geneticist Doctor Mochizuki, used as one of his experiments related the creation of the Neo Organism, enabling him to transform into a grasshopper-like being called Kamen Rider ZO. He fled into the mountainside and went into a coma before he was awakened by a telepathic call two years later with an unconscious urge to protect Hiroshi Mochizuki, the son of Doctor Mochizuki.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lzDXr6naEa4Pcd23B9fZP8zmnMc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:187922'),
  ('1033946756005533111', 'Kamen Rider: THE FIRST', 2005, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Takao Nagaishi, Kazushige Tanaka, Masayuki Taniguchi', 'Toshiki Inoue', 'Masaya Kikawada, Hassei Takano, Rena Komine, Hiroshi Miyauchi, Eiji Wentz, Ryoko Kobayashi, Mayumi Sada, Hideyo Amamoto', null, 'Takeshi Hongo is a man of extraordinary intellect, but his promising future is about to be maliciously snuffed out by and evil secret society known as Shocker. Reinvented against his will and transformed into a powerful experimental cyborg, Hongo will forever be known as Kamen Rider The First.', 'Takeshi Hongo is a man of extraordinary intellect, but his promising future is about to be maliciously snuffed out by and evil secret society known as Shocker. Reinvented against his will and transformed into a powerful experimental cyborg, Hongo will forever be known as Kamen Rider The First.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4PHqhMIF4jsNFLAh9LKsdzVgB1r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41104'),
  ('91024018833512096', 'Kamen Rider: THE NEXT', 2007, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction, Horror', 'Ryuta Tasaki, Kazushige Tanaka, Makoto Yokoyama', 'Toshiki Inoue', 'Masaya Kikawada, Hassei Takano, Kazuki Kato, Miku Ishida, Erika Mori, Rie Mashiko, Tomorowo Taguchi, Shinji Rokkaku', null, 'Bent on the destruction of the human race, the secret underground organization Shocker secretly planned to plunge the world into chaos. But they didn’t count on the revolt of both of their experimentally “reconstructed” human beings, the Kamen Riders. Two years after their first battle with Shocker, a 3rd Rider arises to confront them, known only as “Version 3.” The arrival of the third Kamen Rider will hurl the heroes into their most terrible battle yet and the fate of the world hangs in the balance.', 'Bent on the destruction of the human race, the secret underground organization Shocker secretly planned to plunge the world into chaos. But they didn’t count on the revolt of both of their experimentally “reconstructed” human beings, the Kamen Riders. Two years after their first battle with Shocker, a 3rd Rider arises to confront them, known only as “Version 3.” The arrival of the third Kamen Rider will hurl the heroes into their most terrible battle yet and the fate of the world hangs in the balance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9I2Ta9et1lHwdaaND65Xu6ZfAky.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41105'),
  ('182752431162316179', 'Kamikaze', 1986, 'Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Didier Grousset, Jean-François Robin', 'Michèle Pétin, Luc Besson, Didier Grousset', 'Richard Bohringer, Dominique Lavanant, Michel Galabru, Romane Bohringer, Etienne Chicot, Jean-Paul Muel, Harry Cleven, Riton Liebman', null, 'A disgruntled scientist is fired from his job; slipping into madness, he invents a machine which harnesses the airwaves and can shoot people through the TV screen.', 'A disgruntled scientist is fired from his job; slipping into madness, he invents a machine which harnesses the airwaves and can shoot people through the TV screen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dFlp634hsv9eCOItzhNdhh4QurQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64239'),
  ('629211563539446410', 'Kamikaze', 2014, 'Drama', 'Álex Pina', 'Álex Pina, Iván Escobar', 'Álex García, Verónica Echegui, Carmen Machi, Héctor Alterio, Leticia Dolera, Ivan Massagué, Eduardo Blanco, Daniel Horvath', null, 'Slastan, a Karadjistan man, is willing to blow himself up aboard a Moscow plane bound for Madrid, but his plan is complicated when, due to a snowstorm, the flight is delayed. Staying in a hotel, the terrorist will have to live with the 332 people who he will kill until the storm ceases, which prevents him from continuing his mission. Slastan knows, speaks and relates to his future victims and begins to wonder if suicide and ending the lives of all these innocent people is really right.', 'Slastan, a Karadjistan man, is willing to blow himself up aboard a Moscow plane bound for Madrid, but his plan is complicated when, due to a snowstorm, the flight is delayed. Staying in a hotel, the terrorist will have to live with the 332 people who he will kill until the storm ceases, which prevents him from continuing his mission. Slastan knows, speaks and relates to his future victims and begins to wonder if suicide and ending the lives of all these innocent people is really right.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Ad86K3mZvVgQOVnc6biScHlwyw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:229194'),
  ('201101316470618311', 'Kamikaze ''89', 1982, 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Wolf Gremm, Xaver Schwarzenberger, Karin Viesel', 'Robert Katz, Wolf Gremm', 'Rainer Werner Fassbinder, Günther Kaufmann, Boy Gobert, Arnold Marquis, Richy Müller, Brigitte Mira, Nicole Heesters, Franco Nero', null, 'In a futuristic, totalitarian society wherein the government controls all facets of the media, a homicide detective investigates a string of bombings and uncovers more than he bargained for.', 'In a futuristic, totalitarian society wherein the government controls all facets of the media, a homicide detective investigates a string of bombings and uncovers more than he bargained for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4kaOGOc17LoszAlsj2WKFgapBY8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12607'),
  ('97459607863802792', 'Kamikaze Girls', 2004, 'Comedy', 'Tetsuya Nakashima, Shojiro Nishimi, Shôichi Atô', 'Tetsuya Nakashima', 'Kyoko Fukada, Anna Tsuchiya, Hiroyuki Miyasako, Ryoko Shinohara, Sadao Abe, Yoshinori Okada, Eiko Koike, Shin Yazawa', null, 'Momoko, a strange and seemingly emotionless girl obsessed with 18th century France, befriends a Yanki biker and the two experience the ups and downs of their unusual lives in a rural Japanese town.', 'Momoko, a strange and seemingly emotionless girl obsessed with 18th century France, befriends a Yanki biker and the two experience the ups and downs of their unusual lives in a rural Japanese town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fpmFgBElC7bDSHJwtmfJnYFyMqw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26275'),
  ('1030192883463276031', 'Kamikaze Hearts', 1986, 'Drama, Documentary', 'Juliet Bashore, David Golia', 'Juliet Bashore, Tigr, John Knoop', 'Tigr, Sharon Mitchell, Jon Martin, Sparky Vasc, Jerry Abrams, Robert McKenna, Jorge, Mantra', 'NR', 'Porn stars Sharon Mitchell and Tigr navigate the ups and downs of being in love while working in the sex industry.', 'Porn stars Sharon Mitchell and Tigr navigate the ups and downs of being in love while working in the sex industry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xceKHvJMISQD2kGCabWKgAqD3KW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:215539'),
  ('629902054610036412', 'Kamikaze Taxi', 1995, 'Crime, Action, Drama', 'Masato Harada, Yoshitaka Sakamoto', 'Masato Harada', 'Koji Yakusho, Kazuya Takahashi, Mickey Curtis, Reiko Kataoka, Taketoshi Naitō, Kenichi Yajima, Toshi Shioya, Tomorowo Taguchi', null, 'A young foot soldier in the yakuza seeks revenge when his prostitute girlfriend dies after a session with a high-ranking Japanese politician with a taste for torture. He sets out on a ''kamikaze'' mission to kill his bosses and the politician; along the way, he acquires the aid of a taxi driver who has recently returned to Japan after living in South America for several decades and is struggling to cope with poverty and the prejudices of native-born Japanese.', 'A young foot soldier in the yakuza seeks revenge when his prostitute girlfriend dies after a session with a high-ranking Japanese politician with a taste for torture. He sets out on a ''kamikaze'' mission to kill his bosses and the politician; along the way, he acquires the aid of a taxi driver who has recently returned to Japan after living in South America for several decades and is struggling to cope with poverty and the prejudices of native-born Japanese.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2PoqVj6zx5QCRHdUfFqtvxCbB8W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:158217'),
  ('984287321029351564', 'Kamikazen (Ultima notte a Milano)', 1988, 'Comedy', 'Gabriele Salvatores, Fernando Ciangola', 'Gabriele Salvatores, Enzo Monteleone', 'Paolo Rossi, Gigio Alberti, Claudio Bisio, Flavio Bonacci, Antonio Catania, Laura Ferrari, Silvio Orlando, Gianni Palladino', null, 'A group of comedians are trying to be successful on stage. One night an important television network organises a public variety show to sort out some performers for their programs. Every one of them will try their hardest, but just a few will be chosen.', 'A group of comedians are trying to be successful on stage. One night an important television network organises a public variety show to sort out some performers for their programs. Every one of them will try their hardest, but just a few will be chosen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tUeWOy9YTjXaCwcr1Idb329yy1z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65038'),
  ('183889176259972815', 'Kamikazi, agapi mou', 1983, 'Comedy', 'Giannis Dalianidis, Yiannis Hartomatzidis, Kostas Revithis', 'Giannis Dalianidis', 'Stathis Psaltis, Stamatis Gardelis, Kaiti Finou, Sofia Aliberti, Rena Pagrati, Koula Agagiotou, Vina Asiki, Zano Danias', null, 'Stathis loves bikes, Rena wants to dance all the time and Aleksis goes crazy for rock music. They are three crazy siblings. One of them, Stathis, doesn''t seem capable to keep a job and when he loses his girlfriend, his mother decides to give him what he loves the most, a motorcycle!', 'Stathis loves bikes, Rena wants to dance all the time and Aleksis goes crazy for rock music. They are three crazy siblings. One of them, Stathis, doesn''t seem capable to keep a job and when he loses his girlfriend, his mother decides to give him what he loves the most, a motorcycle!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xljYpfAQefRY81QptcxHxQtmKzU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142749'),
  ('1145044916606356680', 'Kamilla', 1981, 'Family, Drama', 'Vibeke Løkkeberg', 'Vibeke Løkkeberg', 'Nina Knapskog, Kenneth Johansen, Helge Jordal, Vibeke Løkkeberg, Karin Zetlitz Hærem, Klaus Hagerup, Marie Takvam, Per Jansen', null, 'A young girl growing up in Bergen, Norway just after the 2nd world war, is trying to deal with the father''s adultery and mother''s deep depression, as she befriends a boy.', 'A young girl growing up in Bergen, Norway just after the 2nd world war, is trying to deal with the father''s adultery and mother''s deep depression, as she befriends a boy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wwk5agHnksLrVdCobxNS0zSWhJU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147568'),
  ('165514824412114123', 'Kamillions', 1990, 'Horror, Comedy, Romance, Science Fiction', 'Mike B. Anderson, Reonne Haslett, Antoine Maron', 'Harry S. Robins, Mike B. Anderson', 'Christopher Gasti, Dru-Anne Perry, Dan Evans, Kate Alexander, Laura O''Malley, Chuck Bartelle, David Allan Shaw, Andrew Ross Litzky', null, 'Nathaniel Pickman Wingate has opened a gateway to another dimension using equations and equipment in his basement laboratory. His wife, Nancy, wants him to get ready for his own birthday party. He wants his son Sam to help him. Sam is up in his room looking at pictures of Jasmine on his computer, and a poster of her arrives which he puts in his closet. Although it is Nathan''s birthday, the family is enthralled by a visit from Cousin Desmon, who is now a count in Liechtenstein. While Sam is away getting equipment for his father with his friend Alex, his father gets sucked into the other dimension, and a creature from the parallel universe escapes, pursued by another. The first temporarily traps the second with its spit, attacks Desmon, and becomes a duplicate, absorning his thoughts from the unconscious body. The other manages to get free, and unable to find a human to mimic, finds the poster of Jasmine...', 'Nathaniel Pickman Wingate has opened a gateway to another dimension using equations and equipment in his basement laboratory. His wife, Nancy, wants him to get ready for his own birthday party. He wants his son Sam to help him. Sam is up in his room looking at pictures of Jasmine on his computer, and a poster of her arrives which he puts in his closet. Although it is Nathan''s birthday, the family is enthralled by a visit from Cousin Desmon, who is now a count in Liechtenstein. While Sam is away getting equipment for his father with his friend Alex, his father gets sucked into the other dimension, and a creature from the parallel universe escapes, pursued by another. The first temporarily traps the second with its spit, attacks Desmon, and becomes a duplicate, absorning his thoughts from the unconscious body. The other manages to get free, and unable to find a human to mimic, finds the poster of Jasmine...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/coYqidKJ29sLUUVzBemKkvy6PSu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83416'),
  ('5470591161081477', 'Kaminey', 2009, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Vishal Bhardwaj, Rahat Mahajan, Tassaduq Hussain', 'Sabrina Dhawan, Abhishek Chaubey, Supratik Sen', 'Shahid Kapoor, Priyanka Chopra Jonas, Amole Gupte, Deb Mukherjee, Shivkumar Subramaniam, Chandan Roy Sanyal, Hrishikesh Joshi, Adil Hussain', null, 'Two brothers, as different as chalk and cheese, find their lives intertwined when one puts himself in danger via a `get rich quick'' scheme and the other finds there is a price on his head.', 'Two brothers, as different as chalk and cheese, find their lives intertwined when one puts himself in danger via a `get rich quick'' scheme and the other finds there is a price on his head.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4bdPi4rjb4m3Ks806FBsEQYQTo6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20688'),
  ('799543282014836206', 'Kaminsky', 1986, 'Thriller', 'Michael Lähn, Jörg Seidl', 'Michael Lähn', 'Hannelore Elsner, Klaus Löwitsch, Beate Finckh, Horst Pinnow, Alexander Radszun', null, 'Crime scene: 10th police station. A desolate place on the outskirts of Berlin. Two cops are on duty here. Dieter Stecker - young and hopeful - and Rolf Kaminsky - scrapped and bitter. Kaminsky was once a good cop, but because of a crime he was sent to this deserted precinct. Now he is obsessed with just one idea: to get back at those who hurt him. The compulsion to demonstrate his dwindling strength and vitality turns him into an animal, a devil in human form who only follows his animalistic instincts...', 'Crime scene: 10th police station. A desolate place on the outskirts of Berlin. Two cops are on duty here. Dieter Stecker - young and hopeful - and Rolf Kaminsky - scrapped and bitter. Kaminsky was once a good cop, but because of a crime he was sent to this deserted precinct. Now he is obsessed with just one idea: to get back at those who hurt him. The compulsion to demonstrate his dwindling strength and vitality turns him into an animal, a devil in human form who only follows his animalistic instincts...', null, 'tmdb:movie:305435'),
  ('718906368597195479', 'Kammatti Paadam', 2016, 'Drama, Action', 'Chidambaram, Rajeev Ravi, Habeebullah', 'P Balachandran', 'Dulquer Salmaan, Vinayakan, Manikandan Achari, Anil Nedumangad, Shine Tom Chacko, Vinay Forrt, Shaun Romy, Amalda Liz', null, 'Krishnan, who has been living away from his family and friends in Mumbai, gets a call from his friend Ganga in Kerala, out of the blue. He senses danger, and leaves for Kammattipadam, where both of them grew up.', 'Krishnan, who has been living away from his family and friends in Mumbai, gets a call from his friend Ganga in Kerala, out of the blue. He senses danger, and leaves for Kammattipadam, where both of them grew up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2zJoZn1EBR6UQDr6OdT4Og77zFn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:398786'),
  ('268717483778994086', 'Kamome Diner', 2006, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Naoko Ogigami, Tuomo Virtanen, Piia Nokelainen', 'Naoko Ogigami', 'Satomi Kobayashi, Hairi Katagiri, Masako Motai, Tarja Markus, Jarkko Niemi, Markku Peltola, Anita Linnasola, Eine Räihä', null, 'On a quiet street in Helsinki, Sachie has opened a diner featuring rice balls. For a month she has no customers. Then, in short order, she has her first customer, meets Midori, a gangly Japanese tourist, and invites her to stay with her.', 'On a quiet street in Helsinki, Sachie has opened a diner featuring rice balls. For a month she has no customers. Then, in short order, she has her first customer, meets Midori, a gangly Japanese tourist, and invites her to stay with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2J1Pkw1DPMbFRuN07RI6TlZbNmt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25657'),
  ('1073166977928079491', 'Kamouraska', 1973, 'Drama, History', 'Claude Jutra, Michel Brault', 'Claude Jutra', 'Geneviève Bujold, Richard Jordan, Marcel Cuvelier, Suzie Baillargeon, Huguette Oligny, Philippe Léotard, Janine Sutto, Olivette Thibault', null, 'A writer, Kamouraska is based on a real nineteenth-century love-triangle in rural Québec. It paints a poetic and terrifying tableau of the life of Elisabeth d''Aulnières: her marriage to Antoine Tassy, squire of Kamouraska; his violent murder; and her passion for George Nelson, an American doctor. Passionate and evocative, Kamouraska is the timeless story of one woman''s destructive commitment to an ideal love.', 'A writer, Kamouraska is based on a real nineteenth-century love-triangle in rural Québec. It paints a poetic and terrifying tableau of the life of Elisabeth d''Aulnières: her marriage to Antoine Tassy, squire of Kamouraska; his violent murder; and her passion for George Nelson, an American doctor. Passionate and evocative, Kamouraska is the timeless story of one woman''s destructive commitment to an ideal love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jAmwQEfb6ZHMkDBgJdpgmIVLYEf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66962'),
  ('538074875503771014', 'Kamui', 2009, 'Drama, Action', 'Yōichi Sai, Tomoo Ezaki, Megumu Sawada', 'Sanpei Shirato', 'Kenichi Matsuyama, Koyuki, Kaoru Kobayashi, Koichi Sato, Hideaki Ito, Sei Ashina, Shuhei Umeda', 'NR', 'A rebellious ninja in 17th century Japan takes refuge with a fisherman and his family.', 'A rebellious ninja in 17th century Japan takes refuge with a fisherman and his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qga6pGchaxnq5OORsRDESH5GRDO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38604'),
  ('684589715901624892', 'Kan du vissla Johanna?', 1994, 'Family, TV Movie', 'Rumle Hammerich, Ulf Hansson', 'Ulf Stark', 'Tobias Swärd, Jimmy Sandin, Per Oscarsson, Thomas Roos, Gunilla Abrahamsson, Gustav Levin, Mats Bergman', null, 'Young Berra has a friend, Ulf. Ulf has a grandfather which he likes very much, he gives Ulf presents and takes him on fishing trips. Berra doesn''t have a grandfather, but he wants one that''s nice to him and who can teach him to whistle. Ulf knows where to find a grandfather - at a home for senior citizens. They go searching together and Berra finds a great pretend grandfather, Nils.', 'Young Berra has a friend, Ulf. Ulf has a grandfather which he likes very much, he gives Ulf presents and takes him on fishing trips. Berra doesn''t have a grandfather, but he wants one that''s nice to him and who can teach him to whistle. Ulf knows where to find a grandfather - at a home for senior citizens. They go searching together and Berra finds a great pretend grandfather, Nils.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h6wLjg39h2EAxqaI9CHJWwdHzvy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76594'),
  ('767162348333824264', 'Kanak Attack', 2000, 'Drama', 'Lars Becker, Hannes Hubach', 'Bernhard Wutka, Feridun Zaimoglu', 'Haluk Piyes, David Scheller, Tyron Ricketts, Oezlem Cetin, Nadeshda Brennicke, Ercan Durmaz, Murat Yılmaz, Ralph Herforth', null, 'The three friends Ertan, Kemal and Mehdi live in Kiel. They are foreigners, "Kanaks", as they proudly call themselves. For them, this term is an expression of their attitude to life. The trio keeps their heads above water with small-time crooks, but over time they are drawn deeper and deeper into a maelstrom of violence and crime. On a whim, Erkan acts as the protector of two prostitutes and makes enemies of two unscrupulous pimps. After a failed robbery, Ertan ends up in prison for a short time and Kemal is deported to Turkey. However, the two proud "Kanaks" don''t let this get them down, on the contrary: together, the friends now want to build a drug air bridge between Istanbul and Germany. But the dream of quick money ends in death and grief for Kemal and Ertan.', 'The three friends Ertan, Kemal and Mehdi live in Kiel. They are foreigners, "Kanaks", as they proudly call themselves. For them, this term is an expression of their attitude to life. The trio keeps their heads above water with small-time crooks, but over time they are drawn deeper and deeper into a maelstrom of violence and crime. On a whim, Erkan acts as the protector of two prostitutes and makes enemies of two unscrupulous pimps. After a failed robbery, Ertan ends up in prison for a short time and Kemal is deported to Turkey. However, the two proud "Kanaks" don''t let this get them down, on the contrary: together, the friends now want to build a drug air bridge between Istanbul and Germany. But the dream of quick money ends in death and grief for Kemal and Ertan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/idu7JFgt3nXHBwSAiSfWN0p2C00.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10565'),
  ('164848458954537929', 'Kanal', 1957, 'War, Drama', 'Andrzej Wajda, Jerzy Lipman, Maria Starzeńska', 'Jerzy Stefan Stawiński', 'Teresa Iżewska, Tadeusz Janczar, Wieńczysław Gliński, Tadeusz Gwiazdowski, Stanisław Mikulski, Emil Karewicz, Vladek Sheybal, Teresa Berezowska', null, 'In the last few days of the Warsaw Uprising during World War II, a modest group of Resistance members remains. The band must take refuge in the sewers under the orders of leader Zadra, but it''s only a matter of time before they will have to emerge. However, when they try, they are met only with intense hostility from the Nazis. Despite their attempts stay resolute through immense mental strain, it becomes increasingly apparent that they may be doomed.', 'In the last few days of the Warsaw Uprising during World War II, a modest group of Resistance members remains. The band must take refuge in the sewers under the orders of leader Zadra, but it''s only a matter of time before they will have to emerge. However, when they try, they are met only with intense hostility from the Nazis. Despite their attempts stay resolute through immense mental strain, it becomes increasingly apparent that they may be doomed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mUxZNNmvX3MwIJ9LTcuw76ZdtN6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29933'),
  ('302815902019914518', 'Kanaval', 2024, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Henri Pardo, Glauco Bermudez, Ayesha Sheikh, Arantza Maldonado', 'Henri Pardo', 'Rayan Dieudonné, Penande Estime, Martin Dubreuil, Claire Jacques, Tyler Epassy', null, 'In the early 70s, after leaving their troubled hometown in Haiti, a young boy and his mother settle in a small rural village in Quebec where the boy counts on his invisible friend to understand the new world around him.', 'In the early 70s, after leaving their troubled hometown in Haiti, a young boy and his mother settle in a small rural village in Quebec where the boy counts on his invisible friend to understand the new world around him.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2F4%2Fgracenote%2F4a2a45846c1fdf71ec91ded810675fa1.jpg', 'plex:movie:kanaval'),
  ('768540878063396228', 'Kanchana Sita', 1978, 'Drama', 'Shaji N. Karun, Govindan Aravindan', 'Govindan Aravindan', 'Ramdas, Keshav Panicker, Ravindram Nair, Chinnapuliah, Venkateswarlu, Kondavalasa Lakshmana Rao', null, 'The film interprets a story from the Uttara Kanda of the epic poem Ramayana, where Rama sends his wife, Sita, to the jungle to satisfy his subjects. Sita is never actually seen in the film, but her virtual presence is compellingly evoked in the moods of the forest and the elements. The film retells the epic from a womens'' liberationist perspective, and is about the tragedy of power and the sacrifices that adherence to dharma demands, including abandoning a chaste wife.', 'The film interprets a story from the Uttara Kanda of the epic poem Ramayana, where Rama sends his wife, Sita, to the jungle to satisfy his subjects. Sita is never actually seen in the film, but her virtual presence is compellingly evoked in the moods of the forest and the elements. The film retells the epic from a womens'' liberationist perspective, and is about the tragedy of power and the sacrifices that adherence to dharma demands, including abandoning a chaste wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wMgENNhG1SyNB7mWuaIgLOF3qdj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256641'),
  ('158320708305715451', 'Kanchenjungha', 1962, 'Drama', 'Satyajit Ray, Subrata Mitra, Nityananda Datta', 'Satyajit Ray', 'Chhabi Biswas, Karuna Banerjee, Pahadi Sanyal, Anil Chatterjee, Anubha Gupta, N. Viswanathan, Haridhan Mukhopadhyay, Alokananda Roy', null, 'Played out in real time, several complex family dramas intersect in the landscape of the Himalayan foothills, allowing the Bengali auteur to examine the class and generational differences of postcolonial India while celebrating the hopes of a society in transition.', 'Played out in real time, several complex family dramas intersect in the landscape of the Himalayan foothills, allowing the Bengali auteur to examine the class and generational differences of postcolonial India while celebrating the hopes of a society in transition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vqWgW7bJKSHytbkSUWE3IWAA62k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:166204'),
  ('451264882527126602', 'KanColle Movie', 2016, 'Animation, Action, Science Fiction, TV Movie, War', 'Tsutomu Miyazawa, Sorato Shimizu, Ageha Kochouran', 'Kensuke Tanaka, Jukki Hanada', 'Sumire Uesaka, Saki Fujita, Yuka Iguchi, Ayane Sakura, Ayana Taketatsu, Nao Toyama, Iori Nomizu, Rina Hidaka', null, 'The movie starts off after the events of Episode 3, when Kisaragi had sunk. The Mikawa Fleet (Furutaka, Aoba, Kako, Kinugasa and Tenryuu) are in the middle of Night Battle. Choukai uses Searchlight and gets medium damage, but they win in the end. A New Fleet Girl gets "dropped", emerging from the sea. It is Kisaragi. Kisaragi is brought back to the temporary base in Solomon Islands, but she is suffering from PTSD and has amnesia, unable to remember anyone from back in the anime, excluding Mutsuki...', 'The movie starts off after the events of Episode 3, when Kisaragi had sunk. The Mikawa Fleet (Furutaka, Aoba, Kako, Kinugasa and Tenryuu) are in the middle of Night Battle. Choukai uses Searchlight and gets medium damage, but they win in the end. A New Fleet Girl gets "dropped", emerging from the sea. It is Kisaragi. Kisaragi is brought back to the temporary base in Solomon Islands, but she is suffering from PTSD and has amnesia, unable to remember anyone from back in the anime, excluding Mutsuki...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eXtGLWEfv5f5O41vdOdeMAxnnIm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:412383'),
  ('527602888443968297', 'Kandagawa Pervert Wars', 1983, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Kiyoshi Kurosawa, Akihiko Shiota, Masayuki Suō', null, 'Usagi Asō, Makoto Yoshino, Houen Kishino, Mimi Sawaki, Masayuki Suō, Tatsuya Mori', null, 'Two sexually energized young women who live in a high-rise apartment building happen one day to spy from their window a mother and son making love in the apartment across from theirs. They decide to stage a rescue attempt to free him and in the process one of the young women ends up falling in love with the son despite having a boyfriend and enjoying sex with her female companion. Of course, the mother they are warring against has her own plans when she feels her privacy invaded.', 'Two sexually energized young women who live in a high-rise apartment building happen one day to spy from their window a mother and son making love in the apartment across from theirs. They decide to stage a rescue attempt to free him and in the process one of the young women ends up falling in love with the son despite having a boyfriend and enjoying sex with her female companion. Of course, the mother they are warring against has her own plans when she feels her privacy invaded.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zvZBigBCpeURN4LYjNN3UTvlnPJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42951'),
  ('150016034310654788', 'Kandahar', 2001, 'Drama', 'Hossein Amiri, Ebrahim Ghafori, Mohsen Makhmalbaf', null, 'Nelofer Pazira, Ike Ogut, Hassan Tantai, Sadou Teymouri, Hoyatala Hakimi, Noam Morgensztern, Monica Hankievich, Zahra Shafahi', null, 'After an Afghanistan-born woman who lives in Canada receives a letter from her suicidal sister, she takes a perilous journey through Afghanistan to try to find her.', 'After an Afghanistan-born woman who lives in Canada receives a letter from her suicidal sister, she takes a perilous journey through Afghanistan to try to find her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uTeYg3RPKlGYbyvEYKq5Ht5QGch.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28171'),
  ('376524071810500137', 'Kandahar', 2023, 'Action, Thriller, War', 'MacGregor, Simon Adegbenro, Patricia Wheeler', 'Mitchell LaFortune', 'Gerard Butler, Navid Negahban, Travis Fimmel, Ali Fazal, Bahador Foladi, Nina Toussaint-White, Mark Arnold, Corey Johnson', 'R', 'After his mission is exposed, an undercover CIA operative stuck deep in hostile territory in Afghanistan must fight his way out, alongside his Afghan translator, to an extraction point in Kandahar, all whilst avoiding elite enemy forces and foreign spies tasked with hunting them down.', 'After his mission is exposed, an undercover CIA operative stuck deep in hostile territory in Afghanistan must fight his way out, alongside his Afghan translator, to an extraction point in Kandahar, all whilst avoiding elite enemy forces and foreign spies tasked with hunting them down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lCanGgsqF4xD2WA5NF8PWeT3IXd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:717930'),
  ('559197122054094997', 'Kandisha', 2022, 'Horror', 'Sophie Halpérin, Pierre Abadie, Simon Roca', 'Julien Maury, Alexandre Bustillo', 'Mathilde La Musse, Samarcande Saadi, Suzy Bemba, Nassim Lyes, Walid Afkir, Sandor Funtek, Bakary Diombera, Félix Glaux-Delporto', 'PG-13', 'One summer evening, three childhood friends invoke the spirit of Kandisha, a vengeful creature from a Moroccan legend. The game quickly turns into a nightmare when their loved ones begin to disappear.', 'One summer evening, three childhood friends invoke the spirit of Kandisha, a vengeful creature from a Moroccan legend. The game quickly turns into a nightmare when their loved ones begin to disappear.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vgmy1DUrCiakFswahLjEWFGtBhm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:607365'),
