  ('313057310635116068', 'Kansas Pacific', 1953, 'Western, Action', 'Ray Nazarro, Marlin Skiles, Andrew V. McLaglen', 'Daniel B. Ullman', 'Sterling Hayden, Eve Miller, Barton MacLane, Harry Shannon, Tom Fadden, Reed Hadley, Douglas Fowley, Robert Keys', 'NR', 'Just before the Civil War (but after the South has seceded), Southern saboteurs try to prevent railroad construction from crossing Kansas to the frontier; army captain Nelson is sent out to oppose them. As the tracks push westward, Nelson must contend with increasingly violent sabotage, while trying to romance the foreman''s pretty daughter Barbara.', 'Just before the Civil War (but after the South has seceded), Southern saboteurs try to prevent railroad construction from crossing Kansas to the frontier; army captain Nelson is sent out to oppose them. As the tracks push westward, Nelson must contend with increasingly violent sabotage, while trying to romance the foreman''s pretty daughter Barbara.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j9NT0arh7lcHtpokPMvPDBFN9Qr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18807'),
  ('749402476527634388', 'Kansas Raiders', 1950, 'Western', 'Irving Glassberg, Ray Enright, Joseph Gershenson', 'Robert L. Richards', 'Audie Murphy, Brian Donlevy, Marguerite Chapman, Scott Brady, Tony Curtis, Richard Arlen, Richard Long, James Best', 'NR', 'Outraged by Redleg atrocities, the James and Younger Brothers along with Kit Dalton join Quantrill''s Raiders and find themselves participating in even worse war crimes.', 'Outraged by Redleg atrocities, the James and Younger Brothers along with Kit Dalton join Quantrill''s Raiders and find themselves participating in even worse war crimes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Jl1X3GUBgYXHmxBw1ROeDD4a7R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97421'),
  ('1126395474800756991', 'Kantara', 2022, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Rishab Shetty, Arvind Kashyap', 'Rishab Shetty, Anirudh Mahesh, Raj B Shetty', 'Rishab Shetty, Sapthami Gowda, Kishore, Achyuth Kumar, Pramod Shetty, Prakash Tuminadu, Manasi Sudhir, Naveen D. Padil', null, 'Shiva, a tribal vagabond lives with his mother in hamlet, stays away from the traditional Daivaradhane and Bhoota Kola legacy due to an unforgettable childhood incident. He is happy loafing around with his friends and doing petty jobs for his landlord. When Forest officer Murali enters the scene, it gives a fresh dimension to the man-vs-nature fight. Can Shiva save the forest from Murali? Or is Murali just a dummy bait cast by bigger fish?', 'Shiva, a tribal vagabond lives with his mother in hamlet, stays away from the traditional Daivaradhane and Bhoota Kola legacy due to an unforgettable childhood incident. He is happy loafing around with his friends and doing petty jobs for his landlord. When Forest officer Murali enters the scene, it gives a fresh dimension to the man-vs-nature fight. Can Shiva save the forest from Murali? Or is Murali just a dummy bait cast by bigger fish?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jIsKmkxMzdCZ0Ux1GVSnu8m6Na6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:858485'),
  ('1010745271004425312', 'Kantara - A Legend: Chapter 1', 2025, 'Action, Drama, Fantasy', 'Arvind Kashyap, Rishab Shetty, Srikanth Puppala', 'Rishab Shetty, Anirudh Mahesh, Shanil Gowtham', 'Rishab Shetty, Rukmini Vasanth, Jayaram, Gulshan Devaiah, Ramitha Shailendra, Pramod Shetty, Naveen D. Padil, Rakesh Poojari', null, 'During the Kadamba reign, King Vijayendra, the ruler of the fictional feudatory land of Bangra, meets his final fate while venturing into the mystical forest of Kantara. Witnessing this, his son Rajashekara seals the borders of their realm. Later, Prince Kulashekara reopens them through a brutal massacre. The protagonist, Berme, in search of prosperity, crosses the divide and ignites a conflict of faith, power, and destiny between the Kingdom and Nature.', 'During the Kadamba reign, King Vijayendra, the ruler of the fictional feudatory land of Bangra, meets his final fate while venturing into the mystical forest of Kantara. Witnessing this, his son Rajashekara seals the borders of their realm. Later, Prince Kulashekara reopens them through a brutal massacre. The protagonist, Berme, in search of prosperity, crosses the divide and ignites a conflict of faith, power, and destiny between the Kingdom and Nature.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ehQPboTPaIMkMUOoNOh8e7pZ5Rp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1083637'),
  ('501684518663272881', 'Kanthaswamy', 2009, 'Action, Crime, Adventure', 'N K Ekambaram, Susi Ganesan', 'Susi Ganesan', 'Vikram, Shriya Saran, Prabhu, Vadivelu, Ashish Vidhyarthi, Mansoor Ali Khan, Mumaith Khan, Mukesh Tiwari', null, 'A CBI officer moonlights as a modern day Robin Hood in the guise of the masked Kanthaswamy, as he helps fight corruption and aid impoverished people.', 'A CBI officer moonlights as a modern day Robin Hood in the guise of the masked Kanthaswamy, as he helps fight corruption and aid impoverished people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sH1X4a8B6LDeXtchcKnd51F2HcR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25120'),
  ('1010033725476238558', 'Kanto', 2026, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Ensar Altay, Kürşat Üresin', 'Ensar Altay, Oktay Berber', 'Didem İnselel, Sinan Albayrak, Yıldız Kültür, Ece Bağcı, Züleyha Yıldız', null, 'After taking care of her family for years, 45-year-old homemaker Sude is on the verge of starting a regular job. But when her mother-in-law mysteriously disappears, Sude''s family is forced to confront buried secrets and navigate the delicate balance between family love and personal sacrifices.', 'After taking care of her family for years, 45-year-old homemaker Sude is on the verge of starting a regular job. But when her mother-in-law mysteriously disappears, Sude''s family is forced to confront buried secrets and navigate the delicate balance between family love and personal sacrifices.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F1JHB2HbSmRr9nuXNSAD3mTiQ8xg.jpg', 'plex:movie:kanto-2026'),
  ('232060099983905855', 'Kanto Wanderer', 1963, 'Crime, Drama', 'Seijun Suzuki, Shigeyoshi Mine, Masami Kuzū', 'Yasutaro Yagi', 'Akira Kobayashi, Chieko Matsubara, Daizaburo Hirata, Hiroko Itō, Sanae Nakahara, Kaku Takashina, Chikako Shin, Eimei Esumi', null, 'Handsome young Katsuta tries to follow the yakuza code, but even his boss doesn''t believe in it. Diamond Fuyu is less ethical, and allows the idiotic Tetsu to trick a schoolgirl he fancies, Hanako, into a type of bonded prostitution. Because of gang conflict, the Izu family (to whom Katsuta belongs) has their last gambling den taken over, and he seeks revenge. This brings him back into contact with a former lover who is also a card trickster - she is also Diamond Fuyu''s sister, and is now married to Okaru-Hachi, who has mastered a clever card cheating trick called Okaru, which involves the deft use of mirrors.', 'Handsome young Katsuta tries to follow the yakuza code, but even his boss doesn''t believe in it. Diamond Fuyu is less ethical, and allows the idiotic Tetsu to trick a schoolgirl he fancies, Hanako, into a type of bonded prostitution. Because of gang conflict, the Izu family (to whom Katsuta belongs) has their last gambling den taken over, and he seeks revenge. This brings him back into contact with a former lover who is also a card trickster - she is also Diamond Fuyu''s sister, and is now married to Okaru-Hachi, who has mastered a clever card cheating trick called Okaru, which involves the deft use of mirrors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jMEjrRJE87qMa0ZPgR6NEC3BhLR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42809'),
  ('852489966651839618', 'Kanun', 2022, 'Thriller', 'Jérémie Guez, Sofie Tusschans, Siel Van Daele', 'Jérémie Guez', 'Waël Sersoub, Tuğba Sunguroğlu, Arben Bajraktaraj, Sam Dagher', null, 'The story homes in on Lorik, who''s barely thirty years old yet who works as an enforcer for the Albanian mafia in Brussels, alongside his mentor Aleks. And when Lorik falls in love with Sema, a Fine Arts student of Turkish origins, his past comes back to haunt him: a man hailing from Lorik''s village in Albania, whose father was killed by the latter''s uncle, tracks down the young man and demands that his family''s debt be paid for in blood, as per the Kanun tradition. In short, he asks the clan for Lorik''s death.', 'The story homes in on Lorik, who''s barely thirty years old yet who works as an enforcer for the Albanian mafia in Brussels, alongside his mentor Aleks. And when Lorik falls in love with Sema, a Fine Arts student of Turkish origins, his past comes back to haunt him: a man hailing from Lorik''s village in Albania, whose father was killed by the latter''s uncle, tracks down the young man and demands that his family''s debt be paid for in blood, as per the Kanun tradition. In short, he asks the clan for Lorik''s death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lIL2qgfFR4ynB2YcU0xVBfzUOop.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1000640'),
  ('571335352912373836', 'Kaos', 1984, 'Fantasy, Romance, Drama', 'Vittorio Taviani, Paolo Taviani, Roberto Aristarco', 'Tonino Guerra', 'Franco Franchi, Ciccio Ingrassia, Omero Antonutti, Claudio Bigagli, Massimo Bonetti, Margarita Lozano, Orazio Torrisi, Carlo Cartier', 'R', 'Five stories center on a werewolf, a feudal landlord, peasants, a ghost, and a mother and her sons.', 'Five stories center on a werewolf, a feudal landlord, peasants, a ghost, and a mother and her sons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5iQSh2TM2Y8qOPT7LPjW6X7Qfat.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38164'),
  ('1085217810409318664', 'Kapil Sharma: I''m Not Done Yet', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Saahil Chhabria', 'Kapil Sharma, Anukalp Goswami', 'Kapil Sharma', 'R', 'From the liquid courage behind his tweets to the sobering realities of making it in Mumbai, Kapil''s pouring his heart out — with a heavy glug of humor.', 'From the liquid courage behind his tweets to the sobering realities of making it in Mumbai, Kapil''s pouring his heart out — with a heavy glug of humor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lRY6WhMVQATZqLFuXuTUQU7DYAN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:926057'),
  ('785666250595698069', 'Kapitalistis', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Pablo Muñoz Gomez', 'Pablo Muñoz Gomez, Sarah Schenkel, Xavier Seron', 'Georges Siatidis, Nikolaos Sachas, Wim Willaert, Anne Paulicevich, Marouan Iddoub, Jean-Benoît Ugeux, Catherine Salée, Ingrid Heiderscheidt', null, '“Santa Claus is a capitalist. He brings toys to children of the wealthy and sweaters to those of the poor”. Nikos, aged five.', '“Santa Claus is a capitalist. He brings toys to children of the wealthy and sweaters to those of the poor”. Nikos, aged five.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4upF2yujEez754gDwQiBBfuKK56.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:479635'),
  ('647365308255879721', 'Kapitoshka', 1980, 'Animation, Family', 'Borys Khranevych, Iryna Chefranova, Anatolii Havrylov', 'Natalia Huzieieva', 'Bohdan Beniuk, Liudmyla Ihnatenko, Yevhen Papernyi, Olena Slobodianyk, Nataliia Sumska, Olha Sumska', null, 'Animation film about a friendship between young Wolfy and Kapitoshka. Wolfy tries to learn how to be scary and threatening. But then he meets a drop of rain, Kapitoshka, which makes him realize that it is not necessary to be scary.', 'Animation film about a friendship between young Wolfy and Kapitoshka. Wolfy tries to learn how to be scary and threatening. But then he meets a drop of rain, Kapitoshka, which makes him realize that it is not necessary to be scary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zLOqVXEXi24K3LhSbLD2o4WCKLp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:362083'),
  ('423052042480267285', 'Kapo', 1960, 'Drama, War', 'Gillo Pontecorvo, Giuliano Montaldo, Marco Scarpelli', 'Franco Solinas, Gillo Pontecorvo', 'Susan Strasberg, Laurent Terzieff, Emmanuelle Riva, Didi Perego, Gianni Garko, Annabella Besi, Graziella Galvani, Paola Pitagora', null, 'Determined to survive at any price, Edith, a young Jewish woman deported to an extermination camp, manages to survive by accepting the role of kapo, a privileged prisoner whose mission is to ruthlessly guard other prisoners.', 'Determined to survive at any price, Edith, a young Jewish woman deported to an extermination camp, manages to survive by accepting the role of kapo, a privileged prisoner whose mission is to ruthlessly guard other prisoners.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lAd0NUnvTFkgcwbJmbx0sffn7Bk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45884'),
  ('1088012607446024216', 'Kapoor & Sons', 2016, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy, Family', 'Shakun Batra, Dave Sohrab Makker, Aditya Gunavanthe', null, 'Sidharth Malhotra, Fawad Khan, Alia Bhatt, Ratna Pathak Shah, Rishi Kapoor, Rajat Kapoor, Anahita Oberoi, Vikram Kapadia', null, 'Returning home to visit their ill grandfather, two estranged brothers must confront their unresolved rivalry while their parents’ marriage frays.', 'Returning home to visit their ill grandfather, two estranged brothers must confront their unresolved rivalry while their parents’ marriage frays.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oPdcOInH8TqR5udDTDPiDuLSN90.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:374173'),
  ('220781003361201416', 'Kappela', 2020, 'Romance, Mystery', 'Muhammad Musthafa, Jimshi Khalid', 'Muhammad Musthafa', 'Anna Ben, Roshan Mathew, Sreenath Bhasi, Sudhi Koppa, Tanvi Ram, James Eliya, Muhammad Musthafa, Nisha Sarangh', null, 'Falling into an over-the-phone romance with a rickshaw driver, a young woman visits his city when an encounter with a stranger derails their meeting.', 'Falling into an over-the-phone romance with a rickshaw driver, a young woman visits his city when an encounter with a stranger derails their meeting.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5e6yMw6ipz7DvLbtKAvHjbQAjHr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:713854'),
  ('346688637703508485', 'Käpt’n Blaubär – Der Film', 1999, 'Animation', 'Hayo Freitag, Graham Tiernan', 'Walter Moers', 'Wolfgang Völz, Edgar Hoppe, Helge Schneider, Sabine Bohlmann, Felix Beyerbach, Kurt Stukenberg', null, 'Captain Blaubär’s archenemy Prof. Dr. Feinfinger, kidnapped the grandson of Blaubär, three little bears, from his custody to avenge himself at Blaubär, who had destroyed the years before Feinfinger’s plans to conquer the world. Together with his friend Hein Blöd, Blaubär sets out to free them.', 'Captain Blaubär’s archenemy Prof. Dr. Feinfinger, kidnapped the grandson of Blaubär, three little bears, from his custody to avenge himself at Blaubär, who had destroyed the years before Feinfinger’s plans to conquer the world. Together with his friend Hein Blöd, Blaubär sets out to free them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uDQj3XnGc0s9wLGFMvweSYYTKFP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10392'),
  ('673209003613834827', 'Kara Gözlüm', 1970, 'Comedy, Romance, Music', 'Atıf Yılmaz', 'Bülent Oran', 'Türkan Şoray, Kadir İnanır, Ali Şen, Müjdat Gezen, Aziz Basmacı, Diclehan Baban, Mualla Sürer, Mürüvvet Sim Caymaz', null, 'Azize, who sells fish with her father, is discovered by a bar owner with her beautiful voice. She becomes a famous singer in a short time with the anonymous compositions and even gets a movie offer from Hollywood. However, nothing goes as planned for Azize. She is forced to choose between her love and her dreams.', 'Azize, who sells fish with her father, is discovered by a bar owner with her beautiful voice. She becomes a famous singer in a short time with the anonymous compositions and even gets a movie offer from Hollywood. However, nothing goes as planned for Azize. She is forced to choose between her love and her dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lHpoMNp0K1nV3EbyWpiz0zBLRKw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:302081'),
  ('386641805591800044', 'Kara Murat: Denizler Hakimi', 1977, 'Action', 'Natuk Baytan', 'Fuat Özlüer, Rahmi Turan, Erdoğan Tünaş', 'Cüneyt Arkın, Sevda Karaca, Piero Fabiani, Hüseyin Baradan, Kayhan Yıldızoğlu, Atilla Ergün, Süheyl Eğriboz, Kudret Karadağ', null, 'It is the Fatih''s reign.. When the ship of Naval Captain Yunus is on the way to return to the country, the ship is stopped and controlled by the Black Pirate and his men. All the the treasure and monies are taken by him. The pirate is protected by Prince Nikolas of Kos. They always plunder Turkish villages. Fatih orders Kara Murat to take care of them and save the Captain and his men.', 'It is the Fatih''s reign.. When the ship of Naval Captain Yunus is on the way to return to the country, the ship is stopped and controlled by the Black Pirate and his men. All the the treasure and monies are taken by him. The pirate is protected by Prince Nikolas of Kos. They always plunder Turkish villages. Fatih orders Kara Murat to take care of them and save the Captain and his men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4H4FgkoHg5dAH3hJYO02BkDSUw5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:260146'),
  ('600377912273824609', 'Kara Murat: Devler Savaşıyor', 1978, 'Action', 'Natuk Baytan', 'Rahmi Turan, Fuat Özlüer, Erdoğan Tünaş', 'Cüneyt Arkın, Canan Perver, Tanju Gürsu, Sümer Tilmaç, Reha Yurdakul, Hulusi Kentmen, Turgut Özatay, Kayhan Yıldızoğlu', null, 'Fatih Sultan Mehmet learns that Mora is without a leader. Chaos has broken out in Mora. Rum Kani Pasha blames the grand vizier for this chaos. Kara Murat, however, claims that Rum Kani Pasha is slandering him because he has his eye on the grand vizier''s position, and that this is not true. Upon hearing these words, Fatih Sultan Mehmet issues a death warrant for Kara Murat.', 'Fatih Sultan Mehmet learns that Mora is without a leader. Chaos has broken out in Mora. Rum Kani Pasha blames the grand vizier for this chaos. Kara Murat, however, claims that Rum Kani Pasha is slandering him because he has his eye on the grand vizier''s position, and that this is not true. Upon hearing these words, Fatih Sultan Mehmet issues a death warrant for Kara Murat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/504NSpvXhQu5ke1P0Uy3C4nI92S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:453114'),
  ('383247846091132206', 'Kara Murat: Fatih''ın Fedaisi', 1972, 'Action', 'Natuk Baytan', 'Fuat Özlüer', 'Cüneyt Arkın, Hale Soygazi, Turgut Özatay, Mualla Omay, Erol Taş, Süheyl Eğriboz, Bora Ayanoğlu, Atıf Kaptan', null, 'Under the leadership of Sultan Mehmed the Conqueror, the Ottoman army captures one Byzantine territory after another, culminating in the conquest of Constantinople, which becomes the capital of the Ottoman Empire. During this time, Vlad the Impaler, the ruthless and notorious ruler of Wallachia, launches brutal raids on Turkish villages, ambushing and savagely killing Ottoman soldiers. To put an end to Vlad''s atrocities, Sultan Mehmed tasks Hamza Pasha with confronting him. Vlad ensnares the Ottoman raiders, taking most of them captive, including the brother of Kara Murat. Kara Murat is coerced into betraying his master and is sent to the Ottoman palace as a spy.', 'Under the leadership of Sultan Mehmed the Conqueror, the Ottoman army captures one Byzantine territory after another, culminating in the conquest of Constantinople, which becomes the capital of the Ottoman Empire. During this time, Vlad the Impaler, the ruthless and notorious ruler of Wallachia, launches brutal raids on Turkish villages, ambushing and savagely killing Ottoman soldiers. To put an end to Vlad''s atrocities, Sultan Mehmed tasks Hamza Pasha with confronting him. Vlad ensnares the Ottoman raiders, taking most of them captive, including the brother of Kara Murat. Kara Murat is coerced into betraying his master and is sent to the Ottoman palace as a spy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vATDDhYiDjYhbbctsFB0I3oFLDv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:418493'),
  ('698879983077881939', 'Kara Murat: Kara Şövalyeye Karşı', 1975, 'Action', 'Çetin Gürtop, Natuk Baytan', 'Fuat Özlüer, Erdoğan Tünaş, Rahmi Turan', 'Cüneyt Arkın, Burçin Doğu, Mualla Omay, Reha Yurdakul, Turgut Özatay, Atilla Ergün, İsmail Yavuz Selekman, İhsan Gedik', null, 'Byzantine Prince kills Kara Murat''s father and kidnaps his brother to raise him as the Black Knight to fight against Turks. Years later, Kara Murat has to face the notorious enemy in a mission to save abducted Karaca Pasha of Rumelia.', 'Byzantine Prince kills Kara Murat''s father and kidnaps his brother to raise him as the Black Knight to fight against Turks. Years later, Kara Murat has to face the notorious enemy in a mission to save abducted Karaca Pasha of Rumelia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pptuNCOeg1YPve43f95PA3LcbDK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:439983'),
  ('705327427885678416', 'Kara Murat: Ölüm Emri', 1974, 'Action', 'Natuk Baytan', 'Rahmi Turan, Fuat Özlüer, Abdullah Turhan', 'Cüneyt Arkın, Feri Cansel, Cemil Şahbaz, Bülent Kayabaş, Hüseyin Zan, Melek Ayberk, Hulusi Kentmen, Yıldırım Gencer', null, 'Kara Murat goes to Byzantium with two soldiers named Ömer and Cafer. Emperor Constantine will make Prince Orhan the Ottoman ruler after Sultan Murat II dies. Actually, it is Prince Mehmet II''s turn. If Orhan becomes the ruler, Prince Mehmet must be killed because he is a friend of Byzantium.', 'Kara Murat goes to Byzantium with two soldiers named Ömer and Cafer. Emperor Constantine will make Prince Orhan the Ottoman ruler after Sultan Murat II dies. Actually, it is Prince Mehmet II''s turn. If Orhan becomes the ruler, Prince Mehmet must be killed because he is a friend of Byzantium.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rFbVsSUdrmrMgZ2IpYPOztTsqZD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:453100'),
  ('1149457028226465322', 'Karadima Forest', 2015, 'Drama', 'M.I. Littin-Menz, Matias Lira, Ramiro Zamorano', 'Elisa Eliash, Alicia Scherson, Álvaro Díaz González', 'Luis Gnecco, Benjamín Vicuña, Ingrid Isensee, Pedro Campos, Aline Küppenheim, Francisco Melo, Gloria Münchmeyer, Marcial Tagle', null, 'Based on true events, involving powerful Catholic priest Fernando Karadima, who committed crimes of child abuse and pedophile between 1980''s-2000''s. The struggle of his victims, to be able to reveal the truth and look for justice.', 'Based on true events, involving powerful Catholic priest Fernando Karadima, who committed crimes of child abuse and pedophile between 1980''s-2000''s. The struggle of his victims, to be able to reveal the truth and look for justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xjmipY93H5HRk4BS79cDSYpGTRu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:337101'),
  ('783358595644852101', 'Karakon On The Street', 1986, 'Comedy', 'Ahmed Yehia', 'Ahmad El Khatib', 'Adel Emam, Yousra, Ali Al Sharif, Naima ElSoghier, Youssef Daoud, Raafat Maher Labib, Liza, Maher Labib', null, 'Sharif, his wife Su''ad, their daughter Sarah, their son Hany and his mother are all living in the shelters after their house was demolished. Due to the inhumane standard of living in the shelters, they go to live in the courtyard of the family house. Unfortunately they find another person living there. Sharif designs and builds a wooden cabin to live in the street. He is subjected to many harassment.', 'Sharif, his wife Su''ad, their daughter Sarah, their son Hany and his mother are all living in the shelters after their house was demolished. Due to the inhumane standard of living in the shelters, they go to live in the courtyard of the family house. Unfortunately they find another person living there. Sharif designs and builds a wooden cabin to live in the street. He is subjected to many harassment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nnHFW4I27UxBOUllGRxBFIhwYjj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:514146'),
  ('909556611357457571', 'Karam', 2005, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Sanjay F. Gupta', 'Suparn Verma', 'John Abraham, Priyanka Chopra Jonas, Bharat Dabholkar, Vishwajeet Pradhan, Shiney Ahuja', null, 'A hitman quits the killing business when a hit goes right but at the same time produces unfortunate results. Soon, he is forced to return in order to save his wife from the clutches of his boss who won''t spare her unless some targets are executed within the limited time period.', 'A hitman quits the killing business when a hit goes right but at the same time produces unfortunate results. Soon, he is forced to return in order to save his wife from the clutches of his boss who won''t spare her unless some targets are executed within the limited time period.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wyxJ3KkygtNApMpNS1t23nOjmGV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:272220'),
  ('180973056815290862', 'Karamurat', 1976, 'War, Action, Adventure, History', 'Ernst Hofbauer, Natuk Baytan', 'Erdoğan Tünaş, Fuat Özlüer', 'Cüneyt Arkın, Daniela Giordano, Pasquale Basile, Serçin Erden, Bora Ayanoğlu, Kadir Savun, Hüseyin Alp, Turgut Özatay', null, 'Karamurat, a fearless Janissary agent serving Sultan Mehmed, is sent in 1456 to the rebel province of Minchionia to uncover the secret behind the tyrant Mustafa’s power, rumored to stem from a hypnotic “white powder” imported from China.', 'Karamurat, a fearless Janissary agent serving Sultan Mehmed, is sent in 1456 to the rebel province of Minchionia to uncover the secret behind the tyrant Mustafa’s power, rumored to stem from a hypnotic “white powder” imported from China.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kNmQQ0wCXAiwKHrbJtJWCwL0DQ7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:335353'),
  ('170400706662693390', 'Karamurat: The Sultan''s Warrior', 1973, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Natuk Baytan', null, 'Cüneyt Arkın, Melda Sözen, Meral Orhonsay, Erol Taş, Süheyl Eğriboz, Kenan Pars, Mualla Omay, Atilla Ergün', null, 'Sultan Khan of Ottoman Empire has fallen in love with Princess Iren of Byzantium. When he asks her father Niktol for her hand he refuses and tries to kill Khan. The Sultan''s armies then attack and overtake Constantinople (now renamed Istanbul). Niktol kills Princess Iren and flees with his army to the island of Lesbos. From Lesbos, Niktol launches a series of ruthless attacks on Turkish villages resulting in the death of one of the Sultan''s guard''s mother. The guard, Murat, is sent by the Sultan on a mission to avenge his mother''s death and bring back the head of the man who killed Iren. Murat goes undercover in Lesbos posing as Royal Guard Kostas, seeking the killers.', 'Sultan Khan of Ottoman Empire has fallen in love with Princess Iren of Byzantium. When he asks her father Niktol for her hand he refuses and tries to kill Khan. The Sultan''s armies then attack and overtake Constantinople (now renamed Istanbul). Niktol kills Princess Iren and flees with his army to the island of Lesbos. From Lesbos, Niktol launches a series of ruthless attacks on Turkish villages resulting in the death of one of the Sultan''s guard''s mother. The guard, Murat, is sent by the Sultan on a mission to avenge his mother''s death and bring back the head of the man who killed Iren. Murat goes undercover in Lesbos posing as Royal Guard Kostas, seeking the killers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wHz8eOdqbs8yzkjJiuAYF5Bpw8h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:425847'),
  ('156521130846345287', 'Karan Arjun', 1995, 'Action, Thriller', 'Rakesh Roshan, Kaka Thakur, Anurag Singh', null, 'Shah Rukh Khan, Salman Khan, Rakhee Gulzar, Kajol, Mamta Kulkarni, Amrish Puri, Ranjeet Bedi, Aasif Sheikh', null, 'Karan and Arjun reincarnate in the different parts of the country. But the faith of their previous mother brings them together in order to avenge their death.', 'Karan and Arjun reincarnate in the different parts of the country. But the faith of their previous mother brings them together in order to avenge their death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uYhjsC9gCKhxiG2enkCJgdLOXjB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93519'),
  ('649606423857796568', 'Karaoke', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Marine Benoit, Alannah Carrot, Stéphane Ben Lahcene', 'Stéphane Ben Lahcene', 'Michèle Laroque, Claudia Tagbo, Sébastien Chassagne, David Mora, Jochen Hägele, Aaliyah Lexilus, Mahily Dement Elismar, Victoria Monfort', null, 'Bénédicte, a famous opera singer, leads the life of a diva between Parisian palaces and social gatherings. After an evening of excess, she sees her career crumble. Fatou, also a palace regular but as a cleaning lady, is the only one to reach out to her. Passionate about singing, Fatou has one idea in mind: to convince Bénédicte to take part in the big national karaoke contest. The perfect vocal mastery of one and the tenacity of the other could well create sparks and take them very far.', 'Bénédicte, a famous opera singer, leads the life of a diva between Parisian palaces and social gatherings. After an evening of excess, she sees her career crumble. Fatou, also a palace regular but as a cleaning lady, is the only one to reach out to her. Passionate about singing, Fatou has one idea in mind: to convince Bénédicte to take part in the big national karaoke contest. The perfect vocal mastery of one and the tenacity of the other could well create sparks and take them very far.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9JjeH6CYkwl8KsBX4SlJIx4PdUb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1088570'),
  ('313980129197062792', 'Karaoke Crazies', 2016, 'Mystery, Fantasy', 'Kim Sang-chan, Chang U-yeong', 'Park Ji-hong', 'Lee Moon-sik, Bae So-eun, Kim Na-mi, Mr. Pang', null, '"Addiction Karaoke" is run by Sung-wook. When business is slow, he hires singing helper Ha-suck, a girl in her early 20s. She''s a hopeless game addict, but somehow lures customers in. Na-ju joins the crew and brightens up the miserable place with her bubbly character. Just when everything starts turning for the better, little do they know that a serial killer on the loose in town is after something in the karaoke.', '"Addiction Karaoke" is run by Sung-wook. When business is slow, he hires singing helper Ha-suck, a girl in her early 20s. She''s a hopeless game addict, but somehow lures customers in. Na-ju joins the crew and brightens up the miserable place with her bubbly character. Just when everything starts turning for the better, little do they know that a serial killer on the loose in town is after something in the karaoke.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gdKteapzsc2Isgx4gmVyIRJMP1z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:381067'),
  ('53643874298316731', 'Karaoke Terror', 2003, 'Drama', 'Tetsuo Shinohara, Junichi Akatsu, Hiroshi Takase', 'Sumio Ōmori', 'Ryuhei Matsuda, Kanako Higuchi, Masanobu Ando, Hiroyuki Ikeuchi, Yoichiro Saito, Sawa Suzuki, Miwako Ichikawa, Kayoko Kishimoto', null, 'One of a gang of karaoke loving middle aged women is murdered by a young man. Her friends track him down and kill him. His friends track them down and kill the killer and it escalates!', 'One of a gang of karaoke loving middle aged women is murdered by a young man. Her friends track him down and kill him. His friends track them down and kill the killer and it escalates!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hVviScaRhm703pIunceFk97ndQg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73306'),
  ('764816208062807583', 'Karate Bear Fighter', 1975, 'Action, Adventure', 'Kazuhiko Yamaguchi', 'Masahiro Kakefuda, Nobuaki Nakajima', 'Sonny Chiba, Yutaka Nakajima, Yumi Takigawa, Masashi Ishibashi, Hideo Murota, Eiji Gō, Katsumasa Uchida, Mikio Narita', null, 'Masutatsu Oyama is recruited by his former Army friend to work for a crew of gangsters, but when they kill both his girlfriend and his best friend, Oyama flees away to a small town where he both learns lessons in martial arts philosophy from a wandering master and helps a young boy take on a challenge to fight a ferocious captured bear to win money for the boy''s injured father.', 'Masutatsu Oyama is recruited by his former Army friend to work for a crew of gangsters, but when they kill both his girlfriend and his best friend, Oyama flees away to a small town where he both learns lessons in martial arts philosophy from a wandering master and helps a young boy take on a challenge to fight a ferocious captured bear to win money for the boy''s injured father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uVfTKtwjTgiu7HdK7rUEkApQkRU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13124'),
  ('596258496182244081', 'Karate Bullfighter', 1975, 'Action, Drama', 'Kazuhiko Yamaguchi, Yoshio Nakajima, Michio Fukuyu', 'Norifumi Suzuki', 'Sonny Chiba, Jirô Chiba, Kenji Imai, Masashi Ishibashi, Mikio Narita, Yumi Takigawa, Katsumasa Uchida, Etsuko Shihomi', null, 'Sonny Chiba plays Kyokushin Karate founder Masutatsu Oyama, who unexpectedly arrives at a karate tournament in rags, but wins the tournament. After turning down the chance to fight at future tournaments he returns to his simple village life. He reluctantly returns to karate for a final showdown against the students of a rival school.', 'Sonny Chiba plays Kyokushin Karate founder Masutatsu Oyama, who unexpectedly arrives at a karate tournament in rags, but wins the tournament. After turning down the chance to fight at future tournaments he returns to his simple village life. He reluctantly returns to karate for a final showdown against the students of a rival school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jbkAJh4mnYX95Kg7o521vqTLtm8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13125'),
  ('385683298316871533', 'Karate Cop', 1991, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Alan Roberts', 'Bill Zide, Denny Grayson, Ronald L. Marchini', 'Ronald L. Marchini, Carrie Chambers, Michael E. Bristow, David Carradine, D.W. Landingham, Michael M. Foley, Dana Bentley, Dax Nicholas', null, 'John Travis is the last honest cop in a future dominated by terroristic martial-arts gangs who fight gladiator-style in arenas.', 'John Travis is the last honest cop in a future dominated by terroristic martial-arts gangs who fight gladiator-style in arenas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ec58TWPLlmaO05oWShdv9fcGXqG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53979'),
  ('8704041806746362', 'Karate for Life', 1977, 'Action', 'Kazuhiko Yamaguchi', 'Masahiro Kakefuda', 'Sonny Chiba, Hideo Murota, Masaru Shiga, Masashi Ishibashi, Yoko Natsuki, Hiroshi Nawa, Asao Uchida, Kōjirō Hongō', null, 'The last of the Masutatsu Oyama trilogy. Oyama takes a job as a professional wrestler in Okinawa, but when he discovers that he is expected to take a dive, he quits in disgust. However, when a friend finds herself in desperate need of medical supplies, Oyama steps back in the ring to raise the money—but will he be able to follow the script this time?', 'The last of the Masutatsu Oyama trilogy. Oyama takes a job as a professional wrestler in Okinawa, but when he discovers that he is expected to take a dive, he quits in disgust. However, when a friend finds herself in desperate need of medical supplies, Oyama steps back in the ring to raise the money—but will he be able to follow the script this time?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xrMdDEjJhgyQG0LYtXhMNILARo4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13126'),
  ('768967512735715570', 'Karate Girl', 2011, 'Action', 'Yoshikatsu Kimura, Fuyuhiko Nishi, Daisuke Soma', 'Fuyuhiko Nishi', 'Rina Takeda, Hina Tobimatsu, Kazutoshi Yokoyama, Richard Heselton, Keisuke Horibe, Tatsuya Naka, Kyôji Amano, Keisuke Horibe', null, 'In Okinawa, Ayaka Kurenai was born in the world’s greatest legendary Karate family. When she was a child, her family was attacked by a mysterious gang that seeks legendary black belt. Her father Soujiro Kurenai was killed and her younger sister was taken in front of her. Time has passed. In Yokohama, she was spending her life as a normal high school girl, hiding her real name and her status as a heir of the legendary Karate family. However, one incident brought her a fateful encounter with her sister who was separated in their childhood. But, her sister was raised as a heartless killing machine by the mysterious gang who took her. .', 'In Okinawa, Ayaka Kurenai was born in the world’s greatest legendary Karate family. When she was a child, her family was attacked by a mysterious gang that seeks legendary black belt. Her father Soujiro Kurenai was killed and her younger sister was taken in front of her. Time has passed. In Yokohama, she was spending her life as a normal high school girl, hiding her real name and her status as a heir of the legendary Karate family. However, one incident brought her a fateful encounter with her sister who was separated in their childhood. But, her sister was raised as a heartless killing machine by the mysterious gang who took her. .', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5YsUw6U5IE1H21zT39zXsWkNysC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68649'),
  ('1119951275073752854', 'Karate Kid: Legends', 2025, 'Action, Adventure, Drama', 'Jonathan Entwistle, Justin Brown, Richard Graves', 'Rob Lieber', 'Jackie Chan, Ben Wang, Joshua Jackson, Sadie Stanley, Ming-Na Wen, Wyatt Oleff, Aramis Knight, Ralph Macchio', 'PG-13', 'After a family tragedy, kung fu prodigy Li Fong is uprooted from his home in Beijing and forced to move to New York City with his mother. When a new friend needs his help, Li enters a karate competition – but his skills alone aren''t enough. Li''s kung fu teacher Mr. Han enlists original Karate Kid Daniel LaRusso for help, and Li learns a new way to fight, merging their two styles into one for the ultimate martial arts showdown.', 'After a family tragedy, kung fu prodigy Li Fong is uprooted from his home in Beijing and forced to move to New York City with his mother. When a new friend needs his help, Li enters a karate competition – but his skills alone aren''t enough. Li''s kung fu teacher Mr. Han enlists original Karate Kid Daniel LaRusso for help, and Li learns a new way to fight, merging their two styles into one for the ultimate martial arts showdown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c90Lt7OQGsOmhv6x4JoFdoHzw5l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1011477'),
  ('85311962180544244', 'Karate Kill', 2016, 'Action', 'Kurando Mitsutake, Keiya Tabuchi, Sam Yano', 'Kurando Mitsutake', 'Hayate Masao, Mana Sakura, Asami, David Sakurai, Katarina Leigh Waters, Jeffrey James Lippold, Toshiya Agata, Kirk Geiger', null, 'When a mysterious loner and Karate master Kenji''s little sister goes missing in Los Angeles, whoever stands in his way of finding her will face the wrath of a lethal KARATE KILL!', 'When a mysterious loner and Karate master Kenji''s little sister goes missing in Los Angeles, whoever stands in his way of finding her will face the wrath of a lethal KARATE KILL!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nJ2ybTAMo90frsdaXJl5JqwGSEP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:407777'),
  ('812122591722671970', 'Karate Warrior', 1987, 'Action', 'Fabrizio De Angelis, Giuseppe Pinori', 'Fabrizio De Angelis, Dardano Sacchetti', 'Kim Rossi Stuart, Ken Watanabe, Jannelle Barretto, Jared Martin, Janet Ågren, Enrico Torralba, Jonny Tuazon, Rudy Meyer', null, 'Anthony is in the Phillipines visiting his father. He inadvertently interferes with the affairs of local gangster Quino, who also happens to be a champion Karate fighter. After embarrassing Quino near a local tournament, Anthony is beaten up and left for dead. An old monk nurses Anthony back to health and teaches him the ways of martial arts so he may go back and fight Quino again.', 'Anthony is in the Phillipines visiting his father. He inadvertently interferes with the affairs of local gangster Quino, who also happens to be a champion Karate fighter. After embarrassing Quino near a local tournament, Anthony is beaten up and left for dead. An old monk nurses Anthony back to health and teaches him the ways of martial arts so he may go back and fight Quino again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hptHB6GKTb30didoSVM3XNLFZfU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59573'),
  ('403119681442229162', 'Karate Warrior 2', 1988, 'Action, Adventure', 'Fabrizio De Angelis, Giorgio Di Battista', 'Dardano Sacchetti, Fabrizio De Angelis', 'Kim Rossi Stuart, Amy Lynn Baxter, Christopher Alan, Ted Prior, Winston Haynes, Bryan Guerrieri, Leon Elalout, Ishah Laurah Wright', null, 'After studying martial arts in the Philippines and defeating his opponent Quino, Anthony Scott heads back to the U.S. to attend college. Making the promise to his teacher that he will not fight, Anthony finds himself the target of the Tigers, a local martial arts gang led by bully Dick. When Dick constantly attempts to fight Anthony, Anthony refuses. However, Anthony will fight under the condition that it will be a fair fight. When Dick resorts to dirty tactics, Anthony uses his special move, The Dragon Strike, to defeat Dick. Upset at his loss, Dick decides to get even through the Tigers'' real leader, Mark Sanders.', 'After studying martial arts in the Philippines and defeating his opponent Quino, Anthony Scott heads back to the U.S. to attend college. Making the promise to his teacher that he will not fight, Anthony finds himself the target of the Tigers, a local martial arts gang led by bully Dick. When Dick constantly attempts to fight Anthony, Anthony refuses. However, Anthony will fight under the condition that it will be a fair fight. When Dick resorts to dirty tactics, Anthony uses his special move, The Dragon Strike, to defeat Dick. Upset at his loss, Dick decides to get even through the Tigers'' real leader, Mark Sanders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sMbTaC5dIptjgr7czVtGeNiFvRU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28603'),
  ('504402112120368231', 'Karate Warrior 3', 1991, 'Drama, Action, Adventure', 'Fabrizio De Angelis', null, 'Ron Williams, Dorian D. Field, Christopher Alan, Scotty Daffron, Katy Johnson, Lauren Russel, Richard Goon', null, 'A young man has to face a karate fighter to retrieve the kimono that belonged to a great master. The problem is that he does not understand anything about martial arts, but a master is willing to teach it.', 'A young man has to face a karate fighter to retrieve the kimono that belonged to a great master. The problem is that he does not understand anything about martial arts, but a master is willing to teach it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y93kG58apdPkg3IfYgtotS0t2nV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:175050'),
  ('710056336899857820', 'Karate-Robo Zaborgar', 2011, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Noboru Iguchi, Yasutaka Nagano, Isao Karasawa', 'Noboru Iguchi', 'Yasuhisa Furuhara, Itsuji Itao, Mami Yamasaki, Yuya Miyashita, Aimi Satsukawa, Demo Tanaka, Kentaro Kishi, Kentarō Shimazu', null, 'An evil criminal organisation called Sigma kidnap prominment business leaders to harvest their DNA and only Karate-Robo Zaborgar can save them.', 'An evil criminal organisation called Sigma kidnap prominment business leaders to harvest their DNA and only Karate-Robo Zaborgar can save them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wvfbdU4jm09D5miXyOpyiTMOCKN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85656'),
  ('494729186712330020', 'Kardec', 2019, 'Drama, History', 'Wagner de Assis, Renata Amaral, Nonato Estrela', 'L.G. Bayão, Wagner de Assis', 'Leonardo Medeiros, Sandra Corveloni, Dalton Vigh, Julia Konrad, Júlia Svacinna, Genézio de Barros, Charles Fricks, Guida Vianna', null, 'The story of Allan Kardec, from his days as an educator to his contribution to the spiritist codification.', 'The story of Allan Kardec, from his days as an educator to his contribution to the spiritist codification.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gDfki2cMZnwHOUKNfVNWiRNMGht.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:600335'),
  ('94875054991770635', 'Kardes Takimi 3', 2026, 'Adventure, Comedy, Family, Children', 'Bedran Güzel, Özkan Karaköse', 'Elif Dede', 'Ceyda Kasabalı, Fırat Albayram, Ecrin Su Çoban, Çağan Efe Ak, Gece Işık Demirel', null, 'The agent family is this time dragged into an adventure full of leaps in time.', 'The agent family is this time dragged into an adventure full of leaps in time.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F5VwObi6neCFYPmxDYtnb4KmDGS3.jpg', 'plex:movie:kardes-takimi-3'),
  ('632176855797950047', 'Karem the Possession', 2021, 'Horror', 'Junichiro Hayashi, Henry Bedwell', 'Henry Bedwell', 'Raquel Rodríguez, Daniel Martínez, Dominika Paleta, Ramón Medína, Miranda Kay, Gregorio Urquijo, Santiago Beltrán Ulrich, Hector Kotsifakis', null, 'A possessed young girl from an atheist family refuses to let her new powers go and becomes more than a threat to everyone besides her.', 'A possessed young girl from an atheist family refuses to let her new powers go and becomes more than a threat to everyone besides her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zFjccRxU8aYj2NJIOit42zDNd7T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:671269'),
  ('960448622394613', 'Karen', 2021, 'Thriller', 'Anthony J. Rickert-Epstein, Coke Daniels', 'Coke Daniels', 'Taryn Manning, Cory Hardrict, Jasmine Burke, Ava Ann Gale, Gregory Alan Williams, Dawn Halfkenny, Brandon Sklenar, Hunter Bodine', null, 'A racist woman makes it her personal mission to displace the new black family that has just moved in next door to her, but they won''t back down without a fight.', 'A racist woman makes it her personal mission to displace the new black family that has just moved in next door to her, but they won''t back down without a fight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a8J5xyJIPiNG2FGQVMt4IHHaY9M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:735981'),
  ('132263647210148014', 'Karen Cries on the Bus', 2011, 'Drama', 'Gabriel Rojas Vera, Manuel Castañeda', 'Gabriel Rojas Vera', 'Ángela Carrizosa, Juan Manuel Diaz Oroztegui, Diego Galindo, Angelica Sanchez, Diego Pelaez', null, 'Karen discovers, after 10 years of marriage, she has left behind her dreams devoting herself to home chores and realizes it has been a mistake that cost her her youth. She decides then to separate and go in search of a life of its own. With her savings she rents a room in the center of Bogota and tries to get a job, but her age and inexperience makes it difficult. Karen will have to decide between returning to the stability of a relationship or facing life for herself.', 'Karen discovers, after 10 years of marriage, she has left behind her dreams devoting herself to home chores and realizes it has been a mistake that cost her her youth. She decides then to separate and go in search of a life of its own. With her savings she rents a room in the center of Bogota and tries to get a job, but her age and inexperience makes it difficult. Karen will have to decide between returning to the stability of a relationship or facing life for herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1bBNXssEoB8FBKQQrBEc4tKhyhn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88599'),
  ('952890412778500412', 'Karen Kingsbury''s Maggie''s Christmas Miracle', 2017, 'Romance, Drama, TV Movie', 'Michael Robison', 'Karen Kingsbury, Tyler Russell, Maria Nation', 'Jill Wagner, Luke Macfarlane, Laura Soltis, Viv Leacock, Lane Edwards, Françoise Yip, Kelsey Kupecky, Jordyn Ashley Olson', null, 'Maggie, a single mom has to balance between her career and her son, Jordan. Jordan finds a tutor named Casey to help him at school, and Casey becomes like a father figure. Will the three of them find happiness and love once again?', 'Maggie, a single mom has to balance between her career and her son, Jordan. Jordan finds a tutor named Casey to help him at school, and Casey becomes like a father figure. Will the three of them find happiness and love once again?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1q171RMGfBIq36kGRwPznaxoKM2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:480632'),
  ('1030073674849943875', 'Karikaada', 2026, null, 'Gilli Venkatesh', 'Kaada Natraj, Gilli Venkatesh', 'Kriti Verma, Kari Subbu, Yash Shetty, Vipin Prakash, Govinde Gowda', null, 'Divine love transforms Kaada''s hunting heritage into an epic tale of adventure, action, and romance, leading him to abandon his former life.', 'Divine love transforms Kaada''s hunting heritage into an epic tale of adventure, action, and romance, leading him to abandon his former life.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fm.media-amazon.com%2Fimages%2FM%2FMV5BMGZiOTJmZTgtM2UwNi00OGMzLWExN2MtZWViMDlhMjliZDE3XkEyXkFqcGc%40._V1_.jpg', 'plex:movie:karikaada'),
  ('452051412343417475', 'Karin, Daughter of Ingmar', 1920, 'Drama', 'Victor Sjöström, Henrik Jaenzon, Gustaf Boge', 'Victor Sjöström, Ester Julin', 'Tora Teje, Victor Sjöström, Bertil Malmstedt, Nils Lundell, Tor Weijden, Emil Fjellström, Nils Aréhn, Josua Bengtson', null, 'Karin Daughter of Ingmar is a 1920 Swedish silent drama film directed by Victor Sjöström. It is the second part in Sjöström''s large-scale adaption of Selma Lagerlöf''s novel Jerusalem, following Sons of Ingmar from the year before, and depicting chapter three and four from the novel. The critical reception was however unenthusiastic and Sjöström decided to not direct any more parts.', 'Karin Daughter of Ingmar is a 1920 Swedish silent drama film directed by Victor Sjöström. It is the second part in Sjöström''s large-scale adaption of Selma Lagerlöf''s novel Jerusalem, following Sons of Ingmar from the year before, and depicting chapter three and four from the novel. The critical reception was however unenthusiastic and Sjöström decided to not direct any more parts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9s8IwaCyKgHycChI3jsCcHTd8nw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133643'),
  ('807566629131384178', 'Karin''s Face', 1986, 'Documentary', 'Ingmar Bergman', null, 'Ingmar Bergman, Karin Bergman', null, 'This short film assembles still photographs from Ingmar Bergman’s personal family albums, concentrating on portraits of his mother, Karin, from childhood through adulthood. The images are arranged in chronological order and set to a piano score by Käbi Laretei, with no spoken narration.', 'This short film assembles still photographs from Ingmar Bergman’s personal family albums, concentrating on portraits of his mother, Karin, from childhood through adulthood. The images are arranged in chronological order and set to a piano score by Käbi Laretei, with no spoken narration.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gTgB4tiB9ZHIPtwt6jhhwoy15kX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104813'),
  ('505206903350020187', 'Karius and Baktus', 1955, 'Animation, Family', 'Ivo Caprino', 'Thorbjørn Egner', 'Turid Haaland, Kari Diesen, Thorbjørn Egner, Remo Caprino', null, 'The little tooth trolls Karius and Baktus tries to persuade Jens not to brush his teeth, and their picking wholes in his teeth can go on as planned. If the mother''s plea to Jens is winning, the happy days of white bread and syrup is over.', 'The little tooth trolls Karius and Baktus tries to persuade Jens not to brush his teeth, and their picking wholes in his teeth can go on as planned. If the mother''s plea to Jens is winning, the happy days of white bread and syrup is over.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gHNTKzOTDDSKv4JAL9mqJJoxP56.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37577'),
  ('574743876702644572', 'Karl Hess: Toward Liberty', 1980, 'Documentary', 'Roland Hallé, Peter W. Ladue', null, null, null, 'A look at Karl Hess, libertarian intellectual and activist, from his background as a magazine editor in his youth to his work as a Republican speechwriter, as he became simultaneously a writer for Barry Goldwater and a member of Students for a Democratic Society. In the late 1960s he embarked on a new period in his life, moving to rural West Virginia and becoming involved in movements promoting alternative technologies and renewable energy. He discusses his views opposing large institutions, ranging from government to corporations to universities.', 'A look at Karl Hess, libertarian intellectual and activist, from his background as a magazine editor in his youth to his work as a Republican speechwriter, as he became simultaneously a writer for Barry Goldwater and a member of Students for a Democratic Society. In the late 1960s he embarked on a new period in his life, moving to rural West Virginia and becoming involved in movements promoting alternative technologies and renewable energy. He discusses his views opposing large institutions, ranging from government to corporations to universities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i0gEpRrcI6tDTRyuTBxpL2oScQf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:244373'),
  ('694424705301411340', 'Karla', 2006, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Joel Bender, Charles Mills, Brandon Trost', 'Manette Beth Rosen, Joel Bender, Michael D. Sellers', 'Laura Prepon, Misha Collins, Patrick Bauchau, Emilie Jacobs, Alex Boyd, Tess Harper, Leonard Kelly-Young, Cherilyn Hayres', 'R', 'Based on real events, Canada''s most notorious serial killers, Paul Bernardo and wife Karla Homolka kidnap, sexually abuse, and murder three young girls.', 'Based on real events, Canada''s most notorious serial killers, Paul Bernardo and wife Karla Homolka kidnap, sexually abuse, and murder three young girls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mzKbHdw4pXs4QBsNE77LXEbJhZ7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9695'),
  ('934228979751162980', 'Karlson Returns', 1970, 'Adventure, Animation, Family', 'Boris Stepantsev', 'Boris Larin', 'Vasiliy Livanov, Klara Rumyanova, Faina Ranevskaya', null, 'The Kid didn''t have to miss Carlson for long - one day he landed in his room again. This means that there will be new adventures and pranks! With Carlson''s help, the harsh and bossy Freken Bock will be re-educated and become very kind. And then the friends will all put on a costume show with dancing and drink tea with buns.', 'The Kid didn''t have to miss Carlson for long - one day he landed in his room again. This means that there will be new adventures and pranks! With Carlson''s help, the harsh and bossy Freken Bock will be re-educated and become very kind. And then the friends will all put on a costume show with dancing and drink tea with buns.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ig4vsq3CPiJsQXKOIIx92SAkXEc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72203'),
  ('630693044817216425', 'Karlsson on the Roof', 1974, 'Family', 'Olle Hellbom, Lasse Björne', 'Astrid Lindgren', 'Lars Söderdahl, Mats Wikström, Catrin Westerlund, Stig Ossian Ericson, Staffan Hallerstam, Britt-Marie Näsholm, Nils Lagergren, Maria Selander', null, 'Svante is a young boy who lives with his family in a Stockholm apartment. One day he meets Karlsson, a chubby little man in the prime of his life, who can fly using a propeller on his back and who lives in his little house on the roof.', 'Svante is a young boy who lives with his family in a Stockholm apartment. One day he meets Karlsson, a chubby little man in the prime of his life, who can fly using a propeller on his back and who lives in his little house on the roof.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m02v0kOqAUZKvWecht5it3KZFYE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30576'),
  ('843205708880372028', 'Karlsson-on-the-Roof', 1971, 'Comedy, Adventure, Family', 'Valentin Pluchek, Margarita Mikaelyan', null, 'Миша Защипин, Spartak Mishulin, Tatyana Pelttser, Natalya Zashchipina, Полина Казакевич, Yuri Sokovnin, Andrey Mironov, Elena Mikheeva', null, 'The mischievous Carlson and the gullible Kid are the heroes of a well-known fairy tale. Carlson loves to play pranks very much, and for all the consequences of pranks he has a "proprietary" excuse: "It''s nothing, it''s an everyday thing!".', 'The mischievous Carlson and the gullible Kid are the heroes of a well-known fairy tale. Carlson loves to play pranks very much, and for all the consequences of pranks he has a "proprietary" excuse: "It''s nothing, it''s an everyday thing!".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l7B4iSWAWhCLAO8fwxmp8YOZE1V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:417924'),
  ('202189778244816917', 'Karma', 1986, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Thriller', 'Subhash Ghai', 'Kader Khan', 'Dilip Kumar, Naseeruddin Shah, Jackie Shroff, Anil Kapoor, Anupam Kher, Sridevi, Poonam Dhillon, Vinod Nagpal', null, 'When senior police inspector Vishwa Pratap Singh arrests Dr. Michael Dang, the leader of the international terrorist group PSO, the group blast the jail Dang is lodged in killing huge numbers of inmates including two of Vishwa''s sons and his daughter-in-law; with Dang escaping in the process. Vishwa, who now calls himself Dada Thakur, enlists three death row inmates and sets out to avenge his family''s slaughter.', 'When senior police inspector Vishwa Pratap Singh arrests Dr. Michael Dang, the leader of the international terrorist group PSO, the group blast the jail Dang is lodged in killing huge numbers of inmates including two of Vishwa''s sons and his daughter-in-law; with Dang escaping in the process. Vishwa, who now calls himself Dada Thakur, enlists three death row inmates and sets out to avenge his family''s slaughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vN0o0M9ftz1yd3vFYTmb78ZvYoi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:170845'),
  ('548338995206179880', 'Karmina', 1996, 'Comedy, Horror, Romance', 'Gabriel Pelletier, Eric Cayla', 'Yves Pelletier, Ann Burke, Gabriel Pelletier', 'Isabelle Cyr, Robert Brouillette, Yves Pelletier, France Castel, Gildor Roy, Raymond Cloutier, Sylvie Potvin, Diane Lavallée', null, 'Karmina, a young vampire, flees her Translylvanian castle where she must marry the horrible Vlad to please her father, the mean Baron, and her mother, the eccentric Baronness.', 'Karmina, a young vampire, flees her Translylvanian castle where she must marry the horrible Vlad to please her father, the mean Baron, and her mother, the eccentric Baronness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cHG9XPqlrN69MfBh0sSxHpVnew3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64445'),
  ('92589528338872404', 'Karmouz War', 2018, 'Action, War, Drama', 'Peter Mimi, Hussien Asar', 'Peter Mimi', 'Amir Karara, Ghada Abdel Razek, Mahmoud Hemida, Mostafa Khater, Bayoumi Fouad, Fouad Sharaf El Din, Scott Adkins, Mahmoud Hegazy', null, 'Alexandria, Egypt, 1940. Three young Egyptians come to the aid of a woman being attacked by three British soldiers. One of them is arrested and thrown in jail. When the military surrounds the police station and begins an all-out assault, it''s up to one man, Gen. Youssef al-Masri, to defend his prison and protect his people.', 'Alexandria, Egypt, 1940. Three young Egyptians come to the aid of a woman being attacked by three British soldiers. One of them is arrested and thrown in jail. When the military surrounds the police station and begins an all-out assault, it''s up to one man, Gen. Youssef al-Masri, to defend his prison and protect his people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uIDacOXgd06J5qP0PoVQi25ogFm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:521784'),
  ('929273187896423737', 'Karnan', 1964, 'Action, Drama, History', 'B. Ramakrishnaiah Panthulu, V. Ramamoorthy', 'Sakthi T. K. Krishnasamy', 'Sivaji Ganesan, N.T. Rama Rao, Savitri, Devika, M. V. Rajamma, S. A. Asokan, R. Muthuraman, O. A. K. Thevar', null, 'Brave and loyal warrior-archer Karna joins the Kauravas to battle the Pandavas in the Kurukshetra.', 'Brave and loyal warrior-archer Karna joins the Kauravas to battle the Pandavas in the Kurukshetra.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lQsw4hhUuglk8wvbQ34i6axAStN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102129'),
  ('654736950884597811', 'Karnan', 2021, 'Drama, Action', 'Mari Selvaraj, Theni Eashwar', 'Mari Selvaraj', 'Dhanush, Rajisha Vijayan, Natarajan Subramaniam, Lal, Yogi Babu, N. Azhagamperumal, Lakshmi Priyaa, Gouri G Kishan', null, 'Karnan, an angry young man, fights for the rights of his oppressed people. Can he save them from those who wield power and weapons?', 'Karnan, an angry young man, fights for the rights of his oppressed people. Can he save them from those who wield power and weapons?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z5SxDcVWa9nokynVqBHb2IKk78J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:680652'),
  ('352763011744555891', 'Karnaval', 1999, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Thomas Vincent, Colin Houben, Dominique Bouilleret', 'Thomas Vincent, Maxime Sassier', 'Sylvie Testud, Amar ben Abdallah, Clovis Cornillac, Jean-Paul Rouve', null, 'Karnaval is set against a backdrop of intolerance and hostility in the gloomy Northern French city of Dunkirk. The story is set during carnival time, when the citizens let themselves loose for six weeks of partying, carousing and having a good time. The film centers on Larbi, an Arab youth, and his confrontation with one of the turning points of his life. After a violent argument with his father, Larbi decides to leave the family''s business and go to Marseilles for a fresh start. On his last night in the town he grew up in, he sleeps in the hallway of an apartment building, where he is disturbed by Béa and Christian, a couple having fun at the carnival. Larbi is attracted to Béa and decides to stay a few more days to try his luck. In the free atmosphere of the carnival, Larbi discovers a world that he did not know existed, a world which is about to clash with his conservative outlook, and the three lives are changed forever.', 'Karnaval is set against a backdrop of intolerance and hostility in the gloomy Northern French city of Dunkirk. The story is set during carnival time, when the citizens let themselves loose for six weeks of partying, carousing and having a good time. The film centers on Larbi, an Arab youth, and his confrontation with one of the turning points of his life. After a violent argument with his father, Larbi decides to leave the family''s business and go to Marseilles for a fresh start. On his last night in the town he grew up in, he sleeps in the hallway of an apartment building, where he is disturbed by Béa and Christian, a couple having fun at the carnival. Larbi is attracted to Béa and decides to stay a few more days to try his luck. In the free atmosphere of the carnival, Larbi discovers a world that he did not know existed, a world which is about to clash with his conservative outlook, and the three lives are changed forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bLsLQ5GdChG77RDLc81tQOdaOmb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114407'),
  ('313016360606917540', 'Karnaval', 2013, 'Romance, Drama', 'Can Kılcıoğlu', 'Can Kılcıoğlu', 'Serdar Orçin, Tülin Özen, İpek Bilgin, Sait Genay, Vedat Erincin, Sarp Aydınoğlu, Pınar Gök, Sercan Gidişoğlu', null, '36-year-old Alis starts living in his car after his father kicks him out of the house. He shaves on the street, eats the food his mother brings over to his car, and applies to job adverts that his mother marks in the newspaper for him. After a series of rejections, he finds himself working door-to-door marketing Karnaval brand carpet cleaners. An unusual bond forms between Alis and "Karnaval". Karnaval even moves in with Alis occupying the front seat of his car. In this new adventure of his, Alis meets a wedding cake-maker named Demet. She lives with her father ever since her mother''s death, and dreams of hopping on her motorbike and moving to Istanbul where she would open up a bakery shop', '36-year-old Alis starts living in his car after his father kicks him out of the house. He shaves on the street, eats the food his mother brings over to his car, and applies to job adverts that his mother marks in the newspaper for him. After a series of rejections, he finds himself working door-to-door marketing Karnaval brand carpet cleaners. An unusual bond forms between Alis and "Karnaval". Karnaval even moves in with Alis occupying the front seat of his car. In this new adventure of his, Alis meets a wedding cake-maker named Demet. She lives with her father ever since her mother''s death, and dreams of hopping on her motorbike and moving to Istanbul where she would open up a bakery shop', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cZbpUYXBLmcT8LhmqbwiS9jUmi7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:271958'),
  ('435003423197226462', 'Karnawal', 2021, 'Drama', 'Juan Pablo Félix, Ramiro Civita, Silvia Lamas', 'Juan Pablo Félix', 'Martín López Lacci, Alfredo Castro, Mónica Lairana, Diego Cremonesi, Adrián Fondari, José Luis Arias, Sergio Prina, Angel Apolonio Cruz', null, 'During a carnival, near the border between Argentina and Bolivia, a young Malambo dancer prepares for the most important competition of his life. When his ex-felon father returns, he jeopardizes everything by dragging his son into the criminal world.', 'During a carnival, near the border between Argentina and Bolivia, a young Malambo dancer prepares for the most important competition of his life. When his ex-felon father returns, he jeopardizes everything by dragging his son into the criminal world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rge6YRQptZMxP9hCjuVZUU931n9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:680017'),
  ('945438180249958881', 'Karniggels', 1991, 'Comedy', 'Detlev Buck, Roger Heeremann, Hans-Erich Viet', 'Detlev Buck, Wolfgang Sieg', 'Bernd Michael Lade, Julia Jäger, Inga Busch, Anton Rattinger, Gerhard Marcel, Ingo Naujoks, Brigitte Böttrich, Harald Maack', null, 'After his training as a policeman, the young, shy Köppe is transferred to a northern German town. Unfortunately, in an area where fox and rabbit say goodnight, there is little for a lawman to do. So Köppe kills time with the search for mysterious cow murderers, flirting with two attractive women and befriending a likeable petty crook.', 'After his training as a policeman, the young, shy Köppe is transferred to a northern German town. Unfortunately, in an area where fox and rabbit say goodnight, there is little for a lawman to do. So Köppe kills time with the search for mysterious cow murderers, flirting with two attractive women and befriending a likeable petty crook.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6hSzUPtDU8DBzCODDzkdpYcCnqh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10282'),
  ('641945532557510029', 'Karol G: Tomorrow Was Beautiful', 2025, 'Documentary, Music', 'Cristina Costantini', null, 'KAROL G, Shakira, Ovy on the Drums, Becky G, Feid', 'R', 'Karol G pulls back the curtain on her rise to stardom while navigating a sold-out stadium tour, creating new music and releasing a new album.', 'Karol G pulls back the curtain on her rise to stardom while navigating a sold-out stadium tour, creating new music and releasing a new album.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5aXoQYwaQ7JJVUWclHAEXJgiS2M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1469239'),
  ('190230944465397985', 'Karol: A Man Who Became Pope', 2005, 'Drama, History', 'Giacomo Battiato', 'Giacomo Battiato', 'Piotr Adamczyk, Małgorzata Bela, Ken Duken, Hristo Shopov, Ennio Fantastichini, Violante Placido, Matt Craven, Raoul Bova', null, 'The life of the pope John-Paul II, from his youth as a writer, actor, and athlete in war-torn occupied Poland to his election as Pope at the age of 58.', 'The life of the pope John-Paul II, from his youth as a writer, actor, and athlete in war-torn occupied Poland to his election as Pope at the age of 58.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jFGCykDz4pNaaVFKiSlGAG0HFYr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38516'),
  ('598360268530924621', 'Karol: The Pope, The Man', 2006, 'Drama, History', 'Giacomo Battiato, Giovanni Mammolotti', 'Gianmario Pagano, Monica Zapelli, Giacomo Battiato', 'Piotr Adamczyk, Dariusz Kwaśnik, Michele Placido, Dariusz Kwaśnik, Alberto Cracco, Adriana Asti, Raoul Bova, Leslie Hope', 'PG', 'This highly acclaimed feature film on Pope John Paul II was filmed on location in Italy and Poland. Focusing on the papacy of John Paul and the tremendous impact he had on the Church and the world, Karol: The Pope, The Man stars actor Piotr Adamczyk in a deeply moving portrayal of the beloved pontiff. It is the powerful true story of a charismatic spiritual leader who helped bring down Communism, renewed the life of the Church, greatly impacted youth worldwide with love for Christ, and a Pope who reached out to other religions and world leaders with a message of peace and love. Also stars Raoul Bova (Saint Francis), Michele Placido (Padre Pio: Between Heaven and Earth) and Adriana Asti as Mother Teresa. The beautiful film score is by legendary film composer Ennio Morricone.', 'This highly acclaimed feature film on Pope John Paul II was filmed on location in Italy and Poland. Focusing on the papacy of John Paul and the tremendous impact he had on the Church and the world, Karol: The Pope, The Man stars actor Piotr Adamczyk in a deeply moving portrayal of the beloved pontiff. It is the powerful true story of a charismatic spiritual leader who helped bring down Communism, renewed the life of the Church, greatly impacted youth worldwide with love for Christ, and a Pope who reached out to other religions and world leaders with a message of peace and love. Also stars Raoul Bova (Saint Francis), Michele Placido (Padre Pio: Between Heaven and Earth) and Adriana Asti as Mother Teresa. The beautiful film score is by legendary film composer Ennio Morricone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pTZZSSjJvKohXJmBdAT5CO5lXnK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75470'),
  ('1059691264860826099', 'Kart Racer', 2003, 'Action, Drama, Family', 'Stuart Gillard, Thomas Burstyn', 'Nicholas DiBella', 'Randy Quaid, Will Rothhaar, Jennifer Wigmore, David Gallagher, Amanda de Martinis, Joe Dinicol, Jordan Conti, Johnny Griffin', 'PG', 'Fourteen-year-old Watts Davies is estranged from his dad, a former International Karting Federation (IKF) champion. Watts''s resolve to race in the upcoming IKF Regional Championships rekindles their relationship as they pursue the dream together.', 'Fourteen-year-old Watts Davies is estranged from his dad, a former International Karting Federation (IKF) champion. Watts''s resolve to race in the upcoming IKF Regional Championships rekindles their relationship as they pursue the dream together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eZx2F3K9kbBAlWgj62L0Db9mQMA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54243'),
  ('776222154410180969', 'Karthik Calling Karthik', 2010, 'Romance, Thriller', 'Vijay Lalwani, Nandini Shrikent, Sanu John Varghese', 'Vijay Lalwani', 'Farhan Akhtar, Deepika Padukone, Ram Kapoor, Shefali Shah, Vivan Bhatena, Vipin Sharma, Yatin Karyekar, Tarana Raja', null, 'A much abused loner achieves success, and even wins the heart of his gorgeous co-worker, after getting early morning mysterious phone calls from someone.', 'A much abused loner achieves success, and even wins the heart of his gorgeous co-worker, after getting early morning mysterious phone calls from someone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8mIVy8A07asmB9vOSREI9x7kvSd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34764'),
  ('1059845246098539256', 'Karthikeya 2', 2022, 'Mystery, Adventure, Thriller, Action', 'Karthik Ghattamaneni, Chandoo Mondeti', 'Chandoo Mondeti', 'Nikhil Siddhartha, Anupama Parameswaran, Srinivasa Reddy, Harsha Chemudu, Adithya Menon, Praveen, Satya, Tulasi', null, 'Before the Kalyug begins, Lord Krishna hands over an anklet that holds the answer to all of world’s miseries. Years later a doctor finds himself in the thick of things when the pursuit for the anklet carries on. A doctor with a curious mind, Karthikeya, aka Karthik, believes in pursuing the truth. The quest leads Karthik to discover the power of the ancient Indian belief system and the essence of Krishna.', 'Before the Kalyug begins, Lord Krishna hands over an anklet that holds the answer to all of world’s miseries. Years later a doctor finds himself in the thick of things when the pursuit for the anklet carries on. A doctor with a curious mind, Karthikeya, aka Karthik, believes in pursuing the truth. The quest leads Karthik to discover the power of the ancient Indian belief system and the essence of Krishna.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fKKoQndNfbDOLfYM1Zogt7miGF1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:894762'),
  ('25498273764884211', 'Karuppu Pulsar', 2026, 'Action', 'Murali krish', 'Murali Krish', 'V R Dinesh, Kalaiyarasan, Mansoor Ali Khan', null, 'Set against the backdrop of jallikattu culture. Two men''s lives intersect - one from Chennai who owns a Pulsar motorcycle and another from Madurai with a bull named Karuppu.', 'Set against the backdrop of jallikattu culture. Two men''s lives intersect - one from Chennai who owns a Pulsar motorcycle and another from Madurai with a bull named Karuppu.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F83i18z9j9Pezyfbd9vO2sz74GcT.jpg', 'plex:movie:karuppu-pulsar'),
  ('177731602308007134', 'Karwaan', 2018, 'Adventure, Comedy', 'Akarsh Khurana, Avinash Arun', 'Akarsh Khurana, Adhir Bhat', 'Dulquer Salmaan, Mithila Palkar, Irrfan Khan, Kriti Kharbanda, Amala Akkineni, Beena Banerjee, Akash Khurana, Sarang Sathaye', null, 'Avinash, a dejected soul stuck in a dead-end job shares a strange relationship with his father. He holds him responsible for crushing his dreams. However, he is left pondering upon this longstanding hatred when he hears of his father’s untimely demise.', 'Avinash, a dejected soul stuck in a dead-end job shares a strange relationship with his father. He holds him responsible for crushing his dreams. However, he is left pondering upon this longstanding hatred when he hears of his father’s untimely demise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dS0ZFlqGbGGksSUdqk7niL7rywc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:533237'),
  ('57863653864411658', 'Karz', 1980, 'Action, Thriller', 'Subhash Ghai', null, 'Rishi Kapoor, Tina Munim, Simi Garewal, Premnath Malhotra, Pran Sikand, Durga Khote, Aruna Irani, Mac Mohan', null, 'Ravi is killed by his wife after his marriage. He is reborn as Monty and is now a singer he goes to holiday in Ooty where he recollects his memories from previous life and inquires about his family from first life and his evil wife Kamini.', 'Ravi is killed by his wife after his marriage. He is reborn as Monty and is now a singer he goes to holiday in Ooty where he recollects his memories from previous life and inquires about his family from first life and his evil wife Kamini.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hetcyXaRfZPXAInkltGtlNHAJof.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23715'),
  ('639811500462538946', 'Karzzzz', 2008, 'Action, Romance, Thriller', 'Satish Kaushik', null, 'Himesh Reshammiya, Urmila Matondkar, Shweta Kumar, Dino Morea, Raj Babbar, Danny Denzongpa, Gulshan Grover, Rohini Hattangadi', null, 'Singer/Dancer Monty Oberoi meets and falls in love with Tina. He then starts hallucinating and having visions of an unknown place. His doctors advise him to take a break and he decides to travel to Kenya, where Tina resides with her uncle, Kabira, and guardian, Kamini. Monty experiences more incidents and feels as if he has been here before, while Tina notices that he appears to be more attracted to Kamini than herself. Neither are aware that Monty will soon be entrapped in a plot that will result in his sudden death.', 'Singer/Dancer Monty Oberoi meets and falls in love with Tina. He then starts hallucinating and having visions of an unknown place. His doctors advise him to take a break and he decides to travel to Kenya, where Tina resides with her uncle, Kabira, and guardian, Kamini. Monty experiences more incidents and feels as if he has been here before, while Tina notices that he appears to be more attracted to Kamini than herself. Neither are aware that Monty will soon be entrapped in a plot that will result in his sudden death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l7cNOVPNart1QqnZpmu8zQwpfch.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55376'),
  ('239767606988062697', 'KASANE –Beauty and Fate–', 2018, 'Mystery, Fantasy', 'Sohei Tanikawa, Kato Fumiaki, Yuichi Satoh', 'Tsutomu Kuroiwa', 'Tao Tsuchiya, Kyoko Yoshine, You Yokoyama, Mariko Tsutsui, Tomoko Ikuta, Kunio Murai, Rei Dan, Tadanobu Asano', null, 'Kasane Fuchi is the daughter of a beautiful, legendary actress. Kasane has excellent acting skills as well, but she is not attractive. She has a hard time due to her unattractiveness. Kasane has a lipstick left behind by her late mother. The lipstick holds a strange power. Whenever Kasane applies the lipstick and kisses someone, she takes that person''s face. Meanwhile, Nina Tanzawa is a beautiful actress with poor acting skills. She meets Kasane Fuchi and their fates change.', 'Kasane Fuchi is the daughter of a beautiful, legendary actress. Kasane has excellent acting skills as well, but she is not attractive. She has a hard time due to her unattractiveness. Kasane has a lipstick left behind by her late mother. The lipstick holds a strange power. Whenever Kasane applies the lipstick and kisses someone, she takes that person''s face. Meanwhile, Nina Tanzawa is a beautiful actress with poor acting skills. She meets Kasane Fuchi and their fates change.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vzrkeaeq4Rzpwb3EhHo0tunI5m4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:514879'),
  ('443085662459494780', 'Kase-san and Morning Glories', 2018, 'Romance, Animation', 'Kyuta Sakai, Yasunari Nitta, Sakae Shibuya', 'Takuya Sato', 'Ayane Sakura, Minami Takahashi, Yumi Uchiyama, Minako Kotobuki, Ibuki Kido, Masumi Asano', 'PG-13', 'Yamada may be shy and rather clumsy, but the flower gardens at her school have always brought her happiness. Suddenly, a different sort of beauty catches her eye—the vivacious track star, Kase-san. Although the two girls don''t seem to have much in common, they soon start a romance where each must learn an important lesson in tending their budding relationship. Can the two girls, so different from each other, learn how to make their first love blossom?', 'Yamada may be shy and rather clumsy, but the flower gardens at her school have always brought her happiness. Suddenly, a different sort of beauty catches her eye—the vivacious track star, Kase-san. Although the two girls don''t seem to have much in common, they soon start a romance where each must learn an important lesson in tending their budding relationship. Can the two girls, so different from each other, learn how to make their first love blossom?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yUWhMaXRFTPxR0QClWEUxVeHrzj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:515295'),
  ('269748626645300134', 'Kashchey the Immortal', 1944, 'Family, Fantasy', 'Aleksandr Rou, Mikhail Kirillov, Ivan Lukinsky', 'Aleksandr Rou, Vladimir Shveytser', 'Georgi Millyar, Sergey Stolyarov, Galina Grigoryeva, Sergei Filippov, Emmanuil Geller, Ivan Ryzhov, Sergei Troitsky, Сергей Юрцев', null, 'A beautiful maiden, Marya Morevna, gives her prospective husband, the mighty warrior Nikita Kozhemyaka, three riddles to solve before she''ll marry him. Before he can tell her the answers, the Russian land is invaded by the armies of Kashchei the Immortal, in whose footsteps death and destruction follow. Marya is abducted by Kashchei, and Nikita finds his home in ashes. Nikita meets a kindly wizard who gives him a cap of darkness. With it, the hero will find a way to save his bride and rout Kashchei.', 'A beautiful maiden, Marya Morevna, gives her prospective husband, the mighty warrior Nikita Kozhemyaka, three riddles to solve before she''ll marry him. Before he can tell her the answers, the Russian land is invaded by the armies of Kashchei the Immortal, in whose footsteps death and destruction follow. Marya is abducted by Kashchei, and Nikita finds his home in ashes. Nikita meets a kindly wizard who gives him a cap of darkness. With it, the hero will find a way to save his bride and rout Kashchei.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7NRZFY5G6vBjylJ1IZvouXgAKGM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76249'),
  ('406578359408037778', 'Kashtanka', 1952, 'Family, Animation, Fantasy', 'Mikhail Tsekhanovskiy, Mikhail Druyan, Vera Tsekhanovskaya', 'Boris Brodskiy', 'Aleksei Gribov, Boris Chirkov, Vladimir Feoktistov, Yuri Khrzhanovsky, Vladimir Gribkov', null, 'After getting lost in the street, a dog is adopted by a kindly clown.', 'After getting lost in the street, a dog is adopted by a kindly clown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8CH2ejz0ndIXbZ7F1wZbwgqKoQy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:306041'),
  ('698965931130636614', 'Kasoor', 2001, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Roshaan Garry Bhinder, Vikram Bhatt, Emraan Hashmi', 'Mahesh Bhatt', 'Aftab Shivdasani, Lisa Ray, Divya Dutta, Irrfan Khan, Ashutosh Rana', null, 'The film starts with the murder of Priti (Divya Dutta), wife of Shekhar (Aftab Shivdasani), a well-known journalist. Inspector Lokhande (Ashutosh Rana) investigates the case and accuses Shekhar of the murder, saying he has enough evidences to arrest him. Upon getting bail from the court, Shekhar''s lawyer tells him that he will not be able to fight his case because he is a corporate lawyer. He asks him to contact Simran Bhargav (Lisa Ray), who is a criminal lawyer to fight his case.', 'The film starts with the murder of Priti (Divya Dutta), wife of Shekhar (Aftab Shivdasani), a well-known journalist. Inspector Lokhande (Ashutosh Rana) investigates the case and accuses Shekhar of the murder, saying he has enough evidences to arrest him. Upon getting bail from the court, Shekhar''s lawyer tells him that he will not be able to fight his case because he is a corporate lawyer. He asks him to contact Simran Bhargav (Lisa Ray), who is a criminal lawyer to fight his case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/szT2yDKj5MUNBovMS1l69Boh8o0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:136615'),
  ('148058050614777114', 'Kaspar Hauser', 1993, 'Drama', 'Gernot Roll, Peter Sehr', 'Peter Sehr', 'André Eisermann, Udo Samel, Jeremy Clyde, Katharina Thalbach, Johannes Silberschneider, Peter Lohmeyer, Dieter Laser, Uwe Ochsenknecht', null, 'In May 1828, a feral boy aged around 16 was found in Nuremberg. Kaspar Hauser, as he is called, can only speak a few indistinct words and knows nothing about his origins or family. The film depicts the - presumed - circumstances under which Hauser was held captive in complete isolation in a hiding place from infancy onwards. From this emerges the picture of an intrigue involving high circles of aristocratic society. Five years after his liberation, in December 1833, Kaspar Hauser died as a result of a stab wound inflicted by an unknown perpetrator.', 'In May 1828, a feral boy aged around 16 was found in Nuremberg. Kaspar Hauser, as he is called, can only speak a few indistinct words and knows nothing about his origins or family. The film depicts the - presumed - circumstances under which Hauser was held captive in complete isolation in a hiding place from infancy onwards. From this emerges the picture of an intrigue involving high circles of aristocratic society. Five years after his liberation, in December 1833, Kaspar Hauser died as a result of a stab wound inflicted by an unknown perpetrator.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7gA2f8X9bim0905iC5NMXCJh7OS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12632'),
  ('149206525199263024', 'Kästner and Little Tuesday', 2016, 'History, Drama', 'Peter von Haller, Wolfgang Murnberger', 'Dorothee Schön', 'Florian David Fitz, Nico Kleemann, Jascha Baum, Juls Serger, Oskar Bökelmann, Katharina Lorenz, Charlotte Lorenzen, Hans Löw', null, 'Germany, 1931. The youth novel "Emil and the Detectives" is being filmed, which will make its author, Erich Kästner, world famous. An unusual friendship begins between the childless author and fatherless Hans, the 9-year-old playing the character Little Tuesday. Their friendship is put to the ultimate test in the Third Reich when Kästner''s books are banned and little Hans becomes a Hitler Youth. Based on a true story.', 'Germany, 1931. The youth novel "Emil and the Detectives" is being filmed, which will make its author, Erich Kästner, world famous. An unusual friendship begins between the childless author and fatherless Hans, the 9-year-old playing the character Little Tuesday. Their friendship is put to the ultimate test in the Third Reich when Kästner''s books are banned and little Hans becomes a Hitler Youth. Based on a true story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3XmNtl880ezcmYxmgpo0Uh7euVm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:394774'),
  ('1148463245984540852', 'Kat Crime: Tales of the Occult', 2026, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Jerry Artukovich', 'Jerry Artukovich', 'Kyla Nova, Brady Reiter, Cameron Meyer, Christina Colgan, Trevor Stines', null, 'An aspiring true-crime YouTuber investigating an occult-linked disappearance gains exclusive access to a reclusive witch coven-only to discover that belief itself may be the most dangerous weapon of all.', 'An aspiring true-crime YouTuber investigating an occult-linked disappearance gains exclusive access to a reclusive witch coven-only to discover that belief itself may be the most dangerous weapon of all.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FiWpy9pdmJWxiTvKdElOwh5UEroL.jpg', 'plex:movie:kat-crime-tales-of-the-occult'),
  ('769732143925419175', 'Katak: The Brave Beluga', 2023, 'Animation, Family, Adventure', 'Nicola Lemay, Christine Dallaire-Dupont', 'Andrée Lambert', 'Alexandre Bacon, Nancy Bernier, Jeff Boudreault, Benoît Brière, Jérémie Desbiens, Martin Drainville, Marie-Thérèse Fortin, Carolanne Foucher', null, 'While his peers have all turned white, Katak is still small and grey. To prove that he has grown up and to grant the last wish of his adored grandma, Katak departs on a perilous journey to the Great North.', 'While his peers have all turned white, Katak is still small and grey. To prove that he has grown up and to grant the last wish of his adored grandma, Katak departs on a perilous journey to the Great North.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fuJlXADTxAzHWR0XK8tR4DEsJGb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1052152'),
  ('1101139120306217481', 'Katalin Varga', 2009, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'Peter Strickland, Márk Győri', 'Peter Strickland', 'Hilda Péter, Norbert Tankó, László Mátray, Roberto Giacomello, Tibor Pálffy, Melinda Kántor, Fatma Mohamed, Florin Vidamski', null, 'In the beautiful, otherworldly Carpathian Mountains a woman is traveling with a small boy in a horse and cart, looking to punish those who once abused her. For years, Katalin has been keeping a terrible secret. Hitchhiking with two men, she was brutally raped in the woods. Although she has kept silent about what happened, she has not forgotten, and her son Órban serves as a living reminder.', 'In the beautiful, otherworldly Carpathian Mountains a woman is traveling with a small boy in a horse and cart, looking to punish those who once abused her. For years, Katalin has been keeping a terrible secret. Hitchhiking with two men, she was brutally raped in the woods. Although she has kept silent about what happened, she has not forgotten, and her son Órban serves as a living reminder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rJDPimLlUrsu3zxR7AWh91al6TV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34208'),
  ('1063897957778647068', 'Katas', 2024, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Rodante Pajemna Jr.', 'Rodante Pajemna Jr.', 'Sahara Bernales, Chester Grecia, Yda Manzano, Cariz Manzano, Mara Jalipa, Aria Bench, Ardy Raymundo, Horace Mendoza', null, 'Carmina, who works as a maid in a mansion and soon learns about the dirty secret of their masters, Alex and Grace.', 'Carmina, who works as a maid in a mansion and soon learns about the dirty secret of their masters, Alex and Grace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A4STltM7G30jZmagHnfmoXHzqi0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1226306'),
  ('487475617524496172', 'Katatsumori', 1994, 'Documentary', 'Naomi Kawase, Naomi Kawase', 'Naomi Kawase', 'Naomi Kawase, Uno Kawase', null, 'Filmmaker Naomi Kawase captures the love, loss, and loneliness felt as she prepares to move out of her foster mother''s home.', 'Filmmaker Naomi Kawase captures the love, loss, and loneliness felt as she prepares to move out of her foster mother''s home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eSYV631DXWAxxXbC9dFgqhMZGyx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162437'),
  ('551344423331743913', 'Kate', 2021, 'Action, Thriller', 'Charlie Revai, Lyle Vincent, Jonathan Eusebio', 'Umair Aleem', 'Mary Elizabeth Winstead, Miku Martineau, Woody Harrelson, Tadanobu Asano, Jun Kunimura, MIYAVI, Michiel Huisman, Mari Yamamoto', 'R', 'A ruthless criminal operative has less than 24 hours to exact revenge on her enemies and in the process forms an unexpected bond with the daughter of one of her past victims.', 'A ruthless criminal operative has less than 24 hours to exact revenge on her enemies and in the process forms an unexpected bond with the daughter of one of her past victims.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uJgdT1boTSP0dDIjdTgGleg71l4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:597891'),
  ('942577028516400723', 'Kate & Leopold', 2001, 'Romance, Comedy, Fantasy', 'James Mangold, Stuart Dryburgh, Nicholas Mastandrea', 'Steven Rogers, James Mangold', 'Meg Ryan, Hugh Jackman, Liev Schreiber, Breckin Meyer, Natasha Lyonne, Bradley Whitford, Paxton Whitehead, Spalding Gray', 'PG-13', 'When her scientist ex-boyfriend discovers a portal to travel through time -- and brings back a 19th-century nobleman named Leopold to prove it -- a skeptical Kate reluctantly takes responsibility for showing Leopold the 21st century. The more time Kate spends with Leopold, the harder she falls for him. But if he doesn''t return to his own time, his absence will forever alter history.', 'When her scientist ex-boyfriend discovers a portal to travel through time -- and brings back a 19th-century nobleman named Leopold to prove it -- a skeptical Kate reluctantly takes responsibility for showing Leopold the 21st century. The more time Kate spends with Leopold, the harder she falls for him. But if he doesn''t return to his own time, his absence will forever alter history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fbWYmlGvQXmmZEr4bMeJFjWfFXZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11232'),
  ('234248709334300544', 'Kate''s Addiction', 1999, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Eric DelaBarre, Jeffrey Wilkins', 'Eric DelaBarre', 'Kari Wührer, Farrah Forke, Matthew Porretta, Matt Borlenghi, Joel Gretsch, Natalie Radford, Daniel Murray, Lyle Kanouse', null, 'A psychotic woman becomes dangerously jealous when her best friend begins dating a handsome man. She will stop at nothing to keep the two apart, even if it means destroying their relationship or even murdering one of them.', 'A psychotic woman becomes dangerously jealous when her best friend begins dating a handsome man. She will stop at nothing to keep the two apart, even if it means destroying their relationship or even murdering one of them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3G0VDGy3UB4JPq4KfI93NW4h3Jp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50813'),
  ('938145824847509935', 'Kathal', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Yashowardhan Mishra, Harshvir Oberai', 'Ashok Mishra, Yashowardhan Mishra', 'Sanya Malhotra, Anant Joshi, Vijay Raaz, Rajpal Yadav, Neha Saraf, Govind Pandey, Gurpal Singh, Brijendra Kala', null, 'When two prized jackfruits disappear from a politician''s garden, a spirited cop''s investigation takes an unexpected turn as she digs for the truth.', 'When two prized jackfruits disappear from a politician''s garden, a spirited cop''s investigation takes an unexpected turn as she digs for the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yzVMUMN3tkLXdGbLHbOJ6sfXYI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:946025'),
  ('935073048854902778', 'Katherine', 1975, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Jeremy Kagan, Frank Stanley', 'Jeremy Kagan', 'Art Carney, Sissy Spacek, Henry Winkler, Julie Kavner, Jane Wyatt, Joe De Santis, Hector Elias, Jenny Sullivan', 'NR', 'A harrowing look at the 60s and early 70s through the eyes of Katherine Alman, a wealthy debutante who slowly, but inexorably spirals down into a fight for the causes that shook a nation, leading a path to the underground life. Written by Miguel Cane', 'A harrowing look at the 60s and early 70s through the eyes of Katherine Alman, a wealthy debutante who slowly, but inexorably spirals down into a fight for the causes that shook a nation, leading a path to the underground life. Written by Miguel Cane', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jKBayRDTOOrf8FxYDjIDFbRqsgg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:221135'),
  ('619593818337111036', 'Kathleen Madigan: Madigan Again', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Jay Chapman, Samuel Brownfield, Scott Vaneffen', 'Kathleen Madigan', 'Kathleen Madigan', 'NR', 'Kathleen Madigan drops in on Detroit to deliver material derived from time spent with her Irish Catholic Midwest family, eating random pills out of her mother''s purse, touring Afghanistan, and her love of John Denver and the Lunesta butterfly.', 'Kathleen Madigan drops in on Detroit to deliver material derived from time spent with her Irish Catholic Midwest family, eating random pills out of her mother''s purse, touring Afghanistan, and her love of John Denver and the Lunesta butterfly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qZvuMcFIXtrAxqkcgF3JjQGXk1B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:221110'),
  ('988406133278437724', 'Kathmandu Lullaby', 2011, 'Romance, Drama', 'Icíar Bollaín, Antonio Riestra', 'Icíar Bollaín', 'Verónica Echegui, Saumyata Bhattarai, Norbu Tsering Gurung, Jampa Kalsang Tamang, Bikram Pariyar, Muna Thami, Sangita Tamang, Aleix Rengel', null, 'Kathmandu, Nepal, early 1990s. Laia, a young teacher from Catalonia, Spain, works at a local school in the slums of the city where poverty reigns. Her personal path, besieged by a harsh sum of indescribable social conditions, will be a struggle against a nefarious educational system, but a journey of self-discovery as well.', 'Kathmandu, Nepal, early 1990s. Laia, a young teacher from Catalonia, Spain, works at a local school in the slums of the city where poverty reigns. Her personal path, besieged by a harsh sum of indescribable social conditions, will be a struggle against a nefarious educational system, but a journey of self-discovery as well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5doUYTpHBSf38egm2B4cyU1B48Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85457'),
  ('449155427601623769', 'Kaththi', 2014, 'Action, Drama', 'A. R. Murugadoss, George C. Williams, Venkat Mohan', 'A. R. Murugadoss', 'Vijay, Samantha Ruth Prabhu, Sathish, Neil Nitin Mukesh, Tota Roy Chowdhury, Yuvina Parthavi, Sudip Mukherjee, Jeeva Ravi', null, 'Kathiresan aka Kaththi, a criminal, escapes from the Kolkata prison and comes to Chennai, where he comes across his doppelganger Jeevanandham, fighting for his life after being shot at by unknown men. Kathir decides to pass off as Jeeva and make away with a lump sum amount but once he realizes who Jeeva really is, Kathir turns a crusader.', 'Kathiresan aka Kaththi, a criminal, escapes from the Kolkata prison and comes to Chennai, where he comes across his doppelganger Jeevanandham, fighting for his life after being shot at by unknown men. Kathir decides to pass off as Jeeva and make away with a lump sum amount but once he realizes who Jeeva really is, Kathir turns a crusader.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Zp3VCEzDJGHwvMT7pXkPj2vuYm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:263475'),
  ('411968917087955405', 'Katia', 1959, 'Drama, Romance, History', 'Robert Siodmak, Michel Kelber', 'Charles Spaak, Georges Neveux', 'Romy Schneider, Curd Jürgens, Pierre Blanchar, Antoine Balpêtré, Françoise Brion, Monique Mélinand, Michel Bouquet, Bernard Dhéran', null, 'Tsar Alexandre II meets a young student, Katia. He understands that he loves her and try to send her away but they end up seeing each other again and becomes his mistress. With the help of Katia, Alexandre prepares a liberal constitution, but these reforms make him hostile to the more privileged subjects without satirising the revolutionaries against the regime.', 'Tsar Alexandre II meets a young student, Katia. He understands that he loves her and try to send her away but they end up seeing each other again and becomes his mistress. With the help of Katia, Alexandre prepares a liberal constitution, but these reforms make him hostile to the more privileged subjects without satirising the revolutionaries against the regime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6kPcz7YNWodwApCeth7fhacO7Su.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79755'),
  ('323843712484813421', 'Katie Tippel', 1975, 'Drama, History', 'Paul Verhoeven, Jan de Bont', 'Gerard Soeteman', 'Monique van de Ven, Rutger Hauer, Andrea Domburg, Hannah de Leeuwe, Jan Blaaser, Eddie Brugman, Carry Tefsen, Peter Faber', 'R', 'In the late 19th-century, the Tippel family moves to rural Stavoren in search of greener pastures. However, their dreams are quickly shattered, as teenage Katie is terrorized by a male-dominated society who only see her as an object. Her situation worsens when, following her father''s sacking and her elder sister''s descent into alcoholism, her mother decides that, rather than starving, Katie becomes a prostitute.', 'In the late 19th-century, the Tippel family moves to rural Stavoren in search of greener pastures. However, their dreams are quickly shattered, as teenage Katie is terrorized by a male-dominated society who only see her as an object. Her situation worsens when, following her father''s sacking and her elder sister''s descent into alcoholism, her mother decides that, rather than starving, Katie becomes a prostitute.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2xIaUVAzO5IM7PVOqDGxHbTrUf4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42258'),
  ('230429250744760066', 'Katja''s Adventure', 1999, 'Adventure, Family', 'Lars Hesselholdt', 'Pascal Lonhay, Lars Hesselholdt', 'Fanny Louise Bernth, Stefan Jürgens, Alessandro Haber, Loris Tocci, Raimondo Guida, Simone La Vecchia, Mirko Casaburo, Aksel Leth', null, 'Danish Katja looks for a lost falcon while on vacation in Italy.', 'Danish Katja looks for a lost falcon while on vacation in Italy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ackr3iPvPL8b1N8TeEXXLUhPN3G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:212243'),
  ('526178025433467985', 'Katkout', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Atef El Mahdy, Ahmad Awwad', 'Tarek ElAmir', 'Mohamed Saad, Hassan Hosny, Mohamed Wafiq, Heba ElSisi, Ahmed Mounir, Ali Hassanein, Hassan Abdulfattah, Yassmin Jamal', null, 'While escaping being forced to present himself for sacrifice to redeem his family, Katkout is discovered by a National Security Agency who find he bears a strong resemblance to Yousef Khoury, the international terrorist. He is then persuaded him to enter a training mission that will allow him to impersonate Yousef Khoury.', 'While escaping being forced to present himself for sacrifice to redeem his family, Katkout is discovered by a National Security Agency who find he bears a strong resemblance to Yousef Khoury, the international terrorist. He is then persuaded him to enter a training mission that will allow him to impersonate Yousef Khoury.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dDb2307qbRNgiT8UHnmUZPLc6fa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:376487'),
  ('416960831829965465', 'Katma Değer Şaban', 1985, 'Comedy, Action', 'Kartal Tibet, Zafer Par, Seçkin Yasar', 'Osman F. Seden', 'Kemal Sunal, Dinçer Çekmez, Reha Yurdakul, Sevda Aktolga, Eray Özbal, Filiz Ersürer, Mehmet Uğur, Niyazi Gökdere', null, 'Şaban returns to Istanbul from Germany to solve a fraud crime that was framed on his father. But the people who meet him at the airport see Şaban as a punk and think that he can''t help them…', 'Şaban returns to Istanbul from Germany to solve a fraud crime that was framed on his father. But the people who meet him at the airport see Şaban as a punk and think that he can''t help them…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sdmuzbcfXCtYHtONuefcxF5LQ34.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74162'),
  ('484582884103322154', 'Katnip Kollege', 1938, 'Animation, Family, Comedy, Music', 'Cal Dalton, Cal Howard', null, 'Johnnie Davis, Mabel Todd, Poley McClintock, George MacFarland', 'NR', 'At the Katnip Kollege, we see a roomful of cats taking a course in Swingology. Everyone swings except Johnny, who can''t cut it and has to sit in the dunce chair. Miss Kitty Bright tells him to look her up when he learns how to swing. Finally, listening to the pendulum clock at night, Johnny gets the beat. He rushes out to where everyone is playing and sings "Easy As Rollin'' Off a Log" to Kitty Bright. She joins in; he grabs a trumpet for an instrumental break, with the complete band. They both fall off a log; she covers him with kisses.', 'At the Katnip Kollege, we see a roomful of cats taking a course in Swingology. Everyone swings except Johnny, who can''t cut it and has to sit in the dunce chair. Miss Kitty Bright tells him to look her up when he learns how to swing. Finally, listening to the pendulum clock at night, Johnny gets the beat. He rushes out to where everyone is playing and sings "Easy As Rollin'' Off a Log" to Kitty Bright. She joins in; he grabs a trumpet for an instrumental break, with the complete band. They both fall off a log; she covers him with kisses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xsKkYidm70jfcJQRKBcXtm34YlN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83807'),
  ('673206580933340432', 'Katsudō Shashin', 1907, 'Animation, Family', null, null, null, null, 'A boy in a cadet''s uniform paints a statement on the top of the frame and then tips his cap to the audience. Also known as "Matsumoto fragment".', 'A boy in a cadet''s uniform paints a statement on the top of the frame and then tips his cap to the audience. Also known as "Matsumoto fragment".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x7zO5UmucqQO9aclD4WLQS9dEPX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:196462'),
