  ('145306734998578040', 'Katt Williams: The Pimp Chronicles Pt. 1', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Anthony Williams, Gary Binkow', 'Katt Williams', 'Anthony Anderson, Katt Williams, Snoop Dogg, Lil Jon, Cam''ron, André 3000, Da Brat', 'NR', 'Comedian Katt Williams (aka Money Mike) showcases his laugh out loud comedic talents in his first ever HBO stand-up comedy DVD taped in front of a live audience. A native of Cincinnati, Ohio, Williams worked his way up the comedy club ladder before landing key television and film roles that displayed his flashy, sassy, streetwise style.', 'Comedian Katt Williams (aka Money Mike) showcases his laugh out loud comedic talents in his first ever HBO stand-up comedy DVD taped in front of a live audience. A native of Cincinnati, Ohio, Williams worked his way up the comedy club ladder before landing key television and film roles that displayed his flashy, sassy, streetwise style.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eDQutkfqvd6CkyHGXr0HKXnaxDp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34515'),
  ('947638946293942757', 'Katt Williams: Woke Foke', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Troy Miller', 'Katt Williams', 'Katt Williams', 'R', 'Comedian Katt Williams lets loose in real time as he hits the stage for Netflix''s second livestreamed stand-up event.', 'Comedian Katt Williams lets loose in real time as he hits the stage for Netflix''s second livestreamed stand-up event.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hjgAEcu8JEpeF7KEtmjTzPFD3uL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1270880'),
  ('628593345222308682', 'Katti Batti', 2015, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Nikkhil Advani, Tushar Kanti Ray, Mukesh Chhabra', null, 'Kangana Ranaut, Imran Khan, Vivan Bhatena, Mithila Palkar, Suparna Marwah, Suhaas Ahuja, Aadar Malik, Anshul Singhal', null, 'A man falls in love with a woman because of her outlook on life. They are in a relationship for five years until a sudden turn of events causes a problem in their relationship.', 'A man falls in love with a woman because of her outlook on life. They are in a relationship for five years until a sudden turn of events causes a problem in their relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Q2gzibVqJI7Bt6jYELtLfWEdYw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:330636'),
  ('830682349789697184', 'Katy Caterpillar', 1984, 'Adventure, Animation, Family', 'Santiago Moro, José Luis Moro', 'Steve Hulett, Silvia Roche, Peter Young', 'Cristina Camargo, Alfonso Obregon, Héctor Lee, Francisco Colmenero, Diana Santos, Alvaro Tarcisio, Eduardo Tejeda, Nancy MacKenzie', 'G', 'Katy Caterpillar lives in a cherry tree deep in the forest, but she longs to see the wide world. When she finally gets her chance, she meets lots of fascinating characters along the way.', 'Katy Caterpillar lives in a cherry tree deep in the forest, but she longs to see the wide world. When she finally gets her chance, she meets lots of fascinating characters along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5JogRBZEBVGmu2ZRT2pRVKJ1Keh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86277'),
  ('452107283993027065', 'Katy Perry: Part of Me', 2012, 'Documentary, Music', 'Dan Cutforth, Jane Lipsitz, Sarah Weinstein Edwards', null, 'Katy Perry, Shannon Woodward, Rachael Markarian, Mia Moretti, Glen Ballard, Adam Marcello, Casey Hooper, Patrick Matera', 'PG', 'Giving fans unprecedented access to the real life of the music sensation, Katy Perry: Part of Me exposes the hard work, dedication and phenomenal talent of a girl who remained true to herself and her vision in order to achieve her dreams. Featuring rare behind-the-scenes interviews, personal moments between Katy and her friends, and all-access footage of rehearsals, choreography, Katy’s signature style and more, Katy Perry: Part of Me reveals the singer’s unwavering belief that if you can be yourself, then you can be anything.', 'Giving fans unprecedented access to the real life of the music sensation, Katy Perry: Part of Me exposes the hard work, dedication and phenomenal talent of a girl who remained true to herself and her vision in order to achieve her dreams. Featuring rare behind-the-scenes interviews, personal moments between Katy and her friends, and all-access footage of rehearsals, choreography, Katy’s signature style and more, Katy Perry: Part of Me reveals the singer’s unwavering belief that if you can be yourself, then you can be anything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yPW5Lmptt7z8rCYtVYjkpyjI3SY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101267'),
  ('677416309450064743', 'Katya Ismailova', 1994, 'Drama', 'Valery Todorovsky, Sergei Kozlov, Aleksandr Belkin', 'Cécile Vargaftig, François Guérif, Marina Sheptunova', 'Ingeborga Dapkūnaitė, Vladimir Mashkov, Aleksandr Feklistov, Alisa Freyndlikh, Natalya Shchukina, Yuriy Kuznetsov, Avangard Leontyev', null, 'A wife finds her life transformed after a torrid affair in this story of murder. Katia is a rather dull young woman who types manuscripts for Irina, her husband’s mother and successful writer of romance novels. Katia’s husband is a real momma’s boy. They go to Irina’s summer house to work. There Katia encounters the intense and sexy Serguei who creates passionate longings with in her. Overcome she and Serguei engage in vigorous love-making upon a windowsill where Irina sees them. Irina has a weak heart. Quiet Katia, having rediscovered the joys of sex, changes and becomes more assertive and flighty. Serguei quickly loses interest in her. Strange and deadly things begin happening at the summer house which calls the attention of a judge who is extremely familiar with Irina’s writing.', 'A wife finds her life transformed after a torrid affair in this story of murder. Katia is a rather dull young woman who types manuscripts for Irina, her husband’s mother and successful writer of romance novels. Katia’s husband is a real momma’s boy. They go to Irina’s summer house to work. There Katia encounters the intense and sexy Serguei who creates passionate longings with in her. Overcome she and Serguei engage in vigorous love-making upon a windowsill where Irina sees them. Irina has a weak heart. Quiet Katia, having rediscovered the joys of sex, changes and becomes more assertive and flighty. Serguei quickly loses interest in her. Strange and deadly things begin happening at the summer house which calls the attention of a judge who is extremely familiar with Irina’s writing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2KhkSG8at0fwWfoK6EMvSmXGuir.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74054'),
  ('604239910455393875', 'Katyn', 2007, 'Drama, History, War', 'Andrzej Wajda, Jan Kwieciński, Paweł Edelman', 'Władysław Pasikowski, Przemysław Nowakowski, Andrzej Wajda', 'Andrzej Chyra, Maja Ostaszewska, Artur Żmijewski, Danuta Stenka, Jan Englert, Magdalena Cielecka, Agnieszka Glińska, Paweł Małaszyński', null, 'On September 1st, 1939, Nazi Germany invades Poland, unleashing World War II. On September 17th, the Soviet Red Army crosses the border. The Polish army, unable to fight on two fronts, is defeated. Thousands of Polish men, both military and government officials, are captured by the invaders. Their fate will only be known several years later.', 'On September 1st, 1939, Nazi Germany invades Poland, unleashing World War II. On September 17th, the Soviet Red Army crosses the border. The Polish army, unable to fight on two fronts, is defeated. Thousands of Polish men, both military and government officials, are captured by the invaders. Their fate will only be known several years later.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g9yyF5zC2pel0gG6vxlVpkDgZgC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13614'),
  ('1045254734546926421', 'Katzelmacher', 1969, 'Drama', 'Rainer Werner Fassbinder, Dietrich Lohmann, Michael Fengler', 'Rainer Werner Fassbinder', 'Hanna Schygulla, Rainer Werner Fassbinder, Hans Hirschmüller, Lilith Ungerer, Rudolf Waldemar Brem, Elga Sorbas, Harry Baer, Irm Hermann', null, 'A group of young slackers spend most of their time hanging out in front of a Munich apartment building. When a Greek immigrant named Jorgos moves in, however, their aimless lives are shaken up. Soon, new tensions arise both within the group and with Jorgos.', 'A group of young slackers spend most of their time hanging out in front of a Munich apartment building. When a Greek immigrant named Jorgos moves in, however, their aimless lives are shaken up. Soon, new tensions arise both within the group and with Jorgos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r3DoaIqMng1rhjen5gN3iiHB2fA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7736'),
  ('13589694379317421', 'Kaulayaw', 2024, 'Drama', 'Iar Arondaing', null, 'Micaella Raz, Matthew Francisco, Robb Guinto, Adelaide Sojo, Dante Navat, Jolly Jamero', null, 'Two college schoolmates venture into the world of cybersex to support their needs. They fulfill their fans'' sexual fantasy only to realized that they too, are falling for each other.', 'Two college schoolmates venture into the world of cybersex to support their needs. They fulfill their fans'' sexual fantasy only to realized that they too, are falling for each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qifjfp5a2gHQ0WsGhTvlamPshnH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1302007'),
  ('848403806256364922', 'Kaun Pravin Tambe?', 2022, 'Drama', 'Jayprad Desai, Sudhir Palsane, Trishaan', 'Kiran Yadnyopavit', 'Shreyas Talpade, Ashish Vidhyarthi, Anjali Patil, Parambrata Chatterjee, Chhaya Kadam, Arun Nalawade, Arif Zakaria, Varoon Varma', null, 'Mumbai-born leg-spinner Pravin Tambe made his debut in professional cricket at the age of 41 in the IPL for Rajasthan Royals in 2013 not having played any international or even first-class cricket before that. The story traces the extraordinary journey of Tambe as he became the oldest debutant - at an age when most cricketers have retired or are on the verge of retirement - a modern-day fable of an underdog who fought against his destiny.', 'Mumbai-born leg-spinner Pravin Tambe made his debut in professional cricket at the age of 41 in the IPL for Rajasthan Royals in 2013 not having played any international or even first-class cricket before that. The story traces the extraordinary journey of Tambe as he became the oldest debutant - at an age when most cricketers have retired or are on the verge of retirement - a modern-day fable of an underdog who fought against his destiny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w6t4nzjbmlGDAYnNvUeo6zxMySC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:946652'),
  ('342206256309504065', 'Kaun?', 1999, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Ram Gopal Varma, Taufiq Ahmed, Mazhar Kamran', 'Anurag Kashyap', 'Urmila Matondkar, Manoj Bajpayee, Sushant Singh', null, 'While alone in the house, a woman hears news of serial killer on the loose. And then a stranger rings the doorbell...', 'While alone in the house, a woman hears news of serial killer on the loose. And then a stranger rings the doorbell...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tNiBlJVAscbSHiWllhpksmnDFgC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142412'),
  ('803828774125387246', 'Kaunis rietas onnellinen', 2026, 'Biography, Drama, Music', 'Selma Vilhunen, Jarmo Kiuru, Heli Karppinen, Nenna Salminen, Topi Stirkkinen', 'Ilona Ahti', 'Oona Airola, Jari Virman, Maija Paunio, Taneli Mäkelä, Daniel Virtanen', null, 'Kaija Koo is one of the most popular artists in Finnish pop music and power ballads. The biopic follows Kaija Koo''s journey through music and life as she navigates through her challenges and finds true freedom in her personal and professional life. From an insecure young woman, she grows into an independent and strong woman whose personal growth story, and especially the songs that emerge from it, will empower many generations.', 'Kaija Koo is one of the most popular artists in Finnish pop music and power ballads. The biopic follows Kaija Koo''s journey through music and life as she navigates through her challenges and finds true freedom in her personal and professional life. From an insecure young woman, she grows into an independent and strong woman whose personal growth story, and especially the songs that emerge from it, will empower many generations.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FtIDTwZqqMY1AbAuopqtMQ82xZSZ.jpg', 'plex:movie:kaunis-rietas-onnellinen-2026'),
  ('604983515448276378', 'Kauwboy', 2012, 'Drama, Family', 'Boudewijn Koole, Daniël Bouquet', 'Jolein Laarman, Boudewijn Koole', 'Rick Lens, Loek Peters, Susan Radder, Ricky Koole, Cahit Ölmez', null, 'A lively young boy befriends and attempts to raise an abandoned baby jackdaw unbeknownst to his choleric and disapproving father.', 'A lively young boy befriends and attempts to raise an abandoned baby jackdaw unbeknownst to his choleric and disapproving father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7H2QE3PzZlK4ATvGeZda0HbjyRh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114718'),
  ('67552055667152341', 'Kaw', 2007, 'Horror, Thriller, Science Fiction, Action', 'Sheldon Wilson, John P. Tarver', 'Ben Sztajnkrycer', 'Sean Patrick Flanery, Kristin Booth, Megan Park, Stephen McHattie, Rod Taylor, John Ralston, Michèle Duquet, Gray Powell', 'R', 'On the last working day of Sheriff Wayne, his small town is attacked by blood thirsty ravens that eat human flesh. Meanwhile his wife Cynthia visits a farm where a Mennonite family lives to say farewell to her friend Gretchen and discloses a dark secret about the origin of the fierce ravens.', 'On the last working day of Sheriff Wayne, his small town is attacked by blood thirsty ravens that eat human flesh. Meanwhile his wife Cynthia visits a farm where a Mennonite family lives to say farewell to her friend Gretchen and discloses a dark secret about the origin of the fierce ravens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lYfWo6bS9IX8rMIkTyDb1LN3GmD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39158'),
