  ('93411621426963217', 'Kayara', 2025, 'Animation, Adventure, Family', 'Cesar Zelada, Juan Gabriel Carreño', 'Brian Cleveland, Cesar Zelada, Jason Cleveland', 'Naomi Serrano, Nate Begle, Charles Gonzales, Arthur Romero, Edgar Garcia, Kolbe Garza, Jaynalie Rios, Amaury Dupont', null, 'A courageous and athletic teenager, Kayara dreams that she is destined to be the first female to break into the league of Chasquis - the official messengers of the Incan empire. As she learns what it takes to be a Chasqui along with its challenges, she tackles every mission she gets and discovers the ancient stories of her land and her people.', 'A courageous and athletic teenager, Kayara dreams that she is destined to be the first female to break into the league of Chasquis - the official messengers of the Incan empire. As she learns what it takes to be a Chasqui along with its challenges, she tackles every mission she gets and discovers the ancient stories of her land and her people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tpZdjnoJ6Z3NsSxI6HjAIggrcEv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:666154'),
  ('599157460821831045', 'Kaybedenler Kulübü Yolda', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Yasar Aksoy, Sedat Yücel, Mehmet Ada Öztekin', 'Mehmet Ada Öztekin', 'Nejat İşler, Yiğit Özşener, Hande Doğandemir, Merve Çağıran, Sarp Akkaya, Rıza Kocaoğlu, Şafak Başkaya, Zeynep Özyağcılar', null, 'Kaan and Mete, who have a holiday in Olympos with a crowded Kadiköy group, travel to Istanbul with their engines. Two people are accompanied by two unexpected guests on their journey. This journey, which they do with various plans, shows them that the journey and the relations are not as planned at all.', 'Kaan and Mete, who have a holiday in Olympos with a crowded Kadiköy group, travel to Istanbul with their engines. Two people are accompanied by two unexpected guests on their journey. This journey, which they do with various plans, shows them that the journey and the relations are not as planned at all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/swl2YNUjirhLpCnDfrokjYiaoWO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:495356'),
  ('854620095212567548', 'Kaydara', 2011, 'Science Fiction, Action', 'Raphaël Hernandez, Savitri Joly-Gonfard', 'Raphaël Hernandez, Fabien Roussel', 'Alexandre Rodriguez, Savitri Joly-Gonfard, Guillaume Bouvet, Guy Corpataux, Florence Rodriguez, Daniel Terrier, Michel Herrero, Béatrice Ligné', 'NR', 'This story takes place in the universe of the Wachowskis'' film ''The Matrix''. Kaydara, a bounty hunter who is living separately from the Human Resistance Group, does not believe in the prophecy of the ''chosen one'' . He thinks this ''saviour'' is a threat to the awakening of Man''s self-awareness. He considers the ''chosen one'' as his enemy and if they cross paths, will not hesitate to confront him.', 'This story takes place in the universe of the Wachowskis'' film ''The Matrix''. Kaydara, a bounty hunter who is living separately from the Human Resistance Group, does not believe in the prophecy of the ''chosen one'' . He thinks this ''saviour'' is a threat to the awakening of Man''s self-awareness. He considers the ''chosen one'' as his enemy and if they cross paths, will not hesitate to confront him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vT0yUyLxMoF5JWe4pEZJVwmhkn5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64810'),
  ('724747493373649799', 'Kayhan: Revenge at the Reunion', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Togan Gökbakar, Gérard Simon', 'Şahan Gökbakar, Togan Gökbakar', 'Şahan Gökbakar, İrfan Kangı, Gökçe Eyüboğlu, Can Seçki, Bülent Tapıcı, Senem Selimi, Gökhan Eryılmaz, Ahmet Yalçın', null, 'After a brawny alum learns how his classmates truly feel about him, he schemes to give them a lesson on payback during a 20-year high school reunion.', 'After a brawny alum learns how his classmates truly feel about him, he schemes to give them a lesson on payback during a 20-year high school reunion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a3qRd14HpfIWxjm8KsjMIy8pARU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:499639'),
  ('320037122419892434', 'Kayla', 2026, 'Drama, Romance, Thriller', 'Sabree Whitfield, Kellie "Kellz" Smith', 'Sabree Whitfield', 'DeJuan Ford, Darnell Arnold, Brittany Fortune, Kenneth Scott, Sabree Whitfield', null, 'A woman''s affair with a taken man leads to stalking his girlfriend. After discovering the girlfriend''s child''s father, she targets him instead, weaving a dangerous web of manipulation and revenge.', 'A woman''s affair with a taken man leads to stalking his girlfriend. After discovering the girlfriend''s child''s father, she targets him instead, weaving a dangerous web of manipulation and revenge.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FfCSIJNA0oGjr0KvZwsCmPJ0uV9t.jpg', 'plex:movie:kayla-2026'),
  ('556429266866591398', 'Kayoko''s Diary', 1991, 'Animation, Drama, War', 'Seiji Arihara, Hiroshi Isakawa', 'Toshiaki Imaizumi, Seiji Arihara', 'Masako Ikeda, Katsue Miwa, Masako Nozawa, Nozomu Sasaki, Norio Wakamoto, Michiyo Yanagisawa', null, 'Kayoko is a young girl in 1940, just starting first grade. Nothing can prepare her for 1945, and the bleak times that are soon to come.', 'Kayoko is a young girl in 1940, just starting first grade. Nothing can prepare her for 1945, and the bleak times that are soon to come.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2nV5JQrO2uzPqKAndOanfRium5m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80398'),
  ('183880599564195326', 'Kaza-hana', 2001, 'Drama', 'Shinji Sōmai, Hiroshi Machida', 'Raimi Mori', 'Tadanobu Asano, Kyoko Koizumi, Kumiko Aso, Toshinori Omi, Fumiyo Kohinata, Tsurube Shofukutei, Ryô Kinomoto, Minori Terada', null, 'A government employee meets a hostess of a "pink club," and together they set out on a journey.', 'A government employee meets a hostess of a "pink club," and together they set out on a journey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iqTkFODQxApnc4Iurdyaq1riUjW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115799'),
  ('1013388417711387432', 'Kazaam', 1996, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Family', 'Paul Michael Glaser, Charles Minsky, Gary Marcus', 'Christian Ford, Roger Soffer', 'Shaquille O''Neal, Francis Capra, Ally Walker, Marshall Manesh, James Acheson, Fawn Reed, John Costelloe, Mother Love', 'PG', 'When Max fools a gang of local toughs, he finds himself in big trouble. Fleeing from the thugs, Max runs into an old warehouse and bumps into a boom box. By doing that, he manages to release Kazaam, a genie who has been held captive for thousands of years.', 'When Max fools a gang of local toughs, he finds himself in big trouble. Fleeing from the thugs, Max runs into an old warehouse and bumps into a boom box. By doing that, he manages to release Kazaam, a genie who has been held captive for thousands of years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k6kXq27UVxf7zGCWSvygYYIp9eP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11511'),
  ('304708701342528955', 'Kazablan', 1973, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Menahem Golan, David Gurfinkel', 'Menahem Golan, Yigal Mosenzon, Joel Silberg', 'Yehoram Gaon, Efrat Lavie, Arieh Elias, Etti Grotes, Gita Luka, Yehuda Efroni, Abraham Ronai, Chaim Banai', null, 'An adaptation of a popular Israeli stage musical. Kazablan is an army veteran turned gang leader in the Israeli port of Jaffa who masks his feelings of bitterness with a lot of bravado. He''s sweet on Rachel, a young woman who lives with her father and stepmother. The budding relationship scandalizes the neighbors (not to mention Rachel''s parents) and infuriates Yanush, a middle-aged shoe store owner who wants Rachel for himself. (Yanush feels he''s entitled to marry Rachel since they''re both Ashkenazi Jews of Eastern European origins, whereas Kazablan is a Sephardic Jew from Morocco.) The neighborhood has something else to worry about besides the antics of Kazablan and his gang: the city wants to tear down their crumbling homes. The residents pool their resources to save their houses, but the money that''s collected is stolen. When he''s jailed for the theft, Kazablan must find a way to clear himself.', 'An adaptation of a popular Israeli stage musical. Kazablan is an army veteran turned gang leader in the Israeli port of Jaffa who masks his feelings of bitterness with a lot of bravado. He''s sweet on Rachel, a young woman who lives with her father and stepmother. The budding relationship scandalizes the neighbors (not to mention Rachel''s parents) and infuriates Yanush, a middle-aged shoe store owner who wants Rachel for himself. (Yanush feels he''s entitled to marry Rachel since they''re both Ashkenazi Jews of Eastern European origins, whereas Kazablan is a Sephardic Jew from Morocco.) The neighborhood has something else to worry about besides the antics of Kazablan and his gang: the city wants to tear down their crumbling homes. The residents pool their resources to save their houses, but the money that''s collected is stolen. When he''s jailed for the theft, Kazablan must find a way to clear himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bLFew4y1vogTMJY52Hrz15rjqM5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117330'),
  ('1104410334207917142', 'Kaze to Ki no Uta Sanctus: Sei Naru Kana', 1987, 'Animation, Drama, Romance', 'Yoshikazu Yasuhiko, Akihiko Iguchi, Sachiko Kamimura', null, 'Yuko Sasaki, Noriko Ohara, Yoshiko Sakakibara, Kaneto Shiozawa, Hiroshi Takemura, Tsutomu Kashiwakura', null, 'Son of a viscount and a Roma prostitute (both deceased), Serge is intelligent, sweet, talented, and alienated by his family due to his heritage. Upon being sent to his new school, he rooms with Gilbert Cocteau, a gorgeous loner of a boy who sells his body for reasons unknown. Serge''s attempts to reach out to Gilbert fail spectacularly, and yet there is something in both of them that attracts them to each other.', 'Son of a viscount and a Roma prostitute (both deceased), Serge is intelligent, sweet, talented, and alienated by his family due to his heritage. Upon being sent to his new school, he rooms with Gilbert Cocteau, a gorgeous loner of a boy who sells his body for reasons unknown. Serge''s attempts to reach out to Gilbert fail spectacularly, and yet there is something in both of them that attracts them to each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/25ctZ3iDNCp51Aikz1c0B5BKUgl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44454'),
  ('1148026654882187985', 'Kazuo Umezu''s Horror Theater: House of Bugs', 2005, 'Horror, Fantasy', 'Kiyoshi Kurosawa, Masakazu Oka', 'Sadayuki Murai', 'Hidetoshi Nishijima, Tamaki Ogawa, Hisako Shirata, Asahi Uchida', null, 'A husband and wife each believe that the other is cheating on them. The upstairs room in their house becomes a point of bizarre physical transformations.', 'A husband and wife each believe that the other is cheating on them. The upstairs room in their house becomes a point of bizarre physical transformations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zOluLAdmUbDMaLR9ibW5eHJlpBt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107376'),
  ('1007470706477596595', 'Kazuo Umezu''s Horror Theater: Present', 2005, 'Horror', 'Yudai Yamaguchi', 'Kazuo Umezu, Tamio Hayashi', 'Seiko Iwaido, Takamasa Suga, Yoko Mitsuya, Hitomi Kurihara, Kazuyuki Nishio, Sadayoshi Shimane, Kiyo Ôshiro, Go Narumi', null, 'A bunch of happy students enjoying themselves at a Christmas party until a sadistic Santa Claus comes and interrupts the festivities. Spruce Green becomes blood red when the plot is different from the naughty children they please.', 'A bunch of happy students enjoying themselves at a Christmas party until a sadistic Santa Claus comes and interrupts the festivities. Spruce Green becomes blood red when the plot is different from the naughty children they please.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7fHKnJuGsk3hUoZOvPXScI6ocqU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104311'),
  ('797456359807356369', 'Kazuo Umezu''s Horror Theater: The Wish', 2005, 'Horror', 'Atsushi Shimizu', 'Sadayuki Murai', 'Natsumi Okumura, Toshinori Omi, Kyooko Tooyama, Orito Kasahara', null, 'A lonely schoolboy discovers a block of wood carved into the shape of a human head. Seeking companionship he and the puppet-doll become best playmates. Soon things begin to change and the situation goes from innocent to downright sinister.', 'A lonely schoolboy discovers a block of wood carved into the shape of a human head. Seeking companionship he and the puppet-doll become best playmates. Soon things begin to change and the situation goes from innocent to downright sinister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gmTmfgKAoaMU2fwVmVse5TUNPd0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100482'),
  ('619508389343032433', 'Keane', 2004, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Urs Hirschbiegel, Lodge Kerrigan, John Foster', 'Lodge Kerrigan', 'Damian Lewis, Abigail Breslin, Amy Ryan, Tina Holmes, Liza Colón-Zayas, John Tormey, Chris Bauer, Christopher Evan Welch', 'R', 'William Keane is barely able to cope. It has been six months since his six-year-old daughter was abducted from New York City’s Port Authority Bus Terminal while traveling with him. Repeatedly drawn to the site of the abduction, Keane wanders the bus station, compulsively replaying the events of that fateful day, as if hoping to change the outcome.', 'William Keane is barely able to cope. It has been six months since his six-year-old daughter was abducted from New York City’s Port Authority Bus Terminal while traveling with him. Repeatedly drawn to the site of the abduction, Keane wanders the bus station, compulsively replaying the events of that fateful day, as if hoping to change the outcome.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9i0mdCNik76ULpWMQQ4YM6Ecpg1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13468'),
  ('151706077547066079', 'Keanu', 2016, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Peter Atencio, Jas Shelton, Georgianna Whitley', 'Alex Rubens, Jordan Peele', 'Jordan Peele, Keegan-Michael Key, Keanu Reeves, Tiffany Haddish, Method Man, Darrell Britt-Gibson, Jason Mitchell, Jamar Malachi Neighbors', 'R', 'Friends hatch a plot to retrieve a stolen cat by posing as drug dealers for a street gang.', 'Friends hatch a plot to retrieve a stolen cat by posing as drug dealers for a street gang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dPWlBmCixh9k3Jjb7c7jkIaxBbL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:342521'),
  ('264482097356877163', 'Keanu Reeves: Pop Messiah', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Julien Dupuy', null, null, null, 'Revealed in independant movies such as My Own Private Idaho, blockbuster movie star in Point Break and Speed, hero of the digital era in The Matrix, virtuoso killer in John Wick, Keanu Reeves is one of the most intriguous stars of his generation. However, after 25 years in the spotlight, he stays an enigma whose chaotic career seems to go on without a guilding principle. Today, nobody could question his unique status as he reluctantly became a social network icon, and a role model for the « woke » generation.', 'Revealed in independant movies such as My Own Private Idaho, blockbuster movie star in Point Break and Speed, hero of the digital era in The Matrix, virtuoso killer in John Wick, Keanu Reeves is one of the most intriguous stars of his generation. However, after 25 years in the spotlight, he stays an enigma whose chaotic career seems to go on without a guilding principle. Today, nobody could question his unique status as he reluctantly became a social network icon, and a role model for the « woke » generation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kvEqE5xzaoCwb7XjULY9pB5sRta.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1066975'),
  ('1101493129859940727', 'Kebab Connection', 2004, 'Comedy, Action, Romance', 'Hannes Hubach, Anno Saul', 'Fatih Akin, Ruth Toma, Jan Berger', 'Emanuel Bettencourt, Denis Moschitto, Nora Tschirner, Hasan Ali Mete, Adnan Maral, Güven Kıraç, Adam Bousdoukos, Tatjana Velimirov', null, 'In Hamburg, Ibrahim "Ibo" Secmez, of Turkish descent, wants to direct the first German kung-fu movie. For now, he makes commercials for his uncle''s kebab restaurant. Titzie, an aspiring actress and Ibo''s German girlfriend, finds she''s pregnant. Ibo is uncertain about fatherhood - compounded by his father''s disowning him for getting a German girl pregnant - so Titzie sends him packing. He makes attempts at getting it right, but as the birth approaches, he''s still not ready. In the background are three thugs in search of good tripe soup and a Capulet-Montegue feud between the kebab joint and a Greek taverna across the street. Can Ibo be the glove upon that hand?', 'In Hamburg, Ibrahim "Ibo" Secmez, of Turkish descent, wants to direct the first German kung-fu movie. For now, he makes commercials for his uncle''s kebab restaurant. Titzie, an aspiring actress and Ibo''s German girlfriend, finds she''s pregnant. Ibo is uncertain about fatherhood - compounded by his father''s disowning him for getting a German girl pregnant - so Titzie sends him packing. He makes attempts at getting it right, but as the birth approaches, he''s still not ready. In the background are three thugs in search of good tripe soup and a Capulet-Montegue feud between the kebab joint and a Greek taverna across the street. Can Ibo be the glove upon that hand?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jNHsAVtJEzAGQJnv3AGagBSAFLu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2004'),
  ('397185983411134230', 'Kedarnath', 2018, 'Romance', 'Abhishek Kapoor, Mayur Sharma, Pooja Kadam', 'Kanika Dhillon', 'Sushant Singh Rajput, Sara Ali Khan, Nitish Bharadwaj, Alka Amin, Sonali Sachdev, Pooja Gor, Nishant Dahiya, Mir Sarwar', null, 'Mansoor, a reserved and reticent Pithoo (porter), helps pilgrims make an arduous journey upwards to the temple town. His world turns around when he meets the beautiful and rebellious Mukku who draws him into a whirlwind of intense love.', 'Mansoor, a reserved and reticent Pithoo (porter), helps pilgrims make an arduous journey upwards to the temple town. His world turns around when he meets the beautiful and rebellious Mukku who draws him into a whirlwind of intense love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/viq6ltqew6ZU6dur1FUVKpf9tiZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:465656'),
