  ('103809434422295298', 'Keep ''Em Flying', 1941, 'Comedy', 'Arthur Lubin, Joseph A. Valentine, Gil Valle', 'Nat Perrin, John Grant, True Eames Boardman', 'Bud Abbott, Lou Costello, Martha Raye, Carol Bruce, William Gargan, Dick Foran, Charles Lang, William B. Davidson', 'NR', 'When a barnstorming stunt pilot decides to join the air corps, his two goofball assistants decide to go with him. Since the two are Abbott & Costello, the air corps doesn''t know what it''s in for.', 'When a barnstorming stunt pilot decides to join the air corps, his two goofball assistants decide to go with him. Since the two are Abbott & Costello, the air corps doesn''t know what it''s in for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xOPPNuWygmEos57uanj6t7FMimB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33486'),
