  ('946617842838611287', 'Keep My Grave Open', 1977, 'Horror', 'S.F. Brownrigg, Larry N. Stouffer', 'F. Amos Powell', 'Camilla Carr, Gene Ross, Stephen Tobolowsky, Ann Stafford, Sharon Bunn, Annabelle Weenick, Chelcie Ross, Bill Thurman', null, 'A crazy woman who lives in an old mansion thinks she''s with her brother/lover, who lures victims to her.', 'A crazy woman who lives in an old mansion thinks she''s with her brother/lover, who lures victims to her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mmAxG8zTVYgVLKKjFtzU1FEpFHe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108890'),
  ('1051053667015919561', 'Keep on Masturbating: Non-Stop Pleasure', 1994, 'Drama', 'Yasumasa Konishi, Mitsuru Meike, Toshiya Ueno', 'Takahisa Zeze', 'Takeshi Itō, Hotaru Hazuki, Shirō Shimomoto, Kazuhiro Sano', null, 'A man with a troubled past including incest with a younger sister and the murder of a woman travels to an isolated countryside town in Nagano. There a local who mistakes him for a famous television actor shows him the town''s sites, including a strip bar in which the performers remove Heian era costumes. The film''s narrative is in an allegorical and disjointed manner with references to Buddhist concepts.', 'A man with a troubled past including incest with a younger sister and the murder of a woman travels to an isolated countryside town in Nagano. There a local who mistakes him for a famous television actor shows him the town''s sites, including a strip bar in which the performers remove Heian era costumes. The film''s narrative is in an allegorical and disjointed manner with references to Buddhist concepts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vbHEdVxDyHISC7Jzv7wejXnsVcR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:437082'),
  ('1150917437627030302', 'Keep the Aspidistra Flying', 1997, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Robert Bierman, Giles Nuttgens', 'Alan Plater', 'Helena Bonham Carter, Richard E. Grant, Julian Wadham, Jim Carter, Harriet Walter, Lesley Vickerage, Barbara Leigh-Hunt, Liz Smith', null, 'Gordon Comstock is a copywriter at an ad agency, and his girlfriend Rosemary is a designer. Gordon believes he is a genius, a marvelous poet and quits the ad agency, trying to live on his poems, but poverty soon comes to him.', 'Gordon Comstock is a copywriter at an ad agency, and his girlfriend Rosemary is a designer. Gordon believes he is a genius, a marvelous poet and quits the ad agency, trying to live on his poems, but poverty soon comes to him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kOqZpuN5Q3F1GU6SFJjWnYd2uBo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54795'),
  ('391941546575270362', 'Keep the Lights On', 2012, 'Drama, Romance', 'Ira Sachs, Thimios Bakatakis', 'Ira Sachs, Mauricio Zacharias', 'Thure Lindhardt, Zachary Booth, Julianne Nicholson, Souléymane Sy Savané, Justin Reinsilber, Ed Vassallo, Paprika Steen, Marilyn Neimark', 'NR', 'In 1997 New York City, filmmaker Erik bonds with closeted lawyer Paul after a one-night fling. As their relationship evolves through dysfunctional patterns, Erik struggles to negotiate his own boundaries while being true to himself.', 'In 1997 New York City, filmmaker Erik bonds with closeted lawyer Paul after a one-night fling. As their relationship evolves through dysfunctional patterns, Erik struggles to negotiate his own boundaries while being true to himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xuY4WOU8PHEFjRpPxNQMVyLNfPs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84290'),
  ('1142463204459802386', 'Keep Waiting for Me', 1983, 'Drama', 'Juan José Jusid, Félix "Chango" Monti', 'Isidoro Blaisten, Juan José Jusid', 'Víctor Laplace, Alicia Bruzzo, Arturo Bonín, Alberto Segado, Villanueva Cosse, Catalina Speroni, Marzenka Novak, Lucrecia Capello', null, 'Juan remembers his childhood spent during the fifties in Argentina, when he lived doubts, fears and conflicts typical of the passage towards adolescence, surrounded by his family and the neighbors of the neighborhood', 'Juan remembers his childhood spent during the fifties in Argentina, when he lived doubts, fears and conflicts typical of the passage towards adolescence, surrounded by his family and the neighbors of the neighborhood', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qSnijJCxApbUE2tZnCC0qnbRbET.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127187'),
  ('51217549264953696', 'Keep Watching', 2017, 'Thriller, Horror, Drama', 'Sean Carter, Sharone Meir, Brinton Bryan', 'Joseph Dembner', 'Bella Thorne, Chandler Riggs, Natalie Martinez, Ioan Gruffudd, Maya Eshet, Matthew Willig, Leigh Whannell, Jared Abrahamson', null, 'A family imprisoned by intruders is forced to play a terrifying game of "Kill, Or Be Killed". As the night unfolds, the game''s mysterious rules become clear, and the family realizes their nightmare is being streamed live to riveted viewers all over the world, who are compelled to KEEP WATCHING... not knowing if what they''re seeing is real, or staged.', 'A family imprisoned by intruders is forced to play a terrifying game of "Kill, Or Be Killed". As the night unfolds, the game''s mysterious rules become clear, and the family realizes their nightmare is being streamed live to riveted viewers all over the world, who are compelled to KEEP WATCHING... not knowing if what they''re seeing is real, or staged.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wHsHaYUbLJNSt8T8QcFgZqy7Om.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:242606'),
  ('343805833512754664', 'Keep Your Hands Off Eizouken!', 2020, 'Comedy, Adventure', 'Tsutomu Hanabusa', 'Tsutomu Hanabusa, Minato Takano', 'Asuka Saito, Mizuki Yamashita, Minami Umezawa, Sakurako Konishi, Riko Fukumoto, Ema Grace, Suzunosuke Tanaka, Masayuki Deai', null, 'A group of strangers come together to work on creating the greatest anime series ever.', 'A group of strangers come together to work on creating the greatest anime series ever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5vHtc2Sksnz81rMDO3rTDxCTEfO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:671397'),
  ('1109821495272362364', 'Keep Your Mouth Shut', 1944, 'Animation, War', 'Norman McLaren', null, null, null, 'This animated short from Norman McLaren features a human skull cautioning Canadians to “keep their mouths shut” in an effort to end gossiping during World War II.', 'This animated short from Norman McLaren features a human skull cautioning Canadians to “keep their mouths shut” in an effort to end gossiping during World War II.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dzsfHEtETDWCVtVsmAn09mmFhTU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:257548'),
  ('511644839132937898', 'Keep Your Right Up', 1987, 'Comedy, Drama, Fantasy', 'Jean-Luc Godard, Caroline Champetier, Richard Debuisne', 'Jean-Luc Godard', 'Jane Birkin, Dominique Lavanant, Pauline Lafont, Éva Darlan, Isabelle Sadoyan, Carina Barone, Catherine Houssay, Anny Seneque', 'NR', 'This film is made up several sketches in which certain actors play several real or fictional roles to a background of rock music. The lead character, played by Godard himself, is an annoyingly perfectionist film-maker determined to wring every last drop of the finest performance possible from his stars.', 'This film is made up several sketches in which certain actors play several real or fictional roles to a background of rock music. The lead character, played by Godard himself, is an annoyingly perfectionist film-maker determined to wring every last drop of the finest performance possible from his stars.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dSySPJlFdt0khrpM8IyElsXTkQ9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65612'),
  ('493221825158657192', 'Keep Your Seats, Please', 1936, 'Drama, Music', 'Monty Banks, John W. Boyle', 'Thomas J. Geraghty, Anthony Kimmins', 'George Formby, Florence Desmond, Alastair Sim, May Whitty, Enid Stamp-Taylor, Gus McNaughton, Harry Tate, Tom Payne', null, 'Despite being on his uppers, George is still prepared to pawn his beloved banjo in order to help his girlfriend save her niece from the orphanage. Help seems to be at hand when George is left a fortune by his old auntie, but unfortunately his inheritance is hidden inside a chair which has already been auctioned off! Can George and his chums track down his rightful due before his grasping solicitor (Alastair Sim, in an early film appearance) snatches the lot? It''s hard to say, but he still finds time to perform both the title song and the classic ''When I''m Cleaning Windows''.', 'Despite being on his uppers, George is still prepared to pawn his beloved banjo in order to help his girlfriend save her niece from the orphanage. Help seems to be at hand when George is left a fortune by his old auntie, but unfortunately his inheritance is hidden inside a chair which has already been auctioned off! Can George and his chums track down his rightful due before his grasping solicitor (Alastair Sim, in an early film appearance) snatches the lot? It''s hard to say, but he still finds time to perform both the title song and the classic ''When I''m Cleaning Windows''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oWxwDwWcrkgyoYaGJrzZMmc11B3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:211720'),
  ('493333915193138897', 'Keeper', 2015, 'Drama', 'Denis Jutzeler, Guillaume Senez', 'Guillaume Senez, David Lambert', 'Kacey Mottet Klein, Galatea Bellugi, Catherine Salée, Sam Louwyck, Laetitia Dosch, Corentin Lobet, Cédric Vieira, Vincent Sornaga', null, 'Maxime and Mélanie are a typical teenage couple. Like most lovestruck fifteen-year-olds, they can''t get enough of each other and they think they''ll be together forever. But when Mélanie becomes pregnant, their worlds are rocked.', 'Maxime and Mélanie are a typical teenage couple. Like most lovestruck fifteen-year-olds, they can''t get enough of each other and they think they''ll be together forever. But when Mélanie becomes pregnant, their worlds are rocked.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3xmHdPfvUboE3sIaRInFWtAnXYT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:356268'),
  ('1050842818348931272', 'Keeper', 2025, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Osgood Perkins, Jeremy Cox, Adam McCarthy', 'Nick Lepard', 'Tatiana Maslany, Rossif Sutherland, Birkett Turton, Eden Weiss, Cassandra Ebner, Tess Degenstein, Erin Boyes, Gina Vultaggio', 'R', 'Liz and Malcolm escape for a romantic anniversary weekend at a secluded cabin. When Malcolm suddenly returns to the city, Liz finds herself isolated and in the presence of an unspeakable evil that reveals the cabin''s horrifying secrets.', 'Liz and Malcolm escape for a romantic anniversary weekend at a secluded cabin. When Malcolm suddenly returns to the city, Liz finds herself isolated and in the presence of an unspeakable evil that reveals the cabin''s horrifying secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mbGHijUc0C3fcM12l6ro6FgxIvg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1288072'),
  ('821696380028896880', 'Keeper of Darkness', 2015, 'Fantasy, Horror, Romance', 'Chan Chi-Ying, Nick Cheung Ka-Fai', 'Yeung Sin-Ling', 'Nick Cheung Ka-Fai, Amber Kuo Tsai-Chieh, Sisley Choi Si-Pui, Louis Cheung, Philip Keung Ho-Man, Xing Yu, Angie Cheung Wai-Yee, Karena Lam Kar-Yan', null, 'Street-smart exorcist Fatt has an unique method of dealing with vengeful spirits: He negotiates with them and persuades them to let go of their grudges. After recordings of his exorcisms go viral, Fatt attracts the attentions of a murderous spirit who’s targeting mediums, as well as a troublesome reporter who takes great interest in Fatt and his close relationship with a female spirit.', 'Street-smart exorcist Fatt has an unique method of dealing with vengeful spirits: He negotiates with them and persuades them to let go of their grudges. After recordings of his exorcisms go viral, Fatt attracts the attentions of a murderous spirit who’s targeting mediums, as well as a troublesome reporter who takes great interest in Fatt and his close relationship with a female spirit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vFr4XuZkRpxTnvq7PPS7wdabMfF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:371451'),
  ('502484071221607439', 'Keeper of the Flame', 1943, 'Drama, Mystery', 'George Cukor, William H. Daniels', 'Donald Ogden Stewart', 'Spencer Tracy, Katharine Hepburn, Richard Whorf, Margaret Wycherly, Forrest Tucker, Frank Craven, Stephen McNally, Percy Kilbride', null, 'Famed reporter Stephen O''Malley travels to a small town to investigate the death of a national hero.', 'Famed reporter Stephen O''Malley travels to a small town to investigate the death of a national hero.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cuedz5RXa3VUhgespJAkejmfPtn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33034'),
  ('536176404692802825', 'Keeping Everyone Up', 1982, 'Comedy', 'Gérard Lauzier', 'Gérard Lauzier', 'Daniel Auteuil, Catherine Alric, Anne Jousset, Philippe Khorsand, Tanya Lopert, Henri Déus, Jean-Gabriel Nordmann, Franck-Olivier Bonnet', null, 'A homeless street musician meets an attractive woman by chance and keeps following her until he persuades her to let him stay in her place.', 'A homeless street musician meets an attractive woman by chance and keeps following her until he persuades her to let him stay in her place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/smQxSWZxmEiYDOzOM5d9jWI94Gh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:215673'),
  ('835158860905413350', 'Keeping Mum', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Niall Johnson, Gavin Finney', 'Richard Russo, Niall Johnson', 'Rowan Atkinson, Kristin Scott Thomas, Maggie Smith, Patrick Swayze, Tamsin Egerton, Toby Parkes, Liz Smith, Emilia Fox', 'R', 'A pastor preoccupied with writing the perfect sermon fails to realize that his wife is having an affair and his children are up to no good.', 'A pastor preoccupied with writing the perfect sermon fails to realize that his wife is having an affair and his children are up to no good.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nkyS4lkiEOCx7mtlMtWLYodbVpb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9687'),
  ('384262676056136084', 'Keeping the Bees', 2019, 'Drama', 'Serdar Ünlütürk, Eylem Kaftan', 'Eylem Kaftan', 'Meryem Uzerli, Feyyaz Duman, Hakan Karsak, Burcu Salihoğlu, Sennur Nogaylar, Dizem Kaftan', null, 'Ayşe returns to her hometown in northeastern Turkey to nurse her gravely ill mother. Before she dies, Ayse’s mother tells her that she will leave Ayse her much loved bee hives to manage. Ayse’s modern life has moved her away from the mountains of her childhood – a life in which the bees and their honey were central. But she puts her city life on hold to manage the bees, which provide a distraction from her grief. Ayse slowly starts to work with the local bee keeper to manage the hives but finds the lessons of her childhood are buried deep and the hives are more difficult to manage than she remembers. Ayse’s failure to pay needful attention to local advice sees her mothers bee hives seriously damaged, if not lost forever. What’s more a Caucasian bear becomes a real threat to her hives and her life.', 'Ayşe returns to her hometown in northeastern Turkey to nurse her gravely ill mother. Before she dies, Ayse’s mother tells her that she will leave Ayse her much loved bee hives to manage. Ayse’s modern life has moved her away from the mountains of her childhood – a life in which the bees and their honey were central. But she puts her city life on hold to manage the bees, which provide a distraction from her grief. Ayse slowly starts to work with the local bee keeper to manage the hives but finds the lessons of her childhood are buried deep and the hives are more difficult to manage than she remembers. Ayse’s failure to pay needful attention to local advice sees her mothers bee hives seriously damaged, if not lost forever. What’s more a Caucasian bear becomes a real threat to her hives and her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sXITXGXntJruJ9CogXJFjMAUiLW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:631475'),
  ('607151694599162351', 'Keeping the Faith', 2000, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Anastas N. Michos, Edward Norton, Mark Carter', 'Stuart Blumberg', 'Ben Stiller, Edward Norton, Jenna Elfman, Anne Bancroft, Eli Wallach, Ron Rifkin, Miloš Forman, Holland Taylor', 'PG-13', 'Best friends since they were kids, Rabbi Jacob Schram and Father Brian Finn are dynamic and popular young men living and working on New York''s Upper West Side. When Anna Reilly, once their childhood friend and now grown into a beautiful corporate executive, suddenly returns to the city, she reenters Jake and Brian''s lives and hearts with a vengeance. Sparks fly and an unusual and complicated love triangle ensues.', 'Best friends since they were kids, Rabbi Jacob Schram and Father Brian Finn are dynamic and popular young men living and working on New York''s Upper West Side. When Anna Reilly, once their childhood friend and now grown into a beautiful corporate executive, suddenly returns to the city, she reenters Jake and Brian''s lives and hearts with a vengeance. Sparks fly and an unusual and complicated love triangle ensues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9NF199FTvHr9ggqdBTVbPhF1MGk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4967'),
  ('123425511011478176', 'Keeping Up with the Joneses', 2016, 'Action, Comedy', 'Greg Mottola, Jennifer Roberts, Steven Ritzi', 'Michael LeSieur', 'Jon Hamm, Isla Fisher, Zach Galifianakis, Gal Gadot, Patton Oswalt, Matt Walsh, Maribeth Monroe, Kevin Dunn', 'PG-13', 'An ordinary suburban couple finds it’s not easy keeping up with the Joneses – their impossibly gorgeous and ultra-sophisticated new neighbors – especially when they discover that Mr. and Mrs. “Jones” are covert operatives.', 'An ordinary suburban couple finds it’s not easy keeping up with the Joneses – their impossibly gorgeous and ultra-sophisticated new neighbors – especially when they discover that Mr. and Mrs. “Jones” are covert operatives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yvWcTrRCzE4C2hkd2wV4erPuKCn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:331313'),
  ('703689339247390064', 'Keeping Up with the Steins', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Scott Marshall, Charles Minsky', 'Mark Zakarin', 'Daryl Sabara, Jami Gertz, Jeremy Piven, Cheryl Hines, Carter Jenkins, Sandra Taylor, Larry Miller, Doris Roberts', 'PG-13', 'All hilarity breaks loose in this heartwarming coming-of-age comedy when three generations of Fiedlers collide in a crazy family reunion. As they prepare for the biggest Bar Mitzvah on the block, they begin to see that they''re much more alike than they''d originally thought.', 'All hilarity breaks loose in this heartwarming coming-of-age comedy when three generations of Fiedlers collide in a crazy family reunion. As they prepare for the biggest Bar Mitzvah on the block, they begin to see that they''re much more alike than they''d originally thought.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bYp81rOQZEoFfDMX6xqRU1x3R7M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21014'),
  ('699667825863070045', 'Kegworth: Flight to Disaster', 2026, 'Documentary', 'John Martin, Alan Gordon', null, 'Graham Braithwaite', null, 'The air disaster that changed flight safety. Survivors and eyewitnesses tell their story of the terrifying moment Flight BD092 crashed into the side of the M1 motorway.', 'The air disaster that changed flight safety. Survivors and eyewitnesses tell their story of the terrifying moment Flight BD092 crashed into the side of the M1 motorway.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fx0675gY3AIlAkAdXHSUP4ySzYCB.jpg', 'plex:movie:kegworth-flight-to-disaster'),
  ('773000187058270356', 'Kehraus', 1983, 'Comedy, Drama', 'James Jacobs, Hanns Christian Müller, Gertraud Kurz', 'Hanns Christian Müller, Gerhard Polt, Carlo Fedier', 'Gerhard Polt, Gisela Schneeberger, Nikolaus Paryla, Dieter Hildebrandt, Jochen Busse, Karl Obermayr, Veronika Faber, Hans-Günter Martens', null, 'Ferdinand Weitel, a forklift driver, is desperate: Insurance agent Arno von Mehling, a true sales talent, has had contracts signed in record amounts. Now Weitel is wandering through the corridors of the insurance company trying to save what can still be saved - on Shrove Tuesday of all days. The department for customer service and complaints is in a colorful mood and has no ear for Weitel''s worries. Finally, secretary Annerose Waguscheit takes heart and tells him about the evening carnival ball "Traum-Police", where he can safely find Mr. Mehling.', 'Ferdinand Weitel, a forklift driver, is desperate: Insurance agent Arno von Mehling, a true sales talent, has had contracts signed in record amounts. Now Weitel is wandering through the corridors of the insurance company trying to save what can still be saved - on Shrove Tuesday of all days. The department for customer service and complaints is in a colorful mood and has no ear for Weitel''s worries. Finally, secretary Annerose Waguscheit takes heart and tells him about the evening carnival ball "Traum-Police", where he can safely find Mr. Mehling.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9hDldQFGSbcrPfPbV1wRIbV1XYA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10850'),
  ('862107993652801206', 'Keiho', 1999, 'Drama, Crime', 'Yoshimitsu Morita, Hiroshi Takase, Taiichi Sugiyama', 'Sumio Ōmori', 'Kyoka Suzuki, Shinichi Tsutsumi, Ittoku Kishibe, Hideko Yoshida, Mirai Yamamoto, Masanobu Katsumura, Takashi Sasano, Takatoshi Takeda', null, 'The psychiatric evaluation of a young actor arrested for a brutal double murder concludes he may be unfit for trial. Further investigation, however, reveals the crime was a well-planned statement against the section of Japan''s criminal code granting diminished responsibility to the mentally impaired.', 'The psychiatric evaluation of a young actor arrested for a brutal double murder concludes he may be unfit for trial. Further investigation, however, reveals the crime was a well-planned statement against the section of Japan''s criminal code granting diminished responsibility to the mentally impaired.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gebZEDl7qBgAb82mNT79oWLGyIt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:325459'),
  ('300155621863623183', 'Kein Pardon', 1993, 'Comedy', 'Hans-Günther Bücking, Hape Kerkeling, Susan Nielebock', 'Achim Hagemann, Angelo Colagrossi, Hape Kerkeling', 'Hape Kerkeling, Heinz Schenk, Elisabeth Volkmann, Margret Homeyer, Dirk Dautzenberg, Kurt Weinzierl, Maren Kroymann, Annett Kruschke', null, 'Since childhood Peter Schlönzke dreams of a career as a TV presenter. His great role model is Heinz Wäscher, who is always looking for talented young entertainers for his popular show. Peters mother announces her shy boy for an audition, which, although mercilessly goes wrong, but brings him a job as a cable helper. He meets the popular entertainer from the unlikely side: as a bus scrapper who despises his audience. When Peter stumbles into the limelight by chance, he has a unique chance - as successor to scrubber.', 'Since childhood Peter Schlönzke dreams of a career as a TV presenter. His great role model is Heinz Wäscher, who is always looking for talented young entertainers for his popular show. Peters mother announces her shy boy for an audition, which, although mercilessly goes wrong, but brings him a job as a cable helper. He meets the popular entertainer from the unlikely side: as a bus scrapper who despises his audience. When Peter stumbles into the limelight by chance, he has a unique chance - as successor to scrubber.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sCNEO1m302XZTvLCMWcJ9TQOKGa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10807'),
