  ('415762629114595233', 'Keith', 2008, 'Drama, Romance', 'Todd Kessler, Darko Šuvak', 'David Zabel, Todd Kessler', 'Elisabeth Harnois, Jesse McCartney, Ignacio Serricchio, Margo Harshman, Michael McGrady, Jennifer Grey, Michael O''Keefe, Ethan Phillips', 'PG-13', 'Natalie is high school royalty, but her queen bee status falls apart when she falls for the new guy at school. Although Keith ignores her at first, they soon become friends -- even though Natalie suspects that Keith has something to hide. As the free-spirited Keith shows Natalie how to embrace what life offers, they grow closer -- until a secret tests the bounds of their relationship', 'Natalie is high school royalty, but her queen bee status falls apart when she falls for the new guy at school. Although Keith ignores her at first, they soon become friends -- even though Natalie suspects that Keith has something to hide. As the free-spirited Keith shows Natalie how to embrace what life offers, they grow closer -- until a secret tests the bounds of their relationship', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/P9WAFA0yM7eqoxF7cSdOtPsYX3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14859'),
