  ('454910587272768146', 'Kelce', 2023, 'Documentary', 'Don Argott, Jarred Alterman', null, 'Jason Kelce, Travis Kelce, Mike Quick, Aaron Eanes, Kylie Kelce, Donna Kelce, Ed Kelce, Lane Johnson', 'NR', 'An intimate and emotional documentary that chronicles Philadelphia Eagles team captain and All-Pro center Jason Kelce’s 2022 season, which began with him confronting one of the most challenging decisions any professional athlete will ever face—is now the time to hang it up?', 'An intimate and emotional documentary that chronicles Philadelphia Eagles team captain and All-Pro center Jason Kelce’s 2022 season, which began with him confronting one of the most challenging decisions any professional athlete will ever face—is now the time to hang it up?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yq1cuOcQsbGkKj3i0HIo1fxWEFw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1169207'),
  ('380311227651337898', 'Kelly & Cal', 2014, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Jen McGowan, Phil Lott', 'Amy Lowe Starbin', 'Juliette Lewis, Jonny Weston, Josh Hopkins, Cybill Shepherd, Lucy Owen, Ken Marks, Margaret Colin, Scarlett Giuliano', 'R', 'Punk-rocker turned suburban mom, Kelly, is nostalgic for a life she can no longer have and uncertain of a future she doesn’t yet fit in. Seventeen-year-old Cal is frustrated at his lack of control over the hand he''s been dealt. When the two strike up an unlikely friendship, it''s the perfect spark needed to thrust them both back to life.', 'Punk-rocker turned suburban mom, Kelly, is nostalgic for a life she can no longer have and uncertain of a future she doesn’t yet fit in. Seventeen-year-old Cal is frustrated at his lack of control over the hand he''s been dealt. When the two strike up an unlikely friendship, it''s the perfect spark needed to thrust them both back to life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aL4uVxXsSTxMdFdIKDwveF51Spi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:253270'),
  ('81287398136482213', 'Kelly''s Heroes', 1970, 'Adventure, Comedy, War', 'Gabriel Figueroa, Brian G. Hutton, John C. Chulay', 'Troy Kennedy Martin', 'Clint Eastwood, Telly Savalas, Donald Sutherland, Don Rickles, Carroll O''Connor, Gavin MacLeod, Hal Buckley, Stuart Margolin', 'PG', 'A misfit group of World War II American soldiers goes AWOL to rob a bank behind German lines.', 'A misfit group of World War II American soldiers goes AWOL to rob a bank behind German lines.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hleMxFKSC42yT0TClS4G29HV11n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11589'),
  ('809489177262687097', 'Keloğlan Aramızda', 1972, 'Comedy', 'Sırrı Gültekin', 'Turgut Özakman', 'Rüştü Asyalı, Ülkü Özen, Fatma Karanfil, Aydın Babaoğlu, Hayati Hamzaoğlu, Kadir Savun, Suna Pekuysal, Feridun Çölgeçen', null, 'This comedy film tells the story of Keloğlan''s adventures in Istanbul, where he comes with his mother to stay with his uncle. In the film, Keloğlan''s friends Tırtıl and Bicirik help him defeat Çamur Şevket, the neighborhood bully, and save the neighborhood from trouble. Keloğlan is in love with Nurperi, the daughter of İsa Bey, the richest man in the neighborhood. However, Nurperi, being a wealthy city girl, does not pay much attention to Keloğlan. Unbeknownst to Keloğlan, Fatma, one of the beautiful girls in the neighborhood, also has feelings for him. Keloğlan is in love with Nurperi, the daughter of İsa Bey, the richest man in the neighborhood. However, Nurperi is a wealthy city girl and does not pay much attention to Keloğlan. Unbeknownst to Keloğlan, Fatma, one of the beautiful girls in the neighborhood, is also interested in him.', 'This comedy film tells the story of Keloğlan''s adventures in Istanbul, where he comes with his mother to stay with his uncle. In the film, Keloğlan''s friends Tırtıl and Bicirik help him defeat Çamur Şevket, the neighborhood bully, and save the neighborhood from trouble. Keloğlan is in love with Nurperi, the daughter of İsa Bey, the richest man in the neighborhood. However, Nurperi, being a wealthy city girl, does not pay much attention to Keloğlan. Unbeknownst to Keloğlan, Fatma, one of the beautiful girls in the neighborhood, also has feelings for him. Keloğlan is in love with Nurperi, the daughter of İsa Bey, the richest man in the neighborhood. However, Nurperi is a wealthy city girl and does not pay much attention to Keloğlan. Unbeknownst to Keloğlan, Fatma, one of the beautiful girls in the neighborhood, is also interested in him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/frWVnLFMN6iqnahSq6GNHNwRcMZ.jpg', 