  ('627022270555913540', 'Keloglan Vs. The Dark Prince', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Tayfun Güneyer', 'Tayfun Güneyer', 'Mehmet Ali Erbil, Özcan Deniz, Ahu Türkpençe, Petek Dinçöz, Nükhet Duru, Gazanfer Özcan, Bülent Polat, Ayşen Gruda', null, 'Kelogan fights the black prince to serve justice.', 'Kelogan fights the black prince to serve justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6thuMbPKWiH3PSqiF9qgUMIWnwW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31387'),
  ('448269553029569236', 'Ken', 1964, 'Drama', 'Kenji Misumi, Chikashi Makiura, Toshikata Tomoeda', 'Kazuo Funahashi', 'Raizō Ichikawa, Yukiko Fuji, Yūsuke Kawazu, Akio Hasegawa, Akitake Kōno, Yuka Konno, Junko Kozakura, Rieko Sumi', null, 'Kokubu, captain of his university''s kendo team, is a mystery to those who know him: An ascetic dedicated to a point of obsession with the simplicity and beauty of the sword arts. Kagawa, a promising but arrogant kendo student, is attracted to Kokubu''s devout leadership but kept at a distance by his standoffish nature. With the national championships fast approaching, the pair clash as Kokubu drives his students with increasingly rigorous training and Kagawa tests Kokubu''s grip on the class.', 'Kokubu, captain of his university''s kendo team, is a mystery to those who know him: An ascetic dedicated to a point of obsession with the simplicity and beauty of the sword arts. Kagawa, a promising but arrogant kendo student, is attracted to Kokubu''s devout leadership but kept at a distance by his standoffish nature. With the national championships fast approaching, the pair clash as Kokubu drives his students with increasingly rigorous training and Kagawa tests Kokubu''s grip on the class.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1IabLo0a6i3drr1fWw3ld2XKuoT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78492'),
  ('997109690630077088', 'Ken Folletts Eisfieber', 2010, 'Thriller', 'Peter Keglevic', 'Ken Follett', 'Heiner Lauterbach, Isabella Ferrari, Tom Schilling, Matthias Brandt, Anneke Kim Sarnau, Bülent Sharif, Daniel Krauss, Sophie von Kessel', null, 'A deadly virus is stolen from the high-security laboratory of a biotechnology company. Although the thief can be found, lifeless and bleeding from the nose and ears, the danger is not over yet: A gang of unscrupulous criminals is also on the hunt for the virus. Super-GAU at Oxenford Medical: A lab technician has stolen a rabbit infected with the deadly Madoba-2 virus from the high-security laboratory near Edinburgh. After the thief''s gruesome death by infection, a frantic damage limitation operation begins. Toni Gallo, the head of security at Oxenford, realizes that the theft is only the prelude to an even greater catastrophe, because only a few days later criminals attack the laboratory and steal the virus. When a terrible snowstorm condemns the police to inactivity, Toni takes up the pursuit of the perpetrators alone...', 'A deadly virus is stolen from the high-security laboratory of a biotechnology company. Although the thief can be found, lifeless and bleeding from the nose and ears, the danger is not over yet: A gang of unscrupulous criminals is also on the hunt for the virus. Super-GAU at Oxenford Medical: A lab technician has stolen a rabbit infected with the deadly Madoba-2 virus from the high-security laboratory near Edinburgh. After the thief''s gruesome death by infection, a frantic damage limitation operation begins. Toni Gallo, the head of security at Oxenford, realizes that the theft is only the prelude to an even greater catastrophe, because only a few days later criminals attack the laboratory and steal the virus. When a terrible snowstorm condemns the police to inactivity, Toni takes up the pursuit of the perpetrators alone...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ZhVe5xfpmByaT1Ors4xoWdNLXj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31834'),
  ('308697845860679669', 'Ken Jeong: You Complete Me, Ho', 2019, 'Comedy, Documentary', 'Jon M. Chu', 'Ken Jeong', 'Ken Jeong', null, 'In his first-ever stand-up special, Ken Jeong shares hilarious stories from his Hollywood career -- and reveals how "The Hangover" saved his life.', 'In his first-ever stand-up special, Ken Jeong shares hilarious stories from his Hollywood career -- and reveals how "The Hangover" saved his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xhrJCFM3tWWQnRKUGYzrmczVTRX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:573917'),
  ('449880557739889667', 'Ken Park', 2003, 'Drama', 'Edward Lachman, Larry Clark, Larry Clark', 'Harmony Korine', 'James Ransone, Tiffany Limos, Stephen Jasso, James Bullard, Mike Apaletegui, Adam Chubbuck, Amanda Plummer, Wade Williams', 'NR', 'Teen skater Ken Park (nicknamed Krap Nek; his name spelled and pronounced backward) kills himself at a Visalia skate park; his death bookends the lives of four other young people who knew him: Shawn, the most conventional; Tate brims with psychotic rage; Claude is habitually harassed by his brutish father and coddled, rather uncomfortably, by his enormously pregnant mother; and Peaches looks after her devoutly religious father, but yearns for freedom. They''re all rather tight, or so they claim.', 'Teen skater Ken Park (nicknamed Krap Nek; his name spelled and pronounced backward) kills himself at a Visalia skate park; his death bookends the lives of four other young people who knew him: Shawn, the most conventional; Tate brims with psychotic rage; Claude is habitually harassed by his brutish father and coddled, rather uncomfortably, by his enormously pregnant mother; and Peaches looks after her devoutly religious father, but yearns for freedom. They''re all rather tight, or so they claim.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vmCIlPO2qyVLBCmk5REXBMNbOlt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7090'),
  ('260311832995336515', 'Kendime İyi Bak', 2014, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Ruhi Yapıcı', 'Ruhi Yapıcı, Serhan Arslan', 'Çağdaş Onur Öztürk, Aslı Tandoğan, Begüm Birgören, Filiz Ahmet, Gökçe Özyol, Ferdi Kurtuldu, Zamire Zeynep Özdemir, Bora Karakul', null, 'An introvert romancer delves into a reality check after he finds out that he was risen to the bait by his deceased former lover. He breaks up with his girlfriend and starts searching for answers.', 'An introvert romancer delves into a reality check after he finds out that he was risen to the bait by his deceased former lover. He breaks up with his girlfriend and starts searching for answers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jkijMtTOuIUXY8ZxHrK1f9Ppb2Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:278317'),
  ('584236937730397386', 'Kenia Os: La OG', 2025, 'Music', 'Ana Nube, Gastón Etchechoury, Kenia Os', 'Esteban Garrido, Martha Herrera', 'Kenia Os, Bella Poarch, La Joaqui, Yeri Mua, Snow Tha Product', null, 'Kenia Os closes the year with the most important milestone of her career to date: two concerts at the imposing Palacio de los Deportes in Mexico City. This musical phenomenon now transcends the stage to the big screen with ‘Kenia Os: La OG’, a dazzling documentary that captures the magic, power and grandeur of the most spectacular show of the year. The film doesn''t just show the show, it goes beyond the lights and glamour, revealing the intense rehearsals, sacrifice and unwavering passion that made this dream a reality.', 'Kenia Os closes the year with the most important milestone of her career to date: two concerts at the imposing Palacio de los Deportes in Mexico City. This musical phenomenon now transcends the stage to the big screen with ‘Kenia Os: La OG’, a dazzling documentary that captures the magic, power and grandeur of the most spectacular show of the year. The film doesn''t just show the show, it goes beyond the lights and glamour, revealing the intense rehearsals, sacrifice and unwavering passion that made this dream a reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2yiuVwMbfdNjL22Crs5coLmkvmt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1411865'),
  ('29120930178926887', 'Kenji Mizoguchi: The Life of a Film Director', 1975, 'Documentary', 'Kaneto Shindō, Yoshiyuki Miyake', 'Kaneto Shindō', 'Takako Irie, Daisuke Itō, Kyōko Kagawa, Matsutarō Kawaguchi, Michiyo Kogure, Machiko Kyō, Yasuzō Masumura, Kazuo Miyagawa', null, 'In 39 interviews with actors and actresses, writers, producers and staff members, interspersed with film excerpts and stills, Shindō recounts the life and career of his friend and mentor Mizoguchi.', 'In 39 interviews with actors and actresses, writers, producers and staff members, interspersed with film excerpts and stills, Shindō recounts the life and career of his friend and mentor Mizoguchi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vDUCiOa1Mf9ADV3bkLEJ7KTrSe2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44165'),
  ('743997504198247240', 'Kennedy', 2023, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Anurag Kashyap, Sylvester Fonseca', 'Anurag Kashyap', 'Rahul Bhat, Sunny Leone, Mohit Takalkar, Megha Burman, Haripriya Manish Lodhia, Shrikant Yadav, Abhilash Thapliyal, Aamir Dalvi', 'R', 'An insomniac former cop, Kennedy has been presumed dead for years. Yet, in secret, he continues to serve a corrupt system while seeking redemption. Halfway between thriller and film noir, Kennedy chronicles a violent and bloody vendetta in the dark streets of Mumbai. At the rate of the murders, Kennedy''s character reveals itself more and more and sinks into a spiral that seems to have no way out.', 'An insomniac former cop, Kennedy has been presumed dead for years. Yet, in secret, he continues to serve a corrupt system while seeking redemption. Halfway between thriller and film noir, Kennedy chronicles a violent and bloody vendetta in the dark streets of Mumbai. At the rate of the murders, Kennedy''s character reveals itself more and more and sinks into a spiral that seems to have no way out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oi8PrMckw1zOrkfVxwo0o6h7I27.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1112552'),
  ('576183692436175939', 'Kennedy et moi', 1999, 'Comedy', 'Sam Karmann, Guillaume Schiffman', 'Sam Karmann', 'Jean-Pierre Bacri, Nicole Garcia, Patrick Chesnais, Sam Karmann, François Chattot, Éléonore Bernheim, Lucas Bonnifait, Stéphane Höhn', null, 'If he buys a gun, visits his wife''s lover, and ends up savagely biting his dentist, Samuel Polaris is in bad shape. Very bad. Unless the others, the “normal” people – with their career plans, their adulteries, their arrogant incompetence – have fallen into a sort of collective madness. Who knows. Because he has no choice, because he is in love with his wife and because he refuses to resign himself to the worst, Samuel Polaris decides to regain his dignity. Even if, to do this, he has to steal from his psychiatrist the watch that Kennedy was wearing the day he was assassinated.', 'If he buys a gun, visits his wife''s lover, and ends up savagely biting his dentist, Samuel Polaris is in bad shape. Very bad. Unless the others, the “normal” people – with their career plans, their adulteries, their arrogant incompetence – have fallen into a sort of collective madness. Who knows. Because he has no choice, because he is in love with his wife and because he refuses to resign himself to the worst, Samuel Polaris decides to regain his dignity. Even if, to do this, he has to steal from his psychiatrist the watch that Kennedy was wearing the day he was assassinated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8vAW72fQ5vzAHf0mj3jaoBNzQgY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67769'),
  ('1009509958700904816', 'Kenneth Williams: Fantabulosa!', 2006, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Andy de Emmony, David Odd', 'Martyn Hesford, Kenneth Williams', 'Michael Sheen, Cheryl Campbell, Peter Wight, Beatie Edney, Kenny Doughty, Ron Cook, Guy Henry, Joseph Morgan', null, 'Kenneth Williams was the star of the Carry Ons and Round the Horne. Despite his fame, he led a life full of mental torture as he tried to overcome his homosexuality in 1950s Britain. This film follows his life and eventual death based on the many diaries he kept', 'Kenneth Williams was the star of the Carry Ons and Round the Horne. Despite his fame, he led a life full of mental torture as he tried to overcome his homosexuality in 1950s Britain. This film follows his life and eventual death based on the many diaries he kept', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7jUsf4GLLbdeCpheDz3C8lHpegu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39307'),
  ('586316383468257756', 'Kenny', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Clayton Jacobson', 'Clayton Jacobson, Shane Jacobson', 'Shane Jacobson, Eve von Bibra, Ronald Jacobson, Ian Dryden, Chris Davis, Jesse Jacobson, Donald MacDonald', 'PG-13', 'From the biggest festival to the smallest church social, Kenny Smyth delivers porta-loos to them all. Kenny tackles every septic challenge that comes his way, culminating in a visit to the International Pumper and Cleaner Expo in Nashville Tennessee - or as Kenny affectionately calls it, "Poo HQ".', 'From the biggest festival to the smallest church social, Kenny Smyth delivers porta-loos to them all. Kenny tackles every septic challenge that comes his way, culminating in a visit to the International Pumper and Cleaner Expo in Nashville Tennessee - or as Kenny affectionately calls it, "Poo HQ".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wolfQamiBBjpFR06GqeWu1KCOFy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13140'),
  ('582871312862148057', 'Kenny & Company', 1976, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Don Coscarelli, Don Coscarelli, Paul Pepperman', 'Don Coscarelli', 'Dan McCann, A. Michael Baldwin, Jeff Roth, Ralph Richmond, Reggie Bannister, Clay Foster, Kenneth V. Jones, Willy Masterson', 'PG', 'A coming-of-age story about the lives of a teenage boy and his friends as they traverse the highs and lows of boyhood in the run-up to Halloween.', 'A coming-of-age story about the lives of a teenage boy and his friends as they traverse the highs and lows of boyhood in the run-up to Halloween.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ovwEWbDo4Zb6Kpm43HdeyiIssXM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114735'),
  ('101600340991265678', 'Kenny Begins', 2009, 'Action, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Mats Lindberg, Carl Åstrand, Anna Jonsson', 'Mats Lindberg, Vasa, Lars Johansson', 'Johan Rheborg, Carla Abrahamsen, Bill Skarsgård, Jan Mybrand, Brasse Brännström, Björn Gustafsson, Cecilia Frode, Per Svensson', null, 'Kenny Starfighter is probably the most hopeless student the Hero academics of the galaxy has ever had. But in his desperate attempt in graduating he accidentally crashes on earth and discovers Pontus, an earthling who accidentally stumbled upon an intergalactic crystal which gave him inhuman strength. Now Kenny must save Pontus from Rutger Oversmart who wants the powers from the crystal for himself and Pontus must save Kennys faith from failing school and ending up as a hairdresser.', 'Kenny Starfighter is probably the most hopeless student the Hero academics of the galaxy has ever had. But in his desperate attempt in graduating he accidentally crashes on earth and discovers Pontus, an earthling who accidentally stumbled upon an intergalactic crystal which gave him inhuman strength. Now Kenny must save Pontus from Rutger Oversmart who wants the powers from the crystal for himself and Pontus must save Kennys faith from failing school and ending up as a hairdresser.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oQHJCQfM14xSk89xkRi3aryE1Vp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21013'),
  ('1066871244909869879', 'Kensuke''s Kingdom', 2024, 'Animation, Adventure, Drama, Family', 'Peter Dodd, Kirk Hendry, Neil Boyle', 'Frank Cottrell Boyce', 'Sally Hawkins, Cillian Murphy, Raffey Cassidy, Aaron MacGregor, Ken Watanabe, Alfred Kodai Berglund, Ken Ochiai, Cavin Cornwall', null, 'A young boy and his family set off on a sailing trip of a lifetime until a violent storm erupts, sweeping Michael and his dog overboard. After washing up on a remote island, terrified, they struggle to survive and adjust to life alone, One day, Michael discovers he is not alone when he is confronted by a mysterious Japanese man who has lived there secretly since World War II, angry that Michael has arrived. However, as dangerous invaders threaten their fragile island paradise, Michael and the old man, Kensuke, join forces to save their secret world.', 'A young boy and his family set off on a sailing trip of a lifetime until a violent storm erupts, sweeping Michael and his dog overboard. After washing up on a remote island, terrified, they struggle to survive and adjust to life alone, One day, Michael discovers he is not alone when he is confronted by a mysterious Japanese man who has lived there secretly since World War II, angry that Michael has arrived. However, as dangerous invaders threaten their fragile island paradise, Michael and the old man, Kensuke, join forces to save their secret world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9M8tTHbYFrGxCXxNMvAkvRbhtER.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:587563'),
  ('949714895874068229', 'Kentucky', 1938, 'Drama, Romance', 'David Butler, Ernest Palmer, Ray Rennahan', 'Lamar Trotti, John Taintor Foote', 'Loretta Young, Richard Greene, Walter Brennan, Douglass Dumbrille, Karen Morley, Moroni Olsen, Russell Hicks, Willard Robertson', null, 'Young lovers Jack and Sally are from families that compete to send horses to the 1938 Kentucky Derby, but during the Civil War, her family sided with the South while his sided with the North--and her Uncle Peter will have nothing to do with Jack''s family.', 'Young lovers Jack and Sally are from families that compete to send horses to the 1938 Kentucky Derby, but during the Civil War, her family sided with the South while his sided with the North--and her Uncle Peter will have nothing to do with Jack''s family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s7sKkeaXl2wVbLHCONorHMQHYqu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118889'),
  ('337487700489591507', 'Keoma', 1976, 'Western, Action', 'Enzo G. Castellari, Aiace Parolin, Rocco Lerro', 'Nico Ducci, Mino Roli, George Eastman', 'Franco Nero, William Berger, Olga Karlatos, Orso Maria Guerrini, Gabriella Giacobbe, Antonio Marsina, Joshua Sinclair, Donald O''Brien', 'R', 'Half-breed Keoma returns to his border hometown after service in the Civil War and finds it under the control of Caldwell, an ex-Confederate raider, and his vicious gang of thugs. To make matters worse, Keoma''s three half-brothers have joined forces with Caldwell, and make it painfully clear that his return is an unwelcome one. Determined to break Caldwell and his brothers'' grip on the town, Keoma partners with his father''s former ranch hand to exact violent revenge.', 'Half-breed Keoma returns to his border hometown after service in the Civil War and finds it under the control of Caldwell, an ex-Confederate raider, and his vicious gang of thugs. To make matters worse, Keoma''s three half-brothers have joined forces with Caldwell, and make it painfully clear that his return is an unwelcome one. Determined to break Caldwell and his brothers'' grip on the town, Keoma partners with his father''s former ranch hand to exact violent revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Dq0J0mNkUM7SatXzZr7QRciZa5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6609'),
  ('854301908822663560', 'Kepler Sexto B', 2023, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'Alejandro Suárez Lozano, Pablo Bürmann', 'Alejandro Suárez Lozano, Grete Suarez', 'Karra Elejalde, Daniela Pezzotti, Pablo Molinero, Ramiro Blas, Jorge Bosch, Juli Mira, Vicente Vergara', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2AXA0txJlFdBpRwSq1YFGPdGinM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1096316'),
  ('342770089552117118', 'Kept and Dreamless', 2005, 'Drama', 'Vera Fogwill, Martín Desalvo, Bruno Roberti', 'Martín Desalvo, Vera Fogwill', 'Lucia Snieg, Mirta Busnelli, Edda Díaz, Mía Maestro, Elsa Berenguer, Anahí Martella, Gastón Pauls, Julián Krakov', null, 'Florence, a young irresponsible mother and her precocious daughter, Eugenia, have an unusual relationship. The roles between the two are reversed. Florence is totally inept at caring for a daughter, whereas Eugenia, only 10 years old, shows maturity and responsibility far beyond what her age might lead you to suppose.', 'Florence, a young irresponsible mother and her precocious daughter, Eugenia, have an unusual relationship. The roles between the two are reversed. Florence is totally inept at caring for a daughter, whereas Eugenia, only 10 years old, shows maturity and responsibility far beyond what her age might lead you to suppose.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c74cHSa0YgXAu6U44sTOLvL61sw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104431'),
  ('716824965081499604', 'Kept Husbands', 1931, 'Drama', 'Lloyd Bacon, Jack MacKenzie', 'Louis Sarecky', 'Dorothy Mackaill, Joel McCrea, Clara Kimball Young, Ned Sparks, Mary Carr, Robert McWade, Bryant Washburn, Florence Roberts', 'NR', 'A former All-American football star, now working as a steel mill supervisor in New Jersey, falls in love with the mill owner''s wealthy, very spoiled daughter.', 'A former All-American football star, now working as a steel mill supervisor in New Jersey, falls in love with the mill owner''s wealthy, very spoiled daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/amQazk7EXhUbSRD6rtLiIsIKScW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106605'),
  ('805861093889237217', 'Kept Woman', 2015, 'Thriller, TV Movie, Mystery', 'Michel Poulette, Daniel Villeneuve, Robbie Ditchburn', 'Doug Barber, James Taylor Phillips', 'Courtney Ford, Shaun Benson, Andrew W. Walker, Rachel Wilson, Troy Blundell, Jesse Camacho, Matt Enos', null, 'Jessica and her fiancé Evan just moved from the city into their dream home on a quiet suburban street. Soon after, Jessica catches her seemingly friendly new neighbor, Simon, in a strange lie and can''t let her suspicions rest. The danger escalates when Simon lures her inside his home and imprisons Jessica in his secret bunker, meticulously decorated in the idealized style of the 1950''s.', 'Jessica and her fiancé Evan just moved from the city into their dream home on a quiet suburban street. Soon after, Jessica catches her seemingly friendly new neighbor, Simon, in a strange lie and can''t let her suspicions rest. The danger escalates when Simon lures her inside his home and imprisons Jessica in his secret bunker, meticulously decorated in the idealized style of the 1950''s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yHlqPeZ31TACwmFaAl6gygGIPGf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:328480'),
  ('473853627276003683', 'Kerala Cafe', 2009, 'Drama', 'Madhu Ambat, Vijay Ulaganath, M. J. Radhakrishnan', 'Ranjan Abraham, Padmakumar M, Rajesh Jayaraman', 'Dileep, Prithviraj Sukumaran, Suresh Gopi, Jayasurya, Fahadh Faasil, Mammootty, Thilakan, Jagathy Sreekumar', null, 'Ten interconnected short stories unfolding around a roadside railway café in Kerala, where travelers from diverse backgrounds pass through, their lives briefly intersecting amid themes of migration, relationships and modern struggles.', 'Ten interconnected short stories unfolding around a roadside railway café in Kerala, where travelers from diverse backgrounds pass through, their lives briefly intersecting amid themes of migration, relationships and modern struggles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iHocGERTmGi1eLfmKyow8PTtvLe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85089'),
  ('436951709250958716', 'Keriz', 1985, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Kartal Tibet, Deniz Özen, Seçkin Yasar', 'Erdoğan Tünaş', 'Kemal Sunal, Perihan Savaş, Ali Şen, Aliye Rona, Halit Akçatepe, Müge Akyamaç, İhsan Yüce, Nubar Terziyan', null, 'Zülfü and Zülfiye get married. However, Abbas, Zülfü''s uncle, who is trying to take over Zülfü''s property, tries to separate the couple. Abbas spreads rumors about Zülfiye. He incites Zülfü to kill his wife. Eventually, Zülfiye secretly moves to Istanbul with her family. Zülfü goes to Istanbul to kill Zülfiye, influenced by his uncle''s persuasion. However, when a mine is discovered on Zülfiye''s father''s land, all plans will change.', 'Zülfü and Zülfiye get married. However, Abbas, Zülfü''s uncle, who is trying to take over Zülfü''s property, tries to separate the couple. Abbas spreads rumors about Zülfiye. He incites Zülfü to kill his wife. Eventually, Zülfiye secretly moves to Istanbul with her family. Zülfü goes to Istanbul to kill Zülfiye, influenced by his uncle''s persuasion. However, when a mine is discovered on Zülfiye''s father''s land, all plans will change.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6CX6Za52zETO0eQFYCb7uQLqoEI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:436067'),
  ('934577050305343293', 'Kermit''s Swamp Years', 2002, 'Fantasy, Family, Comedy', 'David Gumpel, Rufus Standefer, Rick Callan', 'Jim Lewis, Joey Mazzarino', 'Steve Whitmire, Bill Barretta, Joey Mazzarino, Alice Dinnean, John E. Kennedy, Dave Goelz, Jerry Nelson, Cree Summer', 'NR', 'At 12 years old, Kermit the Frog and best friends Goggles and Croaker travel outside their homes in the swamps of the Deep South to do something extraordinary with their lives.', 'At 12 years old, Kermit the Frog and best friends Goggles and Croaker travel outside their homes in the swamps of the Deep South to do something extraordinary with their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1KCgtq413cBz1qgMT0gkPX67xzZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15909'),
  ('797781205496936685', 'Kerosene Salesman''s Wife', 1989, 'Drama', 'Aleksandr Kaydanovskiy, Alexey Rodionov, Evgeniy Fyodorov', 'Aleksandr Kaydanovskiy', 'Vytautas Paukste, Aleksandr Baluev, Sergey Veksler, Evgeny Mironov, Nikolay Ispolatov, Mikhail Danilov, Alla Malkova, Galina Stakhanova', null, 'A fatal surgical mistake involving the wrong blood type splits the lives of twin brothers. One, the guilt-ridden surgeon, embraces anonymity as a kerosene salesman, while his sibling ascends to become the powerful Chairman of the City Council. When a government investigation into bribery begins, the brothers are finally forced to confront the dark secret that binds them.', 'A fatal surgical mistake involving the wrong blood type splits the lives of twin brothers. One, the guilt-ridden surgeon, embraces anonymity as a kerosene salesman, while his sibling ascends to become the powerful Chairman of the City Council. When a government investigation into bribery begins, the brothers are finally forced to confront the dark secret that binds them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k8gMoyNHq9XZ2gtqDnzKZDEvpFq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:260969'),
  ('997142662531405302', 'Kerr', 2022, 'Thriller, Mystery, Drama', 'Andreas Sinanos, Tayfun Pirselimoğlu, Manolya Maya', 'Tayfun Pirselimoğlu', 'Erdem Şenocak, Jale Arıkan, Rıza Akın, Ali Seçkiner Alıcı, Gafur Uzuner, Melih Düzenli, Sinan Bengier, Muttalip Müjdeci', null, 'Can witnesses a murder in a small town. The police don''t allow him to leave after his testimony. On the other hand, a quarantine is declared due to rabid dogs. The whole town turns into purgatory with no exit is almost at the edge of insanity.', 'Can witnesses a murder in a small town. The police don''t allow him to leave after his testimony. On the other hand, a quarantine is declared due to rabid dogs. The whole town turns into purgatory with no exit is almost at the edge of insanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n3VqCDI5IPwNhuV7i5M2dFnk6Ci.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:872131'),
  ('297523319903083189', 'Kes', 1970, 'Drama', 'Ken Loach, Chris Menges, Keith Evans', 'Ken Loach, Tony Garnett', 'David Bradley, Freddie Fletcher, Lynne Perrie, Colin Welland, Brian Glover, Bob Bowes, Bernard Atha, Laurence Bould', 'PG-13', 'Bullied at school and ignored and abused at home by his indifferent mother and older brother, Billy Casper, a 15-year-old working-class Yorkshire boy, tames and trains his pet kestrel falcon whom he names Kes. Helped and encouraged by his English teacher and his fellow students, Billy finally finds a positive purpose to his unhappy existence.', 'Bullied at school and ignored and abused at home by his indifferent mother and older brother, Billy Casper, a 15-year-old working-class Yorkshire boy, tames and trains his pet kestrel falcon whom he names Kes. Helped and encouraged by his English teacher and his fellow students, Billy finally finds a positive purpose to his unhappy existence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r1FMq75irhsQBVGjXhPU4xA9SDo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13384'),
  ('1011675923345804367', 'Kesari', 2019, 'Action, Drama, History, War', 'Jogi Malang, Anurag Singh, Manav Bhinder', 'Girish Kohli, Anurag Singh', 'Akshay Kumar, Parineeti Chopra, Mir Sarwar, Ashwath Bhatt, ''Om'' Rakesh Chaturvedi, Suvinder Vicky, Vivek Saini, Vansh Bhardwaj', null, 'In 1897, an army of 21 Sikhs battles 10,000 Afghans to prevent the Saragarhi Fort from being taken down.', 'In 1897, an army of 21 Sikhs battles 10,000 Afghans to prevent the Saragarhi Fort from being taken down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ctjT1pMNAGD9ou0kuhz806tf7kX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:498448'),
  ('681598104850958421', 'Kesari Chapter 2: The Untold Story of Jallianwala Bagh', 2025, 'Drama, History', 'Vipul S Arora, Panchami Ghavri, Debojeet Ray', 'Amritpal Singh Bindra, Karan Singh Tyagi', 'Akshay Kumar, R. Madhavan, Ananya Panday, Mark Bennington, Sammy Jonas Heaney, Rohan Verma, Alexx O''Nell, Regina Cassandra', null, 'A dramatization of the life story of C. Sankaran Nair, the lawyer who fought for the truth behind the Jallianwala Bagh massacre.', 'A dramatization of the life story of C. Sankaran Nair, the lawyer who fought for the truth behind the Jallianwala Bagh massacre.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jgGSqe1YgSot6Y1zDVTVkbsZ46z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1137339'),
  ('1098102415710245742', 'Ketenpere', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Kamil Çetin, Eyüp Boz', 'Şafak Sezer', 'Şafak Sezer, Hakan Ural, Mehmet Esen, Elif Erol, Serkan Şengül, Volkan Başaran, Turabi Çamkıran, Abidin Yerebakan', null, 'Kalender who works at a casting company owned by a relative and occasionally takes on small, non-speaking roles in TV series and films. He dreams of marrying his long-term girlfriend İmge and tries to arrange small roles for people in his neighborhood. Kalender is implicated in a financial crime involving his relative''s name and is sent to prison for a short time. In prison, he meets a prisoner named Vefa. Vefa recognizes Kalender from the TV series and films he has appeared in, despite being younger than him; he quickly grows fond of Kalender and takes him under his wing.', 'Kalender who works at a casting company owned by a relative and occasionally takes on small, non-speaking roles in TV series and films. He dreams of marrying his long-term girlfriend İmge and tries to arrange small roles for people in his neighborhood. Kalender is implicated in a financial crime involving his relative''s name and is sent to prison for a short time. In prison, he meets a prisoner named Vefa. Vefa recognizes Kalender from the TV series and films he has appeared in, despite being younger than him; he quickly grows fond of Kalender and takes him under his wing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dLvUlTSLs93gPkUVJBgcfzf8AkP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:477279'),
  ('781527173066004253', 'Ketenpere: Dalavere', 2026, 'Comedy', 'Doğuş Onur Karasu, Varol Şahin', 'Şafak Sezer', 'Şafak Sezer, Büşra Pekin, Uğur Aslan', null, 'In the sequel, Kalender has fulfilled his biggest dream: founding a film company. His new goal is to team up with Vefa, who trapped him in first film, to retrieve the gold from Feza, a wealthy businessman obsessed with aliens.', 'In the sequel, Kalender has fulfilled his biggest dream: founding a film company. His new goal is to team up with Vefa, who trapped him in first film, to retrieve the gold from Feza, a wealthy businessman obsessed with aliens.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FdznIeiQ34jlQqcWzZnQco46EHf1.jpg', 'plex:movie:ketenpere-dalavere-2026'),
