  ('599289268856746594', 'Keyholes Are for Peeping', 1972, 'Comedy', 'Doris Wishman, C. Davis Smith', null, 'Sammy Petrillo, Phillip Stahl, Louis Silverman, Saul Meth, Richard Towers, Arlana Blue, Pamela Mann, Alex Mann', null, 'After earning his degree through a correspondence course, Stanley uses his newfound knowledge to help his neighbors reignite the flames of passion. Little does anyone realize that their most intimate moments are all eye candy for the lonely maintenance man who has open access to the entire building.', 'After earning his degree through a correspondence course, Stanley uses his newfound knowledge to help his neighbors reignite the flames of passion. Little does anyone realize that their most intimate moments are all eye candy for the lonely maintenance man who has open access to the entire building.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Lafw3xtguFPdZm9mBdz6x5pa3d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112359'),
