  ('428973497902879017', 'Keys to Tulsa', 1997, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Leslie Greif, Robert Fraisse', 'Harley Peyton', 'Eric Stoltz, James Spader, Deborah Kara Unger, Joanna Going, Michael Rooker, Mary Tyler Moore, James Coburn, Peter Strauss', 'R', 'Richter Boudreau is on a bad streak: Languishing in the shadow of his celebrity mother, he loses his job as a film critic for the town paper, and now he''s been approached with a dangerous proposition that ultimately leads to blackmail. Richter''s friend Ronnie ropes him into a scheme to steal the inheritance of his wife, Vicky.', 'Richter Boudreau is on a bad streak: Languishing in the shadow of his celebrity mother, he loses his job as a film critic for the town paper, and now he''s been approached with a dangerous proposition that ultimately leads to blackmail. Richter''s friend Ronnie ropes him into a scheme to steal the inheritance of his wife, Vicky.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g3Y1t6AXTVyRrz2DOIGsBeeA3YB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118991'),
  ('203985457619180454', 'Khaali Peeli', 2020, 'Romance, Action, Comedy, Thriller', 'Maqbool Khan, Adil Afsar, Vaisakh Vijayan', null, 'Ishaan Khatter, Ananya Panday, Jaideep Ahlawat, Satish Kaushik, Deshna Dugad, Vedant Desai, Anup Soni, Zakir Hussain', null, 'The story is about two childhood sweethearts Pooja and Blackie who gets separated due to certain circumstances when they were kids. Pooja, who is now aprostitute, decides to escape the brothel on turning 18, with a bag full of stolen money. She bumps into Blackie who is now a very ‘chalu’ Bombay taxi driver. He agrees to ‘drive’ her to freedom, in exchange for a hefty amount.This leads to a series of chase and escape – with the goons on Pooja''s trail and the cops on the goons’ trail.', 'The story is about two childhood sweethearts Pooja and Blackie who gets separated due to certain circumstances when they were kids. Pooja, who is now aprostitute, decides to escape the brothel on turning 18, with a bag full of stolen money. She bumps into Blackie who is now a very ‘chalu’ Bombay taxi driver. He agrees to ‘drive’ her to freedom, in exchange for a hefty amount.This leads to a series of chase and escape – with the goons on Pooja''s trail and the cops on the goons’ trail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ovmbklvzSu8pbIthunlKPgIjlOo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:693836'),
  ('167705615696970601', 'Khakee', 2004, 'Action', 'Rajkumar Santoshi, K. V. Anand', 'Shridhar Raghavan, Rajkumar Santoshi, Ranjit Kapoor', 'Amitabh Bachchan, Akshay Kumar, Aishwarya Rai Bachchan, Ajay Devgn, Tusshar Kapoor, Atul Kulkarni, Sabyasachi Chakraborty, Prakash Raj', 'R', 'DCP Anant and his team get tasked with escorting an alleged terrorist to Mumbai. However, a rogue ex-police officer makes their task difficult as he tries to stop them from reaching their destination.', 'DCP Anant and his team get tasked with escorting an alleged terrorist to Mumbai. However, a rogue ex-police officer makes their task difficult as he tries to stop them from reaching their destination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dMsqwWFl51t8jXR0tWzjEuO8H4l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21665'),
  ('1119507554800091474', 'Khakee(Khaki)', 2026, 'Action, Drama', 'Atanu Bhuyan', 'Atanu Bhuyan', 'Pawan Gayan, Jahanara Begum, Shreya Borthakur, Ishan Hazarika, Arun Nath', null, 'Inspired by a cop''s life, this film explores his struggles against political pressure and corruption. As he battles guilt and power abuse, it asks: Does politics control the police, or can they rise above to serve the public?', 'Inspired by a cop''s life, this film explores his struggles against political pressure and corruption. As he battles guilt and power abuse, it asks: Does politics control the police, or can they rise above to serve the public?', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fm.media-amazon.com%2Fimages%2FM%2FMV5BNTJiYmQ4OTQtN2IzNi00MDVlLWExOWItYzI0MmNhOWU4NmZhXkEyXkFqcGc%40._V1_.jpg', 'plex:movie:khakeekhaki'),
  ('985103331705762880', 'Khal Nayak', 1993, 'Action, Music', 'Subhash Ghai, Nadeem Irani, Rahul Shantaram', 'Ram Kelkar, Subhash Ghai', 'Sanjay Dutt, Madhuri Dixit, Jackie Shroff, Anupam Kher, Ramya Krishnan, Sushmita Mukherjee, Neena Gupta, Rakhee Gulzar', null, 'Inspector Ram succeeds in nabbing notorious criminal Ballu. When Ballu''s escape taints Ram''s name, his fiancee, Ganga, decides to trap Ballu. But, things get complicated however, when Ballu falls for her and she finds that she isn''t entirely immune to his charms.', 'Inspector Ram succeeds in nabbing notorious criminal Ballu. When Ballu''s escape taints Ram''s name, his fiancee, Ganga, decides to trap Ballu. But, things get complicated however, when Ballu falls for her and she finds that she isn''t entirely immune to his charms.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f3uvAGmxMdOPmwycHE13kxTqFKc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32295'),
  ('363427355487650799', 'Khaleja', 2010, 'Action, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Trivikram Srinivas, Yash Bhatt', 'Trivikram Srinivas', 'Mahesh Babu, Shafi, Prakash Raj, Rao Ramesh, Anushka Shetty, Ali Basha, Sunil Varma, Tanikella Bharani', null, 'A village is hounded by an unknown disease, decimating its population. The village priest prophesies that God''s avatar will save them. Siddha goes in search of this supernatural potential and finds it in Seetarama Raju, a cab driver.', 'A village is hounded by an unknown disease, decimating its population. The village priest prophesies that God''s avatar will save them. Siddha goes in search of this supernatural potential and finds it in Seetarama Raju, a cab driver.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rsQbJT4vjyQe6Mpry1i8Tnf86wp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56986'),
  ('221721756351746807', 'Khalif the Stork', 1981, 'Animation, Fantasy', 'Valeriy Ugarov, Mikhail Druyan, Vladimir Kutuzov', 'Anatoliy Petrov, Valeriy Ugarov', 'Vasiliy Livanov, Natalya Seleznyova, Inna Churikova, Garri Bardin, Innokentiy Smoktunovskiy, Yuriy Yakovlev, Zinaida Naryshkina', null, 'A rich caliph is leading a careless life. One day an evil wizard sells him a magic potion that can turn human into any animal he wants. The only condition: one mustn''t laugh.', 'A rich caliph is leading a careless life. One day an evil wizard sells him a magic potion that can turn human into any animal he wants. The only condition: one mustn''t laugh.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9oOFqWZvyBjqIMZRiitc8tGqWjA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90265'),
  ('123236124242918391', 'Khamoshi: The Musical', 1996, 'Drama, Romance', 'Sanjay Leela Bhansali, Anil Mehta', 'Sanjay Leela Bhansali', 'Salman Khan, Manisha Koirala, Nana Patekar, Seema Biswas, Helen, Himani Shivpuri, Raghubir Yadav, Pratik Gala', null, 'The daughter of deaf-mute parents seeks their understanding when she discovers a love for music.', 'The daughter of deaf-mute parents seeks their understanding when she discovers a love for music.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lhOkmrXgbk3U8vZkd5bkynmvdyT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97449'),
