  ('1020829175528760139', 'Khanuma', 1926, 'Comedy, Drama, Music', 'Aleqsandre Tsutsunava, Sergei Zabozlayev (I)', 'Avqsenti Tsagareli, Aleqsandre Tsutsunava', 'Elisabed Cherqezishvili, Vladimir Kavsadze, Tamari Bolqvadze, Mikheil Chiaureli, Kote Mikaberidze, Levan Khotivari, Valerian Gunia, Tsetsilia Tsutsunava', null, 'Prince bon-vivant Levan Phantiashvili finds himself in a difficult financial situation. To make his life better he agrees to marry the merchant Adam Varakhidze’s daughter, Elo. The merchant is happy for this move opens the door in a high society for him until he finds out that Elo is not quite happy with his decision.', 'Prince bon-vivant Levan Phantiashvili finds himself in a difficult financial situation. To make his life better he agrees to marry the merchant Adam Varakhidze’s daughter, Elo. The merchant is happy for this move opens the door in a high society for him until he finds out that Elo is not quite happy with his decision.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8llUASJ0AK3E2RmLRyg5TiNoPjq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:260348'),
  ('93166713384634326', 'Khartoum', 1966, 'History, War, Adventure', 'Eliot Elisofon, Basil Dearden, Edward Scaife', 'Robert Ardrey', 'Charlton Heston, Laurence Olivier, Richard Johnson, Ralph Richardson, Alexander Knox, Johnny Sekka, Michael Hordern, Zia Mohyeddin', null, 'English General Charles George Gordon is appointed military governor of Anglo-Egyptian Sudan by the Prime Minister. Ordered to evacuate Egyptians from the Sudan, Gordon stays on to protect the people of Khartoum, who are under threat of being conquered by a Muslim army.', 'English General Charles George Gordon is appointed military governor of Anglo-Egyptian Sudan by the Prime Minister. Ordered to evacuate Egyptians from the Sudan, Gordon stays on to protect the people of Khartoum, who are under threat of being conquered by a Muslim army.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lcqulOKVAPkyEbvvYtPYgVQazWD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29710'),
  ('870523153076019639', 'Khatta Meetha', 2010, 'Comedy, Drama', 'V. Manikandan, Priyadarshan, Ravindra Jain', 'Priyadarshan', 'Akshay Kumar, Trisha Krishnan, Rajpal Yadav, Johny Lever, Makrand Deshpande, Asrani, Jaideep Ahlawat, Paresh Brahmabhatt', 'PG', 'Sachin Tichkule, a struggling contractor whose failure in making peace with the corrupt bureaucracy in town as well as strained relation with his ex-girlfriend and his family leads to misadventures that deprive him of his closest relations. However, as he begins to mend his ways, justice comes knocking on his door.', 'Sachin Tichkule, a struggling contractor whose failure in making peace with the corrupt bureaucracy in town as well as strained relation with his ex-girlfriend and his family leads to misadventures that deprive him of his closest relations. However, as he begins to mend his ways, justice comes knocking on his door.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rIM83O7WUcZIlg9pd6SgXgB0w2v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44565'),
  ('1084628815805537593', 'Khel', 1992, 'Comedy', 'Rakesh Roshan', 'Javed Akhtar', 'Anil Kapoor, Madhuri Dixit, Prem Chopra, Anupam Kher, Sonu Walia, Mala Sinha, Vijayendra Ghatge, Sujit Kumar', null, 'A trio of cons, tired of small jobs, get together to con a rich, widowed woman, desperately seeking her long-lost grandchild and sole heir. The trio obtain jobs at her estate and set off their plan.', 'A trio of cons, tired of small jobs, get together to con a rich, widowed woman, desperately seeking her long-lost grandchild and sole heir. The trio obtain jobs at her estate and set off their plan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cUFdWhQ6AO8V9fzLKZLI0UbVKF7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:227957'),
  ('674612662970888062', 'Khel Khel Mein', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Mudassar Aziz, Manoj Kumar Khatoi', 'Sara Bodinar, Mudassar Aziz, Paolo Genovese', 'Akshay Kumar, Taapsee Pannu, Vaani Kapoor, Fardeen Khan, Ammy Virk, Pragya Jaiswal, Aditya Seal, Kiran Kumar', null, 'What if for one night your mobile phone was a public property? 7 friends at a wedding after-party decide to play a seemingly harmless but as it turns out, a dangerous game which might have earth-shattering consequences with relationships, marriages and identities being at stake.', 'What if for one night your mobile phone was a public property? 7 friends at a wedding after-party decide to play a seemingly harmless but as it turns out, a dangerous game which might have earth-shattering consequences with relationships, marriages and identities being at stake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/32P0oQf41HXbENRGtu2h0rqBF2k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1241592'),
  ('51926663623591786', 'Khichdi: The Movie', 2010, 'Comedy, Family', 'Aatish Kapadia', 'Aatish Kapadia', 'Anang Desai, Rajeev Mehta, Supriya Pathak, JD Majethia, Nimisha Vakharia, Kirti Kulhari, Gireesh Sahedev, Farah Khan', null, 'In order to immortalize his love, a groom decides to create conflict between his and his to-be bride''s families.', 'In order to immortalize his love, a groom decides to create conflict between his and his to-be bride''s families.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pe00dnjrldNryggGZyBQ6zon30U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53283'),
  ('567722029879824002', 'Khiladi', 1992, 'Thriller, Romance', 'Abbas Alibhai Burmawalla, Mustan Alibhai Burmawalla', 'Saroj Khan', 'Akshay Kumar, Ayesha Jhulka, Deepak Tijori, Sabeeha, Tinnu Anand, Sharat Saxena, Ananth Narayan Mahadevan, Beena Banerjee', null, 'A group of friends, who love to make bets with one another, play a prank that goes horribly wrong when one of them is murdered.', 'A group of friends, who love to make bets with one another, play a prank that goes horribly wrong when one of them is murdered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Adar3XOiv7ckSbxnIWgsbb9XNGu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161436'),
  ('544497449359256038', 'Khiladi 420', 2000, 'Thriller, Comedy, Crime', 'Neeraj Vora, S Pappu, M.S. Prabhu', 'Sikandar Kharbanda', 'Akshay Kumar, Mahima Chaudhry, Antara Mali, Mukesh Rishi, Alok Nath, Gulshan Grover, Viju Khote, Sayaji Shinde', null, 'Dev, a conman, gets killed by his wife Ritu, after she learns that the former is a debt-ridden thug who married her only to repay his debts. Her life turns upside down when she meets Anand, Dev''s identical twin brother.', 'Dev, a conman, gets killed by his wife Ritu, after she learns that the former is a debt-ridden thug who married her only to repay his debts. Her life turns upside down when she meets Anand, Dev''s identical twin brother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b2K32HUUbRli705OQpO9uUciW0N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:304755'),
  ('216861483341961197', 'Khiladi 786', 2012, 'Action, Comedy', 'Ashish R. Mohan', null, 'Akshay Kumar, Asin Thottumkal, Himesh Reshammiya, Mithun Chakraborty, Raj Babbar, Johny Lever, Bharti Singh, Rajesh Khattar', 'NR', 'A father who runs a marriage bureau believes that his son is a failure in life. In order to prove him wrong, his son takes on the task of finding a match for a gangster''s sister.', 'A father who runs a marriage bureau believes that his son is a failure in life. In order to prove him wrong, his son takes on the task of finding a match for a gangster''s sister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3chNHVi7j0jmUvJ1k7n2EYPfFmC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147767'),
  ('738805137016535074', 'Khiladiyon Ka Khiladi', 1996, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Umesh Mehra', 'Umesh Mehra', 'Rekha, Akshay Kumar, Raveena Tandon, Deven Verma, Gulshan Grover, Gavin Packard, Inder Kumar, Dolly Bindra', null, 'A man comes to America in order to find his brother who is wanted by the police. But his search forces him to get mixed up with a lady gangster that facilitates illegal underground fights.', 'A man comes to America in order to find his brother who is wanted by the police. But his search forces him to get mixed up with a lady gangster that facilitates illegal underground fights.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aJdqZqyDgByRhrQE312iF5GAIvs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:230454'),
  ('269105107406812714', 'Kho Gaye Hum Kahan', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Arjun Varain Singh, Tanay Satam, Nandini Shrikent', 'Arjun Varain Singh, Zoya Akhtar, Reema Kagti', 'Siddhant Chaturvedi, Ananya Panday, Adarsh Gourav, Kalki Koechlin, Anya Singh, Rohan Gurbaxani, Vijay Maurya, Divya Jagdale', 'PG-13', 'Three best friends juggle life as 20-somethings in Mumbai, where romance, ambition and heartbreak collide with the addictive draw of social media.', 'Three best friends juggle life as 20-somethings in Mumbai, where romance, ambition and heartbreak collide with the addictive draw of social media.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/WUptEusy1sMh3s46Ik7QbfoKts.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:875188'),
  ('670846187273622780', 'Khoobsurat', 1999, 'Comedy, Romance, Family', 'Sanjay Chhel', 'Sanjay Chhel', 'Sanjay Dutt, Urmila Matondkar, Paresh Rawal, Johny Lever, Om Puri, Farida Jalal, Aanjjan Srivastav, Ashok Saraf', null, 'Sanju, a con-man and petty thief, gets in the bad books of Jogia Seth and ends up owing him money. In order to get the money, Sanju decides to pose as a member of the Shastri family, so that he can gain their confidence and help himself to their wealth. But fate has something else in store for Sanju.', 'Sanju, a con-man and petty thief, gets in the bad books of Jogia Seth and ends up owing him money. In order to get the money, Sanju decides to pose as a member of the Shastri family, so that he can gain their confidence and help himself to their wealth. But fate has something else in store for Sanju.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mS6Srh8CcF5okUpYuBPIz6k1hmV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71257'),
  ('920965815117175607', 'Khoobsurat', 2014, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Shashanka Ghosh', 'Indira Bisht', 'Sonam Kapoor Ahuja, Fawad Khan, Kirron Kher, Ratna Pathak Shah, Aditi Rao Hydari, Cyrus Sahukar, Aamir Raza Husain, Ashok Banthia', 'PG', 'A vibrant, hopelessly romantic physiotherapist meets a handsome young Rajput prince who is the complete opposite of her – and is engaged to someone else.', 'A vibrant, hopelessly romantic physiotherapist meets a handsome young Rajput prince who is the complete opposite of her – and is engaged to someone else.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fJnWRipBGa5p1UxBLShDF1SMw01.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:291157'),
  ('251209891492355839', 'Khoon Bhari Maang', 1988, 'Romance', 'Rakesh Roshan', 'Kader Khan', 'Rekha, Kabir Bedi, Sonu Walia, Kader Khan, Satyajeet Puri, Shatrughan Sinha, Rakesh Roshan, Saeed Jaffrey', null, 'Nandini and Sanjay Verma are lovers, and they conspire to take over the vaste estate of Mr. Saxena and his only widowed daughter, Aarti, and her two children, with the help of Sanjay''s maternal uncle Heeralal, a longtime employee of Saxena. After Saxena passes away suddenly, Sanjay woes Aarti and marries her. On a boating trip both Nandini and Sanjay do away with Aarti, making it look like an accident, and subsequently take over the entire Saxena estate. But Aarti survives, disfigured beyond recognition by a crocodile attack, With the help of plastic surgery transforms herself to a successful model, Jyoti. She then plans to carry out her vengeance against Sanjay, but finds that he has been physically abusing her children, pets, and servants. She must now decide to reveal her identity, or continue with her plan and be a spectator to the abuse on her loved ones. Written by rAjOo (gunwanti@hotmail.com)', 'Nandini and Sanjay Verma are lovers, and they conspire to take over the vaste estate of Mr. Saxena and his only widowed daughter, Aarti, and her two children, with the help of Sanjay''s maternal uncle Heeralal, a longtime employee of Saxena. After Saxena passes away suddenly, Sanjay woes Aarti and marries her. On a boating trip both Nandini and Sanjay do away with Aarti, making it look like an accident, and subsequently take over the entire Saxena estate. But Aarti survives, disfigured beyond recognition by a crocodile attack, With the help of plastic surgery transforms herself to a successful model, Jyoti. She then plans to carry out her vengeance against Sanjay, but finds that he has been physically abusing her children, pets, and servants. She must now decide to reveal her identity, or continue with her plan and be a spectator to the abuse on her loved ones. Written by rAjOo (gunwanti@hotmail.com)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qI1lglqzP0y1lSG9z9Ly9smpD8u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124595'),
  ('158833567853484570', 'Khosla Ka Ghosla!', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Dibakar Banerjee, Amitabha Singh', 'Jaideep Sahni', 'Anupam Kher, Boman Irani, Parvin Dabas, Ranvir Shorey, Tara Sharma, Vinay Pathak, Navin Nischol, Nitesh Pandey', null, 'Kamal Khosla''s land is grabbed by a land shark named Khurana. In a bid to retrieve their land, Khosla''s elder son hatches a clever plan to con the crook and enlists the help of his friends and his dysfunctional family.', 'Kamal Khosla''s land is grabbed by a land shark named Khurana. In a bid to retrieve their land, Khosla''s elder son hatches a clever plan to con the crook and enlists the help of his friends and his dysfunctional family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nYcqtbv8Be6qpTcl6Y7qp0hvVdh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15412'),
  ('351221105803358791', 'Khottabych', 2006, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Pyotr Tochilin, Maksim Drozdov, Anatoliy Susekov', 'Veronika Voznyak', 'Vladimir Tolokonnikov, Marius Jampolskis, Liva Kruminya, Mila Lipner, Yuliya Paranova, Mark Geykhman, Grigoriy Skryapkin, Ivan Gubanov', null, 'Young programmer and hacker Gena meets Khottabych - a genie who can''t quite understand today life realities after spending thousands of years in a lamp.', 'Young programmer and hacker Gena meets Khottabych - a genie who can''t quite understand today life realities after spending thousands of years in a lamp.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p8cwhs5JTy47f45b5GdqhEatLvr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57775'),
  ('723206493599481054', 'Khrustalyov, My Car!', 1999, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Aleksei German, Vladimir Ilin, Юрий Фетинг', 'Svetlana Karmalita, Aleksei German', 'Yuriy Tsurilo, Nina Ruslanova, Jüri Järvet Jr., Mikhail Dementyev, Aleksandr Bashirov, Natalya Lvova, Mulid Makoev, Ivan Matskevich', null, 'Military doctor General Klenski is arrested in Stalin''s Russia in 1953 during an anti-Semitic political campaign accused of being a participant in so-called "doctors'' plot".', 'Military doctor General Klenski is arrested in Stalin''s Russia in 1953 during an anti-Semitic political campaign accused of being a participant in so-called "doctors'' plot".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uMAEIn0fjxHNyweV0GfbTmMnD5D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100784'),
  ('913180355038073611', 'Khubsoorat', 1980, 'Drama, Family, Romance, Comedy', 'Hrishikesh Mukherjee, Jaywant Pathare', 'Gulzar, D.N. Mukherjee', 'Rekha, Dina Pathak, Ashok Kumar, Rakesh Roshan, Shashikala, Aradhana, David Abraham Cheulkar, S.N. Banerjee', null, 'Nirmala Gupta rules her household with an iron fist. While most of her family resents it, they do comply and try to appease to her. When her daughter-in-law''s free-spirited sister comes over to stay for a few days, things in the Gupta family start to change, agitating Nirmala.', 'Nirmala Gupta rules her household with an iron fist. While most of her family resents it, they do comply and try to appease to her. When her daughter-in-law''s free-spirited sister comes over to stay for a few days, things in the Gupta family start to change, agitating Nirmala.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lwCpEyDpmkwocoFkEe8czZKemki.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60730'),
  ('338705003188151797', 'Khuda Gawah', 1992, 'Romance, Action, Adventure', 'Mukul Anand, W. B. Rao', 'Santosh Saroj', 'Amitabh Bachchan, Sridevi, Shilpa Shirodkar, Kiran Kumar, Danny Denzongpa, Anjana Mumtaz, Beena Banerjee, Vikram Gokhale', null, 'Baadshah Khan falls in love with Benazir, a member of a rival clan who has defeated him in a game of buzkashi. Benazir will not marry him unless he brings back the head of her father''s killer, Habibullah, from India. He is successful, but he must return to India. He is then tragically separated from Benazir through a series of incidents that are only resolved years later with the arrival of his daughter, Menhdi, and his release from prison.', 'Baadshah Khan falls in love with Benazir, a member of a rival clan who has defeated him in a game of buzkashi. Benazir will not marry him unless he brings back the head of her father''s killer, Habibullah, from India. He is successful, but he must return to India. He is then tragically separated from Benazir through a series of incidents that are only resolved years later with the arrival of his daughter, Menhdi, and his release from prison.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uUvUFpWfGXlgOzXgkIYwqpchh0f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51725'),
  ('17232127260585975', 'Khuda Haafiz', 2020, 'Action, Thriller', 'Ram Rawat, Faruk Kabir', 'Faruk Kabir, Zaheer Abass Qureshi', 'Vidyut Jammwal, Shivaleeka Oberoi, Annu Kapoor, Aahana Kumra, Vipin Sharma, Nawab Shah, Gargi Patel, Shahnawaz Pradhan', null, 'When the 2008 recession leaves Sameer Chaudhary and his wife Nargis jobless, they struggle to make a living and after three months, succeed when they find jobs in a Middle East country named Noman. Due to delay in arrival of documents, Sameer stays in India while Nargis heads to Noman, upon arriving where she is abducted as she pleads for help over a phone call to Sameer. Enraged and helpless, Sameer heads to Noman and teams up with a local taxi driver to find Nargis before it is too late.', 'When the 2008 recession leaves Sameer Chaudhary and his wife Nargis jobless, they struggle to make a living and after three months, succeed when they find jobs in a Middle East country named Noman. Due to delay in arrival of documents, Sameer stays in India while Nargis heads to Noman, upon arriving where she is abducted as she pleads for help over a phone call to Sameer. Enraged and helpless, Sameer heads to Noman and teams up with a local taxi driver to find Nargis before it is too late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Glh9LgdsmlQxhUUKnCROHWdrsU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:719949'),
  ('427791653459218991', 'Khuda Haafiz Chapter 2: Agni Pariksha', 2022, 'Drama, Action, Romance', 'Faruk Kabir, Jitan Harmeet Singh, Sanket Bhatia', 'Faruk Kabir', 'Vidyut Jammwal, Shivaleeka Oberoi, Rukhsar Rehman, Sheeba Chaddha, Rajesh Tailang, Dibyendu Bhattacharya, Danish Husain, Sidharth Bhardwaj', null, 'Following a traumatic chapter in their lives, Sameer and Nargis try to lead a happy life by adopting Nandini, a friend''s orphaned niece. But fate soon strikes back hard when Nandini goes missing.', 'Following a traumatic chapter in their lives, Sameer and Nargis try to lead a happy life by adopting Nandini, a friend''s orphaned niece. But fate soon strikes back hard when Nandini goes missing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dWYGHG6yIG8Fh8LwhbGnnaYNYyX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:965653'),
  ('971830772426132880', 'Khuda Kay Liye', 2007, 'Drama', 'Shoaib Mansoor, Rudra Banerji, Bilal Lashari', null, 'Shaan Shahid, Fawad Khan, Naseeruddin Shah, Iman Ali, Simi Raheal, Rasheed Naz, Hameed Sheikh, Austin Marie Sayre', 'PG-13', 'The film is about the difficult situation in which the Pakistanis in particular and the Muslims in general are caught up since 9/11. There is a war going on between the Fundamentalists and the Liberal Muslims. This situation is creating a drift not only between the Western world and the Muslims, but also within the Muslims. The educated and modern Muslims are in a difficult situation because of their approach towards life and their western attire. They are criticized and harassed by the fundamentalists and on the other hand the Western world sees them as potential suspects of terrorism just because of their Muslim names.', 'The film is about the difficult situation in which the Pakistanis in particular and the Muslims in general are caught up since 9/11. There is a war going on between the Fundamentalists and the Liberal Muslims. This situation is creating a drift not only between the Western world and the Muslims, but also within the Muslims. The educated and modern Muslims are in a difficult situation because of their approach towards life and their western attire. They are criticized and harassed by the fundamentalists and on the other hand the Western world sees them as potential suspects of terrorism just because of their Muslim names.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4QaOrupHDRLgWRJEndFKERx9I5y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23717'),
  ('891759531549691842', 'Khufiya', 2023, 'Crime, Thriller, Mystery', 'Farhad Ahmed Dehlvi, Gautam Kishanchandani, Abhay Datt Sharma', 'Rohan Narula, Vishal Bhardwaj', 'Tabu, Ali Fazal, Wamiqa Gabbi, Ashish Vidhyarthi, Atul Kulkarni, Navnindra Behl, Shataf Figar, Azmeri Haque Badhon', 'R', 'When a mole in an intelligence unit leads to the murder of an undercover spy, a hardened agent relentlessly pursues him to avenge the death.', 'When a mole in an intelligence unit leads to the murder of an undercover spy, a hardened agent relentlessly pursues him to avenge the death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bbHUuTEo2DsYLoXCjkL8kB0oPhy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:878926'),
  ('470888614539927028', 'Khumba', 2013, 'Animation, Adventure, Family', 'Anthony Silverston', 'Raffaella Delle Donne, Anthony Silverston, Jonathan Roberts', 'Jake T. Austin, Liam Neeson, Steve Buscemi, AnnaSophia Robb, Laurence Fishburne, Richard E. Grant, Loretta Devine, Anika Noni Rose', 'G', 'A half-striped zebra is blamed for the drought and leaves his herd in search of his missing stripes. He is joined on his quest by an overprotective wildebeest and a flamboyant ostrich; they defeat the tyrannical leopard and save his herd.', 'A half-striped zebra is blamed for the drought and leaves his herd in search of his missing stripes. He is joined on his quest by an overprotective wildebeest and a flamboyant ostrich; they defeat the tyrannical leopard and save his herd.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bG32hRPM9LguHXj2tbyeILJisOK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:172391'),
  ('191011523711830257', 'Khun Pan 3', 2023, 'Action, Fantasy, Thriller', 'Kongkiat Khomsiri, Pramett Chankrasse, Putipong Saisikaew', 'Kongkiat Khomsiri', 'Ananda Everingham, Mario Maurer, Phakin Khamwilaisak, Sarika Sathsilpsupa, Bhumibhat Thavornsiri, Chidjun Hung, Krissada Sukosol Clapp, Arak Amornsupasiri', 'R', 'Sorcerer cop Khun Pan is persuaded to take on another dangerous mission. He is hunting down two bandits and uncovering a conspiracy that challenges everything, he believes in.', 'Sorcerer cop Khun Pan is persuaded to take on another dangerous mission. He is hunting down two bandits and uncovering a conspiracy that challenges everything, he believes in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5WrRrKkBhgyj0IOeFdklJ1SdwX2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:938553'),
  ('1096406464705331187', 'Khushi', 2001, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'S. J. Suryah, P. C. Sreeram', 'S. J. Suryah', 'Pawan Kalyan, Bhumika Chawla, Sudhakar, Sivaji Sontineni, Nassar, Janaki Sabesh, Vijayakumar, Sudha', null, 'College friends Siddhu and Madhumati part ways due to a misunderstanding. Although they are in love and realize they cannot live without each other, their egos prevent them from uniting.', 'College friends Siddhu and Madhumati part ways due to a misunderstanding. Although they are in love and realize they cannot live without each other, their egos prevent them from uniting.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jw8CV9vj095jk4sE4bOxt3cv0Gz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81070'),
  ('67949683664738484', 'Khushi', 2003, 'Romance, Drama, Action', 'S. J. Suryah, K. V. Guhan', 'S. J. Suryah', 'Fardeen Khan, Kareena Kapoor Khan, Johny Lever, Anup Soni, Amrish Puri, Sharat Saxena, Navin Nischol, Amitabh Bachchan', null, 'While playing matchmaker to a pair of their friends, two young university students begin developing feelings for each other.', 'While playing matchmaker to a pair of their friends, two young university students begin developing feelings for each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zqEnM5Ef8QXcbWrPZ311i2TLSUA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:345426'),
  ('941752247343932261', 'Ki & Ka', 2016, 'Comedy, Romance', 'R. Balki, P. C. Sreeram, Salman Zaidi', null, 'Kareena Kapoor Khan, Arjun Kapoor, Rajat Kapoor, Swaroop Sampat, Amitabh Bachchan, Jaya Bachchan, Neetha Mohindra, Gulnaaz Khan', null, 'An unconventional woman, gains immense success in her professional life but things take a turn when she meets a guy, who wants to be a house husband.', 'An unconventional woman, gains immense success in her professional life but things take a turn when she meets a guy, who wants to be a house husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h0EdMN91ts85jN62UotOOUXa5Ho.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:390437'),
  ('123060601604732875', 'Kiba: The Fangs of Fiction', 2021, 'Drama', 'Hiroshi Machida, Daihachi Yoshida, Seitaro Kai', 'Ichiro Kusuno, Daihachi Yoshida', 'Yo Oizumi, Mayu Matsuoka, Koichi Sato, Hio Miyazawa, Elaiza Ikeda, Takumi Saitoh, Tomoya Nakamura, Yoshiyuki Tsubokura', null, 'Hayami Teruya is a dedicated salaryman who does a workman like job as the chief editor for a magazine. He has personal charm, get along with both the publisher and subordinates and runs the ship well. Chatting with his direct boss he picks up a certain vibe. Did he misunderstand that the magazine is doomed and will be terminated? If so, he is not going down without a fight. He will fight to make it through and keep his, and the others'', jobs.', 'Hayami Teruya is a dedicated salaryman who does a workman like job as the chief editor for a magazine. He has personal charm, get along with both the publisher and subordinates and runs the ship well. Chatting with his direct boss he picks up a certain vibe. Did he misunderstand that the magazine is doomed and will be terminated? If so, he is not going down without a fight. He will fight to make it through and keep his, and the others'', jobs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gXU3EtNPpdqwymfX9QVQxzQQNHP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:744714'),
  ('254394382839089486', 'Kibakichi', 2004, 'Horror, Action, Fantasy', 'Tomoo Haraguchi, Shôji Ehara', 'Mugi Kamio', 'Ryuji Harada, Nozomi Ando, Kentarō Shimizu, Mubu Nakayama, Miki Tanaka, Masaki Kato, Koichi Kira, Hideki Osako', null, 'A werewolf samurai walks the countryside, finding himself in the middle of a village of monsters who feed on human flesh.', 'A werewolf samurai walks the countryside, finding himself in the middle of a village of monsters who feed on human flesh.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yQMpLDETcIyjs7gSsiX78rxn9Ld.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17173'),
  ('536521327811851601', 'Kichiku: Banquet of the Beasts', 1997, 'Crime, Drama, Horror', 'Kazuyoshi Kumakiri', 'Kazuyoshi Kumakiri', 'Sumiko Mikami, Shunsuke Sawada, Shigeru Bokuda, Toshiyuki Sugihara, Kiyoaki Hashimoto, Sanae Ishida, Yukio Yoshikawa, Yuji Hashimoto', null, 'While the leader is in jail, his leftist group is controlled by his girlfriend, but her leadership lacks conviction and perspective. When the leader commits suicide in prison, despair and confusion rule the group and revenge and violence erupts in graphic way.', 'While the leader is in jail, his leftist group is controlled by his girlfriend, but her leadership lacks conviction and perspective. When the leader commits suicide in prison, despair and confusion rule the group and revenge and violence erupts in graphic way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Ytv2XVXoqVzMXMRvCflisfsDs7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27326'),
  ('775937856090149627', 'Kick', 2009, 'Action, Comedy, Thriller', 'Rasool Ellore, Surender Reddy', 'Surender Reddy', 'Ravi Teja, Ileana D''Cruz, Shaam, Brahmanandam, Sayaji Shinde, Ali Basha, Venu Madhav, Kota Srinivasa Rao', null, 'Kalyan is a kind of guy who prefers a life full of thrills than leading a regular life style. He seeks kick in whatever he does. He finds liking in Naina. They separate due to differences. Krishna is a young cop who is in lookout for a big ticket thief who happens to be Kalyan. Meanwhile, Naina agrees for an engagement with Krishna. The rest of the story is all about how Kalyan wins back his lady love and the real intent behind the robberies of Kalyan.', 'Kalyan is a kind of guy who prefers a life full of thrills than leading a regular life style. He seeks kick in whatever he does. He finds liking in Naina. They separate due to differences. Krishna is a young cop who is in lookout for a big ticket thief who happens to be Kalyan. Meanwhile, Naina agrees for an engagement with Krishna. The rest of the story is all about how Kalyan wins back his lady love and the real intent behind the robberies of Kalyan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lei28oUtPXyzGjkf6YKaIlAscAV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60807'),
  ('219277135846799082', 'Kick', 2014, 'Action, Romance, Comedy, Crime', 'Sajid Nadiadwala, Ayananka Bose, Zahra Bootwalla', 'Rajat Arora, Sajid Nadiadwala, Keith Gomes', 'Salman Khan, Jacqueline Fernandez, Randeep Hooda, Nawazuddin Siddiqui, Mithun Chakraborty, Archana Puran Singh, Vipin Sharma, Saurabh Shukla', 'NR', 'An adrenaline junkie walks away from a whirlwind romance and embraces a new life as a thief, though he soon finds himself pursued by veteran police officer and engaged in a turf war with a local gangster.', 'An adrenaline junkie walks away from a whirlwind romance and embraces a new life as a thief, though he soon finds himself pursued by veteran police officer and engaged in a turf war with a local gangster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/muRGQIGFcHTyHimE2ru6RSjD8D6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:280690'),
  ('502043207779635894', 'Kick the Cock', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Tinto Brass, Andrea Doria', 'Angelita Franco', 'Tinto Brass, Angelita Franco', null, 'Kick the Cock is an old Dutch saying, meaning Peek in the Kitchen.', 'Kick the Cock is an old Dutch saying, meaning Peek in the Kitchen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cEL0Pf5CJritkxBOFEBejW3R4wE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:291860'),
  ('821038478267717132', 'Kick the Moon', 2001, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Chung Kwang-suk, Kim Sang-jin, Kim Dong-uk', 'Kang Woo-suk, Park Jung-woo', 'Lee Sung-jae, Cha Seung-won, Kim Hye-soo, Lee Jong-soo, Lee Won-jong, Sung Ji-ru, Jo Sang-geon, Yoo Hai-jin', null, 'Choi Ki-dong, who becomes a teacher, and Park Young-jun, who becomes a gang member, meet again after 10 years. To compete for Min Ju-ran, they start a fierce battle remembering their high school days, when the situation was completely different.', 'Choi Ki-dong, who becomes a teacher, and Park Young-jun, who becomes a gang member, meet again after 10 years. To compete for Min Ju-ran, they start a fierce battle remembering their high school days, when the situation was completely different.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7qOJ4oAYcxXPeo6zwj7cv1Kf61e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68529'),
  ('676255111186075890', 'Kick-Ass', 2010, 'Action, Crime', 'Tim Maurice-Jones, John King, Matthew Vaughn', 'Jane Goldman, Matthew Vaughn', 'Aaron Taylor-Johnson, Chloë Grace Moretz, Nicolas Cage, Lyndsy Fonseca, Mark Strong, Deborah Twiss, Christopher Mintz-Plasse, Elizabeth McGovern', 'R', 'Dave Lizewski is an unnoticed high school student and comic book fan who one day decides to become a super-hero, even though he has no powers, training or meaningful reason to do so.', 'Dave Lizewski is an unnoticed high school student and comic book fan who one day decides to become a super-hero, even though he has no powers, training or meaningful reason to do so.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iHMbrTHJwocsNvo5murCBw0CwTo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23483'),
  ('58791605056435394', 'Kick-Ass 2', 2013, 'Action, Adventure, Crime', 'Jeff Wadlow, Tim Maurice-Jones, Yari Azzopardi', 'Jeff Wadlow', 'Aaron Taylor-Johnson, Chloë Grace Moretz, Christopher Mintz-Plasse, Lyndsy Fonseca, Jim Carrey, Iain Glen, Clark Duke, Lindy Booth', 'R', 'After Kick-Ass’ insane bravery inspires a new wave of self-made masked crusaders, he joins a patrol led by the Colonel Stars and Stripes. When these amateur superheroes are hunted down by Red Mist — reborn as The Mother Fucker — only the blade-wielding Hit-Girl can prevent their annihilation.', 'After Kick-Ass’ insane bravery inspires a new wave of self-made masked crusaders, he joins a patrol led by the Colonel Stars and Stripes. When these amateur superheroes are hunted down by Red Mist — reborn as The Mother Fucker — only the blade-wielding Hit-Girl can prevent their annihilation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1go2A3gdQjaMuHWquybgoJlQRcX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59859'),
  ('1062859739831563386', 'Kick-Heart', 2013, 'Animation, Comedy, Romance', 'Masaaki Yuasa, Koji Tanaka', 'Masaaki Yuasa, Masaaki Yuasa', 'Tatsuhisa Suzuki, Takako Honda, Wataru Takagi, Yuhko Kaida, Miyuki Satou, Shinobu Matsumoto, Cocoro Kikuchi, Kyoko Chikiri', 'NR', 'Kick-Heart is a love story between Romeo, a successful pro-wrestler, and Juliet, a nun who lives a secret double-life as a female pro-wrestler. Romeo''s secret is that he enjoys taking a beating in the ring, while Juliet feels invigorated when facing her opponents as a wrestler. When the two meet in the ring, the fireworks fly. Their story is set in the colourful backdrop of the professional wrestling world. Will Juliet reveal her true identity to the one she loves? Will Romeo be able to share his secret to the world?', 'Kick-Heart is a love story between Romeo, a successful pro-wrestler, and Juliet, a nun who lives a secret double-life as a female pro-wrestler. Romeo''s secret is that he enjoys taking a beating in the ring, while Juliet feels invigorated when facing her opponents as a wrestler. When the two meet in the ring, the fireworks fly. Their story is set in the colourful backdrop of the professional wrestling world. Will Juliet reveal her true identity to the one she loves? Will Romeo be able to share his secret to the world?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ewXQsNeSE2BdM274LifeckTDvTQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:165718'),
  ('705844054234235476', 'Kickboxer', 1989, 'Action, Thriller, Drama', 'Jon Kranhouse, David Worth, Mark DiSalle', 'Glenn A. Bruce', 'Jean-Claude Van Damme, Dennis Alexio, Dennis Chan Kwok-San, Haskell V. Anderson III, Rochelle Ashana, Michel Qissi, Steve Lee Ka-Ting, Gam Biu', 'R', 'If your enemy refuses to be humbled... Destroy him. Accompanied by his brother Kurt, American kickboxing champion Eric Sloane, arrives in Thailand to defeat the Eastern warriors at their own sport. His opponent: ruthless fighter and Thai champion, Tong Po. Tong not only defeats Eric, he paralyzes him for life. Crazed with anger, Kurt vows revenge.', 'If your enemy refuses to be humbled... Destroy him. Accompanied by his brother Kurt, American kickboxing champion Eric Sloane, arrives in Thailand to defeat the Eastern warriors at their own sport. His opponent: ruthless fighter and Thai champion, Tong Po. Tong not only defeats Eric, he paralyzes him for life. Crazed with anger, Kurt vows revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/58ZbhxPT8UrUpxEZVvLtinXDB1a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10222'),
  ('844132371047089503', 'Kickboxer 2: The Road Back', 1991, 'Action, Adventure', 'Albert Pyun, George Mooradian, Robert M. Williams Jr.', 'David S. Goyer', 'Sasha Mitchell, Dennis Chan Kwok-San, Cary-Hiroyuki Tagawa, Michel Qissi, Matthias Hues, Vincent Klyn, Peter Boyle, John Diehl', 'PG-13', 'In this rousing sequel to Kickboxer, Tong Po broods about his defeat at the hands of Kurt Sloan. Po and his managers resort to drastic measures to goad Kurt''s brother into the ring for a rematch.', 'In this rousing sequel to Kickboxer, Tong Po broods about his defeat at the hands of Kurt Sloan. Po and his managers resort to drastic measures to goad Kurt''s brother into the ring for a rematch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pNvuLT77H9eSStoqmB7EMLdlffv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24993'),
  ('1095908522582434916', 'Kickboxer 3: The Art of War', 1992, 'Action, Thriller', 'Rick King, Vicente Amorim, Webster Whinery', 'Dennis A. Pratt', 'Sasha Mitchell, Dennis Chan Kwok-San, Richard Comar, Noah Verduzco, Alethéa Miranda, Ricardo Petraglia, Milton Gonçalves, Gracindo Júnior', 'R', 'Kick-box champion David Sloan arrives in Rio de Janeiro for an exhibition fight. He and mentor Xian take pity on Brazilian rascal Marcos Coasta, an urchin who offers guide services but routinely steals from tourists for himself and his older sister Isabella. David is shocked when he sees how his Argentinian opponent Marcelo needlessly abuses a courteous local sparing partner. That''s the doing of his evil US manager, Lane. He has nasty plans to force David to cheat and runs a white slavery racket.', 'Kick-box champion David Sloan arrives in Rio de Janeiro for an exhibition fight. He and mentor Xian take pity on Brazilian rascal Marcos Coasta, an urchin who offers guide services but routinely steals from tourists for himself and his older sister Isabella. David is shocked when he sees how his Argentinian opponent Marcelo needlessly abuses a courteous local sparing partner. That''s the doing of his evil US manager, Lane. He has nasty plans to force David to cheat and runs a white slavery racket.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eGVPTY8ifyogwFZu3WJ4MLLJgdE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39027'),
  ('556743094868823002', 'Kickboxer 4: The Aggressor', 1994, 'Action, Drama, Thriller, Romance', 'Albert Pyun, George Mooradian, Sazzy Lee Calhoun', 'David Yorkin, Albert Pyun', 'Sasha Mitchell, Kamel Krifa, Brad Thornton, Jill Pierce, Michele "Mouse" Krasnoo, Nicholas Guest, Burton Richardson, Thom Mathews', 'R', 'David Sloan must travel to Mexico to save his wife from a savage international terrorist.', 'David Sloan must travel to Mexico to save his wife from a savage international terrorist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9hA6SzsDkLTKxKOcfYVmRrq4Z0U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50346'),
  ('897868750076040443', 'Kickboxer: Retaliation', 2018, 'Action, Drama', 'Paracha Pavarolarvidya, Desho Bernard, Gerardo Madrazo', 'Dimitri Logothetis', 'Alain Moussi, Christopher Lambert, Jean-Claude Van Damme, Mike Tyson, Sara Malakul Lane, Hafþór Júlíus Björnsson, Sam Medina, Steven Swadling', null, 'One year after the events of "Kickboxer: Vengeance", Kurt Sloan has vowed never to return to Thailand. However, while gearing up for a MMA title shot, he finds himself sedated and forced back into Thailand, this time in prison. He is there because the ones responsible want him to face a 6''8" 400 lbs. beast named Mongkut and in return for the fight, Kurt will get two million dollars and his freedom back. Kurt at first refuses, in which a bounty is placed on his head as a way to force him to face Mongkut. Kurt soon learns he will have no other choice and will undergo his most rigorous training yet under some unexpected mentors in order to face Mongkut in hopes to regain his freedom.', 'One year after the events of "Kickboxer: Vengeance", Kurt Sloan has vowed never to return to Thailand. However, while gearing up for a MMA title shot, he finds himself sedated and forced back into Thailand, this time in prison. He is there because the ones responsible want him to face a 6''8" 400 lbs. beast named Mongkut and in return for the fight, Kurt will get two million dollars and his freedom back. Kurt at first refuses, in which a bounty is placed on his head as a way to force him to face Mongkut. Kurt soon learns he will have no other choice and will undergo his most rigorous training yet under some unexpected mentors in order to face Mongkut in hopes to regain his freedom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oMWP4cAoy8WBauuKZAVTIfuY3Fw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:447665'),
  ('73751073642294347', 'Kickboxer: Vengeance', 2016, 'Action, Drama', 'John Stockwell, Mateo Londoño', 'Dimitri Logothetis, Jim McGrath', 'Alain Moussi, Dave Bautista, Sara Malakul Lane, Jean-Claude Van Damme, Darren Shahlavi, Georges St-Pierre, Gina Carano, Phi Vu', 'NR', 'Eric and Kurt Sloane are the descendants of a well-known Venice, California-based family of martial artists. Kurt has always been in older brother, Eric''s shadow, as he lacks the instincts needed to become a champion. Against Kurt''s concerns, Eric accepts a paid offer and travels to Thailand to challenge the Muay Thai champion Tong Po and fails with dire consequences. Kurt sets out for revenge. He trains with his brother''s mentor, Master Durand, for a Muay Thai fight against the merciless champion, Tong Po. Durand first thinks Kurt is impossible to train, but through a series of spiritual exercises and tests, Durand discovers that Kurt has a deeper strength that will carry him through his final showdown with Tong Po.', 'Eric and Kurt Sloane are the descendants of a well-known Venice, California-based family of martial artists. Kurt has always been in older brother, Eric''s shadow, as he lacks the instincts needed to become a champion. Against Kurt''s concerns, Eric accepts a paid offer and travels to Thailand to challenge the Muay Thai champion Tong Po and fails with dire consequences. Kurt sets out for revenge. He trains with his brother''s mentor, Master Durand, for a Muay Thai fight against the merciless champion, Tong Po. Durand first thinks Kurt is impossible to train, but through a series of spiritual exercises and tests, Durand discovers that Kurt has a deeper strength that will carry him through his final showdown with Tong Po.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9suFyXDE1MhZ8I8tuhmTd0fJ7G8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:308529'),
  ('507913501329097117', 'Kickboxer''s Tears', 1992, 'Drama, Action', 'Sam Daat-Wai, Siu Tak-Foo, Lau Hung-Chuen', 'Sam Daat-Wai', 'Moon Lee Choi-Fung, Yukari Ôshima, Lung Fong, Ken Lo Wai-Kwong, Mark Cheng Ho-Nam, Wilson Lam Chun-Yin, Gabriel Wong Yat-Shan, Ricky Lau', null, 'A kickboxer is killed in the ring by a dirty opponent who works for a syndicate. The sister of the dead kickboxer vows revenge by facing off against both the dirty kickboxer and the crime syndicate.', 'A kickboxer is killed in the ring by a dirty opponent who works for a syndicate. The sister of the dead kickboxer vows revenge by facing off against both the dirty kickboxer and the crime syndicate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/piferxVtxydE83KqS6CveEJGnv3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45459'),
  ('581990908026465164', 'Kicked in the Head', 1997, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama, Romance', 'Howard Krupa, Matthew Harrison, John Thomas', 'Matthew Harrison, Kevin Corrigan', 'Kevin Corrigan, Linda Fiorentino, Michael Rapaport, Lili Taylor, James Woods, Burt Young, Olek Krupa, Elliot Cuker', null, 'When Redmond finds himself out of home and job, his life becomes a series of unpredictable escapades - from dodging gunfire after his uncle makes him deliver a highly suspicious package to pursuing a moody stewardess he thinks has come to save him. Soon Redmond begins to suspect his road of mishap might actually be the path to the truth he has been seeking all along.', 'When Redmond finds himself out of home and job, his life becomes a series of unpredictable escapades - from dodging gunfire after his uncle makes him deliver a highly suspicious package to pursuing a moody stewardess he thinks has come to save him. Soon Redmond begins to suspect his road of mishap might actually be the path to the truth he has been seeking all along.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jJVtdeWddiarPpWgSnEBXEJAsz4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56651'),
  ('790663638925408018', 'Kickin'' It Old Skool', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Harvey Glazer, Robert M. Stevens, Eric Banz', 'Dylan Morgan, Josh Siegal, Trace Slobotkin', 'Jamie Kennedy, Maria Menounos, Miguel A. Núñez Jr., Michael Rosenbaum, Christopher McDonald, Debra Jo Rupp, Bobby Lee, Aris Alvarado', 'PG-13', 'In 1986, a young breakdancer falls into a coma after hitting his head in a talent show. 20 years later, he awakens and attempts to revive his dance team''s short-lived career in order to support his parents'' failing yogurt shop.', 'In 1986, a young breakdancer falls into a coma after hitting his head in a talent show. 20 years later, he awakens and attempts to revive his dance team''s short-lived career in order to support his parents'' failing yogurt shop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yigEC20RnNqaXPeItmEO3RpdFdB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13280'),
  ('84192081053314379', 'Kicking & Screaming', 2005, 'Family, Comedy', 'Jesse Dylan, Lloyd Ahern II, Jody Spilkoman', 'Leo Benvenuti, Steve Rudnick', 'Will Ferrell, Robert Duvall, Mike Ditka, Kate Walsh, Musetta Vander, Dylan McLaughlin, Josh Hutcherson, Steven Anthony Lawrence', 'PG', 'Phil Weston has been unathletic his entire life. In college he failed at every sport that he tried out for. It looks like his 10-year old son, Sam, is following in his footsteps. But when Phil''s hyper-competitive dad benches Sam, Phil decides to transfer his son to a new team which needs a coach. Phil steps in to be the temporary coach and immediately begins to butt heads with his dad over this new competition in their lives.', 'Phil Weston has been unathletic his entire life. In college he failed at every sport that he tried out for. It looks like his 10-year old son, Sam, is following in his footsteps. But when Phil''s hyper-competitive dad benches Sam, Phil decides to transfer his son to a new team which needs a coach. Phil steps in to be the temporary coach and immediately begins to butt heads with his dad over this new competition in their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4erPZ5V0yzNXRB2IcypOACMEgOA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9981'),
  ('748979308183161309', 'Kicking and Screaming', 1995, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Noah Baumbach, Steven Bernstein', 'Noah Baumbach', 'Josh Hamilton, Olivia D''Abo, Chris Eigeman, Parker Posey, Jason Wiles, Cara Buono, Carlos Jacott, Elliott Gould', 'R', 'After college graduation, Grover''s girlfriend Jane tells him she''s moving to Prague to study writing. Grover declines to accompany her, deciding instead to move in with several friends, all of whom can''t quite work up the inertia to escape their university''s pull. Nobody wants to make any big decisions that would radically alter his life, yet none of them wants to end up like Chet, the professional student who tends bar and is in his tenth year of university studies.', 'After college graduation, Grover''s girlfriend Jane tells him she''s moving to Prague to study writing. Grover declines to accompany her, deciding instead to move in with several friends, all of whom can''t quite work up the inertia to escape their university''s pull. Nobody wants to make any big decisions that would radically alter his life, yet none of them wants to end up like Chet, the professional student who tends bar and is in his tenth year of university studies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ynAtSpTou7snNOq32djzILw9VCA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28387'),
  ('430919206215495346', 'Kicks', 2016, 'Drama, Crime, Action', 'Justin Tipping, Michael Ragen', 'Joshua Beirne-Golden, Justin Tipping', 'Jahking Guillory, Kofi Siriboe, Mahershala Ali, Christopher Meyer, C.J. Wallace, Molly Shaiken, Dyendis Davis-Jones, Kyndall Ferguson', 'R', 'When his hard-earned kicks get snatched by a local hood, fifteen-year old Brandon and his two best friends go on an ill-advised mission across the Bay Area to retrieve the stolen sneakers.', 'When his hard-earned kicks get snatched by a local hood, fifteen-year old Brandon and his two best friends go on an ill-advised mission across the Bay Area to retrieve the stolen sneakers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5lW7mFOQW5wPlCIT0gUuYbhNtVP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:385736'),
  ('41835997794007063', 'Kid', 1990, 'Thriller, Action', 'John Mark Robinson', 'Leslie Bohem', 'C. Thomas Howell, Sarah Trigger, Brian Austin Green, R. Lee Ermey, Dale Dye, Michael Bowen, Damon Martin, Lenore Kasdorf', null, 'A young man (the ''Kid'') returns to the small town where his parents were murdered when he was a boy. He''s there for revenge. Locals Kate and Louie befriend him, much to the annoyance of some of the town folk.', 'A young man (the ''Kid'') returns to the small town where his parents were murdered when he was a boy. He''s there for revenge. Locals Kate and Louie befriend him, much to the annoyance of some of the town folk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6FzmnnRnVovKTe2pZfSfrPtVVU2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121840'),
  ('853812302185897569', 'Kid', 2015, 'Drama', 'Pepe Schettino, Júlio Bressane, Fernanda Romero', 'Júlio Bressane', 'Marjorie Estiano, Gabriel Leone, Josie Antello', null, 'Inspired by Jorge Luis Borges’ The Disinterested Killer Bill Harrigan, Garoto follows a young couple who find themselves in an enchanted place where they experience an amorous and spiritual adventure.', 'Inspired by Jorge Luis Borges’ The Disinterested Killer Bill Harrigan, Garoto follows a young couple who find themselves in an enchanted place where they experience an amorous and spiritual adventure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tOPyy2eAqsPg45LoReXtC0ioCYX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:354431'),
  ('436487573270991039', 'kid 90', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Todd Hickey, Soleil Moon Frye', null, 'Soleil Moon Frye, David Arquette, Stephen Dorff, Balthazar Getty, Mark-Paul Gosselaar, Brian Austin Green, Tori Leonard, Heather McComb', 'PG-13', 'As a teenager in the ''90s, Soleil Moon Frye carried a video camera everywhere she went. She documented hundreds of hours of footage and then locked it away for over 20 years.', 'As a teenager in the ''90s, Soleil Moon Frye carried a video camera everywhere she went. She documented hundreds of hours of footage and then locked it away for over 20 years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5yK7ySo3E3w1JDjqq9WNk9oIwsw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:795859'),
  ('568816876503813340', 'Kid Blue', 1973, 'Comedy, Western', 'Anthony Ray, James Frawley, Billy Williams', 'Bud Shrake', 'Dennis Hopper, Warren Oates, Peter Boyle, Ben Johnson, Lee Purcell, Janice Rule, Ralph Waite, Clifton James', 'PG', 'Bickford Waner, an apparently naive young man from Fort Worth, arrives in the tiny Texas town of Dime Box and takes on a variety of menial jobs. He''s befriended by Reese Ford and his wife Molly, but before long Molly has seduced Bickford. Only with the arrival of Bickford''s former girlfriend Janet Conforto is it revealed that Bickford is actually the notorious train robber Kid Blue. Humiliated by a scandal arising from his affair with his friend''s wife, Bickford gives up on going straight and plots a crime.', 'Bickford Waner, an apparently naive young man from Fort Worth, arrives in the tiny Texas town of Dime Box and takes on a variety of menial jobs. He''s befriended by Reese Ford and his wife Molly, but before long Molly has seduced Bickford. Only with the arrival of Bickford''s former girlfriend Janet Conforto is it revealed that Bickford is actually the notorious train robber Kid Blue. Humiliated by a scandal arising from his affair with his friend''s wife, Bickford gives up on going straight and plots a crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fCrMlwSEEy05ZwLxlTdaAklwqA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:154073'),
  ('1087667331549299134', 'Kid Cannabis', 2014, 'Drama', 'Peter A. Holland, John Stockwell', 'John Stockwell', 'Jonathan Daniel Brown, Kenny Wormald, Ron Perlman, Aaron Yoo, John C. McGinley, Corey Large, Bryce Hodgson, Jeffrey Ballard', 'NR', 'An eighteen year old high school drop out and his twenty-seven year old friend start trafficking marijuana across the border of Canada in order to make money and their lives are changed forever.', 'An eighteen year old high school drop out and his twenty-seven year old friend start trafficking marijuana across the border of Canada in order to make money and their lives are changed forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xv9HaE9DCTkXTkwxILdnpjkR4eY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:212231'),
