  ('933060758392421020', 'Kid Galahad', 1962, 'Drama, Music', 'Phil Karlson, Jerome M. Siegel, Burnett Guffey', 'William Fay', 'Elvis Presley, Gig Young, Lola Albright, Joan Blackman, Charles Bronson, David Lewis, Robert Emhardt, Liam Redmond', 'NR', 'After completing his military service, Walter Gulick takes a job as a sparring partner at a gym, the owner of which sees potential in Walter as a professional fighter—and takes him under his wing.', 'After completing his military service, Walter Gulick takes a job as a sparring partner at a gym, the owner of which sees potential in Walter as a professional fighter—and takes him under his wing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9iyvjDZgbbMTgoAbsVk7B4GvTjR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18684'),
  ('951663495608557753', 'Kid Glove Killer', 1942, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Fred Zinnemann, Paul Vogel, Douglas Shearer', 'Allen Rivkin, John C. Higgins', 'Van Heflin, Marsha Hunt, Lee Bowman, Samuel S. Hinds, Cliff Clark, Eddie Quillan, John Litel, Cathy Lewis', 'NR', 'Van Heflin stars as the head of a city crime lab who tries to solve the murder of the town mayor by scientifically analyzing evidence.', 'Van Heflin stars as the head of a city crime lab who tries to solve the murder of the town mayor by scientifically analyzing evidence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6v6aw8NdFAKBw9Z4QWXzLdhzJhi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48987'),
  ('1150722472926229463', 'Kid Speed', 1924, 'Comedy, Action', 'Noel M. Smith, Larry Semon, Hans F. Koenekamp', 'Noel M. Smith, Larry Semon', 'Larry Semon, Dorothy Dwan, Oliver Hardy, Frank Alexander, Spencer Bell, William Hauber, James J. Jeffries, Grover Ligon', null, 'Avery DuPoys is a wealthy businessman, organising a race. He meets one of the competitors of the race, who is in love with DuPoys''s daughter. Another competitor crashes into the action, who is also in love with DuPoys''s daughter. DuPoys suggests that whoever wins the race will have the opportunity to visit his daughter every Wednesday night. An action-packed race commences, with one competitor doing more than usual to win the race.', 'Avery DuPoys is a wealthy businessman, organising a race. He meets one of the competitors of the race, who is in love with DuPoys''s daughter. Another competitor crashes into the action, who is also in love with DuPoys''s daughter. DuPoys suggests that whoever wins the race will have the opportunity to visit his daughter every Wednesday night. An action-packed race commences, with one competitor doing more than usual to win the race.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/19Nm3QR5cxDCXgIu7PPVitPuMYJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107290'),
  ('594135452423960335', 'Kid Vengeance', 1976, 'Western', 'Joseph Manduke, David Gurfinkel', 'Bud Robbins, James Telfer, Ken Globus', 'Lee Van Cleef, Jim Brown, Leif Garrett, Timothy Scott, Glynnis O''Connor, John Marley, David Loden, Dalia Penn', 'R', 'Tom, a teenager, teams with a black gunfighter named Isaac to avenge his family.', 'Tom, a teenager, teams with a black gunfighter named Isaac to avenge his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gFo96tYNFUvwTt5shEvqfA5GsUG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77632'),
  ('269983699271278708', 'Kid with the Golden Arm', 1979, 'Action, Drama', 'Chang Cheh, Chan Yau-Man, Chiang Sheng', 'Chang Cheh, Ni Kuang', 'Sun Chien, Phillip Kwok Chui, Lo Meng, Lu Feng, Johnny Wang Lung-Wei, Yang Hsiung, Chiang Sheng, Suen Shu-Pei', null, 'Jin bei tong opens with a group of escort guards preparing to move a shipment of gold from the local government to an area stricken by famine... one of the very few Venom films where all six Venom actors are present within a single film.', 'Jin bei tong opens with a group of escort guards preparing to move a shipment of gold from the local government to an area stricken by famine... one of the very few Venom films where all six Venom actors are present within a single film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aCAiIBRYcxsqAIxMG7J42ZZ6C37.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13513'),
  ('605971168041189236', 'Kid''s Story', 2003, 'Science Fiction, Animation', 'Shinichiro Watanabe, Shinji Hashimoto, Hiroshi Murakami', 'Shinichiro Watanabe, Lana Wachowski, Lilly Wachowski', 'Clayton Watson, Keanu Reeves, Carrie-Anne Moss, John DeMita, Kevin Michael Richardson, James Arnold Taylor', null, 'A high school student is haunted by thoughts of "The Matrix" and a person named "Neo".', 'A high school student is haunted by thoughts of "The Matrix" and a person named "Neo".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/SteXNwc3hRV9o2BlyxV3yBXCV2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24914'),
  ('580083667559615499', 'Kidco', 1984, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Ronald F. Maxwell, Paul Lohmann, Al Nicholson', 'Bennett Tramer', 'Scott Schwartz, Cinnamon Idles, Clifton James, Vincent Schiavelli, Tristine Skyler, Elizabeth Gorcey, Charles Hallahan, Margaret Blye', 'PG', 'A boy who lives at a country club where his father works decides to make some extra money by selling composted horse manure as fertilizer, and has his three sisters (two of which are older) join him in the enterprise. As their sales increase, they draw increased scrutiny from the IRS and state tax board, as well as the large scale competitor who seeks to put them out of business at any cost.', 'A boy who lives at a country club where his father works decides to make some extra money by selling composted horse manure as fertilizer, and has his three sisters (two of which are older) join him in the enterprise. As their sales increase, they draw increased scrutiny from the IRS and state tax board, as well as the large scale competitor who seeks to put them out of business at any cost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9RxRjuU5Op6vJvtgsoVFSuuA4pc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87909'),
  ('949019581617997763', 'Kiddin'' the Kitten', 1952, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Robert McKimson, Carl W. Stalling', null, 'Bea Benaderet, Mel Blanc, Sheldon Leonard', 'NR', 'A lazy and fat cat, named Dodsworth, is ordered by his mistress to catch mice that have invaded her home and are terrorizing her. Dodsworth doesn''t want to condescend to personal physical effort to catch the mice, so dons a professor''s hat and dupes a kitten into doing the job for him, on the pretext that he''s a teacher who is giving the kitten a valuable learning experience.', 'A lazy and fat cat, named Dodsworth, is ordered by his mistress to catch mice that have invaded her home and are terrorizing her. Dodsworth doesn''t want to condescend to personal physical effort to catch the mice, so dons a professor''s hat and dupes a kitten into doing the job for him, on the pretext that he''s a teacher who is giving the kitten a valuable learning experience.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tMg7bhSrTiGbVtE56QEwbv0fL24.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:159102'),
  ('14820904486120323', 'Kidnap', 2008, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Sanjay Gadhvi', 'Shibani Bathija', 'Imran Khan, Sanjay Dutt, Minissha Lamba, Vidya Malvade, Reema Lagoo, Rahul Dev, Raj Zutshi, Sophiya Chaudhary', null, 'A fortnight before her eighteenth birthday, Sonia goes missing. Her family receives a call informing them that she has been kidnapped and her estranged father, a US-based businessman, must now follow the kidnapper’s instructions to the letter if he is to entertain any hopes of seeing her alive again. Is this a mere kidnapping or is there more to it than what meets the eye?', 'A fortnight before her eighteenth birthday, Sonia goes missing. Her family receives a call informing them that she has been kidnapped and her estranged father, a US-based businessman, must now follow the kidnapper’s instructions to the letter if he is to entertain any hopes of seeing her alive again. Is this a mere kidnapping or is there more to it than what meets the eye?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ewELRO32JnBBDTcYRtyrVD2Uyw6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19669'),
  ('379232800510779533', 'Kidnap', 2017, 'Action, Thriller', 'Luis Prieto, Flavio Martínez Labiano, Michael Applebaum', 'Knate Gwaltney', 'Halle Berry, Sage Correa, Chris McGinn, Lew Temple, Jason George, Christopher Berry, Arron Shiver, Kurtis Bedford', 'R', 'A mother (in her Minivan) stops at nothing to recover her kidnapped son.', 'A mother (in her Minivan) stops at nothing to recover her kidnapped son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fwdOX3PEZlOLXr9SMpgRnSmTVFp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:293768'),
  ('338013386912909973', 'Kidnap Syndicate', 1975, 'Crime, Action', 'Fernando Di Leo, Angelo Vicari, Erico Menczer', 'Fernando Di Leo, Ernesto Gastaldi, Nicola Manzari', 'Luc Merenda, James Mason, Marino Masé, Irina Maleeva, Daniele Dublino, Vittorio Caprioli, Valentina Cortese, Marco Liofredi', null, 'After his son is kidnapped, a millionaire industrialist seeks revenge, in spite of the potential danger that his rash actions will bring about for his child and another kidnapped boy, the son of a poor mechanic.', 'After his son is kidnapped, a millionaire industrialist seeks revenge, in spite of the potential danger that his rash actions will bring about for his child and another kidnapped boy, the son of a poor mechanic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yP4wNPK7KIUyPNCpNtQ55sco00y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74379'),
  ('408521065954462173', 'Kidnapped', 1960, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Family', 'Robert Stevenson, Paul Beeson', 'Robert Stevenson', 'Peter Finch, James MacArthur, Bernard Lee, John Laurie, Niall MacGinnis, Finlay Currie, Miles Malleson, Duncan Macrae', null, 'Kidnapped and cheated out of his inheritance, young David Balfour falls in with a Jacobite adventurer, Alan Breck Stewart. Falsely accused of murder, they must flee across the Highlands, evading the redcoats.', 'Kidnapped and cheated out of his inheritance, young David Balfour falls in with a Jacobite adventurer, Alan Breck Stewart. Falsely accused of murder, they must flee across the Highlands, evading the redcoats.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5aMT9Mkkqx1q9JhDmAX5ydcSTrK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43037'),
  ('661416628033700722', 'Kidnapped', 1971, 'Adventure, History', 'Delbert Mann, Paul Beeson', 'Jack Pulman', 'Michael Caine, Lawrence Douglas, Vivien Heilbron, Trevor Howard, Jack Hawkins, Donald Pleasence, Gordon Jackson, Freddie Jones', null, 'Scottish orphan David Balfour is betrayed by his wicked uncle Ebeneezer, who arranges for David to be kidnapped and sold into slavery so that he cannot claim his inheritance. The boy is rescued and befriended by Alan Breck, a Scottish rebel fighting on behalf of his country''s independence from the British.', 'Scottish orphan David Balfour is betrayed by his wicked uncle Ebeneezer, who arranges for David to be kidnapped and sold into slavery so that he cannot claim his inheritance. The boy is rescued and befriended by Alan Breck, a Scottish rebel fighting on behalf of his country''s independence from the British.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kppWLRmQ1YuLNcBPsPwjpAAZOPS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32032'),
  ('836426746470587554', 'Kidnapped', 1995, 'Action, Adventure, TV Movie', 'Ivan Passer', null, 'Armand Assante, Patrick Malahide, Michael Kitchen, Brian Blessed, Brian McCardie, Des Braiden, Adam Blackwood, Antoine Byrne', null, 'When Scottish young gentleman David Balfour''s father dies, he leaves school to collect his inheritance from uncle Ebenezer, who in turn sells the boy as a future slave to a pirate ship. When staunch Stuart dynasty supporter Alan Breck Stewart accidentally boards the ship, he takes David along on his escape back to Edinburgh. They part and meet again repeatedly, mutually helpful against the Redcoats and respectful, although David is loyal to the English crown, but learns about its cruel oppression. Both ultimately face their adversaries.', 'When Scottish young gentleman David Balfour''s father dies, he leaves school to collect his inheritance from uncle Ebenezer, who in turn sells the boy as a future slave to a pirate ship. When staunch Stuart dynasty supporter Alan Breck Stewart accidentally boards the ship, he takes David along on his escape back to Edinburgh. They part and meet again repeatedly, mutually helpful against the Redcoats and respectful, although David is loyal to the English crown, but learns about its cruel oppression. Both ultimately face their adversaries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pegmnsYtN6wRxgDFGAFZ0KRHVWs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142150'),
  ('380756221731033145', 'Kidnapped', 2010, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Miguel Ángel Vivas, Pedro J. Márquez', 'Javier García, Miguel Ángel Vivas', 'Fernando Cayo, Ana Wagener, Manuela Vellés, Dritan Biba, Martijn Kuiper, Guillermo Barrientos, Xoel Yáñez, César Díaz Capilla', null, 'Three hooded Eastern-European criminals burst into a home in a Madrid gated community, holding the family hostage in its own home, and forcing the father to empty his credit cards. But the family fights back - brutally.', 'Three hooded Eastern-European criminals burst into a home in a Madrid gated community, holding the family hostage in its own home, and forcing the father to empty his credit cards. But the family fights back - brutally.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/26H9sh943M4ZYbyvTRfKdm7mzNr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48393'),
  ('400273791770380790', 'Kidnapped', 2021, 'Thriller, Drama, TV Movie', 'Vic Sarin, Simon Harding', 'Shanrah Wakefield', 'Claire van der Boom, Todd Lasance, Melina Vidler, Jason Wilder, Molly Wright, Lynn Gilmartin, James Hoare, Sophie Tilson', null, 'Savannah Duke-Morgan realizes her lifetime dream to bring her husband Brad and her five-year-old daughter Aria back to her birthplace on the Gold Coast of Australia until it turns into her worst nightmare when Aria goes missing from the resort’s Kidz Klub.', 'Savannah Duke-Morgan realizes her lifetime dream to bring her husband Brad and her five-year-old daughter Aria back to her birthplace on the Gold Coast of Australia until it turns into her worst nightmare when Aria goes missing from the resort’s Kidz Klub.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s9YfXjDp388djaEYPck7GAhwPUN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:782474'),
  ('847272943025808705', 'Kidnapped', 2023, 'Drama, History', 'Francesco Di Giacomo, Barbara Daniele, Marco Bellocchio', 'Edoardo Albinati, Daniela Ceselli', 'Enea Sala, Leonardo Maltese, Paolo Pierobon, Fausto Russo Alesi, Barbara Ronchi, Andrea Gherpelli, Samuele Teneggi, Corrado Invernizzi', null, 'The story of Edgardo Mortara, a young Jewish boy living in Bologna, Italy, who in 1858, after being secretly baptized, was forcibly taken from his family to be raised as a Christian. His parents’ struggle to free their son became part of a larger political battle that pitted the papacy against forces of democracy and Italian unification.', 'The story of Edgardo Mortara, a young Jewish boy living in Bologna, Italy, who in 1858, after being secretly baptized, was forcibly taken from his family to be raised as a Christian. His parents’ struggle to free their son became part of a larger political battle that pitted the papacy against forces of democracy and Italian unification.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p0tanDacNHQhXPdu583UG3KS7fM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:801112'),
  ('350077643183687793', 'Kidnapped: Elizabeth Smart', 2026, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Benedict Sanderson', null, 'Elizabeth Smart, Steevan Glover, John Stableforth, Brian David Mitchell, Wanda Barzee, Soledad O''Brien, Katie Couric', 'R', 'Elizabeth Smart''s harrowing abduction at 14 from her family''s Utah home unfolds through her own words and never-before-seen material in this documentary.', 'Elizabeth Smart''s harrowing abduction at 14 from her family''s Utah home unfolds through her own words and never-before-seen material in this documentary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8yuMPfz154d0PqX5PFXmgCCuTGd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1595481'),
  ('390452822008540635', 'Kidnapping Mr. Heineken', 2015, 'Drama, Action, Crime, Thriller, Mystery', 'Willem de Beukelaer, Ruud Ahsmann, Daniel Alfredson', 'William Brookfield', 'Anthony Hopkins, Jim Sturgess, Sam Worthington, Ryan Kwanten, Mark van Eeuwen, Thomas Cocquerel, Jemima West, David Dencik', 'R', 'The true story of the kidnapping of Freddy Heineken, the grandson of the founder of the Heineken brewery, and his driver. They were released after a ransom of 35 million Dutch guilders was paid.', 'The true story of the kidnapping of Freddy Heineken, the grandson of the founder of the Heineken brewery, and his driver. They were released after a ransom of 35 million Dutch guilders was paid.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6JAb9jQa4sONkutfqfR3I7LFpGd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:228968'),
