  ('1044839640668599801', 'Kikaider Reboot', 2014, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Ten Shimoyama, Gen Kobayashi', 'Kento Shimoyama', 'Jingi Irie, Aimi Satsukawa, Yuta Ikeda, Maryjun Takahashi, Shingo Tsurumi, Daisuke Ban, Minami Kajihara, Renji Ishibashi', 'NR', 'In the near future, the brilliant Dr. Komyoji is enlisted to lead the ARK Project—a scientific endeavor dedicated to forging a brighter tomorrow through robotics. However, the doctor’s mysterious death puts those plans to an abrupt hold... Not long after, the grieving Komyoji children wander into the crosshairs of a black ops squad on the hunt for their father’s research. But from within the cross fire emerges Jiro—a bleeding-edge android programmed to protect the siblings! Now on the run, the Komyojis soon discover their father’s once hopeful ambitions have taken a DARK turn...', 'In the near future, the brilliant Dr. Komyoji is enlisted to lead the ARK Project—a scientific endeavor dedicated to forging a brighter tomorrow through robotics. However, the doctor’s mysterious death puts those plans to an abrupt hold... Not long after, the grieving Komyoji children wander into the crosshairs of a black ops squad on the hunt for their father’s research. But from within the cross fire emerges Jiro—a bleeding-edge android programmed to protect the siblings! Now on the run, the Komyojis soon discover their father’s once hopeful ambitions have taken a DARK turn...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wGirjKumQOvnd49hZXbo7vV3FVW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:267046'),
