  ('839696243739444751', 'Kiki''s Delivery Service', 2014, 'Fantasy, Adventure, Comedy', 'Takashi Shimizu, Sohei Tanikawa, Tak Sakaguchi', 'Satoko Okudera, Takashi Shimizu', 'Fuka Koshiba, Ryohei Hirota, Machiko Ono, Hiroshi Yamamoto, Yoh Yoshida, Hirofumi Arai, Kotaro Shiga, Yousei Bun', null, 'A young girl named Kiki must leave her home for a year to begin training in witchcraft. She leaves on her broom, but first says goodbye to her friends and family. Kiki then begins her new life with her trusted cat Jiji.', 'A young girl named Kiki must leave her home for a year to begin training in witchcraft. She leaves on her broom, but first says goodbye to her friends and family. Kiki then begins her new life with her trusted cat Jiji.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4okVsLYuRH9DSzLAvg44DcckkiB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:252391'),
  ('375552772215940792', 'Kikoriki: Team Invincible', 2011, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Denis Chernov, Igor Yakovel', 'Alexey Lebedev', 'Vadim Bochanov, Anton Vinogradov, Svetlana Pismichenko, Kseniya Brzhezovskaya, Mikhail Khrustalev, Stanislav Kontsevich, Vladimir Postnikov, Mikhail Chernyak', null, 'But the lives of the Kikoriki are suddenly turned upside-down when they stumble on a strange device they had only heard about - a TV.', 'But the lives of the Kikoriki are suddenly turned upside-down when they stumble on a strange device they had only heard about - a TV.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xtqIX6CVic7KesVBs2YFjCfC5ul.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85315'),
  ('911186933263914791', 'Kikoriki. Deja Vu', 2018, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Denis Chernov', 'Denis Chernov, Dmitry Yakovenko', 'Pavel Derevyanko, Anton Vinogradov, Sergey Mardar, Mikhail Chernyak, Vladimir Postnikov, Svetlana Pismichenko, Mikhail Khrustalev, Vadim Bochanov', null, 'Krash decides to throw his best buddy Barry an unforgettable birthday party. He contacts the DejaVu Agency, which organizes exciting time travel adventures. A cataclysmic accident occurs after the Kikoriki crew fail to follow the rules and scatter the group across time. Krash has to find and retrieve his friends through the ages with the help of his alter ego from another time and place, who materializes out of the rupture in the space-time continuum. Just when you thought the Kikoriki adventures couldn''t get wilder, along comes this thrilling time travel adventure suitable for all ages across the globe.', 'Krash decides to throw his best buddy Barry an unforgettable birthday party. He contacts the DejaVu Agency, which organizes exciting time travel adventures. A cataclysmic accident occurs after the Kikoriki crew fail to follow the rules and scatter the group across time. Krash has to find and retrieve his friends through the ages with the help of his alter ego from another time and place, who materializes out of the rupture in the space-time continuum. Just when you thought the Kikoriki adventures couldn''t get wilder, along comes this thrilling time travel adventure suitable for all ages across the globe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wyJ9R71OgRKpNhaFbpMPJJDd45H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:506752'),
  ('367192390882751248', 'Kikoriki. Legend of the Golden Dragon', 2016, 'Animation, Family', 'Denis Chernov', 'Denis Chernov, Dmitry Yakovenko', 'Vadim Bochanov, Anton Vinogradov, Anton Vinogradov, Mikhail Chernyak, Sergey Mardar, Vladimir Postnikov, Garik Kharlamov, Dmitriy Nagiev', 'PG', 'The lovably simple residents of peaceful Kikoriki Island are thrown kicking and screaming into big adventure, when their resident scientist invents an amazing device - a helmet called "the Improverizor," which takes personality traits from one person and swaps them with traits of someone else. But when spineless young Wally tries to use the untested device to cure his cowardice, he ends up even more spineless - by getting accidentally body-switched with a squirmy little caterpillar. Now he has even more to fear than he could have ever imagined, and so do his fellow villagers, as they''re dragged into a madcap adventure packed with plane crashes, mistaken identities, erupting volcanoes and angry primitives on the warpath. Boy, do the Kikoriki Crew wish they could switch place now - with anyone.', 'The lovably simple residents of peaceful Kikoriki Island are thrown kicking and screaming into big adventure, when their resident scientist invents an amazing device - a helmet called "the Improverizor," which takes personality traits from one person and swaps them with traits of someone else. But when spineless young Wally tries to use the untested device to cure his cowardice, he ends up even more spineless - by getting accidentally body-switched with a squirmy little caterpillar. Now he has even more to fear than he could have ever imagined, and so do his fellow villagers, as they''re dragged into a madcap adventure packed with plane crashes, mistaken identities, erupting volcanoes and angry primitives on the warpath. Boy, do the Kikoriki Crew wish they could switch place now - with anyone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AwCzt2CX3OmWfwvWQImHJMSF5fQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:377883'),
  ('794161280071478196', 'Kikujiro', 1999, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Katsumi Yanagijima, Takeshi Kitano, Hiroshi Shimizu', 'Takeshi Kitano', 'Takeshi Kitano, Yusuke Sekiguchi, Kayoko Kishimoto, Yuko Daike, Kazuko Yoshiyuki, Beat Kiyoshi, The Great Gidayû, Rakkyo Ide', null, 'Brash, loudmouthed and opportunistic, Kikujiro is the unlikely companion for Masao who is determined to see the mother he has never met. The two begin a series of adventures which soon turns out to be a whimsical journey of laughter and tears with a wide array of surprises and unique characters along the way.', 'Brash, loudmouthed and opportunistic, Kikujiro is the unlikely companion for Masao who is determined to see the mother he has never met. The two begin a series of adventures which soon turns out to be a whimsical journey of laughter and tears with a wide array of surprises and unique characters along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zTelT1xAO4Owxk1jHJM4puoei5N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4291'),
  ('912177954368711112', 'Kill', 2024, 'Action, Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Nikhil Nagesh Bhat, Rafey Mehmood', 'Nikhil Nagesh Bhat', 'Lakshya Lalwani, Raghav Juyal, Tanya Maniktala, Ashish Vidhyarthi, Abhishek Chauhan, Harsh Chhaya, Adrija Sinha, Meenal Kapoor', 'R', 'When an army commando finds out his true love is engaged against her will, he boards a New Dehli-bound train in a daring quest to derail the arranged marriage. But when a gang of knife-wielding thieves begin to terrorize innocent passengers on his train, the commando takes them on, one by one.', 'When an army commando finds out his true love is engaged against her will, he boards a New Dehli-bound train in a daring quest to derail the arranged marriage. But when a gang of knife-wielding thieves begin to terrorize innocent passengers on his train, the commando takes them on, one by one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m2zXTuNPkywdYLyWlVyJZW2QOJH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1160018'),
  ('813014248777974475', 'Kill ''em All', 2017, 'Action, Crime', 'Peter Malota, Mark Rutledge, Derek Hall', 'Jesse Cilio, Brian Smolensky, Craig Stewart', 'Jean-Claude Van Damme, Autumn Reeser, Peter Stormare, María Conchita Alonso, Daniel Bernhardt, Kris Van Damme, Mila Kalađurđević, Peter Organ', 'R', 'After a massive shootout, a mysterious stranger arrives at a local hospital on the brink of death. Then, a foreign gang brazenly comes to the hospital to hunt him down. His nurse, the sole surviving witness to the follow-up shootout, must face an FBI interrogation that unlocks a plot of international intrigue and revenge.', 'After a massive shootout, a mysterious stranger arrives at a local hospital on the brink of death. Then, a foreign gang brazenly comes to the hospital to hunt him down. His nurse, the sole surviving witness to the follow-up shootout, must face an FBI interrogation that unlocks a plot of international intrigue and revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cWkZQqS2IxMcvH7UZSHFR8YYRfk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:449503'),
  ('841790350544198195', 'Kill ''em All 2', 2024, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Valeri Milev', 'Jim Agnew, Ferdinando Dell''Omo, Andrea Iervolino', 'Jean-Claude Van Damme, Jacqueline Fernandez, Andrei Lenart, Peter Stormare, Talia Asseraf, María Conchita Alonso, Antonino Iuorio, Dimitar Doychinov', 'R', 'Phillip and Suzanne are retired from the spy game, living peacefully off the grid. That''s until their whereabouts are discovered by Vlad, the vengeful brother of their target from the first film.', 'Phillip and Suzanne are retired from the spy game, living peacefully off the grid. That''s until their whereabouts are discovered by Vlad, the vengeful brother of their target from the first film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s5KZqIvyjwKpTRESCVrVGkT1JX3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1215162'),
  ('739076896412592673', 'Kill and Be Killed', 1962, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Manuel Mur Oti, Manuel Berenguer', 'Enrique Llovet, Luis Saslavsky', 'Olga Zubarry, Alberto de Mendoza, Luis Prendes, Katia Loritz, José Nieto, Luis Peña, Jesús Tordesillas, José Marco Davó', null, 'A former singer lives alone with her fortune - and with her nephew, Fernando, a low character to whom she refuses to lend more money. Elisa leaves prison and starts a new life as a personal attendant to the aging singer, using her knowledge as a former nurse - a profession she can not return to. Fernando meets Elisa, and together they plan to poison the lonely woman, and use her money abroad. They plan their alibis well. But those who kill by the sword will perish by the sword.', 'A former singer lives alone with her fortune - and with her nephew, Fernando, a low character to whom she refuses to lend more money. Elisa leaves prison and starts a new life as a personal attendant to the aging singer, using her knowledge as a former nurse - a profession she can not return to. Fernando meets Elisa, and together they plan to poison the lonely woman, and use her money abroad. They plan their alibis well. But those who kill by the sword will perish by the sword.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/404axMyQQFB5hXcjsD7ktwbLKVx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:409368'),
  ('964575162419750051', 'Kill and Kill Again', 1981, 'Action', 'Ivan Hall, Chris Gillian', 'John Crowther', 'James Ryan, Anneline Kriel, Michael Mayer, Marloe Scott Wilson, Bill Flynn, Ken Gampu, Stan Schmidt, Norman Robinson', 'PG', 'Dr. Horatio Kane has been kidnapped, and is being forced to create an army of martial artists who will help take over the world. His daughter, Kandy Kane, enlists the help of Steve Chase (and a few of his friends) to rescue her father before it''s too late.', 'Dr. Horatio Kane has been kidnapped, and is being forced to create an army of martial artists who will help take over the world. His daughter, Kandy Kane, enlists the help of Steve Chase (and a few of his friends) to rescue her father before it''s too late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5DGRTbz8k4nK4B6xjYEPTf5e8To.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79875'),
  ('1111844165546657068', 'Kill and Pray', 1967, 'Action, Western', 'Carlo Lizzani, Sandro Mancori, Giorgio Gentili', 'Lucio Battistrada, Adriano Bolzoni, Armando Crispino', 'Lou Castel, Mark Damon, Pier Paolo Pasolini, Barbara Frey, Rossana Martini, Mirella Maravidi, Franco Citti, Luisa Baratto', null, 'A Mexican community is slaughtered by Confederate troops; the lone survivor, a boy, is taken in by a preacher. Years later, the boy is now a soft-spoken, devout young man with perfect shooting skills (despite being a pacifist). On his journey to help his half-sister out of a complicated situation, he crosses paths with the men who killed his family, unbeknownst to him.', 'A Mexican community is slaughtered by Confederate troops; the lone survivor, a boy, is taken in by a preacher. Years later, the boy is now a soft-spoken, devout young man with perfect shooting skills (despite being a pacifist). On his journey to help his half-sister out of a complicated situation, he crosses paths with the men who killed his family, unbeknownst to him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e3rDgShdLUHs3d3Tf55OTcplDYQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:122787'),
  ('298004961780028440', 'Kill Bill: The Whole Bloody Affair', 2011, 'Action, Crime', 'Robert Richardson, Quentin Tarantino, William Paul Clark', 'Quentin Tarantino', 'Uma Thurman, Lucy Liu, Vivica A. Fox, Michael Madsen, Daryl Hannah, David Carradine, Julie Dreyfus, Chiaki Kuriyama', 'NR', 'Quentin Tarantino''s complete cut combining Kill Bill: Vol. 1 and Vol. 2 follows The Bride, a former assassin who awakens from a four-year coma after being shot by her mentor and lover, Bill. She embarks on a vengeful quest to eliminate Bill and the Deadly Viper Assassination Squad who betrayed her.', 'Quentin Tarantino''s complete cut combining Kill Bill: Vol. 1 and Vol. 2 follows The Bride, a former assassin who awakens from a four-year coma after being shot by her mentor and lover, Bill. She embarks on a vengeful quest to eliminate Bill and the Deadly Viper Assassination Squad who betrayed her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nSOJfWJCdVFZQwXQA7RXn7FIIiY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:414419'),
  ('839529278197516774', 'Kill Bill: Vol. 1', 2003, 'Action, Crime', 'Robert Richardson, Katsuhito Ishii, Satoko Saito', 'Quentin Tarantino', 'Uma Thurman, Lucy Liu, Vivica A. Fox, Daryl Hannah, David Carradine, Michael Madsen, Julie Dreyfus, Chiaki Kuriyama', 'R', 'An assassin is shot by her ruthless employer, Bill, and other members of their assassination circle – but she lives to plot her vengeance.', 'An assassin is shot by her ruthless employer, Bill, and other members of their assassination circle – but she lives to plot her vengeance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v7TaX8kXMXs5yFFGR41guUDNcnB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24'),
  ('657582344319015642', 'Kill Bill: Vol. 2', 2004, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Robert Richardson, Christopher Tandon, Dawn Massaro', 'Quentin Tarantino', 'Uma Thurman, David Carradine, Daryl Hannah, Michael Madsen, Gordon Liu Chia-Hui, Michael Parks, Perla Haney-Jardine, Vivica A. Fox', 'R', 'The Bride unwaveringly continues on her roaring rampage of revenge against the band of assassins who had tried to kill her and her unborn child. She visits each of her former associates one-by-one, checking off the victims on her Death List Five until there''s nothing left to do … but kill Bill.', 'The Bride unwaveringly continues on her roaring rampage of revenge against the band of assassins who had tried to kill her and her unborn child. She visits each of her former associates one-by-one, checking off the victims on her Death List Five until there''s nothing left to do … but kill Bill.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2yhg0mZQMhDyvUQ4rG1IZ4oIA8L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:393'),
  ('51099955621295100', 'Kill Boksoon', 2023, 'Action, Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Byun Sung-hyun, Cho Hyoung-rae, Lee Gil-gyu', 'Byun Sung-hyun', 'Jeon Do-yeon, Sul Kyung-gu, Kim Si-a, Esom, Koo Kyo-hwan, Kim Seung-o, Lee Yeon, Hwang Jung-min', 'R', 'At work, she''s a renowned assassin. At home, she''s a single mom to a teenage daughter. Killing? That''s easy. It''s parenting that''s the hard part.', 'At work, she''s a renowned assassin. At home, she''s a single mom to a teenage daughter. Killing? That''s easy. It''s parenting that''s the hard part.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/taYgn3RRpCGlTGdaGQvnSIOzXFy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:849869'),
  ('10246429612123055', 'Kill Buljo', 2007, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'Tommy Wirkola, Odd Helge Haugsnes, Matthew Weston', 'Tommy Wirkola, Stig Frode Henriksen', 'Stig Frode Henriksen, Tommy Wirkola, Natasha Angel Dahle, Linda Øverlie Nilsen, Martin Hykkerud, Ørjan Gamst, Jørn Tore Nilsen, John Even Pedersen', 'R', 'Jompa Tormann and his guests and family are brutally gunned down during an engagement party. Sami- and women-hating police officer Sid Wisløff is put on the case. Together with his colleague and a Sami guide, Wisløff tries to find the guilty party, but Tormann survived and he wants revenge!', 'Jompa Tormann and his guests and family are brutally gunned down during an engagement party. Sami- and women-hating police officer Sid Wisløff is put on the case. Together with his colleague and a Sami guide, Wisløff tries to find the guilty party, but Tormann survived and he wants revenge!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lHne3zKSBk96UVhBs0q9Wm2N0GL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17285'),
  ('94522395772410521', 'Kill Cavalry', 2021, 'War', 'Christopher Forbes, Russell Dobson', 'Christopher Forbes', 'Jerry Chesser, Brad Owens', null, 'U.S. General Hudson Kilpatrick is known to many as “Kill Cavalry,” not for the number of enemy troops he has killed, but his own, due to brash decisions that lead to heavy Federal casualties', 'U.S. General Hudson Kilpatrick is known to many as “Kill Cavalry,” not for the number of enemy troops he has killed, but his own, due to brash decisions that lead to heavy Federal casualties', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s2gSemOsLwp7PHThlDNNPTmvEhc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:792329'),
  ('33470132918191170', 'Kill Chain', 2020, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Ken Sanzel, Manuel Castañeda', 'Ken Sanzel', 'Nicolas Cage, Anabelle Acosta, Enrico Colantoni, Ryan Kwanten, Angie Cepeda, Eddie Martinez, Alimi Ballard, Jon Mack', 'R', 'A hotel room shootout between two assassins kicks off a long night where bodies fall like dominoes, as we follow a chain of crooked cops, gangsters, hitmen, a femme Fatale and an ex-mercenary through a relay of murder, betrayal, revenge and redemption.', 'A hotel room shootout between two assassins kicks off a long night where bodies fall like dominoes, as we follow a chain of crooked cops, gangsters, hitmen, a femme Fatale and an ex-mercenary through a relay of murder, betrayal, revenge and redemption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bFfUDQkCh6Zxgs4qyVgVTuS2PXN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:531299'),
  ('669833546856181778', 'Kill Command', 2016, 'Action, Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Steven Gomez, Simon Dennis', 'Steven Gomez', 'Vanessa Kirby, Thure Lindhardt, David Ajala, Tom McKay, Deborah Rosan, Bentley Kalu, Mike Noble, Osi Okerafor', null, 'Set in a near future, technology-reliant society that pits man against killing machines. Against this backdrop an elite army unit is helicoptered to a remote, off-the-grid island training facility. What starts out as a simple training exercise for Captain Bukes and his tight-knit unit, descends into a terrifying battle to the death, as the marines discover the island is overrun by an enemy that transcends the human concept of evil.', 'Set in a near future, technology-reliant society that pits man against killing machines. Against this backdrop an elite army unit is helicoptered to a remote, off-the-grid island training facility. What starts out as a simple training exercise for Captain Bukes and his tight-knit unit, descends into a terrifying battle to the death, as the marines discover the island is overrun by an enemy that transcends the human concept of evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xn6t1nYJaUMmudnHHiK390AORNu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:384798'),
  ('241601095245944002', 'Kill Crazy', 1990, 'Action', 'David Heavener, Bruce L. Finn', 'David Heavener', 'David Heavener, Rachelle Carson-Begley, Steve DeVorkin, Danielle Brisebois, Bruce Glover, James Emery, Lawrence Hilton-Jacobs, Burt Ward', 'R', 'Five Vietnam vets, on release from a mental hospital, think they''re headed for a weekend camping trip. Instead they become target practice for an army of killers playing violent war games. It''s a massacre until one of the vets becomes a machine of revenge.', 'Five Vietnam vets, on release from a mental hospital, think they''re headed for a weekend camping trip. Instead they become target practice for an army of killers playing violent war games. It''s a massacre until one of the vets becomes a machine of revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/coRnaZ9lNdcyNrE2snj2TBtJzWa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100219'),
  ('385056172918231415', 'Kill Cruise', 1990, 'Thriller', 'Peter Keglevic, Edward Kłosiński', 'Peter Keglevic', 'Jürgen Prochnow, Patsy Kensit, Elizabeth Hurley, Franz Buchrieser, Grażyna Szapołowska, Manuel Cauchi, Carmel S. Aquilina, John Suda', 'R', 'Two British beauties go to Barbados with a yacht captain who does not know what he''s in for.', 'Two British beauties go to Barbados with a yacht captain who does not know what he''s in for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3JeW4tHcLrrft8Fxtm45c8GjQyl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12638'),
  ('322010622777111559', 'Kill Daddy Good Night', 2009, 'Drama', 'Michael Glawogger, Attila Boa', 'Michael Glawogger', 'Helmut Köpping, Ulrich Tukur, Sabine Timoteo, Itzhak Finzi, Samuel Finzi, Franziska Weisz, Otto Tausig, Christian Tramitz', null, 'The story and fate of three families: A Jewish family destroyed by the massacres of the Nazis in Lithuania; the family of the culprit, who flew to America and keeps grotesque family cohesion; the family of Ratz, a social democratic family, dissolving itself miserably in today''s Vienna. The condemnation of the last century bundled in these three families showing clearly that one could never escape from its own past. Written by themoth-1', 'The story and fate of three families: A Jewish family destroyed by the massacres of the Nazis in Lithuania; the family of the culprit, who flew to America and keeps grotesque family cohesion; the family of Ratz, a social democratic family, dissolving itself miserably in today''s Vienna. The condemnation of the last century bundled in these three families showing clearly that one could never escape from its own past. Written by themoth-1', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1xcbjgfgx5G7QRZG4722Kw8Hq3A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61932'),
  ('203567075906530098', 'Kill Dil', 2014, 'Action, Drama, Romance', 'Avik Mukhopadhyay, Shaad Ali', 'Nitesh Tiwari, Shreyas Jain, Nikhil Mehrotra', 'Ranveer Singh, Ali Zafar, Govinda, Parineeti Chopra, Brijendra Kala, Alok Nath, Rocky Verma, Maanvi Gagroo', 'PG-13', 'Once upon a time in North India, two killers – Dev and Tutu - roamed free. Abandoned when young and vulnerable, Bhaiyaji gave them shelter and nurtured them to kill! All is normal in their lives until destiny throws free-spirited Disha into the mix. What follows is a game of defiance, deception and love.', 'Once upon a time in North India, two killers – Dev and Tutu - roamed free. Abandoned when young and vulnerable, Bhaiyaji gave them shelter and nurtured them to kill! All is normal in their lives until destiny throws free-spirited Disha into the mix. What follows is a game of defiance, deception and love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rs93Rh0oeJ4eYCpfn0GvkrtpSbQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:296690'),
  ('766954247951444082', 'Kill for Me', 2013, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Michael Greenspan, James Liston', 'Christopher Dodd, Michael Greenspan, Christian Forte', 'Katie Cassidy, Tracy Spiridakos, Donal Logue, Adam DiMarco, Shannon Chan-Kent, Torrance Coombs, Chelah Horsdal, Ryan Robbins', 'R', 'Rent’s a bitch. And that is why, six months after her best friend went missing, Amanda finally gives in to getting another roommate, Hailey. The two college students turn out to have something in common, however: abusive men. For Hailey, it’s her dad. For Amanda, it’s a stalkery ex-boyfriend. But problems can be solved and, you know, you scratch my back, I scratch yours. In other words, Kill for Me, I kill for you.', 'Rent’s a bitch. And that is why, six months after her best friend went missing, Amanda finally gives in to getting another roommate, Hailey. The two college students turn out to have something in common, however: abusive men. For Hailey, it’s her dad. For Amanda, it’s a stalkery ex-boyfriend. But problems can be solved and, you know, you scratch my back, I scratch yours. In other words, Kill for Me, I kill for you.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3qPF6czScVZQMbGoLkpBgjdAxET.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:167305'),
  ('299685786436683830', 'Kill Her Gently', 1957, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Walter J. Harvey, Charles Saunders, Douglas Hermes', 'Paul Erickson', 'Griffith Jones, Maureen Connell, Marc Lawrence, George Mikell, Shay Gorman, Marianne Brauns, Frank Hawkins, John Gayford', 'NR', 'A motorist picks up to escaped convicts. Instead of turning them over to the police he hires them to kill his wife.', 'A motorist picks up to escaped convicts. Instead of turning them over to the police he hires them to kill his wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q7CGjyVKfWqyWGVgHZ5h2C5uoG0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48280'),
  ('486019222106230626', 'Kill Her Goats', 2023, 'Horror', 'Steve Wolsh', 'Steve Wolsh', 'Arielle Raycene, Ellie Gonsalves, Kane Hodder, Danielle Mathers, Monica Sims, Amberleigh West, Colleen Hagerty, Skyler Seymour', 'NR', 'Audra''s graduation gift is her dream house, but it soon becomes a living nightmare when some uninvited guests come to her homecoming party who aren''t very subtle about the fact they don''t approve of the home''s new owner.', 'Audra''s graduation gift is her dream house, but it soon becomes a living nightmare when some uninvited guests come to her homecoming party who aren''t very subtle about the fact they don''t approve of the home''s new owner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mFzyMEQvKwf2rXxB1GsSocJfL11.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1073079'),
  ('385999211916902809', 'Kill Hitler! The Luck of the Devil', 2015, 'Documentary, History, War', 'Frédéric Tonolli', null, null, null, 'When Hitler committed suicide in his bunker in Berlin, he managed to do what many others had tried to do for 20 years. This film explores how the fate of Europe and countless lives may have been very different if it hadn''t been for the luck of the devil.', 'When Hitler committed suicide in his bunker in Berlin, he managed to do what many others had tried to do for 20 years. This film explores how the fate of Europe and countless lives may have been very different if it hadn''t been for the luck of the devil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qURYXkZdsI8Nn83TfauFGG9Qztr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:595822'),
  ('617267210197950713', 'Kill List', 2011, 'Horror, Thriller, Crime', 'Ben Wheatley, Laurie Rose, James Sharpe', 'Ben Wheatley, Amy Jump', 'Neil Maskell, MyAnna Buring, Harry Simpson, Michael Smiley, Struan Rodger, Emma Fryer, Esme Folley, Ben Crompton', 'NR', 'Nearly a year after a botched job, a hitman takes a new assignment with the promise of a big payoff for three killings. What starts off as an easy task soon unravels, sending the killer into the heart of darkness.', 'Nearly a year after a botched job, a hitman takes a new assignment with the promise of a big payoff for three killings. What starts off as an easy task soon unravels, sending the killer into the heart of darkness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qwT2I3ons0oD58jIppKmd4qLtvB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74725'),
  ('1141178050922274599', 'Kill Me', 2012, 'Drama', 'Emily Atef', 'Emily Atef, Esther Bernstorff', 'Maria Dragus, Roeland Wiesnekker, Anne Bennent, Robert Hunger-Bühler, Wolfram Koch, Christine Citti, Geno Lechner, Thiemo Schwarz', null, 'A teenage girl helps an escaped fugitive flee Germany into France, after extracting a promise that he will help her commit suicide.', 'A teenage girl helps an escaped fugitive flee Germany into France, after extracting a promise that he will help her commit suicide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x2M6jUfUWxvOEh0uK8bIn83AcuC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110182'),
  ('284506913189717246', 'Kill Me Again', 1989, 'Drama, Action, Thriller, Crime', 'John Dahl, Beth Jana Friedberg, Jacques Steyn', 'John Dahl, David W. Warfield', 'Val Kilmer, Joanne Whalley, Michael Madsen, Jon Gries, Michael Greene, Bibi Besch, Joseph Carberry, Pat Mulligan', 'R', 'After Faye and her psychotic boyfriend, Vince, successfully rob a mob courier, Faye decides to abscond with the loot. She heads to Reno, where she hires feckless private investigator Jack Andrews to help fake her death. He pulls the scheme off and sets up Faye with a new identity, only to have her skip out on him without paying. Jack follows her to Vegas and learns he''s not the only one after her. Vince has discovered that she''s still alive.', 'After Faye and her psychotic boyfriend, Vince, successfully rob a mob courier, Faye decides to abscond with the loot. She heads to Reno, where she hires feckless private investigator Jack Andrews to help fake her death. He pulls the scheme off and sets up Faye with a new identity, only to have her skip out on him without paying. Jack follows her to Vegas and learns he''s not the only one after her. Vince has discovered that she''s still alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vuYSteL8OqGLXhXfnnBVtxjxyuN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31583'),
  ('961285275666777848', 'Kill Me Again', 2025, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Keith Jardine, Juergen Heinemann', 'Keith Jardine', 'Brendan Fehr, Majandra Delfino, Raoul Max Trujillo, Keith Jardine, Tait Fletcher, Michelle Waterson-Gomez, Matthew Page, Donald Cerrone', null, 'Charlie, a notorious serial killer known as the Midnight Mangler finds himself trapped, reliving the same violent night over and over. Initially embracing his grisly urges, Charlie soon becomes desperate to escape the endless nightmare.', 'Charlie, a notorious serial killer known as the Midnight Mangler finds himself trapped, reliving the same violent night over and over. Initially embracing his grisly urges, Charlie soon becomes desperate to escape the endless nightmare.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tPUC1q4zfxxoAPvz9ssF5QQ0sYk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1514364'),
  ('936504804371630919', 'Kill Me Because I''m Dying!!!', 1951, 'Comedy', 'Ismael Rodríguez, Jack Draper', null, 'Germán Valdés, José René Ruiz, Óscar Pulido, Yolanda Montes ''Tongolele'', Marcelo Chávez, José René Ruiz, Emma Rodríguez, Tito Novaro', null, 'Tin Tan just won the lottery and wants to donate it to an orphanage. Sataela and Riverita want to keep the money for themselves. In an attenpt to do so, they convince him of having a terminal disease and suggest that committing suicide is his best option.', 'Tin Tan just won the lottery and wants to donate it to an orphanage. Sataela and Riverita want to keep the money for themselves. In an attenpt to do so, they convince him of having a terminal disease and suggest that committing suicide is his best option.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zhCROTRo82Ow0KbdtvvSvQEGyHS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101275'),
  ('258387756194190783', 'Kill Me If You Dare', 2019, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Serda Ceren Sagbas, Erhan Yetkin, Şenol Sönmez', 'Murat Dişli', 'Murat Boz, Seda Bakan, Açelya Topaloğlu, Özgür Emre Yıldırım, Seda Güven, Yosi Mizrahi, Dilşad Şimşek, Ali Yoğurtçuoğlu', null, 'Demet and Okan, a married couple, find that the spark in their relationship has disappeared. But life gives them another chance when Okan buys a lottery ticket and happens to win the lottery.', 'Demet and Okan, a married couple, find that the spark in their relationship has disappeared. But life gives them another chance when Okan buys a lottery ticket and happens to win the lottery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/huniiuLjJpdgMQ8Any22RJ67W57.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:585969'),
  ('383027703493324967', 'Kill Me If You Dare', 2024, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Filip Zylber, Paulina Budyta, Renata Kubiczek', 'Murat Dişli', 'Weronika Książkiewicz-Nathaniel, Mateusz Banasiuk, Agnieszka Więdłocha, Piotr Rogucki, Mikołaj Roznerski, Paulina Gałązka, Mirosław Baka, Dorota Pomykała', null, 'A winning lottery ticket has grave consequences for a married couple when they start hatching plans to kill each other for the prize money.', 'A winning lottery ticket has grave consequences for a married couple when they start hatching plans to kill each other for the prize money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wbfDIr5dKx4fri5by7NSIht0Y7M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1232943'),
  ('236896337268057461', 'Kill Me Later', 2001, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime, Romance', 'Dana Lustig, David M. Ferrara', 'Dana Lustig, Annette Goliti Gutierrez', 'Selma Blair, Max Beesley, O''Neal Compton, Lochlyn Munro, D.W. Moffett, Brendan Fehr, Tom Heaton, Alex Zahara', 'R', 'Her goldfish dead, her lover exposed as a rat, Shawn Holloway leaves her bank post and goes to the roof intent on suicide. Before she can leap, she''s taken hostage by Charlie Anders, a fleeing bank robber. He and his partners have stolen a million in cash and plan to escape to Venezuela. Shawn agrees to cooperate if Charlie promises to kill her once he''s in the clear. Parts of the plan go awry, so Charlie has time to try to pierce her bleak manner and self pity, and she has time for reflection. As night falls, their interlude ends: they''re each alone, Charlie facing prison as the police close in, and Shawn staring down at a river from atop a high bridge.', 'Her goldfish dead, her lover exposed as a rat, Shawn Holloway leaves her bank post and goes to the roof intent on suicide. Before she can leap, she''s taken hostage by Charlie Anders, a fleeing bank robber. He and his partners have stolen a million in cash and plan to escape to Venezuela. Shawn agrees to cooperate if Charlie promises to kill her once he''s in the clear. Parts of the plan go awry, so Charlie has time to try to pierce her bleak manner and self pity, and she has time for reflection. As night falls, their interlude ends: they''re each alone, Charlie facing prison as the police close in, and Shawn staring down at a river from atop a high bridge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2HaAtSaml6QLc6fs9H1BBM5nDMF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35176'),
  ('683875072680848380', 'Kill Me Please', 2010, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Olias Barco, Frédéric Noirhomme', 'Stéphane Malandrin, Virgile Bramly, Olias Barco', 'Aurélien Recoing, Virgile Bramly, Daniel Cohen, Virginie Efira, Bouli Lanners, Benoît Poelvoorde, Saul Rubinek, Zazie de Paris', null, 'Doctor Kruger dreams to insert “the suicide in modernity”. He offers to his patients the service of a private clinic where one can die in all peace, champagne glass to the hand. But in the private clinic of “ideal death”, nothing occurs as envisaged.', 'Doctor Kruger dreams to insert “the suicide in modernity”. He offers to his patients the service of a private clinic where one can die in all peace, champagne glass to the hand. But in the private clinic of “ideal death”, nothing occurs as envisaged.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2a2OBkgMtX9vQ5COuGhtD1H1xb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45585'),
  ('367969506937045952', 'Kill Me Please', 2015, 'Thriller, Drama, Horror', 'Anita Rocha da Silveira, João Atala', 'Anita Rocha da Silveira', 'Valentina Herszage, Dora Freind, Mari Oliveira, Julia Roliz, Rita Pauls, Laryssa Ayres, Vicente Conde, Gabriel Lara', null, 'Barra da Tijuca, West Side Zone of Rio de Janeiro. A wave of murderers plague the area. What starts off as a morbid curiosity for the local youth, slowly begins to spoil away at their lives. Among them is Bia, a 15-year-old girl. After an encounter with death, she will do anything to make sure she is alive.', 'Barra da Tijuca, West Side Zone of Rio de Janeiro. A wave of murderers plague the area. What starts off as a morbid curiosity for the local youth, slowly begins to spoil away at their lives. Among them is Bia, a 15-year-old girl. After an encounter with death, she will do anything to make sure she is alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ctcqurctSGPY5beTAujecZ0i92.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:359429'),
  ('1022109024782214976', 'Kill Me Tender', 2004, 'Drama, Comedy', 'David Omedes, Ramón de España', null, 'Ingrid Rubio, Alberto San Juan, Emilio Gutiérrez Caba, Manuel Manquiña, Chusa Barbero, Ágata Lys, Javivi, Bea Segura', null, 'Do all men want the same thing? Nestor, recently widowed, runs a bakery near Barcelona, has a bank account and a bad heart, and swims in the sea every day. He also has a daughter and a two-timing son-in-law. Nestor''s maid asks him to hire her 20-something daughter, Maribel, as a shop assistant.', 'Do all men want the same thing? Nestor, recently widowed, runs a bakery near Barcelona, has a bank account and a bad heart, and swims in the sea every day. He also has a daughter and a two-timing son-in-law. Nestor''s maid asks him to hire her 20-something daughter, Maribel, as a shop assistant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mJhmXtuO1FIlflwYQXR1gT4s9Xj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88810'),
  ('259694747769923367', 'Kill Me Three Times', 2015, 'Comedy, Thriller, Mystery', 'Kriv Stenders, Geoffrey Simpson, Jamie Crooks', 'James McFarland', 'Simon Pegg, Teresa Palmer, Sullivan Stapleton, Alice Braga, Luke Hemsworth, Callan Mulvey, Bryan Brown, Steve Le Marquand', 'R', 'While on a seemingly routine job, a jaded hit man discovers that he''s not the only one with his target in the crosshairs.', 'While on a seemingly routine job, a jaded hit man discovers that he''s not the only one with his target in the crosshairs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dfsDkaWN8jhoa4przuvP1S3woqm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:237756'),
  ('1051617886088360168', 'Kill Me, Cop', 1988, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Jacek Bromski, Jacek Mierosławski', 'Jacek Bromski', 'Bogusław Linda, Piotr Machalica, Anna Romantowska, Maria Pakulnis, Andrzej Grabarczyk, Zbigniew Zamachowski, Marek Barbasiewicz, Tomasz Lengren', null, 'The story is a duel between criminal-on- the-run and the cop who put him behind the bars the first time around.', 'The story is a duel between criminal-on- the-run and the cop who put him behind the bars the first time around.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6OLOMcIYh5komycAzfywjNKkSif.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36408'),
  ('216735674089435103', 'Kill Mobile', 2018, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Chan Chi-Ying, Yang Jiang, Zhao Nan', 'Paolo Costella, Filippo Bologna, Paolo Genovese', 'Tong Dawei, Ma Li, Huo Siyan, Qiao Shan, Tian Yu, Dai Lele, Allen, Morning Chang', null, 'Seven friends get together for dinner, and decided to play a game where they must share all messages and calls of their cell phones. Throughout the evening, wechat messages, phone calls and APP notifications are coming out continuously. Hilarity and drama ensue together as everyone''s secrets are unveiled and the seven friends find themselves more like strangers to each other.', 'Seven friends get together for dinner, and decided to play a game where they must share all messages and calls of their cell phones. Throughout the evening, wechat messages, phone calls and APP notifications are coming out continuously. Hilarity and drama ensue together as everyone''s secrets are unveiled and the seven friends find themselves more like strangers to each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/creo2bt3ouBC6lVefZ577TBmmok.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:571432'),
  ('275853818511165888', 'Kill Mode', 2020, 'Science Fiction, Action', 'Thijs Meuwese, Jasper Verkaart', 'Thijs Meuwese', 'Julia Batelaan, Dave Mantel, Cyriel Guds, Ted Neeley, Yasmin Blake, Manouk van der Meulen, Rein van Duivenboden, Wesley Mutsaars', null, 'It is the year 2027, eight years after the first outbreak of The Sickness, a highly contagious, adaptive and lethal virus. The world is now run by a pharmaceutical corporation called The Company, which distributes a treatment for the virus but charges a high price for it, putting the majority of people in a state of poverty and dependence.', 'It is the year 2027, eight years after the first outbreak of The Sickness, a highly contagious, adaptive and lethal virus. The world is now run by a pharmaceutical corporation called The Company, which distributes a treatment for the virus but charges a high price for it, putting the majority of people in a state of poverty and dependence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mGKdrPQDkDS8xsv0ogLasgQVyGs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:526120'),
  ('1056169979919267190', 'Kill or Be Killed', 1976, 'Action, Adventure, Drama', 'Ivan Hall', 'C.F. Beyers-Boshoff', 'James Ryan, Charlotte Michelle, Norman Coombes, Daniel DuPlessis, Raymond Ho-Tong, Ed Kannemeyer, Douglas Baggott, Stan Schmidt', 'PG', 'Two former ranking figures of the Axis powers (the evil General Von Rudloff and Japanese master Miyagi) schedule a deadly martial arts tournament in Von Rudloff''s desert castle. They race to assemble the top competitors from around the world, with the rebellious Steve Hunt being the most sought after.', 'Two former ranking figures of the Axis powers (the evil General Von Rudloff and Japanese master Miyagi) schedule a deadly martial arts tournament in Von Rudloff''s desert castle. They race to assemble the top competitors from around the world, with the rebellious Steve Hunt being the most sought after.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gNrwR35kiMYCgZ8YAaPzwU95rUI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97466'),
  ('872032513934981752', 'Kill Pinochet', 2020, 'Drama, History, Thriller', 'Daniel Matesanz, Pelayo Lira, Katherine Medel', 'Juan Ignacio Sabatini, Enrique Videla, Pablo Paredes', 'Daniela Ramírez, Cristián Carvajal, Juan Martín Gravina, Gastón Salgado, Julieta Zylberberg, Gabriel Cañas, Mario Horton, Alejandro Goic', null, 'Chile, September 1986. Tamara, commander of the communist guerrilla group Manuel Rodríguez Patriotic Front, and her comrades-in-arms set out to overthrow the military regime installed in 1973 by assassinating the dictator Augusto Pinochet.', 'Chile, September 1986. Tamara, commander of the communist guerrilla group Manuel Rodríguez Patriotic Front, and her comrades-in-arms set out to overthrow the military regime installed in 1973 by assassinating the dictator Augusto Pinochet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2AV91YhlW9KG2HpgdZsogecLjj8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:725905'),
  ('335021927362097141', 'Kill Plan', 2021, 'Thriller', 'Gregory Hatanaka, Gregory Hatanaka', 'Jamie Grefe', 'Jason Toler, Chris Spinelli, Benny Tjandra, Sarah Brine, Nicole D''Angelo, Craijece Lewis, Scott Butler', null, 'A weathered CIA agent is thrown into a web of deception when he uncovers a rogue government plot to unleash a deadly drug on humanity.', 'A weathered CIA agent is thrown into a web of deception when he uncovers a rogue government plot to unleash a deadly drug on humanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bxGucvOXiVK70uhMN9OkntvyGJY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:790786'),
  ('833967422995454637', 'Kill Shot', 2023, 'Action', 'Ari Novak', 'Rib Hillis, Ari Novak', 'Rachel Cook, Rib Hillis, Rob MacDonald, Mara Ohara, Mark Murphy, Xian Mikol, Kensley Allen, Todd Gordon', 'NR', 'Posing as hunters, a group of terrorists are in search of $100 million that was stolen and lost in a plane crash en route from Afghanistan.', 'Posing as hunters, a group of terrorists are in search of $100 million that was stolen and lost in a plane crash en route from Afghanistan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5kCEHZnUeAZFJvE3l8K5OYjIwjj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1134055'),
  ('689415460300303877', 'Kill Squad', 1982, 'Action', 'Patrick G. Donahue', 'Patrick G. Donahue', 'Jean Glaudé, Jeff Risk, Jerry Johnson, Francisco Ramírez, Bill Cambra, Gary Fung, Marc Sabin, Cameron Mitchell', 'R', 'A wealthy business man is a victim of an assault and is shot and wheelchair bound while his wife is gang raped and murdered. He then assembles his motley squad of Vietnam buddies to kung fu their way to revenge and get those muthas back.', 'A wealthy business man is a victim of an assault and is shot and wheelchair bound while his wife is gang raped and murdered. He then assembles his motley squad of Vietnam buddies to kung fu their way to revenge and get those muthas back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aOmTdfZTTIe774YfBxrT8XsSGqZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81472'),
