  ('625696294292797895', 'Kill Switch', 2017, 'Science Fiction, Action, Thriller', 'Tim Smit, Jacco van Ree', 'Charlie Kindinger, Omid Nooshin', 'Dan Stevens, Bérénice Marlohe, Charity Wakefield, Gijs Scholten van Aschat, Mike Reus, Tygo Gernandt, Mike Libanon, Bas Keijzer', 'R', 'A pilot battles to save his family and the planet after an experiment for unlimited energy goes wrong.', 'A pilot battles to save his family and the planet after an experiment for unlimited energy goes wrong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8K6pfMcT3hiIlCFw2RrHoXLshxl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:423988'),
  ('805566749709879702', 'Kill the Day', 1996, 'Drama', 'Lynne Ramsay, Alwin H. Küchler', 'Lynne Ramsay', 'James Ramsay, Drew Cain, Andrew Barton, Stevan Brennan, Michael Thompson, Jason McKenzie, Nikki Wright, Ian Hanmore', null, 'A desperate drug addict breaks into a locker and steals a bag for his next fix, a small crime that lands him behind bars. In prison, he’s a loner, baited by guards who want to see him snap and lose his shot at parole.', 'A desperate drug addict breaks into a locker and steals a bag for his next fix, a small crime that lands him behind bars. In prison, he’s a loner, baited by guards who want to see him snap and lose his shot at parole.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hfGKe70WfqMyH9MXIGfiHPHuBCh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49488'),
  ('372866267921506603', 'Kill the Irishman', 2011, 'Action, Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Karl Walter Lindenlaub, Jonathan Hensleigh, Phil Robinson', 'Jeremy Walters, Jonathan Hensleigh', 'Ray Stevenson, Vincent D''Onofrio, Val Kilmer, Christopher Walken, Linda Cardellini, Tony Darrow, Robert Davi, Fionnula Flanagan', 'R', 'Over the summer of 1976, thirty-six bombs detonate in the heart of Cleveland while a turf war raged between Irish mobster Danny Greene and the Italian mafia. Based on a true story, Kill the Irishman chronicles Greene''s heroic rise from a tough Cleveland neighborhood to become an enforcer in the local mob.', 'Over the summer of 1976, thirty-six bombs detonate in the heart of Cleveland while a turf war raged between Irish mobster Danny Greene and the Italian mafia. Based on a true story, Kill the Irishman chronicles Greene''s heroic rise from a tough Cleveland neighborhood to become an enforcer in the local mob.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yjDvqAMyFlesBtWNUUZMgglo78y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51209'),
  ('1056730980582297993', 'Kill the Jockey', 2024, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Timo Salminen, Luis Ortega, Guido Berenblum', 'Luis Ortega, Fabián Casas, Rodolfo Palacios', 'Nahuel Pérez Biscayart, Úrsula Corberó, Daniel Giménez Cacho, Mariana Di Girolamo, Daniel Fanego, Osmar Núñez, Roberto Carnaghi, Luis Ziembrowski', null, 'Remo''s self-destructive behavior overshadows his talent. Abril, an upcoming jockey, is pregnant with Remo''s baby and has to decide between the child or continuing to race. They both race for Sirena, a businessman who saved Remo''s life in the past but now is determined to find him, dead or alive.', 'Remo''s self-destructive behavior overshadows his talent. Abril, an upcoming jockey, is pregnant with Remo''s baby and has to decide between the child or continuing to race. They both race for Sirena, a businessman who saved Remo''s life in the past but now is determined to find him, dead or alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2CGm69ebTBnbqFZIT8cWSuRIb8S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1104937'),
  ('835332066488833271', 'Kill the Messenger', 2014, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery, Thriller, History', 'Michael Cuesta', 'Peter Landesman', 'Jeremy Renner, Mary Elizabeth Winstead, Michael Sheen, Ray Liotta, Robert Patrick, Andy Garcia, Paz Vega, Michael Kenneth Williams', 'R', 'A reporter becomes the target of a vicious smear campaign that drives him to the point of suicide after he exposes the CIA''s role in arming Contra rebels in Nicaragua and importing cocaine into California. Based on the true story of journalist Gary Webb.', 'A reporter becomes the target of a vicious smear campaign that drives him to the point of suicide after he exposes the CIA''s role in arming Contra rebels in Nicaragua and importing cocaine into California. Based on the true story of journalist Gary Webb.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8gaNZiKZHvKCqMDByY00dUIV0YC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:245916'),
  ('458056735325898700', 'Kill the Referee', 1984, 'Thriller, Drama, Comedy', 'Jean-Pierre Mocky, Edmond Richard', 'Jacques Dreux, Jean-Pierre Mocky', 'Michel Serrault, Carole Laure, Eddy Mitchell, Laurent Malet, Claude Brosset, Jean-Pierre Mocky, Géraldine Danon, Nathalie Dauchez', null, 'Michel, a referee has to suffer the consequences of having whistled a penalty against a team which is supported by football hooligans.', 'Michel, a referee has to suffer the consequences of having whistled a penalty against a team which is supported by football hooligans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6lop2rOifoPQ9XZeSe5fTUbzEpP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74401'),
  ('200112394630516923', 'Kill the Wicked!', 1967, 'Western', 'Tanio Boccia, Giuseppe Aquari', 'Mino Roli', 'Larry Ward, María Silva, Rod Dana, Massimo Righi, Furio Meniconi, Daniela Igliozzi, Vivi Gioi, José Bastida', null, 'A robber decides to hide his loot in a ghost town, helped by his girlfriend and his one remaining man. Keeping it though may be a problem, with the lone inhabitant, an old lady, a mysterious stranger, a recent widow and a former gang member all more or less plotting against the bandits.', 'A robber decides to hide his loot in a ghost town, helped by his girlfriend and his one remaining man. Keeping it though may be a problem, with the lone inhabitant, an old lady, a mysterious stranger, a recent widow and a former gang member all more or less plotting against the bandits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eCVJWCKNOYXGxmFu2myTI31zZvx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:159276'),
  ('999954370641308614', 'Kill Them All and Come Back Alone', 1968, 'Western, War, Action', 'Enzo G. Castellari, Alejandro Ulloa, Carlo Moscovini', 'Joaquín Romero Hernández', 'Chuck Connors, Frank Wolff, Franco Citti, Leo Anchóriz, Giovanni Cianfriglia, Alberto Dell''Acqua, Hércules Cortés, Emilio Cigoli', 'R', 'During the American Civil War, a Confederate prisoner, Clyde McKay, attempts to steal a box of gold from a Union prison camp. He is aided by a group of prisoners and a prison guard but he is double-crossed along the way.', 'During the American Civil War, a Confederate prisoner, Clyde McKay, attempts to steal a box of gold from a Union prison camp. He is aided by a group of prisoners and a prison guard but he is double-crossed along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kQzzmAyWanSdsErGMYjxa3IwA8z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130322'),
  ('183507984147740035', 'Kill Theory', 2009, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Chris Moore, David A. Armstrong', 'Kelly C. Palmer', 'Don McManus, Ryanne Duzich, Teddy Dunn, Daniel Franzese, Agnes Bruckner, Patrick John Flueger, Steffi Wickens, Theo Rossi', null, 'While celebrating a graduation at a secluded vacation home, a group of college students find themselves targeted by a sadistic killer who forces them to play a deadly game of killing one another in order to survive.', 'While celebrating a graduation at a secluded vacation home, a group of college students find themselves targeted by a sadistic killer who forces them to play a deadly game of killing one another in order to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pMKJS9yP1eh5DMC1ndwXgsomtqa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19237'),
  ('38199731993114992', 'Kill Tony: Once Upon a Time in Texas', 2026, 'Comedy', 'Anthony Giordano', null, 'Tony Hinchcliffe, Brian Redban, Gabriel Iglesias, Harland Williams, Carrot Top', 'R', 'One minute. One mic. No mercy. Tony Hinchcliffe and a panel of famous guests put up-and-coming comedians to the test at a relentless Austin.', 'One minute. One mic. No mercy. Tony Hinchcliffe and a panel of famous guests put up-and-coming comedians to the test at a relentless Austin.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FkepiMVDrjSvNM9afWewWxlWXXK6.jpg', 'plex:movie:kill-tony-once-upon-a-time-in-texas'),
