  ('145182253606272350', 'Killed the Family and Went to the Movies', 1969, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Júlio Bressane, Thiago Veloso, Guará Rodrigues', 'Júlio Bressane', 'Márcia Rodrigues, Renata Sorrah, Antero de Oliveira, Vanda Lacerda, Paulo Padilha, Rodolfo Arena, Maria Rodrigues, Carlos Eduardo Dolabella', null, 'A man living with his parents in a low middle-class apartment in Rio de Janeiro coldly stabs them with a razor and then goes to the movies. Marcia, a rich and dissatisfied young woman, takes advantage of a trip from her husband to go to her home in Petrópolis, where she receives a visit from an old friend, Regina.', 'A man living with his parents in a low middle-class apartment in Rio de Janeiro coldly stabs them with a razor and then goes to the movies. Marcia, a rich and dissatisfied young woman, takes advantage of a trip from her husband to go to her home in Petrópolis, where she receives a visit from an old friend, Regina.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rjRQ2v3UDAyWbvYAxAQiEtn0D7E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:175125'),
