  ('498399600483324739', 'Killer Meteors', 1976, 'Action, Thriller', 'Lo Wei, Chris Chen Ching-Chu, Chan Chung-Yuen', 'Gu Long', 'Jimmy Wang Yu, Jackie Chan, Yu Ling-Lung, Lily Lan, Tung Lin, Ma Chi, Lee Si-Si, Chen Hui-Lou', null, 'Mi Wey is a local hero named after "Killer Meteors", his secret weapon which makes him invincible. However, when "Immortal" Wa Wu Bin, another powerful local character seeks his assistance, Killer Meteor will face the greatest and the deadliest challenge of his life.', 'Mi Wey is a local hero named after "Killer Meteors", his secret weapon which makes him invincible. However, when "Immortal" Wa Wu Bin, another powerful local character seeks his assistance, Killer Meteor will face the greatest and the deadliest challenge of his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n4YPTn7rg4wyAuAOglkBgJAmJA1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46111'),
  ('953174721908951557', 'Killer Mirindas', 1992, 'Comedy, Thriller', 'Álex de la Iglesia, Kiko de la Rica', 'Jorge Guerricaechevarría, Álex de la Iglesia', 'Álex Angulo, Saturnino García, José Antonio Álvarez, Ramón Barea, Óscar Grijalba', null, 'A man with a suspicious attitude enters a bar where only a bartender and another customer are present and orders an orange soda, a Mirinda, very cold; but later refuses to pay by offering a surprising argument.', 'A man with a suspicious attitude enters a bar where only a bartender and another customer are present and orders an orange soda, a Mirinda, very cold; but later refuses to pay by offering a surprising argument.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h5d7LNOfVc4mFFqj9bJfZBNgFru.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83374'),
  ('978122378271969749', 'Killer Mosquitos', 2018, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Armando De Vincentis, Riccardo Paoletti', 'Andrea Garello', 'Alessio Lapice, Cristina Marino, Salvatore Langella, Filippo Tirabassi, Maria Chiara Giannetta, Federico Tolardo, Giulio Greco, Lana Vlady', null, 'A group of friends, spending the weekend in a house in the isolated countryside, are attacked by a swarm of killer horseflies that feed on human flesh like piranhas. The group soon discovers that the only deterrent that can keep the insects away is THC, the main ingredient that makes up cannabis. Their only hope of survival is therefore given by the consumption of grass, with all the consequences that entails.', 'A group of friends, spending the weekend in a house in the isolated countryside, are attacked by a swarm of killer horseflies that feed on human flesh like piranhas. The group soon discovers that the only deterrent that can keep the insects away is THC, the main ingredient that makes up cannabis. Their only hope of survival is therefore given by the consumption of grass, with all the consequences that entails.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zVeD5HjdDIi7GcLjFuYx19hwX6d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:534023'),
  ('366588424666139762', 'Killer Mountain', 2011, 'Adventure, TV Movie, Horror', 'Sheldon Wilson, Neil Cervin', 'Peter Sullivan', 'Emmanuelle Vaugier, Aaron Douglas, Paul Campbell, Yan-Kay Crystal Lowe, Curtis Caravaggio, Torrance Coombs, Byron Lawson', null, 'A team of climbers is assembled by a rich and eccentric man to rescue a missing expedition he sent up to a forbidden mountain who disappeared after sending out one last disturbing radio message.', 'A team of climbers is assembled by a rich and eccentric man to rescue a missing expedition he sent up to a forbidden mountain who disappeared after sending out one last disturbing radio message.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8mSprWxYCAugD1cyK2NCqmLiikp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74539'),
  ('531286507763047234', 'Killer Movie', 2008, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Jeff Fisher, Dino Parks', 'Jeff Fisher', 'Paul Wesley, Kaley Cuoco, Gloria Votsis, Torrey DeVitto, Jason London, Cyia Batten, Adriana DeMeo, Al Santos', null, 'A reality TV director copes with a spoiled celebutante and a show gone haywire when a masked killer starts bumping off the crew in this slasher-movie satire.', 'A reality TV director copes with a spoiled celebutante and a show gone haywire when a masked killer starts bumping off the crew in this slasher-movie satire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fhZNX8SCvtrrTfh8NV5EgtZC9d0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14862'),
  ('88597900527531907', 'Killer Nerd', 1991, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Mark Steven Bosko, Wayne A. Harold', 'Mark Steven Bosko, Wayne A. Harold', 'Toby Radloff, Lori Scarlett, Tony Zanoni, Heidi Lohr, Richard Zaynor, Kim Allen, Shawna Baer, Teresa Bosko', null, 'A nerd is harassed by punks, and is the object of ridicule at work. Enamoured by a co-worker, he buys a tape series on how to be cool, summons up his nerve, and goes to the co-worker''s house, only to find her in the clutches of another co-worker. Dejected, he goes out on the town and parties with some babes, but when their friends, who turn out to be the same punks that harassed him earlier, trash him again something snaps, and the irritants in his life begin experiencing an attrition problem.', 'A nerd is harassed by punks, and is the object of ridicule at work. Enamoured by a co-worker, he buys a tape series on how to be cool, summons up his nerve, and goes to the co-worker''s house, only to find her in the clutches of another co-worker. Dejected, he goes out on the town and parties with some babes, but when their friends, who turn out to be the same punks that harassed him earlier, trash him again something snaps, and the irritants in his life begin experiencing an attrition problem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rt3xKGrQNepEQU0plHgdVsC8EhN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41790'),
  ('176347713487520807', 'Killer Nun', 1979, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Giulio Berruti, Antonio Maccoppi, Alberto Vari', 'Alberto Tarallo, Giulio Berruti', 'Anita Ekberg, Joe Dallesandro, Alida Valli, Massimo Serato, Daniele Dublino, Paola Morra, Lou Castel, Laura Nucci', null, 'A demented nun sliding through morphine addiction into madness, while presiding over a regime of lesbianism, torture and death. Sister Gertrude is the head nurse/nun in a general hospital, whose increasingly psychotic behavior endangers the staff and patients around her.', 'A demented nun sliding through morphine addiction into madness, while presiding over a regime of lesbianism, torture and death. Sister Gertrude is the head nurse/nun in a general hospital, whose increasingly psychotic behavior endangers the staff and patients around her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eAFJOwTZWU13kC1q3o8vQah2MWH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42211'),
  ('153881173149749043', 'Killer of Men', 2022, 'Thriller', 'Tzvi, Erica Gliksman, Adam Holoubek', 'Tzvi', 'Jon Peterson, Stacie Brown, Paquito G Myers, Noah Forrest, Amit Patel', null, 'A man lurks the night alleys, killing people at random, he feels nothing, no emotion, and no pain; when he meets a graceful widow he must confront what it means to be human.', 'A man lurks the night alleys, killing people at random, he feels nothing, no emotion, and no pain; when he meets a graceful widow he must confront what it means to be human.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wtZiIzJsjGM1wKnQ8x5UgP7eM7N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:879502'),
  ('177278611952116670', 'Killer of Sheep', 1978, 'Drama', 'Charles Burnett, Charles Burnett', 'Charles Burnett', 'Henry G. Sanders, Kaycee Moore, Charles Bracy, Angela Burnett, Eugene Cherry, Jack Drummond', null, 'An African-American man working at a slaughterhouse in the Watts area of Los Angeles leads a dissatisfied and listless existence.', 'An African-American man working at a slaughterhouse in the Watts area of Los Angeles leads a dissatisfied and listless existence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z1CqJKI6gmdAMprD1NOYSCHVXEv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27432'),
  ('955452167128905193', 'Killer Pad', 2008, 'Comedy, Horror', 'David Stump, Robert Englund', 'Dan Stoller', 'Daniel Franzese, Eric Jungmann, Emily Baldoni, Shane McRae, Noureen DeWulf, Héctor Jiménez, Jennifer Lyons, Andy Milonakis', 'R', 'Three naïve guys, in their 20s, drive from Illinois to LA. A sleazy real-estate agent gives them a great deal on a house in the Hollywood Hills. The night they arrive, a solitary Mexican, who speaks only Spanish, tries to warn them that the place is possessed by Satan. They don''t understand him, move in, and plan a party after they meet Lucy, their gorgeous neighbor from down the hill. An old friend of theirs, studying to be a priest, joins them. In the basement is a portal to Hell, so at the party, guests meet their end in various ways. Lucy and her friends may not be who the lads think. Is there any hope for these innocents? Maybe their neutered dog can help.', 'Three naïve guys, in their 20s, drive from Illinois to LA. A sleazy real-estate agent gives them a great deal on a house in the Hollywood Hills. The night they arrive, a solitary Mexican, who speaks only Spanish, tries to warn them that the place is possessed by Satan. They don''t understand him, move in, and plan a party after they meet Lucy, their gorgeous neighbor from down the hill. An old friend of theirs, studying to be a priest, joins them. In the basement is a portal to Hell, so at the party, guests meet their end in various ways. Lucy and her friends may not be who the lads think. Is there any hope for these innocents? Maybe their neutered dog can help.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oOZOKZYD51wD2gjvd9lGXliE5WB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58096'),
  ('825730173156363988', 'Killer Party', 1986, 'Comedy, Horror', 'William Fruet, John Lindley', 'Barney Cohen', 'Joanna Johnson, Elaine Wilkes, Sherry Willis-Burch, Martin Hewitt, Ralph Seymour, Paul Bartel, Alicia Fleer, Woody Brown', 'R', 'It''s April Fool''s Day and the sisters of Sigma Alpha Pi believe they''ve found the perfect place to throw a party: the abandoned fraternity house where the guillotined pledge once lost his head in a hazing gone awry.', 'It''s April Fool''s Day and the sisters of Sigma Alpha Pi believe they''ve found the perfect place to throw a party: the abandoned fraternity house where the guillotined pledge once lost his head in a hazing gone awry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ym1KgAPOfmVYSh31mzK56jytqfT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74225'),
  ('619422031135957707', 'Killer Sofa', 2019, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Bernie Rao, Bernie Rao, Bernie Rao', 'Bernie Rao', 'Piimio Mei, Nathalie Morris, Jim Baltaxe, Jed Brophy, Stacey King, Angelica Thomas, James Cain, Jordan Rivers', null, 'Francesca has always attracted weirdos. When one of her stalkers is found dead, she looks for comfort from her best friend, Maxi. Meanwhile, Maxi’s grandfather, Jack, a disgraced Rabbi, comes across a reclining chair containing a Dybbuk inside. Jack and his voodoo sorceress partner try to find out where the recliner has been delivered while exploring Jack’s newfound gift for communicating with the other world. Meanwhile, the reclining chair becomes obsessed with Francesca and begins to commit crimes of passion.', 'Francesca has always attracted weirdos. When one of her stalkers is found dead, she looks for comfort from her best friend, Maxi. Meanwhile, Maxi’s grandfather, Jack, a disgraced Rabbi, comes across a reclining chair containing a Dybbuk inside. Jack and his voodoo sorceress partner try to find out where the recliner has been delivered while exploring Jack’s newfound gift for communicating with the other world. Meanwhile, the reclining chair becomes obsessed with Francesca and begins to commit crimes of passion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zRA71SDccp0VJicyeOdC070LSxA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:628446'),
  ('256795795027584752', 'Killer Tattoo', 2001, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Yuthlert Sippapak, Sutuch Intranupakorn, Peeraphon Thiancharoen', 'Yuthlert Sippapak', 'Suthep Pongam, Sornsutha Klunmalee, Petchtai Wongkamlao, Pongsak Pongsuwan, Somchai Kemklad, Pailin Pichitumphol, Krung Srivilai, Jaran Petcharoen', null, 'Set in a future Bangkok, the story picks-up after a hit-gone-wrong on Iron Cop, the area police chief. The would-be killer Pae, together with his equally inept collection of thugs, now become wanted men themselves as the Thai underworld bristles with the shame and dishonor of such an ignoble bungling.', 'Set in a future Bangkok, the story picks-up after a hit-gone-wrong on Iron Cop, the area police chief. The would-be killer Pae, together with his equally inept collection of thugs, now become wanted men themselves as the Thai underworld bristles with the shame and dishonor of such an ignoble bungling.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/piXvXR15igHryNOhsJnTpFJOgnK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18492'),
  ('36556415305169062', 'Killer Tomatoes Eat France!', 1992, 'Horror, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'John De Bello, Kevin Morrissey', 'John De Bello, Costa Dillon, J. Stephen Peace', 'John Astin, Tom Katsis, Marc Price, Steve Lundquist, Costa Dillon, Maxime Dumesnil, Bill LaFleur, Eileen Bowman', 'NR', 'After being busted out of jail by his tomatoes, Professor Mortimer Gangreen begins a new plot to take over the world by inserting his hapless lackey Igor into the throne of the King of France.', 'After being busted out of jail by his tomatoes, Professor Mortimer Gangreen begins a new plot to take over the world by inserting his hapless lackey Igor into the throne of the King of France.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fLpZEAPtMVlxIY9sxZK1giGPhIK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36896'),
