  ('28627341819819191', 'Killer Tongue', 1996, 'Comedy, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Alberto Sciamma, Denis Crossan, Kuki López Rodero', 'Alberto Sciamma', 'Melinda Clarke, Jason Durr, Mapi Galán, Mabel Karr, Robert Englund, Alicia Borrachero, Doug Bradley, Michael Cule', 'R', 'A bank robber seeks refuge in a desert gas station run by nuns, awaiting her boyfriend''s release. An alien meteorite transforms her into a flesh-craving monster with a monstrous tongue, while her poodles become drag queens.', 'A bank robber seeks refuge in a desert gas station run by nuns, awaiting her boyfriend''s release. An alien meteorite transforms her into a flesh-craving monster with a monstrous tongue, while her poodles become drag queens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x10qG3xHVxhUanEvawlhodSnGKq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36271'),
