  ('667770547426239383', 'Killer Whale', 2026, 'Thriller, Horror, Action, Mystery, Science Fiction', 'Jo-Anne Brechin, Shing Fung Cheung, Rick Beecroft', 'Katharine McPhee, Jo-Anne Brechin', 'Virginia Gardner, Mel Jarnson, Mitchell Hope, Isaac Crawley, Scott James George, Luke Cunningham, Anna Yen, Shinji Ikefuji', 'R', 'Follows best friends Maddie and Trish as they find themselves trapped in a remote lagoon with the dangerous killer whale named Ceto.', 'Follows best friends Maddie and Trish as they find themselves trapped in a remote lagoon with the dangerous killer whale named Ceto.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xC6zdIoIHjhOIFmjNyGgtzhuhiF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1412598'),
