  ('603210580806658153', 'Killer: A Journal of Murder', 1996, 'Drama', 'Tim Metcalfe, Ken Kelsch', 'Tim Metcalfe', 'James Woods, Robert Sean Leonard, Cara Buono, Ellen Greene, Robert John Burke, Lili Taylor, Seth Romatelli, Richard Riehle', 'R', 'Carl Panzram is sent to Leavenworth Prison for burglary. While there, he is brutally beaten by a guard. Neophyte guard Henry Lesser feels sympathy for Panzram, befriends him, and gets him to write his life story. Lesser learns that Panzram''s past is much more violent than he thought, but also that he''s capable of being a much better person than the rest of the prison staff believes - or so Lesser thinks.', 'Carl Panzram is sent to Leavenworth Prison for burglary. While there, he is brutally beaten by a guard. Neophyte guard Henry Lesser feels sympathy for Panzram, befriends him, and gets him to write his life story. Lesser learns that Panzram''s past is much more violent than he thought, but also that he''s capable of being a much better person than the rest of the prison staff believes - or so Lesser thinks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bGhq64TzH7i1jSmK0tYHbDmgzVQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59569'),
  ('810615595237795504', 'Killer''s Kiss', 1955, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Stanley Kubrick, Stanley Kubrick', 'Howard Sackler', 'Frank Silvera, Jamie Smith, Irene Kane, Jerry Jarrett, Mike Dana, Felice Orlandi, Shaun O''Brien, Barbara Brand', null, 'Davey Gordon, a New York City boxer at the end of his career, falls for dancer Gloria Price. However, their budding relationship is interrupted by Gloria''s violent boss, Vincent Rapallo, who has eyes for Gloria. The two decide to skip town, but before they can, Vincent and his thugs abduct Gloria, and Davey is forced to search for her among the most squalid corners of the city, with his enemy hiding in the shadows.', 'Davey Gordon, a New York City boxer at the end of his career, falls for dancer Gloria Price. However, their budding relationship is interrupted by Gloria''s violent boss, Vincent Rapallo, who has eyes for Gloria. The two decide to skip town, but before they can, Vincent and his thugs abduct Gloria, and Davey is forced to search for her among the most squalid corners of the city, with his enemy hiding in the shadows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rLbad0lscycS4R3qTSrKguZ0Zz5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10056'),
  ('685508343509297443', 'Killer''s Mission', 1969, 'Action', 'Shigehiro Ozawa, Tokimi Kaneko, Tatsuo Honda', 'Norimichi Matsudaira, Kōji Takada, Masaru Igami', 'Tomisaburō Wakayama, Yumiko Nogawa, Tomoko Mayama, Jūkei Fujioka, Kenji Ushio, Kōji Sekiyama, Osman Yusuf, Junko Toda', null, 'Ichibei is assigned by Shogun Tokugawa to prevent the sale of a Dutch ships-load of rifles to the hostile Shogun Satsuma. On his mission he meets a cowardly Ronin who becomes his assistant, as well as a female spy and a female warrior...', 'Ichibei is assigned by Shogun Tokugawa to prevent the sale of a Dutch ships-load of rifles to the hostile Shogun Satsuma. On his mission he meets a cowardly Ronin who becomes his assistant, as well as a female spy and a female warrior...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/C12iNHmqOE6cBLB6Ype5Ntq7OT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:281971'),
