  ('539793700367021957', 'Killers from Space', 1954, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'W. Lee Wilder, William H. Clothier', 'William Raynor', 'Peter Graves, Barbara Bestar, James Seay, Frank Gerstle, Shepard Menken, Steve Pendleton, John Frederick, Jack Daly', 'NR', 'Atomic scientist/pilot Doug Martin is missing after his plane crashes on an reconnaissance mission after a nuclear test. Miraculously appearing unhurt at the base later, he is given sodium amethol, but authorities are skeptical of his story that he was captured by aliens determined to conquer the Earth with giant monsters and insects. Martin vows to use existing technology to destroy them.', 'Atomic scientist/pilot Doug Martin is missing after his plane crashes on an reconnaissance mission after a nuclear test. Miraculously appearing unhurt at the base later, he is given sodium amethol, but authorities are skeptical of his story that he was captured by aliens determined to conquer the Earth with giant monsters and insects. Martin vows to use existing technology to destroy them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ajQgkwtcVvjqBcDq31qwbn8svyT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23045'),
  ('402183112061144574', 'Killers of the Flower Moon', 2023, 'Crime, History, Drama', 'Matthew Gatlin, Ellen Kuras, Kit Conners', 'Martin Scorsese, Eric Roth', 'Leonardo DiCaprio, Robert De Niro, Lily Gladstone, Jesse Plemons, Tantoo Cardinal, John Lithgow, Brendan Fraser, Cara Jade Myers', 'R', 'When oil is discovered in 1920s Oklahoma under Osage Nation land, the Osage people are murdered one by one—until the FBI steps in to unravel the mystery.', 'When oil is discovered in 1920s Oklahoma under Osage Nation land, the Osage people are murdered one by one—until the FBI steps in to unravel the mystery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dB6Krk806zeqd0YNp2ngQ9zXteH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:466420'),
  ('835927476567379378', 'Killers on Parade', 1961, 'Crime, Comedy, Action', 'Masahiro Shinoda, Shôji Miyagawa, Masao Kosugi', 'Shūji Terayama', 'Yūsuke Kawazu, Shima Iwashita, Kayoko Honoo, Fumio Watanabe, Kazuya Kosaka, Kōji Mitsui, Keijirō Morozumi, Ryōhei Uchida', null, 'A vengeful contractor hires a series of young killers to target a woman muckraker. Trouble brews when an amateur marksman shows up his eclectic competition.', 'A vengeful contractor hires a series of young killers to target a woman muckraker. Trouble brews when an amateur marksman shows up his eclectic competition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zDGhqKHC457VFUV5WaCHhCSMv9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133563'),
  ('795769743383249621', 'Killing', 2018, 'Drama, Action', 'Satoshi Hayashi, Shinya Tsukamoto, Katsuyuki Nakanishi', 'Shinya Tsukamoto', 'Sosuke Ikematsu, Yu Aoi, Tatsuya Nakamura, Ryusei Maeda, Shinya Tsukamoto, Kohji Katoh, Shûji Ôtsuki, Makiko Kuno', null, 'In mid-19th century Edo period, a masterless rōnin named Ikematsu Sosuke resides in a peaceful village among those he helps. However, as the prevalent peace and tranquility are sure to be replaced by war and conflict across the land, the swordsman feels restlessness creeping upon him.', 'In mid-19th century Edo period, a masterless rōnin named Ikematsu Sosuke resides in a peaceful village among those he helps. However, as the prevalent peace and tranquility are sure to be replaced by war and conflict across the land, the swordsman feels restlessness creeping upon him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9YZkePtrSaAsL509v0mBwve2c7n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:531753'),
  ('645698917275077041', 'Killing American Style', 1988, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Amir Shervan, Peter Palian', 'Amir Shervan', 'Harold Diamond, Jim Brown, Robert Z''Dar, Joselito Rescober, John Lynch, Veronica Paul, Jimmy Williams, G. Alexander Virdon', 'R', 'A gang of hot headed brutes lead by Tony Stone and sexual sadist John Lynch execute a robbery with some inside help. A bloody shoot-out with the LAPD ensues and the criminals are apprehended. After a brief stint in the slammer, the gang escapes a prison-bus with the help of Tony s brother Jesse who is critically wounded in the process. He needs a doctor, fast. A hospital visit too risky, they seek out other options. Now on the run, they commandeer a palatial residence, taking hostages. All - American good guy John Morgan returns home becoming a pawn; sent out to retrieve the doctor.', 'A gang of hot headed brutes lead by Tony Stone and sexual sadist John Lynch execute a robbery with some inside help. A bloody shoot-out with the LAPD ensues and the criminals are apprehended. After a brief stint in the slammer, the gang escapes a prison-bus with the help of Tony s brother Jesse who is critically wounded in the process. He needs a doctor, fast. A hospital visit too risky, they seek out other options. Now on the run, they commandeer a palatial residence, taking hostages. All - American good guy John Morgan returns home becoming a pawn; sent out to retrieve the doctor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gO9nL4DcFr2hLeFW1YDPYrmfsKU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144209'),
  ('21198531072625182', 'Killing Birds', 1988, 'Horror', 'Joe D''Amato, Claudio Lattanzi, Antonio Bonifacio', 'Daniele Stroppa', 'Robert Vaughn, Lara Wendel, Timothy W. Watts, Leslie Cumming, James Villemaire, James Sutterfield, Lin Gathright, Sal Maggiore', null, 'A group of students goes into the woods to study birds, and soon the dead begin to rise to devour the living.', 'A group of students goes into the woods to study birds, and soon the dead begin to rise to devour the living.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/khdLWItOdgfrvCCpNq2hA7ziXca.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65588'),
  ('509763674663623915', 'Killing Blues', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Cécilia Rouaud, Pierre Cottereau, Véronique Lamarche', 'Cécilia Rouaud', 'François Damiens, William Lebghil, Laura Felpin, Vanessa Paradis, Bruno Podalydès, Lucile de la Morena, Alicia Hava, Genti Kame', null, 'Max, a ruthless 50-year-old hitman, discovers he has a problem: he now faints at the drop of blood. With his future in the profession in jeopardy, he''s going to have to retrain... But not so simple when his only professional skill is to kill people... They are helped by a couple of young neighbors, Karim and Stéphanie, who do not imagine for a moment who they are dealing with... Max becomes attached, in spite of himself, to the young couple, until his past catches up with him.', 'Max, a ruthless 50-year-old hitman, discovers he has a problem: he now faints at the drop of blood. With his future in the profession in jeopardy, he''s going to have to retrain... But not so simple when his only professional skill is to kill people... They are helped by a couple of young neighbors, Karim and Stéphanie, who do not imagine for a moment who they are dealing with... Max becomes attached, in spite of himself, to the young couple, until his past catches up with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3W6DBswu6Y0AIvIIzQbsVMJHOYV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:984307'),
  ('991311049839908168', 'Killing Bono', 2011, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Nick Hamm, Kieran McGuigan', 'Dick Clement, Ian La Frenais, Simon Maxwell', 'Ben Barnes, Robert Sheehan, Pete Postlethwaite, Krysten Ritter, Ralph Brown, Justine Waddell, Luke Treadaway, Martin McCann', 'R', 'The true story of Neil and Ivan McCormick, two Irish brothers who attempt to become rock stars but can only look on as their high school friends U2 become the biggest band in the world.', 'The true story of Neil and Ivan McCormick, two Irish brothers who attempt to become rock stars but can only look on as their high school friends U2 become the biggest band in the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ad7cAq9NYKaoeNlTgci0Jq0rikM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54093'),
  ('554679952478485074', 'Killing Cabos', 2004, 'Comedy, Action, Crime', 'Alejandro Lozano', 'Kristoff Raczynski, Tony Dalton', 'Tony Dalton, Ana Claudia Talancón, Pedro Armendáriz Jr., Kristoff Raczynski, Raúl Méndez, Joaquín Cosío, Silverio Palacios, Rocío Verdejo', 'R', 'Two young men get involved with some criminals while trying to free the tycoon they kidnapped.', 'Two young men get involved with some criminals while trying to free the tycoon they kidnapped.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d6fY8CZH2UyFlFi8r8odbJR0YEt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14399'),
  ('262781489691660273', 'Killing Cabos 2: The Mask of El Máscara', 2021, 'Action, Comedy, Adventure', 'Alejandro Lozano', 'Alejandra Rodríguez, Alejandro Lozano, Raquel Aedo', 'Joaquín Cosío, Silverio Palacios, Gustavo Sánchez Parra, Martha Claudia Moreno, Jesús Lozano, Ricardo Barona, Marianna Burelli, Roberto Duarte', null, 'Faced with the unexpected death of his estranged father -El Máscara- and the subsequent theft of his precious mask, Rubén -Mascarita- will find himself confronted with his past. Alongside his invincible bodyguard Tony "The Cannibal" and, an unexpected ally, he will have only one day to recover it and make amends with the memory of his father.', 'Faced with the unexpected death of his estranged father -El Máscara- and the subsequent theft of his precious mask, Rubén -Mascarita- will find himself confronted with his past. Alongside his invincible bodyguard Tony "The Cannibal" and, an unexpected ally, he will have only one day to recover it and make amends with the memory of his father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jxdKa1467pktAILLbfw6kZyQlbW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:772436'),
  ('431906395781180678', 'Killing Car', 1993, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Jean Rollin, Max Monteillet', null, 'Tiki Tsang, Frederique Haymann, Jean-Jacques Lefeuvre, Karine Swanson, Jean-René Gossart, Karine Hulewicz, Pascal Montsegur, Barbara Annovozi', null, 'Two cops try to stop a mysterious serial killer dubbed "Car Woman" after the toy car she always leaves next to her victims in this surreal slasher.', 'Two cops try to stop a mysterious serial killer dubbed "Car Woman" after the toy car she always leaves next to her victims in this surreal slasher.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1wuEWUTsXDMy6JDsc9qU7Ijm5vs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146644'),
  ('925636319893728332', 'Killing Daddy', 2014, 'Thriller, Crime, Mystery, TV Movie', 'Curtis Crawford, Bill St. John', 'Trent Haaga', 'Elizabeth Gillies, Cynthia Stevenson, William R. Moses, Sebastian Pigott, Tori Anderson, Tom Barnett, Sabrina Mangiaracina, Jennilee Murray', 'PG-13', 'When Cassie''s father finds himself vulnerable and bedridden, she believes she has the perfect revenge for her mother''s death.', 'When Cassie''s father finds himself vulnerable and bedridden, she believes she has the perfect revenge for her mother''s death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l5zS9XOPws4cZ6te7Ard7Xi8PAO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:280874'),
  ('609073830652613623', 'Killing Emmett Young', 2002, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Keith Snyder', 'Keith Snyder', 'Scott Wolf, Gabriel Byrne, Tim Roth, Greg Wood, Ira Hawkins, Khandi Alexander, Adam LeFevre, Danielle Mason', null, 'In the Philadelphia police department, Emmett Young is a hotshot, a workaholic newly promoted to homicide. He learns he has a disease that will soon kill him painfully, so he hires a stranger to arrange his own death. With one eye on the calendar (he''s allowed a few days'' grace before his murder), he pursues a final case, the serial killing of young women. Emmett develops a profile of the assailant. Meanwhile, his fixer hires an ex-cop to kill Emmett, a lonely security guard whom the fixer taunts and belittles. In this limited time, can Emmett sort out what''s important?', 'In the Philadelphia police department, Emmett Young is a hotshot, a workaholic newly promoted to homicide. He learns he has a disease that will soon kill him painfully, so he hires a stranger to arrange his own death. With one eye on the calendar (he''s allowed a few days'' grace before his murder), he pursues a final case, the serial killing of young women. Emmett develops a profile of the assailant. Meanwhile, his fixer hires an ex-cop to kill Emmett, a lonely security guard whom the fixer taunts and belittles. In this limited time, can Emmett sort out what''s important?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z33ANbYqbxQWqQ4bsMFSl8dRIHl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33625'),
  ('69654179878378086', 'Killing Faith', 2025, 'Thriller, Western', 'Ned Crowley, James Grayford, Justin Hamilton', 'Ned Crowley', 'Guy Pearce, DeWanda Wise, Bill Pullman, Raoul Max Trujillo, Ryan de Quintal, Emily Katherine Ford, Jack Alcott, Charlie Talbert', 'R', 'In the summer of 1859, a widowed physician reluctantly agrees to take a recently freed slave and her mysterious Caucasian daughter on a five-day journey through the bloody West to find a distant town''s Faith Healer. The woman believes her daughter is possessed. The doctor believes she simply carries The Sickness. Either way the fact remains that every living thing the girl touches mysteriously dies.', 'In the summer of 1859, a widowed physician reluctantly agrees to take a recently freed slave and her mysterious Caucasian daughter on a five-day journey through the bloody West to find a distant town''s Faith Healer. The woman believes her daughter is possessed. The doctor believes she simply carries The Sickness. Either way the fact remains that every living thing the girl touches mysteriously dies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lzqqjVZsQu8NZOeAYZffP5FKnRy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1200320'),
  ('740008309173387640', 'Killing for Love', 2016, 'Crime, Documentary', 'Marcus Vetter, Karin Steinberger', 'Marcus Vetter, Karin Steinberger', 'Imogen Poots, Daniel Brühl, Jens Söring, Gail Ball, Steven Rosenfield, Tom Elliott, Ricky Gardner, Gail Marshall', null, 'Derek and Nancy Haysom were brutally murdered in their house in Lynchburg, Virginia, on March 30, 1985. Suspicion fell on their daughter Elizabeth and her boyfriend Jens Söring. They flee to Europe, but are caught and extradited to the U.S. Elizabeth is sentenced to 90 years in jail for incitement to murder, Jens Söring to two life sentences. Karin Steinberger, Marcus Vetter and their team spent over three years researching this case, which achieved world-wide notoriety. They uncovered new evidence, including the fact none of the blood samples found at the scene of the crime belonged to Jens Söring.', 'Derek and Nancy Haysom were brutally murdered in their house in Lynchburg, Virginia, on March 30, 1985. Suspicion fell on their daughter Elizabeth and her boyfriend Jens Söring. They flee to Europe, but are caught and extradited to the U.S. Elizabeth is sentenced to 90 years in jail for incitement to murder, Jens Söring to two life sentences. Karin Steinberger, Marcus Vetter and their team spent over three years researching this case, which achieved world-wide notoriety. They uncovered new evidence, including the fact none of the blood samples found at the scene of the crime belonged to Jens Söring.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/af43DiWkC8Ndn9LTurEsdhFLCHR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:402919'),
  ('117390509780979166', 'Killing for the Prosecution', 2018, 'Mystery, Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Masato Harada, Takahide Shibanushi, Masayuki Taniguchi', 'Masato Harada, Takahide Shibanushi', 'Takuya Kimura, Kazunari Ninomiya, Yuriko Yoshitaka, Yutaka Matsushige, Takehiro Hira, Norito Yashima, Koji Ohkura, Tsutomu Yamazaki', null, 'Young public prosecutor Keiichiro Okino is assigned to the department of the Tokyo Public Prosecutors Office that deals with violent cases, where he will work with Takeshi Mogami, whom he admires. When a money lender is killed and it is suspected that someone from Mogami’s past is the perpetrator, the team prepares to do his best in order to prove the alleged criminal’s guilt.', 'Young public prosecutor Keiichiro Okino is assigned to the department of the Tokyo Public Prosecutors Office that deals with violent cases, where he will work with Takeshi Mogami, whom he admires. When a money lender is killed and it is suspected that someone from Mogami’s past is the perpetrator, the team prepares to do his best in order to prove the alleged criminal’s guilt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z2dHKW75faQCned5qC070uJ4JOM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:517373'),
  ('924564990090394029', 'Killing God', 2017, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Caye Casas, Albert Pintó', 'Albert Pintó, Caye Casas', 'Francesc Orella, Itziar Castro, Eduardo Antuña, Emilio Gavira, Boris Ruiz, David Pareja', null, 'When Carlos invites his father and his brother to spend a pleasant New Year in a strange house isolated in the forest with him and his wife Ana. But what promised to be a quiet family dinner, suddenly is interrupted by the presence of a peculiar vagabond, dwarf and very bad man, who claims to be God.', 'When Carlos invites his father and his brother to spend a pleasant New Year in a strange house isolated in the forest with him and his wife Ana. But what promised to be a quiet family dinner, suddenly is interrupted by the presence of a peculiar vagabond, dwarf and very bad man, who claims to be God.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fJHIW6xmKZJTsTCXsWKt3s1ZLt9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:464832'),
