  ('349700216404407616', 'Killing Moon', 1999, 'Thriller, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'John Bradshaw', 'Tony Johnston', 'Daniel Baldwin, Penelope Ann Miller, Kim Coates, Daniel Kash, Denis Akiyama, Christopher Bolton, Dave Nichols, William B. Davis', null, 'A mysterious disease threatens airline passengers.', 'A mysterious disease threatens airline passengers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ifrcsJqXng1edraeaAUkx2n9d15.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109547'),
  ('782781711301368379', 'Killing Mr. Griffin', 1997, 'Thriller, TV Movie', 'Jack Bender, David Geddes', null, 'Scott Bairstow, Amy Jo Johnson, Mario López, Chris Young, Michelle Williams, Jennifer Hammon, Mindy Spence, Maitland Ward', null, 'After being humiliated in English class by his teacher Mr. Griffin, High School student Mark Kinney and his friends plot their revenge. The prank goes wrong when Mr. Griffin dies from heart failure. Now, Mark and his friends must cover their tracks before they are accused of murder.', 'After being humiliated in English class by his teacher Mr. Griffin, High School student Mark Kinney and his friends plot their revenge. The prank goes wrong when Mr. Griffin dies from heart failure. Now, Mark and his friends must cover their tracks before they are accused of murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/shNIoisVb4cwdWWR1IsZA1alc5z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44232'),
  ('449011940929970766', 'Killing Romance', 2023, 'Thriller, Comedy', 'Lee Seung-ho, Kang Min-woo, Jin Sung-hyun', 'Park Jeong-ye', 'Lee Hanee, Lee Sun-kyun, Gong Myoung, Bae Yu-ram, Andrew Bishop, Shim Dal-gi, Debbie Reid, Choi Deok-moon', null, 'Hwang Yeo-rae, a once-popular actress, faces a turbulent marriage and yearns for her old career. When she moves in next to Kim Beom-woo, her biggest fan, a desperate plan to regain her freedom and revive her career unfolds.', 'Hwang Yeo-rae, a once-popular actress, faces a turbulent marriage and yearns for her old career. When she moves in next to Kim Beom-woo, her biggest fan, a desperate plan to regain her freedom and revive her career unfolds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d5cvYhiyykZrliPSPqO4iFGJMus.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:746349'),
  ('611252291411382363', 'Killing Salazar', 2017, 'Crime, Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Lauro David Chartrand-DelValle, Keoni Waxman, Brian O''Sullivan', 'Keoni Waxman, Richard Beattie', 'Steven Seagal, Luke Goss, Georges St-Pierre, Bruce Crawford, Lauro David Chartrand-DelValle, Darren E. Scott, Florin Piersic Jr., Martine Argent', 'R', 'An elite team of DEA agents are assigned to protect a dangerous drug lord and take refuge in a luxury hotel while they await extraction. They soon find themselves at the center of an ambush as the drug lord''s former associates launch an explosive assault on the hotel.', 'An elite team of DEA agents are assigned to protect a dangerous drug lord and take refuge in a luxury hotel while they await extraction. They soon find themselves at the center of an ambush as the drug lord''s former associates launch an explosive assault on the hotel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2J7jc9VZroyf4rFlyWJ0mIreu2A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:412678'),
  ('553256518661189477', 'Killing Season', 2013, 'Action, Thriller', 'Mark Steven Johnson, Peter Menzies Jr., Nick Satriano', 'Evan Daugherty', 'Robert De Niro, John Travolta, Milo Ventimiglia, Liz Olin, Diana Lyubenova, Kalin Sarmenov, Stefan Shterev, Joseph Oliveira', 'R', 'Two veterans of the Bosnian War, one American, one Serbian, clash in the remote Smoky Mountain wilderness.', 'Two veterans of the Bosnian War, one American, one Serbian, clash in the remote Smoky Mountain wilderness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o55HXx21PqRcOgAaOWFz4tGMrZh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77663'),
  ('114946158933111350', 'Killing Spree', 1987, 'Horror', 'Tim Ritter', 'Tim Ritter', 'Asbestos Felt, Courtney Lercara, Raymond Carbone, Bruce Paquette, Joel D. Wynkoop, Kieran Turner, Rachel Rutz, Tim Ritter', null, 'Newly wed Tom Russo suspects his wife is having sexual encounters with their suburban neighbors, and launches a methodical campaign to murder the lovers.', 'Newly wed Tom Russo suspects his wife is having sexual encounters with their suburban neighbors, and launches a methodical campaign to murder the lovers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/91JfaHy6A8qjtXGYs6wkifcFyEE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81478'),
  ('202245202185295833', 'Killing Streets', 1991, 'Action', 'Stephen Cornwell', 'Stephen Cornwell, Andrew Deutsch', 'Michael Paré, Lorenzo Lamas, Jennifer Runyon, Rahely Chimeyan, Hashem Yassin, Yaacov Gvir-Cohen, Menahem Einy, Shaul Mizrahi', null, 'A young Marine is kidnapped by terrorists in Lebanon. His twin brother, frustrated at his inability to get any kind of information from the government about his brother''s plight, travels to Lebanon with a plan for his own rescue operation.', 'A young Marine is kidnapped by terrorists in Lebanon. His twin brother, frustrated at his inability to get any kind of information from the government about his brother''s plight, travels to Lebanon with a plan for his own rescue operation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7eSrCYNszMUmRGmG8ICUQ0xL2Kk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105858'),
  ('483149433912827501', 'Killing the Dead', 2019, 'Thriller', 'Hugo Giménez, Hugo Colace', 'Hugo Giménez', 'Ever Enciso, Aníbal Ortíz, Silvio Rodas, Jorge Román', null, 'Paraguay 1978, during Stroessner’s dictatorship, Pastor and Dionisio work burying bodies illicitly. In Argentina, the World Cup is being held. One morning, among the bodies, they find Mario, who is still alive. They know they must kill him but the problem is: in spite of what they are doing, they have never killed anyone before. A storm indicates that the winter is coming while the destiny of the three men is determined during the World Cup final. Both Pastor and Dionisio are the last link of a chain in the terrible system that has as a result in all the missing people.', 'Paraguay 1978, during Stroessner’s dictatorship, Pastor and Dionisio work burying bodies illicitly. In Argentina, the World Cup is being held. One morning, among the bodies, they find Mario, who is still alive. They know they must kill him but the problem is: in spite of what they are doing, they have never killed anyone before. A storm indicates that the winter is coming while the destiny of the three men is determined during the World Cup final. Both Pastor and Dionisio are the last link of a chain in the terrible system that has as a result in all the missing people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2cyy2O6NFdxuHCB0mO8oaRgPS6D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:616999'),
  ('73610757630038614', 'Killing the Devil', 1970, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Ester Krumbachová, Drahomíra Králová, Jiří Macák', 'Jan Němec, Ester Krumbachová', 'Jiřina Bohdalová, Vladimír Menšík, Ljuba Hermanová, Helena Růžičková, Jana Hana Duffková, Jindřiška Gabriela Preissová, Olga Jungová, A. Květoňová', null, 'A lonely woman gets more than she bargained for when she begins wooing Mr Devil, an insatiable glutton who turns out to be the boyfriend from Hell.', 'A lonely woman gets more than she bargained for when she begins wooing Mr Devil, an insatiable glutton who turns out to be the boyfriend from Hell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h0YDsCfsRJybUZnvCixcsnDKfSr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:266429'),
  ('359922041850460419', 'Killing the Shadows', 2006, 'Comedy, Drama, History', 'Ezel Akay, Mehmet Kurtuluş, Hayk Kirakosyan', 'Levent Kazak, Ezel Akay', 'Haluk Bilginer, Beyaz, Şebnem Dönmez, Güven Kıraç, Ragıp Savaş, Ayşe Tolga, Altay Özbek, Hasan Ali Mete', null, 'Killing The Shadows is a bawdy comic fable set in the Ottoman Empire during the mid-14th century based on two legendary figures in Turkish folkore, the jester Hacivat (Beyazit Ozturk) and the nomad Karagoz (Haluk Bilginer), men who apparently lived and died by their sense of humour.', 'Killing The Shadows is a bawdy comic fable set in the Ottoman Empire during the mid-14th century based on two legendary figures in Turkish folkore, the jester Hacivat (Beyazit Ozturk) and the nomad Karagoz (Haluk Bilginer), men who apparently lived and died by their sense of humour.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q74W88WLCrld7x1YDyJneSffPLr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50046'),
  ('295733699953901911', 'Killing Them Softly', 2012, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Cali Pomés, Jonas Spaccarotelli, Scott Robertson', 'Andrew Dominik', 'Brad Pitt, Scoot McNairy, Ben Mendelsohn, James Gandolfini, Ray Liotta, Richard Jenkins, Vincent Curatola, Sam Shepard', 'R', 'Jackie Cogan is an enforcer hired to restore order after three dumb guys rob a Mob protected card game, causing the local criminal economy to collapse.', 'Jackie Cogan is an enforcer hired to restore order after three dumb guys rob a Mob protected card game, causing the local criminal economy to collapse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/heaz45kpFa4Oa7iLis0OBas68ls.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64689'),
  ('300588203159883981', 'Killing Words', 2004, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Laura Mañá', null, 'Darío Grandinetti, Goya Toledo, Fernando Guillén, Eric Bonicatto, Mariona Perrier, Robert Forcadell', null, 'A mild-mannered psychopath plays mind-games with a woman he has tied to a chair in his basement.', 'A mild-mannered psychopath plays mind-games with a woman he has tied to a chair in his basement.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v8cJwKbYd9v73DEy9qvEOVoRafT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31068'),
  ('986443549567808438', 'Killing Zoe', 1993, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Roger Avary, Tom Richmond, Trey Batchelor', 'Roger Avary', 'Eric Stoltz, Julie Delpy, Jean-Hugues Anglade, Tai Thai, Bruce Ramsay, Kario Salem, Salvator Xuereb, Gary Kemp', 'R', 'Zed is an American vault-cracker who travels to Paris to meet up with his old friend Eric. Eric and his gang have planned to raid the only bank in the city which is open on Bastille day. After offering his services, Zed soon finds himself trapped in a situation beyond his control when heroin abuse, poor planning and a call-girl named Zoe all conspire to turn the robbery into a very bloody siege.', 'Zed is an American vault-cracker who travels to Paris to meet up with his old friend Eric. Eric and his gang have planned to raid the only bank in the city which is open on Bastille day. After offering his services, Zed soon finds himself trapped in a situation beyond his control when heroin abuse, poor planning and a call-girl named Zoe all conspire to turn the robbery into a very bloody siege.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k3UEKMVnkljOlsO5sLmz87YGlaG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:507'),
  ('1079593867292228287', 'Killjoy', 2000, 'Horror', 'Craig Ross Jr., Carl Bartels, Louis Paul Tocchet', 'Carl Washington', 'Ángel Vargas, Vera Yell, Lee Marks, Carl Washington, Jamal Grimes, Dee Dee Austin, Corey Hampton, Rani Goulant', 'R', 'Deep in an inner city hell, a ghastly figure is killing off the bad guys. A vigilante, or a demon? For the beautiful high school student, Jada, that''s the question that will bring her face to face with the killer clown Killjoy.', 'Deep in an inner city hell, a ghastly figure is killing off the bad guys. A vigilante, or a demon? For the beautiful high school student, Jada, that''s the question that will bring her face to face with the killer clown Killjoy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3oN0u5ok4spH5g4ZkwjcNcwfUzy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27711'),
  ('555535721586706776', 'Killjoy 2: Deliverance from Evil', 2002, 'Horror', 'Tammi Sutton, Balthazar Jones, Michael G. Maurer', 'Tammi Sutton, Douglas Snauffer', 'Logan Alexander, Debbie Rochon, Trent Haaga, Austin Priester, Nicole Pulliam, Choice Skinner, Olimpia Fernandez, Rhonda Claerbaut', 'R', 'In this sequel, two juvenile detention officers must escort a group of criminally-inclined urban kids to the country where they are being forced to renovate a shelter for teens as punishment for their crimes. After one of them is shot by a local, the survivors seek refuge in the home of a voodoo woman, where they mistakenly summon legendary clown-faced demon Killjoy who begins hunting them down one by one.', 'In this sequel, two juvenile detention officers must escort a group of criminally-inclined urban kids to the country where they are being forced to renovate a shelter for teens as punishment for their crimes. After one of them is shot by a local, the survivors seek refuge in the home of a voodoo woman, where they mistakenly summon legendary clown-faced demon Killjoy who begins hunting them down one by one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a41tDBrTNfFcRe3gAVfhjlbKdPR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27712'),
  ('471100440555950667', 'Kills on Wheels', 2016, 'Action, Drama, Comedy', 'Attila Till, Imre Juhász', 'Attila Till', 'Szabolcs Thuróczy, Zoltán Fenyvesi, Ádám Fekete, Dusán Vitanovics, Lídia Danis, Mónika Balsai, Björn Freiberg, Zoltán Mucsi', null, 'Two physically handicapped youngsters make friends with a paralysed hitman and are commissioned by a local mafia boss. They have little to lose although things are never as they first appear. The boundaries between fantasy and reality blur as the unlikely heroes stumble from one close encounter to the next and we gain an unusual insight into their lives on the periphery of society.', 'Two physically handicapped youngsters make friends with a paralysed hitman and are commissioned by a local mafia boss. They have little to lose although things are never as they first appear. The boundaries between fantasy and reality blur as the unlikely heroes stumble from one close encounter to the next and we gain an unusual insight into their lives on the periphery of society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uycU7uKMU5H5Un4DMPQXNV5IogI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:393695'),
  ('161894807557644190', 'Killshot', 2008, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'John Madden, Caleb Deschanel', 'Hossein Amini', 'Mickey Rourke, Diane Lane, Thomas Jane, Rosario Dawson, Joseph Gordon-Levitt, Brandon McGibbon, Peter Kelly Gaudreault, Michelle Arvizu', 'R', 'Beautiful Carmen Colson and her ironworker husband Wayne are placed in the Federal Witness Protection program after witnessing an "incident". Thinking they are at last safe, they are targeted by an experienced hit man and a psychopathic young upstart killer.', 'Beautiful Carmen Colson and her ironworker husband Wayne are placed in the Federal Witness Protection program after witnessing an "incident". Thinking they are at last safe, they are targeted by an experienced hit man and a psychopathic young upstart killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ckUhio8KhGDcvFV7g34kYjVLEEW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16164'),
  ('572593541981430845', 'Kilometers and Kilometers', 2020, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Sinu Sidharth, Jeo Baby', 'Jeo Baby, Deepu Pradeep', 'Tovino Thomas, India Jarvis, Joju George, Sidhartha Siva, Basil Joseph, Sudheesh, Maala Parvathi, Pauly Valsan', null, 'When a debt-ridden man reluctantly agrees to drive an American tourist around India, their stark differences lead to bickering… and unexpected bonding.', 'When a debt-ridden man reluctantly agrees to drive an American tourist around India, their stark differences lead to bickering… and unexpected bonding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x2X1Speb2aQqk4Z3B2yngh33lx7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:731949'),
  ('896775352349266205', 'Kiltro', 2006, 'Action, Adventure', 'Ernesto Díaz Espinoza', 'Ernesto Díaz Espinoza', 'Marko Zaror, Caterina J, Miguel Ángel de Luca, Man Soo Yoon, Alejandro Castillo, Roberto Avendano, Ximena Rivas, Daniela Lhorente', null, 'Street tough Zamir has been in love with Kim ever since he rescued her from rapists, but the only way that he can express his affection is to attack any man who shows interest in her. Kim tolerates Zamir''s infatuation, but keeps him at arm''s length. When Max Kalba arrives in town to take vengeance on Kim''s father, Zamir attempts to rescue her once again.', 'Street tough Zamir has been in love with Kim ever since he rescued her from rapists, but the only way that he can express his affection is to attack any man who shows interest in her. Kim tolerates Zamir''s infatuation, but keeps him at arm''s length. When Max Kalba arrives in town to take vengeance on Kim''s father, Zamir attempts to rescue her once again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/55dSTVl28buCnjaSorzDoJbkZf1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26481'),
  ('258946489619080053', 'Kilukkam', 1991, 'Comedy, Family', 'Priyadarshan, S. Kumar', 'Venu Nagavalli', 'Mohanlal, Jagathy Sreekumar, Revathi, Thilakan, Innocent, Sharat Saxena, K. B. Ganesh Kumar, Sukumari', null, 'Nandini is an illegitimate child who comes to Ooty in search of her father. She meets Joji, a tourist guide, and pretends to be mentally unstable in order to get shelter in his house.', 'Nandini is an illegitimate child who comes to Ooty in search of her father. She meets Joji, a tourist guide, and pretends to be mentally unstable in order to get shelter in his house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5F37oi8ClcxKBcwqwUlATHBd1mD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:139476'),
  ('324410734878525405', 'Kim', 1950, 'Adventure, Drama, Family', 'Victor Saville, William V. Skall', 'Leon Gordon, Helen Deutsch, Richard Schayer', 'Errol Flynn, Dean Stockwell, Paul Lukas, Robert Douglas, Thomas Gomez, Cecil Kellaway, Arnold Moss, Reginald Owen', 'NR', 'During the British Raj, the orphan of a British soldier poses as a Hindu and is torn between his loyalty to a Buddhist mystic and aiding the English secret service.', 'During the British Raj, the orphan of a British soldier poses as a Hindu and is torn between his loyalty to a Buddhist mystic and aiding the English secret service.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/naUTqET84gVJcn0e1AnA3eL05t1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110465'),
  ('1003923008191348234', 'Kim Bu Aile?', 2022, 'Comedy, Action, Adventure', 'Bedran Güzel', null, 'Cengiz Bozkurt, Nurgül Yeşilçay, Onur Buldu, Ferit Aktuğ, Beste Kökdemir, Doğan Can Sarıkaya, Altan Erkekli, Fatih Al', null, 'Adem Haberdar''s life takes a completely different turn when he has to leave the police after failing an important operation. Pursuing the gang that caused him to quit his job, Adem has to take over a chicken restaurant in order to follow the gang.', 'Adem Haberdar''s life takes a completely different turn when he has to leave the police after failing an important operation. Pursuing the gang that caused him to quit his job, Adem has to take over a chicken restaurant in order to follow the gang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nvNqP5Z0mpwgqI0ciRkT32Uf36m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1031869'),
  ('982091470460061776', 'Kim Ji-young: Born 1982', 2019, 'Drama', 'Kim Do-young, Lee Sung-jae, Lee Dong-hwa', 'Kim Do-young, Yu Young-ah', 'Jung Yu-mi, Gong Yoo, Kim Mi-kyeong, Gong Min-jeung, Park Seong-yeon, Lee Bong-ryeon, Kim Sung-cheol, Lee Eol', null, 'Kim Ji-young, an ordinary woman in her 30s, suddenly shows signs of being inhabited by other women from her life, past and present.', 'Kim Ji-young, an ordinary woman in her 30s, suddenly shows signs of being inhabited by other women from her life, past and present.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gA4J1jio3O5monA9GrAnxjlcvqw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:586048'),
  ('1127996997822279177', 'Kim Jong-un: The Unauthorized Biography', 2015, 'Documentary, History, TV Movie', 'Anthony Dufour, François Cauwel, Nicolas Wiart', null, 'Titus Plattner, Ueli Studer, Kim Kwang-jin, Victor D. Cha, Kim Yeon-soon, David S. Maxwell, Joseph R. DeTrani, Keith Luse', null, 'A journey through several countries to find those who really know Kim Jong-un, North Korea''s leader, in an attempt to profile a contradictory dictator who seems to rule his nation with both disturbing benevolence and cold cruelty while being worshipped as a living god by his subjects in exalted displays of ridiculous fanaticism.', 'A journey through several countries to find those who really know Kim Jong-un, North Korea''s leader, in an attempt to profile a contradictory dictator who seems to rule his nation with both disturbing benevolence and cold cruelty while being worshipped as a living god by his subjects in exalted displays of ridiculous fanaticism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vqojHTR0YzR6SWf3M9XsEAUSbdQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:417483'),
  ('459673863705147457', 'Kim Novak Never Swam in Genesaret''s Lake', 2005, 'Crime, Drama', 'Martin Asphaug, Philip Øgaard', 'Martin Asphaug', 'Anton Lundqvist, Jesper Adefelt, Jonas Karlsson, Helena af Sandeberg, Anders Berg, Pär Luttropp, Emil Johnsen, Johan H:son Kjellgren', null, '14-year old Erik gets sent to live with his older brother, Henry, during the summer as his mother is dying in cancer. Henry starts dating Ewa, who is married to Berra. A few days after Ewa shows up battered and bruised from an altercation with Berra, he is found dead on a nearby parking lot.', '14-year old Erik gets sent to live with his older brother, Henry, during the summer as his mother is dying in cancer. Henry starts dating Ewa, who is married to Berra. A few days after Ewa shows up battered and bruised from an altercation with Berra, he is found dead on a nearby parking lot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tpVDiw0p6T67VL3v2GWzB973FW6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25544'),
  ('789596170331548472', 'Kim Novak: Hollywood''s Golden Age Rebel', 2023, 'Documentary', 'Jessica Menendez, Hervé Glabeck', 'Jessica Menendez, Karim Miské', 'Kim Novak, Leah Aldridge, Emily Carman, Tania Modleski, Léonie Simaga, Marie-Ève Dufresne, Anne Jacq, Jacky Tavernier', null, 'Kim Novak never dreamed on being a star, but she became one. Most famous for her enigmatic performance in Hitchcock’s Vertigo (1958), the Chicago-born actress never quite fitted into the Hollywood mould and wanted to do things her own way.', 'Kim Novak never dreamed on being a star, but she became one. Most famous for her enigmatic performance in Hitchcock’s Vertigo (1958), the Chicago-born actress never quite fitted into the Hollywood mould and wanted to do things her own way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v0yItEJWUmGyMDqLIcRzoRKUXir.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:975395'),
  ('249292680850475301', 'Kim Possible', 2019, 'Family, Action, Adventure, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Melissa R. Stubbs, Adam B. Stein, Zach Lipovsky', 'Josh A. Cagan, Mark McCorkle, Bob Schooley', 'Sadie Stanley, Sean Giambrone, Ciara Riley Wilson, Taylor Ortega, Connie Ray, Issac Ryan Brown, Erika Tham, Maxwell Simkins', 'PG', 'Everyday teen hero Kim Possible and her best friend Ron Stoppable embark on their freshman year of high school, all while saving the world from evil villains. While Kim and Ron have always been one step ahead of their opponents, navigating the social hierarchy of high school is more challenging than the action-hero ever imagined. With Drakken and Shego lurking in the wings, Kim must rely on her family and Team Possible—Ron, tech-genius Wade, new friend Athena, and Rufus, a Naked mole-rat.', 'Everyday teen hero Kim Possible and her best friend Ron Stoppable embark on their freshman year of high school, all while saving the world from evil villains. While Kim and Ron have always been one step ahead of their opponents, navigating the social hierarchy of high school is more challenging than the action-hero ever imagined. With Drakken and Shego lurking in the wings, Kim must rely on her family and Team Possible—Ron, tech-genius Wade, new friend Athena, and Rufus, a Naked mole-rat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t37Xa74GFO1R3kebocqSV4hFrPO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:520720'),
  ('878952369591725160', 'Kim Possible Movie: So the Drama', 2005, 'Animation, Adventure, Family, Action, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Bong Hee Han, Steve Loter', 'Mark McCorkle, Bob Schooley', 'Christy Carlson Romano, Will Friedle, Nancy Cartwright, Tahj Mowry, Mayim Bialik, Gary Cole, John DiMaggio, Shaun Fleming', 'G', 'Dr. Drakken has an evil new plot for world domination, but his ultimate success depends upon finding out KP''s weakness which may involve a new hottie at Middleton High School named Eric, who suddenly sparks feelings in Ron about Kim that resemble much more than friendship. To make matters worse, Bueno Nacho, Ron''s favorite fast food chain has turned sour on him by bombarding him with little Devils.', 'Dr. Drakken has an evil new plot for world domination, but his ultimate success depends upon finding out KP''s weakness which may involve a new hottie at Middleton High School named Eric, who suddenly sparks feelings in Ron about Kim that resemble much more than friendship. To make matters worse, Bueno Nacho, Ron''s favorite fast food chain has turned sour on him by bombarding him with little Devils.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rQ5WS0zWDRau2lI0FYpGYDGmDVS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20771'),
  ('1113267711836202016', 'Kim Possible: A Sitch In Time', 2003, 'TV Movie, Action, Adventure, Animation, Family', 'Steve Loter', 'Bill Motz, Bob Roth', 'Christy Carlson Romano, Will Friedle, Nancy Cartwright, Tahj Mowry, Gary Cole, John DiMaggio, Michael Dorn, Michael Clarke Duncan', 'G', 'Kim and Ron start a new school year, only to learn that Ron''s family is moving to Norway. This puts a strain on their partnership, just as Dr. Drakken, Monkey Fist, and Duff Killigan team up to find and use an ancient time travel device to rule the world. Attacking Kim in the past, present, and future, can these villians succeed? Or will an unforeseen force be more destructive?', 'Kim and Ron start a new school year, only to learn that Ron''s family is moving to Norway. This puts a strain on their partnership, just as Dr. Drakken, Monkey Fist, and Duff Killigan team up to find and use an ancient time travel device to rule the world. Attacking Kim in the past, present, and future, can these villians succeed? Or will an unforeseen force be more destructive?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3XAMrWxsqqQI5HNJfegbUXtXiEG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51786'),
  ('939501916296479971', 'Kim''s Video', 2023, 'Documentary, History', 'David Redmon, Ashley Sabin, David Redmon', 'Ashley Sabin, David Redmon', 'David Redmon, Kim Yong-man, Vittorio Sgarbi, Isabel Gillies, Robert Greene, Eric Hynes, Lorry Kikta, Ryan Krivoshey', null, 'Since 1987, and for almost three decades, New York cinephiles had access to a vast treasure trove of rare films thanks to Kim''s Video, a small empire run by Yongman Kim, an enigmatic character who amassed more than fifty thousand VHS tapes.', 'Since 1987, and for almost three decades, New York cinephiles had access to a vast treasure trove of rare films thanks to Kim''s Video, a small empire run by Yongman Kim, an enigmatic character who amassed more than fifty thousand VHS tapes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rqMNKFY5RpbavDAiPd3jgNzd6fP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1058673'),
  ('694358298112277235', 'Kimagure Orange Road: I Want to Return to That Day', 1988, 'Romance, Animation, Drama, Comedy', 'Hitoshi Kaneko, Noriyoshi Matsuura, Tomomi Mochizuki', 'Kenji Terada', 'Toru Furuya, Eriko Hara, Maria Kawamura, Chiyoko Kawashima, Tomoko Maruo, Keiichi Nanba, Katsumi Suzuki, Naoki Tatsuta', null, 'Kyousuke and Madoka have finally arrived at the point where they are close to graduation and have to decide where they want to go to college. Naturally, they want to go together, so beside all the studying they also have to look for a proper college where they can enter both. Hikaru, still a year from graduating, wants to support Kyousuke as well and does that in her own way. But while she does that, Madoka feels jealous and tells her feelings to Kyousuke. And then Kyousuke has to take action to finally decide on the girl he loves.', 'Kyousuke and Madoka have finally arrived at the point where they are close to graduation and have to decide where they want to go to college. Naturally, they want to go together, so beside all the studying they also have to look for a proper college where they can enter both. Hikaru, still a year from graduating, wants to support Kyousuke as well and does that in her own way. But while she does that, Madoka feels jealous and tells her feelings to Kyousuke. And then Kyousuke has to take action to finally decide on the girl he loves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ogeQoeHVPPDglkaMIVy0o3roHkx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:186383'),
  ('665378857578151848', 'Kimberly', 1999, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Bernd Heinl, Frederic Golchan', 'Frederic Golchan', 'Gabrielle Anwar, Sean Astin, Patty Duke, Jim Gaffigan, Peggy Cafferty, Veronica Alicino, Jason Lewis, Robert Mailhouse', null, 'Four young men fall in love with the same woman. When they all find themselves attracted by Kimberly, hey vow not to fight for her affections during the season -- but then she gets pregnant and doesn''t know which teammate is the father.', 'Four young men fall in love with the same woman. When they all find themselves attracted by Kimberly, hey vow not to fight for her affections during the season -- but then she gets pregnant and doesn''t know which teammate is the father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/47yCsMGRa3WMxufj8NHbNDiztiK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:171840'),
  ('253066405398647397', 'Kimi', 2022, 'Thriller, Mystery, Crime', 'Victor Capoccia, Steven Soderbergh, Jody Spilkoman', 'David Koepp', 'Zoë Kravitz, Byron Bowers, Jaime Camil, Erika Christensen, Derek DelGaudio, Robin Givens, Charles Halford, Devin Ratray', 'R', 'A tech worker with agoraphobia discovers recorded evidence of a violent crime but is met with resistance when she tries to report it. Seeking justice, she must do the thing she fears the most: leave her apartment.', 'A tech worker with agoraphobia discovers recorded evidence of a violent crime but is met with resistance when she tries to report it. Seeking justice, she must do the thing she fears the most: leave her apartment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/okNgwtxIWzGsNlR3GsOS0i0Qgbn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:800510'),
  ('321078293157582888', 'Kin', 1982, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Nikita Mikhalkov, Pavel Lebeshev, Valentin Bobrovsky', 'Viktor Merezhko', 'Nonna Mordyukova, Svetlana Kryuchkova, Andrei Petrov, Ivan Bortnik, Yuri Bogatyryov, Fyodor Stukov, Vsevolod Larionov, Nikita Mikhalkov', null, 'The story follows Maria Konovalova who travels from her rural village to visit her daughter Nina in the city. Maria''s arrival exposes the stark contrasts between rural and urban lifestyles and reveals deep-seated family tensions. Interestingly, Родня (Rodnya) in Russian sounds very similar to the word Родина (Rodina), which means "Motherland." The film features three generations of women — Maria, her daughter Nina, and her granddaughter Irina — symbolizing three different Russias: one from the past, one modern, and one representing the future.', 'The story follows Maria Konovalova who travels from her rural village to visit her daughter Nina in the city. Maria''s arrival exposes the stark contrasts between rural and urban lifestyles and reveals deep-seated family tensions. Interestingly, Родня (Rodnya) in Russian sounds very similar to the word Родина (Rodina), which means "Motherland." The film features three generations of women — Maria, her daughter Nina, and her granddaughter Irina — symbolizing three different Russias: one from the past, one modern, and one representing the future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8K2TT0ohs1ym0QJUoUqpzjRDhB9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83620'),
  ('1004621100461551593', 'Kin', 2018, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Aric Dupere, Josh Baker, Larkin Seiple', 'Jonathan Baker, Josh Baker', 'Myles Truitt, Jack Reynor, Dennis Quaid, Zoë Kravitz, James Franco, Carrie Coon, Ian Matthews, Mark O''Brien', 'PG-13', 'A young boy finds a powerful otherworldly weapon, which he uses to save his older adoptive brother from a crew of thugs. Before long, the two of them are also pursued by federal agents and mysterious mercenaries aiming to reclaim their asset.', 'A young boy finds a powerful otherworldly weapon, which he uses to save his older adoptive brother from a crew of thugs. Before long, the two of them are also pursued by federal agents and mysterious mercenaries aiming to reclaim their asset.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oPE5GXHaTlu5eRcd4USuOX3A1mf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:425505'),
  ('510915584025555825', 'Kin-dza-dza!', 1986, 'Comedy, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Georgiy Daneliya, Pavel Lebeshev, Sergei Khramtsov', 'Georgiy Daneliya, Revaz Gabriadze', 'Stanislav Lyubshin, Evgeni Leonov, Yuriy Yakovlev, Levan Gabriadze, Lev Perfilov, Irina Shmeleva, Olga Mashnaya, Georgiy Daneliya', null, 'Two Soviet humans previously unknown to each other are transported to the planet Pluke in the Kin-dza-dza galaxy due to a chance encounter with an alien teleportation device. They must come to grips with a language barrier and Plukian social norms (not to mention the laws of space and time) if they ever hope to return to Earth.', 'Two Soviet humans previously unknown to each other are transported to the planet Pluke in the Kin-dza-dza galaxy due to a chance encounter with an alien teleportation device. They must come to grips with a language barrier and Plukian social norms (not to mention the laws of space and time) if they ever hope to return to Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b38fRsOD7LoPGQSmKeB2jQvVkGx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20874'),
  ('295496719361422991', 'Kina & Yuk', 2023, 'Family, Adventure, Documentary', 'Guillaume Maidatchevsky, Daniel Meyer, Mélanie Caudron', 'Michaël Souhaité, Guillaume Maidatchevsky', 'Virginie Efira, Robert Naylor, Veronique Boileau, Trinity Vittrekwa, Joe Bishop', null, 'Kina & Yuk are two Arctic foxes, ready to start a family. But the climate is warmer, and the food is more and more rare. Kina & Yuk are obliged to venture far and far away.', 'Kina & Yuk are two Arctic foxes, ready to start a family. But the climate is warmer, and the food is more and more rare. Kina & Yuk are obliged to venture far and far away.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9hJJnhVHtvlM9ChmFTRFvoot125.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:983015'),
  ('206452088969100222', 'Kind Lady', 1935, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'George B. Seitz, Eddie Imazu, Edwin B. Willis', 'Lucien Hubbard', 'Aline MacMahon, Basil Rathbone, Mary Carlisle, Frank Albertson, Dudley Digges, Doris Lloyd, Nola Luxford, Murray Kinnell', 'NR', 'Mary, a woman with good intentions, takes pity on Henry, an artist with no home. What begins as a simple offer to come inside from the cold for tea gradually turns into more. Before the unsuspecting woman knows it, Henry, his family, and his friends con their way into her home. Eventually, Mary creates a ruse to rid herself of the parasites, but they have a different plan.', 'Mary, a woman with good intentions, takes pity on Henry, an artist with no home. What begins as a simple offer to come inside from the cold for tea gradually turns into more. Before the unsuspecting woman knows it, Henry, his family, and his friends con their way into her home. Eventually, Mary creates a ruse to rid herself of the parasites, but they have a different plan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qXPAB50X1odPxfvCduQa3TOHXVy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:173891'),
  ('406513594952695480', 'Kind Lady', 1951, 'Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Joseph Ruttenberg, John Sturges', 'Jerry Davis, Edward Chodorov, Charles Bennett', 'Ethel Barrymore, Maurice Evans, Angela Lansbury, Keenan Wynn, Betsy Blair, John Williams, Doris Lloyd, John O''Malley', null, 'Mary Herries has a passion for art and fine furniture. Even though she is getting on in years, she enjoys being around these priceless articles. One day she meets a strange young painter named Elcott, who uses his painting skill to enter into her life. Little does she expect that his only interest in Mary is to covet everything she has.', 'Mary Herries has a passion for art and fine furniture. Even though she is getting on in years, she enjoys being around these priceless articles. One day she meets a strange young painter named Elcott, who uses his painting skill to enter into her life. Little does she expect that his only interest in Mary is to covet everything she has.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oIIMGWSApeKqYhYP2NMghciuAL8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:193547'),
  ('30946102381849974', 'Kinda Pregnant', 2025, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Tyler Spindel, Stuart Dryburgh', 'Amy Schumer, Julie Paiva', 'Amy Schumer, Jillian Bell, Brianne Howey, Will Forte, Lizze Broadway, Damon Wayans Jr., Urzila Carlson, Chris Geere', 'R', 'When Lainy''s plan to settle down and start a family falls apart, she puts on a fake baby bump, tells a lie — and accidentally falls for her dream guy.', 'When Lainy''s plan to settle down and start a family falls apart, she puts on a fake baby bump, tells a lie — and accidentally falls for her dream guy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k2Lq3rCJ7P9gk5Df9of9kqr9IJM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1212142'),
  ('495681769910077817', 'Kinderfänger', 2023, 'Horror', 'Bridger Nielson', null, 'Dmitrious Bistrevsky, Aiden Burkett, Andi Chapman, Aliyah M. Harris, Summer Kenyon, Lonzo Liggins, Joni Mann, Andrew Morgado', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gU1gFpqpMchC5OsIaFLNZTzHym3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1115604'),
  ('831473045643676897', 'Kindergarten Cop', 1990, 'Comedy', 'Ivan Reitman, Michael Chapman, Kate Davey', 'Murray Salem, Herschel Weingrod, Timothy Harris', 'Arnold Schwarzenegger, Penelope Ann Miller, Pamela Reed, Linda Hunt, Richard Tyson, Carroll Baker, Joseph Cousins, Christian Cousins', 'PG-13', 'Hard-edged cop John Kimble gets more than he bargained for when he goes undercover as a kindergarten teacher to get the goods on a brutal drug lord while at the same time protecting the man''s young son. Pitted against a class of boisterous moppets whose antics try his patience and test his mettle, Kimble may have met his match … in more ways than one.', 'Hard-edged cop John Kimble gets more than he bargained for when he goes undercover as a kindergarten teacher to get the goods on a brutal drug lord while at the same time protecting the man''s young son. Pitted against a class of boisterous moppets whose antics try his patience and test his mettle, Kimble may have met his match … in more ways than one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nKnHWwkXyvhzCYWm3FyRAv3qBrl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:951'),
  ('1031788909116702203', 'Kindergarten Cop 2', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Don Michael Paul, Kamal Derkaoui', 'David H. Steinberg', 'Dolph Lundgren, Sarah Strange, Bill Bellamy, Andre Tricoteux, Aleks Paunovic, Fiona Vroom, Rebecca Olson, Jody Thompson', 'PG-13', 'Assigned to recover sensitive stolen data, a gruff FBI agent goes undercover as a kindergarten teacher, but the school''s liberal, politically correct environment is more than he bargained for.', 'Assigned to recover sensitive stolen data, a gruff FBI agent goes undercover as a kindergarten teacher, but the school''s liberal, politically correct environment is more than he bargained for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6iVUHy9P7gzaCbMjj13qc6t7my4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:383121'),
  ('812358328148334943', 'Kindering', 1987, null, 'Stan Brakhage', null, null, null, 'Refracted images, not unlike those in a funhouse mirror, display two children playing in a backyard, a boy and a girl. There''s a dog, a swing, a picket fence, a Big Wheels trike. The grass is green and lush. A soundtrack mixes a chorus, swelling strings, and a child vocalizing. The effect is to idealize the images.', 'Refracted images, not unlike those in a funhouse mirror, display two children playing in a backyard, a boy and a girl. There''s a dog, a swing, a picket fence, a Big Wheels trike. The grass is green and lush. A soundtrack mixes a chorus, swelling strings, and a child vocalizing. The effect is to idealize the images.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nm255W5evrbZB5UtrqPdouGDVVF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126192'),
  ('858658684632585981', 'Kindred', 2020, 'Drama, Mystery, Horror', 'Joe Marcantonio, Carlos Catalán', 'Jason McColgan, Joe Marcantonio', 'Tamara Lawrance, Jack Lowden, Edward Holcroft, Chloe Pirrie, Kiran Sonia Sawar, Michael Nardone, Fiona Shaw, Anton Lesser', 'NR', 'When her boyfriend Ben suddenly dies in an accident, mother-to-be Charlotte collapses upon receiving the news. She wakes up in Ben’s family home, a crumbling old manor house in the middle of nowhere with Ben’s overbearing mother and his controlling stepbrother who are determined to care for her. Grief-stricken and increasingly haunted by visions possibly brought on by the pregnancy, Charlotte begins to doubt the family''s intentions and her suspicions grow that they may be trying to control her and her unborn baby.', 'When her boyfriend Ben suddenly dies in an accident, mother-to-be Charlotte collapses upon receiving the news. She wakes up in Ben’s family home, a crumbling old manor house in the middle of nowhere with Ben’s overbearing mother and his controlling stepbrother who are determined to care for her. Grief-stricken and increasingly haunted by visions possibly brought on by the pregnancy, Charlotte begins to doubt the family''s intentions and her suspicions grow that they may be trying to control her and her unborn baby.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qvVtPCnkY0k4B5iy1tCR7QWLsIw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:717672'),
  ('335891247042069182', 'Kinds of Kindness', 2024, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Yorgos Lanthimos, Robbie Ryan, Alexander Armero', 'Yorgos Lanthimos, Efthimis Filippou', 'Emma Stone, Jesse Plemons, Willem Dafoe, Margaret Qualley, Hong Chau, Mamoudou Athie, Joe Alwyn, Hunter Schafer', 'R', 'A triptych fable following a man without choice who tries to take control of his own life; a policeman who is alarmed that his wife who was missing-at-sea has returned and seems a different person; and a woman determined to find a specific someone with a special ability, who is destined to become a prodigious spiritual leader.', 'A triptych fable following a man without choice who tries to take control of his own life; a policeman who is alarmed that his wife who was missing-at-sea has returned and seems a different person; and a woman determined to find a specific someone with a special ability, who is destined to become a prodigious spiritual leader.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/50lPmjIpDs8gKfgK7fPIeKzpllh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1029955'),
  ('1082200789431789584', 'Kinetta', 2005, 'Drama', 'Yorgos Lanthimos, Kostas Papadakis, Thimios Bakatakis', 'Yorgos Lanthimos, Yorgos Kakanakis', 'Evangelia Randou, Aris Servetalis, Costas Xikominos, Ektoras Kaloudis, Vasilis Karaboulas, Steve Krikris, Tina Papanikolaou, Youlika Skafida', null, 'At a Greek hotel in the off-season, a chambermaid, a man obsessed with BMW cars, and a photo-store clerk attempt to film and photograph various badly re-enacted struggles between a man and a woman.', 'At a Greek hotel in the off-season, a chambermaid, a man obsessed with BMW cars, and a photo-store clerk attempt to film and photograph various badly re-enacted struggles between a man and a woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bjgIJAcL0HonVzvvZ2ebTN1F9SA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91410'),
  ('921561996556106926', 'King', 2022, 'Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Antoine Sanier, David Moreau', 'Zoé Bruneau, David Moreau, Jean-Baptiste Andrea', 'Gérard Darmon, Lou Lambrecht, Léo Lorléac''h, Thibault de Montalembert, Clémentine Baert, Daniel Semporé, Alain Blazquez, Laurence Facelina', null, 'King, a trafficked lion cub, escapes from the airport and takes refuge with Inès and Alex, who then have the crazy idea of getting him back to Africa. Anything can happen when Max their kooky grandfather, decides to join the adventure.', 'King, a trafficked lion cub, escapes from the airport and takes refuge with Inès and Alex, who then have the crazy idea of getting him back to Africa. Anything can happen when Max their kooky grandfather, decides to join the adventure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kEyi52oFS45X5sb78kAMnfrenxm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:892527'),
  ('1013832746515976512', 'King', 2026, 'Action, Thriller', 'Siddharth Anand, Satchith Paulose, Mukesh Chhabra', 'Sujoy Ghosh, Sagar Pandya, Suresh Nair', 'Shah Rukh Khan, Suhana Khan, Deepika Padukone, Abhishek Bachchan, Jackie Shroff, Anil Kapoor, Rani Mukerji, Raghav Juyal', null, 'Mentor and disciple embark on a perilous journey, pushing their survival skills to the limit against overwhelming odds and unforgiving environments.', 'Mentor and disciple embark on a perilous journey, pushing their survival skills to the limit against overwhelming odds and unforgiving environments.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/74fHULlTBMGGLusfFBVAkMAZbce.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1145110'),
  ('664470504262723851', 'King & Jester: Forever', 2026, 'Adventure, Comedy, Drama, Fantasy, Musical', 'Rustam Mosafir, Stepan Beshkurov, Ivan Stolbov, Rostislav Grigoryev, Vladislav Vdovin, Ekaterina Isakova', 'Rustam Mosafir, Alexander Buzin', 'Konstantin Plotnikov, Vladislav Konoplev, Darya Melnikova, Ilya Khvostikov, Vera Gudkova', null, 'The punk universe of "The King and the Jester" is threatened with destruction. The fairy-tale world is collapsing under the footsteps of the dead, resurrected by the mad Necromancer. No one can defeat the villain except his creators - friends separated by death... Pot and Prince.', 'The punk universe of "The King and the Jester" is threatened with destruction. The fairy-tale world is collapsing under the footsteps of the dead, resurrected by the mad Necromancer. No one can defeat the villain except his creators - friends separated by death... Pot and Prince.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FyIO2EOrFM1rV0o8JcBK1rMaq4OS.jpg', 'plex:movie:korol-i-shut-navsegda'),
  ('112682197434611593', 'King and Country', 1964, 'War, Drama', 'Joseph Losey, Denys N. Coop', 'J.L. Hodson, A.E. Housman, Dirk Bogarde', 'Dirk Bogarde, Tom Courtenay, Leo McKern, Peter Copley, Barry Foster, Barry Justice, James Villiers, Jeremy Spenser', 'PG', 'During World War I, Army Private Arthur James Hamp is accused of desertion during battle. The officer assigned to defend him at his court-martial, Captain Hargreaves, finds out there is more to the case than meets the eye.', 'During World War I, Army Private Arthur James Hamp is accused of desertion during battle. The officer assigned to defend him at his court-martial, Captain Hargreaves, finds out there is more to the case than meets the eye.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mBkHGc2whVQBGt4bxMU37DZVgTl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96394'),
  ('932161643969139738', 'King Arthur', 2004, 'Adventure, War, History, Action, Drama', 'Antoine Fuqua, Sławomir Idziak, Anna Rackard', 'David Franzoni', 'Clive Owen, Ioan Gruffudd, Keira Knightley, Mads Mikkelsen, Joel Edgerton, Hugh Dancy, Ray Winstone, Stephen Dillane', 'PG-13', 'The story of the Arthurian legend, based on the ''Sarmatian hypothesis'' which contends that the legend has a historical nucleus in the Sarmatian heavy cavalry troops stationed in Britain, and that the Roman-British military commander, Lucius Artorius Castus is the historical person behind the legend.', 'The story of the Arthurian legend, based on the ''Sarmatian hypothesis'' which contends that the legend has a historical nucleus in the Sarmatian heavy cavalry troops stationed in Britain, and that the Roman-British military commander, Lucius Artorius Castus is the historical person behind the legend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iKLZEAnjzr51Ij7TJtNejc5CN3i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9477'),
  ('584829663012334897', 'King Arthur: Excalibur Rising', 2017, 'Action', 'Antony Smith', 'Antony Smith, Victor Mawer', 'Adam Byard, Annes Elwy, Gavin Swift, Nicola Stuart-Hill, Simon Armstrong, Dewi Rhys Williams, Kerry Joy Stewart, Joshua Richards', null, 'A re-imagining of the Arthurian legend centered around Arthur''s illegitimate son Owain who must learn to take up his father''s mantle as king.', 'A re-imagining of the Arthurian legend centered around Arthur''s illegitimate son Owain who must learn to take up his father''s mantle as king.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gUa5CmvFDoUU02KnG9ic58BC5iN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:447427'),
  ('881656651793320148', 'King Arthur: Legend of the Sword', 2017, 'Action, Drama, Fantasy', 'Guy Ritchie, John Mathieson, Denis Schnegg', 'Joby Harold, Lionel Wigram, Guy Ritchie', 'Charlie Hunnam, Jude Law, Àstrid Bergès-Frisbey, Djimon Hounsou, Eric Bana, Aidan Gillen, Freddie Fox, Craig McGinlay', 'PG-13', 'When the child Arthur’s father is murdered, Vortigern, Arthur’s uncle, seizes the crown. Robbed of his birthright and with no idea who he truly is, Arthur comes up the hard way in the back alleys of the city. But once he pulls the sword Excalibur from the stone, his life is turned upside down and he is forced to acknowledge his true legacy... whether he likes it or not.', 'When the child Arthur’s father is murdered, Vortigern, Arthur’s uncle, seizes the crown. Robbed of his birthright and with no idea who he truly is, Arthur comes up the hard way in the back alleys of the city. But once he pulls the sword Excalibur from the stone, his life is turned upside down and he is forced to acknowledge his true legacy... whether he likes it or not.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9kKXH6eJpzoFGhCbTN3FVwSQK3n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:274857'),
  ('377348629395472409', 'King Cobra', 1999, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'David Hillenbrand, Scott Hillenbrand, Philip D. Schwartz', 'Scott Hillenbrand, David Hillenbrand', 'Pat Morita, Scott Hillenbrand, Casey Fallo, Hoyt Axton, Joseph Ruskin, Courtney Gains, Eric Lawson, Arell Blanton', 'PG-13', '30 feet of pure terror is the result of an experimental drug used in a biochemical lab and this mutated nightmare is pure evil! Half-African cobra and half-diamondback, he''s 30 feet long with a giant appetite for terror.', '30 feet of pure terror is the result of an experimental drug used in a biochemical lab and this mutated nightmare is pure evil! Half-African cobra and half-diamondback, he''s 30 feet long with a giant appetite for terror.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p5s5Vt1RLiqI3HQ9WaDm32e8zWH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40833'),
  ('162092046500250597', 'King Cobra', 2016, 'Crime, Drama', 'Justin Kelly, Benjamin Loeb', 'Justin Kelly', 'Garrett Clayton, Christian Slater, Keegan Allen, James Franco, Alicia Silverstone, Molly Ringwald, Spencer Rocco Lofranco, Sean Grandillo', 'NR', 'It’s 2006, YouTube is in its infancy, and internet porn is still behind a paywall. Taking the stage name Brent Corrigan, a fresh-faced, wannabe adult video performer is molded into a star by Stephen, a closeted gay porn mogul who runs the skin flick empire Cobra Video from his seemingly ordinary suburban home.', 'It’s 2006, YouTube is in its infancy, and internet porn is still behind a paywall. Taking the stage name Brent Corrigan, a fresh-faced, wannabe adult video performer is molded into a star by Stephen, a closeted gay porn mogul who runs the skin flick empire Cobra Video from his seemingly ordinary suburban home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sEun5y2q3aIrmpIAAhtS9G2JwH0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:390584'),
  ('817821873452583929', 'King Corn', 2007, 'Documentary', 'Aaron Woolf', 'Ian Cheney, Curtis Ellis, Jeffrey K. Miller', 'Ian Cheney, Curtis Ellis, Earl L. Butz, Michael Pollan', 'G', 'King Corn is a fun and crusading journey into the digestive tract of our fast food nation where one ultra-industrial, pesticide-laden, heavily-subsidized commodity dominates the food pyramid from top to bottom – corn. Fueled by curiosity and a dash of naiveté, two college buddies return to their ancestral home of Greene, Iowa to figure out how a modest kernel conquered America. With the help of some real farmers, oodles of fertilizer and government aide, and some genetically modified seeds, the friends manage to grow one acre of corn. Along the way, they unlock the hilarious absurdities and scary but hidden truths about America’s modern food system in this engrossing and eye-opening documentary.', 'King Corn is a fun and crusading journey into the digestive tract of our fast food nation where one ultra-industrial, pesticide-laden, heavily-subsidized commodity dominates the food pyramid from top to bottom – corn. Fueled by curiosity and a dash of naiveté, two college buddies return to their ancestral home of Greene, Iowa to figure out how a modest kernel conquered America. With the help of some real farmers, oodles of fertilizer and government aide, and some genetically modified seeds, the friends manage to grow one acre of corn. Along the way, they unlock the hilarious absurdities and scary but hidden truths about America’s modern food system in this engrossing and eye-opening documentary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zVHWzV9o2FU1SasNxuiJMW2FY0V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15281'),
  ('1117208194948713657', 'King Creole', 1958, 'Drama, Music, Crime', 'Michael Curtiz, Russell Harlan, Michael D. Moore', 'Herbert Baker, Michael V. Gazzo', 'Elvis Presley, Carolyn Jones, Walter Matthau, Dolores Hart, Dean Jagger, Liliane Montevecchi, Vic Morrow, Paul Stewart', null, 'Danny Fisher, young delinquent, flunks out of high school. He quits his job as a busboy in a nightclub, and one night he gets the chance to perform. Success is imminent and the local crime boss Maxie Fields wants to hire him to perform at his night club The Blue Shade. Danny refuses, but Fields won''t take no for an answer.', 'Danny Fisher, young delinquent, flunks out of high school. He quits his job as a busboy in a nightclub, and one night he gets the chance to perform. Success is imminent and the local crime boss Maxie Fields wants to hire him to perform at his night club The Blue Shade. Danny refuses, but Fields won''t take no for an answer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k5WBAgKrI8OytCSxMd4oau5KXzn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18644'),
  ('512137472554127373', 'King Dave', 2016, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Podz, Harvey Drouelle, Latifah Naouri', 'Alexandre Goyette', 'Alexandre Goyette, Mylène St-Sauveur, Moe Jeudy-Lamour, Karelle Tremblay, Mathieu Baron, Jhonattan Ardila, Jade-Mariuka Robitaille, Sabrina Baribeau', null, 'Dave is young and rebellious. A self-proclaimed King, influenced but not unconscious. As he sets out to find the stranger who danced with his girlfriend grabbing her ass, as if nothing had happened, he decides to take justice into his hands. Between violence, heartbreak and friendship betrayal, Dave will put his finger through the wringer and rush forward, unable to stop.', 'Dave is young and rebellious. A self-proclaimed King, influenced but not unconscious. As he sets out to find the stranger who danced with his girlfriend grabbing her ass, as if nothing had happened, he decides to take justice into his hands. Between violence, heartbreak and friendship betrayal, Dave will put his finger through the wringer and rush forward, unable to stop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hp5D8QEDS05940BqIJ0rozybFaZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:402453'),
  ('1056060319628169997', 'King David', 1985, 'Action, Adventure, History, Drama', 'Bruce Beresford, Donald McAlpine, David Tomblin', 'Andrew Birkin, James Costigan', 'Richard Gere, Edward Woodward, Denis Quilley, Alice Krige, Cherie Lunghi, John Castle, George Eastman, Tomas Milian', 'PG-13', 'This is a movie about the life of Israel''s king David.', 'This is a movie about the life of Israel''s king David.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pFdaND8Dl4yLGvzIBlahiqAaec3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42040'),
  ('600161473351668754', 'King Dinosaur', 1955, 'Science Fiction, Horror, Adventure', 'Bert I. Gordon, Gordon Avil, Robert Agnew', 'Tom Gries', 'William Bryant, Patti Gallagher, Douglas Henderson, Wanda Curtis, Marvin Miller', null, 'In 1960, four American scientists travel to a planet that has just entered Earth''s solar system to see if it''s able to support an Earth colony. They find an oxygen atmosphere, a lush earth-like forest, and earth-like animals living around a potable fresh-water lake.', 'In 1960, four American scientists travel to a planet that has just entered Earth''s solar system to see if it''s able to support an Earth colony. They find an oxygen atmosphere, a lush earth-like forest, and earth-like animals living around a potable fresh-water lake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pMNXiEj9pfzlgwsMLxHByfvsvzJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28590'),
  ('1045461478084878756', 'King Eagle', 1971, 'Action', 'Chang Cheh, Kung Mu-To, Yun-Kang Chen', 'Ni Kuang', 'Chan Sing, Ti Lung, Li Ching, Ching Miao, Chang Pei-Shan, David Chiang Da-Wei, Yuen Woo-Ping, Yuen Shun-Yi', null, 'Reclusive hero Jin Fei (Ti Lung), known as the King Eagle, inadvertently gets involved in the internal conflicts of the Tien Yi Tong society, after he falls in love their 7th chief, Yuk Lin (Li Ching).', 'Reclusive hero Jin Fei (Ti Lung), known as the King Eagle, inadvertently gets involved in the internal conflicts of the Tien Yi Tong society, after he falls in love their 7th chief, Yuk Lin (Li Ching).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cAKs0lSmzN5A8EFQpMr6I1ZAHE0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64311'),
  ('495207310635030022', 'King for a Day', 1983, 'Comedy', 'Nikolay Volev, Krasimir Kostov, Velika Terzieva', 'Nikolai Statkov', 'Todor Kolev, Yordanka Stefanova, Itzhak Finzi, Stoyan Gudev, Nikola Pashov, Ivan Grigorov, Ivan Obretenov, Trifon Dzhonev', null, 'This film is a comedy about a poor man named Purko. Purko always fails in his attempt to escape from poverty. The film illustrates the social and the moral atmosphere in Bulgaria during the 1930''s.', 'This film is a comedy about a poor man named Purko. Purko always fails in his attempt to escape from poverty. The film illustrates the social and the moral atmosphere in Bulgaria during the 1930''s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gUbR473Lwe89LbbTHhCJLlcxd9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:214938'),
  ('598847094186590117', 'King Frat', 1979, 'Comedy', 'Ken Wiederhorn, Vincent Agostino', 'Ron Kurz', 'John DiSanti, Charles Pitt, Roy Sekoff, Robert Small, Dan Chandler, Dan Fitzgerald, Tom Tully, Ted Richert', 'R', 'Set on the quiet campus of Yellowstream University, this comedy follows the rivalries that build between two of the college''s fraternities. When they''re not mooning everyone they pass and throwing garbage on the lawns of rival frats, the members of the Pi Kappa Delta fraternity are mainly interested in drinking and... well, drinking. When a campus-wide farting contest is announced, Grossout, the leader of the Deltas, is all too eager to stand up, bend over and defend the honor of his fraternity.', 'Set on the quiet campus of Yellowstream University, this comedy follows the rivalries that build between two of the college''s fraternities. When they''re not mooning everyone they pass and throwing garbage on the lawns of rival frats, the members of the Pi Kappa Delta fraternity are mainly interested in drinking and... well, drinking. When a campus-wide farting contest is announced, Grossout, the leader of the Deltas, is all too eager to stand up, bend over and defend the honor of his fraternity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1NHQaxktd3lwNqE3RwHVHSK2kr1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23819'),
  ('1039783805520232156', 'King Guillaume', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Pierre-François Martin-Laval, Régis Blondeau', 'Frédéric Proust, Pierre-François Martin-Laval, Jean-Paul Bathany', 'Florence Foresti, Pierre-François Martin-Laval, Pierre Richard, Raymond Bouchard, Isabelle Nanty, Omar Sy, Rufus, Frédéric Proust', null, 'Magali plays in a brass band. Guillaume drives a small tourist train. Both spin a perfect love, they share modest dreams and their baby is about to come. But an unexpected news upsets their routine: a man appears and announces that he is Guillaume''s estranged father and also reveals that Guillaume is his legitimate heir of a kingdom offshore of France and England. Guillaume and Magali start to dream of a life as monarchs, surrounded by faithful subjects in their castle, enjoying their wealth. But reality is often different to what you can imagine.', 'Magali plays in a brass band. Guillaume drives a small tourist train. Both spin a perfect love, they share modest dreams and their baby is about to come. But an unexpected news upsets their routine: a man appears and announces that he is Guillaume''s estranged father and also reveals that Guillaume is his legitimate heir of a kingdom offshore of France and England. Guillaume and Magali start to dream of a life as monarchs, surrounded by faithful subjects in their castle, enjoying their wealth. But reality is often different to what you can imagine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rUQGQDVwVIYaG2GtR4MqRFF1R5q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14725'),
  ('851733091793230686', 'King Ivory', 2025, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'John Swab, Will Stone', 'John Swab', 'Ben Foster, Michael Mando, James Badge Dale, Graham Greene, Rory Cochrane, Melissa Leo, Ritchie Coster, George Carroll', null, 'Based on extensive research involving law enforcement and gang members, a never-before-seen, authentic look inside the underworld of fentanyl trafficking from gangs inside the Oklahoma State Penitentiary at McAlester a.k.a. "Big Mac."', 'Based on extensive research involving law enforcement and gang members, a never-before-seen, authentic look inside the underworld of fentanyl trafficking from gangs inside the Oklahoma State Penitentiary at McAlester a.k.a. "Big Mac."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qtNdrKvD5MqvUbAQEja5WaKuVN1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1155324'),
  ('1128735754955090129', 'King Jack', 2015, 'Drama', 'Brandon Roots, Felix Thompson', 'Felix Thompson', 'Charlie Plummer, Cory Nichols, Christian Madsen, Danny Flaherty, Erin Davie, Chloë Levine, Keith Leonard, Yainis Ynoa', null, 'Growing up in a rural town filled with violent delinquents, Jack has learned to do what it takes to survive, despite having an oblivious mother and no father. After his aunt falls ill and a younger cousin comes to stay with him, the hardened 15-year-old discovers the importance of friendship, family, and looking for happiness even in the most desolate of circumstances.', 'Growing up in a rural town filled with violent delinquents, Jack has learned to do what it takes to survive, despite having an oblivious mother and no father. After his aunt falls ill and a younger cousin comes to stay with him, the hardened 15-year-old discovers the importance of friendship, family, and looking for happiness even in the most desolate of circumstances.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mguFl12DkIljwp8Kal04q04FeLw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:330916'),
  ('759528988966487672', 'King Kong', 1933, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Horror', 'Merian C. Cooper, Ernest B. Schoedsack, Vernon L. Walker', 'Ruth Rose, James Ashmore Creelman', 'Robert Armstrong, Fay Wray, Bruce Cabot, Frank Reicher, Victor Wong, James Flavin, Sam Hardy, Noble Johnson', null, 'Adventurous filmmaker Carl Denham sets out to produce a motion picture unlike anything the world has seen before. Alongside his leading lady Ann Darrow and his first mate Jack Driscoll, they arrive on an island and discover a legendary creature said to be neither beast nor man. Denham captures the monster to be displayed on Broadway as King Kong, the eighth wonder of the world.', 'Adventurous filmmaker Carl Denham sets out to produce a motion picture unlike anything the world has seen before. Alongside his leading lady Ann Darrow and his first mate Jack Driscoll, they arrive on an island and discover a legendary creature said to be neither beast nor man. Denham captures the monster to be displayed on Broadway as King Kong, the eighth wonder of the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lHlnxKL5GbgRibyRFI7n1Ey850i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:244'),
  ('173704834103961555', 'King Kong', 1976, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Horror', 'John Guillermin, Richard H. Kline, William Kronick', 'Lorenzo Semple Jr., Ruth Rose, James Ashmore Creelman', 'Jeff Bridges, Jessica Lange, Charles Grodin, John Randolph, René Auberjonois, Julius Harris, Jack O''Halloran, Ed Lauter', 'PG', 'An oil company expedition disturbs the peace of a giant ape and brings him back to New York to exploit him.', 'An oil company expedition disturbs the peace of a giant ape and brings him back to New York to exploit him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/paYKhEwUaxKA05vmOfU7FlleTln.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10730'),
  ('563951853211840077', 'King Kong', 2005, 'Adventure, Drama, Action', 'Andrew Lesnie, Peter Jackson, Richard Taylor', 'Peter Jackson, Fran Walsh, Philippa Boyens', 'Naomi Watts, Adrien Brody, Jack Black, Andy Serkis, Colin Hanks, Thomas Kretschmann, Jamie Bell, Kyle Chandler', 'PG-13', 'In 1933 New York, an overly ambitious movie producer coerces his cast and hired ship crew to travel to mysterious Skull Island, where they encounter Kong, a giant ape who is immediately smitten with the leading lady.', 'In 1933 New York, an overly ambitious movie producer coerces his cast and hired ship crew to travel to mysterious Skull Island, where they encounter Kong, a giant ape who is immediately smitten with the leading lady.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6a2HY6UmD7XiDD3NokgaBAXEsD2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:254'),
  ('180024585489121741', 'King Kong Escapes', 1967, 'Action, Fantasy, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Ishirō Honda, Hajime Koizumi, Ken Sano', 'Takeshi Kimura', 'Akira Takarada, Mie Hama, Rhodes Reason, Linda Miller, Hideyo Amamoto, Yoshibumi Tajima, Sachio Sakai, Ryuji Kita', 'G', 'An adaptation of the Rankin/Bass cartoon, "The King Kong Show". King Kong is brought in by the evil Dr. Who to dig for Element X in a mine when the robot Mechani-Kong is unable to do the task. This leads to the machine and the real Kong engaging in a tremendous battle atop Tokyo Tower.', 'An adaptation of the Rankin/Bass cartoon, "The King Kong Show". King Kong is brought in by the evil Dr. Who to dig for Element X in a mine when the robot Mechani-Kong is unable to do the task. This leads to the machine and the real Kong engaging in a tremendous battle atop Tokyo Tower.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Z2fL5ycdVGs83i4iPdliDZVeVM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39276'),
  ('536935243560539303', 'King Kong Lives', 1986, 'Fantasy, Action, Adventure', 'John Guillermin, Brian W. Cook, Alec Mills', 'Ronald Shusett, Steven Pressfield', 'Linda Hamilton, Brian Kerwin, Peter Elliott, George Antoni, John Ashton, Peter Michael Goetz, Frank Maraden, Robin Cahall', 'PG-13', 'After falling from the Twin Towers, Kong lies in a coma for ten years. When his heart begins to fail, scientists engineer an artificial heart, and a giant female ape is captured to serve as a source for a blood transfusion. When Kong awakens following his heart transplant, he senses the nearby presence of the female ape and the two escape to wreak havoc together.', 'After falling from the Twin Towers, Kong lies in a coma for ten years. When his heart begins to fail, scientists engineer an artificial heart, and a giant female ape is captured to serve as a source for a blood transfusion. When Kong awakens following his heart transplant, he senses the nearby presence of the female ape and the two escape to wreak havoc together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gI37vg2otF348OHxsx97hWCVvNI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31947'),
  ('828512699274749584', 'King Kong vs. Godzilla', 1962, 'Science Fiction, Comedy, Adventure, Fantasy, Action', 'Ishirō Honda, Hajime Koizumi, Koji Kajita', 'Shinichi Sekizawa', 'Tadao Takashima, Kenji Sahara, Yū Fujiki, Ichirō Arishima, Jun Tazaki, Akihiko Hirata, Mie Hama, Akiko Wakabayashi', 'NR', 'The advertising director of Pacific Pharmaceuticals, frustrated with the low ratings of their sponsored TV program, seeks a more sensationalist approach. He orders his staff to Faro Island to capture King Kong for exploitation. As Godzilla re-emerges, a media frenzy generates with Pacific looking to capitalize off of the ultimate battle.', 'The advertising director of Pacific Pharmaceuticals, frustrated with the low ratings of their sponsored TV program, seeks a more sensationalist approach. He orders his staff to Faro Island to capture King Kong for exploitation. As Godzilla re-emerges, a media frenzy generates with Pacific looking to capitalize off of the ultimate battle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hXUiDE1CgRJlcXMVZC1g5wFAdn6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1680'),
  ('380390272160475853', 'King Kong vs. Godzilla', 1963, 'Action, Science Fiction, Comedy, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Hajime Koizumi, Akira Watanabe, Sadamasa Arikawa', 'Paul Mason, Bruce Howard', 'Michael Keith, Harry Holcombe, James Yagi, Tadao Takashima, Kenji Sahara, Ichirō Arishima, George Takei, Les Tremayne', 'NR', 'When an underhanded pharmaceutical company goes to a remote tropical island to steal King Kong for advertising purposes, they get more than they bargained for when the gigantic ape attacks an unsuspecting village and an enormous octopus.', 'When an underhanded pharmaceutical company goes to a remote tropical island to steal King Kong for advertising purposes, they get more than they bargained for when the gigantic ape attacks an unsuspecting village and an enormous octopus.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v4lxYywAyEuT974dVi22y8TGP0t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:686487'),
  ('39626099958889036', 'King Kong: Peter Jackson''s Production Diaries', 2005, 'Documentary', 'Michael Pellerin', null, 'Peter Jackson, Jack Black, Andy Serkis, Adrien Brody, Naomi Watts', 'G', 'Academy Award - winning filmmaker Peter Jackson invites you behind the scenes of his latest movie to witness the birth of King Kong.', 'Academy Award - winning filmmaker Peter Jackson invites you behind the scenes of his latest movie to witness the birth of King Kong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bTGMqzes9ZofcLgnLm4QdK8iFue.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82864'),
  ('531961818579701925', 'King Lavra', 1951, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Karel Zeman, Antonín Horák', 'Karel Zeman', null, null, 'A king hides an embarrassing secret - and it causes him to execute every barber who cuts his hair.', 'A king hides an embarrassing secret - and it causes him to execute every barber who cuts his hair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oxtze9sL2MgrH0fkOmZt7in3CpH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:449958'),
  ('1112894516409292415', 'King Lear', 1970, 'Drama', 'Grigori Kozintsev, Iosif Shapiro, Jonas Gricius', 'Grigori Kozintsev', 'Jüri Järvet, Galina Volchek, Elza Radziņa, Valentina Shendrikova, Oleg Dal, Donatas Banionis, Regimantas Adomaitis, Aleksandr Vokach', null, 'King Lear, old and tired, divides his kingdom among his daughters, giving great importance to their protestations of love for him. When Cordelia, youngest and most honest, refuses to idly flatter the old man in return for favor, he banishes her and turns for support to his remaining daughters. But Goneril and Regan have no love for him and instead plot to take all his power from him. In a parallel, Lear''s loyal courtier Gloucester favors his illegitimate son Edmund after being told lies about his faithful son Edgar. Madness and tragedy befall both ill-starred fathers.', 'King Lear, old and tired, divides his kingdom among his daughters, giving great importance to their protestations of love for him. When Cordelia, youngest and most honest, refuses to idly flatter the old man in return for favor, he banishes her and turns for support to his remaining daughters. But Goneril and Regan have no love for him and instead plot to take all his power from him. In a parallel, Lear''s loyal courtier Gloucester favors his illegitimate son Edmund after being told lies about his faithful son Edgar. Madness and tragedy befall both ill-starred fathers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iP4J0hWdkpK7PB18bQ1JU1LQzZm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9554'),
  ('144634366424089273', 'King Lear', 1988, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jean-Luc Godard, Sophie Maintigneux, Hervé Duhamel', 'Norman Mailer, Jean-Luc Godard, Peter Sellars', 'Peter Sellars, Burgess Meredith, Julie Delpy, Leos Carax, Molly Ringwald, Jean-Luc Godard, Woody Allen, Freddy Buache', 'PG', 'A descendant of Shakespeare tries to restore his plays in a world rebuilding itself after the Chernobyl catastrophe obliterates most of human civilization.', 'A descendant of Shakespeare tries to restore his plays in a world rebuilding itself after the Chernobyl catastrophe obliterates most of human civilization.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wjuPAH78cV1DfcnWEwTAvP3Tsd1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50012'),
  ('131315423866949716', 'King Lear', 2018, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Richard Eyre, Nina Gold, Nick Shuttleworth', 'Richard Eyre', 'Anthony Hopkins, Emma Thompson, Emily Watson, Jim Broadbent, Florence Pugh, Jim Carter, Andrew Scott, John Macmillan', null, 'An aging King invites disaster, when he abdicates to his corrupt, toadying daughters, and rejects his loving and honest one.', 'An aging King invites disaster, when he abdicates to his corrupt, toadying daughters, and rejects his loving and honest one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dHd0YS1PGxjfZCVbYi9Hetg7zZd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:513427'),
  ('13091098360448323', 'King Naresuan Part: 1', 2007, 'Drama, History, War, Action', 'Chatrichalerm Yukol, Guy Norris, Putipong Saisikaew', 'Sunait Chutintaranond, Chatrichalerm Yukol', 'Sarunyu Wongkrachang, Sorapong Chatree, Chatchai Plengpanich, Jakkrit Amarat, Wanchana Sawasdee, Pratcha Sananwatananont, Suchada Chekly, Pratcha Sunanvatananont', null, 'The film concerns the life of King Naresuan, who liberated the Siamese from the control of Burma. Born in 1555, he was taken to Burma as a child hostage; there he became acquainted with sword fighting and became a threat to the Burmese empire.', 'The film concerns the life of King Naresuan, who liberated the Siamese from the control of Burma. Born in 1555, he was taken to Burma as a child hostage; there he became acquainted with sword fighting and became a threat to the Burmese empire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ukm7YlCLkhITmTzLqf8Akb5YTYC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24474'),
  ('410215860602086552', 'King Naresuan Part: 2', 2007, 'History, Action, Drama, War', 'Chatrichalerm Yukol, Guy Norris', 'Chatrichalerm Yukol', 'Wanchana Sawasdee, Nopachai Jayanama, Taksaorn Paksukcharern, Intira Jaroenpura, Sorapong Chatree, Chatchai Plengpanich, Sompob Benjathikul, Jakkrit Amarat', null, 'Prince Naresuan is now the crown prince of Ayutthaya, and the king of Burma is dead. While the new Burmese king is waging war, the crown prince plots to assassinate Naresuan.', 'Prince Naresuan is now the crown prince of Ayutthaya, and the king of Burma is dead. While the new Burmese king is waging war, the crown prince plots to assassinate Naresuan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/girqhxJZfSpYHbOyDRx6fV4xrwb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90677'),
